HZ.cmnem={"的":["of","{Darth Vader} looms on the {Roof} of the {Hut}, breathing loudly, and lifts a *white dove* and a *ladle* into the air with the Force. He booms out what belongs to whom: the ladle **of** the dove, the dove **of** the Empire, the hut **of** Lord Vader. Trembling stormtroopers tie on labels, until even the ladle dangles a tag saying property **of** Vader."],"一":["one","{Yoshi} skids in {Front} of the {Beach}, flicks out his long tongue and swallows every deckchair, towel and umbrella in sight. He strains, turns pink and lays just **one** egg. It cracks, and out slides **one** *plank*, which surfs away carrying **one** very confused crab while Yoshi cheers his own name."],"是":["to be","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and studies one crumb of wax through his magnifying glass. From that alone he deduces what everything **is**: that **is** a drone, this **is** the queen, you **are** a wasp in disguise. A glowing *tick mark* hops onto each insect as he names it, because everything simply has **to be** what Sherlock says it is."],"不":["not","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and growls that splashing is **not** allowed. From his utility belt he fires a *no sign* on a grappling hook, and it clamps onto each swimmer in turn, beeping. Ducks do **not** quack, taps do **not** drip, and Alfred, listening on the radio, is **not** amused."],"了":["done","{Lara Croft} vaults onto the {Roof} of the {Hut}, where a *swaddled baby* sits on an ancient altar, gurgling at a row of traps. She backflips past the darts and the rolling boulder, calling each one off with a flick of her ponytail: darts **done**, boulder **done**, puzzle **done**. The baby burps, the last trap clicks shut, and the whole tomb is **done** by lunchtime."],"在":["to be at","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and slashes a huge Z into the tiles. A giant *left hand* slaps down beside it and points: this is where he happens **to be at**. He vanishes laughing and carves another Z on a palm tree, and the hand scuttles after him, tapping each letter so the puffing sergeant always knows where Zorro **is at**."],"人":["person","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Funfair} with his visor scanning everything, stiff and heavy on the candyfloss. A *person* wobbles past, and the targeting display locks on and reads aloud: **person**, two legs, sticky. He politely arrests the man for being a **person**, recites the directive that every **person** may ride the dodgems, then joins the queue behind him."],"有":["to have","{Yoshi} waddles down to the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, where a fisherman stands *holding meat* and refusing to share. Out shoots the sticky tongue, gulp, and now Yoshi **has** it. He lays it as a spotted egg and sits on it, beaming, because **to have** a thing is to keep it warm. The fisherman wails, so Yoshi swallows his boat too and **has** that as well."],"我":["I","{Walter White} stands at a chalkboard in the {Basement} of the {Fort}, adjusting his glasses over a beaker of perfect green flame. A *spearman* pokes the glassware and demands to know who made it. Walter raps the flask and announces that he is the one who knocks: **I** measured it, **I** balanced the equation, **I** alone got every decimal right."],"他":["he","{Tarzan} swings down on a vine in {Front} of the {Spa}, yelling, and lands beside a *standing person* in a bathrobe. A *scorpion* clicks out a complaint, and Tarzan, who talks to animals, translates for the guests: **he** stole the cucumber slices, **he** blocked the hot tub. Tarzan points a long finger at the man, the apes all point too, and the whole jungle hoots: **he**, **he**, **he**."],"这":["this","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, unrolling a paper *road* across the floor to lure you closer. He rolls up one purple sleeve to show off a *tattoo* of a flower and begs you to look at **this**, just **this**, right here. You lean down the road for a better view, and the tattoo squirts you in the eye: **this** close, **this** wet."],"个":["general measure word","{Gandalf} blocks the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} with his staff and booms that no *person* shall pass without the **measure word**: \"One ge pumpkin! Three ge carrots!\" Anyone who forgets finds a magic *pole* slamming down before their noun. By sunset the queue chants \"ge, ge, ge!\", for 个 is the wizard's all-purpose **measure word**, fit for almost any noun."],"们":["plural (-s)","{Mario} bounces on the {Roof} of the {Funfair} and head-butts a floating block, hoping for a coin. Instead a *standing person* pops out and marches through a *gate*. Bonk, two people, bonk, forty, and with a 'Wahoo!' he stomps out **plural** after **plural**, until the gate bursts under a **plural** crowd wearing hats with an -s on them."],"中":["middle","The {Joker} prances in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, flicking trick playing cards at a floating *bullseye*. Every card thuds dead in the **middle**, until the bullseye flips over and a squirting flower pops out of its **middle** and soaks him right in the **middle** of his huge grin. He cackles so hard that he topples into the **middle** of the water."],"来":["to come","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Island} temple and lifts a relic off its pedestal, and of course the traps wake up. Giant rolling bales of *barley* begin **to come** after her down the corridor, rumbling and shedding grain. She backflips over one and beckons with a grin, and still they **come**, from the left, from the ceiling, until she is ponytail-deep in golden straw."],"上":["up","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and spots one crumb on the ceiling. A smug puff of his pipe, and he has deduced that the thief went **up**. The *upstairs* unfolds with a creak, and he marches Watson **up** it, **up** past the aeroplanes, **up** through the clouds, playing his violin and saying that it is elementary."],"大":["big","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, breathing loudly, and finds a *big man* stuck in the mud bath. He raises one black glove and strains to lift him with the Force, but the man is so **big** that his elbows knock out two walls. Vader's red lightsaber looks like a toothpick beside him, and for once the booming voice sounds small: too **big**."],"为":["for","{Walter White} lines up beakers in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and mixes a giant school experiment **for** an *elephant handler*, who waits with a very large toothbrush. Elephant toothpaste, Walter announces proudly, as foam erupts from the flask, every precise gram of it **for** one elephant. The handler scrubs away, the lake turns to suds, and it was all **for** one smile."],"和":["and","{Homer} wakes up {Inside} the {Hut} wanting a doughnut **and** a nap **and** another doughnut. His dim scheme is to dangle the doughnut from a *grain stalk* over a huge *mouth* he has built from cardboard, to chew it for him. The mouth snaps shut on doughnut **and** stalk **and** sleeve, **and** Homer howls 'D'oh!' as it drags him in."],"国":["country","{Gandalf} arrives {Inside} the {Warehouse}, taps his staff on a shining *jade gem* and mutters a spell. A *fence* springs from the floorboards in a ring of sparks, fireworks burst out an anthem, and the wizard declares a new **country**, with mice for a parliament. He lights his pipe, stamps a forklift's passport and grumbles that running a **country** is worse than fighting dragons."],"地":["ground","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and, disapproving of everything, presses one black glove downward. The Force pins it all to the **ground**: buckets, towels, a startled gull. The *soil* heaves up around his boots, a *scorpion* flattens itself and scuttles for cover, and Vader booms that he finds this lack of **ground** disturbing."],"到":["to arrive","{Darth Vader} looms by the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} beneath an *arrival* board, breathing loudly, because his shuttle is late. He Force-chokes the board until it wheezes and flips, and everything hurries **to arrive**: shuttles, stormtroopers, a very frightened admiral. They all **arrive** through the wall at once and salute in the rubble."],"以":["to use","{Yoshi} slurps a rusty *tool* off the wall in the {Basement} of the {Beach}, gulps, and lays it as a spotted egg. He has worked out how **to use** it: he lobs the egg at a coconut, and the tool hatches out and whacks the shell open. Delighted, he **uses** it on a padlock, a clam and finally his own stuck tongue."],"说":["to speak","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, and one glance at a *money changer* sets him off **to speak**. A *small speech bubble* pops from his pipe, then another, each naming the man's breakfast, debts and favourite aunt. He **speaks** faster and faster, smug and unstoppable, until the bubbles fill the street and the money changer pays him to stop."],"时":["time","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Beehive} and ignores every clock. He licks his *thumb*, holds it up against the *sun* through a crack in the wax, and deduces the exact **time** to the second, sniffing that it is elementary. The shadow creeps round like a clock hand, the bees learn they are nine seconds late and panic, and Watson asks the **time** again."],"要":["to want","{Yoshi} sniffs the air in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, and his eyes lock on a *cabinet* full of sweets. He begins **to want** it with his whole green body. A *woman* clings to the door yelling that she **wants** it too, so out shoots his tongue, and he gulps down the lot. He lays a huge egg, and she sticks her head through the shell, still **wanting** more."],"就":["then","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} and presses the fake *wart* that Q glued to his nose. A folding *palace* bursts from his cufflink, **then** a moat, **then** a drawbridge that lowers over the bathmat. He strolls across, unruffled, **then** announces his name to the startled backpackers, and **then** the whole thing folds up again."],"出":["to go out","{Charlie Brown} finally decides **to go out** and fly a kite in {Front} of the {Pool}, and a *double mountain* promptly erupts under his feet and eats it. Good grief, he sighs, as the two peaks shove him back through the door. He **goes out** again, and again the mountain sneezes him back, while Snoopy **goes out** on his doghouse with no trouble at all."],"会":["can","{Homer} falls asleep in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and wakes in the middle of a *meeting* where everyone lists what they **can** do. He says he **can** eat eleven doughnuts, **can** nap standing up and **can** run a nuclear plant. The meeting demands proof, so he eats twelve, drops off with a happy 'Mmm', and the plant alarm goes off."],"可":["can","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Basement} of the {Hut}, stage-managing the world's smallest show, and begs a *nodding head* for permission. **Can** the banjo start, **can** the chickens come on, **can** the curtain go up? It nods at everything, faster and faster, so the chickens stampede over him, and Kermit lets out a panicked 'Yaaay!' and asks if he **can** please lie down."],"也":["also","{Yoshi} flicks out his tongue in the {Basement} of the {Hut} and swallows a melon, and a *scorpion* scuttles up asking to be swallowed **also**. Gulp, and out come two eggs. The scorpion climbs from its shell looking pleased, and now the bucket wants a turn **also**, and the mop **also**, and the boiler **also**, shuffling into line behind a very full dinosaur."],"你":["you","{Naruto} bursts into the {Basement} of the {Beach} in his orange jumpsuit and makes a hundred shadow clones. Every one of them jabs a finger at a mirror where the word *you* wriggles and jabs right back, and they all roar '**You**!' at once. Yes, **you**, the loud one, he shouts, and the clones agree that **you** will never get rid of **you**."],"对":["correct","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} over two *dance partners* doing a terrible tango. With one raised finger he hoists them off the floor by the Force and sets their feet in place: left foot **correct**, right foot a disappointment. He breathes, he disapproves, and he does not lower them until every single step is **correct**."],"生":["to grow","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Jungle}, his magnifying glass trained on a tiny *seedling*. From one crumb of soil he deduces that it will **grow** to exactly ninety feet by teatime, and he smugly lights his pipe to wait. It **grows** under his deerstalker, lifts him, then Watson, and Sherlock calls down from the clouds that it was elementary."],"能":["can","{Naruto} yells {Inside} the {Jungle} that he **can** beat a huge *bear*, and he believes every word. The bear swats his first clone, then fifty more, and each time he gets up shouting that he **can**. By sunset, a wobbling Rasengan finally ruffles its fur, and the exhausted bear sits down, pats his headband and agrees he **can**, then shares his ramen."],"而":["and yet","{Casper} floats {Inside} the {Car Park} wearing a fake *beard*, so that drivers will think he is a normal friend. He waves hello, **and yet** they scream. He turns invisible to calm them, **and yet** the beard hangs in the air, bobbing along by itself, and they scream louder. He only wants a pal, **and yet** here he is, alone, with a beard."],"子":["child","{Zorro} lands on the {Roof} of the {Beehive} with a swirl of black cape, where a *child* in a paper mask challenges him to a duel with a twig. Dashing as ever, he lets the **child** win, flicking his rapier so that a tiny Z appears on his own shirt. He vanishes laughing, while the **child** carves wobbly Zs all over the hive."],"那":["that","{Naruto} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, smelling ramen and demanding to know where it is. A giant *pointing finger* swings across the room and jabs: **that** door, **that** shelf, **that** far corner. A dozen shadow clones pile off yelling, each one pulling out a towel and shouting not this, **that**, until the last clone finds the bowl over there, by **that** cucumber."],"得":["to get","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly {Inside} the {Hut}, following a trail of *footsteps* to a *found coin* on the carpet. He does not bend down: he reaches out with the Force **to get** it, and it rattles across the floor towards his glove. A pigeon snatches it first, so he lifts the pigeon too, and now he **gets** the coin and a very quiet bird.","dé"],"于":["at","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Museum}, aiming his sticky tongue **at** a *coat stand* in the hall. It sticks **at** the very top, and the stand springs back and flings him **at** a suit of armour. He swallows the helmet, lays it as an egg and lobs it **at** a guard, who catches it and stays exactly **at** his post."],"着":["-ing (ongoing)","The {Joker} sits grinning on the {Roof} of the {Hut}, winding up a clockwork *sheep* with a joke *eye* on a spring. It is walking, still walking, the eye bouncing, because his prank has no off switch and everything is **ongoing**. He is cackling, still cackling, cards are falling, still falling, and the **-ing** just never stops."],"下":["down","{Shrek} storms into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} wanting to be left alone, but the donkey will not shut up. So he stomps **down** the *downstairs*, which peel open beneath him layer by layer like an onion. The chatter bounces after him, so he roars and goes further **down**, and further **down**, until there is nothing beneath him but swamp."],"自":["self","{Zorro} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and comes *nose* to nose with a dashing masked stranger in a mirror of honey. He bows, he flicks his rapier, and he slashes a Z on the glass, only to find that the stranger is his own **self**. Enchanted, he taps his nose, kisses his own **self** on the hand, and vanishes laughing."],"之":["of","The {Joker} deals a *winding path* of trick cards in {Front} of the {Beehive}, cackling as it curls away over the grass. Every card has a title: Queen **of** Bees, Ace **of** Honey, King **of** Absolutely Nothing. A bee follows the path to the end, picks up the last card, the Joke **of** the Day, and gets squirted by a flower."],"年":["year","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} in a *slanted cap*, demanding to be paid in ramen. The clerk tells him to come back next **year**, and Naruto, who never gives up, does, his *mirror feet* stamping each calendar page as it flies off the wall. Ten **years**, fifty **years**, and his headband is grey, and he is still shouting at the window."],"过":["to pass","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, slams his staff down on a *road* and thunders that nothing shall **pass**. A giant hitchhiking *thumb* wobbles up and begs. The cranky wizard sighs, puffs his pipe and raises his staff, and with a burst of fireworks everything may **pass**: lorries **pass**, bikes **pass**, and the thumb **passes** too, waving."],"发":["to send out","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Spa} on sore, hairy feet and drops the Ring on a *launch pad*, refusing to walk another mile. Loyal Sam counts down, and they **send out** the Ring by rocket, whistling over the hills. It boomerangs straight back onto his finger, so he vanishes with a weary sigh, and Sam has **to send out** the towels instead."],"后":["after","{Homer} lies down behind a *leaning cliff* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, and promises that he will do it all **after**: work **after** lunch, lunch **after** a doughnut. His *covered mouth* mumbles through the crumbs that the cliff can wait until **after** his nap. It cannot, and it tips over on him with a groan, and his 'D'oh!' comes just **after** the crash."],"作":["to do","{Zorro} swings on a chain into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, where a *standing person* weeps over a list of things **to do**. A *jack-in-the-box* boings up with every new chore, shrieking it aloud. Swish, swish, Zorro slashes a Z through each one, and whatever he slashes gets done with a flourish: he **does** the crates, he **does** the forklifts, then vanishes laughing."],"里":["inside","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Basement} of the {Beach} and solves the puzzle on a sealed stone box. **Inside** is a tiny *village* ringing its bells in alarm. An ancient mechanism shrinks her to fit, and she climbs **inside** its church, where a pea rolls after her like a boulder, and she dives **inside** a thimble-sized tomb with a triumphant flick of her ponytail."],"用":["to use","{Yoshi} lassoes a *bucket* with his sticky tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, and he knows exactly how **to use** it. He **uses** it as a yo-yo, then as a parachute for his flutter jump, then as a helmet when he misses. A whale surfaces and asks **to use** it too, so Yoshi spits it out, and it makes a very small snorkel."],"道":["way","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and finds a giant stone *head* lying across the *road* painted on the tiles, blocking his **way**. He booms that the dark side is the only **way**, lifts one glove and sends it rolling with the Force. The head rolls on ahead of him, crushing a hedge and clearing the **way**."],"行":["to walk","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where the canvas is painted as a *crossroads*, determined **to walk** home to his swamp alone. He **walks** north, and the donkey **walks** beside him, talking. He roars, turns and **walks** south, and the donkey is still there, still talking, so the boxers give up and trudge along behind them both."],"所":["place","{Sailor Moon} twirls through a long sparkly transformation in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} and trips over an *old door*. Sobbing loudly, she throws her tiara, which bounces off an *axe*, which chops the door open. Behind it is a cosy **place** with slippers and a fire, and she makes a speech about justice, while Luna claims the best **place** on the rug."],"然":["so","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Mansion} and his visor picks up *flames* on a birthday cake, in breach of directive nine. **So** he politely arrests the candles, **so** the room goes dark, **so** the guests complain, **so** he arrests the guests for noise. One rule leads stiffly to the next, **so** by midnight he is reading himself his rights."],"家":["home","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Piazza} and clicks open Q's newest gadget, a briefcase that does only one thing: it unfolds into a tiny *home*. Chased by villains, he clicks it again and steps through a little door, and there is his **home**, with slippers and a fire. He sips, unruffled, and remarks that there's no place like **home**."],"种":["kind","The {Joker} spreads out a deck in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, every card a different **kind** of prank. He hurls a *grain stalk* at a *bullseye*, and custard squirts out of it, then glitter, then a rubber eel. Cackling at a puzzled haddock, he asks what **kind** of fish it is, then squirts it with its own **kind** of water."],"事":["matter","{Sherlock} drops a *fish hook* into the honey in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, because the queen's crown has gone and this is a serious **matter**. He sniffs one sticky crumb, plays three notes on his violin and deduces the whole thing. Up comes the hook with a wasp dangling on it, and he tells poor Watson that the **matter** is closed."],"成":["to become","{Charlie Brown} wanders {Inside} the {Jungle} and, for once in his life, wins a golden *trophy*. At last he will **become** a winner, and his zigzag shirt starts **to become** a champion's robe. Then the trophy **becomes** a football, Lucy pulls it away, and he **becomes** a flat heap on the jungle floor, sighing good grief."],"方":["direction","{Frodo} trudges in {Front} of the {Hangar} onto a painted *square* with one **direction** marked on each side, and wearily asks which way is Mordor. The Ring tugs him in one **direction**, his aching feet in another and Sam, loyal and lost, in a third. The square starts to spin like a compass, and every **direction** looks like a very long walk."],"多":["many","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Warehouse} and looks up at *many moons* rising, stacked on top of each other. He breathes that it is no moon, but it is, and there are **many**. He flings them away with the Force, and more come, so **many** that they begin to bump. So **many** he cannot disapprove of them all."],"经":["to pass through","{James Bond} adjusts his cuffs in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and fires Q's latest gadget, a cufflink that shoots a *silk thread* able **to pass through** anything. It **passes through** the ropes, the popcorn machine and both boxers' gloves. He clips on, zips along it, **passes through** the lot without creasing his tuxedo, and remarks that he was only passing."],"么":["what?","{Mario} head-butts a block on the {Roof} of the {Hut}, expecting a coin, and a *tiny thread* drifts out instead. '**What**?' he says, and stomps on it. It wraps itself round his moustache and pulls, and he leaps, stomps and bonks again, and each block gives only more thread. '**What**?!' he wails, tied to his own red cap."],"去":["to go","{Chewbacca} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, because the ship is leaving and it is time **to go**. An *exit* sign blinks at the far wall, so he rips the wall open beneath it in a temper, tucks a dinosaur skeleton under one hairy arm and howls at the guards. Only a friend could translate, but the meaning is clear: **go**, **go**, **go**."],"法":["method","{Frodo} is stuck in the {Basement} of the {Spa} and needs a **method** of escape. The Ring only makes him invisible and lost, so plan two is weary sobbing, and so many *water drops* fall that the room floods. He and Sam float up on a frying pan, straight through the *exit*, and Sam writes it down as the proper **method**."],"学":["to study","{Shrek} grumbles {Inside} the {Ice Rink}, ordered by a fearless *child* **to study** a book on figure skating. He **studies** it the way he eats an onion, peeling one layer of chapters at a time and roaring at each page, while the donkey reads loudly over his shoulder. The child loops past him, and Shrek just **studies** on."],"如":["if","{Robocop} stands stiffly {Inside} the {Pool} and runs his directives: **if** swimmer runs, then whistle, **if** whistle fails, then arrest. An *echo* bounces back off the tiles, repeating his every **if**, and his visor flickers as he starts to arrest it. **If** the echo resists, then what, he asks, and it asks him back until he locks up, one foot in the air."],"都":["all","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Boathouse} as a *capital city* drifts up on a barge, ringing its bells. He raises one glove, and the Force lifts **all** of it at once: **all** the trams, **all** the statues, **all** the pigeons, hanging over the river. He booms that he is their father, every one of them, and **all** of them gasp."],"同":["same","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Lagoon} tea party, baffled by civilisation, where each guest sips from a *matching cup*. Raised by apes, he decides this is a troop, and it must all do the **same**. He beats his chest and yells, and every guest does the **same** yell. He scratches his armpit, and a hundred duchesses do the **same**, cups clinking."],"现":["now","{Shrek} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} at a *king* and a *watcher* who have barged in, and he wants them gone **now**. Not later, **now**, in his own swamp voice, so loud that the tiles rattle. The watcher checks his clock, the king flees with his crown askew, and the donkey pops up to ask if they are there yet, **now**."],"当":["to act as","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Hangar} when a plane's brakes fail and the *roadblock* topples over, so he steps out **to act as** one, holding up a single glove. Then his booming voice has **to act as** the control tower, his cape **acts as** a windsock, and his red lightsaber **acts as** the wand that waves in the next landing."],"没":["not have","{Mario} head-butts every block {Inside} the {Lake} and gets nothing but *water drops* on his moustache. He does **not have** a coin. A turtle swings a *war club* and knocks off his red cap, so he does **not have** that either, and now he does **not have** a mushroom, a pipe or a single 'Wahoo!' left in him."],"动":["to move","{Darth Vader} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, breathing so loudly that a small *cloud* begins **to move** with every wheeze. In, it drifts towards his helmet, and out, it sails away across the water. A *strong arm* rises from the lagoon to hold it still, but the next breath **moves** that too, and **moves** the palm trees, the boats, the whole island."],"面":["face","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and bonks a block, and out flies a coin with a *face* on it. It winks. He stomps on it, and the **face** goes flat and springs back, moustached like his own. He eats a mushroom and his own **face** swells up to fill the room, while the coin laughs."],"起":["to rise","{Chewbacca} is fixing the ship in the {Basement} of the {Beach}, roaring at a wire, when a *runner* trips over his *coiled rope*. He yanks the last cable, the engines whine and the whole ship begins **to rise**, tearing through the ceiling. The rope pays out, the runner dangles from it, still jogging, and they all **rise** into the sky."],"看":["to look","{Kermit} hops up on the sink in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, trying **to look** for his missing cast, with a *shading hand* over one bulging *eye*. He **looks** left at a flying pig, he **looks** right at a burning piano, and his arms start to flail. A panicked 'Yaaay!' bursts out of him, and the whole audience turns **to look**."],"定":["to fix","{Darth Vader} glares up in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} at a *roof* that slides about, and he has had enough. With the Force he hammers in a *foot stop* and declares that it is **fixed**. Then he orders the whole bout frozen in carbonite, which **fixes** the referee, **fixes** both gloves in mid-punch, and leaves them standing there forever."],"天":["day","{Tarzan} throws back his head in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and lets out his jungle yell, and the *sky* turns blue: it is **day**. He swings off on a vine and falls asleep, and it goes dark. He yells again, and it's **day** again, and the clerks open and shut the shop until, by lunch, they have had forty **days**."],"分":["to divide","{Frodo} sits wearily in {Front} of the {Funfair} with a *cut cake*, the last food on a very long walk, and sets out **to divide** it with Sam. He **divides** it in half. Loyal Sam **divides** his half and hands one piece back, so Frodo **divides** that, and they go on until each has a single crumb and neither will eat it."],"还":["still","{Homer} trudges {Inside} the {Island} after a doughnut van, along a *road* with a *no sign* on every bend. He is tired, and he is **still** walking. He trips, says 'D'oh!', drools 'Mmm', and he is **still** walking, because for once a dim scheme has hold of him. The van is **still** a long way ahead."],"进":["to enter","{James Bond} straightens his bow tie in the {Bathroom} of the {Inn}, where a secret *road* runs across the tiles and stops at a *well*. Q's shoe-horn gadget squeezes him through any gap, so he **enters** the well, slides through a vault and comes out at a villain's dinner. Unruffled, he takes a seat, and remarks that it is always polite **to enter** late."],"好":["good","{Homer} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Tower} on the trail of a doughnut and finds a *woman* and her *child* sharing the very last one. 'Mmm, **good**,' he drools, planning to snatch it. The child holds out a sticky piece instead, and the woman pats his bald head and calls him a **good** boy, and for once nothing backfires. It feels **good**."],"小":["small","{Shrek} squeezes into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} and everything is **small**: **small** chairs, **small** cups, **small** boots on a cat with enormous eyes. A gingerbread man leaves a trail of *crumbs*, and they scatter under his green thumb. He sits down, and the whole **small** table disappears beneath him with a tiny, polite crunch."],"部":["part","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where a tiled *hillside* rises and a *spitting mouth* on top spits out the Batmobile, **part** by **part**. A wheel, a door, a fin. He snags each flying **part** with his grappling hook and bolts it on with a tool from his belt, until one last **part** is left over, and he broods over it."],"其":["its","{Chewbacca} sits {Inside} the {Beach} fixing the ship, shaking spare bolts in a *winnowing basket* and growling. Each bolt flies to **its** own socket, every wire to **its** own clip. One stubborn wrench refuses, so he rips the panel open in a temper and slams it into **its** place, and then the basket hops back to **its** own hook, terrified."],"些":["some","{Shrek} sits grumpily on *this spot* in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, laid across *two planks*, peeling an onion and wanting to be left alone. The donkey asks for **some**, so Shrek tears off **some** layers and hurls them. Then the planks creak, **some** onion slides off, and it lands on **some** very surprised skiers below."],"主":["master","The {Joker} sits in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, holding up a trick *candle* that relights however hard you blow, and declares himself the **master** of the dark. Each cleaner who puffs at it gets a squirt in the face, then bows. The inflatable flamingos salute and the drain gurgles 'Yes, **master**' as he cackles and deals out more cards."],"样":["appearance","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, swallows a *tree* and a *sheep* in one gulp, and lays a huge spotted egg. It hatches into a woolly shrub with the **appearance** of neither, bleating and dropping leaves. Yoshi is thrilled, and he gulps down a jet plane to change his own **appearance**, turning up with wings and a very long face."],"理":["reason","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Beach}, where a stone *king* guards a carved *village*, and she reads the ancient clues upside down. Every trap has a **reason**: this tile sinks because the king is greedy, that blade swings because the village is thirsty. She finds the last **reason**, pours water on the model, and the door grinds open."],"心":["heart","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Inn}, peeling an onion to prove that ogres have layers and no feelings at all. He peels and peels, and at the very centre a huge *heart* is thumping like a drum. It bounces away and hops onto his chest, his green cheeks flush, and the donkey sobs that he knew Shrek had a **heart**, a big soft **heart**."],"她":["she","{Tarzan} drops from a vine in {Front} of the {Spa} and beats his chest before a *woman* in a sunhat, with a *scorpion* sitting on the brim. 'Me Tarzan, **she** Jane,' he explains to it, in perfect scorpion. It clicks back that **she** is calm, **she** is clever, and **she** lifts it off herself and sets it on his head."],"本":["root","{Batman} descends to the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, because every crime has a **root**, he growls, and tonight the rides are misbehaving. He follows a tangle of *roots* with a torch from his belt, tugging one and making the carousel spin, tugging another and shaking the big wheel. He digs to the very **root** and finds one smug carrot."],"前":["front","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, sees a very long queue and roars until the *front* of it trembles. He wants the **front**, so he tears the counter out of the floor and carries it back to himself, and now he is at the **front**. His friends grin, the clerk faints, and everyone pretends that is where the **front** always was."],"开":["to open","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Island} theatre, because the show must **open** in ten seconds and the curtain is stuck. He hops up and hauls on a heavy *door bar*, and it gives way: doors **open**, trunks **open**, clams **open**, a crate of chickens bursts **open**. He throws his arms in the air, mouth wide **open**, and screams 'Yaaay!'"],"但":["but","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} over a *standing person* painting a *sunrise* on the wall. He studies it through his helmet with booming disapproval: it is quite good, **but** too pink. The painter fixes it, **but** now there are too few stormtroopers. The painter adds fifty, weeping, **but** Vader only sighs that the sky is still far too cheerful."],"因":["cause","{Yoshi} swallows a *sleeping mat* in {Front} of the {Inn} and lays a big round egg, and that is the **cause** of everything. It rolls away and bowls over a waiter, whose soup flies onto a cow, who stampedes through the washing. The innkeeper follows the chaos back up the street, looking for the **cause**, and finds a green dinosaur asleep and smiling."],"只":["only","The {Joker} fans out a deck for a *lone bird* in the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, grinning hugely and telling it to pick a card, any card. It pecks one: a joker. It pecks again: a joker. The whole deck holds **only** jokers, the trick has **only** one ending, and the bird, the **only** audience he has, gets squirted."],"从":["from","{Cookie Monster} munches {Inside} the {Lagoon}, spraying crumbs, and a *follower* trots behind him eating them, then another, then fifty. Me want know where cookie come **from**, he bellows, googly eyes rolling. They trace the crumbs back **from** the sea, **from** the palm trees, **from** the stairs, and all of them point at his furry blue belly."],"想":["to think","{Shrek} sits in the {Basement} of the {Stadium}, trying **to think** in peace about his swamp, with a *lookout* posted to warn him about the donkey. He **thinks** about mud and his *heart* thumps happily, then he **thinks** about onions and steam rises from his ears. The lookout yells, the donkey arrives talking, and Shrek roars and forgets it all."],"实":["real","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Beehive} to inspect a bee with a towering *hairdo* that scrapes the *roof*. Watson says it is obviously a wig. Sherlock lifts his magnifying glass, sniffs one crumb of wax, tugs once, and the bee yelps: it is **real**, he announces smugly, elementary. Every bee in the hive at once begs to know if its own fuzz is **real**."],"日":["sun","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, and his visor locks on to the *sun* shining through the window, unlicensed. He stiffly reads out the directive and politely arrests the **sun**, cuffing it with one steel hand. His armour starts to glow, honey melts and bees don sunglasses, so he releases the **sun** with a formal warning."],"军":["army","{James Bond} is surrounded in {Front} of the {Dunes} by an entire *army* on camels, all aiming at his tuxedo. Bond. James Bond, he says, unruffled, and presses a button on Q's watch, which does one absurd thing: it vibrates the sand. The whole **army** wobbles and falls in a heap, shaken, not stirred, and he strolls through the **army** straightening his tie."],"者":["one who","The {Joker} peeks into the {Basement} of the {Hut} and finds a *busy man* rushing from job to job. Cackling, he pins a trick badge on him for each: **one who** cooks, **one who** sweeps, **one who** sings to potatoes. Each badge squirts him when he reads it, and the Joker adds a badge of his own: **one who** laughs."],"意":["meaning","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, and can only ever say his own name, so nobody knows his **meaning**. He swallows the *music* off the radio and lays it as a singing egg, which hatches a pink *heart* that thumps in time. At last everyone gets the **meaning**: the drums say hello, and the flutes say lunch."],"无":["without","{Walter White} stands {Inside} the {Pool} with his goggles and beakers, proudly painting a *vanishing man* with a harmless disappearing ink from his school experiment. First the man is **without** his hat, then **without** his legs, then **without** a head. Only his trunks are left, bouncing down the slide **without** anybody in them, and Walter notes the result **without** a single error."],"力":["power","{Lara Croft} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} tower just as an ancient trap releases a huge stone ball. She hangs from a ledge by one *strong arm*, swings up, and stops the boulder dead with pure **power**. Her ponytail doesn't even move. Then she heaves it back up the ramp, and the tower shakes with her **power**."],"它":["it","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Spa} when a long *serpent* slides up the lamp post, and nobody knows what **it** is. He tries talking to **it**, but **it** only hisses, so, baffled, he yells his jungle yell, grabs **it** by the tail and swings away, using **it** as a vine across the car park."],"与":["and","{Yoshi} tugs the ribbon of a *gift* with his tongue in the {Basement} of the {Museum}, and finds a teapot **and** a goldfish. He swallows the teapot **and** the goldfish **and** the paper, then lays one egg. It cracks, **and** out comes a teapot with fins, swimming round the exhibits, **and** the curator faints."],"长":["long","{Charlie Brown} sighs {Inside} the {Hangar}, because his single curl has suddenly turned into *long hair*, so **long** that it slides across the floor and out on the runway. His kite string gets tangled in it, a kite-eating tree grabs the end, and he is dragged away. Good grief, he says, and it grows **longer**, and it is a **long** way to the tree.","cháng"],"把":["to hold","{Batman} slips into the {Basement} of the {Spa} after a *python* wrapped around a stolen safe, growling that it has a choice. He pulls a gadget from his utility belt: a spring-loaded *helping hand* built **to hold** anything. It shoots out and **holds** the snake by its tail, **holds** the safe, and then **holds** Batman's cape, and he broods, stuck."],"机":["machine","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Beach}, while Q, sighing, unveils his latest **machine**. It does one absurd thing: it turns a *tree* into a *small table*, with a whirr and a puff of sawdust. Bond pushes the lever, escapes three villains by serving them coconut drinks on it, and remarks that the **machine** does cater well."],"十":["ten","{Sherlock} slips {Inside} the {Beehive}, sees a wax *cross* blink on a cell door, and instantly deduces there are **ten** bees here, no more. He ticks them off on his long violinist's fingers, all **ten**, with Watson trailing behind him. One bee walks in late and spoils the sum, and Sherlock simply sends it home, because the answer was **ten**."],"民":["people","{Mario} stomps on a warp pipe {Inside} the {Inn}, and instead of a coin, out pops a *commoner*, then another, then two hundred. These **people** pour down the stairs, ordering soup and singing. He jumps on the pipe to stop it, shouting 'Wahoo!', but the **people** just bounce him aloft and elect him king of the plumbing."],"第":["number (ordinal)","{Darth Vader} strides out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, lifting a *slingshot* made of *bamboo* with the Force, and fires coconuts down a row of stormtroopers. Each trooper who catches one gets a **number**: **number** one, **number** two, **number** three, read out in a booming voice. Whoever is last has to polish the helmet."],"公":["public","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Lagoon} exactly when he means to, and taps his staff until a whole *town square* grows out of the sand. He fires off a free fireworks show that everyone may watch, because it is **public**. Dolphins take the benches, tourists picnic, and when the cranky manager objects, the wizard blows a smoke ring: it is **public** now."],"此":["this","{Cookie Monster} thunders into the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, googly eyes spinning, and stabs a furry blue finger at *this spot*. Me want **this**, he bellows, and he devours the spot in a spray of crumbs. There is a hole there now, and **this** one hole has a cookie in it, so he dives in after **this**."],"已":["already","{Yoshi} races down to the {Basement} of the {Beach} to swallow the party food, but his tongue comes back empty, because it has **already** gone. He looks round and finds an egg **already** laid beside him, **already** hatched, its shell **already** swept up. The cake in it was **already** eaten, by him, some time ago, and he burps."],"工":["work","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, too cranky and too wise to do his own **work**, and points his staff at a *workbench*. With a spell it lurches to life, saws fly and hammers bang, and it starts to **work** on a boat, a bridge and a duck. It won't stop, the wizard puffs his pipe, and soon the shore is one clattering factory."],"使":["to make","{Sherlock} strolls into the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, and with one remark about ink stains he can **make** a *clerk* faint. Bored and smug, he **makes** the clerk confess. He deduces a secret about a *standing person* and **makes** him blush, then plays his violin and **makes** all the bees dance a waltz, without once leaving his chair."],"情":["feeling","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, hugging a *standing heart* covered in green *moss*, and lets out a roar so full of **feeling** that only his friends can understand. The boxers sob. He growls again, softer, the moss bursts into tiny flowers, and a new **feeling** washes over the crowd, while the referee wails in those enormous hairy arms."],"明":["bright","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and head-butts a block above the canvas, and out float the *sun and moon* together. He grabs them and glows like a star, invincible and flashing, so **bright** that the boxers wear three pairs of sunglasses. 'Wahoo!' he cries, stomping about, and every shadow flees the **bright** ring."],"性":["nature","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, roaring, because it is an ogre's **nature**, and he plants a *seedling* in the mud. It sprouts through the tiles, as is its **nature**, and a *standing heart* beats calmly next to it, unbothered. The donkey says he's just soft by **nature**, and Shrek roars louder, blushing."],"知":["to know","The {Joker} bounces in {Front} of the {Beehive} to prank a *sage* who is said **to know** everything. He holds out a squirting flower and asks him to smell it. The sage **knows**, and steps aside, so the water hits a bee. He **knows** about the trick cards, too, and the Joker's huge grin slowly droops."],"全":["whole","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Mint} and has no patience for a single coin. He growls, wraps his hairy arms around a *treasure chest* and rips the **whole** thing from the wall, then the **whole** vault door with it. He hoists the **whole** lot onto his bandolier and clanks off, loyally saving some for a friend."],"三":["three","{Sailor Moon} begins her long sparkly transformation in {Front} of the {Mansion} and trips over *three planks* that have fallen off the porch. She tries **three** more twirls and falls **three** more times, and her wail goes up **three** octaves. Luna sighs, the tiara flies, and it knocks over **three** garden gnomes in the name of justice."],"又":["again","{Yoshi} swallows a bath duck in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and lays it as an egg, and it hatches, and he swallows it **again**. His *right hand* pats his belly, and here comes another egg. Out pops the duck, and his tongue shoots out **again**, and the ducks in the water hold up score cards, and he goes **again**."],"关":["to close","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} and raises his staff at a tiny *mountain pass*, muttering the old stone words. With a boom it starts **to close**, granite grinding shut on an advancing line of swans. Cranky now, he **closes** the umbrellas with a spell, **closes** his hat brim, and lights his pipe."],"点":["dot","{Darth Vader} visits a *fortune teller* in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, who flicks glowing *embers* onto a chart of the galaxy. He leans in, breathing loudly, and touches the tip of his red lightsaber to the paper, leaving one tiny burning **dot**. Then another. He joins each **dot** into a helmet and booms his approval."],"正":["straight","The {Joker} leaps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} and deals his cards in a dead **straight** line through the vines, up to a *goal line* painted between two trees. A five-card **straight** lands in a row, and then he walks along it, bent double with cackling, and it's the only **straight** thing about him."],"业":["business","{Yoshi} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and starts a **business** selling his own eggs, stacking them up a wobbling *scaffold*. Customers pay in melons, he swallows the melons, and he lays more eggs. **Business** booms, the scaffold sways, and soon he has a tiny tie and a very long tongue for answering the phone."],"外":["outside","{Walter White} sniffs his beaker in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, announces that this precise school experiment must be done **outside**, and marches out to the RV. Under a *dusk moon*, he stirs with a *fortune stick*, and a harmless stink of rotten eggs rolls from the flask. It's so bad that all the islanders and even their furniture move **outside**."],"将":["will","{James Bond} is tied to a chair in {Front} of the {Stadium} while a *general* tells him the future: he **will** talk, he **will** beg. Unruffled, Bond replies with what **will** happen instead: this cufflink **will** beep, that chair **will** fold, and the general **will** be wearing the ropes. Each thing happens, right on the dot, and he straightens his bow tie."],"两":["two","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Stadium} and finds an ancient *balance scale* guarding a relic. One idol tips it and the ceiling starts to fall, so the puzzle clearly wants **two**. She flips over a dart, snatches a twin idol off a ledge and sets the **two** down at once, and **two** huge doors roll open."],"高":["tall","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Tower}, irritated that he can't see over the hills. He taps the *tower* with his staff and mutters, and it grows **tall**, floor on floor, with sparks flying. His pointy hat grows too, **taller** and **taller**, until clouds snag on it and geese stop to ask for directions, and he finds it just **tall** enough."],"间":["between","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, where red lasers leave only a thin *gap* **between** each beam. He slips **between** the first two, unruffled, without creasing his tuxedo. He squeezes **between** the next, sipping his drink, and bends **between** two guards, then he comes out and remarks that he was caught **between** engagements."],"由":["from","{Yoshi} wanders {Inside} the {Boathouse} and finds a *sprouting field* growing up through the boards, and everything comes **from** it. His tongue plucks a melon **from** the soil, then a rowing boat, then a goose. He lays them as eggs, so now the goose comes **from** an egg, which comes **from** Yoshi, who shrugs and carries on."],"问":["to ask","{Walter White} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, where a *gate* with a talking *mouth* won't open, and being a teacher, he knocks and starts **to ask**. What is the atomic number of gold, he **asks**. The mouth guesses twelve, so he adjusts his glasses and **asks** a harder one, until the gate gives up and flies open."],"很":["very","{Homer} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, **very** lazy and **very** hungry, following the *footsteps* of a doughnut vendor. He comes up against a *glare* from the vendor, so he tries a dim scheme: a fake moustache. It falls off in the jam. 'D'oh!' he says, **very** sticky, and it is **very** clear there will be no doughnut."],"最":["most","{Zorro} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *grabbing hand* holds up a golden *sun* as a prize for whoever slashes the **most** Zs. Swish, swish, he carves up the magazines, the chairs and the mayor's hat, and he wins with the **most** by far. Dashing to the last, he bows the **most** deeply, and vanishes laughing."],"重":["heavy","The {Joker} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} with a *heavy weight* painted with a sign saying feather, and hands it to a passing diver, grinning. It is so **heavy** that the diver sinks straight through the floor. The Joker cackles and picks up another one, the real feather. No, this one is the **heavy** one, and down he goes as well."],"并":["and also","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, pulling gadgets from his utility belt, and he clicks together some *linked rails* across the floor. He adds a batarang, **and also** a smoke bomb, **and also** a grappling hook, and sets a tiny Batmobile running along the track. Then, brooding, he solves the case, **and also** the boxer's maths homework."],"物":["thing","{Walter White} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with a bag of chemistry props and proudly explains that every **thing** is made of elements. To prove it, he chalks a formula on a *cow*, which stands there, waving a *pennant*. Each **thing** gets its label, the tap, the soap, the towel, and the cow, until nothing is left unnamed."],"手":["hand","{Sherlock} climbs down into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, where a stranger's *hand* sticks up from the bilge, and raises his magnifying glass. From one callus, he deduces a left-handed oarsman, a cat and a dreadful aunt. The **hand** claps slowly, in smug agreement. Sherlock shakes the **hand**, and poor Watson faints into the boat."],"应":["should","{Yoshi} sits in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, staring at a little *shed* with a sign saying he **should** not eat it. He knows he **should** walk away. His long tongue doesn't, and it shoots out, wraps round the shed and gulps it down. He lays it as an egg, looking guilty, and agrees he **should** really have read that sign."],"战":["to fight","The {Joker} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and hands a rubber *halberd* to a *fortune teller* and to the butler, then dares them **to fight**. They **fight** across the marble, thwacking each other with squeaks, while he throws trick cards and cackles. They both turn on him at last, and now all three **fight** in a storm of confetti."],"向":["towards","{Shrek} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium}, and straps on a *weathervane* that points only **towards** his swamp. He roars and sets off **towards** it, straight through the wall, flattening a goalpost. The donkey trots **towards** him, talking, so Shrek spins and the whole crowd leans **towards** the mud as well."],"头":["head","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Boathouse} on a vine, yelling, and flies **head** first into a pillar with a great clonk. Luckily, a *hairdo* full of ribbons and seagulls, borrowed from a startled guest, is piled on his **head**, and it cushions the blow. He shakes his **head**, baffled by the bun, and the apes all fall about laughing."],"文":["writing","{Walter White} stalks {Inside} the {Funfair} with chalk in hand, and he rolls up his sleeve on a *tattoo* of the periodic table, drawn with precise pride. He starts **writing** equations on the dodgems, on the candyfloss, on the big wheel, in perfect tiny **writing**. The children gather round to learn it, and he gives every one of them a test."],"体":["body","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Beach}, where a *standing person* has feet with *roots* growing into the floor. Raised by apes, he decides that this **body** is badly built, so he pokes it, thumps its chest and lifts its arms. He shows off his own **body** with a jungle yell, and the man's whole **body** creaks like a tree."],"政":["politics","The {Joker} grins in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, where monkeys argue over a *goal line* and a tortoise bangs a *cane* for order. He thinks **politics** is the funniest prank ever, so he runs for office with a squirting flower in his lapel. He wins by accident, and every speech ends in a bucket, which, he says, is just **politics**."],"美":["beautiful","{Mario} warps down a green pipe into the {Basement} of the {Lake} house and stomps on a scruffy *sheep*, and a coin pops out with a ding. The *sheep* turns **beautiful**: silky wool, sparkling hooves, a tiara. A *big man* begs for the same and bends over; one 'Wahoo!' stomp later he is **beautiful** too, twirling in a ballgown and shedding coins."],"相":["each other","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Stadium} from a wooden *lookout*, wanting everyone gone, and across the plaza Donkey climbs a second one and brays back. They bellow at **each other** for hours, ogre breath against donkey chatter. The *lookout* posts sway closer until they bump, and the two end up nose to nose, grumpily peeling onions for **each other**."],"见":["to see","{James Bond} adjusts his tuxedo in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and slips on Q's latest gadget, spectacles that let him **see** through anything. A *watcher* in the mirror, eyes all over her coat, stares straight back and can **see** him too. Unruffled, he tips the glasses at every eye and murmurs, 'Nice **to see** you. All of you.'"],"被":["by (passive)","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} pier, and for once everything is done to him. His cape is snagged **by** a hook, his belt is emptied **by** an otter and his *shirt* is stolen **by** a heron. Brooding, he wraps himself in a cow *hide* to lurk unseen, and the *hide* is promptly dragged off **by** a goose."],"利":["benefit","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} ruin, where an ancient *sickle* swings on a pendulum trap. She backflips over it, and its blade slices open a sealed jar of golden relics. The **benefit** is instant: treasure pours across the tiles. The **benefit** spreads too, since every crab leaves wearing a tiny crown and Lara gets a free trim from the next swing."],"什":["what","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Funfair} ghost train, where a *standing person* holds up a giant *cross* like a riddle. One crumb usually tells him everything, but not this. '**What** is it for?' he demands through his magnifying glass, while the cross spins, Watson whispers '**What**?' and, for the first time ever, Sherlock has no idea **what**."],"二":["two","{Casper} drifts through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Car Park}, turns invisible and lifts *two planks* to build a bench for **two**. He only wants a friend to sit on it. A driver sees the *two planks* floating by themselves, shrieks **two** times and bolts; the planks sink down sadly side by side, **two** empty seats."],"等":["to wait","{Darth Vader} storms into the {Basement} of the {Jungle} *temple* and Force-chokes a ticket machine, which only prints number nine million: he has **to wait**. He breathes loudly while *bamboo* grows up through the floor and lifts his bench, and monkeys raise families on his helmet. He booms his disapproval, but the *temple* bell just tolls, and a tiny monk says **wait**."],"产":["to produce","{Charlie Brown} sighs in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, hoping **to produce** one decent kite from a rickety machine. With his luck, it beeps and **produces** a *newborn* lamb instead, then a *newborn* elephant, then a squeaking *newborn* hippo. 'Good grief,' he says as the machine keeps **producing**, each baby sitting on his zigzag shirt while Snoopy naps on top."],"或":["or","{Homer} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} until a *guard post* rolls up and its guard offers one choice: a doughnut **or** a pillow. 'Mmm,' he says, and schemes to grab both at once. He jams himself in the doorway between them, neither one **or** the other. 'D'oh!' he cries, while the doughnut **or** the pillow, nobody can say which, rolls slowly away."],"新":["new","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Inn} at a pile of *firewood* left in his way, then peels a log like an onion. Layer after layer comes off until the core is shiny and **new**, price tag still on. Furious, he peels another and finds a **new** kettle, a **new** hat and a **new** donkey who will not shut up."],"己":["self","{James Bond} straps on Q's gadget in the {Basement} of the {Beach} house: a *coiled rope* that can tie up only the wearer's own **self**. It shoots out and lashes him to a chair, with nobody else in the room. Unruffled, he nods at his own **self** in the mirror, says 'Bond. James Bond,' and slips free, leaving the rope hugging empty air."],"制":["to control","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, gripping a rubber *standing knife* wired up as a joystick. It is his best prank yet: now he can **control** every bee. Tilt left and they swerve, tilt right and they spell a huge grin in the air. Then the queen squirts his own flower at him and takes **control** of the knife."],"身":["body","{Sherlock} crouches in {Front} of the {Funfair} beside a huge inflatable *torso* and lifts one crumb from its belly with his magnifying glass. 'Elementary, Watson: this **body** belongs to a strongman who lost it at hoopla.' The *torso* hiccups and bounces off over the dodgems with Watson clinging on, and Sherlock smugly adds that the **body** prefers candyfloss."],"果":["fruit","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} exactly when he means to and taps one seed with his staff, and *fruit* explodes from the ceiling with a firework bang: apples, mangoes, melons as big as cars. 'You shall not pass!' he snaps at a rolling watermelon, and the **fruit** stacks itself into a wall, while he puffs his pipe on a throne of **fruit**."],"加":["to add","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Piazza} with Q's latest gadget, a giant *plus sign* whose one function is **to add**. He aims it at his drink, and it **adds** an olive, then a pigeon, then a scooter. 'I asked for shaken, not more,' he says, unruffled, as it goes on **adding** the cathedral bell."],"西":["west","{Shrek} stomps in {Front} of the {Beach} chalet wanting only peace, and a *bird nest* on the lamp post squawks at him. He roars so hard that the *bird nest* and every bird in it blow **west**, straight into the setting sun. Donkey gallops **west** after them, still talking, and Shrek finally sits alone in the orange glow."],"斯":["this","{Sailor Moon} strikes a pose in {Front} of the {Beehive} and starts a long sparkly speech about justice, *tearing* pages from her script and thrusting each one at the bees. '**This**!' she cries, throws her tiara and trips. Sobbing loudly and still *tearing*, she holds up the last page, and Luna the cat reads out its single word: **this**."],"月":["moon","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, where the *moon* has rolled down from the sky to wash. His long tongue shoots out and swallows the **moon** whole, plunging the night into darkness. 'Yoshi!' he gulps, wobbling, then lays a huge silver egg that cracks across the ice, and out skates the **moon**, glowing and very cross."],"话":["speech","{Homer} wakes in the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park} on a huge pink *tongue* and decides, in a dim scheme for free doughnuts, to make a **speech**. A *small speech bubble* floats from his mouth and says 'Mmm.' That is the whole **speech**. The *tongue* flicks him into the pool, and the bubble drifts down after him, popping with a 'D'oh!'"],"合":["to join","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Hut} with a doughnut jar whose *fitted lid* refuses **to join** it. His dim scheme is to sit on it, and click! They **join** so tightly that his trousers **join** them too. 'D'oh!' he yells, hopping in circles with the *fitted lid* clamped to his seat and every doughnut sealed out of reach."],"回":["to return","{Homer} shuffles {Inside} the {Waiting Room} and finds a *fence* within a *fence*, with a doughnut at the far exit. He waddles round between them, sure his scheme is working, and only **returns** to the same plastic chair. 'D'oh!' He tries again and **returns**, naps, tries again and **returns**, while the doughnut grows a little staler."],"特":["special","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and lands in a tiny *temple*, where a *cow* sits in a golden hat. Baffled, he asks her in animal talk what this is all about. She moos that she is very **special**, and the *temple* rings its bells for her alone. Tarzan gives his jungle yell, and the monks hand him a **special** hat too."],"代":["generation","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} clinic, then booms at a shaky *stand-in* in a plastic helmet, 'I am your father.' The *stand-in* gasps, points at a smaller one and says the same. That one points at a smaller one, **generation** after **generation**, down to a baby in a tiny cape, until a whole family tree wheezes back at Vader."],"内":["inside","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} cottage, shouting that he will never give up, and finds an *inner room* with another room **inside** it. His shadow clones poof out by the dozen, one for each door, each diving deeper **inside**. The last clone crawls into an *inner room* the size of a shoebox, where a frog is calmly eating ramen."],"信":["to believe","{Shrek} sits grumpily in the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} when a *standing person* floats a *speech bubble* at him: this swamp water is a fine perfume. Shrek refuses **to believe** it. Donkey, who will not shut up, **believes** every word and gargles the lot. Then the *speech bubble* turns to Shrek and calls him handsome, and, blushing green, he decides **to believe** that."],"表":["to show","{Batman} glides down to the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} **to show** off the newest item from his utility belt: a cape with a sequinned *robe hem*. He pulls a cord and a *seedling top* sprouts from his cowl, while he growls that this is what he will **show** criminals. The cats yawn, so he broods alone on a catwalk of yarn."],"化":["to change","{Homer} dozes in the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park} when a *shape-shifter* slips past looking exactly like a doughnut. He lunges with a 'Mmm', and it **changes** into a rubber ring, so he bites that. 'D'oh!' It **changes** into a lifeguard, a dolphin and a jelly, and while he chews, it **changes** him too: into a very surprised inflatable duck."],"老":["old","{Lara Croft} abseils into the {Basement} of the {Tower} and dodges a rolling boulder, only to find that the ancient relic is an *old man*. He is so **old** that his beard has wrapped the room three times, and he remembers when the tower was a pebble. She slings him over her shoulder and flips past every trap, while he grumbles that traps were better in the **old** days."],"给":["to give","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Lake} cottage with a flick of his staff, and presents spin out of the air, each box closed by a *fitted lid* and tied with *silk thread*. Cranky but wise, he casts a spell **to give** one to every frog. The *silk thread* unties itself, the lid pops, and out bursts a firework that **gives** everyone a free moustache."],"世":["world","{Sherlock} stoops in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} over a spinning *globe* and peers through his magnifying glass at one crumb of honey. 'Elementary: this bee has travelled the whole **world**.' The *globe* spins faster, bees orbit it like satellites, and Sherlock smugly names every country they visited, until Watson sighs that he has just deduced the **world**."],"位":["position","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} pavilion, where a *standing person* refuses to leave the top of a *podium*. Everyone wants that **position**. So Walter pours two beakers into a third beneath it, and the *podium* rises on fizzing foam, tipping each climber off in turn and swapping every **position** with precise, proud science."],"次":["time (occurrence)","{Cookie Monster} joins a *queue* of bees in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, howling 'Me want cookie!' The first **time**, he gets one crumb and devours it. The second **time**, he eats the tap in a spray of crumbs. Each **time** he shuffles back, googly eyes rolling, until the whole *queue* hands him a biscuit just to make him stop."],"度":["degree","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, lifts a giant *thermometer* with the Force and Force-chokes it until the mercury climbs. One **degree**, two **degrees**: the tap water bubbles and the rubber ducks turn pink. He booms his disapproval at the heat and drops it **degree** by **degree**, until the pool freezes and his breathing steams up his helmet."],"门":["door","{Mario} runs {Inside} the {Funfair} haunted house and stomps on a creaking *gate*, which pops a coin and turns into a **door**. 'Wahoo!' He head-butts a block and another **door** drops out, then a hundred more. Each **door** is a warp pipe in disguise, and the last one spits him back out on the same *gate*, moustache flapping."],"任":["responsibility","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and reads out a new directive: he is the *bearer* of all **responsibility**. His visor targets every task and stacks it on his steel back: the Ferris wheel, the hot-dog stand, three lost toddlers. A small boy politely hands him a goldfish. Stiffly, he arrests his own knees for creaking under the **responsibility**."],"常":["often","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Hangar} under a *hanging lamp* with a frilly *lampshade*, which swings and bonks him on the head. This happens **often**. It bonks him on the way in, it snags his kite and it bonks him again, 'Good grief', and Snoopy sets his watch by it, because bad luck visits Charlie so **often**."],"先":["first","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} at dawn, planning to be **first** so he can get his business done alone. A *front runner* in a gold medal is already there, smiling. Shrek roars, and the blast blows the *front runner* to the next town, but Donkey trots up, sits down and announces that he came **first**."],"海":["sea","{Homer} snores in the {Basement} of the {Island} cottage while a *busy mother* flicks *water drops* at him to wake him up. His dim scheme is to plug them with doughnuts, and soon the doughnuts float off on a rising **sea**. 'D'oh!' he says, paddling after them in a laundry basket across a whole **sea**, with gulls stealing every crumb."],"通":["to go through","{Tarzan} swings in on a vine in {Front} of the {Lagoon} hotel and, baffled by a *road* that stops at a wall, gives his jungle yell. Elephants answer and butt a *tunnel* straight through, so that he can **go through**. Monkeys **go through**, then a bus, then a flock of flamingos, while Tarzan swings to and fro, delighted by civilisation at last."],"教":["to teach","{James Bond} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} **to teach** a *dutiful son* the family trade. Q has supplied a *cane* that does one absurd thing: it shoots balls of wool. Unruffled, Bond taps the chalkboard, the son salutes, and every cat pounces. Lesson one, he says, straightening his tuxedo, is how **to teach** under fire."],"儿":["child","{Casper} drifts {Inside} the {Car Park}, turning invisible to play hide and seek with a **child** on tiny running *legs*. He has no *legs* of his own and is terribly jealous. He pops up to say hello, expecting the usual scream, but the **child** shrieks with joy instead, and at last Casper has a friend."],"原":["original","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Mint} and lands beside a *cliff spring* gushing gold coins out of the wall. His tongue lashes out and swallows the first coin ever made, the **original**, with a dinosaur stamped on it. 'Yoshi!' He lays it as an egg, every other coin bows, and the *cliff spring* chimes that this egg holds the **original**."],"东":["east","{Darth Vader} wakes in {Front} of the {Lagoon} lighthouse as the sun bursts up in the *east*, glaring off his helmet. He booms his disapproval and raises a hand, and the Force swivels every palm tree, fish and deckchair to point **east**. Then he Force-chokes the sunrise, which does nothing at all, and he stands breathing heavily, shaking his lightsaber at the **east**."],"声":["sound","{Sherlock} sits in {Front} of the {Jungle} treehouse playing his violin while a *scholar* listens for one strange **sound**. The *scholar* raises an *eyebrow* at every noise, but Sherlock needs only one creak. 'Elementary: a left-handed monkey with hiccups.' He deduces it from the **sound** alone, and the *eyebrow* flies off in amazement."],"提":["to lift","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Beach} chalet on a vine and stares, baffled, at a suitcase. He yells, and a gorilla's *helping hand* comes through the window **to lift** it. Then the gorilla **lifts** Tarzan, then the whole chalet, and a giant *tick mark* scrawls itself across the ceiling as everything floats off over the waves."],"立":["to stand","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} temple and steps on an ancient *podium*, a trap that commands all who enter **to stand**. Stone doors grind, and a rolling boulder stops dead. Ponytail swinging, she feels the *podium* sink: she must **stand** perfectly still or be squashed, and so must every crab on the floor, very upright."],"及":["to reach","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} pier as a *chaser* lunges **to reach** him. The *chaser* almost **reaches** his collar, but Bond, unruffled, fires Q's telescopic sleeve, a rubber glove that does nothing but stretch. It shoots out, **reaches** a passing kite and lifts him clear, and he straightens his cuffs in mid-air."],"比":["to compare","{Batman} glides down to the {Basement} of the {Beach} hotel, where a pair of *twins* both claim to have stolen one biscuit. He pulls a scanner from his utility belt **to compare** them: freckles, fingerprints, shoe size. 'Identical,' he growls, brooding. He **compares** their shadows by batarang-light too, and the *twins* giggle and swap hats behind his cape."],"员":["member","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Mint}, where each *employee* wears a badge: proud **member** of the coin club. He wants one, so his tongue shoots out and swallows a badge with a gulp. He lays it as an egg, and it cracks to reveal a new *employee* in a tiny tie. The club votes, and Yoshi's egg is now a fully paid **member**."],"解":["to solve","{James Bond} descends into the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave}, where the yeti sobs in a giant tangle of rope. Q's gadget is a pen that does one thing: **solve** knots. One click and each loop becomes an *untied knot*, and the yeti is free. Unruffled, Bond hands him a crossword, and the pen **solves** that as well."],"水":["water","{Sherlock} sits in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} as *water* trickles under the door, and he studies a single drop through his magnifying glass. 'Elementary, Watson: this **water** comes from the cooler, filled on a Tuesday by a man with a limp.' The **water** rises past the magazines while he deduces, and Watson paddles by on a chair, begging for a plumber."],"名":["name","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and head-butts a block, and a *name tag* pops out instead of a coin. It slaps itself on the referee, whose **name** is now Gerald. 'Wahoo!' Every hit gives a sillier **name**, the bell becoming Sir Dingdong and the gloves Punchy, until a *name tag* sticks to Mario's own moustache."],"真":["true","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Funfair}, holding up a trick *magnifying glass* that shows only what is **true**. He points it at his playing cards: all aces, all fake. He points it at his squirting flower: plastic. Then he peers at his own huge grin, and the glass whispers the one **true** thing: spinach in his teeth."],"论":["to discuss","{Lara Croft} climbs out of a vent into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} and finds an ancient puzzle: a *neat stack* of golden tablets. Each carving speaks in a *small speech bubble*, and they begin **to discuss** which of them is cursed. Lara flips between the bubbles while they **discuss** and **discuss**, until one pops and the *neat stack* releases a rolling boulder."],"处":["place","{Charlie Brown} sighs in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, his *trudging feet* hunting for one **place** to fly his kite. A *fortune stick* floats by and points to the perfect **place**, the very end of the diving board. Good grief: a tree has somehow grown out there, and it eats the kite at once while Snoopy watches from the towels."],"走":["to walk","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} as a *runner* sprints past. With three flicks of his rapier he slashes a Z on the man's shoes, which means he must **walk**. The *runner* slows to a **walk**, and so do the ducks, the rowing boats and Zorro's black horse, all very dignified, until Zorro vanishes laughing."],"义":["meaning","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} gazebo, where a *judge* in a curly wig thunders, 'What is the **meaning** of this?' Yoshi's tongue whips out and swallows the wig, the question and the gavel in one gulp. He lays an egg on the bench, the *judge* cracks it open, and out comes a scroll giving the **meaning** of life: ice cream."],"各":["each","{Gandalf} raises his staff in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} as a *visitor* climbs from the tub, then another, then a hundred. Cranky and wise, he casts a spell for **each** one: **each** gets a firework in a different colour and one line of advice. Then **each** *visitor* sneezes a spark and climbs back in, and Gandalf mutters that they arrived exactly when they meant to."],"入":["to enter","{Robocop} stands stiffly at the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, his visor scanning each *person* who tries **to enter**. He recites a directive about towels and politely arrests a flip-flop. Then a *person* in armbands whispers 'Please', his display flashes green, and everyone may **enter** at once in a stampede that leaves him spinning like a turnstile."],"几":["how many","{James Bond} lays a *small table* in the {Basement} of the {Beach} house and clicks a cufflink from Q that counts guests. '**How many** for dinner?' it chirps at each ring of the doorbell. Two, twelve, forty seagulls: the *small table* stretches with every answer. Unruffled, Bond adjusts his bow tie and asks **how many** like their chips shaken, not stirred."],"口":["mouth","{Kermit} flails down into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, where a giant *mouth* in the wall is eating rowing boats. 'Yaaay!' he shrieks, arms waving, trying to stage-manage the chaos. He hops up and plays his banjo to soothe it, but the **mouth** swallows the banjo, burps a perfect chord, and the **mouth** demands an encore."],"认":["to recognize","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, running his targeting display over each *person* in the queue. His visor beeps: he can **recognize** nobody. Then a *small speech bubble* pops up over an old lady, saying 'Hello, tin can!' He whirrs, finally **recognizes** his inventor, and politely arrests her for excessive hugging."],"条":["strip","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Cat Café} on a vine, then plods on *trudging feet*, dragging a *bare tree* behind him. Baffled by tables, he peels the bark into long **strips** and hangs one from every lamp to swing on. The cats, who understand his yell, shred each **strip** into thinner **strips**, and the whole place dangles with ribbons."],"平":["flat","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, sparks fizzing from his cheeks, and looses a Thunderbolt that knocks everything *flat*. Ropes, stools and both boxers lie **flat** as pancakes, blinking and smoking gently. 'Pika!' he says proudly, and then a Poké Ball rolls in, bonks him on the head and leaves him **flat** too."],"系":["system","{Shrek} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} lido wanting a quiet mud bath, but Donkey has built a **system**. A tug on a *silk skein* tips a bucket of onions down a *slide*, which kicks a lever, which wakes a goose. Shrek roars, the roar shakes the next lever, and the whole **system** goes off at once, landing Donkey in the bath."],"气":["air","{Chewbacca} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} sauna and a blast of *steam* whooshes out. In a temper he rips a pipe clean off the wall, and the **air** roars out with it, inflating every lilo on the sand. He tries to fix it the way he fixes ships, growling, and only pumps in more **air** until the whole beach floats up like a balloon."],"题":["question","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Beach} lifeguard station and lands on an exam *page* full of **questions**. Baffled by pencils, he asks the animals each **question**: can a crab wear trousers, do seagulls need hats? The crab nods, the seagull squawks, a monkey scrawls a *tick mark* with a banana, and Tarzan gives a yell of triumph."],"活":["to live","{Homer} wobbles {Inside} the {Warehouse} and spills a puddle of *living water* while hunting for doughnuts. Wherever it flows, things start **to live**: crates sprout legs, a broom dances and a doughnut gets up and runs. 'D'oh!' Homer chases it with a dim scheme involving a sock, while the doughnut makes up its mind **to live** freely."],"尔":["so","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Basement} of the {Car Park} and brushes a *wind chime*, **so** it tinkles, **so** a pigeon panics, **so** the alarm wails. He only wants to say hello, **so** he turns visible, **so** the attendant screams and runs. Casper sighs, **so** the *wind chime* rings all over again."],"更":["more","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} lodge and strikes a huge *gong* with his staff, muttering a spell. Each bang makes **more**: **more** vines, **more** bananas, **more** fireworks exploding from the plughole. The cranky wizard bellows that there shall be no **more**, the *gong* takes it as a challenge, and his hat sprouts **more** hats."],"别":["don't","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} with a *spare part* for the Batmobile, past a sign pinned by a *standing knife*: **Don't**! Gruffly, he checks his utility belt for a gadget to handle it. He fires his grappling hook at another sign, **don't** touch, which yanks down an avalanche, and the yeti sledges past, shaking his head."],"打":["to hit","{Darth Vader} stands in the {Basement} of the {Spa}, trying to hang up a towel. He lifts a hammer with the Force **to hit** a *nail*, misses, and it **hits** a pipe instead. A rubber *helping hand* on a spring grabs the hammer and **hits** everything, boiler and gong and all, until the spa clangs like a drum and Vader breathes along in time."],"女":["woman","{Naruto} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Museum} and shouts a challenge at a marble statue of a *woman*. She blinks, steps off her plinth and beats him in a race. He never gives up, so a dozen shadow clones poof out, and the stone **woman** beats them too, then hands him ramen, and he vows to run as fast as that **woman**."],"变":["to change","{Batman} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *sweating man* waves his *right hand* over coins **to change** them into buttons. Batman scans him with a gadget, which is promptly **changed** into a bread roll. Gruffly he throws a batarang, it **changes** into a pigeon in mid-air and flies off, and Batman broods."],"四":["four","{Sailor Moon} twirls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and transforms in a long sparkly sequence beside a tiny *fence*. In the pen a bee on **four** tiny *legs* stares up at her. She gives a speech about justice, throws her tiara and knocks down all **four** posts; then she cries loudly, **four** great sobs, while Luna the cat counts them."],"神":["god","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Funfair} to a *small altar* where a tiny **god** in a golden hat is hiding. A sticky *skewer* drips a clue on the steps, and he examines it through his magnifying glass. 'Elementary: this **god** had toffee apples at noon and rode the dodgems in disguise.' The little **god** applauds, blushing, and Watson hands over a napkin."],"总":["overall","{Zorro} leaps from his black horse in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} aquarium and slashes a Z into the wall for every creature, a dashing *tally*: three hundred fish, forty crabs, one grumpy octopus. With a last flourish he circles the **overall** total, but the octopus rubs out a Z and the *tally* wobbles. Zorro vanishes laughing, and the **overall** count remains: lots, plus one octopus."],"何":["what","{Homer} snoozes {Inside} the {Hut} under a huge *lotus leaf* when a frog hops off it and croaks, '**What** are you doing?' Homer's brain stops. He asks **what** a Tuesday is and **what** a doughnut is, and the frog answers by eating his. 'D'oh!' he says, as the leaf flops down over his head."],"电":["electricity","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and raises a *lightning bolt* with the Force. He plugs his red lightsaber into it, and **electricity** crackles everywhere: the tills spin, coins stand on end, the cashier's hair puffs up like a dandelion. His breathing turns into a loud hum, and the whole building glows with **electricity**."],"数":["number","{Sherlock} leans in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} beside a lifeguard with a *tall bun*, who taps each swimmer with a *cane*. One glance at the wet tiles and he deduces every **number**: seven swimmers, three verrucas, ninety hairpins in the *tall bun*. 'Elementary,' he says smugly, and the *cane* taps him with the biggest **number** of the day."],"安":["peaceful","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Mansion}, a *safe home* in a thunderstorm. People usually scream at him, but tonight they are all fast asleep. He turns invisible so as not to wake a soul, and everything is **peaceful**: rain on the windows, cocoa on the step, the *safe home* gently snoring. Casper, **peaceful** at last, has frightened nobody for a whole minute."],"少":["few","{Sherlock} examines a *pinch* of crumbs in the {Basement} of the {Tower}, just a **few**: three, possibly four. 'Elementary, Watson. From these **few** I deduce a left-handed baker, a lost goat and a hidden diary.' Watson sneezes, the *pinch* blows away, and Sherlock smugly solves the rest of the town's crimes from the empty air."],"报":["to report","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and catches a newsroom at work: a *helping hand* writes while a *pressing hand* stamps. They **report** everything he does. He throws a batarang, and it makes the headline; he swings out on his grappling hook, and it makes the headline. Gruffly he growls for silence, and they **report** that too, in huge letters."],"才":["only then","{Cookie Monster} sits {Inside} the {Island} palace, googly eyes fixed on a *green shoot*, told he may eat when it flowers. 'Me want cookie!' he wails, chewing the curtains in a spray of crumbs. On day forty the *green shoot* pops out one flower, and **only then** does he devour the cookie. **Only then** does he also eat the palace."],"结":["knot","{James Bond} stands {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and tests Q's gadget, a *lucky charm* on a *silk thread* that ties one absurdly tight **knot**. It coils round him and the yeti in a fluffy **knot**. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, unruffled, by way of introduction, then escapes with a tiny cufflink, leaving the yeti dressed as a bow."],"反":["opposite","{Frodo} trudges into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} on bare hairy feet, where a *rebel* does the **opposite** of everything. Frodo pleads that he must walk on, and the *rebel* sits down. He slips on the Ring to go invisible, and the *rebel* lights up like a bonfire, doing the **opposite**. Weary, Frodo says 'Stay,' and the *rebel* walks off with Sam."],"受":["to receive","{Sherlock} bends in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, watching the *handover* of a golden oar through his magnifying glass. One wet footprint and he deduces it is meant for him, so he holds out his arms **to receive** it. It is so heavy that he sinks through the floorboards into the river, and he **receives** a second prize: a soggy, outraged duck."],"目":["eye","{Mario} jumps up in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and head-butts a floating block, and a huge *eye* rolls out instead of a coin. He stomps on it with a 'Wahoo!' The **eye** squashes, pops and blinks back bigger. It follows him down the warp pipe in the plughole, and he comes up a moment later wearing the **eye** on his cap."],"太":["too","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} cottage and lands on a sleeping *giant*. He tries to talk to him as he talks to apes, but the *giant* is **too** big, **too** loud and **too** deep asleep. Baffled, Tarzan gives his jungle yell, the *giant* sneezes, the island tips over, and the vine turns out **too** short."],"量":["quantity","{Lara Croft} cartwheels into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} and finds an ancient puzzle: a stone jug must hold the right **quantity** of *sun*. She climbs the towel rail, angles a relic mirror and pours in golden light, jug after jug. Get the **quantity** wrong and a boulder rolls, so she dodges it, ponytail flying, while the *sun* giggles down the drain."],"再":["again","{Zorro} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} cabin and builds a seesaw from a *plank* and a *tortoise shell*. With a flourish he slashes a Z on the wood and jumps down, and the tortoise flies up. It lands and says '**Again**!' So he slashes and jumps **again** and **again**, until he vanishes laughing and tortoises queue round the island."],"感":["to feel","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and casts a small spell on an onion, and *tears* stream down into his beard. Now he can **feel** everything at once: sad, happy, hungry, cranky. He waves his staff, and everyone starts **to feel** it too: the mops sob, the boiler sighs, and his fireworks go off in gentle, weeping sparks."],"建":["to build","{James Bond} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with Q's gadget, a wristwatch that can only **build**. He presses the crown and a tiny *builder* pops out and starts **to build** a tower of coins, up past the ceiling and past the clouds. Unruffled, Bond steps aboard, and a passing aeroplane stops to buy some yen."],"务":["task","{Walter White} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with a list of every *chore*: scrub the tiles, clear the drains, polish the taps. Proud of his precise science, he mixes a fizzing beaker for each **task** and labels it in neat chalk. The foam scrubs so well that it takes his glasses too, and mopping that up becomes the final **task**."],"做":["to do","{Zorro} swings in on a rope to the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, where a *storyteller* tells a *standing person* what **to do**. The tale says lift a crate, so he **does**, and Zorro slashes a Z on it. The tale says juggle hedgehogs, and everyone **does** that too, until Zorro vanishes laughing with the last page."],"接":["to receive","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} as the yeti hurls snowballs at him, and not a hair moves. A *handmaid* from Q's lab presses a button, and a *helping hand* springs from his tuxedo **to receive** each one neatly. It **receives** a fridge, a sledge and finally the yeti, who only wanted a hug."],"必":["must","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} kiosk with a *pinned heart* badge on his cape, listing his vows. He **must** brood. He **must** patrol every crab. He **must** fire his grappling hook at the tide before it turns, growling through the salt spray, because the *pinned heart* keeps throbbing and a man in a cape simply **must**."],"场":["field","{Charlie Brown} goes down to the {Basement} of the {Hangar} to fly his kite at last, shovelling in *soil* and switching on lamps that blaze *sun rays*. A whole **field** grows overnight, with wind and wheat. He runs, the kite soars, and a tree shoots up in the middle of the **field** and eats it. 'Good grief.'"],"件":["item","{James Bond} checks the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *standing person* in a lab coat reads out Q's packing list, **item** by **item**: exploding hat, teapot radio, one *cow*. He raises an eyebrow at the *cow*, and it turns out to be a disguised submarine. It eats its own label, and Bond, unruffled, signs for the last **item**."],"计":["to calculate","{James Bond} escapes into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} ice-cream van with seconds left on a machine set to blow sprinkles everywhere. He must **calculate** which wire to snip, and each sum floats up in a *small speech bubble* with a *cross* for every plus. Unruffled, he **calculates** seven cones plus three flakes, snips at one second and orders a lolly, shaken."],"管":["to manage","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} pavilion, where an *official* with a *bamboo* clipboard is failing **to manage** two hundred swans. They bite it. Cranky, Gandalf lifts his staff and booms 'You shall not pass!' Every swan freezes mid-honk and files neatly back past the *official*, and with one firework he **manages** them perfectly."],"期":["period","{Chewbacca} sits in {Front} of the {Beach} chalet timing the *moon* with a *winnowing basket* of sand that drains like an hourglass. Every **period** it empties he roars, and his friends know that means one lunar month. One **period** he loses his temper and rips the basket in two, so the *moon* waits, embarrassed, while he mends it with a ship's spanner."],"市":["city","{Sherlock} examines the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} through his magnifying glass and finds a bustling *market* of bees selling honey. From one crumb of wax he deduces the whole **city** beyond: buses, skyscrapers, a mayor with a limp. 'Elementary, Watson.' The *market* grows around his boots, and by evening the **city** has named a bridge after his violin."],"直":["straight","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Beehive}, dangling a trick *plumb line* that pulls everything **straight**. The bees fly in a **straight** line and the crooked honeycombs snap into neat rows. His prank backfires when the line catches his huge grin, and his face goes **straight** for the first time ever, to the delight of the queen."],"德":["virtue","{Darth Vader} stomps {Inside} the {Hut} following a saint's glowing *footsteps*, as a *watchful heart* on the wall judges his every heavy breath. He lifts a lost sock with the Force and earns a point of **virtue**. He rescues a spider, and the heart glows brighter. Booming, he disapproves, then admits that it feels nice, a rare touch of **virtue**."],"资":["capital","{Zorro} gallops up in {Front} of the {Beehive} on his black horse and slashes a Z on a *shell*, turning it into money: his **capital** for a new hideout. A *queue* of animals lines up to invest, and he marks every coin with a flick of his rapier, until the **capital** buys a giraffe, which eats the hive as he vanishes laughing."],"命":["life","{Mario} bounces into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, where a little *tent* hangs a brass *door knocker*. He head-butts the knocker and a green mushroom pops out: one extra **life**! 'Wahoo!' He stomps on the mat, and a glove, a stool and the bell spring to **life**, all starting a match of their own."],"山":["mountain","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Mansion} and studies one crumb of rock on the lawn through his magnifying glass. 'Elementary: a *mountain* is coming.' The lawn cracks, the **mountain** rumbles up under him, and he is lifted higher and higher with Watson dangling. At the top he smugly remarks on the goat, then skis down the **mountain** on his violin."],"金":["gold","{James Bond} steps out in {Front} of the {Inn} in his tuxedo and presses a button on his watch, Q's gadget for turning things to *gold*. Unruffled, he tries it on a lamp post, then a pigeon, then his **gold** bow tie. Guests rush up to touch him and end up solid **gold**, and he escapes on a **gold** bicycle with a one-liner."],"指":["to point","The {Joker} sneaks down to the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, cackling, with a rubber *helping hand* on a spring that can only **point**. He unrolls an *edict scroll* declaring that whoever it picks must wear a clown nose. It **points** at the queen, then a drone; then it swings round and **points** at the Joker, who gets a squirt from his own flower."],"克":["to overcome","{Kermit} is pinned in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} under a huge *antique* wardrobe, arms flailing in panic. 'Yaaay!' he wails, but the show must go on, so he braces his frog *legs* **to overcome** it. One mighty hop and he **overcomes** the wardrobe, bursting out with his banjo while the crew applauds. It is not easy being green."],"许":["to allow","{Shrek} stomps down to the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a guard grinds a *pestle* beneath a *small speech bubble* that says not **allowed**. Shrek roars, and the bubble wobbles. Donkey chats on and on, until at last the worn-out guard gives in, the bubble flips to **allowed**, and ogre and donkey settle down to eat onions on the dinosaur."],"统":["to unite","{Tarzan} swims down to the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} aquarium and calls out to every fish in its own tongue. Baffled by their squabbles, he ties each to a *balloon* with *silk thread* and knots the strings **to unite** them. Sharks and sardines, **united** at last, float up as one giant kite, with Tarzan swinging from the bottom and yelling."],"区":["area","{Chewbacca} roars in {Front} of the {Museum}, waving a huge *district map*, because someone has parked his ship in the wrong **area**. In a temper he rips the map apart, one **area** in each paw. Then, loyal as ever, he fixes it with his bandolier, strapping every **area** back so carefully that even the pigeons land by zone."],"保":["to protect","{Batman} stands watch in the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where he has trained a fierce *nanny* **to protect** his birthday cake. She **protects** it with gadgets off his own belt: smoke bombs, a grappling hook, an umbrella that folds into a batarang. When Batman, brooding, reaches for a slice, she glides over in a spare cape and whacks his hand."],"至":["to arrive","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} as an *arrow landing* thunks into the door with a trick card: I **arrive** at noon. Another card pops from the shaft: I **arrive** now. Then a flower squirts him in the eye, and a tiny bee with a suitcase has finally **arrived**, in on the prank and grinning hugely."],"队":["team","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and, with one wave of the Force, lifts the mops and plungers into a *team*. They march in step behind his cape. 'You are a **team**,' he booms, breathing loudly, and they scrub in perfect rhythm. When a plunger falls out of line he Force-chokes it, and the rest of the **team** snap to attention."],"形":["shape","{Shrek} shambles {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, furious at being disturbed, and swings a *door bar* covered in *bristles* like a giant brush. He peels each boxer in layers, as onions have layers, and every layer is a new **shape**: a triangle, a star, a squashed doughnut. The referee begs for his old **shape** back, and Shrek roars and hands him a square."],"社":["society","{Sherlock} opens the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, and one crumb tells him everything: a secret **society** of beetles has built a *small altar* in the *soil* of a pot plant. 'Elementary, Watson: they meet on Fridays and the treasurer is a ladybird.' The *soil* heaves, the **society** salutes, and they make him an honorary member, at crumb size."],"便":["convenient","{Batman} fires his grappling hook and swings down a *shortcut* into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}: a secret chute straight from the Batmobile to the till. How **convenient**, he growls, brooding that crime should never be this quick. Soon the whole town is using his **convenient** chute, and the seats of the Batmobile fill up with yen and strangers."],"空":["empty","{Kermit} hops out in {Front} of the {Lagoon} theatre and flings open an *empty room*, the set for tonight's big show. Nothing: not a puppet, not a prop, not a chair. 'Yaaay!' he wails, arms flailing, and his banjo case is **empty** too. He shouts for the cast, and the only reply is an **empty** echo."],"决":["to decide","{James Bond} skates {Inside} the {Ice Rink} in his tuxedo, with *icicles* hanging over him and one second **to decide**. He flips an *archer's ring*: heads the red wire, tails the blue. It lands on its edge. Unruffled, he **decides** on both, the *icicles* crash down behind him, and he escapes on a hockey stick."],"治":["to govern","The {Joker} leaps onto a *stage* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, grinning, **to govern** the bees with prank laws: all stings must be tickles, all honey must fizz. His squirting flower fires *water drops* for every vote. The queen arrives, flicks one wing and tips the whole *stage*, so she **governs** now, and he bows, cackling."],"展":["to spread out","The {Joker} tiptoes down to the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, flicks a trick card, and it lands on a *lying man*. The whole deck **spreads out** across the floor, and the man **spreads out** too, arms and legs and newspaper, pulled by hidden springs. The Joker cackles as the prank fills every corner, then has to tiptoe over the tummy to reach the stairs."],"马":["horse","{Mario} drops from a warp pipe into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and head-butts a block, and a *horse* pops out instead of a coin. He stomps on its back for a ride, 'Wahoo!', but the **horse** just shakes itself, puts on a fluffy robe and slides into the hot tub. Mario stomps again, and the **horse** books a massage."],"科":["branch of study","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Hut} with a *grain stalk* and a *dipper*, stage-managing the world's first class in grain. Each scoop starts a new **branch of study**: scoopology, sneezing, advanced banjo. Panicked, he hops between them. 'Yaaay!' he yells, as every **branch of study** collapses on the grass in a heap of encyclopaedias."],"司":["to manage","{Sailor Moon} spins in {Front} of the {Beehive}, transforming in a long sparkly sequence, with a tiny *boss* bee in a suit shouting at her. She makes a speech about justice, vowing **to manage** the hive by love, and throws her tiara. It knocks the *boss* flat, and she cries loudly while Luna the talking cat has **to manage** the lot."],"五":["five","{Walter White} adjusts his goggles in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and unwinds a *spool* of wire into **five** beakers, each fizzing a different colour. Proud of his science, he counts the results: **five** bangs, **five** puffs of foam, **five** very surprised ducks. He tips his black hat and declares the whole class passed, with distinction, by all **five** ducks."],"基":["base","{James Bond} presses a button in {Front} of the {Beach} lighthouse, and Q's secret **base** rises from the sand on a *winnowing basket* packed with *soil*. On that **base** stand a helicopter, a ladder and a cat. The basket wobbles and the *soil* spills, but Bond, unruffled, adjusts his cuffs while the **base** holds firm."],"眼":["eye","{Yoshi} lands with a flutter jump in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} before a single giant *eye* with a *glare* so fierce the bats hide. His tongue shoots out and swallows the **eye** with a gulp. He lays it as an egg, 'Yoshi!', but the shell cracks, and the **eye** peers out, its *glare* fixed on him."],"书":["book","{Sherlock} sits in {Front} of the {Pool} studying a **book** when a single *drop* of water lands on the page. 'Elementary,' he says, smug behind his magnifying glass: from that one *drop* he deduces the whole **book**, plot and ending, and tells it all to Watson, who was only on page three and sadly closes his copy."],"非":["not","{Frodo} trudges in {Front} of the {Lake} lodge on bare hairy feet as a goose with *spread wings* blocks his path. He asks if this is the way to the mountain, then that way, and every time it honks **not**. Wearily he slips on the Ring to sneak past, but the goose honks **not** at the empty air too, and Sam sighs."],"则":["rule","{Zorro} bursts {Inside} the {Hut} with a dashing leap and lands on a *rulebook* the size of a mattress. Every page has a **rule**: no capes, no horses, no laughing. With three flicks of his rapier he slashes a Z through each **rule**, and the *rulebook* snaps shut on his cape as he vanishes, laughing."],"听":["to listen","{Tarzan} crouches in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} **to listen** for a far-off ape, but a giant *mouth* is chattering in his ear. He grabs an *axe* and chops its words in half, then cups his hand. Now he can **listen**: his gorilla mother calling across the jungle. He yells back, and the *mouth*, baffled, shuts at last."],"白":["white","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Island} lighthouse, and a *white dove* lands on his cowl. Brooding, he reaches for his utility belt, but the dove has turned it **white**, along with his cape, his batarangs and everything else it touches. He growls that a **white** Batman cannot brood in shadows, and sulks in the one dark corner until that goes pale as well."],"却":["but","{Chewbacca} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, ready to charge, **but** his friends sound the *retreat*. He fixes the door to stop them, **but** it falls off. He rips a locker apart in a temper, **but** the whole gang keeps skating backwards, and, loyal to the end, he slides after them, growling."],"界":["boundary","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} onto a *rice field* split by a painted **boundary**, with the yeti glaring from one side and a farmer from the other. A *go-between* scurries back and forth carrying insults. Unruffled, Bond taps his shoe, a tiny bridge unfolds over the **boundary**, and he strolls across, shaken, not stirred."],"达":["to reach","{Darth Vader} marches {Inside} the {Spa}, up a *road* spiralling into the clouds, towards a cucumber slice he must **reach**. A *big man* in a bathrobe lies across it, snoring. Vader lifts him with the Force and floats him aside, breathing loudly, and finally **reaches** the top, only to find that the hot tub is full."],"光":["light","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Swamp} shack and strikes the ground with his staff, and white *light* bursts over the black water. Frogs wake, crocodiles blink, lilies open. He sends a firework up, and the **light** floods so bright that the swamp becomes a disco, with the wizard crankily dancing in the **light**."],"放":["to put","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, weary, with a *cane* and one task: **to put** the Ring in a chalk *square* on the floor. He cannot let it go. He **puts** down a plane, a bicycle, the pilot, his lunch and Sam instead, until the *cane* taps him on the toe and he sighs: tomorrow."],"强":["strong","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Stadium} as a giant *mosquito* blocks the tunnel. He draws his *bow* and fires, but the *mosquito* is **strong** and catches the bolt. Roaring in a temper, he rips up the goalposts and hurls them, mosquito and all, clean out of the ground. Now he is the **strong** one, and his friends understand every growl."],"即":["namely","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} pier in his tuxedo and meets a *kneeling man* proposing to his true love, **namely** a seagull. It accepts, **namely** by stealing his chips. Unruffled, Bond offers a one-liner, **namely** 'Shaken, not stirred', and slips away as the *kneeling man* fires confetti from Q's ring."],"像":["to resemble","{Shrek} grumbles in the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} beside a *standing person* dressed as an *elephant*: grey suit, flappy ears, a hosepipe trunk. He **resembles** one so well that real elephants come to greet him. Shrek roars at them all to leave him alone, and Donkey notes that a green ogre with those ears begins **to resemble** one too."],"难":["difficult","{Naruto} sneaks {Inside} the {Mansion}, clutching a *caught bird* for a ninja test, and it is **difficult**: it tweets, flaps and pecks his headband. He summons shadow clones to hush it, and they all sneeze and poof. More **difficult** still, it bursts into opera, but he never gives up, and he bribes it with ramen."],"且":["moreover","{Chewbacca} climbs a *stepladder* in the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave}, roaring one complaint per rung, and only the yeti understands. He is cold; **moreover**, the ship is broken. **Moreover**, his bandolier is itchy, and the yeti ate his lunch. At the top rung, **moreover**, the whole *stepladder* rips apart in his temper."],"权":["authority","{Chewbacca} bursts {Inside} the {Mint}, hauls a *tree* up through the floor to fix his ship, and raises a huge hairy *right hand*. The guards demand his **authority**. He roars so loud that the coins rattle and rips the vault door off its hinges, and nobody argues: his growl is now **authority** itself, and he grants Monday off."],"思":["to think","{Sailor Moon} lies in {Front} of the {Beehive} in a *rice field*, trying **to think** of her speech about justice. Her *heart* thumps, her pigtails droop and thoughts buzz out of her ears like bees. Luna tells her **to think** harder, so she cries loudly and transforms, sparkling, and the rice plants cover their ears."],"王":["king","{Walter White} marches {Inside} the {Hangar} in his black hat, glasses gleaming, past a *king* using a jumbo jet as his throne. 'I am **king** of the skies!' the man declares. Walter calmly pours one precise beaker into another, the foam lifts the plane off its wheels, and he explains that on his chart the only **king** is the letter K for potassium."],"象":["elephant","{Shrek} opens the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium}, hoping for peace, and an *elephant* squeezes out and sits on his onion. He roars, and the **elephant** flaps its ears and does not budge. Donkey talks at it for an hour, and only then does the **elephant** flee out onto the pitch and score a goal."],"完":["to finish","{Walter White} lines up his beakers {Inside} the {Mansion} and adds one precise drop to a flask, which foams into a glowing *finish line* across the ballroom. 'Reaction **finished**,' he announces, adjusting his glasses, as every candle, clock and conversation stops dead at the tape. Nothing can start again now, because Walter's experiment is **finished** and the dinner bell has fainted."],"设":["to set up","{Sherlock} squeezes into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, studies one crumb on the mat and deduces the culprit returns at midnight. He must **set up** a trap, so a *small speech bubble* dictates the plan while Watson's *war club* bangs in tripwires, a decoy sandwich and a violin alarm. By dusk it is all **set up**, and Sherlock, smug as ever, steps straight into it."],"式":["form","{Sherlock} raises his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and notices that every bee has exactly the same **form**. 'Elementary,' he says, peeling a giant *stencil* off the wall, and one spray through it produces another bee with the same stripes and the same wings. Watson holds up his hat to look, the stencil sprays that too, and now the hat has the **form** of a bee and flies away."],"色":["colour","{Sailor Moon} begins her long sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, and her moon wand fires a *rainbow* that splashes **colour** over everything. The soap goes violet, the taps turn tangerine and Luna the talking cat comes out electric pink. Sailor Moon trips on her own pigtails and cries loudly, and every tear lands in a different **colour**."],"路":["road","{Lara Croft} solves the tile puzzle in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, and a hidden *pathway* of ancient stones grinds up out of the floor. A rolling boulder chases her along it, flattening it wider and wider until it is a four-lane **road**. Lara backflips over a lorry, snatches the relic from a lay-by, and the boulder stops politely at the first traffic light on the **road**."],"记":["to record","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} while a villain brags about his secret plan. A cufflink from Q fires a *coiled rope* that lassos each *small speech bubble* leaving the villain's lips and ties it down to be **recorded**. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, pressing play, and the whole plan, neatly **recorded**, squeaks out across the sand to the police."],"南":["south","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Mansion} yelling that he will never give up heading *south*, and he makes a hundred shadow clones to find the way. Every orange clone runs **south** through a wall, a greenhouse and a ballroom, leaving a row of Naruto-shaped holes. They all pile out onto a sunny beach far to the **south**, slurping ramen in matching headbands."],"品":["product","{Pikachu} tumbles out of his Poké Ball in the {Basement} of the {Inn} and lands on a heap of *goods*: toasters, lamps and woolly socks. 'Pika!' A Thunderbolt from his cheeks tests each **product** in turn, so the toaster flies and the lamp sings. Only the socks survive, crackling, and the innkeeper slaps Pikachu's face on the box and sells them as his finest **product**."],"住":["to live","The {Joker} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a *standing person* in slippers who **lives** there, reading by a *candle*. Cackling, he swaps the candle for a trick one that relights forever, puts a squeaky cushion on the sofa and unpacks a purple suitcase. A huge grin and a new door sign announce that the Joker **lives** here too."],"告":["to tell","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} exactly when he means to and taps an *announcer* on the head with his staff. The spell swells the man's voice until he must **tell** the whole city everything: who stole the gnome, who drowned the tulips, who snores. Gandalf puffs his pipe and crankily refuses to **tell** anyone how to switch it off."],"类":["kind","{Lara Croft} cracks open the sealed {Bathroom} of the {Lake} temple, where an ancient puzzle demands that every grain of *rice* be sorted by **kind**. A *big man* carved from stone raises his fist at each mistake. Lara flips between the bowls with her ponytail flying, long in one and sticky in another, until the last **kind** clicks home and the big man bows and hands her the relic."],"求":["to seek","{Chewbacca} thunders {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} roaring, because someone has taken his *fur coat*. He **seeks** it everywhere, ripping bunks apart and tearing lockers off the walls while backpackers nod at growls they cannot understand. At last a mirror shows him he has been wearing it all along, so he stops **seeking** and sheepishly fixes every bunk."],"据":["according to","{James Bond} slips into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where a *helping hand* from Q passes him a tiny model *house* with a talking chimney. **According to** the house, the diamond lies behind the third tap. Bond turns it, unruffled, and a false floor drops him into a tank of sharks, which, **according to** the house, is the quick way out."],"程":["process","{Charlie Brown} only wants to fly his kite {Inside} the {Jungle}, but the **process** demands that a *grain stalk* must stamp a *petition* signed by every monkey. Good grief. Step by step he drags himself through the whole **process** for three weeks, with Snoopy asleep on the forms, and on the final day he gets his permit just as a tree eats the kite."],"北":["north","{Batman} broods in the {Basement} of the {Lake} until a compass on his utility belt swings *north* and starts to tug. He fires his grappling hook **north**, and it yanks him up through the ice with his cape flapping, past puffins and bewildered icebergs. He glides down onto the Pole and growls at a polar bear, and the compass, still pointing **north**, now points straight at his boots."],"边":["side","{Batman} roars up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} in the Batmobile and finds the *road* jammed solid. He presses a gadget, and a *strong arm* pops out of the bonnet and shoves each car to the **side**, one after another. Soon every car is parked on the **side**, the way is clear for one brooding man, and he has nowhere to go."],"死":["to die","{Sailor Moon} trips over a tiny *grave* in the {Basement} of the {Beehive} and cries loudly, because a drone bee has **died** of boredom. She launches a sparkly three-minute transformation and a long speech about justice. The drone sits up, yawns, listens to all of it, and lies back down, announcing he would rather **die** again than hear it twice."],"张":["sheet (measure)","The {Joker} prances in {Front} of the {Hangar} with a *stretched bow*, firing **sheets** of paper instead of arrows, each with a huge grin drawn on it. One **sheet** wraps a pilot, one wraps a plane and one smothers the windsock. Cackling, he counts them all like trick cards, three thousand and one, and the whole runway grins back at him."],"该":["should","{Gandalf} stands crankily in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse as a *wild boar* charges, and he raises his staff and booms, 'You shall not pass!' The spell turns its squeal into a *small speech bubble* that nags on his behalf: you **should** wipe your trotters, you **should** wear a hat. The boar slinks home with the bubble scolding behind it, while the wizard nods wisely."],"交":["to hand over","{James Bond} sits with *crossed legs* in {Front} of the {Cat Café} while a villain's fluffy white cat purrs that he must **hand over** the secret file. Unruffled, he uncrosses them, and his shoe from Q fires out the file tied to a sausage. The cat lunges, and to get the sausage it **hands over** its entire lair."],"规":["rule","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} and taps a giant *compass* with his staff, so it leaps up and scratches a glowing circle around every chair. Each circle carries a magic **rule**: no humming, no sighing, no looking at the clock. Anyone who breaks a **rule** hears a booming 'You shall not pass!' and bounces gently off the air."],"万":["ten thousand","{Walter White} adds one drop to a beaker in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, and a *swarm* of glowing bubbles rises and fills the air. He counts them with a teacher's pride and his glasses on the end of his nose: exactly **ten thousand**, not one more. When a single bubble pops he scowls, adds a tiny precise drop, and restores his **ten thousand**."],"取":["to take","{Chewbacca} stomps into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, and a *grabbing hand* shoots out of a crate to **take** his bandolier. He roars so loudly that the mummies sit up. In a temper he rips the crate to splinters, **takes** back his bandolier, and then, because he can fix anything, bolts the hand onto his ship as a useful spare part."],"拉":["to pull","{Lara Croft} spots an ancient chain in {Front} of the {Spa}, and a stone statue's *pulling hand* seizes it and starts to **pull**. Out slide the hot tub, three guests in towels and a rolling boulder. Lara somersaults over the lot, grabs the chain and **pulls** back with all her strength until the hand gives up and waves goodbye."],"格":["grid","{Gandalf} waves his staff {Inside} the {Hut}, and a *tree* bursts through the floor with its branches growing in a perfect **grid** of squares. A muddy *visitor* walks in and may now step only on the glowing ones, hopping about in panic. Gandalf lights his pipe and plays noughts and crosses on the **grid** with little fireworks, using the visitor as a counter."],"望":["to hope","{Walter White} hands a *king* his precise lighter-than-air formula in the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and watches the royal *diaphragm* swell like a balloon. They both **hope** he will float. Walter checks his notes, peers over his glasses and adds one more drop, full of **hope**, and the king rises squeaking through the hangar doors with a flock of paper planes."],"觉":["to feel","{James Bond} skates {Inside} the {Ice Rink} with an *alarm clock* from Q strapped under his tuxedo, a gadget that does one absurd thing. RRRING! Suddenly he can **feel** everything: the cold in his toes, the bump on his bottom, a deep sadness about a sandwich. Unruffled, he adjusts his bow tie and says he **feels** shaken, not stirred."],"术":["technique","{Sherlock} watches a conjuror perform a *magic trick* in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, pulling a whole dolphin out of a hat. He sniffs one wet crumb of fish and says, 'Elementary,' then explains the **technique**: wrist flick, false bottom, very patient dolphin. He repeats it with smug perfection, while Watson, copying the **technique**, pulls out only a soggy sock."],"领":["to lead","{Lara Croft} drops on a rope into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, a sealed tomb where a stone *herald* blows his trumpet and a ghostly *page* points at the dark. Lost boxers beg her to **lead** them out. She vaults spike traps and dodges boulders with her ponytail flying, and a hundred fighters, **led** like ducklings, leap wherever she leaps."],"共":["common","{Gandalf} raises his staff in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, and a spell seals every creature into one great ring of *joined hands*: fish, turtles, a pelican and the wizard himself. They now have one **common** sandwich between them, passed mouth to mouth, because nobody can let go. Gandalf chews crankily, for a **common** lunch is the one thing magic cannot improve."],"确":["certain","{Chewbacca} tests the floor of the {Bathroom} at the {Ice Rink} the way he tests a ship's hull, dropping a *stone* and whacking it with an *ox horn*. Not one crack. He roars that he is **certain**, and though only friends can understand him, the skaters nod, **certain** too, as his huge hairy weight sits down and the ice holds."],"传":["to pass on","{Charlie Brown} wades {Inside} the {Swan Pond} with a *spindle* of kite string that he must **pass on** to a *standing person* in a long line. Each one **passes on** the string until the kite sails up from the far end of the queue, for once in the wind. A tree eats it, and the blame gets **passed on** all the way back to Charlie. Good grief."],"师":["teacher","{Sherlock} marches up in {Front} of the {Beehive}, studies a speck of chalk under his magnifying glass and deduces that a *teacher* is near. He finds a tiny **teacher** rapping a board as the bees take notes. Sherlock smugly corrects her spelling of buzz, and she keeps him behind after class, because even the greatest detective must obey a **teacher**."],"观":["to watch","{Gandalf} settles on a bench in {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, raises his *right hand* and conjures a *watcher* out of pipe smoke, all eyes. Together they **watch** two swans fight over a bread roll. The swans stop, turn, and **watch** them right back, and nobody blinks for an hour, until the cranky wizard ends it with one firework."],"清":["clear","{Chewbacca} growls in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, because its big window is furred over with green *moss*, just like the cockpit of his ship. He rips out a pipe, mends a pump and blasts it with *water drops* until the glass is perfectly **clear**. The crowd roars at the view, and he roars louder, because the whole fight is now crystal **clear**."],"今":["now","{James Bond} sits strapped to a giant *clock* in {Front} of the {Inn} while a villain rambles on about yesterday and tomorrow. The clock's face has only one word on it: **now**. Unruffled, Bond taps his watch from Q, the straps spring open, and he strolls off with a one-liner, 'Your time is **now**,' as the inn's entire washing drops on the villain."],"切":["to cut","{Chewbacca} fires his crossbow in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, and every bolt makes a clean *cut*: icicles, a washing line, the yeti's fringe. The yeti roars with fury, and Chewbacca, who understands perfectly, roars back and **cuts** him a tidier fringe with the next bolt. Then he **cuts** a perfect snowflake out of the shaggy fur, and they hug.","qiē"],"院":["courtyard","{Yoshi} licks his lips in the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, shoots out his sticky tongue and swallows a whole *hillside*, then a *finish line* for pudding. 'Yoshi!' He lays one enormous spotted egg, which cracks open into a sunny **courtyard** with cobbles and a fountain, the hill curling round its walls. Coins race round the **courtyard** and snap through the tape."],"让":["to let","{Robocop} clanks to a stop at the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, visor glowing, blocking the stairs. A *small speech bubble* floats over and asks to go *upstairs*, and he reads out a directive: he may **let** nobody pass without a polite request. His targeting display blinks, politeness detected, and he stiffly steps aside and **lets** it through, then a parrot, then a marching band."],"识":["to know","{Sherlock} strolls {Inside} the {Beehive} and meets a *lone bird* whose *small speech bubble* announces that it **knows** who stole the honey. Sherlock sniffs a crumb on its beak and says, 'Elementary,' he **knows** that it knows nothing. The bubble lists the thief, the time and his own shoe size, and Sherlock, for once, goes very quiet."],"候":["time (when)","{Homer} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} with a dim scheme: at exactly the right **time**, he will leap out and catch a giant pike with a doughnut. 'Mmm,' he says, and eats the bait, and then he has a nap. He wakes with a 'D'oh!' to see the pike paddling off in his canoe, waving, right on **time**."],"带":["to bring","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, breathes loudly and lifts one black glove, and the Force **brings** everything flying across the sea to clip onto his *belt*: a toothbrush, a coconut, a grand piano. Castaways stare in awe and beg him to **bring** a boat. He booms his disapproval, and the belt sags with a groan."],"导":["to lead","{Darth Vader} stands in the {Basement} of the {Tower} and Force-lifts a *cobra* and a giant *thumb* into the air to act as his guides, the snake hissing directions as the thumb jabs left and right. He sets off to **lead** his troopers up the spiral stairs, breathing loudly, cape sweeping. They go wrong twice, but nobody dares say so to the man who **leads** them."],"争":["to strive","The {Joker} sets up a *tug of war* in {Front} of the {Jungle} between a gorilla and an elephant, cackling and waving a purple flag. Both **strive** with all their might, grunting and digging in their heels. They **strive** all afternoon, until the rope stretches, squeaks and turns out to be one long string of trick handkerchiefs, and both sit down with a bump."],"运":["to transport","{Yoshi} sits in the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} and uses his long tongue to swallow a camel, a watermelon and a grand piano, then lays them as three huge eggs. He flutter-jumps onto a passing *cloud*, which rolls along a *road* across the sand. The cloud can **transport** anything, and Yoshi, the only **transport** in the desert, delivers each egg with a cheerful 'Yoshi!'"],"笑":["to laugh","{Shrek} only wants to be left alone in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, but Donkey bursts in with a *dancer* who starts tickling him with a stick of *bamboo*. Shrek roars. He stays grumpy layer after layer, like an onion, until the last layer gives way and he **laughs** so hard his ears pop. The cats **laugh** too, and Donkey will not shut up about it."],"飞":["to fly","{Frodo} trudges on weary hairy feet in {Front} of the {Lake}, too tired to walk another step, when a giant *swan* swoops down and scoops him up. They **fly** low over the water, with his cloak streaming and ducks diving out of the way. Sam, running along the shore with the saucepans, shouts that hobbits were never meant to **fly**."],"风":["wind","{Frodo} limps along on his bare feet in {Front} of the {Jungle} when a howling *wind* hits him. He is so small that the **wind** picks him up and spins him past the parrots, with Sam clinging to his ankles. He lands with a weary sigh, because he walked for a month to get here, and the **wind** has blown him back to the start."],"步":["step","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} over a single wet *step* on the tiles, and a gadget from his belt lights up the next footprint, and the next. A detective to the bone, he follows every **step** in gruff silence, out of the door, round the diving board and back. The last **step** matches his own boot, and he broods about it for a week."],"改":["to change","{Gandalf} has mislaid his staff in the {Basement} of the {Island}, so he mutters a spell and whacks a *coiled rope* with a *cane*, and it **changes**: into a snake, a hosepipe, a strand of spaghetti. Delighted, he keeps tapping. At last it **changes** into a second cranky wizard, who snatches the cane and turns him into a teapot."],"收":["to receive","{Sherlock} sits in {Front} of the {Boathouse} with a *cane* tied to a *twisted vine*, fishing for parcels in the river and deducing each one before it lands. 'A cake,' he says, 'from a guilty aunt.' He **receives** it with a smug nod, and Watson signs. Then he **receives** a very cross goose, which he had not deduced at all."],"根":["root","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Funfair}, finds a *tree* blocking the gate and fixes it with a wizard's furious *glare*. 'You shall not pass!' he booms. The terrified tree yanks up its **roots** and bolts, the **roots** scuttling like spider legs past the dodgems, and it hides behind the candyfloss stall, shaking, while he lights his pipe."],"干":["to do","{Gandalf} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, cranky about the chores, and zaps a *drying rack* with his staff. It springs to life and starts to **do** everything at once: hanging laundry, peeling potatoes, polishing spoons, drying the cat. The butler asks what else it can **do**, and the rack starts ironing the butler while Gandalf puffs his pipe."],"造":["to build","{Zorro} swings off a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} as an *announcer* bellows that it must be finished by dawn. His rapier slashes a Z into the rock, slicing out perfect bricks, and his black horse gallops them up a *road* that spirals round the walls. They **build** all night, and having **built** the whole tower in the shape of a Z, he vanishes laughing."],"言":["words","{Yoshi} shoots out his long tongue {Inside} the {Mansion} and swallows a huge *speech bubble* floating from the butler's mouth. Gulp! He lays a speckled egg, and it cracks open to spill **words** down the staircase like marbles: banana, tremendous, hiccup. The butler opens his mouth, finds he has no **words** left at all, and the only sound is a happy 'Yoshi!'"],"联":["to unite","{Lara Croft} scales a ledge {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} and finds a stone *ear* hearing traders yell on either side of a *mountain pass* made of paperwork. It is a puzzle. Lara flips across and slots the ear into an ancient lock, and the two walls grind together, so the traders **unite**, then hug, and **unite** so tightly they become one confused banker."],"持":["to hold","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Beehive}, and a *helping hand* gives him a tiny golden *temple* to **hold**, just for a moment. Good grief. He **holds** it for an hour with his arms shaking and bees settling on his zigzag shirt. When at last he straightens up to give it back, the hand whisks it away like a football, and he falls flat on his back."],"组":["to organize","{Zorro} leaps from a *stepladder* in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, and his rapier whips a line of *silk thread* from wall to wall in three great slashes, making a Z. He **organizes** the chaos at sword point: flippers on one stroke, rubber rings on the next, sleepy seals on the last. Everything is **organized** when he vanishes laughing."],"每":["every","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Basement} of the {Lake}, where a *busy mother* has hung a block above **every** frog, duck and fish. 'Wahoo!' He leaps and head-butts them in turn, and a coin bursts out for each child. She points out one he missed, then another, and he cannot go home until he has bonked **every** last one."],"济":["to aid","{James Bond} rolls out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, tuxedo spotless, and finds a *trimmed hedge* wilting in the sun. His pen from Q does one thing, spraying *water drops*, so he gives it emergency **aid** and it perks up at once. Every plant on the beach starts queuing, and he straightens his tie and remarks that this is foreign **aid**."],"车":["car","{Charlie Brown} pushes a wooden *cart* in {Front} of the {Hut} and bolts on an engine, a horn and a steering wheel, and at last it coughs into a roaring **car**. For once something has gone right. He runs up to climb in, and the **car** pulls away at the last second, just like the football, with Snoopy at the wheel. Good grief."],"亲":["parent","{Chewbacca} stops dead in {Front} of the {Inn}, because his *parents* have arrived, even huger and hairier than he is. They roar, he roars, and only a **parent** could understand what is being said about his fur. He is two hundred years old and carries a crossbow, yet each **parent** licks a paw and wipes his face in full view of the guests."],"极":["extremely","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} in his tuxedo with a *chaser* behind him, **extremely** fast and gaining. He presses his bow tie, and a palm *tree* inflates beneath his shoes, shooting up like a rocket and flinging him over the bay. He lands on a speedboat without a wrinkle and says the whole thing was **extremely** refreshing."],"林":["woods","{Lara Croft} pulls an ancient lever {Inside} the {Inn}, and a *grove* erupts through the carpet. In seconds the place is thick **woods**, with owls in the wardrobes and a fox at reception. She swings from branch to branch and climbs a wardrobe with her ponytail flying, hunting the lost relic: a breakfast menu missing in the **woods** since the Bronze Age."],"服":["clothes","{Frodo} pads {Inside} the {Pool} on bare hairy feet after a very long walk, and his **clothes** are nothing but mud. A giant *pressing hand* reaches down and irons his cloak flat on the shining face of the *moon*, then does the whole wardrobe in silver. The Ring whispers that he could vanish and keep it all, but Sam coughs, so he takes one set of **clothes**."],"快":["quick","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Bathroom} of the {Wine Cellar} because the curtain rises in ten seconds and nothing is ready. His *standing heart* thumps out the beat as he twangs cue cards off an *archer's ring*, yelling **quick**, **quick**, at a chorus of corks. They hop on stage just in time, 'Yaaay!', and he sags against the banjo, because it's not easy being green."],"办":["to handle","{Batman} slides open a secret *workshop* behind the mirror in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, and growls that he will **handle** it. A batarang fixes the dripping tap, the grappling hook cures a squeaky door, and a small gadget frees a duke stuck in a vase. Alfred asks if he can also **handle** a cup of tea, and Batman stares into it, brooding."],"议":["to discuss","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a *judge* in a wig and a *small speech bubble* **discuss** the correct number of towers on a sandcastle. Bored, he shoots out his tongue and swallows them both, wig and all. He lays a large spotted egg, and from within the shell comes the faint sound of them still **discussing** it."],"往":["towards","{Walter White} lights a *candle* in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and dusts the floor with a precise pinch of school chemistry, and glowing *footsteps* appear. The flame leans **towards** them. 'Science,' he says proudly, adjusting his hat, and the footsteps march **towards** the far wall, up it and through a hatch, while he follows with his notebook, recording everything."],"元":["yuan","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Mint}, shoots out his tongue and swallows a giant *yuan coin* rolling off the press. With a gulp and a 'Yoshi!' he lays a speckled egg that rattles, and it cracks open to reveal one shiny **yuan**. The manager demands it back, so Yoshi hands him the egg and charges him one **yuan** for the shell."],"英":["British","{Yoshi} licks up a *hero* in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, bowler hat, teacup and all, then lays a speckled egg. It hatches into a tiny Yoshi in a bowler, who apologises to the referee, queues politely for the ring and offers his opponent a biscuit. How terribly **British**, the crowd sighs, and soon the pigeons are saying sorry too, very **British** indeed."],"士":["scholar","{Sherlock} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, inspects a stranger's cuff under his magnifying glass and announces a *scholar*. 'Elementary, Watson: ink stains, ten volumes on buzzing, a **scholar** of honey.' The stranger peers back through his spectacles and deduces Sherlock's breakfast, his violin and his shoe size, and the smug detective finally bows to the **scholar**."],"证":["proof","The {Joker} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, cackling, and rolls a trick coconut over a *goal line* while a *small speech bubble* snaps its picture. Here is the **proof**, it squeaks, it was a goal! The gorilla goalkeeper leans in, demanding more **proof**, and the photograph squirts him right in the eye."],"近":["near","{James Bond} steps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} holding Q's latest gadget: an *axe* that chops distance. One swing, and the long *road* to town shrinks until the next village is **near**. Another swing, and the church is in the dining room. 'A little too **near**,' Bond remarks, straightening his tie, as the bell rings in his soup."],"失":["to lose","{Sherlock} examines a *lost arrow* in {Front} of the {Beehive}, deducing its owner, its age and its low opinion of cows. He is so busy being smug that he **loses** his pipe, then his deerstalker, then Watson. 'Elementary,' he murmurs, reaching for a magnifying glass he has also **lost**, and he wanders off after the arrow to ask it for directions."],"转":["to turn","The {Joker} bolts a *cart* to a giant *spindle* in the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} and deals trick cards to anyone who wants a **turn**. He yanks the lever and it starts to spin, flinging cards in a purple blur while the swans overhead whirl like ballerinas. Cackling, he tries to stop it, but the lever **turns** too, and so does his grin."],"夫":["husband","{Frodo} limps up in {Front} of the {Pool} after a very long walk to hand a wedding ring to a bride in armbands. Reluctantly he gives it up, and she slides it onto the finger of her *husband*, who instantly turns invisible. Now she is wading about calling for her **husband**, while a pair of flippers tiptoes off, and Frodo sighs, because that Ring is no gift for a **husband**."],"令":["to order","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, where a stone *herald* comes to life, unrolls a scroll and blasts a trumpet. By ancient **order**, he booms, intruders must be chased by a boulder. Lara flips over it, solves the scroll's puzzle in midair and rewrites it, and then gives her own **order**: the boulder rolls off to fetch the tea."],"准":["accurate","The {Joker} bets on a *sparrow* in the {Basement} of the {Casino} that flicks *icicles* at a dartboard, perfectly **accurate** every time. Cackling, he tries every prank to put it off: squeaky cushion, squirting flower, trick playing cards. The sparrow pops each one out of the air, still dead **accurate**, and the last icicle lands neatly in his green hair."],"布":["cloth","{Batman} tears his cape in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, so he fires his grappling hook into a roll of *linen* and hauls. Metres of **cloth** come out, then kilometres, until swimmers are splashing under a dark ceiling of it. He cuts it free with a batarang, and glides off gruffly with so much **cloth** behind him that it is still leaving next Tuesday."],"始":["to begin","{Sherlock} tunes his violin on a tiny *stage* in the {Basement} of the {Beehive} as a *woman* in the audience claps and calls for the show to **begin**. He plays one note. She claps and it all **begins** again from the start. From one crumb on her glove he deduces she will never be satisfied, and on the fortieth start he is proved right."],"怎":["how","{Zorro} slashes a Z into a *jack-in-the-box* in the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, and out bounces a big red cartoon *heart*. **How**? he gasps, swinging from a lamp. **How** does a heart fit in a toy? The heart whips out its own tiny rapier, carves a Z in his cape, and vanishes laughing, which is his job."],"呢":["question particle","{Naruto} leaps onto the {Roof} of the {Hut} and lands beside a *nun* whose *mouth* tacks a **question particle** onto every sentence: ramen, ne? Headband, ne? He makes a hundred shadow clones to answer her, but each orange clone catches the habit and adds the same **question particle** at the top of his voice. Soon the whole hillside is shouting, ne? ne? ne?"],"存":["to deposit","{Cookie Monster} barrels {Inside} the {Casino} with a *piggy bank* as big as a pony, and the manager tells him to **deposit** his cookies for safekeeping. 'Me **deposit**!' he promises, googly eyes rolling, and in they go, clink, clink. The temptation lasts four seconds, and he eats the cookies, the chips and then the pig in a spray of crumbs."],"未":["not yet","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and drips a precise growth formula onto a *sapling*, asking if it is a mighty oak, and **not yet**, it squeaks. He checks his calculations, adds a drop, knocks on the bark like the one who knocks and asks again, and it squeaks **not yet**. A hundred years pass, his goatee reaches his toes, and it has one new leaf."],"远":["far","{Yoshi} slurps up a *yuan coin* in the {Basement} of the {Mint}, lays it as a speckled egg and hurls it along a *road* painted on the floor. It bounces out of the door, across the country and over the sea, and it travels **far**. Three years later he gets a postcard from the egg, sent from somewhere very **far** away."],"叫":["to call","{James Bond} picks up Q's newest telephone in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}: a giant *mouth* on the end of a *twisted vine*, built to do one thing. It **calls**. 'Bond, James Bond,' it booms, then it **calls** every cat in town, and hundreds pour through the windows and settle on his tuxedo. 'Wrong number,' he says, unruffled."],"台":["platform","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Island} on a long vine with a jungle yell and lands on a *stage* left behind by tourists. Baffled by civilisation, he decides this **platform** is a strange flat tree and sniffs it. He calls his ape family over, and they all climb up and beat their chests on the **platform** until the seagulls applaud."],"单":["single","{Darth Vader} Force-lifts one huge *racket* in {Front} of the {Mansion} and plays tennis with a **single** ball, his loud breathing marking every stroke. No partner, no net, no opponent. The butler brings out a second racket, and Vader Force-chokes it into a crumpled twist, booming his disapproval: this match has one **single** player, and it always will."],"影":["image","{Yoshi} licks a paintbrush's wet *bristles* in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} and swallows a painted *landscape* for afters. He lays a glowing egg that cracks and throws a bright moving **image** on the wall: hills, a river, a sunset. A painted cow steps out of the **image** to drink from the water bucket, and the boxers forget to fight."],"具":["tool","{James Bond} opens a *toolbox* from Q in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, and every **tool** does one absurd thing: the spanner whistles, the saw sings opera, the hammer only hits on Tuesdays. An alarm wails and the guards close in. Unruffled, he checks his watch, sees it is Tuesday, and escapes through the wall with the one **tool** that works."],"罗":["to collect","{Lara Croft} swings {Inside} the {Warehouse} on a rope with a *gauze net*, **collecting** ancient relics from the top shelves: a cursed button, a lost sock of the pharaohs, a jade kite. A rolling boulder chases her down the aisle. She somersaults over it, nets it too, and **collects** one last prize, the warehouse manager, who was only passing."],"字":["character","{Zorro} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, slashing a Z into everything, until a *child* under a tiny *roof* tuts and shows him how to write a proper Chinese **character**. Zorro tries again, and his rapier whirls with stroke after stroke as the bees fly into line. They spell one huge **character** in the air, and he vanishes laughing behind it."],"爱":["to love","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Bathroom} on the {Island}, and every castaway runs away screaming, though he only said hello. Then he finds a coconut with a painted smile that does not flee, his first *friend*. He falls in **love** at once, drifting around it in the moonlight, and turns invisible when he blushes. It says nothing, and he is sure that it is **love**."],"击":["to strike","{James Bond} flicks open a briefcase from Q in {Front} of the {Beach} huts, and a spring-loaded *punch* in a boxing glove shoots out. Bam! It **strikes** a coconut, a sandcastle and a henchman's hat, and then it turns round looking for more. Bond steps aside without creasing his tuxedo as it **strikes** his ice cream into orbit, and he calls the result quite **striking**."],"流":["to flow","{Lara Croft} pulls a forbidden lever {Inside} the {Youth Hostel}, and *water drops* start to trickle from the stone walls, then gush. It is an ancient flood trap. A *tumbling baby* in a rubber ring **flows** past, giggling, so Lara runs along the wall, ponytail flying, and scoops it up as the torrent **flows** through the bunks and out to sea."],"备":["to prepare","{Batman} broods in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake}, because Batman must always **prepare** for the worst. His *trudging feet* carry him out to a frozen *rice field* with a fully stocked belt: bat-sickle, bat-umbrella, weevil repellent. No villain comes, not one, but he has **prepared** so thoroughly that when a lone squirrel appears, he has the exact gadget."],"兵":["soldier","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, where *troops* of tin **soldiers** are marching left, right, left. He flings a batarang, which clips the first in line and topples the whole row like dominoes. Standing over them he growls for their commander, and the last brave **soldier** gets up, salutes and asks to be his sidekick."],"连":["to link","{Lara Croft} climbs a stone ledge {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} and finds an ancient puzzle: a *convoy* of tiny carts that must **link** in exactly the right order. She flips between them, ponytail swinging, hooking each one to the next. As the last cart clicks, all of them **link** into one long chain, the vault groans open, and out rolls a boulder."],"调":["to transfer","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, where a giant *circuit* hums and a *small speech bubble* rides its wires reading out his disapproval: you are being **transferred**! With a lift of his glove, the Force picks up a sleeping cat and **transfers** it to command of a Star Destroyer. Vader breathes loudly, and the fleet is told to purr."],"深":["deep","{Sherlock} drops a coin down a hole in {Front} of the {Funfair} and listens to *water drops* echoing from a *deep cave* far below. Counting on his violin bow, he smugly deduces that it must be exactly one thousand metres **deep**. Elementary. Watson leans over to check and falls in, and it is so **deep** that his reply arrives a week later."],"商":["merchant","{Sherlock} marches up in {Front} of the {Hangar}, magnifies a single crumb and deduces that a **merchant** is at work. Sure enough, a *skylight* flips open overhead and a voice sells him a second magnifying glass, a violin string and a slightly used cloud. Watson points out that the **merchant** has also sold him back his own crumb."],"算":["to calculate","{Sailor Moon} starts her transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, and her moon wand turns a stick of *bamboo* into a glittering *abacus*. In the name of the moon she will **calculate** how many breadcrumbs each swan deserves! She clacks the beads, gets forty-seven and a half, and cries loudly, so Luna sighs and **calculates** it all again with one paw."],"质":["quality","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} dressed as an inspector, tapping each golden *shell* with a *pair of axes* made of rubber. Honk! Top **quality**, he cackles, and stamps it with a huge grin. The queen presents her own shell and he declares it poor **quality**, at which point it squirts him in the face, and the bees cheer."],"团":["group","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Swan Pond} and gives a jungle yell, baffled by a tiny *fence* around one *green shoot*. He calls to the animals, and swans, ducks and frogs all rush up in one big honking **group**. The fence gives way, the shoot springs up into a great tree, and the whole **group** climbs it behind him."],"集":["to gather","{James Bond} blows Q's newest whistle {Inside} the {Beach}, a gadget that does one thing: every *sparrow* for miles comes to **gather** in the same *tree*. Hundreds arrive, then thousands, and the tree bends like a fishing rod. They **gather** on his shoulders and his bow tie too, and Bond, unruffled, says he seems to draw a crowd."],"百":["hundred","{Batman} fires his grappling hook in the {Basement} of the {Island} and snags a *banknote* poking through the floorboards. He hauls, and out comes another and another: a **hundred** of them, tied in a line. Being a detective, he finds that each bears a tiny bat, so he folds them, brooding, and flings all **hundred** across the room like batarangs."],"需":["to need","{Shrek} stands *waiting in rain* in {Front} of the {Museum}, wanting only to be left alone, while Donkey will not shut up. You **need** an umbrella, says Donkey, you need a hug, you need a friend. Shrek roars, and the marble goddesses flinch. He says all he will ever **need** is his swamp, and then he remembers this rain is making one."],"价":["price","{James Bond} steps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} to buy an ice cream, and a *go-between* runs off to haggle while a *standing person* shouts each new **price**. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, and the **price** doubles. He pays with a pen from Q, whose cheque unfolds into a parachute, and he floats off with the cone, unruffled."],"花":["flower","{Homer} naps on the *grass* in {Front} of the {Water Park} until it tickles his nose and he spots a *shape-shifter* turning into a giant doughnut. 'Mmm,' he says, and he pounces, and just as he bites, it turns into a pink **flower**. With a 'D'oh!' he chews it anyway, shrugs, and goes back to sleep with the **flower** stuck in his teeth."],"党":["party","{Darth Vader} booms 'I am your father' in the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, but the man wearing a *lampshade* only corrects him: he is his *big brother*, and the leader of a political **party**. The mice cheer. Vader Force-lifts the lampshade in disapproval, the crowd takes it as a campaign promise, and the **party** elects him Minister of Breathing."],"华":["splendid","{Homer} sneaks {Inside} the {Water Park} at night with a dim scheme to toast one doughnut over a box of *fireworks*. 'D'oh!' The whole crate goes up, gold, crimson and emerald, and he rockets down the slide in a shower of sparks. The sky turns **splendid**, the crowd gasps, and he says 'Mmm, **splendid**' with the toasted doughnut in his mouth."],"城":["city","{Charlie Brown} spends all summer piling *soil* into walls and towers {Inside} the {Jungle}, hoping at last to win the golden *trophy* for best **city**. Monkeys and tapirs move in with briefcases and traffic lights. Good grief: the trophy goes to Snoopy's kennel, and his own **city** will not let him in without a permit."],"石":["stone","{Sherlock} picks up a *stone* {Inside} the {Beehive} and studies it through his magnifying glass, deducing at once that this **stone** has been to Peru, is left-handed and has a slight cold. 'Elementary,' he says. Watson points out that it is merely a **stone**, and the stone gives a small polite cough."],"级":["level","{James Bond} water-skis {Inside} the {Beach} on a *silk thread* from a Q speedboat, with a *chaser* thundering behind him. Each jump lands him on a new **level**, like a video game: crabs, then seagulls, then a sandcastle dragon. He clears the top **level** without getting his tuxedo wet, and the chaser turns out to be his own shadow."],"整":["whole","The {Joker} hires a *drill sergeant* in the {Basement} of the {Jungle} to march the **whole** jungle up to a *goal line*: every ant, every elephant, every vine. Just as they reach it, he sneaks the line back ten paces and squirts his flower, cackling. So the sergeant bellows, and the **whole** jungle turns round and starts again."],"府":["government","{Frodo} wanders into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and finds a tiny marble *mansion*, where frogs in suits are running the **government**. They hand him one heavy form and order him to carry it to the far side of the pool. He gazes at it wearily, sighs and sets off barefoot with Sam, because nobody ever says no to the **government**."],"离":["to leave","{Lara Croft} lifts a relic {Inside} the {Beach} ruins, and a *goblin* guarding it squeaks that the trap has sprung and they must **leave** now. A rolling boulder thunders in as it packs one towel and a crab into a tiny suitcase. Lara backflips clear, and the goblin **leaves** on a seagull, then comes back three times to wave."],"况":["situation","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, arms flailing, and finds his *big brother* trapped in a block of *icicles* with the show starting in a minute. What is the **situation**? he yells, plucking the icicles like a banjo. 'Yaaay!' The **situation**, his brother croaks, is that he has turned blue, and it's not easy being green."],"亚":["Asia","{Yoshi} shoots out his tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and swallows a *silver medal* the size of a frying pan. 'Yoshi!' He lays a warm egg, which cracks and pours out a steaming map of **Asia**, with tiny mountains and tiny rivers running over the tiles. He flutter-jumps across all of **Asia**, from Tokyo to Istanbul, in one breath."],"请":["to invite","{Chewbacca} wants to **invite** the whole town to a party in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, but only friends understand his roars. So he scratches a card onto soft *moss* and sends a *small speech bubble* to every door to translate: you are **invited**! By nine the place is packed with boxers and grannies, and each gets a huge hairy hug."],"技":["skill","{James Bond} wakes tied to a *branch* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} as a line of crabs advances. A *helping hand* reaches out to free him, but he politely declines, because this calls for pure **skill**. He wriggles loose with a paperclip, ties the crabs in a bow, and steps away without a crease. **Skill**, he says, or a very good tailor."],"际":["between","{James Bond} finds himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} wedged **between** a *hillside* and a stone *altar*, which a villain's trap is slowly pushing closer. He raises one eyebrow and unfolds a shoehorn from Q. He shoots free like a cork, adjusts his cuffs and tells the villain that he is **between** jobs."],"约":["appointment","{Yoshi} ties a *promise knot* in his own long tongue in {Front} of the {Ice Rink} so he will remember an **appointment**. Then, out of habit, he swallows it. 'Yoshi?' He lays an egg, it hatches into a tiny diary, and every page is another missed **appointment**, including one to untie his tongue."],"示":["to show","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, climbs up on the bees' *altar* and promises to **show** them who stole the honey. 'Elementary,' he says, and Watson holds up one crumb under a spotlight. He **shows** them the crumb, the clue and the footprint, all pointing to the queen, who politely shows him the door."],"复":["to return","{Frodo} sets off from the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} on bare feet with the longest walk of his life ahead of him, and at the far end he buys a ticket for the *return trip*. He trudges back and **returns** at last, weary and dripping. Sam asks if he brought the saucepans, so he sighs, walks all the way there, and **returns** again."],"病":["illness","{Batman} lies on a *sickbed* balanced on a wobbly *tripod* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, struck down by a strange **illness**: each sneeze fires a batarang from his belt. Alfred ducks in with soup. Boxers dive for cover, and Batman growls that this **illness** will never break him, then sneezes the tripod right out from under himself."],"息":["to rest","{Shrek} lies down in {Front} of the {Beach} lifeguard tower for a long **rest**, away from everyone. Each slow *breath* he snores puffs Donkey up the sand like a kite, and each time Donkey trots back, chattering. Shrek opens one eye, peels an onion, and with one mighty sigh blows him clear to the horizon, and finally he can **rest**."],"究":["to investigate","{James Bond} prises open the {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} with a *crowbar* from Q and finds a *cave* hidden behind the porch, full of muddy footprints. He must **investigate**, so he lights it with his watch and strolls in with one eyebrow raised. Bond **investigates** the case calmly, and it leads to a backpacker eating everyone's yogurts, who confesses at the first one-liner."],"线":["line","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} wanting to be left alone, so he unrolls a *silk thread* while *twin blades* snip it to length, and lays it down as one dead-straight **line**. Ogres only past this point, he roars. Donkey hops over it, hops back and asks whether the **line** is for him."],"似":["to seem","{Sailor Moon} spots a *standing person* holding a *tool* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, and it **seems** to be a villain with a weapon. She spins through her whole transformation, delivers a long speech about justice and throws her tiara. It only **seems** that way, says Luna, for he is a plumber with a spanner, and Sailor Moon cries loudly."],"官":["official","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} exactly when he means to, and an *official* in a tall hat stamps a form and declares, 'You shall not pass!' The wizard swells with fury at his own line. He raises his staff and turns the rubber stamp into a firework, and it chases the **official** round the bandstand while the swans queue to thank him. **Official** business, he says."],"火":["fire","{Homer} lights a tiny *campfire* in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} to toast a doughnut, ignoring everything he learned at the plant. The **fire** gobbles the doughnut and then the box. 'D'oh!' He runs in circles while rockets whiz past, then stops, sniffs and spots a sausage, and says 'Mmm' as he cooks it on the **fire**."],"断":["to break","{Darth Vader} Force-lifts an *axe* in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, breathing loudly at a stuck rowing boat, and Force-chokes the oar until it **breaks**. Crack! The jetty **breaks** next, then the boat, then a bread roll. The swans stare at him as the axe hangs quivering in the air, and he booms his disapproval at the pieces."],"精":["essence","{James Bond} pours *rice* and *moss* into a silver shaker in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, and shakes it, never stirs it, until only one glowing drop remains: pure **essence**. One sniff, and his bow tie straightens itself. The boxers catch the scent and start dancing ballet, and Bond notes that this, apparently, is the **essence** of boxing."],"满":["full","{Mario} the plumber unscrews one pipe in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, and *water drops* come pouring out without end. The sink is **full**, the room is **full** and the butler is swimming laps. 'Wahoo!' Mario stomps on the valve and dives into a warp pipe, but that is packed with water too, and it spits him straight back."],"支":["to support","The {Joker} props up a sagging awning with a forked *branch* in {Front} of the {Beehive}, a trick one that should fold up at once and dump the queen in the honey. Cackling, he waits. But the branch **supports** the throne, the jars and the entire cheering hive, and as it goes on **supporting** them his huge grin slowly sags instead."],"视":["to look at","{Sherlock} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and finds a *watcher* kneeling at a *small altar* with a telescope on it. The watcher **looks at** Sherlock. Sherlock raises his magnifying glass and **looks at** the watcher, deducing his breakfast. Then both slowly turn to the telescope, which, elementary, has been aimed at them all along."],"消":["to subside","{Shrek} roars at a *portrait* of Donkey in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, and its painted eyes weep *water drops* that flood the lawn. The cats climb the awning. He peels an onion, layer by layer, and his temper starts to **subside**. As it does, the flood **subsides** too, down to a puddle, and the portrait starts talking again."],"越":["the more","{Yoshi} licks up a *runner* and his *ceremonial axe* in the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, and lays an egg that hatches two more of them. **The more** he swallows, the more eggs he lays, and **the more** eggs he lays, the more runners skate out twirling axes. Soon the rink is a whirlwind, and he is very full."],"器":["device","{Chewbacca} rips the hand dryer off the wall in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and, growling happily, rebuilds it into a strange **device** with four horns and a crank. He straps the **device** to a *dog*, and when the dog wags its tail, the horns burst out singing like a *chorus*. Only friends can tell him it is flat."],"容":["to contain","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Lagoon} with an empty *container* and reads out a directive: all disorderly fish must be **contained**. He politely arrests a fish, some coral, a shipwreck and then a whale, and somehow the container **contains** them all and still has room. His targeting display finds one more offender, and he stiffly arrests himself and climbs in."],"照":["to shine","The {Joker} blows on a pile of *embers* in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} until they glow, then feeds them into a giant *spotlight*. It starts to **shine** his huge grin on the clouds over the city, and owls put on sunglasses. Cackling, he swings it onto the moon, which goes on **shining** with a purple grin all night."],"须":["must","{Shrek} finds a *page* of rules nailed up in {Front} of the {Museum}, which Donkey reads aloud without pausing for breath: all ogres **must** wipe their feet, and all ogres **must** be brushed. Stiff *bristles* leap off the wall and start scrubbing him. Shrek roars and tears the rule up, and the bristles scrub him twice for littering."],"九":["nine","{James Bond} levers open a crate with a *crowbar* from Q in the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel}, and it folds out into exactly **nine** gadgets, none of which helps. Out of the crate step a villain's **nine** white cats. He looks them over without a flicker, does the sum, and notes that he is facing eighty-one lives before breakfast."],"增":["to increase","{Zorro} rides up on his black horse in {Front} of the {Jungle}, pours *soil* into a bamboo *steamer* and slashes a Z through the lid, and with a puff the soil doubles. Every Z makes the steam **increase** the pile, until it buries the treehouse and the monkeys open a ski resort. He vanishes laughing, and still the heap **increases** behind him."],"研":["to research","{Yoshi} does his **research** {Inside} the {Mansion} the only way he knows: he swallows a *stone*, then a heavy *door bar*, then the butler's notebook, and studies whatever comes out. Each time he lays an egg. He taps every shell with his nose and says 'Yoshi!' gravely. After weeks of **research**, his finding is that all things are eggs."],"写":["to write","{Shrek} stomps into the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave} and sits at a *writing desk*, grumpily determined to **write** one sign saying Keep Out. Donkey stands behind him dictating improvements, and the ogre, who has never been so annoyed, keeps on **writing** them down. By morning the sign is a nine-hundred-page novel, and Donkey is in it as the hero."],"称":["to name","{Charlie Brown} hangs a *wind chime* made of *grain stalk* in {Front} of the {Jungle} temple, and whenever it tinkles it gives a passing animal a **name**: Bob for a tapir, Gertrude for a tiger. Every creature gets a splendid **name**, and then Charlie steps up hopefully, zigzag shirt straightened, and it tinkles, Blockhead. Good grief."],"企":["enterprise","{Chewbacca} digs down into the {Basement} of the {Beach} and finds a *person* beside a *stop sign*, running a tiny **enterprise** that sells stop signs to crabs. The sign blocks his way, so he roars and rips it in half. The person hands him a bill, and he sulkily rebuilds it with engines, and now the **enterprise** sells flying stop signs."],"八":["eight","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Spa} and fires his grappling hook at a pair of *curtains*, which rip open on a crime scene: **eight** octopuses in bathrobes, each hiding something. He reaches into his utility belt and cuffs them with **eight** gadgets, one after another. Still brooding, he growls that **eight** arms each makes sixty-four suspects."],"功":["achievement","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, exactly when he means to, and taps a rusty *workbench* with his staff. A *strong arm* of pure magic bursts out of it and hammers a single firework into a gold medal. \"Your first **achievement**,\" he mutters crankily to a startled fish, then sets off rockets spelling **achievement** over the water."],"吗":["question particle","{Mario} stomps on the {Roof} of the {Spa}, and each stomp makes a giant *mouth* pop out of a block. Whatever it says, a tiny *horse* gallops onto the end: \"The bath is hot, ma?\" Mario head-butts it for a coin and shrugs, because that little ma is the **question particle**: it turns any sentence into a yes-or-no **question particle** moment."],"包":["to wrap","In {Front} of the {Tower}, {Batman} spreads his cape over a suspicious *parcel* and **wraps** it tight, then pulls a rope from his utility belt and **wraps** that round too. He grapples round and round the building, faster and faster, until the whole tower is **wrapped** like a birthday present, with one gruff voice somewhere in the middle asking for scissors."],"片":["thin piece","{Pikachu} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, sparks flying from his cheeks, and fires a Thunderbolt at a log. Zap after zap shaves off a *wood slice*, each one a **thin piece** you can read a banknote through. \"Pika!\" The bankers hold every **thin piece** up to the light, where it glows yellow and still crackles."],"史":["history","In the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, {Sherlock} studies one crumb of honeycomb through his magnifying glass and deduces the hive's entire **history**: the Great Honey Flood, the War of the Wasps, the year the queen sneezed. A dusty *historian*, who has spent nine hundred years writing it all down, drops his quill. \"Elementary,\" says Sherlock, smugly correcting **history** on his way out."],"委":["to entrust","In the {Basement} of the {Lake}, {Walter White} adjusts his glasses and **entrusts** a beaker of precisely measured plant food to a nervous frog. \"Three drops, no more,\" he says, pointing at his *wilting stalk*. The frog measures so carefully that the *wilting stalk* stands up and salutes, so Walter, proud of such clean science, **entrusts** it with his black hat too."],"乎":["at","{Homer} slumps in {Front} of the {Pool} with a dim new scheme: blow a *whistle* **at** a doughnut until it rolls over to him. He blasts it **at** the doughnut, **at** the swimmers and at a passing helicopter, and all of them come rushing **at** him. \"D'oh!\" he says, flattened, then \"Mmm\", because the doughnut has landed in his mouth."],"查":["to check","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Spa} to **check** on his kite, which the potted *tree* in the lobby has eaten again. He **checks** every branch, and the *tree* eats his clipboard as well. Then the *sunrise* pours through the glass and lights up the kite string, so he **checks** that too, and down comes a bucket of bath water. \"Good grief.\""],"轻":["light","{Chewbacca} rips the engine out of a *cart* in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, growling, then tears off the doors and wheels until it is so **light** that it lifts off the ground. He clings on, roaring, as the *cart* sails over the city like a balloon. Only his friends understand the next roar, which means: too **light**, put the engine back."],"易":["easy","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a smug *lizard* is hogging the sink. Out shoots his sticky tongue, and one gulp later he lays the *lizard* as a neat spotted egg. So **easy**! The egg hatches, the *lizard* climbs straight back onto the sink, and Yoshi swallows it again, because for him it is always **easy**."],"早":["early","In the {Basement} of the {Tower}, {Zorro} swings in at four in the morning to be dashing, but an *early bird* has beaten him to it and already pecked a Z on the wall. It is far too **early**! He slashes a bigger Z with his rapier, the bird pecks a bigger one still, and each day he arrives **earlier** and vanishes laughing, yet it is always there, yawning."],"曾":["once","{Cookie Monster} crashes {Inside} the {Jungle} and finds an old bamboo *steamer*; its lid lifts and a puff of steam sighs that a giant cookie **once** lived here. \"Me want cookie!\" he howls, and devours the *steamer* in a spray of crumbs. Burping, he tells the monkeys that there was **once** a steamer as well."],"除":["to remove","{Charlie Brown} wades {Inside} the {Pool} with a spade, because a whole *hillside* of *leftovers* has slid into the water and he alone has been told to **remove** it. For each scoop he **removes**, the *hillside* slides back with two more, plus a kite. The *leftovers* bury him up to his zigzag shirt. \"Good grief,\" he says, and **removes** a sprout from his ear."],"农":["farming","{Naruto} dives {Inside} the {Lagoon} and finds a flooded *farm* with nobody to work it. He crosses his fingers with a shout, and a hundred shadow clones in orange burst out to take up **farming**: ten plough with crabs, ten milk clams, ten eat the ramen meant for lunch. The *farm* has never been so loud, and he swears he will be the greatest **farming** ninja of all."],"找":["to look for","In the {Basement} of the {Tower}, the {Joker} cackles, because he has hidden a trick card and now everyone must **look for** it. A *helping hand* pokes a *halberd* behind barrels and under rugs, and each thing it pokes squirts water. The guards **look for** it, the cook **looks for** it, and at last he grins and flips the card off the tip of the *halberd*."],"装":["to adorn","In {Front} of the {Swamp}, the {Joker} tiptoes up to a snoozing *strongman* and, grinning hugely, begins to **adorn** him. Over the muscles goes a purple *robe*, and onto the *robe* go trick playing cards, squirting flowers and fairy lights. The *strongman* wakes and flexes, the *robe* bursts into a sprinkler, and every frog within reach is **adorned** with glitter."],"广":["wide","{Gandalf} raps his staff in the {Basement} of the {Swamp}, and a cramped *shed* starts to grow, its walls sliding apart with a grumble of runes. **Wide** as a street, then wide as a valley, it soon holds three ponds and a herd of puzzled cows. \"Too **wide**,\" he snaps, lighting his pipe, and his smoke ring needs a week to reach the far wall."],"显":["to reveal","In the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, {Shrek} plonks an enormous onion in a glass *showcase* and peels off a layer to **reveal** another layer. Ogres have layers, he grunts, and peels on, as the bankers weep and the *showcase* fills with skins. The final layer **reveals** the donkey, who will not shut up, and Shrek roars for everybody to get out."],"吧":["suggestion particle","{Batman} crouches on the {Roof} of the {Spa}, brooding, when a *python* slithers up and opens its smiling *mouth*: \"Let's take a bath, ba.\" The gruff detective scans it with a belt gadget, which prints: **suggestion particle**. \"Let's share a bun, ba,\" it adds, and the *python* ties his cape in a bow. He growls, but nobody can arrest a **suggestion particle**."],"阿":["a- (before names)","{Casper} drifts through a wall in {Front} of the {Spa}, hoping for a friend, and greets each sunbather with a shy **A-** before their name: \"Morning, A-Li! Hello, A-Mei!\" They shriek and run, all except one *auntie* in hair curlers, who beams: she has put **A-** before her nephews' names for fifty years. Casper has finally found someone cosy."],"李":["plum","{Lara Croft} abseils into the {Basement} of the {Beach}, ponytail swinging, and finds a stone *tree* hung with purple **plums**. She lifts one off its branch, a trap clicks, and a **plum** the size of a boulder rolls straight at her. She sprints and vaults, and a small *child* leaps from behind a pillar, catches it and eats it in one slurp."],"标":["mark","In {Front} of the {Cat Café}, {Batman} investigates the stolen tuna, flinging a batarang to leave a bat-shaped **mark** on each clue. The *tree* drops a branch in protest and the *altar* rings its little bell, but he marks them anyway. Then the cats stroll out and **mark** his cape with muddy paw prints, and he broods about it all night."],"谈":["to talk","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Mansion} on a curtain cord, baffled by a *blaze* in a fireplace, and tries to **talk** to it the way he talks to gorillas. A *small speech bubble* pops out of the *blaze* with one crackling word, then another. Soon they **talk** about vines, bananas and why humans wear trousers, and the butler finds him yelling happily into the hearth."],"吃":["to eat","{Charlie Brown} sits in {Front} of the {Beehive} with the only sandwich he has ever won, when a *beggar* with an enormous *mouth* asks for a bite. The *beggar* **eats** the sandwich, then the kite, then three honeycombs. \"Good grief,\" sighs Charlie, as the *mouth* **eats** his hat as well and Snoopy looks the other way."],"图":["picture","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Pool} on a vine and crashes into a *fence* painted with a **picture** of a *winter coat*. Raised by apes, he has never seen a **picture**, so he lets out his jungle yell and tries to wrestle it. The *fence* wobbles, the *winter coat* seems to flap back, and his gorilla friends hold their sides, howling."],"念":["to read aloud","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and makes a hundred shadow clones, each one ready to **read aloud** the poem his *heart* is thumping out. The wall *clock* tick-tocks them into a rhythm and they bellow in chorus, all in orange, about ramen. The bankers beg for mercy, but he never gives up, and the clones **read aloud** verse two."],"六":["six","{Lara Croft} cartwheels into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} and solves an ancient puzzle set in the tiles: throw a pair of stone *dice* and get **six**. The *dice* tumble and land on **six**, and a secret panel slides open. Out roll **six** boulders, one after another, which she leaps with her ponytail flying, while backpackers calmly brush their teeth."],"引":["to pull","In the {Basement} of the {Inn}, {Yoshi} shoots out his long sticky tongue, sticks it to the string of a giant *bow* lashed to a *pole*, and starts to **pull**. He **pulls** until the *pole* bends double and the barrels roll towards him. Then his tongue slips, and the *bow* twangs him across the cellar with an indignant \"Yoshi!\""],"历":["to experience","{Lara Croft} climbs out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} onto a sheer *cliff*, and her own *strong arm* swings her up to **experience** every ancient trap in person. Darts, collapsing ledges, a rolling boulder: she **experiences** each one and ticks it off in her notebook, ponytail singed, asking politely whether the *cliff* has any more."],"首":["head","In the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, {Sherlock} lifts a sheet off a giant stone *head* in a captain's hat. Through his magnifying glass, one crumb on its lip tells him everything: this **head** ate the rowers' lunch. \"Elementary,\" he says, the *head* blushes and confesses, and Watson writes up the **head** as chief suspect."],"医":["medicine","{Yoshi} waddles up in {Front} of the {Beach}, where an *arrow* in the sand points to an *open crate* rattling with bitter **medicine** and a sunburnt walrus who refuses to take it. He slurps up the bottles with his tongue and lays them as one big spotted egg. The walrus swallows the egg whole, never suspecting the **medicine**, and turns grey again."],"局":["office","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Museum} in his tuxedo and presses his cufflink, Q's latest absurd gadget, which unfolds into a full **office**: desk, phone, filing cabinet. It opens on the tummy of a *lying man*, who goes on snoring while visitors queue for stamped forms. \"Bond. James Bond,\" he tells them, unruffled, stamping a dinosaur in the best **office** he has ever had."],"突":["sudden","{Tarzan} strolls in {Front} of the {Pool}, chatting to a squirrel, when a *dog* bursts out of a *cave* with a **sudden** bark. His **sudden** jungle yell answers it, so loud that every swimmer leaps out of the water and his vine snaps. Then the *cave* sneezes, and the *dog*, in perfect ape, says sorry."],"专":["special","In {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, the {Joker} twirls a *spindle* and spins a **special** thread from the purple of his suit. He announces, grinning, a very **special** surprise for one lucky swan: a bow tie that squirts. The *spindle* whirls faster, he ties it on, cackling, and the first guest the swan bows to goes home dripping."],"费":["to cost","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} after a very long walk, only to find a crab with a *dollar sign* painted on its *shell*. Washing one hairy foot will **cost** ten coins, it snaps, and the other will **cost** twenty. Weary, he slips on the Ring and turns invisible, but the crab charges him for that as well."],"号":["number","{Homer} snores in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, and out of his wide-open *mouth* drifts a *puff of breath* shaped like a **number**: seven. He wakes, decides it is next week's winning raffle ticket and bets every doughnut he owns. The **number** turns into a zero as it fades. \"D'oh!\""],"尽":["to the utmost","In the {Basement} of the {Inn}, {James Bond} is locked in with the walls closing, so he clicks Q's latest gadget, a *ruler* that extends **to the utmost** and jams them apart. As it bends **to the utmost**, *two sparks* fizz along it. He straightens his bow tie, unruffled, and orders a drink, shaken not stirred, while the inn creaks."],"另":["another","{Lara Croft} wedges herself into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, where an ancient mechanism has jammed. She pulls a *spare part* from her pack and slots it in, and the floor drops to reveal **another** lock. She somersaults across, fits **another** *spare part*, and a boulder rolls out followed by **another** boulder, while a boxer waits patiently with a towel."],"周":["week","In {Front} of the {Boathouse}, the {Joker} builds a little *circuit* of trick playing cards and rolls a clockwork rat round it, one lap per day with a prank for each. Monday brings a squirting flower, Tuesday a rubber oar, and after seven laps a whole **week** has passed. The *circuit* dings, he cackles, and another **week** of soggy rowers begins."],"较":["to compare","{James Bond} wheels a squeaky *cart* into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, carrying Q's latest gadget: a dial that can **compare** any two things. Two cats sit with *crossed legs*, daring him to **compare** their purrs. He adjusts his cufflink, unruffled, and the dial announces that both are superior to him. \"Shaken,\" he says, \"not stirred.\""],"注":["to focus","The {Joker} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with his hardest prank yet: balancing a lit *candle* on a squirting flower, which takes total **focus**. Cold *water drops* plop on his green hair, the flame dips, and his grin trembles. He must **focus**, he must not cackle. Then he cackles, and the flower puts it out."],"语":["language","In the {Basement} of the {Museum}, {Yoshi} finds a *speaker* blasting out a *small speech bubble* in a new **language** every second. He slurps one up with his long tongue and lays it as an egg, which cracks open reciting dolphin. Soon every egg speaks a different **language**, and the only thing he can still say is \"Yoshi!\""],"仅":["only","In the {Basement} of the {Inn}, {James Bond} is tied to a barrel with **only** his *right hand* free and **only** one gadget from Q: a pen that tickles. A *standing person* guards the door, trying not to laugh. One tickle and the guard collapses, and Bond strolls out, straightening his bow tie with **only** that hand."],"考":["to test","In the {Basement} of the {Tower}, {Kermit} hops about with a clipboard, flailing his arms, because tonight's show is a live *exam* and he has to **test** the whole cast. He **tests** the chickens on maths, the bears on jokes and his banjo on history. Everything fails at once, and he throws up his arms with a panicked \"Yaaay!\""],"落":["to fall","{Lara Croft} treads on a loose tile in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, and the floor opens: an ancient trap. She **falls** through hanging *grass* that snaps in her hands, ponytail streaming upward, and lands in a perfect roll on an underground *riverbank*. Crates **fall** after her, then a forklift, and the *riverbank* sighs and crumbles, tipping the lot into the water."],"青":["green","{Chewbacca} flies into a temper in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and rips up a carpet of *moss*, which clings to every hair on his body. He stands up entirely **green**, roaring, with a **green** bandolier and green teeth. The *moss* starts to grow, and the boxers, reaching for the salad dressing, ask him to keep still."],"随":["to follow","{Sailor Moon} trips {Inside} the {Waiting Room} halfway through her sparkly transformation, and a *pilgrim*, dazzled by the pigtails, starts to **follow** her. She runs out crying up a *hillside*, which shakes under all those feet, because the patients **follow** the *pilgrim*, then the doctor. At the top she makes a speech about justice to the whole town, and Luna asks where everyone is going."],"选":["to choose","In the {Basement} of the {Mint}, {Shrek} paints a *road* on the floor and lines up eleven onions, growling that he will **choose** the *front runner* for his lunch. They roll off, the donkey will not stop commentating, and it ends in a tie. He roars, **chooses** all eleven and eats them layer by layer, in peace at last."],"列":["to line up","{Lara Croft} cracks the ancient puzzle in the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}: the stone gate opens only if the yetis **line up**, tallest to shortest. She backflips along the *lineup*, nudging each one into place, until the last yeti sneaks ahead. A rolling boulder scatters the *lineup*, and with a sigh and a tug of her ponytail she makes them all **line up** again."],"武":["martial","In the {Basement} of the {Pool}, {Walter White} meets a *warrior* who challenges him to **martial** combat, kicking and chopping the boiler. Walter adjusts his glasses, mixes vinegar and baking soda with great precision, and lobs the beaker. The foam lifts the *warrior* to the ceiling, and Walter, proud, declares chemistry the only **martial** art that comes with a lab report."],"红":["red","{Homer} dozes {Inside} the {Lagoon} on a floating *workbench* and hatches a dim scheme: squeeze his jam doughnuts over a reel of *silk thread* to dye it **red**. The jam keeps coming, the thread unspools, and the whole lagoon turns **red**, flamingos included. \"D'oh!\" he says, then licks the water and adds, \"Mmm.\""],"响":["sound","In the {Basement} of the {Stadium}, {Shrek} only wants a nap, but a squeaky *weathervane* keeps spinning and its huge *mouth* honks a new **sound** at every turn. He takes a breath and roars. The **sound** rattles the whole ground, the goalposts dance, and the *weathervane* spins so fast it joins in, while the donkey asks if they can do that again."],"虽":["although","{Sailor Moon} stumbles in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} and meets a *mosquito* the size of a seagull. **Although** she is crying loudly, she launches her whole sparkly transformation and a long speech about justice. **Although** the *mosquito* yawns and Luna begs her to hurry up, she flings her tiara, misses by a mile, and calls it a victory."],"推":["to push","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, baffled by a sofa on the pavement. A *sparrow* chirps in his ear that humans **push** these things, so he gives a jungle yell and **pushes**, with a *helping hand* from a passing gorilla. Sofa, piano and one sleeping patient roll away down the street, and the *sparrow* rides on top."],"势":["power","{Sherlock} kneels in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and squints through his magnifying glass at a pair of *handcuffs*, snapped and still twitching. One crumb of wax tells him everything: a wasp has seized **power** here. Behind him a *strong arm* flexes and lifts the whole hive, and \"Elementary,\" he says smugly, as such **power** picks him up by the collar."],"参":["to take part","In {Front} of the {Mansion}, {Cookie Monster} spots a race between knobbly *ginseng* roots on tiny legs, with one cookie as the prize. \"Me **take part**!\" he bellows, googly eyes spinning. He **takes part** by devouring the starting flag, the finish line and the prize in a spray of crumbs, and the *ginseng* carries him off on its shoulders anyway."],"希":["to hope","In {Front} of the {Beach}, {Shrek} strings up a curtain of *lace* round his onion patch and **hopes**, grumpily, to be left alone at last. He **hopes** all night. At dawn the *lace* billows aside and there stands the donkey, talking, with a picnic, and the ogre's roar sends every gull into the sky."],"古":["ancient","In the {Basement} of the {Pool}, {Gandalf} blows the dust from an *antique* rubber duck and reads the **ancient** runes on its belly by the light of his staff. He mutters a spell, and the *antique* opens one eye and quacks in a tongue older than Moria, demanding its bath. \"Not even I am that **ancient**,\" he says crankily, lighting his pipe."],"众":["crowd","The {Joker} flings open a tiny trick cupboard in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, and out climbs a *person*, then another *person*, then a third *person*, each in a green wig. Cackling, he deals more cards and the **crowd** keeps growing, hundreds of them squashed against the sinks. On his signal the whole **crowd** squirts its flowers, and everyone, even him, goes home soaked."],"构":["to construct","{Gandalf} raises his staff in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, and a *tree* tears itself up by the roots and comes marching in. A *hook* of blue light swings each log into place as he mutters, and he **constructs** a boat, then a floating castle with turrets. At the gate he has just **constructed**, he glares at the ducks and thunders, \"You shall not pass!\""],"房":["house","{Frodo} trudges {Inside} the {Hangar} on bare hairy feet, weary from a very long walk, and finds a round *door* standing alone in a chalk *square*. He opens it and a whole **house** unfolds: armchairs, a kitchen, Sam with a teapot. The *square* grows to fit, planes taxi round the garden, and he refuses ever to leave this **house**."],"半":["half","{Batman} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, unclips a laser from his utility belt and cuts the crime scene in *half*: bathtub, mirror, the butler's toast. Only **half** the clues remain, he growls, brooding over a cracked soap dish. So he solves **half** the case and glides away with **half** a cape."],"节":["festival","{James Bond} skis {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and, cornered by yetis, clicks Q's newest gadget, which does just one absurd thing: it fires a blade of *grass*. The *grass* waves in the icy draught, and the yetis, who have never seen green, declare a **festival** on the spot. He straightens his tuxedo, unruffled, and leads the conga at the Grass **Festival**."],"土":["earth","{Tarzan} drops on a vine into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and kneels, overjoyed, at a mountain of *soil*, the first real **earth** he has smelled since leaving the jungle. He gives his jungle yell, the worms yell back, and the *soil* starts to wriggle. Baffled staff with mops try to sweep it away, so he rolls in the **earth** to protect it."],"投":["to throw","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Boathouse}, where a chimp's *helping hand* passes him a *war club*. Raised by apes, he **throws** things at whatever he does not understand, so it whizzes at an oar, a lifejacket and a rowing machine. He **throws** it again, harder, and the *war club* comes back holding a fish."],"某":["a certain","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} and head-butts a block, and out bounces a *plum* with a tag: for **a certain** someone. It is no coin, so he stomps it, and the *plum* bounces away. Every rower blushes, each claiming to be **a certain** someone, while he twirls his moustache and says nothing."],"案":["case","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, hoping to help solve a **case**: who stole the garden *tree*? He turns invisible to snoop and frightens the butler by accident, then drifts through walls to a *safe home* that opens its shutters, and there hides the *tree* with a teddy bear. **Case** closed, he says, and asks them both to be his friends."],"黑":["black","{Homer} dozes in {Front} of the {Lake} beside the power plant's chimney and leans on the one button he was told never to touch. A cloud of *soot* belches out and coats him **black**, bald head included. \"D'oh!\" he says, and the swans scream at the big **black** swan holding a doughnut."],"维":["to maintain","{Walter White} wades {Inside} the {Lake} with a rack of beakers, proud of the precise science it takes to **maintain** his floating classroom. A *sparrow* stitches loose planks with *silk thread*, while he checks the water's acidity to three decimal places. Every evening the whole thing sags, so every morning, glasses gleaming, he **maintains** it all again."],"革":["leather","{Gandalf} stoops {Inside} the {Hut}, taps a stiff *rawhide* with his staff and mutters a spell. With a crackle the *rawhide* softens and turns to **leather**, but the magic spreads: his pointy hat, his pipe, the carrots on the shelf. Cranky and creaking, he glares at his **leather** beard and tries to look as if he meant it."],"划":["to plan","{Homer} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park} to **plan** his dimmest scheme yet: stealing every doughnut from the snack bar. The *halberd* scratches the route on the tiles and the *standing knife* marks the stall with an X. He **plans** so hard that he falls asleep, the wave machine kicks in, and the whole scheme floats off. \"D'oh!\""],"敌":["enemy","{Darth Vader} strides {Inside} the {Beach}, breathing loudly, and meets his greatest **enemy**: a giant toffee with a sticky *tongue*. It licks his *cane* and glues it fast. He Force-chokes the toffee, which has no neck, then booms that he is its father, and his **enemy** just licks him again."],"致":["to cause","The {Joker} rigs a prank in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, taps his *cane* on a tripwire, and the *arrow landing* on its target **causes** a chain reaction: lid flips, honey squirts, flower sprays, a cow lands on a trampoline. The bees demand to know what **caused** it. He bows, cackling, and hands them a playing card."],"陈":["to display","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Funfair} and up a grassy *hillside* to **display** every kite he has ever built. The wind blows in from the *east*, lifts the whole **display** and feeds it, one kite at a time, to the only tree for miles. \"Good grief,\" he says, as the *hillside* slides gently from under him, and Snoopy wins a ribbon."],"律":["law","{Lara Croft} slides into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, following *footsteps* that glow on the tiles, and finds a cursed *writing brush* on a pedestal. She swaps it for a bag of sand, and it dashes off an ancient **law** in the air: no touching the relics. She laughs, the ceiling starts to descend, and she flips clear, breaking the **law** a second time."],"足":["foot","{Zorro} swings {Inside} the {Pool} on a chandelier and lands on a giant *foot* dipping slowly into the water. Three flicks of his rapier slash a Z into its sock, and the **foot** wiggles its toes and giggles. It kicks him clear across the pool, and he vanishes laughing, while that huge **foot** sloshes all the water out into the street."],"态":["attitude","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, and a *giant* with a tiny *heart* stomps out, sulking and kicking coconuts. What an **attitude**! Tarzan knows just what to do with a moody gorilla, so he beats his chest, yells, and gives the *giant* a huge hug. The *heart* swells, his whole **attitude** flips, and he starts handing out coconuts."],"护":["to protect","{Homer} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} to **protect** his last doughnut from the seagulls, using a *door* for a shield while a *helping hand* holds the doughnut high. Gulls dive-bomb, he swings the *door*, **protecting** it heroically, and at last the sky is clear. Then, without thinking, he eats it himself. \"D'oh!\""],"七":["seven","{Chewbacca} crouches in {Front} of the {Beach} repairing his ship, hammering with a *bent cross* of steel. **Seven** bolts pop loose, and he roars once for each, seven growls only his friends understand. The *bent cross* spins from his paw and bonks **seven** crabs, who each pick up a bolt and screw it back for him."],"兴":["interest","{Shrek} storms into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} for some peace, but the donkey has thrown him a surprise *party*. He growls that he has no **interest** in balloons and no **interest** in games. Then the *party* brings out a cake made of onions, layer upon layer, and the ogre's **interest** wakes with a rumble."],"派":["group","{Pikachu} scampers into the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, and the tap spits *water drops* that split up and run off in streams. Each **group** has its own idea, so he fires a Thunderbolt to herd them. \"Pika!\" Every **group** crackles and scatters faster, and he retreats to his Poké Ball, soaked and fizzing."],"孩":["child","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Island} clutching a doughnut, when a *child* rides up on a *wild boar* like a pony. The **child** snatches the doughnut and gallops off, shrieking with joy. \"D'oh!\" He lumbers after them, puffing, until the *wild boar* stops dead and he falls flat, because no lazy man ever caught a **child** on a boar."],"验":["to test","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, where an *assembly* of scientists wants to **test** a *horse*. Out flicks his tongue, the *horse* vanishes, and he lays it as an enormous egg. The *assembly* taps, weighs and **tests** the egg, and from the shell comes a muffled neigh."],"责":["duty","{Zorro} crashes through the window {Inside} the {Hut}, where a *debt collector* is waving a bill at a poor old man. A masked hero has one **duty**, he cries, and slashes a Z through the bill with his rapier. The *debt collector* produces a new bill, for the window, and Zorro, remembering his other **duty**, leaps onto his black horse and vanishes laughing."],"营":["camp","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, gobbles up every tent, pan and sleeping bag in sight, and lays them as eggs on a carpet of *grass*. Each egg cracks and a little tent pops up, until the ring is one big **camp**. The *grass* tickles the sleeping referee, who wakes in pyjamas and joins the **camp** for sausages."],"星":["star","{Shrek} is eating an onion in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} when a falling *star* crashes into his lap and starts singing. He roars to be left alone, it sings louder, and the donkey declares himself its manager. Shrek hurls the **star** back at the sky, and the crowd, thrilled, screams that the grumpy ogre is the real **star**."],"够":["enough","{Gandalf} reads an old *quotation* aloud in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, not noticing that it is a spell, and *many moons* rise over the sinks, jostling and glowing. He bangs his staff and thunders, \"**Enough**!\" The moons sheepishly shrink away until one remains, since one moon, as the *quotation* now admits, is **enough** for anyone."],"章":["chapter","In {Front} of the {Hangar}, the {Joker} folds each **chapter** of his joke book into a paper plane and pins a *badge* on its nose. He launches them one by one, cackling, and every time someone peels a **chapter** off their windscreen, the *badge* squirts them in the eye."],"音":["sound","In {Front} of the {Inn}, {Yoshi} flicks out his tongue and swallows all the *music* coming from a village band, leaving them sawing away in silence. There is not a **sound** for a full minute. Then he lays a spotted egg, it cracks, and the *music* comes back as a **sound** like a trombone falling down a well."],"跟":["to follow","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Funfair} and finds that a cursed *kicking foot* has begun to **follow** him. He gives it his fiercest wizard's *glare* and sets off a firework behind it, but it goes on **following**, hopping after him through the dodgems and onto the carousel. \"You shall not pass!\" he roars, and it nips at his heel and passes."],"志":["ambition","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, revealing his greatest **ambition**: to squirt the moon with his flower. A tiny *scholar* does the maths and shakes his head, but the Joker's *heart* beats so hard with **ambition** that it pumps the flower full and blasts him upward. He waves a playing card, grinning, past the clouds."],"底":["bottom","In the {Basement} of the {Beach}, {Darth Vader} raises a *shed* with the Force, breathing loudly, then lifts its *foundation* too, and still finds no **bottom** to the hole beneath. He booms his disapproval and levitates crabs and pirate gold out of the way. At the very **bottom** sits a tiny crab on a tiny chair, and he announces that he is its father."],"站":["to stand","The {Joker} climbs onto a *podium* in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, because a *fortune teller* has promised a prize to anyone who can **stand** perfectly still for a hundred years. He **stands**, grin fixed, while pigeons nest in his green hair. When the day comes the prize is a chair, and it squirts him, because he rigged it himself."],"严":["stern","{Yoshi} flutters {Inside} the {Mansion} to face a **stern** judge whose frown drops like a *cliff* and who only ever hands out a *silver medal*, never gold. He swallows the *silver medal* and lays it as an egg, hoping for a smile. The judge hands back the egg, as **stern** as ever, and marks it down for shape."],"巴":["to long for","{Batman} crouches in {Front} of the {Spa} all night, brooding, and **longs for** one hot bath he can never take. Beside him a *python* sighs and **longs for** it too, writing poems about bubbles. At dawn he fires his grappling hook, swings the *python* into the tub, and glides off, gruffly refusing to admit how much he envies a snake."],"例":["example","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and plucks a *standing person* from a *lineup* of tourists for a lesson in tomb safety. Here is an **example** of what not to do, she says, as he steps on the wrong tile and a rubber boulder bonks him. The *lineup* gasps, and she cartwheels across every trap as the good **example**."],"防":["to defend","{Frodo} digs in on a *hillside* {Inside} the {Hangar}, with loyal Sam and a *square* of sandbags, to **defend** a single potato. Custard and pigeons rain down from above, so he slips on the Ring to vanish. The *square* of sandbags holds, the *hillside* rumbles, and weary, invisible Frodo keeps on **defending** that potato until the pigeons surrender."],"族":["nationality","{Zorro} vaults {Inside} the {Pool}, where a *clan* of penguins squabbles over passports showing each one's **nationality**: Emperor, King, Rockhopper. With three flicks of his rapier he slashes a Z through every passport. The *clan* blinks at the holes, and he vanishes laughing, leaving them all one **nationality**: Zorroland."],"供":["to supply","In {Front} of the {Lagoon}, {Gandalf} conjures a *standing person* from his pipe smoke, then dozens, and they form a line of *joined hands* down to the water. Along it they pass buckets that he fills by spell, to **supply** the fish with lemonade and the turtles with fireworks. \"A wizard's **supply** never runs out,\" he says, just as it does."],"效":["effect","{Shrek} sits with *crossed legs* in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, thumps his *cane* and lets out one huge onion belch. The **effect** is instant: every cat's fur stands up and they all float round the lampshade. The donkey begs him to do it again, so he does, the **effect** doubles, and for once there is silence."],"续":["to continue","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} to escape the donkey, but a *market stall* stands there, unwinding one endless *silk thread*, and the donkey **continues** along it, talking. Shrek roars and stuffs the *silk thread* in his own ears. Still the chatter **continues**, past the dinosaurs and through the night, in layers."],"施":["to carry out","In {Front} of the {Beehive}, {Sherlock} studies a crumb on a paving *square* and deduces the whole plot: a *snake* has been hired to **carry out** a honey robbery at noon. At noon the *snake* slithers across the *square* and does **carry out** the job, and swallows his deerstalker too. \"Elementary,\" he says, hatless, while Watson takes notes."],"留":["to stay","{Lara Croft} scales the bunks {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} and lifts a glittering *keepsake* off its pedestal, and the door slams: a trap that makes anyone who touches it **stay**. She backflips, picks locks and climbs vents, but each way out seals itself. The *keepsake* hums smugly, so she sighs, unrolls a sleeping bag and **stays** another year."],"讲":["to explain","In the {Basement} of the {Stadium}, {James Bond} dangles over a deep *well* and, unruffled, clicks Q's latest gadget, which does nothing but blow a *small speech bubble* that **explains** the offside rule. The bubble **explains** it so slowly that the guard at the rope nods off. The *well* yawns too, and Bond climbs out with a dry one-liner."],"型":["type","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, shoves the chattering donkey's head through a pair of wooden *stocks* and presses his face into wet *soil* to make a mould. He labels it a **type**: annoying. Then every boxer wants a go, the *soil* keeps printing faces, and soon there is a **type** for all of them: sweaty, grumpy, snoring, and one more annoying."],"料":["material","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, facing a pressure plate that needs an exact weight, and looks round for **material**. She swings a stone *dipper* and shovels *rice* onto the plate, grain by grain, until the wall grinds open. The cats then bring **material** of their own, yarn, feathers and tuna, and the trap jams forever."],"终":["end","In {Front} of the {Lagoon}, the {Joker} sneaks up behind a ferryman and tugs a loose *silk thread* on his *winter coat*. He runs, cackling, all round the water as the *winter coat* unravels, until he reaches the very **end** of the thread. There dangles a tiny playing card that reads The **End**, and he takes a bow."],"答":["to answer","{Darth Vader} looms {Inside} the {Spa}, breathing loudly, and lifts a *bamboo* basket into the air with the Force. He booms that it must **answer** him. Its *fitted lid* clacks once for yes and twice for no. He asks whether he is its father, it **answers** with a long wet raspberry, and the whole spa holds its breath."],"紧":["tight","In the {Basement} of the {Inn}, {James Bond} is trussed up in a *silk skein* that pulls itself **tight** round his tuxedo. He clicks Q's cufflink, which does one absurd thing: it makes knots even **tighter**. He hops away like a caterpillar, unruffled, and orders a drink through a straw."],"黄":["yellow","{Homer} lumbers {Inside} the {Swamp} with a dim scheme to make the world's biggest custard doughnut, trips, and smashes a giant egg. A flood of *yolk* turns everything **yellow**: frogs, lily pads, a startled crocodile. \"Mmm,\" he says, and climbs out **yellow** from head to toe, and nobody can tell the difference."],"绝":["to cut off","{James Bond} skates {Inside} the {Ice Rink} in his tuxedo, where a *rainbow* dangles by a single *silk thread*, and raises Q's laser watch, which can **cut off** one thing only. Snip! The *rainbow* falls and shatters into coloured ice cubes, and skaters skid in all directions. \"Cool,\" he says, unruffled, as the manager **cuts off** his skating for life."],"奇":["strange","{Chewbacca} wanders {Inside} the {Beach} and meets an *oddball* in a tuxedo made of seaweed, walking a lobster on a lead. How **strange**, he growls, and the *oddball* growls the same thing back in perfect Wookiee. He rips open his bandolier in a panic, and it gets **stranger**: the lobster understands him as well, and offers to fix his ship."],"察":["to examine","{Charlie Brown} shuffles {Inside} the {Spa}, where a *detective* **examines** his zigzag shirt, his kite string and one lonely sock, seeking the cause of all his bad luck. Nothing there, so it is time to **examine** the football. The *detective* holds it steady, Charlie runs up to kick, and it is pulled away. \"Good grief.\""],"母":["mother","{Mario} slides down a warp pipe into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and head-butts a block, and out pops not a coin but his *mother*, with a towel and a snack. Like every **mother**, she straightens his red cap and wipes his moustache. He eats a mushroom, grows ten feet tall and shouts \"Wahoo!\", and his **mother** simply asks if he is warm enough."],"京":["capital","{James Bond} strolls up in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, shakes out his pocket square, Q's most absurd gadget yet, and it unfolds into a full-size *palace*. He declares it the **capital** of a country with one citizen. Trumpets play from the *palace* windows, pigeons queue for passports, and he stands unruffled in the **capital**, stamping them."],"段":["section","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, red lightsaber humming, where a *blacksmith* is hammering a long iron bar. He booms his disapproval and slices the bar into neat **sections**. The *blacksmith* shrugs and hammers each **section** into railings for the swans, as Vader breathes loudly and lifts the last one away with the Force."],"依":["to depend on","In {Front} of the {Beach}, {Yoshi} flutter-jumps after a kite and loses height, so he shoots out his sticky tongue and sticks it to the *robe* of a *standing person*. Now he **depends on** that one hem to keep from falling. The person sneezes, the *robe* stretches, and Yoshi, who **depends on** the sneezing stopping, lays a nervous egg."],"批":["to approve","In {Front} of the {Beach}, {Pikachu} sits at a tiny desk while *twins* bring him plans for a sandcastle, and he **approves** each with a spark that scorches a yellow tick. A *helping hand* holds the next sheet still. \"Pika!\" Without reading it he **approves** that too, and it was the twins' plan to catch him in a Poké Ball."],"群":["crowd","{Chewbacca} strides {Inside} the {Dunes}, huge and hairy, and a *lord* in a velvet cape mistakes him for the biggest of his *sheep*. The whole woolly **crowd** agrees and surges after him, thousands of them, baaing. He roars in a temper and rips the cape in two, and the **crowd** just chews up the pieces and looks at him for more."],"项":["item","{Shrek} slams down a *workbench* in the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} and reads out a *page* listing every **item** he needs to be left alone: moat, sign, onions, earplugs. Each time he ticks off an **item**, the donkey trots in and adds a new one to the *page*: waffles. He roars, and the *workbench* collapses."],"故":["reason","{Gandalf} appears in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, exactly when he means to, and a dripping *storyteller* demands the **reason** he is so late. A wizard is never late, he snaps, blowing a smoke ring. So the *storyteller* invents one: a frog prince, a lost slipper. Each time Gandalf frowns, a firework pops and another **reason** appears in the sparks."],"按":["to press","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and tries to **press** a red button marked *safe home*, but his finger goes straight through. A *helping hand* shoots out of the tiles and **presses** it for him, and the whole mansion folds up like a tent. The butler screams at the sight of him, and poor Casper only wanted a friend."],"河":["river","{Homer} nods off {Inside} the {Hut} beside a leaky tap he was too lazy to fix, and the *water drops* swell and roar into a **river**. His *nodding head* bobs along on top, still asleep. The **river** carries him out to sea on a raft of doughnuts, and he wakes with \"D'oh!\", then \"Mmm.\""],"米":["rice","{Mario} head-butts a block in the {Basement} of the {Beach}, and out pops one grain of *rice* where a coin should be. He hits it again and again, shouting \"Wahoo!\", and **rice** gushes out of every warp pipe in the place. Plumber that he is, he stomps on the pipes and swims up through a sea of **rice**, moustache first."],"围":["to surround","{Walter White} stands {Inside} the {Lake} with a beaker, growing crystals in a perfect school experiment, and they climb up into a glittering *fence*. It spreads until it **surrounds** the ducks, the fish and his RV, each post fastened with a *leather strap*. Too late he sees that it **surrounds** him as well, so he knocks, being the one who knocks, and a swan lets him out."],"江":["river","In {Front} of the {Stadium}, Q slides {James Bond} a pen across a *workbench*; one click, and *water drops* start falling. They do one absurd thing, which is never stop, and soon a **river** wraps the stadium like a moat. Bond steps onto the floating *workbench* in a dry tuxedo and escapes down the **river**, one hand on his bow tie."],"织":["to weave","In {Front} of the {Beehive}, the {Joker} cackles as he pays a *lone bird* to **weave** a hammock of *silk thread*. It **weaves** in and out faster than a sewing machine, in purple and green, with one trick knot hidden in the middle. Grinning hugely, he invites the queen bee to lie down, then forgets, lies down himself and hits the ground."],"害":["to harm","{Homer} spots a *pest* in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, a tiny beetle nibbling his doughnut, and hatches a dim scheme to **harm** it. The mallet bounces off his own toe, the bucket drops on his own bald head, and the mousetrap takes his trousers. \"D'oh!\" Every plan to **harm** the *pest* lands on him, while it sunbathes on the icing."],"斗":["to fight","{Darth Vader} ignites his red lightsaber in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} to **fight** a rower armed with only a soup *dipper*. Clang! The *dipper* bonks his helmet with a long echo, so he lifts all the soup in the place with the Force. They **fight** on, dripping, until he booms that he is the rower's father and the rower says no."],"双":["pair","In {Front} of the {Swamp}, {Sherlock} lifts two muddy boots in *both hands* and inspects them. From one crumb of mud he deduces all: a **pair** of frogs lives in them, shares a violin and owes Watson money. \"Elementary,\" he says, and *both hands* jump as that **pair** of frogs hops out and proves him right."],"境":["surroundings","{James Bond} presses Q's latest gadget in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}: a watch that does nothing but change his **surroundings**. Up bursts *soil* across the floor, then sunflowers, then cows in the towels. For the *finale* the tiles turn into a meadow, and he adjusts his bow tie, unruffled, and calls his new **surroundings** udderly charming."],"客":["guest","{Kermit} flings open the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and a *guest* strolls on into the spotlight, because he is stage-managing a chat show in there. Another **guest** follows, then chickens, then a hundred more, each expecting a song. He flails his arms, plays a banjo chord and shrieks \"Yaaay!\" as the last **guest** sits on him."],"纪":["era","{James Bond} tugs a *coiled rope* from his cufflink in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, Q's latest absurd gadget, with a *silk thread* tied to every knot. Each knot he pulls brings a new **era**: dinosaurs, pyramids, knights. Unruffled, he orders a drink from a caveman, then raises it to the next **era** as a dinosaur queues politely behind him."],"采":["to pick","In the {Basement} of the {Island}, {Cookie Monster} meets a *fruit picker* who wants him to **pick** mangoes off the ceiling. \"Me **pick** cookie!\" he bellows, googly eyes spinning, and there are no cookies. So he devours the mangoes, the ladder and the basket in a spray of crumbs, and the *fruit picker*, sighing, picks crumbs out of his fur."],"举":["to lift","At a *party* in the {Basement} of the {Museum}, {James Bond} clicks Q's latest gadget, a bow tie that can **lift** exactly one thing: a marble lion. Up it floats, roaring softly, and he stays unruffled beneath it. The *party* cheers, and the statues **lift** him on their shoulders and carry him round the room, drink still unspilled."],"杀":["to kill","In {Front} of the {Spa}, {Sherlock} finds one flattened mosquito and one crumb, and deduces everything: an *assassin* in a dressing gown has come with a fly swatter to **kill** every mosquito in the place. \"Elementary,\" he says, smugly, pipe in hand. The *assassin* bows, admits it, and goes on to **kill** the next one on Sherlock's nose."],"攻":["to attack","In {Front} of the {Lagoon}, {Gandalf} is lighting his pipe on a *workbench* when five hundred seagulls **attack** his sandwich. \"You shall not pass!\" he thunders, and enchants a *cane* to **attack** them for him. It whirls through the flock, whacking at feathers, fireworks bursting from its tip, and the gulls retreat with only the crusts."],"父":["father","{Frodo} slips on the Ring in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and turns invisible, trying to escape his *father*, who is in a stripy swimsuit telling terrible jokes. It is no use: like any **father**, he spots the hairy feet and asks if anyone wants a sandwich. Frodo groans, for a **father** like that makes Mordor look like a short walk."],"苏":["basil","In {Front} of the {Pool}, {Sailor Moon} trips over the *grass* and crashes through a *workshop*, moon wand firing sparkles in all directions. The sparkles turn every blade into giant **basil**, with leaves the size of surfboards, and the *workshop* starts humming pesto. She gives a long speech about justice while Luna, sneezing, drowns in **basil**."],"密":["secret","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and head-butts a straw *roof*, which flips open on a **secret** level. Down he drops into a *hideout* stuffed with coins and mushrooms. \"Wahoo!\" A crab peeks in and sees the **secret**, so he pays it one coin to keep quiet."],"低":["low","In {Front} of the {Beach}, {Darth Vader} disapproves of a *standing person* building a hut on a weak *foundation*, so he lowers them both with the Force, breathing loudly. Down goes the *foundation*, **lower** and **lower**, until only a hat shows, very **low** indeed. He bends down, cape in the sand, to boom at the hat."],"朝":["court","{Charlie Brown} is summoned {Inside} the {Tower} to kick the royal football before the *royal court*. Trumpets blare, lords bow, and the whole **court** holds its breath as he runs up. The queen pulls the ball away at the last second, he lands flat on his back, and the **court** applauds politely. \"Good grief.\""],"友":["friend","In the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, {Yoshi} gulps down his new best *friend*, a walrus, in one affectionate slurp of his tongue. He looks guilty, then lays a huge spotted egg, which hatches to reveal his **friend** wearing the shell as a hat. A real **friend** always comes back, and this one asks to do it again."],"诉":["to tell","{Sailor Moon} sobs in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, because a *small speech bubble* has floated up carrying a *chipped axe* and begun to **tell** its sad story. She raises her moon wand, strikes a pose, and **tells** it a far longer story about love and justice. Luna covers her ears, the *chipped axe* weeps, and both of them cry into the water."],"止":["to stop","In the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, the {Joker} holds up a trick *stop sign*, and every bee **stops** dead in mid-air, buzzing on the spot. The honey **stops** dripping, the clock **stops** ticking, and he cackles at his finest prank. Then he flips the sign, it squirts him in the face, and they all zoom off at once."],"细":["thin","{Shrek} bursts out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} to escape the donkey and steps onto a *silk thread* stretched over a flooded *rice field*. The thread is **thin**, and the ogre is not. He sheds layer after layer, as ogres do, trying to get **thin** enough, until it snaps and the *rice field* swallows him with a splash and a roar."],"愿":["wish","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, where a *cliff spring* bubbles over the tiles and grants one **wish** for one coin. He gobbles the bank's coins, lays them as a golden egg and drops it in with his *heart* thumping. His **wish** comes true at once: more eggs gush out of the spring, all landing on him."],"千":["thousand","In {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, {Chewbacca} is fixing his ship's engine when a *thousand ants* march into his fur. He roars and rips off his bandolier, but they only carry away a **thousand** tiny bolts. Then they carry them back, every one in the right place, and he growls with loyal love for his **thousand** new mechanics."],"值":["worth","The {Joker} sneaks {Inside} the {Beehive}, where a *standing person* dangles a *plumb line* over each honeycomb to see what it is **worth**. He swaps the line for a trick one, cackling, and the next comb squirts. Then it swings at him and declares his huge grin **worth** exactly three jars of honey and a playing card."],"仍":["still","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Jungle} and politely arrests a *standing person* whose pink *ribbon* has snagged him on a vine for a hundred years. His targeting display blinks: suspect **still** standing, *ribbon* **still** knotted. Directive one says check again next century, so Robocop waits with the handcuffs raised, **still** reciting the rules while moss creeps over his visor."],"男":["male","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Mansion} with dozens of shadow clones, every one of them a loud, orange, **male** ninja. A lone *man* at the door holds a list marked **male** guests only, gasps at the queue, and ticks furiously. The clones keep multiplying, and the *man* is carried off on a tide of identical boys yelling for ramen."],"钱":["money","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} with a broken ship part, roars for **money**, and rips the safe apart in a temper. Out spill *gold coins*, while the clerk's *twin blades* snip at his fur to make him stop. Chewbacca growls, stuffs all the **money** into his bandolier, and leaves a hairy thank-you on the counter."],"破":["broken","{Pikachu} sits in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} with his cheeks sparking when a *stone* toilet, draped with a drying *hide*, flushes at him. One startled Thunderbolt later the *stone* is **broken**, the *hide* is smoking and the taps are **broken** too, and Pikachu squeaks an apologetic 'Pika' from his Poké Ball."],"网":["net","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where a chalk *archway* frames his finest school experiment. From two beakers he draws a thread of nylon, precise to the gram, and weaves it across the *archway* into a gleaming *lattice*, a giant **net**. 'I am the one who knits', he says proudly, as the **net** drops over his whole class."],"热":["hot","{Robocop} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and reads the *embers* their rights, since they are glowing under the tub without a permit. He snaps on his *handcuffs*, which turn so **hot** they shine orange. Steam pours off his armour, his display flashes **hot**, **hot**, **hot**, and he goes on arresting them politely."],"助":["to help","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where a swimmer dangles from a wobbly *stepladder* crying for **help**. Out of his purple sleeve springs a rubber *strong arm* that lifts the swimmer to safety, then squirts him with a flower. It is a prank, but it is also real **help**, and the Joker's grin falters in horror."],"倒":["upside down","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and lifts a *standing person* with the Force, turning him **upside down** over the sink. A new *arrival* knocks, so Vader booms his disapproval and flips the *arrival* too. Soon towels, toothbrushes and both guests hang **upside down**, while his cape alone stays magnificently the right way up."],"育":["to raise","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, snatches a stone *moon* from an exhibit with his long tongue, swallows it and lays it as a spotted egg. It hatches a baby *moon*, so now Yoshi must **raise** it, feeding it melons and teaching it to flutter jump. It takes a whole month to **raise** it to full."],"属":["to belong to","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Basement} of the {Pool} at a lost swimming cap and one crumb. 'Elementary', he says: it must **belong to** these *kinfolk*, who all share the same enormous nose. Watson trails behind with armfuls of goggles and flippers, and the smug detective proves that all of it must **belong to** the *kinfolk* too."],"坐":["to sit","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and finds a *sitting pair* refusing to budge from the only bench. Three flicks of his rapier carve a Z across the bench, the *sitting pair* yelp and leap, and dashing Zorro seizes his chance to **sit**. His black horse trots in to **sit** on his lap, and he vanishes laughing from underneath it."],"帝":["emperor","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, breathing loudly, and kneels before a *sky god* in a shower cap who demands to be called **emperor**. Vader Force-lifts the towels into a throne and the seashells into a crown, then booms across the sand that all shall bow to the **emperor**. The *sky god* thunders for more soap."],"限":["to limit","{Shrek} bellows from the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} that he wants to be left alone, and heaps up a muddy *hillside* to **limit** who can get in. His ogre *glare* sweeps the queue: one visitor, no more, and no onions. Then the donkey trots over the *hillside*, talking, and Shrek learns that his patience has a **limit**."],"船":["boat","{Charlie Brown} tiptoes {Inside} the {Swan Pond} with a toy *boat*, his one hope of winning the regatta. The wind catches it, a swan eats the sail the way trees eat his kites, and the **boat** is towed off backwards with Snoopy saluting from the deck. 'Good grief', says Charlie, and he wades after his **boat** with a very small net."],"脸":["face","{Lara Croft} flips down into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and scales a wall to a carved *moon* with a stern **face**. She solves the puzzle by tweaking its nose, a trap clicks, and a stone *assembly* of statues slides out on rollers, every one pulling exactly the same **face** at her as her ponytail whips past."],"职":["duty","The {Joker} squeezes {Inside} the {Beehive} and finds a *lone bird* on sentry **duty**, stiff and serious. Cackling, he fastens a rubber *ear* to its head, and the *ear* honks each time a bee walks past. The bird stays at its post, honking, because **duty** is **duty**, and for once the Joker's prank gets no laugh at all."],"速":["fast","{Sailor Moon} slips on the soap in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} as Luna shrieks that evil is fleeing down the *road* with a *bundle* of towels. For once she does her sparkly transformation **fast**, one second flat, pigtails whirling. Then she throws her tiara so **fast** that it knocks the *bundle* sky-high, and she trips over her own speech about justice."],"刻":["moment","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, stage-managing a show that opens this very **moment**. A *wild boar* crashes on too early, a *standing knife* hops after it to do its cutlery act, and Kermit shrieks 'Yaaay!' at nobody. Then, for one single **moment**, everything is perfectly still, and the boar takes a bow."],"乐":["happy","{Lara Croft} somersaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and prises a relic out of the wall, bracing for darts. Instead the trap sets off *joy bells*, and even the rolling boulder chasing her looks **happy**, bouncing in time. Lara dangles from the shower rail by one hand, ponytail swinging, the first truly **happy** tomb raider in history."],"否":["to deny","{Frodo} tiptoes on bare hairy feet into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, where a talking *mouth* on the wall asks who carries the Ring. He slips it on, vanishes, and can only **deny** everything, waving a *no sign* that appears to float in midair. The *mouth* grins, and Sam, loyal as ever, helps him **deny** it in a very loud whisper."],"刚":["just","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Hangar} at the instant he means to, which is **just** now. With a wave of his staff a stone *ridge* heaves out of the tarmac, and a *standing knife* hops along it, carving the time in firework sparks. A wizard is never late, he grumbles, and the smoke from his pipe has **just** caught up."],"威":["power","{Walter White} lays out his beakers in {Front} of the {Lake} as a *woman* with a *battle axe* strides up and demands to know who has the **power** here. Walter straightens his glasses and flicks a pea of sodium into the water, and it fizzes, bangs and soaks her. She lowers the *battle axe*, and he says proudly that precise science is **power**."],"毛":["hair","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Tower}, head-butts a brick block and gobbles the mushroom that pops out. But it only grows his **hair**: his moustache sprouts thick *fur*, **hair** pours out from under his red cap, and it fills the stairs. 'Wahoo!' he cries, stomping along on his own *fur* as it carries him out of the door."],"状":["shape","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, whittling a *split log* into the exact **shape** of a *dog* and painting a huge grin on it. A real *dog* wanders in and stares at the *split log* in alarm. Then, tricked, it stiffens into the very same **shape**, tail and all, and the Joker deals it a playing card."],"率":["rate","{Lara Croft} cartwheels through the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where an ancient trap fires darts at a **rate** of one per second. She times her flips to that **rate**, until a hidden *dragnet* falls and the darts double their **rate**. Unbothered, she swarms straight up the *dragnet*, ponytail swinging, and picks the relic off the light fitting."],"甚":["even","{Sherlock} kneels in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} beside an *overflowing bowl* of popcorn and deduces everything from one crumb. He names the thief, the thief's aunt, **even** the aunt's favourite violin tune. Watson gasps, the *overflowing bowl* slops over his shoes, and smug Sherlock announces that he deduced **even** that, a minute ago."],"独":["alone","{Darth Vader} wades {Inside} the {Pool}, breathing so loudly that every swimmer flees and leaves him **alone**. A *prowling dog* slinks up, hears 'I am your father', and bolts, and a *bug* he gently lifts with the Force flies away offended. Vader floats on his cape, **alone**, booming his disapproval at the empty water."],"球":["ball","{Chewbacca} stomps {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} for table tennis against a snooty *king* in a *fur coat*. He loses one point, roars, and rips the **ball** apart in a temper. Then, since he fixes everything, he rebuilds the **ball** from ship parts and hands it back, while the *fur coat* slides off the king and hugs him like a long-lost cousin."],"般":["kind","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Mansion} and growls at a soggy *boatman*: what **kind** of boat needs a driveway? The *boatman* begs for a gadget, so Batman opens his utility belt, which holds every **kind** of oar, paddle and anchor, sorted and labelled. He broods for an hour over which **kind** suits a man with no water."],"普":["general","{Pikachu} sneezes a Thunderbolt in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, and sparks run through all the water until it glows like *broad daylight*. Nobody is left out: the tingling is **general**, every swimmer's hair stands on end, and in **general** the whole crowd is now squeaking 'Pika' along with him."],"怕":["to fear","{Pikachu} cowers in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, cheeks fizzing, for the one thing he **fears** is a Poké Ball. A *white dove* flutters in carrying something round, and his *standing heart* jumps up on its little legs and hides in the laundry. It is only a bar of soap, but **fear** has already thundered every towel to a crisp."],"弹":["bullet","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} as a *bow* twangs by itself and fires a **bullet** of soap at his helmet. He halts it in midair with one raised glove. A *racket* swoops in to swat it, so Vader flings the soapy **bullet** back with the Force and booming disapproval, and it pings around the tiles."],"校":["school","{Shrek} roars from the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} because somebody has opened a **school** in it, and he only wanted some peace. A *tree* chalks onion layers on the wall, kittens with *crossed legs* chant them back, and the donkey appoints himself head of the **school**, talking without a single breath."],"苦":["bitter","{Kermit} hops into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and tastes the *grass* sprouting from an *antique* teapot, since it is green like him. It is so **bitter** that his arms flail and his banjo twangs out of tune. 'Yaaay', he wheezes, tongue hanging out, for it's not easy being green, and it's even harder being **bitter**."],"创":["to create","{Charlie Brown} sets out in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp} to **create** a kite no tree can eat, carving it with a *standing knife* in a leaning little *barn*. Good grief: the *barn* falls over and the *standing knife* cuts his string. What he does **create** is a whole new kind of disaster, and Snoopy applauds from the wreck."],"假":["fake","{James Bond} strolls through the {Basement} of the {Piazza} and nods to a *standing person* who turns out to be a **fake**, a rubber dummy of himself. He clicks the *borrowed tool* Q lent him, which does one absurd thing: it inflates **fake** moustaches. Unruffled, Bond sticks one on the dummy and bows to it."],"久":["long","{James Bond}, rolled in a *blanket* in the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel}, checks his watch: the villain's speech has gone on very **long**. The slow *sweep* of a cleaner's broom passes again and again for years, and dust settles on his tuxedo. At last he wriggles free, straightens his tie, and remarks that it has been a **long** time since he was shaken."],"错":["wrong","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, googly eyes spinning, and gobbles a plate of what looks like cookies. **Wrong**: they are *gold coins* and round slices of *sun-dried meat*, and his teeth clang. 'Me eat **wrong** thing', he wails, spraying bits everywhere, then he reaches for the soap, which is also **wrong**."],"承":["to bear","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Jungle} with *three planks* on his shoulders, because someone must **bear** them and it is always him. His *lifting hands* shake as a kite drops out of a tree onto the pile, then Snoopy hops up, then it rains. 'Good grief', he sighs, and he goes on, since he can **bear** anything by now."],"印":["to print","{Yoshi} swallows an ink pad in the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} with one flick of his sticky tongue, then lays a leaky egg. A *kneeling man* rolls the egg across a sheet of paper, and it starts to **print** a green dinosaur over and over. 'Yoshi!' he cheers, laying another, so the *kneeling man* can **print** the whole newspaper."],"晚":["evening","{Walter White} holds **evening** class in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, lowering a glowing flask *sun* on a string until the room turns dim. A *dodger* sneaks towards the door at the last minute. Walter raps the flask with a spoon, says he is the one who knocks, and declares that this **evening** nobody leaves before the chemistry is done."],"兰":["orchid","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Mansion}, past spikes and swinging pendulums, to an ancient pedestal where a single *orchid* blooms. She swaps the **orchid** for a cabbage of equal weight, but the trap is not fooled and a boulder starts to roll. She sprints away, ponytail flying, with the precious **orchid** clenched between her teeth."],"试":["to try","{Sherlock} lights his pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and resolves to **try** an experiment on one smug theory. He presses a *stencil* to the wall and paints a letter in honey, and a *small speech bubble* pops from a passing bee, saying 'Elementary'. Now he must **try** it again, with Watson holding the violin and getting stung."],"股":["stock (share)","{Gandalf} raises his staff in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and casts a glowing share chart across a conjured *moon*, for he holds **stock** in the place. It climbs like fireworks, then plunges. Cranky Gandalf smashes the graph with a *war club* and bellows 'You shall not pass!' at the falling **stock**, which halts at once in terror."],"拿":["to hold","{Naruto} charges {Inside} the {Spa} with a pot of ramen, its *fitted lid* rattling, and yells that he will never let go. He summons dozens of shadow clones, and every clone must **hold** something: a *hand* on the pot, a *hand* on the lid, a *hand* on another clone's ear. They **hold** on through the steam, shouting, and nobody gets any ramen."],"脑":["brain","{Naruto} yells in the {Basement} of the {Tower} that he will finally use his **brain**, and taps his headband hopefully. Dozens of shadow clones try too, all thinking at once, until a grey, wrinkled *moon* swells over their heads like one giant **brain**. It hums for a second, forgets what it was for, and they all order ramen."],"预":["in advance","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and, for once, lays the egg **in advance**, before he has swallowed anything. Out of the shell falls a *page* listing what he will eat next. An *offering* of melons shuffles up exactly on time, the tongue flicks, and every bite has been arranged **in advance**."],"谁":["who","{Sherlock} paddles {Inside} the {Lake}, deerstalker dripping, as a *small speech bubble* floats past asking **who**. A *sparrow* perches on his pipe with one crumb in its beak, and he narrows his eyes. Elementary: the *sparrow* itself is asking, and Watson, sinking gently beside him, has no idea **who** anyone is."],"益":["benefit","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps over a *spilling dish* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, catching every drop of soup on his sticky tongue. That is the **benefit** of being him, and there is more: he lays the soup as a warm egg and rolls it to the hungry queue. Everyone gets the **benefit**, and the *spilling dish* keeps refilling in hope."],"阳":["sun","{Yoshi} pads {Inside} the {Hangar}, where an indoor *hillside* has a *sun* peeking over it. His tongue shoots out, yanks down the **sun** and swallows it, and everything goes dark except his glowing belly. He lays a blazing egg, it rolls to the top of the *hillside*, it hatches, and out climbs the **sun**, sulking."],"若":["to seem","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and his visor locks onto a *lookalike*, stiff and shiny. The display says the suspect **seems** to be Robocop, so he reads it the rules and arrests it politely. Only then, as the *lookalike* salutes back from the mirror, does it **seem** that he has arrested himself."],"哪":["which","{Naruto} makes a hundred shadow clones in the {Basement} of the {Spa}, and a huge *mouth* on the wall booms out a question: **which** one is real? A *pointing finger* wobbles along the orange row, stops, and wobbles on. Every clone yells that it's him, and nobody, not even Naruto, can say **which**."],"微":["tiny","{Walter White} sets up a school microscope in {Front} of the {Lake} and places one drop on the slide with proud precision. Under the lens march **tiny** *footsteps*, left by something too **tiny** to name. He adjusts his glasses and lectures the whole class about it, until the water flea taps back on the glass, announcing that it is the one who knocks."],"尼":["nun","{Naruto} tunnels {Inside} the {Beach}, yelling, and surfaces under a *nun* in a deckchair. He tries a Transformation Jutsu to apologise, and two dozen orange clones pop up, each dressed as a **nun**. The real *nun* sighs, collects their headbands and orders silence, which no **nun** in history has ever managed with Naruto."],"继":["to continue","{James Bond} dangles in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} from a *silk thread* spun by a cufflink from Q, which does only that. A villain cuts it, the cufflink spins more, and Bond, falling, adjusts his tie and suggests they **continue**. The *silk thread* snaps nine times, and nine times, unruffled, he goes on to **continue** his sentence."],"送":["to deliver","{Sailor Moon} sets off from the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} to **deliver** a parcel, after a very long sparkly transformation. She trips along the *road*, wails all the way up a *mountain pass* and drops the parcel twice, with Luna riding on her head giving directions. In the name of the moon she will **deliver** it, and she gives the startled granny a speech about justice."],"急":["urgent","{James Bond} sips calmly in a bunker {Inside} the {Beach} while Q's wristwatch flashes **urgent**, **urgent**, and a bomb ticks by his elbow. A *racing heart* pops out of his tuxedo and sprints in circles squeaking that it is very **urgent**. Bond orders it a drink, shaken not stirred, and escapes with one second to spare."],"血":["blood","{Shrek} stumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, grumbling, nicks his thumb on an onion knife, and a single *drop* falls into a soap *dish*. The donkey, who will not shut up, shrieks about **blood** for ten minutes. Shrek roars that it is one *drop* of **blood**, and that all he wants is a plaster and to be left alone."],"惊":["to startle","{James Bond} presses Q's newest button in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, and an inflatable *palace* bursts out with a bang to **startle** the boxers. They leap, and a *standing heart* hops out of each chest and runs for it. Bond does not blink: it takes more than a *palace* to **startle** him, he says, straightening his tie."],"伤":["injury","{Sherlock} circles a *standing person* in {Front} of the {Hangar}, magnifying glass up, and deduces the **injury** from one crumb on his sock: a stubbed toe, Tuesday, on a violin case. 'Elementary', he says, smug as a cat. Watson, trailing behind and taking notes, walks straight into a rake and adds a fresh **injury** to the file."],"素":["plain","{Sailor Moon} waves her wand in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and starts her long sparkly transformation, but it goes wrong and she comes out **plain**. No ribbons, no tiara, only a grey frock woven from one undyed *silk skein*, and a *seedling top* poking up as her only decoration. Luna stares, and she sobs loudly about justice in a perfectly **plain** voice."],"药":["medicine","{Yoshi} slurps up a tongueful of *grass* in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and lays it as a round green egg of **medicine**. A *promise knot* tied round a sneezing knight's finger binds the knight to swallow it whole, and one gulp cures him. 'Yoshi!' comes the happy cry, and more **medicine** rolls out across the tiles."],"适":["to fit","{Sherlock} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} with a lost boot and studies its worn *tongue*, which flaps and licks his magnifying glass. Along a tiny *road* of suspect bees he goes, trying the boot on each, but nothing will **fit**. 'Elementary', he says, smugly pulling it onto Watson, for whom it is a perfect **fit**."],"波":["wave","{Batman} broods in {Front} of the {Fort} when a giant *wave* rolls in over the sand. He fires his grappling hook, pulls a bat-shaped surfboard from his utility belt and rides the **wave** with a gloomy scowl, cape streaming. The next **wave** dumps him into the Batmobile, and he growls at the sea to confess."],"夜":["night","{Yoshi} shoots out his tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and swallows the whole *night*, stars and all, so it is suddenly noon and the owls complain. He flutters up and lays a huge black egg. It cracks, **night** pours out, and he sits blinking in the dark, burping up one last star of **night**."],"省":["to save","{Sherlock} rations his pipe in the {Basement} of the {Jungle}, trying to **save** tobacco, one *pinch* a day. His sharp *eye* deduces from a single crumb that Watson has overspent on bananas. Smug as ever, he lists how they can **save** on violin strings by owning just the one, and plays it, badly, to prove the point."],"初":["at first","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Pool} and cuts a kite sail from his zigzag *shirt* with a *knife*. **At first** it flies beautifully. **At first** he even smiles, and Snoopy dances along below. Then a tree appears from nowhere and eats the lot, and he stands there in half a *shirt*, saying 'Good grief'."],"喜":["to like","{Shrek} sulks in the {Basement} of the {Beach}, hating everyone, while the donkey thumps a *joy drum* and insists that Shrek must **like** him. Shrek roars for silence and hurls an onion. Then his great green foot begins to tap, and though he would never admit it, he does **like** this, layer by layer."],"卫":["to guard","{Walter White} nails a *plank* across the door of the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} to **guard** his school experiment, a fizzing beaker no pupil may touch. Pupils rap on the wood, begging to see it. Walter, goggles on, shakes his head and explains that he is the one who knocks, and that **guard** duty means the *plank* stays put."],"源":["source","{Yoshi} follows a trail of *water drops* {Inside} the {Mint} to a *cliff spring* gushing between the coin presses. His tongue laps at the **source**, he swallows the lot, and he lays it as one wobbly egg. When the egg cracks the water spurts out again, and now Yoshi himself is the **source**, flooding the floor with wet coins."],"食":["food","{Sherlock} creeps {Inside} the {Beehive}, magnifying glass up, and studies one crumb of *food* on the wax floor. Elementary: a pie, a picnic, a bear with a grudge, all deduced from that scrap of **food**. Watson trails behind, quietly eating the evidence and every other bit of **food** in the hive."],"险":["danger","{Shrek} hammers up **danger** signs in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} to keep everyone away, just as he does at his swamp. An *assembly* of villagers ignores them and storms over a muddy *hillside* with pitchforks. Shrek roars, their torches blow out, and they realise that the real **danger** is the ogre holding the hammer."],"待":["to wait","{Darth Vader} must **wait** outside the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, breathing louder each minute, in a queue that stretches back to a *temple*. He hears *footsteps* and lifts his hopes and the door handle with the Force, but it is only somebody else joining the line. He finds this lack of flushing disturbing, he booms, and goes on to **wait**."],"述":["to tell","{Sherlock} perches in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and cannot help but **tell** everyone how each *magic trick* is done, from one crumb of chalk. He follows the magician down the *road*, violin under his arm, going on to **tell** the whole street, while Watson begs him not to spoil the rabbit."],"陆":["land","{Lara Croft} escapes a flooded tomb in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, using her ponytail as a rudder, desperate for dry **land**. She scrambles onto a muddy *hillside* rising from the tiles as a stone fist throws a *punch* at her. She flips over it, sticks the dismount, and kisses the good solid **land**."],"习":["to practise","{Shrek} digs himself {Inside} the {Beach} to **practise** his scariest roar in peace, again and again, layer by layer. The donkey turns up with a *single wing* strapped on, determined to **practise** flying, and flaps off the edge onto his nose, talking the whole way down. Shrek roars at him, and it is his best roar yet."],"置":["to place","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} to **place** a trick playing card on every seat, exactly straight, checked with a *plumb line*. His *fishing net* swoops down and scoops up the bees so they can watch. With a huge grin he goes to **place** the squirting flower last, cackling, and the first bee sits."],"居":["residence","{James Bond} presses a cufflink in {Front} of the {Museum} and Q's gadget unfolds with a whoosh into a whole *house*, which does one thing only: it becomes his official **residence**. A postman at once delivers his letters. Unruffled, Bond signs for the doormat and tells the curator that his **residence** has the nicer lawn."],"劳":["to toil","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Tower}, where an ancient puzzle demands that a hundred stone blocks be moved, and a worn-out *labourer* simply hands her his shovel. She must **toil**, ponytail plastered down, hauling and heaving until the last block clicks. A boulder rolls in and knocks them all back, and the two of them **toil** again."],"财":["wealth","{Cookie Monster} tunnels {Inside} the {Island} and uncovers a pirate's **wealth**: a giant pearly *shell*, heaped with treasure, with a *green shoot* of new money sprouting from it. His googly eyes spin, and he devours the lot in a spray of crumbs. 'Me eat all **wealth**', he burps, 'but me still want cookie'."],"环":["ring","{Homer} wades {Inside} the {Swan Pond}, drooling at a shiny gold **ring** that he takes for a doughnut. A *king* on a swan holds up a *no sign*, since it is the royal **ring**, but Homer only hears 'Mmm' in his own head. He bites down, his teeth clang, and the whole pond hears 'D'oh!'"],"排":["to line up","{Pikachu} crackles {Inside} the {Island} and his static makes every spoon, nail and teapot **line up** in a neat row. A *helping hand* straightens the last one, gulls with *spread wings* hop into the row too, and they all **line up** facing him. 'Pika', he says sternly, and one more spark sends them marching off."],"福":["good fortune","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Pool} after a very long walk and finds a *small altar* by the diving board, with a *full jar* of honey cakes sitting on it. Such **good fortune** has never met a hobbit. Even the Ring stays quiet while Sam shares them out, and weary Frodo dangles his hairy feet in the water, blessing his **good fortune**."],"纳":["to accept","{Naruto} bursts through the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} into an *inner room*, where a tiny old ninja lowers a bowl of ramen on a *silk thread*. Dozens of shadow clones bow at once, all bellowing that they **accept**. They go on to **accept** seconds, thirds and finally the thread, slurped up like one long noodle."],"欢":["joyous","{Homer} wakes from a nap in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} with a huge *yawn*, and his *right hand* discovers a doughnut sitting on his chest. 'Mmm', he says, and he is **joyous**. A swan steals it, the *yawn* comes back, and his *right hand* finds a second one in his shirt, so the whole **joyous** business begins again."],"雷":["thunder","{Lara Croft} dives {Inside} the {Lake} and pulls a relic from a drowned tomb, which instantly sets off the oldest trap there is: **thunder**. Down comes *rain*, a sunken *rice field* shudders, and the **thunder** rolls after her like a boulder. She sprints across the mud, ponytail crackling, one step ahead of every boom."],"警":["police","{James Bond} strolls through the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} as the **police** storm in, and he gives them an unruffled *salute*. Q's pen, which does one absurd thing, blows up a *speech bubble* bearing his name in large letters. While the **police** stand reading it, he slips out of the back in a spotless tuxedo."],"获":["to obtain","{Homer} hatches a dim scheme in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} to **obtain** the last doughnut: crawl through the *grass* growing over the floor and snatch it. A *dog fight* breaks out over the same doughnut, and he gets dragged round the room by his trousers. 'D'oh!' Still, he does **obtain** it, half licked, and murmurs 'Mmm'."],"模":["model","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Fort} and finds a perfect **model** of his whole world on a table: a wee *tree*, a painted *sunset*, tiny warp pipes. He eats the wrong mushroom, shrinks, and dives in with a 'Wahoo!' He stomps across the **model**, head-butts a thimble-sized block, and collects one coin the size of a crumb."],"充":["to fill","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Lagoon} trying to **fill** a *balloon*, puffing until his zigzag shirt strains. At last it swells, lifts him off the ground and floats him straight into a kite-eating tree, which pops it. 'Good grief', he says from a branch, and he starts to **fill** it all over again."],"负":["to bear","{Frodo} staggers through the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} under a *backpack* heavier than any hobbit should **bear**, with the Ring growing heavier at his neck. Sam, loyal as ever, offers to take it, but no: he alone must **bear** this. The *backpack* groans, his hairy feet plod on, and it is a very long walk to the door."],"云":["cloud","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Dunes} and finds a *cloud* lying on the sand, wheezing. His tongue flicks out, slurps it down like candyfloss, and a moment later he lays it as a soft white egg. The shell cracks, a new **cloud** puffs up and floats off, and he rides away on the **cloud**, shouting 'Yoshi!'"],"停":["to stop","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} on a vine with his jungle yell, baffled by the ropes. A *standing person* in a bow tie shouts **stop**, but Tarzan has never heard the word and sails on into a *pavilion*, which collapses. Only when an elephant sits on the vine does he finally **stop**, and he thanks it warmly."],"木":["tree","{Mario} plunges a blocked drain in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, and out shoots a *tree*, growing as fast as if it had swallowed a mushroom. He stomps on it and it grows more. 'Wahoo!' He head-butts the **tree**, coins rain from its branches, and the plumber warps away as the **tree** bursts through the door."],"游":["to tour","{Yoshi} leads a **tour** {Inside} the {Boathouse}, holding a *streamer* in his teeth, with *water drops* pattering on the visitors. At each stop his tongue shoots out, he swallows the exhibit and he lays it as a souvenir egg. The **tour** ends in an empty building, with forty delighted people hugging warm eggs."],"龙":["dragon","{Lara Croft} dives {Inside} the {Lagoon} after a relic, and it turns out to be the tooth of a sleeping *dragon*. The **dragon** opens one eye, so she sprints up its neck like a cliff, ponytail flying, and solves the puzzle of its scales one by one. Then she leaps off as the **dragon** sneezes her out to safety."],"树":["tree","{Sherlock} examines a *tree* growing in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and deduces from one crumb of bark that *dance partners* have waltzed around it all night. 'Elementary', he says, and Watson writes it down. The *dance partners* sweep back in on cue and spin him off, and the **tree** sways along, for the **tree** was the third dancer all along."],"疑":["to doubt","{Yoshi} digs {Inside} the {Beach} and finds an egg he does not remember laying, with a *puzzled face* peering out of the crack. He starts to **doubt** everything: did he swallow a melon, a shoe, a seagull? 'Yoshi?' he asks, and his tongue creeps out and tests the shell in **doubt**."],"层":["layer","{Cookie Monster} crashes {Inside} the {Jungle} to a cake as high as the palms, **layer** upon **layer**, with a *lying man* snoring on top under a *cloud* of icing sugar. 'Me eat one **layer**', he growls, then the next, in a spray of crumbs, until the *lying man* sinks slowly to the ground, still asleep."],"冷":["cold","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Jungle}, teeth chattering, where a stone *herald* blows a horn to announce the **cold**. Down fall *icicles* like a spiked trap, and she dodges them, then climbs them, her ponytail frozen stiff as a poker. It is so **cold** that even the rolling boulder stops and shivers."],"洲":["continent","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Boathouse} with a stolen map and his squirting flower. The flower sprays *water drops* all over the paper until the painted *islands* slide together and join into one huge **continent**. An old captain sets sail for it, and the Joker deals him a trick card, grinning that he has moved a whole **continent** for a laugh."],"冲":["to rush","{Charlie Brown} starts his **rush** in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, charging over crunching *icicles* at a football set on a painted *bullseye*. Lucy pulls it away, as always, and he flies up, hangs in the air and lands flat on his back. 'Good grief', he says, then he gets up to **rush** at it again."],"射":["to shoot","{Sherlock} sniffs one feather in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and deduces that a hidden *archer* is about to **shoot** a rubber sucker at him. 'Elementary', he says, stepping aside, and it thwacks onto Watson's hat. Smug as ever, he then shows the *archer* exactly where to **shoot** next, and takes out his violin to wait."],"略":["outline","{Lara Croft} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} and scratches the rough **outline** of a lost tomb on the frosty wall: a *rice field*, a path, one big X. A confused *visitor* asks for details, but she only flips away, calling that the **outline** will do. The boulder she forgot to draw rolls out after the *visitor*."],"范":["model","{Frodo} wades barefoot through the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, where a *flood* swirls round tufts of *grass*, and the Ring whispers to him to give up. He trudges on, weary and loyal, and Sam points him out to the watching hobbit children as a **model** of patience. All of them copy him, tiny hairy feet in a row behind their **model**."],"竟":["unexpectedly","{James Bond} adjusts his tuxedo in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} just as the grand *finale* of the villain's scheme goes off, **unexpectedly**, ten minutes early. The walls fall flat around him. Then, **unexpectedly**, the one gadget Q called useless, a spray-on moustache comb, saves the day, and he walks out with not a hair out of place."],"句":["sentence","{James Bond} tumbles through a window into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, lands in the tub and delivers his one-liner, a single unruffled **sentence**. Q's pen, which does nothing else, records it and frames it as a *quotation* that the curators hurry to hang on the wall. He says another **sentence**, and they run for more frames."],"室":["room","{Sherlock} raps on the wax in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and deduces, from one crumb, a hidden **room**. A tiny *roof* lifts off like a lid, an *arrow landing* on the floor quivers to show the way, and there is the secret **room**, with Watson in it, covered in honey and looking sorry."],"异":["different","{Yoshi} slurps up a *cobra* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and lays an egg, but out of the shell comes a tuft of *grass*, something totally **different**. Puzzled, he swallows the *grass* and lays again, and this time out hops a small hissing teapot, **different** yet again. 'Yoshi?' he asks it."],"激":["to arouse","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Beach}, where the whole crowd is snoring, and presses a cufflink from Q that flicks icy *water drops* with a dazzling *sparkle* into every ear. Everyone leaps up, shrieking and whooping, a stirred-up mob now chasing him along the sand. 'Do try not to **arouse** suspicion', he says to the gadget, having managed to **arouse** the entire coast."],"汉":["Han","{Homer} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} on a history book about the **Han** dynasty, dribbling *water drops* onto the emperors. His *right hand* crawls out for a snack and draws a doughnut on every portrait. He wakes, licks the page, and mumbles 'Mmm, **Han** with sprinkles' before the book snaps shut on his nose. 'D'oh!'"],"村":["village","{Cookie Monster} discovers a tiny **village** in {Front} of the {Casino}, all gingerbread huts round one sugar *tree*. 'Me only look', he says, googly eyes rolling, but his big blue *thumb* presses down on the church to test it. Moments later the whole **village** is gone in a spray of crumbs, and he is licking the *tree*."],"哈":["ha","{Homer} tugs at a doughnut tin in {Front} of the {Spa}, its *fitted lid* stuck fast. He heaves, it pops, and the tin flies straight into his own wide-open *mouth*, doughnuts and all. 'D'oh!' he gargles, and young Nelson strolls by, points a finger and says **ha**, then **ha** once more."],"策":["plan","{Cookie Monster} scratches a **plan** on a slip of *bamboo* with a *thorn* in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, tongue out, googly eyes crossed. Step one: find cookie. Step two: 'Me want cookie!' Then he gets hungry, and in a spray of crumbs he eats the *bamboo*, the *thorn* and the whole **plan**."],"演":["to perform","{Yoshi} steps onto a little stage in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} to **perform** the only act he knows. He gulps down a *temple arrow*, flutter-jumps through a curtain of *water drops*, and lays an egg that splits to reveal the arrow, while the crowd roars. He will **perform** it twice nightly."],"简":["simple","{James Bond} faces a giant safe in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} with its hundred dials, and Q has given him one gadget: a stick of *bamboo*. Unruffled, he pokes it through a *gap* in the wall and pushes the door, which was never locked. 'It's quite **simple**', he says, and walks out, because **simple** always beats clever."],"卡":["card","{Kermit} hops around the {Basement} of the {Spa} holding up a cue **card**, flailing, while the show *upstairs* collapses with a great thump. A *fortune stick* pokes through the ceiling and taps him on the head. He flips to the next **card**, which says only 'Yaaay!', so he reads it out loud in a panic."],"罪":["crime","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier through the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} as a thief makes off with all the towels, a **crime** in any land. He swoops down, cape like *spread wings*, and one flick of his rapier drops a *fishing net* over the villain. He slashes a Z in the man's hat, so nobody forgets the **crime**, and vanishes laughing."],"判":["to judge","{Pikachu} sits in a tiny wig in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, called upon to **judge** two children fighting over a cake. A *standing knife* hops up and cuts it in *half*, and they both howl. 'Pika', he rules, cheeks sparking, and a Thunderbolt toasts the bigger piece, because that is how Pikachu will **judge** every case."],"担":["to carry","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Mansion} as a *sunrise* gleams on his helmet, and he refuses to **carry** the luggage like a common butler. A *helping hand* reaches out to him and he waves it away with booming disapproval. He raises one finger, and with the Force he makes the air **carry** every suitcase behind him in a stately line."],"州":["state","The {Joker} unrolls a map in {Front} of the {Boathouse} and declares his own **state** of nonsense, with a playing card for its flag. Some *islands* pop up out of the water to join, squirting flowers at each other. He swears himself in as governor, cackling, and passes the first law of the **state**: everyone must slip on a banana peel."],"静":["calm","{James Bond} sits perfectly **calm** in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} with a drink while a *tug of war* rages around him. Villains haul the rope across his tuxedo, and a soft lump of *moss* has grown on his shoulder from sitting so still. A bomb ticks and he stays **calm**: shaken, he says, not stirred, and neither is he."],"退":["to retreat","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} with his jungle yell and meets his first hand dryer, which roars back. Baffled by civilisation, he makes a wild *u-turn* on the vine and shouts to the apes to **retreat**. They all **retreat**, tumbling over the chairs, and the hand dryer clicks off in triumph."],"既":["already","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a villain is proudly unveiling a deadly dinner trap, and points at the *finished meal* on the tray. He has **already** eaten it. He has **already** defused the bomb, **already** kissed the villain's hand goodbye, and his drink, shaken not stirred, is **already** empty."],"衣":["clothes","{Yoshi} stretches his tongue in {Front} of the {Beach} and snatches a sunbather's *robe*, then every item of **clothes** on the washing line, and swallows the lot. He lays one enormous egg. It cracks open and out strolls a tiny dinosaur chick wearing socks, a hat, three shirts and the *robe*, a walking pile of **clothes**."],"您":["you (polite)","{Naruto} skids {Inside} the {Inn} yelling at the old innkeeper, until a shadow clone whispers to him to use the honoured **you** instead. He puts a hand on his *heart*, bows till his headband slips, and asks if **you**, esteemed elder, would pass the ramen. The rude old *you* slinks out of the door in shame."],"宗":["sect","{Zorro} leaps from his black horse in {Front} of the {Lagoon} at an *ancestral hall* where a secret **sect** meets, all in masks and capes. He slashes a Z on the door, and every member gasps and slashes a Z on the nearest thing, the walls, the benches, each other's hats. The **sect** has a new leader, and he vanishes laughing."],"积":["to accumulate","{James Bond} lounges in {Front} of the {Beach} in a tuxedo with Q's new pocket magnet, which attracts straw and nothing else. A *lone bird* flies by, dropping one *grain stalk* after another, and they begin to **accumulate**. By sunset the stalks **accumulate** to the size of a haystack with one bow tie on it, and he asks for a drink."],"余":["surplus","{Yoshi} wanders {Inside} the {Museum} and his tongue sweeps up the *leftovers* of the opening party, every sandwich and sausage roll. He swallows them and lays them all as eggs, far too many, rolling down the halls. The curators stack the **surplus** by the dinosaur bones, and Yoshi, delighted, lays the **surplus** of the **surplus**."],"痛":["pain","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, misses his vine and stubs his toe on the sink, and the jungle yell he lets out is pure **pain**. Worried apes carry him on a *sickbed* through a long *tunnel*, and the howl of **pain** echoes ahead of them, scaring all the fish."],"检":["to check","{James Bond} sweeps the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} with Q's monocle, a gadget that can only **check** whether things are fake. A potted *tree* beeps, and then an *assembly* of bankers beep one after another. Unruffled, he turns it on himself to **check** his own tie, which beeps too, and he leaves by the window."],"差":["short of","{Charlie Brown} saves up in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} for a kite string, but he is one cent **short of** the price. He builds a string from his *workbench* shavings, and a *sheep* eats it. Now he is one metre **short of** the sky, one cent **short of** a new string, and 'Good grief' is all he has left."],"富":["rich","{Frodo} pads into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a *full jar* of gold, with a tiny *roof* hopping over it to keep it dry. The Ring whispers that he could be **rich**, and it tempts him for a moment. But weary Frodo, who never wanted to be **rich**, sighs and walks on, while loyal Sam stuffs one coin in his sock for later."],"灵":["quick","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} as an ancient trap springs and a *campfire* bursts up through the canvas. **Quick** as a cat, she vaults it, snatches a relic *comb* from the flames, and runs it through her ponytail before the darts arrive. Only somebody that **quick** could dodge a boulder with neat hair."],"协":["to cooperate","{Shrek} wants to be left alone {Inside} the {Yeti Cave}, but a wooden *cross* has fallen across the door of the *workshop*, trapping him with the donkey. He must **cooperate**, which he hates. He lifts while the donkey talks non-stop, and the two of them **cooperate** so badly that he hurls the *cross* out and the donkey with it."],"角":["corner","{James Bond} is backed into a **corner** in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} by a hundred angry kittens, and he is not ruffled. Q's latest gadget, an *ox horn*, does one absurd thing: it blasts a noise like a can opener. Every kitten bolts to the opposite **corner**, and he walks out smoothing his tuxedo."],"占":["to occupy","The {Joker} locks himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and announces, cackling, that he will **occupy** it forever. A *fortune teller* outside peers into her crystal ball and predicts a very long queue. He squirts his flower under the door, and rubber chickens **occupy** every shelf, the sink and her chair."],"配":["to match","{Pikachu} must **match** two things in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} to win a trainer's contest: an old *wine jug* and a *coiled rope*. Neither looks like the other at all. 'Pika!' One Thunderbolt scorches them the very same shade of yellow, and now they **match** him and each other perfectly."],"征":["to recruit","The {Joker} sets up a table in {Front} of the {Jungle} to **recruit** an army of clowns, dealing trick playing cards to every monkey and parrot. Each new **recruit** gets a squirting flower and a huge painted grin. Then the *march* sets off, honking and cackling, and promptly walks in a circle right back to the table."],"修":["to repair","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} with a plank under one arm, to **repair** the door the donkey crashed through, so that he can shut it and be left alone. He patches it with swamp mud and onion skins, grumbling. The donkey bursts through again, still talking, and Shrek roars and starts to **repair** it again."],"皮":["skin","{Pikachu} naps in a cave {Inside} the {Beach} and wakes with his yellow **skin** prickling from static. A spark lifts a stiff old *hide* off the wall, and it wraps itself round him like a coat. 'Pika', he squeaks, and one more Thunderbolt tans it until he is wearing **skin** over **skin**, smoking gently."],"挥":["to wave","{Homer} dozes in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} as an *army* marches past with a band. He mistakes it for a doughnut parade and, too lazy to lift his arm, lets a *helping hand* raise it for him to **wave**. 'Mmm', he says, and the whole *army* turns to **wave** back at a sleeping man with sprinkles on his chin."],"胜":["victory","{Sherlock} bets Watson in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} that he can name the night's *moon* from one crumb of soil on a tiny *seedling*. 'Elementary', he says, and the *moon* peeks in at the window to confirm it. Smug beyond measure, he plays a **victory** tune on his violin, then a second **victory** tune for having played the first one."],"降":["to fall","{James Bond} begins to **fall** through the skylight of the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium}, adjusting his cufflinks on the way down. His *descending feet* hit a grassy *hillside* that Q's shoe has just inflated, and he bounces, still calm, and starts to **fall** again. He lands in a seat, and asks who's winning."],"阶":["stairs","{James Bond} clicks his heels in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, and Q's shoes unfold a flight of **stairs** up the *hillside*. A nervous *go-between* meets him halfway with a note, and as he reads it the **stairs** fold up behind him one by one. Unruffled, he hands back the note and steps into thin air, onto the next step that pops out."],"审":["to examine","{Sherlock} sets up a *courtroom* in the {Basement} of the {Funfair} and begins to **examine** every clown through his magnifying glass. One crumb of toffee apple, and he deduces the lot of them. Watson, sworn in as jury, can only nod, and smug Sherlock moves on to **examine** the goldfish, which breaks down and confesses."],"沉":["to sink","{Charlie Brown} finally wins a prize {Inside} the {Funfair}, and it is a heap of *clutter*: stuffed bears, a bowling ball, a kite. He climbs aboard the raft ride, *water drops* patter through a hole, and he starts to **sink**. 'Good grief', he says, and he goes on to **sink** slowly, zigzag shirt last, with Snoopy asleep on the floating kite."],"坚":["solid","{James Bond} sprays Q's aerosol in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} on a patch of soft *soil*, which sets **solid** at once, trapping the boots of the villains chasing him. Unruffled, he taps it with his umbrella. 'Rock **solid**', he says, straightens his bow tie and strolls off, leaving them all planted there like garden gnomes."],"善":["kind","{Sherlock} deduces from one crumb in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} that Watson is sad, and then, shockingly, opens his *mouth* and says something **kind**. Watson faints. 'Elementary', mutters the great detective, embarrassed at being so **kind**, and he plays him a gentle tune on the violin until he wakes."],"妈":["mom","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in {Front} of the {Spa} with a 'Wahoo!', and a *woman* gallops up on a *horse*. It is his **mom**, who licks her thumb and scrubs his moustache and straightens his red cap. He head-butts a block to fetch her a coin, the *horse* eats it, and his **mom** tells him to wear a scarf."],"刘":["to kill","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} with a *tattooed blade* prised from an ancient tomb, because one whining mosquito has kept every bunk awake. She somersaults over the beds and sets a rolling boulder after it, determined **to kill** that bug. The boulder flattens the laundry, the mosquito lands on her ponytail, and the blade's tattoos wriggle off the steel and help her **to kill** it."],"读":["to read","{Darth Vader} looms {Inside} the {Pool}, breathing loudly, and Force-lifts every book off a poolside *market stall* so they hover open around his helmet. He has come **to read**, and each page puffs out a *small speech bubble* that chatters its words at him. One book mumbles, so he Force-chokes it until it speaks up, then booms that every swimmer will learn **to read**."],"啊":["ah","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Spa} hoping to make a friend, and passes his hand through the shoulder of a dozing *auntie*. He turns visible to say hello, and her *mouth* falls open: **ah**! Every guest in a face mask joins in with a long, rising **ah**, cucumber slices flying, while poor Casper hangs his head and sighs a small sad **ah** of his own."],"超":["to overtake","{Charlie Brown} trudges in {Front} of the {Tower} in a race he is sure to lose, while a *runner* zooms by and a *town crier* bawls the score: last, as usual. Then a gust snatches his kite and drags him along on his stomach, just enough **to overtake** them both. For one second he has managed **to overtake** somebody, good grief, before a tree eats the kite and everyone passes him again."],"免":["to exempt","{Mario} warps up a green pipe into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a sly *dodger* is ducking away from a mountain of unpaid fees. Mario stomps the mountain flat, head-butts a block, and out pops a shiny coin stamped with an order **to exempt** the dodger. With a loud Wahoo the whole queue lines up, begging him **to exempt** them too."],"压":["to press","{Yoshi} flutters in {Front} of the {Spa} beneath a *cliff*, licks up a *clod* of earth and lays it as a big round egg. He climbs the cliff and ground-pounds the egg **to press** it flat as a pancake. The delighted guests hold out their towels, so he thumps down again and again **to press** each one smooth."],"银":["silver","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Inn} and slurps a pile of *gold coins* off the counter with his sticky tongue. The innkeeper's icy *glare* follows them down, so cold that it chills his whole tummy, and the egg he lays clanks out gleaming **silver**. It cracks open and the gold has turned to pure **silver**, which the innkeeper bites in amazement."],"买":["to buy","{Mario} drops down a pipe into the {Basement} of the {Island} swinging a *shopping basket*, ready **to buy** the whole place. He head-butts every block on the ceiling and coins rain out, ping, ping, ping. He stuffs the basket with mushrooms and shouts Wahoo, he has coins enough **to buy** the shopkeeper, who eats a mushroom, grows enormous and doubles the prices."],"皇":["emperor","{Homer} wades {Inside} the {Swamp}, spots a ring-shaped *golden crown* floating in the mud, and takes it for a doughnut. He bites it, yells D'oh, and it sticks on his bald head, so every alligator bows to their new **emperor**. He decrees a doughnut tax and falls asleep on a log, the laziest **emperor** the mud has ever known."],"养":["to raise","{Yoshi} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where a lamb, a goat and a baby jet plane sit crying for milk. His tongue whips out, swallows all three, and he lays them as speckled eggs, because that is how he plans **to raise** a family. He sits on them for weeks, they hatch, and he flutters around with bottles until he has managed **to raise** a goat that can fly."],"伊":["you (literary)","{Yoshi} flutters in {Front} of the {Beach} and lands beside a *magistrate*, a stiff *standing person* in a long robe, who bows and recites: O thou, O **you**, fair green one. Yoshi snatches the fancy word out of the air with his tongue, gulps, and lays an egg stamped **you (literary)**. It hatches, and a little old-fashioned **you (literary)** hops away, bowing to the seagulls."],"怀":["bosom","{Homer} sneaks {Inside} the {Wine Cellar} with a stolen doughnut hidden in his **bosom**, his *standing heart* thumping with love for it. A *no sign* swings down from the ceiling: no snacks allowed, D'oh! He only clutches the doughnut tighter to his **bosom**, mumbles Mmm, and gets caught by the trail of crumbs down his shirt."],"执":["to grasp","The {Joker} skips {Inside} the {Beehive} grinning and holds out a trick playing card for the queen bee **to grasp**. The moment her little legs close on it, tiny *handcuffs* pop out and click around them, and he cackles until his green hair shakes. Now she has **to grasp** it all day, and the card squirts honey whenever she sneezes."],"副":["secondary","{Frodo} trudges on hairy bare feet into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, with loyal Sam puffing behind him under a *full jar* of jam. A *standing knife* carves supper: the first slice for the Ring-bearer, the **secondary** slice for Sam. Sam gets the **secondary** towel too, and he beams, because every very long walk needs someone who comes second."],"乱":["in disorder","{Lara Croft} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} chasing a relic and lands on an ancient pressure plate. Click: a stone *tongue* shoots out of the wall, a lone *ski* whirls from the ceiling, a boulder rolls, and the swans explode in every direction. She backflips through it all unhurt, but the whole room is **in disorder**, and so is her ponytail, **in disorder** and stuffed with feathers."],"抗":["to resist","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} with his arms flailing, as a *helping hand* tries to drag him on stage in a stiff *high collar*. He screams Yaaay and struggles **to resist**, gripping the taps with his webbed toes. The hand tugs, the collar squeaks, and he croaks that it's not easy being green, but any frog has the right **to resist** a costume change."],"犯":["to offend","{Frodo} shuffles into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} after a very long walk, and his hairy, muddy bare feet are enough **to offend** anyone. A *prowling dog* sniffs them and faints, and a *bowing man*, the butler, bows lower and lower to get away. Weary Frodo slips on the Ring and vanishes, but the smell stays behind, still managing **to offend** the whole house."],"追":["to chase","The {Joker} stands in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} and flicks a trick playing card down the *road*, where it scuttles off on tiny legs. The patients leap up **to chase** it, over a heap of *sandbags* that burst and puff out green glitter. Cackling, he deals another card, so the whole queue has **to chase** that one too, and it squirts them."],"帮":["to help","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Hangar} and growls that he is here **to help**, because a tiny *country* on the pilots' map is flooding. His utility belt holds the exact gadget: a folded bat-*towel*, fired by grappling hook, which mops its rivers dry in one swoop. The tiny citizens wave, and he broods in the shadows, then stays **to help** wring it out."],"宣":["to announce","{Shrek} storms out in {Front} of the {Mint} with a giant *megaphone*, because he has one thing **to announce**: get out of my swamp. His roar is so loud that coins leap from their sacks. Then Donkey grabs the megaphone, will not shut up, and has a thousand more things **to announce**, until Shrek plugs it with an onion."],"佛":["Buddha","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Fort} and meets a calm *standing person* who sits down cross-legged and turns into a smiling golden **Buddha**. A glowing *dollar sign* floats up, and the Ring whispers to Frodo to grab it, grab it. The **Buddha** only smiles, the sign melts into lotus petals, and for the first time in months Frodo sits down too, resting his hairy feet.","fó"],"岁":["year of age","{Sailor Moon} twirls into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and begins her long sparkly transformation, so long that a *dusk moon* rises and sets behind a *mountain* in the window, again and again. Luna the cat counts aloud, because each moonrise adds one **year of age**. When the ribbons finally stop she is ninety, and she wails loudly over every single **year of age**."],"航":["to sail","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Hangar} in a *boat* he mistook for a sofa, starched into a captain's *high collar* for his latest dim scheme **to sail** to an island made of doughnuts. Needing wind, he switches on a jet engine. The boat rockets out of the door, and he begins **to sail** across the airfield yelling D'oh, still holding his snack."],"优":["excellent","{Yoshi} lands in {Front} of the {Boathouse} beside a sad *standing person* with a huge *wart* on his nose. Out shoots the long tongue, thwip, and the wart is gone, swallowed and laid as a gleaming gold-spotted egg. The nose is **excellent**, the egg is **excellent**, and the judges on the jetty give Yoshi ten out of ten."],"怪":["strange","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Wine Cellar} exactly when he means to, taps his staff, and the spell goes **strange**. A stone *saint* climbs off its plinth and tap-dances, a *standing heart* hops about on little legs, and the bottles sing in Elvish. He puffs his pipe, frowns under his pointy hat and mutters that this is very **strange** indeed."],"香":["fragrant","{Shrek} stomps in {Front} of the {Stadium} reeking of swamp and onions, and the crowd groans. Donkey lights a giant stick of *incense* under his nose, and Shrek roars at it, blowing the smoke across the whole pitch. Suddenly everything is **fragrant**, the referee's socks smell of roses, and Shrek, furious, finds even his armpits have turned **fragrant**."],"著":["famous","The {Joker} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a *busy man* mowing a strip of *grass*, so he decides as a prank to make him **famous**. Cackling, he prints the man's face on a thousand trick playing cards and flings them over the town. Crowds scream, flowers squirt, and the poor man, now **famous** for mowing, signs autographs with his shears.","zhù"],"田":["field","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, baffled by all the paper money, and lets out his jungle yell. Apes pour in, rip up the carpet, and neat squares of *rice field* sprout across the trading floor. Tarzan nods at last: a **field** makes sense, you can eat a **field**, and he swaps a banker's wallet for a handful of rice."],"铁":["iron","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave}, and a *lost arrow* zips out of the dark, hits a pile of *gold coins* and turns them all to grey, clanking **iron**. Baffled by shiny things, he ties the whole heap to his vine and swings with a jungle yell. The **iron** drags him straight down to the floor, where the apes laugh themselves silly."],"控":["to control","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} with a clipboard, because the show must start, and finds only an *empty room* with one big lever. A *helping hand* pops up and offers him the remote, and he screams Yaaay. He tries **to control** the waves, the lights and the singing fish, the tide falls on him, and he croaks that nothing here is easy **to control**."],"税":["tax","{Sherlock} kneels in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and studies one *grain stalk* through his magnifying glass. Elementary: a *money changer* has skimmed one stalk from every farmer's bag, and that is a **tax**. Watson gasps, Sherlock smugly points at the sticky-fingered culprit, and the money changer promptly charges him a **tax** on deductions."],"左":["left","{Zorro} swings on a chain into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} and slashes a Z on every crate, but today his rapier will only go *left*. Slash: the crates slide **left**, the forklifts turn, the arrows on the wall all spin round. His black horse wheels the same way, and he vanishes laughing through the **left** door, only to gallop back in by it a moment later."],"右":["right","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, where a *feeding hand* tosses bread from one side only, the **right**. His tongue shoots out, always to the **right**, swallowing every crumb, and he lays egg after egg along that wall. The eggs pile up so heavily that the whole boathouse tips over with a groan."],"份":["portion","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} after a very long walk, and a *standing person* is slicing one last cake of elven waybread. Loyal Sam makes sure each hobbit gets exactly one **portion**. Weary Frodo slides his **portion** across to Sam, Sam sneaks it back, and it travels to and fro until a clown eats it."],"穿":["to wear","{Charlie Brown} stands gloomily in {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, looking for something **to wear** besides his zigzag shirt. In a nearby *cave* he finds a fine coat with a *fang* for a button, and it bites him, good grief. Snoopy trots off in the coat looking splendid, and the only thing left **to wear** is the zigzag shirt, now with a hole in it."],"艺":["art","{Yoshi} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, slurps up a mouthful of *grass* and a startled *swan*, and lays one enormous egg swirled in green and feathers. The swan climbs out indignantly, but the crabs gasp, because the egg is **art**. Yoshi sets it on a rock, lays another, and the crabs pay a seashell each to look at real **art**."],"背":["back","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake}, brooding, staring due *north* with his **back** to the window. He hears the *moon* creep up behind him, and being a detective, he does not bother to look. He fires his grappling hook over his shoulder, lassos it and hauls it down onto his **back**, cape creaking, growling that nothing gets behind him."],"阵":["troop formation","The {Joker} leans out of the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and deals his trick playing cards down a *hillside*, and each card springs up as a tiny soldier pushing a *cart*, all in perfect **troop formation**. He cackles and squirts his flower like a signal. They shuffle into a square, then a triangle, and finally a **troop formation** shaped like his own huge grin."],"草":["grass","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Basement} of the {Tower} roaring me want cookie, and finds only *grass* poking through the floor and an *early bird* pecking at it. Googly eyes spinning, he devours it in a spray of green crumbs, shouting me eat **grass** now. The bird stares, the **grass** grows straight back, and he decides it is a very long cookie."],"脚":["foot","{James Bond} strolls into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} in a shoe from Q that does one absurd thing: under a *moon*, it squeaks like a mouse. The moon rises in the window, the shoe squeaks, and forty cats pounce on his **foot**. Time to *retreat*, so he fires the heel rocket and hops off on his other **foot**, tuxedo spotless, remarking that he started on the wrong one."],"概":["general","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and finds a *tree* standing over a *finished meal*, so he taps it with his staff and spells it into speech. It answers only in **general**: some food happened, around lunchtime, more or less. He puffs his pipe and nods, for wizards too speak only in **general**, and never give a straight answer."],"恶":["evil","{Casper} drifts through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, hoping for a friend, and meets a man with a black *heart* polishing a stolen *silver medal*. The man is **evil**: he cackles and twirls his moustache. Casper waves hello, the villain shrieks and leaps into the air, and the fright shakes the **evil** clean out of him, so he hands back the medal."],"块":["chunk","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Wine Cellar} with his banjo twanging, and the noise shakes a **chunk** of *soil* off the ceiling onto his head. He screams Yaaay and hops clear, but a glittering *archer's ring* comes down stuck in another **chunk**. Being a stage manager of chaos, he simply calls for the next act while the room rains lumps."],"顿":["to pause","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino}, where a *camp* of gamblers huddles in little tents, and lifts a *page* of house rules with the Force. Between every word he has **to pause** for one long, loud breath: no, hhhh, betting, hhhh, here. The whole camp has **to pause** too, cards frozen in the air, waiting for the next word."],"敢":["to dare","{Gandalf} strides into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} with his staff away for repairs and only a walking *cane* in hand, and there lies a sleeping dragon. It takes a wizard **to dare** this, so he pokes its nose and thunders You shall not pass. It opens one eye, he sets off a firework under it, and the watching mice, inspired, begin **to dare** to tickle its toes."],"守":["to guard","{Sherlock} sits in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} with his violin, having deduced from one wet crumb that the *roof* will spring a leak at midnight precisely. Elementary, he says, and the drip arrives on the stroke, so he plugs it with his *thumb* **to guard** the boats below. Watson brings tea, and Sherlock smugly stays all night **to guard** them, thumb wrinkling like a prune."],"酒":["wine","{James Bond} strolls into the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel}, where *water drops* are falling from a pipe into a giant *wine jug*. He sniffs, raises one eyebrow, and declares the **wine** ruined. Then he flicks a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing, turning water red, shakes the jug without stirring, and hands round **wine** in tooth mugs."],"岛":["island","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Basement} of the {Tower} and finds a tiny *island* bobbing in a puddle, palm trees and all. He raises one black glove and lifts the whole **island** into the air with the Force, breathing heavily. A pirate the size of a thumb shakes his fist, Vader booms I am your father, and the **island** drops back with a very small splash."],"托":["to entrust","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, where a *helping hand* pokes out of a hatch and gives him a form for his one precious *grass blade*. Baffled by paper, he gives his jungle yell and calls an elephant **to entrust** it to. The clerks ask why anyone would want **to entrust** grass to an elephant, and Tarzan asks what a clerk is."],"央":["centre","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Hangar} with a wooden *yoke* on his back and a heavy egg dangling from each end. He must land dead in the **centre** of the white line or both eggs roll away. His legs pedal madly, he wobbles, then his tongue sticks to a post at the exact **centre** and he hangs there while planes land either side."],"户":["household","{Homer} wakes from a nap in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and walks through a *door* he thinks leads to the doughnuts. D'oh: behind it sits an entire **household**, wife, kids and baby on a lilo, all talking at once. He is apparently the head of this **household**, they hand him the bills, so he shuts the door and goes back to sleep."],"烈":["intense","{Lara Croft} drops on a rope into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and triggers an ancient trap: a *lineup* of stone yetis starts spitting glowing *embers*. The heat is **intense**, her ponytail begins to smoke, and she runs up the wall and flips over them all. The heat grows so **intense** that the rolling boulder behind her melts into a puddle."],"洋":["ocean","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Hangar} and laps up the *water drops* leaking from a plane, along with a passing *sheep*, for an hour without stopping. Then he lays an egg so huge that it cracks and out rolls an **ocean**, waves and all. The planes bob like ducks, and the sheep drifts off across the **ocean** on a suitcase, bleating goodbye."],"哥":["elder brother","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Hut} exactly when he means to, and his *elder brother*, an even older and greyer wizard, has arrived one second earlier just to annoy him. They duel with fireworks, the **elder brother** turns Gandalf's pointy hat into a hen, and he blocks the gate crying You shall not pass. Gandalf grumbles that this is what an **elder brother** is for."],"索":["to search","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, loses her tiara and bursts into loud tears. She ties a *silk skein* to one long pigtail and sets off **to search** every crate, finding a sock, a parrot and a lost grandma. Luna the cat points out that the tiara is on her head, but she sobs about justice and vows **to search** on."],"胡":["reckless","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Pool} with a set of cat *whiskers* glued to his chin, convinced they will guide him with his eyes shut. This **reckless** scheme begins with a cannonball off the high board on a tray of doughnuts. He misses the water, yells D'oh, and bounces off a lifeguard, who shouts that he is **reckless** while Homer licks icing off his whiskers."],"款":["funds","{Kermit} flails into the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} begging for **funds** to keep the show running, and strums his banjo for the audience of swans. They answer with one enormous *yawn*, and out tumble coins, notes and gold bars. He screams Yaaay, hops about catching the **funds** in his banjo case, and the show goes on, disastrously."],"靠":["to lean on","{Kermit} staggers into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} after a week of stage-managing chaos, too tired to hop. A puppet *cow head* sits there sipping *coffee*, so he decides **to lean on** it. It slides, he flails, the coffee flies, and he croaks a tiny Yaaay, but with nothing else to do the two of them settle down **to lean on** each other and snore."],"评":["to comment","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, cheeks sparking, determined **to comment** on every punch, but his *small speech bubble* only ever says Pika. A boxer laughs, so one little Thunderbolt knocks him *flat*. The referee leans down and politely asks for an opinion, and out floats another bubble, Pika, the only way he knows **to comment**."],"版":["edition","{Batman} grapples down into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, where a *rebel* is printing a secret paper from a carved *wood slice*. From one ink smudge he deduces, gruffly, that this is the third **edition**. He pulls a bat-press from his belt and runs off the next **edition** himself, every headline brooding the same words: it is dark."],"宝":["treasure","{Batman} roars the Batmobile into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, his scanner pinging wildly at something overhead. He fires his grappling hook at the *roof* and yanks down a glowing *jade gem*, a lost **treasure**. He glides to the floor with it, cape spread, and growls into his radio that the **treasure** is safe, though the falling gem has dented the Batmobile."],"座":["seat","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and slashes a Z through the wall of a *shed*, where a *sitting pair* of walruses hog the only **seat**. One flick of his rapier and the sofa falls neatly in two. He bows, carves a Z on his own half of the **seat**, and vanishes laughing before anyone can sit on it."],"释":["to explain","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} at *animal tracks* crossing the honey, and deduces everything from one sticky crumb. The bees buzz, demanding that he has something **to explain**. Elementary, he says, plays a little violin, then takes twenty smug minutes **to explain** to Watson that it was a bear, wearing slippers."],"景":["scenery","{James Bond} hides from angry boxers in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} and clicks a watch from Q that does one absurd thing: it paints a *landscape* on the nearest wall. Mountains, rivers and cows appear, and he strolls calmly into the **scenery**. The boxers thunder past, and Bond, tuxedo spotless, leans on a cow and remarks that he does like a change of **scenery**."],"顾":["to look after","{Gandalf} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a *trapped man* pinned under a giant *page* from an old book of spells. He lifts it with his staff and reads that whoever frees the man must promise **to look after** him. Cranky but wise, he conjures soup, blows comforting smoke rings, tucks him under his pointy hat, and stays **to look after** him."],"弟":["younger brother","{Darth Vader} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, breathing loudly, and his *little brother* bursts out behind him waving a spade. This **younger brother** draws a moustache on the black helmet and copies the breathing, hhhh, hhhh. Vader Force-lifts the spade and booms his disapproval, but a **younger brother** cannot be frightened, and he only asks for a go on the lightsaber."],"登":["to climb","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Jungle} as a puffing *climber* struggles up a wall of vines, and he breathes his disapproval. He Force-lifts the man to the top, but the man yells that he wants **to climb** by himself. So Vader sets him down, carves footholds with his red lightsaber, and booms that everyone in the empire will now learn **to climb**."],"货":["goods","{Homer} shuffles into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and meets a *shape-shifter* who, for one *shell*, will become any **goods** you ask for: a vase, a bike, a sofa. Homer's dim scheme is to ask for a mountain of doughnuts and pay once. He sighs Mmm, bites the top one, and yells D'oh, as the **goods** complain and bite him back."],"互":["mutual","{Homer} floats into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} on a *plank* with a doughnut, and a *pig snout* rises from the water beside him and sniffs it. He sniffs back, and they stare: the hunger is **mutual**. They each bite one side, sigh Mmm together, and fall asleep nose to nose, the love now completely **mutual**."],"付":["to pay","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, and a *cashier* on a lilo holds out a bill for a very long walk's worth of towels. He has nothing **to pay** with but the Ring, which whispers temptingly. He slips it on and tiptoes away invisible, but his wet, hairy footprints give him away, and loyal Sam turns out his pockets **to pay**."],"伯":["uncle","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Fort} and studies a *standing person* with a *white dove* on his head. From the droppings on one shoulder he deduces, gruffly, that this can only be his **uncle**. His **uncle** pinches his cheek through the mask, pulls a coin from his ear, and walks away wearing the utility belt, while Batman broods."],"慢":["slow","{Mario} eats the wrong mushroom in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, and suddenly everything is **slow**. His *standing heart* beats once a minute, a *long veil* drifts down over his red cap like treacle, and his Wahoo takes a full hour to finish. He jumps at a goomba and hangs in the air, so **slow** that the goomba goes off for lunch."],"欧":["Europe","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, unrolling a *district map* to look for a friend, and gives a huge lonely *yawn*. He drifts straight through the paper and out of a cuckoo clock in **Europe**. He says hello in Paris, Venice and Vienna, turning visible each time, and frightens all of **Europe** by accident, in twenty languages."],"换":["to exchange","{Homer} slouches into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} with a dim scheme to look thin, and a *helping hand* gives him a *makeover*: pink wig, glitter boots, feather boa. A swan offers a doughnut, so he decides **to exchange** the boa for it. Mmm. Then he tries **to exchange** the wig and boots too, and walks home in a towel, yelling D'oh."],"闻":["to hear","{Walter White} marches {Inside} the {Funfair} with his chemistry class, presses a glass beaker to the *gate* of the ghost train and puts his *ear* to the beaker. It is a very precise school experiment, he says, adjusting his glasses: sound travels through glass, so now you are able **to hear** the rattling. The students line up, and each one learns **to hear** a scream in perfect science."],"危":["danger","{Walter White} sets up a school experiment in {Front} of the {Lake}, black hat on, and a *teetering man* wobbles on a stool beside his bubbling beaker. Stand back, he calls, **danger**, and he chalks the man's centre of gravity on a blackboard. The stool tips, Walter pours in one exact spoonful, and a mountain of soft foam catches him, proof that **danger** obeys science."],"忙":["busy","{Mario} races {Inside} the {Hangar} so **busy** that his moustache is a blur: stomping on goombas, head-butting blocks, fixing a leaky warp pipe. His *standing heart* hammers, and a *tombstone* rises in his path, carved game over. He stomps it for a coin with a Wahoo, because he is far too **busy** to stop."],"核":["pit","{Homer} is napping {Inside} the {Hut} under a *tree* growing through the floor when a *wild boar* spits a peach **pit** at his head. He takes it for a tiny doughnut, sighs Mmm, bites, and yells D'oh, clutching his tooth. He hurls the **pit** back, the boar catches it and spits it again, and that is the whole afternoon."],"暗":["dark","{Casper} drifts through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and plays some friendly organ *music* to cheer up the guests. It comes out so mournful that the *sun* hides, and every room goes **dark**. The guests stumble about screaming, so Casper floats over to help, glowing faintly as a kindly nightlight, the only thing visible in the **dark**, and they scream louder."],"姐":["older sister","{James Bond} escapes everything, but in the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave} a *woman* climbs down a *stepladder* and catches him by the ear: his **older sister**. She confiscates the exploding pen from Q and tells him to wash his hands. Bond, he says, James Bond, unruffled, and she says yes, Jimmy, because no spy has a licence against an **older sister**."],"介":["to introduce","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a fussy *go-between* rushes up **to introduce** him to a large yeti. Bond, James Bond, he says, and hands over a business card from Q that does one absurd thing: it shouts his name. The card leaps away and goes on **to introduce** him to every icicle in the cave."],"坏":["bad","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Wine Cellar} and spots a doughnut half-buried in *soil* beside a *no sign*, which he ignores. He sighs Mmm and eats it, and it is **bad**, green and fuzzy and very **bad**. He yells D'oh, his stomach roars like the nuclear plant, and he runs off, holding his belly with both hands."],"讨":["to discuss","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where apes, elephants and parrots have gathered **to discuss** the humans, each one sending up a *small speech bubble*. He translates everything with grunts, baffled by the idea of a meeting. A gorilla raises a *thumb*, the elephants trumpet no, and they stay **to discuss** it for three days until he ends it with his jungle yell."],"丽":["beautiful","{Lara Croft} sprints into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, a boulder rolling behind her, and leaps onto a rotten *plank* across a pit. It flips over, revealing an ancient underside set with pearls and gold, the most **beautiful** relic she has ever seen. She rides it like a surfboard down the tomb's wet slope, ponytail flying, and it looks so **beautiful** that even the boulder stops."],"良":["good","{Lara Croft} scales the walls {Inside} the {Stadium}, climbs the scoreboard and finds an ancient chest locked by a puzzle of turning dials. She solves it upside down, and within steams a *good meal*: the soup is **good**, the bread is **good**, and the dumplings have waited a thousand years. She tosses them to the hungry team, and suddenly they play **good** football."],"序":["order","{Shrek} hides in a *shed* in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} to be left alone, but Donkey keeps bringing him an *offering* of onions. So Shrek explains that ogres have layers, and peels one, setting out the layers in strict **order**, biggest to smallest. Donkey will not shut up and muddles them, Shrek roars, and every layer scurries back into perfect **order**."],"升":["to rise","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Jungle} studying one blade of *grass* on a playground *slide* through his magnifying glass. Elementary, he says, it leans uphill, so the ground is about **to rise**. Watson laughs, the earth rumbles, and the slide tilts as monkeys, parrots and Watson all begin **to rise**, while Sherlock smugly lights his pipe."],"监":["to supervise","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} in his tuxedo, as an *inspector* with a clipboard arrives from headquarters **to supervise** him. Unruffled, Bond presses a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing, and the inspector's shoes launch him over the bank on tiny rockets. He keeps scribbling as he goes, still trying **to supervise** from a passing cloud."],"临":["to face","{Lara Croft} tiptoes {Inside} the {Inn} along a corridor of ancient traps, and a huge boulder comes rumbling down the staircase. She plants her boots and turns **to face** it, staring right at its carved stone eye, then backflips over at the last second. It smashes through the wall, and now, ponytail swinging, she has **to face** the innkeeper and the bill."],"亮":["bright","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} and finds an old relic on a *small table*, a puzzle of tilting mirrors. She twists them one by one, catches a thin ray of moonlight, and the beam grows **bright**. It bounces out across the whole pitch, the players pull on sunglasses, and the night is as **bright** as noon."],"露":["to reveal","{Lara Croft} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} as *rain* pours through a crack and washes the mud off an old *pathway*, and the tiles begin **to reveal** ancient symbols. She reads them, swings across on her rope and stamps on three in order. A secret door grinds open **to reveal** a pirate in a nightshirt, who is very embarrassed to be found."],"永":["forever","{Yoshi} flops into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} beside a *stream* and sticks out his long tongue for a quick drink. It never stops flowing, so he swallows and swallows, laying egg after egg, and he will be here **forever**. Years pass, the eggs reach the ceiling, fish nest on his head, and he says Yoshi, happily, gulping **forever**."],"呼":["to call","{Homer} wakes from a nap in {Front} of the {Pool} as the doughnut van drives away, and he jams a *whistle* in his *mouth* **to call** it back. He gasps for breath, swallows the thing, and yells D'oh, which comes out as a shrill toot. Now every snore is enough **to call** all the dogs in town, and they arrive, dripping, to lick him."],"味":["taste","{Walter White} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} with his glasses on and his pipette raised, teaching how chemistry makes **taste**. He adds one exact drop of citric acid to a *sapling* and a leaf turns lemony, while a classroom model of a giant *mouth* chews and puckers. Proud of his precision, he writes the formula for every **taste** on the board."],"野":["wild field","{Yoshi} tumbles down a chute into the {Basement} of the {Hut} and lands in a whole *wilderness* of wolves, cacti and waterfalls. It is a **wild field**, and he licks up everything in sight, howl and all. He lays it as eggs in neat rows, and they hatch at once, so the **wild field** comes back, with a lot of confused wolves in it."],"架":["frame","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza}, and flicks a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing: it grows into a giant *plus sign*. He hooks it on a *tree* and it unfolds into a gilded **frame**. He stands perfectly still behind the **frame** like a portrait of a man in a tuxedo, and the villain's guards walk straight past, admiring it."],"域":["region","{Yoshi} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, swallows a mouthful of *soil* and lays it as a ring of muddy eggs around the floor. Within that ring is his own **region**, and he hoists a *guard post* into place with his tongue. Any curator who steps into his **region** gets licked up and laid back out, politely, as an egg on the far side."],"沙":["sand","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Spa} and studies one grain of *sand* through his magnifying glass. Elementary, he announces: this **sand** comes from Egypt, so the man in the mud wrap has lied about his holiday and owns a camel. Watson scoffs, and at that moment a camel strolls up, shedding more **sand** from its hooves, while Sherlock smugly relights his pipe."],"掉":["to drop","{Darth Vader} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, and a *helping hand* passes him a lit *beacon*, which he Force-lifts high over his helmet. A kitten climbs his cape, tickling him, and his concentration snaps, forcing him **to drop** it with a crash. Every cat watches, then slowly begins **to drop** a teacup off the shelf, staring straight at him."],"括":["to include","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, where the cast of the finale is out of control, and a *helping hand* gives him the clipboard. He has promised **to include** everybody, so out shoots his long frog *tongue*, wrapping crates, workers and a banjo in one sticky loop. He hauls them all on stage with a muffled Yaaay, and has managed **to include** himself."],"舰":["warship","{James Bond} wanders into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with a tiny rubber *boat* from Q, which does one absurd thing: pull the cord and it inflates into a grey **warship**, cannons and all. It bursts through the wall onto the trading floor, and a *watcher* in the crow's nest shouts that bankers are ahead. Bond straightens his tie and says he ordered a smaller **warship**."],"鱼":["fish","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum}, and his tongue shoots through a hole in a glass case and whips out a stuffed *fish*. He gulps it down, and out comes an egg that hatches a live **fish**, which flutter-jumps past the dinosaurs with its little fins pedalling. The alarms ring, the curators chase it, and Yoshi says his own name proudly and goes back for another **fish**."],"杂":["mixed","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier {Inside} the {Spa}, slashes a Z in a *bare tree* hung with laundry, and uses a *crowbar* to pop open the cupboard behind it. Out pour towels, ducks, a trumpet and spaghetti, and his rapier flicks them all into one tub, whisk, whisk, all **mixed** up. He vanishes laughing, and the guests soak in a **mixed** bubbling stew."],"误":["mistake","{Walter White} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with a tray of beakers, and a *loudmouth* in the back row keeps shouting wrong numbers, each in a *small speech bubble*. Walter, proud of his precise science, ignores them, until one sneaks onto his blackboard. **Mistake**! The beaker foams pink and floods the room, and the loudmouth gives him a thumbs-up for his first **mistake**."],"湾":["bay","{Walter White} stands in {Front} of the {Mansion} with a class of students and a *bent bow* of glass tubing, shooting *water drops* at the lawn in a lesson about erosion. Each precisely measured drop digs the curve a little deeper, until the sea rushes in and fills it. Now the garden has a **bay**, and he floats on a raft taking notes in the middle of the **bay**."],"吉":["lucky","{James Bond} falls out of the sky {Inside} the {Beach} wearing a *lucky charm* from Q, which does one absurd thing: it makes everything land the right way up. He lands on a lilo, a seagull returns his hat, and a passing crab offers him a drink. He straightens his bow tie and says that he is never **lucky**, merely prepared, then trips over a shell and lands on a chest of gold, **lucky** again."],"减":["to decrease","{James Bond} is locked in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, with *icicles* lowering from the ceiling and a villain's voice counting down. Unruffled, he takes out a shaker of *salt* from Q and shakes it, never stirs it. The icicles begin **to decrease**, drip by drip, the countdown begins **to decrease** too, and he walks out remarking that it was a rather cold reception."],"编":["to weave","{Batman} crouches in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and loads his grappling gun with a long *silk thread*, firing it back and forth across an old *nameboard* **to weave** a giant net shaped like a bat. It catches one pigeon, and he interrogates it gruffly. Then, brooding, he stays out all night **to weave** himself a second cape."],"楚":["clear","{Charlie Brown} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a tangled *grove* has swallowed his kite, and sighs good grief. He rolls out a white *bolt of cloth* and wipes the mist off every leaf until the view is finally **clear**. Now he can see the tree eating his kite, and a second kite behind it, and it is **clear** that he will never win."],"肯":["to be willing","{Kermit} flails into the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, begging for a volunteer for the ghost train, but a *stop sign* blocks the way and nobody seems **to be willing**. A paper *moon* on a string swings down and nudges him, and the whole cast stares at him. He gulps, grabs his banjo, screams Yaaay and hops in, the only frog ever known **to be willing**."],"测":["to measure","{Cookie Monster} thunders into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, where a fat *rulebook* orders him **to measure** a puddle of *water drops*. Me want cookie, he roars, and decides **to measure** it in cookies, but he has none, so he eats the ruler. Then he eats the rulebook, in a great spray of crumbs, and declares the puddle exactly one burp long."],"败":["to defeat","{Batman} crashes through the window of the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, cape spread, facing an army of crabs, each armoured in a *shell*, led by a crab waving a tiny *cane*. He means **to defeat** them all. A batarang whirls round the walls and tips each one onto its back, a smoke pellet does the rest, and he growls that it was too easy **to defeat** them, then broods about it."],"屋":["house","{Walter White} stands in {Front} of the {Pool} with a beaker and a proud smile, growing sugar crystals for his class. The crystals spread and spread into a glittering *cottage* with a chimney and a doorbell, a real **house**. He adjusts his glasses, raps on the door and announces that he is the one who knocks, and the **house** knocks back."],"跑":["to run","{Pikachu} scampers into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where a *parcel* suddenly sprouts a *kicking foot*, boots him in the shin and begins **to run**. He yells Pika and fires a Thunderbolt, but the sparks only charge it up, and now he has **to run** twice as fast, round and round the stairs. It bursts open at last, and a Poké Ball pops out and catches him."],"梦":["dream","{Mario} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, in a misty *grove* under a *dusk moon*, and tumbles into a **dream**. He stomps on clouds, head-butts the stars for coins, and rides a warp pipe through a monkey's hat, shouting Wahoo. He wakes up in his red cap, scratches his moustache, and finds a coin still in his hand, so was it a **dream** at all?"],"散":["to scatter","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} in the middle of a speech about justice, and hurls her tiara at a sack of *scattered seeds*. It bursts, and the seeds are enough **to scatter** the guests, shrieking, as they bounce into the soup. She is so sorry that she wails, and that one loud wail is enough **to scatter** all the pigeons too."],"温":["warm","{Walter White} stands in {Front} of the {Funfair} on a freezing night with his class, holding a *warm bowl* of quicklime and a pipette. Each measured drip of *water drops* makes it hotter, and he lectures proudly on heat and reactions as the steam rolls out. The dodgems sigh, the frozen clown thaws, and the whole funfair glows **warm**, so **warm** that the students take off their scarves."],"困":["trapped","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} and sees a *trapped tree* in a box, sobbing leaves. He leaps in to rescue it with a heroic Yaaay, and the lid snaps shut, so now they are both **trapped**. He flails, he plays the banjo for help, he yells for a stagehand, and hours later he is still **trapped**, losing at cards to a tree."],"剑":["sword","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and faces an *assembly* of bankers, each one brandishing a *standing knife*. Unruffled, he clicks a pen from Q that does one absurd thing: it telescopes into a long silver **sword**. He slices their ties off with a flick, buttons his tuxedo, sheathes the **sword** in his top pocket and remarks that the meeting is adjourned."],"渐":["gradually","{James Bond} sits tied to a *chopping block* in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, as *water drops* fall one at a time onto the ropes. He does not panic; the watch from Q does nothing but tick. **Gradually** the knots go soft, and **gradually** the villain gets bored and leaves, and Bond stands up, tuxedo uncreased, and asks who ordered the shaken drink."],"封":["to seal","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Jungle} with a heavy *jade tablet*, determined to shut the Ring away in a stone box and **to seal** it for good. He presses his *thumb* into hot red wax, but the Ring whispers and his hand shakes. Loyal Sam takes his other hand, and together, weary to the bone, they manage **to seal** the lid, then walk on."],"救":["to save","{James Bond} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel}, where a cat is drowning in a sink. He extends a *cane* from Q, hooks it out with one flick, and wraps it in a *fur coat*, for he has time **to save** a cat before saving the world. The cat purrs, calls forty friends, and they all fall in, so he has **to save** them too, unruffled."],"贵":["expensive","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and frowns at the bar of soap, whose *price tag* reads one million gold. Very **expensive**, he grumbles, and taps it with his staff to spell the number lower. The spell backfires in a shower of fireworks, adding three more noughts, and now even the soap is too **expensive** to look at, so he washes in pipe smoke."],"枪":["gun","{Chewbacca} roars in a temper in {Front} of the {Stadium}, rips a *tree* out of the ground and hurls it through the wall of a *barn*. Out falls an old rusty **gun**, and being very good at fixing things, he takes it apart with his huge hairy paws and rebuilds it. He fires the **gun** at the sky, bang, confetti everywhere, and the crowd roars back."],"缺":["to lack","{Chewbacca} crouches in {Front} of the {Ice Rink} fixing his ship, which seems **to lack** a valve. He roars for spare parts, and all he finds in the box is a *clay jar* with a chunk missing and an *archer's ring* that fits nothing. He growls, rips the box apart in a temper, and finds that the whole ship seems **to lack** everything."],"楼":["building","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Boathouse}, up a *tree* wearing a *tall bun* of braided hair, because a relic is hidden at the top. The bun keeps growing under her hands, storey after storey, until it is a whole **building** with windows and lifts. She swings from ledge to ledge, ponytail flying, and reaches the summit of the **building** to find a duck renting the top floor."],"县":["county","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} looking for some peace, shoves a banker aside with his *elbow* and climbs a *stepladder* to find a quiet spot. From the top he sees the whole **county**, and Donkey is in every field of it, talking. He takes a deep breath and roars so loud that the whole **county** hears, get out of my swamp."],"尚":["still","{Sherlock} climbs from the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} up into a dusty *attic* and inspects it through his magnifying glass. Elementary, he tells Watson: the teacup is **still** warm, the pipe smoke **still** hangs in the air, so the burglar is **still** here. He smugly points his violin bow behind Watson, where a man has been standing very **still** all along."],"毫":["tiny bit","{Homer} shuffles {Inside} the {Tower} with his latest dim scheme: one strand of *fur* glued to his bald head, as a full new hairdo. It covers only a **tiny bit**, D'oh. To cheer himself up he promises to eat just a **tiny bit** of doughnut, and he sighs Mmm, one crumb after another, until the box is empty and the fur has fallen in the icing."],"移":["to move","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Beach} with a *grain stalk* in his mouth and a plan **to move** the entire place. He licks up one tongueful of sand, trots to the next bay and lays it as an egg, over and over, for *many moons*. The crabs follow in a long line, and then he turns his tongue on the sea, ready **to move** that too."],"娘":["mother","{Naruto} charges {Inside} the {Stadium}, loud and orange, and a kind *woman* holds out a *good meal*, wiping his nose as if she were his **mother**. He has never had one, and he never gives up on a good thing, so he makes a hundred shadow clones. Every clone lines up for ramen and a hug, and she scolds them all, a true **mother**, until they cry."],"朋":["friend","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Jungle} arm in arm with his two *buddies*, a monkey and a parrot, his cheeks sparking with joy. A tiger comes along and asks to be a **friend**, and he says Pika and hugs it, with a small Thunderbolt by accident. The tiger stands there smoking with every hair on end, then grins, a **friend** for life."],"画":["to draw","{Homer} lazes in the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park}, too comfortable to get up for a snack, and has a dim scheme **to draw** one instead. He scribbles a doughnut on a *plank* with a crayon, sighs Mmm, bites it and yells D'oh as a splinter hits his tongue. Undeterred, he decides **to draw** a softer one, and bites that too."],"班":["class","{Batman} stands in the shadows in {Front} of the {Mansion} and growls at his first **class** of small, frightened children, who are learning to be detectives. He holds up *twin jades* and demands to know which is fake, then scans them from his utility belt. Nobody answers, so he glides off the balcony to show how it is done, and the whole **class** applauds, hanging upside down."],"智":["wisdom","The {Joker} bounces into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and meets a *sage* polishing the *sun* with his beard. He asks for a drop of **wisdom** and holds out his squirting flower, grinning hugely. The sage calmly turns the flower around with one finger, and it squirts the Joker in the eye, which is **wisdom**, and he cackles until the bees fall over."],"亦":["also","{Yoshi} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, and a *sweating man* starts copying everything he does. Yoshi flutter-jumps, and the man **also** flaps his legs in mid-air. Yoshi sticks out his long tongue and licks a crab, and the man **also** licks a crab. Then Yoshi calmly lays an egg, and the poor man, red and dripping, **also** stares hopefully at the floor."],"耳":["ear","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Basement} of the {Car Park} and finds a giant *ear* across three parking spaces, listening to every engine. At last, someone who will hear him, so he whispers hello into the **ear**, and drifts right through it by accident. The **ear** jumps in fright, hits the ceiling and scuttles away, and Casper sighs, friendless again."],"恩":["kindness","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Funfair}, where everyone runs from him except one shivering clown, and he gives the clown a *warm hug*, cold as he is. Nobody has shown the clown such **kindness**, so he hands out free balloons to every child. The **kindness** spreads to the carousel horses, who nuzzle each other, and Casper finally has a friend."],"短":["short","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond}, ignites his red lightsaber and trims an *arrow* until it is **short**. He Force-lifts a *bean* and slices that too, breathing with satisfaction. The swans stretch their long necks and hiss, so he booms his disapproval, whirls the blade, and finds that his own cape is now rather **short**."],"掌":["palm","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where a giant *palm* sticks up through the floor, and he cackles, hiding a joy buzzer in his own **palm**. He shakes one huge finger and, bzzzt, the giant hand jumps and flings him at the ceiling. It catches him, tickles him in its **palm**, and high-fives a passing plane, trick playing cards flying everywhere."],"恐":["afraid","{Kermit} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} with his arms already flailing, a metal *brace* clamped round his trembling *heart*. He is **afraid** of the dark, of the crabs, of the show tonight, and he lets out a thin Yaaay. The brace pops off and hits a crab, who runs away, also **afraid**, and Kermit faints with a clatter of banjo."],"遗":["to leave behind","{Yoshi} trots {Inside} the {Beach} down a sandy *road*, swallowing everything he passes, and each thing he has no choice but **to leave behind** as an egg. Out plop his sandals, a towel, and even a *price tag*, in a long speckled trail. He flutter-jumps on without a backward look, and the seagulls open a shop selling all he happens **to leave behind**."],"固":["solid","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, raises his staff over a rickety *fence* round an *antique* vase, and thunders You shall not pass. The spell turns the fence to **solid** stone in a flash of light. Swimmers bounce off it and a shark bumps it, but the wall stays **solid**, and Gandalf looks smug, until he realises his hat is on the wrong side."],"席":["seat","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Beach}, spreads his *towel* on the hot sand as his own private **seat**, and roars at everyone to stay away. The sunbathers flee, and at last he is alone in his swamp of peace. Then Donkey trots up, flops down on the same towel and will not shut up, and Shrek's only remaining **seat** is a very small onion."],"松":["loose","{Sailor Moon} twirls in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and begins her transformation, but her ribbons come **loose** and tangle round a *tree* in the *town square*. She strikes a pose, makes a speech about justice, and walks off, dragging the tree behind her. Luna the cat sighs, Sailor Moon trips and wails loudly, and even her pigtails are now **loose**."],"秘":["secret","{Mario} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and head-butts the wall, because he knows every level has a **secret**. A *grain stalk* bends like a lever and a tile slides open, showing a *pinned heart* and a green warp pipe nobody has ever found. He grabs the heart with a Wahoo and dives in, and he will never tell anyone the **secret**."],"谢":["to thank","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and gets rescued from a yeti by a dashing *archer*, which he hates. Donkey will not shut up, nagging him **to thank** the man, so Shrek growls and roars and goes green in the face. At last a *small speech bubble* squeezes out of him, the size of a pea, because it pains an ogre **to thank** anyone."],"鲁":["crass","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and solves an ancient puzzle of a carved *fish* holding up a golden *sun*. The stone fish comes to life, burps, spits at the wall and wipes its fins on her ponytail, thoroughly **crass**. She backflips away with the relic, while it yells rude things after her, the most **crass** guardian in any tomb."],"遇":["to meet","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} along a painted *road*, and happens **to meet** a *monkey* in a top hat. He has only one way to greet anyone: out comes the tongue, gulp, and he lays the monkey as an egg. It hatches, the monkey bows politely with its hat on crooked, and Yoshi goes on **to meet** a mummy the same way."],"康":["healthy","{Kermit} hops in {Front} of the {Hangar} and gives up flies for a bowl of *rice husk*, because he wants to be **healthy**. Three bites later he flexes his green arms, leaps over a plane and lifts another one, screaming Yaaay. All the pilots eat husks too, and he sighs, flailing happily, that it's not easy being **healthy**."],"虑":["to consider","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and lands on an ancient floor puzzle: one wrong tile frees a stone *tiger*, another wakes a golden *heart* pounding in the wall. Hanging from a pipe by one hand, ponytail swinging, she stops to **consider** every tile. The *tiger* yawns and the heart thumps faster, and still she goes on, calmly, to **consider** her next jump."],"幸":["lucky","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} to be left alone, and an angry villager hurls a *pitchfork* after him. It sinks into a heap of swamp *soil* on the sink, a whisker from his ear. Donkey will not shut up about how **lucky** he is, so Shrek digs an onion out of the heap, roars, and admits he is one **lucky** ogre."],"均":["even","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Dunes} and clicks a gadget from Q that does one absurd thing: it makes everything **even**. Piles of *soil* shoot apart into perfect *even shares*, and every dune sinks to exactly the same height. 'Shaken,' says Bond, unruffled, gazing along the flattened sand, 'but perfectly **even**.'"],"销":["to sell off","{Shrek} drags his whole swamp onto the pavement in {Front} of the {Cat Café} to **sell off**, so that he can finally be alone. Donkey screams the prices nonstop, *gold coins* rain into a bucket, and a cat pays for a *portrait* of an onion. When everything is **sold off**, Shrek roars with joy, then realises he now has nowhere to live."],"钟":["clock","The {Joker} wheels a giant **clock** to the water in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, its face painted as a *bullseye* and its hands made of trick playing cards. Whenever it strikes, *gold coins* squirt from the centre and a flower sprays whoever checks the time. He cackles as the **clock** chimes thirteen and every duck in the place is late for nothing."],"诗":["poem","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Beehive}, magnifying glass trained on one crumb of honey, and deduces that the bees are writing a **poem**. A *small speech bubble* floats from each bee to a tiny wax *temple*, stacking up in verses. 'Elementary, Watson: fourteen lines, and everything rhymes with buzz,' he says smugly, and plays the **poem** on his violin."],"藏":["to hide","{Cookie Monster} bursts {Inside} the {Hangar}, where someone has tried to **hide** every cookie in a steel *vault* under a heap of *grass*. 'Me know where you **hide** them!' he booms, eating the grass, the door and the vault in a spray of crumbs. Then, horrified by the empty shelves, he tries to **hide** his huge blue self behind one crumb."],"赶":["to hurry","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} exactly when he means to, and finds a *runner* dawdling round a *drying rack* of socks. 'You are late, **hurry**!' he snaps, and a spell turns every sock into a firework that chases the poor man's heels. 'A wizard never has to **hurry**,' he adds, lighting his pipe, as the runner blurs past."],"剧":["play","{James Bond} adjusts his bow tie in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and finds he has walked into a **play**, with an audience packed among the sinks. Q's *standing knife* pops up and cuts a rope, and a painted *house* of scenery falls around him, his head passing neatly through its window. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, unruffled, and the **play** runs for ten years."],"票":["ticket","{Pikachu} sparks into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} to find a queue of cats, each pawing at a broken *ticket* machine. 'Pika!' A Thunderbolt from his cheeks jolts it awake, and **ticket** after singed **ticket** spits out and flutters onto every paw. The last one lands on his nose, so a cat punches a hole in it and pops him back into his Poké Ball."],"损":["to harm","{Sailor Moon} spins through her long sparkly transformation in the {Basement} of the {Casino}, and her clumsy tiara ricochets off every pipe. A *helping hand* reaches up to save her and gets bonked, and then an *employee* takes one on the nose. 'I would never **harm** the innocent!' she wails, crying loudly, while Luna adds up the **harm**: one bent wand, one sore hand, one dented waistcoat."],"忽":["suddenly","{Homer} naps with a doughnut on his belly in {Front} of the {Pool}, under a drooping *pennant*. **Suddenly** the flag snaps straight and whacks his ear, and his *heart* jumps like a startled frog. 'D'oh!' he yelps, and **suddenly** the doughnut has rolled into the water, and just as **suddenly** he is fast asleep again, drooling."],"巨":["huge","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} with a tiny *set square* from Q, which does one absurd thing: press the button and it turns **huge**. It shoots out into a **huge** triangle of steel, jamming the door and lifting him to the ceiling. 'A **huge** improvement,' says Bond, unruffled, straightening his cuffs as he slides down the long side."],"炮":["cannon","{Pikachu} finds a rusty **cannon** in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, standing beside a small *campfire* with a mystery *parcel* stuffed down its barrel. 'Pika!' A single cheek spark lights the fuse, the **cannon** booms, and the parcel blasts through the wall with him clinging on, yellow ears flapping. It lands miles away, right beside a trainer, and he gets caught."],"旧":["old","{James Bond} stops in the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel}, where Q's latest gadget, a telescopic *pole* with a tiny *sun* on its tip, does one absurd thing: whatever it shines on turns **old**. The taps rust, the backpackers sprout grey beards and the soap wrinkles. 'Shaken, not stirred, and rather **old**,' says Bond, unruffled, inspecting his new eyebrows."],"端":["end","{Darth Vader} stands on a *podium* in {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, breathing loudly, and with the Force lifts a *sprout tip* out of the mud, pinching it by its very **end**. The little plant trembles in the air. 'This,' he booms at the swans in deep disapproval, 'is the **end** of your honking.' Silence falls, and one swan bows its long neck."],"探":["to explore","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and, baffled by civilisation, sets out to **explore** it. A *helping hand* lowers him to the plughole, which he takes for a *deep cave*, and he gives his jungle yell down it to hear the echo. Then he goes on to **explore** a toothbrush, a loofah and, with grave suspicion, the taps."],"湖":["lake","{Homer} wanders {Inside} the {Pool} with a dim scheme: he plugs the drains so the *water drops* gather into his own private **lake**, stocked with doughnuts. A huge catfish surfaces, *whiskers* twitching, and steals the first one. 'D'oh!' he cries, toppling in, and his **lake** rises so high that the swimmers need a boat."],"录":["to record","{Lara Croft} climbs out of a drain in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, clutching an ancient *logbook* from a flooded tomb. A trap springs and a boulder of soap comes rolling; she backflips over it and still pauses to **record** the date. Ponytail dripping, she dodges the shampoo darts, then goes on to **record** each one in neat columns."],"叶":["leaf","{Yoshi} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} as a red *cross* swings open on the medicine cabinet and a single **leaf** drifts out. His tongue shoots from his *mouth* and snatches it: gulp, strain, plop, and he lays a green egg. It cracks and out flutters another **leaf**, so 'Yoshi!' he cheers and does it again until the floor is ankle deep."],"春":["spring","{Charlie Brown} sighs in {Front} of the {Casino} on the first day of *springtime*, clutching a brand new kite. All around him **spring** arrives: buds burst, lambs leap, and a tree that grew its blossoms only this morning eats the kite. 'Good grief,' he says, gloomy in his zigzag shirt, as Snoopy dances past. Another **spring**, another kite."],"乡":["countryside","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Stadium} until the noisy crowd flees, then tears one long *slash* in the car park with a green fingernail. Out through it rolls the **countryside**: mud, onions, cows, a quiet little swamp. 'Finally,' he grunts, lying down in the **countryside** he always wanted, as Donkey trots up, still talking."],"附":["to attach","{Frodo} drags his bare hairy feet over a *hillside* of damp towels into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, weary from the long walk, and a *cashier* holds out her hand for the entry fee. The Ring slides off its chain, trying to **attach** itself to her finger. Frodo sighs: it will **attach** itself to anyone, and now loyal Sam is stuck to her too."],"吸":["to breathe in","{Shrek} plants himself in {Front} of the {Beach}, opens his huge *mouth* and starts to **breathe in**, because a *chaser* is sprinting up to evict him. Onions, umbrellas and a shrieking Donkey all slide towards him. He **breathes in** once more, the sea backs away, and the chaser is left running on the spot in mid-air."],"予":["to give","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a grand stone *offering* sits on a plinth waiting for a god. His tongue whips out, gulp, and the whole thing is gone. Guilty, he flutters up to the curator, strains and lays a spotted egg: he can only **give** what he has swallowed. 'Yoshi!' he chirps, and goes on to **give** an egg to everyone."],"礼":["gift","{Lara Croft} drops on a rope into the {Basement} of the {Beach}, where a *small altar* holds a **gift** tied with ribbon. She lifts it, the trap springs, and a boulder comes rolling; she jumps onto a single ancient *ski* and rides it out, ponytail flying. Up in the sunlight she unwraps the **gift**: another, smaller boulder, with a card."],"港":["harbour","{Gandalf} strides into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and raps his staff on the floor, muttering a spell. Up rise *water drops* in their thousands, flooding a narrow *alley* between the crates until it becomes a **harbour**, with gulls and a fireworks lighthouse. 'You shall not pass!' he snaps at a ship too big for it, then, cranky, lets it moor in his **harbour** for one biscuit."],"雨":["rain","{Yoshi} is sitting in the {Basement} of the {Museum} when *rain* starts falling through the ceiling onto the mummies. His tongue catches every drop until his belly swells like a blimp. 'Yoshi!' He strains and lays one wobbly egg, which cracks and lets out even more **rain**, so he flutter jumps over the puddles, gulping and laying, and the **rain** never ends."],"呀":["ah","{Yoshi} lounges on the {Roof} of the {Spa} when his long tongue flicks out of his *mouth* and comes back with a tiny *fang* stuck on its tip. '**Ah**!' he yelps, gulping it down. Out it comes as an egg, which hatches and nips his tail, and '**Ah**!' he says again, flutter jumping in circles through the steam."],"板":["board","{Batman} glides into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, where a *rebel* is sawing up a *tree* to nail one **board** across the Batcave door. A grappling hook yanks the **board** free and, growling, he pulls a gadget from his utility belt that nails it over the rebel's escape hatch instead. Then he stands in the dark and broods at it all night."],"庭":["courtyard","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, baffled to find a paved *courtyard* where the canvas should be and a garden *shed* in one corner. He gives his jungle yell and apes pour over the ropes to plant trees all over the **courtyard**. The shed door slams in alarm, and by the final bell the **courtyard** is jungle and the referee is being groomed."],"妇":["woman","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} to wash his hairy feet, and a kind old *woman* waves a *comb* at his toes. Mortified, he slips on the Ring to vanish. The **woman** is not fooled and combs the invisible feet anyway, and Sam whispers that this **woman** is the scariest thing since Mordor."],"归":["to return","{Gandalf} blazes back into view in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, robes gone white, for he always manages to **return** exactly when he means to. He waves a magic *comb*, and every lost hat, sock and umbrella in the world starts to **return** too, whirling through the air to its owner. Everyone applauds, and he grumbles about the queue."],"睛":["eyeball","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} as Q hands him a gadget: a glass **eyeball** wearing a small wig of *moss*. It does one absurd thing, which is roll after villains and wink at them. Its *eye* swivels, the moss bristles, and it bounces away over the ropes. 'I'll keep an **eyeball** out,' says Bond, unruffled."],"饭":["meal","{Frodo} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} after walking for months, so hungry he could weep, and lays out a **meal** on the sink. A *rebel* dashes in and grabs the *side dish*, so Frodo slips on the Ring and steals it back unseen. Sam adds the potatoes, and they eat the best **meal** of the whole quest sitting on a towel."],"额":["forehead","{Casper} floats through the wall {Inside} the {Hut}, hoping for a friend, and finds a sleeping *guest* with a *page* of a book lying on his **forehead**. Invisible and gentle, Casper lifts the page to say hello, and one cold finger brushes the **forehead**. The guest wakes screaming and bolts through the door, the page still flapping behind him, and Casper sighs."],"含":["to hold in the mouth","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Mansion} with a whole *clock* stuffed in his *mouth*, thinking it's a doughnut. \"Mmm…\" Told he must **hold in the mouth** whatever he can't swallow, he clamps his lips as it ticks. At midnight it chimes, his teeth rattle, and he mumbles \"D'oh!\" but keeps on trying to **hold in the mouth** that clanging clock."],"顺":["to follow","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} and deduces everything from one wet *page* on the floor. 'Elementary, Watson: it floated down this *river*, and we must **follow** it.' Smugly he wades off along the stream from the burst tap, with poor Watson obliged to **follow** him all the way to the card tables."],"输":["to lose","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Pool}, racing Watson, having deduced from one crumb of bark that a *dugout canoe* on a *cart* must win. For once he is wrong: the wheels drop off, Watson strolls past, and the great detective manages to **lose**. Scarlet, he demands to know how anyone can **lose** so logically, and plays his violin very sadly."],"摇":["to shake","{Yoshi} flutter jumps {Inside} the {Tower}, gulps down a *helping hand* that came to pat him, and starts to **shake** all over, belly wobbling and walls rattling. He lays an egg, and the egg starts to **shake** too, jittering down the stairs. It hatches, the hand leaps out and rattles him by the tail, and 'Yoshi!' echoes through the stones."],"招":["to recruit","The {Joker} sets up a table in {Front} of the {Tower} to **recruit** clowns, grinning hugely while a *town crier* bellows the jobs through a squirting horn. A *helping hand* on a spring shoots out and yanks passers-by to the desk, and the pen sprays them purple as they sign. Cackling, he goes on to **recruit** the whole town, crier included."],"婚":["marriage","{Homer} stands in {Front} of the {Casino} at *twilight*, doughnut in hand, proposing **marriage** to a *woman* at the chapel window. He has forgotten the ring, so his dim scheme is to use the doughnut instead. 'Mmm,' he says, and eats it mid-vow. 'D'oh!' Luckily she laughs, and the **marriage** is sealed with a single sprinkle."],"脱":["to take off","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Warehouse} under the *moon*, where a *money changer* swaps him a stiff suit for one coconut. Baffled by civilisation, he gives his jungle yell and tries to **take off** the jacket, then the socks. The moon blushes as he **takes off** the last button with his teeth and swings away in his loincloth."],"补":["to patch","{Batman} drops into the {Basement} of the {Pool} clutching a torn *shirt* and brooding over it. From his utility belt comes a gadget for everything, this time a *fortune stick* that shoots thread and foresees each hole before it happens. He swings it and **patches** the shirt, then hears a drip in the wall and, growling, **patches** that too."],"谓":["to say","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and pours fizzing baking soda into a model *stomach* for his chemistry class. A *small speech bubble* rises from it with every burp. 'Precise science,' he says proudly: 'the stomach will now **say** what it ate.' It bubbles out 'vinegar', and Walter nods, for whatever the beaker has to **say**, he believes."],"督":["to supervise","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Pool}, breathing loudly, to **supervise** someone's *uncle* scrubbing the tiles. A giant *eye* hovers at his command, held up by the Force, and follows each stroke of the sponge. 'I find your scrubbing disturbing,' he booms. The uncle scrubs faster, and Vader sighs: nobody else can **supervise** quite so heavily."],"毒":["poison","{Darth Vader} stalks {Inside} the {Pool} and his breathing speeds up: somebody has spilled **poison** into the water. A *mother* points at a green *seedling top* dripping purple by the shallow end. He lifts it out with the Force, chokes the leaky bottle beside it until it coughs, and booms that **poison** disappoints him. The mother offers him a towel."],"油":["oil","{Yoshi} skids {Inside} the {Boathouse} on a slick of **oil** that has crept in from a *sprouting field*, with *water drops* beading on top. One long lick of his tongue gets the lot, and he lays an egg so slippery that it shoots across the floor and into a rowing boat. 'Yoshi!' he yells, flutter jumping after it with **oil** dripping off his chin."],"疗":["to cure","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Cat Café} with an ancient relic said to **cure** anything, and two boulders roll in after her. On a *sickbed* among the cats lies a *swaddled baby* with hiccups. She leaps the boulders, climbs the cushions and sets the relic on the blanket; the hiccups stop at once, and every sneezing cat lines up to be **cured**."],"旅":["to travel","{Lara Croft} climbs down into the {Basement} of the {Museum} and stands on a stone *square* in a puzzle of ancient tiles. It drops and whisks her off, and she begins to **travel**: through a jungle, over Peru, past an ice temple with a boulder behind her. She lands back home, ponytail askew, because only Lara would **travel** by floor tile."],"泽":["pond","{Zorro} leaps {Inside} the {Hut} on a swinging lamp and slashes a Z in the wall, and *water drops* come trickling out of it. They spread across the floor into a dark little **pond**. His black horse paddles in, Zorro bows to a frog, and with one more Z carved across the surface of the **pond** he vanishes, laughing."],"材":["material","{Cookie Monster} stomps deep {Inside} the {Island} looking for building **material** for a giant cookie jar. He fells a *tree*, and a *green shoot* pops up beside it. 'Me need **material**!' he howls, googly eyes rolling, then bites the tree, bites the shoot and sprays crumbs everywhere, so now he has no wood and a jar made of crumbs."],"灭":["to put out","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a yeti has lit a *campfire* on the tiles. 'Wahoo!' He leaps onto a *plank* and stomps it down over the flames to **put out** the blaze, and a coin pops up. One spark still flickers, so he stomps again to **put out** that too, moustache only slightly singed."],"逐":["to chase","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Pool}, driving a greased *pig* up a fake *road* painted across the water. He gives **chase** in purple flippers, squirting his flower at its curly tail. Then the pig spins round with the flower in its snout and starts to **chase** him back the other way, all the way to the deep end."],"莫":["do not","{Mario} bursts from a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, where a sign says **do not** jump on the pretty *sunset* painted on the wall. His moustache twitches, and 'Wahoo!', he stomps it; a coin pops out and the room goes dark. A tiny Toad shakes his head and squeaks **do not**, as Mario eyes the next sign."],"笔":["writing brush","{Batman} glides into the {Basement} of the {Beach}, pulls a length of *bamboo* from his utility belt and ties a tuft of bat *fur* to one end. He has made a **writing brush**, and naturally it is also a gadget: he hurls it like a batarang and it signs his name across the dark wall. Nobody else could brood so hard over a **writing brush**."],"亡":["to die","{Walter White} stands {Inside} the {Hangar} with his chemistry class, showing how a flame will **die** without oxygen. He lowers a glass over a candle, it flickers out, and a tiny *tombstone* pops up on the bench. 'Precise science,' he says proudly, lifting his black hat. Then the classroom's sad fern, which he forgot to water, decides to **die** as well."],"鲜":["fresh","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} with a *fish* that leaps and slaps him, so **fresh** it is still trying to swim. A *sheep* takes one sniff of the sea air on it and faints. Shrek roars in disgust, since he likes his supper swampy, while Donkey will not stop shouting how **fresh**, how very **fresh**, it all is."],"词":["word","{Cookie Monster} bursts {Inside} the {Beehive}, and a *small speech bubble* floats out of the queen *boss* with a single **word** in it: buzz. He eats it. 'Me want **word**!' he shouts, googly eyes rolling, so out comes another, and he gobbles that too, spraying crumbs of letters everywhere until the boss is left speechless."],"圣":["sage","{Sherlock} strides through the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} with Watson trailing and finds a *saint* sitting on a stump, halo shining. From one crumb on the robe he deduces the man's whole life, but the old **sage** calmly deduces right back, down to Sherlock's breakfast. 'Elementary,' the old man murmurs, and Sherlock, smug no longer, bows to the greater **sage**."],"择":["to choose","{Zorro} vaults {Inside} the {Hut} with his rapier drawn and finds a *helping hand* offering him two masks, then three, then forty. He must **choose**. Dashing as ever, he slashes a Z in one and it falls apart, slashes the next, and on it goes. Forced at last to **choose**, he picks a black one, identical to the rest, and vanishes laughing."],"寻":["to search","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Dunes} to **search** for his lost onion, raking the sand with a huge *comb*. Every grain gets squashed under his green *thumb* for inspection, while Donkey keeps suggesting places it obviously is not. He roars, and keeps up the **search** until sunset, when he finds it sitting right on Donkey's head."],"厂":["factory","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and finds a **factory** carved into a *cliff*, turning out footballs by the thousand. He takes a long run at the very first one, and a steel lever whips it away. 'Good grief,' he says, flat on his back, while the whole **factory** hoots at him and Snoopy runs the conveyor belt."],"睡":["to sleep","{Sherlock} slumps in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and deduces, from one crumb on his collar, that he has had no **sleep** for nine days. A *weeping willow* in a pot droops over him and one *eye* slides shut, while the other stays open to deduce some more. 'Elementary, Watson,' he yawns, and slips down to **sleep** beneath the leaves, violin on his chest."],"博":["extensive","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Fort} and, being a detective, unrolls a *proclamation* that runs for miles, listing every clue he has ever found. A red *cross* marks each entry. His files are **extensive**, his gadgets are too, and he reads it all out gruffly until dawn, when the guards beg him to stop, for his research is far too **extensive**."],"勒":["to rein in","{Lara Croft} clings to the pipes in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} as a stone horse, freed by an ancient trap, gallops past. She lassoes it with a strip of *rawhide* and, with one *strong arm*, hauls hard to **rein in** the statue, ponytail whipping. It drags her twice round the sink before she manages to **rein in** the beast, and then the tap."],"烟":["smoke","{Yoshi} waddles up in {Front} of the {Mansion}, where a *campfire* has caught one corner of a *sleeping mat* and tall grey **smoke** is curling up. Slurp: his tongue swallows the fire, the mat and all. His ears begin to steam, and he lays an egg with **smoke** pouring through its cracks, which he flutter jumps away from, coughing 'Yoshi!'"],"授":["to teach","{Sherlock} perches on the sink in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} to **teach** Watson how to deduce, smugly waving his pipe. A *helping hand* passes him a single crumb in a solemn *handover*. 'Observe: this reveals a left-handed rower with a cat.' Watson scribbles it all down, and Sherlock, delighted with himself, goes on to **teach** him the violin as well."],"诺":["to promise","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and shouts a **promise** in a *small speech bubble*: he will be the greatest ninja ever, no going back. With a poof a *lookalike* appears, a shadow clone, then dozens more in orange, each yelling the same **promise** louder than the last, until the mirrors shake and the taps run ramen."],"伦":["human relations","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Casino} and finds an ancient relic: a *neat stack* of stone tablets listing the rules of **human relations**. A *standing person* is arguing nearby with a cousin, so she scales the stack and reads aloud about thanking your aunt. The first rule sets off a rolling boulder; **human relations**, it turns out, were always a trap."],"岸":["shore","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and finds the tub has become a sea, with a tiny *mountain* and a sandy *shore*. He waves hello to a crab on the **shore**. It screams, the goats on the peak bolt, and everything runs away down the beach, leaving him all alone on the **shore**, only wanting a friend."],"奥":["mysterious","{Casper} turns invisible in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and drifts through a *maze* of shower curtains. Taps turn on by themselves and a **mysterious** voice whispers, 'Be my friend?' The visitors run off screaming. Casper is sad, and the place grows even more **mysterious**, because nobody ever finds out who left the kind little note on the mirror."],"唐":["Tang dynasty","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Hangar}, where a court from the **Tang dynasty** has set up shop, robes, poets and all, with heaps of *sugar* on silk cushions. Baffled by civilisation, he gives his jungle yell, and the apes charge in to gobble the lot. The poets sigh that the **Tang dynasty** has never seen such sticky manners."],"卖":["to sell","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, head-butts a block, and a whole *market stall* tumbles out, piled with mushrooms. 'Wahoo!' He tries to **sell** them to a passing Goomba, jumps on it out of habit, and a coin pops up. Goombas keep coming, coins keep popping, and soon he can **sell** the whole stall to himself."],"俄":["Russia","{Casper} floats {Inside} the {Hut}, and through the window lies snowy **Russia**, all onion domes and birch trees. He drifts out to say hello to a *standing person* in a fur hat and a *spearman* on guard. They yell, drop everything and flee over the ice, so he wanders sadly across the whole of **Russia** looking for just one friend."],"炸":["to explode","The {Joker} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} with a huge grin and lights a small *campfire* beneath a *jack-in-the-box*. It ticks, it rattles, and then the towels **explode** into confetti and the taps **explode** into streamers. The jack springs up cackling along with him, and everyone is left glittering and squirted by a flower."],"载":["to carry","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, where his black horse refuses to walk on wet tiles. He slashes a Z on a *cart*, rigs a *lance* as its pole, and heaves until it can **carry** the horse. Puffed but dashing, he hauls it out to the waves, and the cart goes on to **carry** the horse home while he vanishes laughing."],"洛":["Luo River","{Lara Croft} dives through a drain in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and surfaces in the **Luo River**, a long yellow ribbon sliding past an old *riverbank*. Ponytail dripping, she scales the bank to a carved relic, a boulder starts to roll, and she leaps back into the **Luo River** and floats away, holding her prize high."],"健":["healthy","{James Bond} checks his cufflinks in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} as a tired *standing person* and a wheezing *builder* shuffle in. Q's wristwatch does one absurd thing: it squirts vitamins. At once they glow a **healthy** pink and start doing squats by the sink. 'Shaken, not stirred, and perfectly **healthy**,' says Bond, unruffled, ordering a carrot juice."],"堂":["hall","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Hangar} and lands in a grand *main hall* full of chandeliers, baffled by so much civilisation. He gives his jungle yell, and the echo comes back so loud that apes arrive from miles away. Soon this **hall** has vines on the pillars, and elephants are filing solemnly down the **hall** in search of the buffet."],"旁":["side","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Hangar} along a painted *roadside* and, being small and yellow, gets brushed to the **side** by every passing plane. 'Pika!' he squeaks, sparks crackling from both cheeks. One Thunderbolt knocks the next plane over to the other **side**, and he sits there looking pleased, tail twitching, while the pilots climb out to apologise."],"宫":["palace","{Gandalf} raps his staff in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and, with a mighty spell, a **palace** bursts up out of the water. A glittering *roof* rises first, carried on a giant stone *spine*, and fireworks burst from every window. 'You shall not pass,' he snaps at a wet duck on the doorstep, then settles, cranky as ever, on the steps of his **palace** with his pipe."],"喝":["to drink","{Homer} wakes in {Front} of the {Hut} with a dry *mouth* and a *question mark* floating over his bald head: what can he **drink**? His dim scheme is to lie under the garden hose and open wide, and it blasts him clean across the lawn. 'D'oh!' Finally he dunks a doughnut in a puddle and sips a **drink** of that. 'Mmm.'"],"借":["to borrow","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and, smooth as ever, asks a *standing person* if he might **borrow** a strip of *sun-dried meat*. It is for a gadget from Q that does one absurd thing: it turns jerky into a tiny parachute. Floating out of the window, he calls back, unruffled, 'I only **borrow**; Q will return it, in small pieces.'"],"君":["monarch","{James Bond} kneels in {Front} of the {Dunes}, tuxedo spotless, as a *lord* in a long wig announces that the **monarch** is arriving. Q's umbrella does one absurd thing: it springs open into a throne, just in time. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, unruffled, and the **monarch** sits down, hands him a secret mission and asks for a small drink, shaken."],"禁":["to forbid","{James Bond} strolls through the {Bathroom} of the {Inn}, swings open the mirror and finds behind it a *forbidden grove*. Signs spring up at every tree to **forbid** him: no walking, no tuxedos, no one-liners. Q's fountain pen does one absurd thing and rewrites them all to say 'Welcome'. 'They can **forbid** what they like,' he says, unruffled, strolling on."],"阴":["overcast","{Yoshi} sits in {Front} of the {Inn} in the last of the sun, then flicks out his long tongue and swallows a huge passing cloud. He lays it as a grey egg, which cracks, and the whole sky turns **overcast**, plunging the street into *shade*. 'Yoshi?' he asks, a little gloomy, as the day grows more **overcast** with every egg he lays."],"园":["garden","{Yoshi} wanders {Inside} the {Mint}, swallows a *yuan coin* and lays it as an egg, which sprouts a shoot. Delighted, he gulps down a whole *fence* and lays it again around the shoot, plank by plank, until a little **garden** stands among the money presses. 'Yoshi!' he cheers, flutter jumping over his **garden**, where the trees are starting to drip small change."],"谋":["to plan","{Mario} crouches {Inside} the {Boathouse} with a *plum* balanced on his red cap and a *small speech bubble* floating by his moustache: his **plan**. Step one, hit block. Step two, stomp things. Step three, 'Wahoo!' He head-butts a block, gets a coin, stomps the plum by mistake, and cheerfully declares that this too was the **plan**."],"宋":["Song dynasty","{Sailor Moon} twirls through a long sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, and her moon wand zaps the place back to the **Song dynasty**. A curly tiled *roof* flaps down like a hat and a bent *tree* springs up in a bowl among the scholars. She makes a speech about justice, trips on the bowl and cries loudly, and Luna sighs that the **Song dynasty** is unimpressed."],"避":["to avoid","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and hears a cheerful *pioneer* clomping along the *road* with a wagon, wanting a chat with everyone. Batman will do anything to **avoid** small talk: he fires his grappling hook, glides over the showers and vanishes mid-sentence. 'Hello?' calls the pioneer, and Batman, brooding in a locker, continues to **avoid** him."],"抓":["to grab","The {Joker} lurks in {Front} of the {Water Park} with a fake *helping hand* up his sleeve, offering handshakes. Whoever shakes it sees a plastic *talon* spring out and **grab** their hat, towel or ice cream, while he cackles, green hair flying. Then an inflatable flamingo makes a **grab** for him, and he gets squirted by his own flower."],"荣":["glory","{Robocop} clanks deep {Inside} the {Lagoon}, stiff and dripping, and politely arrests a blade of *grass* for loitering. His visor flashes directive four: seek **glory**. The frogs erupt in applause, and with his steel chest gleaming he stands to attention in pure **glory**, reading the grass its rights in a flat, heroic voice."],"姑":["aunt","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Pool} exactly when he means to, for his **aunt** has sent for him. She is a tiny *woman* who wields an *antique* umbrella and demands fireworks. Cranky, he mutters a spell, a rocket goes off and scorches her bonnet, and his **aunt** thwacks the great wizard smartly on his pointy hat."],"孙":["grandson","{Sailor Moon} strikes a pose in {Front} of the {Casino} to begin her speech about justice, when a small boy tugs her skirt: her *grandson*, visiting from the future in a tiny tiara. 'Grandma!' he says, and she cries loudly at the word. Luna explains that a **grandson** is a **grandson**, and he throws the tiara, exactly as clumsily as she does."],"逃":["to escape","{Tarzan} wakes {Inside} the {Tower}, locked up by civilisation and baffled by the door handle. A parrot drops a *cracked shell* on his head, the signal from his friends, and he answers with a jungle yell as monkeys pass a vine through the window. To **escape**, he swings out over the *road*, dodges the buses and **escapes** into the trees, thumping his chest."],"牙":["tooth","{Yoshi} licks his way {Inside} the {Spa} and snatches somebody's false *fang* off the counter with his long tongue. Gulp. He flutter jumps in a panic, lays an egg, and out pops one shining **tooth**, then another, until the hot tub is bobbing with every **tooth** in town, and Yoshi, who has none of his own, beams."],"束":["to bind","{Sherlock} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with a *bundle* of wet towels and deduces the thief from one knot. 'Elementary: a left-handed sailor.' To prove it he must **bind** everything the same way, so he ties up socks, mops and Watson, smug as ever. Watson, unable to move, notes that he has also managed to **bind** his pipe to the violin."],"跳":["to jump","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, where a *cracked shell* skitters under his *kicking foot* and a kitten springs out of it, hissing. He gives his jungle yell and has to **jump** for the curtain rail; then all the cats **jump** too, followed by the soap. He has a word with them in cat, and they agree to do this every morning."],"顶":["top","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, breathing loudly, and with the Force lifts a *nail* and a single *page* up towards the ceiling. He drives the nail through the very **top** of the page, at the highest spot in the room. Nobody else can reach the **top**, and he booms his disapproval at anyone who tries."],"玉":["jade","{Yoshi} tiptoes through the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and spots a green *jade gem* that looks exactly like a snack. Slurp goes the tongue, down goes the **jade**, and he lays an egg of solid **jade**, as green as he is. Alarms ring, and he flutter jumps past the guards, 'Yoshi!', leaving one glowing egg in the sink."],"镇":["to calm","The {Joker} lurks in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, where tourists are panicking over a spider, and he grins and offers to **calm** them down. One by one he drops *gold coins* into the sink, peering at each through a huge *magnifying glass*, until they stop and stare. Everyone is utterly **calm**, and then the last coin squirts them and he runs away cackling."],"雪":["snow","{Shrek} wants peace and quiet in the {Basement} of the {Ice Rink}, but a leak drips *rain* through the pipes, so he roars at it. The roar freezes it into **snow**, which piles up on his ears while Donkey will not shut up about how pretty it is. Grumpily he drags a huge *comb* through the drifts and shapes an onion out of **snow**."],"午":["noon","{Walter White} works in the {Basement} of the {Pool} with his chemistry class, grinding chalk with a *pestle* for an experiment that must finish at exactly **noon**. He grinds, the class watches, the clock ticks, and on the last stroke of twelve every beaker turns gold. Walter lifts his black hat, proud of such precise science, and announces it is **noon**."],"练":["to practise","{Lara Croft} strings a *silk thread* across the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and backflips over it, because a tomb raider must **practise**. She tumbles over it a hundred times, ponytail whipping, and then raises it an inch. A boulder of soap rolls past, and she goes on to **practise** along the ceiling until the cashiers start applauding."],"迫":["to force","{Pikachu} crackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, where a *white dove* refuses to leave a cubicle and go back to the *road* outside. 'Pika!' A tiny Thunderbolt on the door handle will **force** it; every feather stands on end and it shoots off. Then a trainer arrives with a Poké Ball to **force** Pikachu in as well, sparks and all."],"爷":["grandpa","{Yoshi} flutter jumps {Inside} the {Hut}, where his *father* is snoring in a chair. Slurp: he swallows him whole and lays him as a big mottled egg. When it hatches, out climbs an older, creakier dinosaur with a walking stick: **grandpa**. 'Yoshi,' he grumbles, and **grandpa** goes on at length about how the eggs were bigger in his day."],"篇":["piece of writing","{Pikachu} sits on a *nameboard* in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and, with a burnt *bamboo* stick and his cheek sparks, scorches a whole **piece of writing** into the pavement. Every word of it is 'Pika'. A passer-by reads the **piece of writing** aloud, weeps at its beauty, and tries to catch the author in a Poké Ball."],"肉":["meat","{Robocop} clanks stiffly into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, where a slab of *meat* sits on the sink, and his targeting display locks on. 'Directive two,' he reads out, 'unattended **meat** is not permitted in this area.' He cuffs it politely, reads the **meat** its rights and leads it off, while a sausage tries to climb out of the window."],"嘴":["mouth","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room}, where a giant parrot with a yellow *beak* is squawking his secret name. He leaps, taps its *mouth* shut with the flat of his rapier and carves a tiny Z on its nose. He laughs with his **mouth** wide open, the parrot's **mouth** pops open too, and he vanishes, still laughing."],"馆":["building","{Gandalf} raps his staff in the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} and, when a fussy *official* denies him a permit, mutters a spell over a *side dish* of peas. The peas rise and stack into a whole **building**, with windows, pointy towers and fireworks from the chimney. 'You shall not pass,' he tells the official, and shuts the door of his **building**."],"遍":["time (round)","{Batman} glides through the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} on patrol, following a *road* of wet footprints to a *nameboard* on a door. There is no clue, so he goes back for another **round**, and another. For the ninth **time** he sweeps his cape past the same sink, gruffly muttering that one more **round** will crack it."],"凡":["ordinary","{Frodo} tiptoes {Inside} the {Mansion}, small and weary, wishing he were just an **ordinary** hobbit. He slips on the Ring and vanishes, and a great *sail* draped over the piano billows as he bumps into it. Taking the Ring off, he sees his own hairy feet, no quest and no dragons, only an **ordinary** Tuesday, and Sam brings him tea."],"础":["foundation","{Charlie Brown} sighs in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and lays one careful *stone* to begin a **foundation**, with a *double mountain* of rubble waiting behind him. He steps back to admire it and trips over a football that Lucy has left there. The rubble slides, and the **foundation** cracks in a zigzag exactly like his shirt. 'Good grief.'"],"洞":["hole","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, breathing loudly, and his red lightsaber burns a neat **hole** through the sink. Out pour *water drops*, which he catches in a *matching cup* held up by the Force. He booms his disapproval, slices a second **hole** in the cup by accident, and stands there, dripping, deeply disappointed in everyone."],"卷":["to roll up","{James Bond} slips into the {Basement} of the {Mint}, tuxedo spotless, and finds a long *scroll* of banknotes unwinding across the floor. Q's cufflink does one absurd thing: it makes everything **roll up**. He presses it, and the notes, the carpets and the guards' trouser legs all **roll up** tight. 'A nice little earner,' he says, unruffled, tucking the lot under one arm."],"坦":["flat","{Tarzan} swings down to the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, where a *sunrise* is painted on the wall and a great heap of *soil* blocks the way. He gives his jungle yell, calls in the elephants, and they trample the heap until it is perfectly **flat**. The painted sun peeps over it, and Tarzan lies down, baffled by how **flat** civilisation has become."],"牛":["ox","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} in his orange jumpsuit, ready to fight an enormous **ox** whose horns are scraping the ceiling. He makes shadow clones by the dozen to shove it, and it will not budge. Then a small *cow* trots in and moos, and the **ox** follows her out, with Naruto riding on its back, still yelling that he never gives up, slurping ramen."],"宁":["peaceful","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, yelling at the top of his lungs that this place will be **peaceful**, whatever it takes. He sends shadow clones to hammer a *nail* through a loose *roof* that keeps banging, and one Rasengan finishes the job with a huge bang. Finally it is **peaceful**, for one second, until all the clones start cheering."],"纸":["paper","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} and unrolls a sheet of **paper** showing a *family tree* of bees, every one drawn with his huge grin. He dangles it on a *silk thread* past the queen. She lunges, and the **paper** turns out to be a trick card that squirts her with honey, and he cackles all the way up the stairs."],"诸":["all","The {Joker} stands in {Front} of the {Pool} with a clipboard, doing a *headcount* and promising a prize to everybody. He grins until **all** of them have lined up, purple suit gleaming. Then he pulls a trick card from his sleeve, and **all** the flowers on **all** the swimming caps squirt at once, while he cackles and runs."],"训":["to train","{Shrek} marches Donkey into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} to **train** him to shut up. Every time a *small speech bubble* pops from Donkey's mouth, Shrek grabs it, roars and drops it into a little *river* from the burst pipe, where it floats away. By sunset Donkey is **trained** at last, and goes on talking with his ears."],"私":["private","{Sailor Moon} waves her moon wand in {Front} of the {Beehive}, clutching a *grain stalk* that is her secret snack, and bursts into loud tears whenever anyone looks at it. She sticks out an *elbow* to block the bees and delivers a speech about justice: this snack is strictly **private**. Luna, the talking cat, points out that **private** things should not be waved about."],"庄":["village","The {Joker} pops up in {Front} of the {Swamp}, where a quiet *farmstead* has grown into a sleepy **village**. Overnight he swaps all the signs, fills the milk churns with squirting flowers and deals trick cards to the chickens. By morning the whole **village** wakes up with green hair and a huge grin, and he cackles from the duck pond."],"祖":["ancestor","{Zorro} climbs down a *stepladder* into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a *small altar* holds an old black mask that belonged to his **ancestor**. He bows, cape sweeping, and slashes a Z through the candle smoke in salute. On the wall, a dusty painting of his **ancestor** winks, draws a tiny rapier, slashes a Z back and vanishes laughing."],"丝":["silk","{Sailor Moon} sparkles through her transformation in {Front} of the {Beehive}, ribbons of **silk** pouring from her moon wand. Clumsy as ever, she strides out along a *plank*, which tips and pitches her off. The bees sail by wrapped in **silk**, and she cries loudly, bound up like a parcel, while Luna quietly helps herself to a scarf."],"翻":["to turn over","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Mansion}, footsore, through a muddy *footprint field*, because he has dropped the Ring and must **turn over** every clod. *feathers* fly up as a furious goose objects to being disturbed. Loyal Sam helps him **turn over** the goose as well, and there is the Ring, looped around its foot, looking pleased with itself."],"暴":["violent","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, cape steaming, in a *heatwave* so **violent** that it melts the taps. Towels whip themselves against the walls and the mirrors rattle. He reaches into his utility belt for a gadget, and a **violent** gust blows him straight out of the window, growling, until his grappling hook hauls him back."],"森":["forest","{Sailor Moon} raises her moon wand in {Front} of the {Funfair}, speechifying about justice, and by accident sparkles up a *tree*. Then comes a second *tree*, and a third *tree*, and soon the carousel is lost in a **forest**. She stumbles about crying loudly, clumsy as ever, while Luna the talking cat leads her out of the **forest** by one pigtail."],"塔":["pagoda","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and, baffled by civilisation, tries to build the only tall thing he has heard of: his apes pile up *soil*, layer on layer, each one capped with *thatch*. It becomes a wobbly **pagoda**. He gives his jungle yell from the top of the **pagoda**, and the chimpanzees queue up for massages."],"默":["silent","{Mario} creeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, black with *soot* from a warp pipe, and for once must stay **silent**, because a huge *dog* sleeps on the mat. He tiptoes, moustache quivering, without one 'Wahoo!' Then a block floats past at head height, he head-butts it by habit, and ding! So much for **silent**: the dog wakes, and he runs."],"握":["to grasp","{Walter White} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, a proud chemistry teacher, showing his class a crystal *cottage* he grew in a beaker. A *helping hand* reaches out to **grasp** it, and it crumbles at one touch. 'Precise tongs,' he says, adjusting his glasses. They **grasp** the tongs, and only then do they **grasp** the science."],"戏":["drama","{Shrek} just wants a quiet soak in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, but Donkey bursts in with a costume **drama**: a knight gripping a *halberd* in his *right hand*, gasping out his lines. The ogre roars until the tiles shake. Everyone applauds, taking it for part of the **drama**, and he has to bow, onion in hand."],"隐":["hidden","{Yoshi} creeps down into the {Basement} of the {Inn} and curls up behind a painted *hillside* to stay **hidden**, a *racing heart* thumping so loudly that the jars rattle. He lays a dozen eggs in a heap around himself and tucks in his nose. Now he is perfectly **hidden** among them, one more egg, except for a long green tail."],"熟":["ripe","{Sherlock} stalks {Inside} the {Pool} past a *roast* sizzling on glowing *embers*, his magnifying glass fixed on one crumb of peach in the crackling. 'Elementary, Watson: it fell from a tree three hours ago, perfectly **ripe**.' He squeezes the nearest peach, which sprays his deerstalker, and he smugly pronounces it **ripe**."],"骨":["bone","{Gandalf} finds a dry old *bone* in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and taps it with his staff. With one cranky spell the **bone** rises, dances and knocks on the pipes, and it summons a second **bone** to join in, with fireworks. 'You shall not pass!' he barks at a dog leaping for it, and the dog, impressed, sits down and waits for its supper."],"访":["to visit","{Frodo} plods into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} after a very long walk, only to **visit** Sam's cousin. A *small speech bubble* pops up asking why he came; he has crossed a *square*, two mountains and a marsh on bare hairy feet. He slips on the Ring by mistake, the cousin lays a plate for nobody, and next time he will **visit** by post."],"弱":["weak","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, stiff and heavy, and his visor flashes a warning: battery **weak**. One steel arm droops. 'Directive three,' he reads in a slowing voice, 'arrest that tap.' He cannot close the cuffs, his knees fold, and in a **weak** little voice he apologises politely as he sits down, gently, in the sink."],"蒙":["to cover","{Mario} bursts out of a warp pipe {Inside} the {Jungle} and head-butts a block, and out flies a *blindfold*, flapping like a bat to **cover** his eyes. He stomps blindly about, 'Wahoo!', and one stomp shakes down a mushroom. He grows huge, and now he needs whole trees to **cover** his moustache."],"歌":["song","{Gandalf} leans on his staff in {Front} of the {Hut} and begins a long and ancient **song**, which of course is a spell. His *elder brother*, an even crankier wizard, joins in on the pipe. A vast magical *yawn* rolls over the valley, and by the ninth verse of the **song** every sheep has fallen asleep standing up."],"店":["shop","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, breathing loudly, and finds a little **shop** set up in a garden *shed* and run by a *fortune teller*. She tells him he will buy a towel. He lifts the till with the Force and booms his disapproval at the prices, then, as foreseen, leaves the **shop** with a towel and a receipt."],"鬼":["ghost","{Gandalf} lights his staff in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *ghost* is rattling all the chairs. 'You shall not pass!' he bellows, and the **ghost** floats straight through him. Cranky, he tries fireworks, and the **ghost** applauds, then politely takes a number and sits down to wait its turn, while he lights his pipe in defeat."],"软":["soft","{Robocop} clanks into the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} and politely arrests a *cart* stuffed with swan down, and his steel fingers sink right in. His targeting display reads **soft**. A long *yawn* creaks from his visor as the feathers wrap round his armour, and he lies back on the **soft** heap, reading a pillow its rights."],"典":["canon","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and with the Force draws a heavy book from behind the *curtains*. It is the **canon**, the great rulebook every Sith must know by heart. Breathing loudly, he booms a *song* from it as the pages turn themselves, and anyone who misquotes the **canon** gets his deepest disapproval."],"欲":["desire","{Yoshi} wakes in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} with a *yawn* so huge that a painted *valley* on the wall seems to slide into it. A great **desire** seizes him to eat everything: the soap, the hand dryer, the mop. Tongue out, gulp, gulp, but each egg he lays only fills him with fresh **desire**, and he eyes the door hungrily. 'Yoshi!'"],"萨":["Bodhisattva","{Sailor Moon} sparkles through her transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, trips on a mat of *grass* and lands at the feet of a calm **Bodhisattva** sitting on a folded towel. She gives her full speech about justice and bursts into loud tears. The **Bodhisattva** only smiles and pats her pigtail, and Luna the talking cat bows low."],"伙":["companion","{Homer} naps by a *campfire* in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, doughnut on his chest, when a *standing person* comes up offering marshmallows. 'Mmm,' he says, and just like that he has a **companion**. His dim scheme to share only half backfires when the doughnut rolls into the fire. 'D'oh!' Still, a **companion** laughs and hands you the burnt bit."],"遭":["to suffer","{Zorro} gallops up the *road* in {Front} of the {Tower} on his black horse and slashes a Z through a rope to swing dashingly up. It snaps, and down he drops into a *trough* of cold muddy water. His mask slips, his cape sags and even Zorro must **suffer**, but only he could **suffer** a wet hat with such style."],"盘":["plate","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Mansion} and finds a **plate** the size of a pond, with a tiny *boat* floating on gravy in the middle of the *dish*. 'Pika!' he squeaks, climbing aboard after the peppers. His cheeks spark, a Thunderbolt cracks the **plate** clean down the centre, and the boat sinks while he sits on the dry half, munching."],"爸":["dad","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, grappling hook ready, as a *python* coils around somebody's *father* in a robe. The kids shout '**Dad**!' A batarang ties the snake in a neat bow, and gruffly he tells them, 'Your **dad** is safe.' The python, unwrapped, slithers off wearing the bow, and the man tells a terrible joke."],"扩":["to enlarge","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, stage manager of a musical whose only set, a tiny *shed*, cannot fit the chorus line. \"Yaaay!\" he panics, and a giant *helping hand* grabs the walls to **enlarge** it. Every time his arms wave it must **enlarge** again, until the shed swallows the warehouse and Kermit is a green speck on a vast stage."],"盖":["lid","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} exactly when he means to, as a *sheep* gallops around eating the towels. He taps his staff and a silver *dish* flies up, flips over and slams down as a **lid**, trapping the animal with a clang. \"You shall not pass!\" he tells the baaing **lid**, and seals it with a shower of fireworks."],"弄":["to do","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, where a lazy *king* lounging on a heap of *grass* waves a long list of things **to do**. Forty orange shadow clones pop into being, and each grabs a chore: they **do** the mopping, the dishes and the royal hair. When nothing is left, the clones start mowing the grass under the king, still yelling for more."],"雄":["male","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Youth Club} wanting to be left alone, but a *sparrow* is flexing one huge *upper arm* on his onion sandwich and crowing that it is the toughest **male** in town. Shrek lets out a swamp roar that blows every feather backwards. The sparrow roars back, tiny and proud, and Donkey announces that he is the real **male** around here."],"稳":["steady","{Walter White} sets up a school experiment in the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, balancing a full beaker on a single *grain stalk*. His *racing heart* thumps as the rollercoaster shakes the walls, yet he adjusts his glasses, measures to the millimetre and holds it **steady**. The liquid stays **steady** as rock while the whole funfair wobbles, and he looks insufferably proud of his science."],"忘":["to forget","{Walter White} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} to teach memory chemistry and sniffs one fizzing beaker too many. His *heart* skips, and a *tombstone* pops up engraved with all the elements he is about **to forget**. He **forgets** hydrogen, then his black hat, then why he is holding a beaker, and the proud teacher asks a passing plane for the answer."],"亿":["hundred million","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} as a *standing person* points at one lonely *swan*. His sticky tongue whips out, gulps it down, and he lays a spotted egg that hatches two more, so he swallows those and lays again. By sunset a **hundred million** swans are honking across the sand, and the person is still counting the **hundred million** eggshells."],"刺":["thorn","{Cookie Monster} spots a *thorn* shaped like a cookie in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, and his googly eyes spin. \"Me want cookie!\" He gobbles it in a spray of crumbs, and the **thorn** jabs his tongue. A *standing knife* hops over to prise out the **thorn**, so he eats that as well and howls that this bakery is terrible."],"拥":["to embrace","{Yoshi} stands in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and, being short of arms, decides to **embrace** everybody with his long sticky tongue. It loops around a *helping hand* carrying a *bucket* of fish, then crabs, then tourists, squeezing them all together. \"Yoshi!\" he beams, flutter-jumping with joy, and he **embraces** the whole lagoon in one enormous slobbery hug."],"徒":["disciple","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Pool}, giving his jungle yell, and a puffing *runner* below copies his *footsteps* exactly. Soon the runner is beating his chest and begging to be his **disciple**. Apes and lifeguards fall in behind him, and when the baffled Tarzan dives off the vine, every **disciple** dives too, yelling."],"姆":["nanny","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and lands among a hundred squalling toddlers ruled by one stern *woman*. She is the **nanny**, tougher than any *mother*, and when he stomps on her pram to show off, she makes him say sorry. Then he head-butts a block for coins, and the **nanny** confiscates every one for the piggy bank."],"杨":["poplar","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Hangar}, trying to reach the top of a tall skinny *tree* glittering in the *sun rays*. It is a **poplar**, so he flicks out his tongue, swallows the whole thing and strains to lay one very long, thin egg. The egg cracks, and out shoots another **poplar**, shaking its leaves and whispering at the parked planes."],"齐":["neat","{Chewbacca} roars {Inside} the {Beach} club, because the place is a mess and he likes things shipshape. He rips a wild bush apart with his bare paws until it is a *trimmed hedge*, then yanks the deckchairs, towels and crabs into perfect rows. Everything is **neat**, and he growls at the sea until even the waves lie **neat** as a carpet."],"赛":["competition","{Sailor Moon} spins through her sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and, in the name of the moon, declares a **competition**: crabs must race along the *roof* while coconuts roll and gulls sprint. She throws her tiara as the starting signal and trips over her own pigtails. She cries so loudly that Luna the cat awards her last place in the **competition**."],"趣":["interesting","{Chewbacca} ducks into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} just as a *runner* with a *grabbing hand* snatches the guide's notes, so he has to give the tour himself, in roars. Nobody understands a word, yet every growl sounds so **interesting** that visitors gasp and nod at a broken spoon. The runner comes back to return the notes, finding the roaring far more **interesting**."],"曲":["crooked","{Chewbacca} tries to fix the flagpole in {Front} of the {Museum} while howling a Wookiee *song*. Every note makes his huge paws twist harder, so the pole comes out **crooked**, then the lamp posts, then his own crossbow. The curator wails in protest, and the song is so strong that his glasses and his nose end up **crooked** too."],"刀":["knife","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Tower} and raises one glove, and a giant *knife* floats off a picnic table on the Force. Breathing loudly, he makes the **knife** slice clouds into cubes and butter a whole loaf from across the courtyard. \"Impressive,\" he booms, then spots a crumb, and the **knife** hangs trembling in shame."],"床":["bed","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Swamp} *shed*, exhausted, because a *tree* has eaten his kite and grown through the floor. Good grief. He builds a **bed** from its branches and lies down, but the tree keeps growing and lifts him up to the ceiling. Stuck up there, he sighs that even his **bed** hates him, while Snoopy snores on his doghouse below."],"迎":["to welcome","{Yoshi} hops {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, his *upward gaze* fixed on a balloon drifting down a *road* of clouds. To **welcome** the guests he shoots out his tongue, gulps each one and lays them as polka-dot eggs along the ropes. The eggs crack, the dazed guests step out, and he cries \"Yoshi!\" to **welcome** them all over again."],"冰":["ice","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, pulls a freeze pellet from his utility belt and hurls it at a puddle of *water*. With a crack everything turns to **ice**, and long *icicles* grow from the ropes and the bell. Boxers skid helplessly past him, and he slides slowly away across the **ice**, still brooding, cape stiff as a board."],"虚":["empty","{Shrek} wants peace, so he stomps out in {Front} of the {Museum} and lets out one mighty roar that echoes off the *ruins*. Tourists, guards and pigeons all flee, and the whole place is **empty** at last: no tickets, no sandwiches, nobody. He sighs with bliss, until Donkey trots up asking why everything is so **empty**, and whether he can stay."],"玩":["to play","{Walter White} marches {Inside} the {Mansion}, where a bored *king* flips a *yuan coin* to choose a game **to play**. Walter insists that the only way **to play** is with science, so he mixes bouncing polymer balls in exact proportions and turns the ballroom into a lesson. The king shrieks with delight as the balls ricochet through the chandeliers, and Walter checks each bounce with a ruler."],"析":["to analyze","{Shrek} plonks down in {Front} of the {Beach} hut and declares that ogres are like onions, so a *woodcutter* splits one with his axe to **analyze** it. Layer by layer they **analyze** every ring under a lens, charting the tears, the whiffs and the grumpiness. Donkey insists on being next, and the woodcutter has to draw him a chart of nonsense."],"窗":["window","{Charlie Brown} runs up to kick a football in {Front} of the {Swamp} *cave*, but it is whisked away, and he sails through the air and crashes through the wall by the *chimney*, which coughs soot on him. Good grief: he has made a **window**. The frogs peer in and laugh, and a kite-eating tree reaches through the **window** to take his hat."],"醒":["to wake up","{Shrek} snores in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, hugging a *wine jug* of swamp juice under a sign saying \"Go away\". A falling *star* crashes through the ceiling and bonks him on the nose, and Donkey starts yelling in his ear, so he has **to wake up**. His furious roar makes everyone in the stadium **wake up** too, in their pyjamas."],"妻":["wife","{Chewbacca} bellows in {Front} of the {Beach} villa, and nobody understands a word except his *wife*, who parachutes in wearing a veil and a bandolier. She answers with a roar twice as loud. He fixes her deckchair, she rips it apart in joy, and the gulls agree that only a Wookiee **wife** could love that noise, so he hugs his **wife** until the sand shakes."],"透":["to seep through","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and yells at a puddle that has begun **to seep through** the floorboards. Baffled by plumbing, he asks the frogs, who croak that a pink *blossom* has floated in along the flooded *road* and blocked the drain. Now water, petals and tadpoles **seep through** every crack, and he beats his chest at the wet floor."],"购":["to purchase","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} meaning **to purchase** a boat, and the cranky old boatman will take only seashells. He waves his staff, and a magic *hook* flies out across the lake and fishes up one *shell* after another, each landing in the till with a firework. He **purchases** a canoe, a lifebuoy and, because he can, the whole lake."],"替":["to substitute","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} club, baffled by civilisation, and decides **to substitute** the jungle for all of it. A banana leaf is the *substitute* for the towel, a monkey replaces the toothbrush and a very patient python stands in for the hose. Then the lifeguard goes to lunch, and Tarzan **substitutes** himself, yelling at the waves from a vine."],"塞":["to stuff in","{Sailor Moon} arrives in {Front} of the {Island} hut, late and sobbing, with far more luggage than the place can hold. She lifts the *roof* like a lid to **stuff in** moon wands, spare tiaras, comics and a protesting Luna. It clangs shut, she gives a speech about justice and **stuffs in** one last cupcake, and the walls burst in a shower of sparkles."],"努":["to strive","{Naruto} faceplants in the {Basement} of the {Pool} for the hundredth time, because he never gives up: he will **strive** until his Rasengan finally spins. A worn-out *drudge* scrubbing the tiles lends one *strong arm* to haul him up, and off he goes again, clones cheering. He **strives** all night on one bowl of ramen, shouting that tomorrow he will do it twice."],"休":["to rest","{Shrek} flops against a shady *tree* in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} and growls that all he wants is **to rest**. A *standing person* strikes up a guitar and Donkey starts talking, so he roars until they both drop flat in fright. Silence at last: the ogre pulls a mud blanket up to his chin and **rests**, snoring louder than the roar."],"虎":["tiger","{Homer} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Pool} after the smell of doughnuts and finds a *crouching tiger* eating them. \"D'oh!\" His dim scheme is to paint on stripes and pose as a **tiger** to sneak the rest of the box. It backfires, because the real **tiger** falls in love with him and licks the icing off his bald head."],"扬":["to raise","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Hangar}, legs whirring, with his sticky tongue stuck to a flag. A *helping hand* boosts him up into the *sun rays*, and each frantic kick helps **raise** the flag higher. Still stuck, he **raises** a plane too, then three mechanics, all dangling from one long tongue and cheering."],"途":["route","{Tarzan} swings from vine to vine {Inside} the {Pool}, following a *road* of *leftovers* that some picnic has dropped: half a sandwich, a banana skin, cold noodles. Baffled by the map, he eats it and asks a gull for the **route** instead. It squawks directions, the apes argue, and the whole troop hoots along the **route** to find a bear finishing the picnic."],"侵":["to invade","{Chewbacca} is fixing a ship in {Front} of the {Inn} when a *standing person* climbs the wall with a ladder, then a hundred more, all coming **to invade**. He roars so hard his bandolier rattles and rips every ladder into toothpicks. They scatter, the guests cheer, and then Chewbacca smells the porridge and **invades** the kitchen himself."],"刑":["punishment","{Shrek} trudges {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and roars at the bell, so the referee locks him in wooden *stocks*. His **punishment** is not the custard pies the crowd throws. His **punishment** is that Donkey sits beside him for a whole afternoon, singing, talking and asking if they are there yet, while Shrek begs for more pies."],"绿":["green","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, following a clue in an old *logbook* that says to tug the *silk thread* behind the sink. She tugs, and an ancient trap releases a rolling boulder of slime, which turns the statues **green** as she somersaults over it. Lara lands perfectly, ponytail and all completely **green**, holding the relic."],"兄":["elder brother","{Shrek} wants to be left alone in {Front} of the {Youth Club} when his *big brother*, an even larger ogre, turns up. Shrek roars, and the **elder brother** roars louder; Shrek has layers, and he has twice as many. Donkey cackles at the news, and the **elder brother** picks Shrek up and tucks him under one arm like an onion."],"迅":["rapid","{Shrek} bolts out of the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} and down a sandy *road*, desperate to escape Donkey's talking. No ogre has ever been so **rapid**, overtaking a *swift* and blowing the tops off the dunes with each stomp. Yet Donkey's **rapid** chatter stays right beside his ear, asking whether they are there yet."],"套":["to cover","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, where a *big man* scolds him for wearing only a loincloth. Baffled, Tarzan grabs the man's own *flowing locks* to **cover** himself and wraps them round his waist. Apes arrive with armfuls of banana leaves to **cover** them both, and soon the pair is a large green bush arguing with itself."],"贸":["trade","{Mario} stomps on a turtle in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and keeps the empty *shell*. \"Wahoo!\" He carries it to a stall built on a wooden *mortise*, which snaps open like a till, and starts a **trade**: shell for mushroom, mushroom for coins, coins for a bigger shell. Soon Toads are queueing down the stairs, and the tower is a roaring **trade** fair."],"毕":["to finish","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, gruffly timing two *twins* racing toward a *cross* scratched in the sand. One stumbles, so he fires his grappling hook, yanks them both over the line and growls that they must **finish** together. They **finish** in a gasping heap, and he has already vanished with a swish of the cape, leaving only a batarang on the mark."],"唯":["only","{Walter White} strides {Inside} the {Lake} house and chalks up a chemistry question that no student has answered in thirty years. A *sparrow* opens its huge *mouth* and chirps the formula, the **only** correct answer he has ever heard. Pale with pride, Walter tips his black hat to it and declares it the **only** pupil worthy of his beakers."],"谷":["valley","{Gandalf} strikes his staff in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, and with a crack of spellwork the floor splits open into a green *valley*. Mountains heave up on both sides, a river runs down the middle and bewildered swimmers wander off among the sheep. He lights his pipe, sends fireworks over the **valley**, and blows a smoke ring that drifts the length of the **valley**."],"轮":["wheel","{Lara Croft} leaps {Inside} the {Casino} and trips an ancient trap, and a huge stone **wheel** comes rolling after her. She flips onto a *cart*, ponytail flying, and it smashes through a *neat stack* of poker chips as she climbs a chandelier. The roulette table joins the chase, and she lands safely on top of the giant **wheel**, running backwards to steer it."],"库":["warehouse","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} looking for props and finds a secret *warehouse* under the tiles, stuffed with rubber chickens and spare banjos. \"Yaaay!\" he flails, trying to run the place like a show, but one tug on a banjo brings the shelves down. It's not easy being in charge of a **warehouse**, he sighs, buried in the **warehouse** chickens."],"迹":["trace","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and clicks a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing: it sniffs out sweat. It beeps along a *road* of damp footprints, every **trace** leading to a *sweating man* hiding under a towel. \"Bond. James Bond,\" he says, without a **trace** of a crease in his tuxedo."],"尤":["especially","{Yoshi} clambers {Inside} the {Boathouse} and gulps down everything with his tongue: oars, ropes, buoys, and a *wart* off a passing toad. He loves it all, **especially** the wart, which glows in his throat. Out come the spotted eggs, each one lovely, but **especially** the one with a golden bump on top, which he polishes with pride."],"竞":["to compete","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} and steps onto a *podium*, where a caped *big brother* challenges him **to compete**. Bond presses his watch from Q, which does one absurd thing: it inflates his bow tie to the size of a sofa. They **compete** for hours, and the unruffled Bond escapes the tie with a one-liner and takes the top step."],"街":["street","{James Bond} pulls up at a *crossroads* in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} and presses a button on a *jade tablet* from Q. Instantly it unrolls an entire **street** across the snow: lamp posts, cafes, a bus full of yetis. \"Shaken, not stirred,\" he says with a raised eyebrow, and the whole **street** starts to rattle as the yetis honk."],"促":["to hurry","{Cookie Monster} stamps one huge blue *foot* in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, because a *standing person* is taking forever to unwrap a cookie. \"Me want cookie! You **hurry**!\" Fingers blur, crumbs spray, and he gets so impatient that he eats the wrapper, the towel and the bench to help them **hurry** along."],"延":["to extend","{Yoshi} sticks out his tongue {Inside} the {Mansion} to reach a melon at the far end of a *stretching road*. The further the road runs, the further he must **extend** that long sticky tongue: through the hall, over the lawn, across a river. He **extends** it around the whole world until it taps him on the back of the head."],"震":["to shake","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, winding up a giant *clam* full of joke-shop chattering teeth and leaving it out in the *rain*. The wet teeth chatter so hard that the floor begins **to shake**. The ferris wheel wobbles, the candy floss trembles, and the prank **shakes** the whole fair like jelly while he dances, green hair quivering."],"弃":["to abandon","{Chewbacca} is the most loyal friend in the galaxy, but in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} he finds his starship stuffed with tall *grass*, and it will not start. In a temper he rips off a door, throws down his tools and storms off **to abandon** it. Ten steps later he howls with guilt, runs back and hugs the hull, unable to **abandon** anything."],"甲":["first","{James Bond} descends into the {Basement} of the {Piazza} in shiny *armour* from Q that does one absurd thing: it always has to come **first**. It drags him to the head of every queue, past the pigeons, ahead of the waiters, and he sips his drink as he clanks along. \"After you,\" he tells nobody, because he is **first** already."],"伟":["great","{Walter White} drops a tiny *standing person* into a beaker in the {Basement} of the {Lake} house, to show his class how a grow-in-water toy swells. It swells, snaps its *leather strap* and keeps going until its head fills the stairwell. A **great** man! Walter adjusts his glasses, too proud to be scared, and announces that the **great** thing here is his science."],"麻":["hemp","{Mario} head-butts a block {Inside} the {Spa} and, instead of a coin, out flops a bundle of scratchy *hemp*. \"Wahoo!\" Every jump brings more **hemp**, so the plumber stuffs it into the leaky pipes, where it swells and bursts them. Guests squirm and itch in their new **hemp** robes, and he tips his red cap and warps away."],"川":["river","{Charlie Brown} sets out a kite and a gloomy picnic in {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, and of course the pond bursts its bank into a roaring *river*. Good grief. The **river** sweeps away his lunch, his shoes and finally him, past swans who do not even look up. Snoopy floats by on his doghouse, enjoying the **river** enormously."],"申":["to state","{Sherlock} holds a single crumb up on a *skewer* in {Front} of the {Funfair}, and smugly begins **to state** the facts while Watson takes notes. He **states** who ate the kebab, what they had for breakfast and which clown has a secret sister. \"Elementary,\" he adds, and the skewer stands to attention at the sheer confidence of it."],"缓":["slow","{Homer} is stuck in the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} pavilion after a dim doughnut scheme, and a *rescue rope* of *silk thread* drops down to him. He hauls himself up **slow**, stops for a nap, then climbs even more **slow**, murmuring \"Mmm\". A snail overtakes him, the swans fall asleep watching, and it is next week before he reaches the doughnut."],"潜":["hidden","{Chewbacca} tries to stay **hidden** {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} behind a very small pot plant, which is hopeless, since he is eight feet tall and dripping *water drops* on the carpet. A *substitute* teller pretends not to see him for fear of the temper. He stays perfectly **hidden** for about four seconds, until he growls at his own stomach."],"闪":["to dodge","{Sherlock} steps through a creaky *gate* into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and deduces from one crumb that a *person* is about to throw a custard pie. \"Elementary,\" he says, and he **dodges** before it even leaves the hand. Left, right, a tilt of the deerstalker: he can **dodge** them all without looking up, while poor Watson, trailing behind, takes every one."],"售":["to sell","{Sherlock} sets up shop in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and deduces what each customer needs from a single crumb, while a *sparrow* yells his findings through its big *mouth*. \"Damp cuff, nervous aunt: you need a canoe!\" He can **sell** anything this way, smug as ever. He **sells** rowing boats, a submarine and, once he has examined his boots, Watson."],"灯":["lamp","{Darth Vader} breathes heavily in {Front} of the {Jungle} treehouse, ignites his red lightsaber and touches it to a tiny *campfire* in a jar. With a flick of the Force he drives a *nail* into the trunk and floats the jar up onto it: a **lamp**! Moths and monkeys gather to read by it, and he booms his disapproval at the **lamp** for being too cheerful."],"针":["needle","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Funfair}, piling *gold coins* on a big *cross* painted on the ground with a sign saying \"Free treasure\". Under them he has hidden a **needle**. Every balloon seller who bends to grab some goes pop, pop, pop, and he twirls the **needle** with a huge grin while the balloon animals fly away."],"哲":["wise","The {Joker} sneaks {Inside} the {Hut} wearing a false beard and pretends to be a **wise** hermit, leaning on a *snapped stick*, his grinning *mouth* full of riddles. Pilgrims queue for an answer and lean in close. A flower squirts each one in the face, and they bow, dripping, and call it the most **wise** thing they have ever seen."],"络":["network","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and freezes, for ancient *silk thread* is strung between every shelf, and one lost *visitor* has just tripped it. A bell rings at the far end, then a boulder rumbles, because every strand is linked in one vast **network**. She climbs and somersaults through the **network**, ponytail flying, and plucks the relic from its centre."],"抵":["to resist","{Darth Vader} raises a glove in the {Basement} of the {Beach} house as a huge wave crashes in, and the Force stops it dead over the *foundation*. He will **resist** the sea itself, breathing loudly while it hangs there trembling. A *helping hand* reaches out offering him a towel, and he **resists** that too, with booming disapproval."],"朱":["vermilion","The {Joker} swaps all the sunscreen in {Front} of the {Pool} for pots of *red lacquer*, and his squirting flower is loaded as well. Swimmers rub it on and turn **vermilion** from nose to toes, shining like lobsters. He laughs until his purple suit shakes, and then the flower backfires and paints his green hair **vermilion** too."],"埃":["dust","{Casper} floats through a wall in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse and says a friendly hello, frightening a man into dropping his sack of *soil*. It bursts into **dust**, which swirls and settles into one tiny *full stop* in the air. Casper, invisible, is suddenly outlined in **dust**, so everybody else runs off too, and he only wanted a friend."],"抱":["to hold","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and scans a wriggling *parcel* with a gadget from his belt: no bomb, only a puppy. A *helping hand* reaches out to take it, but he growls, \"I'll **hold** it,\" in that gruff voice. All night he broods with the puppy wrapped in his cape, and he **holds** it so tenderly that it falls asleep on his utility belt."],"鼓":["drum","{Gandalf} taps his staff in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, and a fat *branch* leaps up under a spell and starts beating a giant *drum*. On every boom, fireworks shoot out of the **drum** and the water jumps out of the pool. Crankily he lights his pipe and mutters that he never did like a **drum** in the deep."],"植":["to plant","The {Joker} tiptoes {Inside} the {Beehive} with a *plumb line*, grinning, and checks every honeycomb cell is straight before he can **plant** a trick *tree* in each one. The bees sniff the little saplings, and each one squirts them with water and honks. He **plants** hundreds, cackling, and by the end the queen is wearing a whoopee cushion and the hive is a forest of pranks."],"纯":["pure","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Casino} fresh from summer *camp*, a boy so **pure** that he hands back his only winning chip in case it was a mistake. A loose *silk thread* from his zigzag shirt snags on the wheel, and he loses that too. \"Good grief,\" he says, without a trace of a grudge, and the dealers weep at how **pure** he is."],"夏":["summer","{Shrek} lumbers into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza}, sweating, because it is high *summer* and his swamp has dried up. Like an onion he peels off one layer after another, grumbling that **summer** is for donkeys. Sure enough, Donkey is sunbathing on the cobbles in tiny sunglasses, singing about the **summer** at the top of his voice."],"忍":["to endure","{Robocop} stands stiffly in the {Basement} of the {Funfair} while a *blade edge* tickles the steel over his *heart*. \"Directive: **endure**,\" he reads out on his visor, as clowns honk at him and children stick balloons on his helmet. He **endures** it all with a polite beep, then politely arrests the blade for tickling."],"页":["page","{Yoshi} licks a giant *page* off the floor in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and swallows it whole, words and all. With a grunt he lays a polka-dot egg, and when it cracks open the **page** flutters out, folded and sticky. The villagers try to read the **page**, but it has been rewritten, and every single word now says \"Yoshi\"."],"杰":["hero","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Yeti Cave}, where a fallen *tree* burns down to glowing *embers* and trapped yetis whimper. Not a hair out of place, he clicks a bow tie from Q that inhales sparks, then walks out with a yeti under each arm. \"All in a day's work,\" he says, as the yetis chant **hero** and crown their **hero** with a medal of ice."],"筑":["to build","The {Joker} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} hauling poles of *bamboo* and a wooden *brace*, set **to build** the finest diving tower in town. He **builds** it high, and swimmers queue to climb it. Halfway up it flops open like a jack-in-the-box, a flag saying BANG pops out, and he cackles himself silly."],"折":["to break","The {Joker} deals out trick furniture {Inside} the {Hut}, starting with a *snapped stick* he has glued together, which he hands to a visiting hiker with a huge grin. It is rigged **to break** the moment anybody leans on it. Then the chair goes, then the teapot, each one rigged to **break** with a cartoon crack, and he falls about laughing in his purple suit."],"郑":["Zheng","The {Joker} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} lodge and fills a *pitcher* with fizzy lemonade for famous explorer Mr **Zheng**. It is a prank, of course: when lifted it squirts him in the eye and honks out his name. \"**Zheng**, Zheng, Zheng!\" it blares, and the monkeys copy it all night while the Joker holds his sides."],"贝":["shell","{Batman} fires his grapple in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house at an enormous *shell*, which snaps shut on the hook and drags him in. He reaches for his utility belt, and sure enough there is a can of **shell** repellent in it. Brooding, he prises it open, finds a pearl and climbs aboard, gliding off across the lake in the Bat-**shell**."],"尊":["to respect","{Zorro} sweeps up in {Front} of the {Casino} on his black horse and raises a glass in a *toast* to the oldest tortoise in the world. Then he draws his rapier and salutes it, for even he must **respect** such age. Gamblers doff their hats to **respect** it as well, and he slashes a very polite Z in the pavement and vanishes laughing."],"吴":["Wu","{Walter White} tries to teach sound waves {Inside} the {Pool}, but a *loudmouth* named Mr **Wu** keeps shouting his own name. Walter clips a meter to him and measures it exactly: one hundred decibels of \"**Wu**!\" per lap. Proud of his data, he plots the echoes on the blackboard, and the graph itself begins to shout."],"秀":["graceful","{Shrek} squeezes into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} and, because Donkey bet that an ogre never could be **graceful**, balances a pink *blossom* on one ear. He twirls and tiptoes over the bunk beds, enormous and silent, and backpackers sigh at how **graceful** he is. Then he burps, and the petals blow away."],"混":["to mix","{Homer} stumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} with a dim scheme to **mix** his own doughnut batter, using *water drops* from the tap and an *insect* for sprinkles. In go the poker chips, playing cards and somebody's hat. \"Mmm,\" he says, and he keeps trying to **mix** it with his fist until it explodes all over him. \"D'oh!\""],"臣":["official","{Charlie Brown} queues {Inside} the {Funfair} with everyone else, and a *minister* in long robes, the stamping **official** of the whole place, picks him out of hundreds. Naturally he alone has the wrong ticket. \"Good grief,\" he says, as the **official** stamps DENIED on his zigzag shirt and waves Snoopy through."],"雅":["elegant","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Spa}, where a *sparrow* with one silver *fang* sips tea from a thimble, terribly **elegant**. Yoshi tries it too, swallowing the teapot whole with his tongue, then lays a small round egg with his pinky raised. It cracks with a dainty tink, and he bows, never so **elegant** in his life."],"振":["to shake","The {Joker} plunges into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and offers a rubber *helping hand* with a joy buzzer in its palm to a giant *clam*. Bzzzt! The clam begins **to shake** like a maraca, pearls rattling out, and it won't let go. He cackles until his green hair stands up, and the buzzer **shakes** them both across the floor."],"染":["to dye","{Robocop} marches stiffly into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and reads out a directive: all evidence must be marked. His steel hand dunks a whole *tree* in a purple *mountain spring* **to dye** it, then the curtains, then the politely arrested butler. His targeting display locks on the last clean thing, and he **dyes** himself, standing there like a giant grape."],"盛":["flourishing","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} temple at one crumb on a *dish* beside a golden *trophy*. \"Elementary,\" he says, deducing that the place is **flourishing**, and each thing he names sprouts at once: vines, mangoes, whole villages. Soon everything is so **flourishing** that Watson disappears under the leaves, still taking notes."],"怒":["anger","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} to find that a *drudge* has eaten his last bowl of ramen. His *heart* pounds, his whiskers thicken and fiery **anger** boils out around him until the water steams. Forty clones share the **anger**, all stamping and howling, and they stop only when the terrified drudge cooks a fresh pot."],"舞":["to dance","{Walter White} pours cornstarch goo onto a loudspeaker in the {Basement} of the {Pool} to teach his class about vibration. The goo begins **to dance**, sprouting wobbling *dancing feet* that tango off the tray. Proud and precise, he adjusts his glasses and his black hat, but then his own shoes catch the beat, and he **dances** out of class still explaining the frequency."],"圆":["round","{Yoshi} wanders {Inside} the {Mint}, where an *employee* is building a *fence* around a heap of square coins. He flicks out his tongue, swallows the lot and lays them again: everything he swallows comes out **round**. The fence goes in and comes out a hoop, the employee goes in and comes out rather **round** too, and they all roll down the stairs."],"搞":["to do","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Tower} with a mile-long list of chores, far too cranky **to do** them himself. A wave of the staff conjures a glowing *helping hand*, and it **does** everything at once: mops the steps, polishes the whole *tower* and dusts the bats. Then it runs out of jobs and does Gandalf's beard in ringlets."],"狂":["mad","{Kermit} hops {Inside} the {Swamp} theatre on opening night to find that a *mad dog* in a crown has eaten the curtain. He flails his arms, screaming \"Yaaay!\", and soon the panic spreads, the whole cast goes **mad**, and the trombones chase the chickens. By curtain-up there is no curtain, and Kermit has gone utterly **mad**, conducting the mosquitoes with a banjo."],"措":["to handle","{Cookie Monster} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, where a mountain of *sun-dried meat* has toppled over. A *helping hand* comes to sort it out, but he waves it away with his googly eyes rolling: \"Me **handle** it!\" He **handles** it the only way he knows, gobbling the whole heap in a spray of crumbs, and then he eats the hand's clipboard."],"姓":["surname","{Shrek} just wants to be left alone in the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, but a *woman* holding a little *seedling* barges in and demands a **surname** for it. Donkey shouts out a hundred suggestions, none of them shutting up. Shrek roars \"Ogre!\", the walls shake, and the seedling sprouts a tiny tag with its new **surname**."],"残":["to destroy","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Mansion}, where a clattering *skeleton* waving *twin blades* guards the cookie jar. \"Me want cookie!\" He gulps the curtains, the piano and the sofa in a spray of crumbs, set **to destroy** the place room by room. The skeleton chops at the crumbs, and between them they **destroy** everything but the jar, which he then eats."],"秋":["autumn","{Chewbacca} shakes himself in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} and it is suddenly *autumn*, because he has started to moult. Clumps of reddish fur float down like leaves, covering the bunks, the bikes and the backpackers, who bring out their rakes. He roars at the wind, and it feels more like **autumn** with every growl, until the squirrels hoard his fur for **autumn**."],"培":["to cultivate","{Pikachu} kneels {Inside} the {Lake} house, heaping *soil* around one sad little seed that he means **to cultivate**. A *spitting mouth* carved in the wall sprays it with water, and he adds a tiny zap from his cheeks. \"Pika!\" A full Thunderbolt follows, and he **cultivates** a palm tree so huge and startled that he has to hide in his Poké Ball."],"迷":["to be lost","{Mario} drops from a warp pipe {Inside} the {Beach} hotel beside a *lost traveller* clutching his map upside down. They jump into another pipe, then another, \"Wahoo!\", and every one spits them out on the same stairs. Now they are both **lost**, so Mario head-butts a block for a clue, and all he gets is a coin and the news that he is still **lost**."],"诚":["sincere","{Charlie Brown} wins a *trophy* {Inside} the {Jungle} lodge, the first of his whole life, and a *small speech bubble* floats up from him saying that the kite-eating tree deserves it more. He is utterly **sincere**. The tree eats the trophy, and he thanks it, so **sincere** that even the parrots stop laughing and Snoopy lowers his ears."],"宽":["wide","{Kermit} throws out his skinny arms in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} pavilion with a panicked \"Yaaay!\", and they keep going, **wide** enough to catch the *roof* as it blows off. His mouth opens just as **wide**, and purple *amaranth* flowers spill out over his banjo. The swans simply paddle around him, as he is now the width of the park."],"宇":["universe","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in the {Basement} of the {Museum} and flicks out his tongue at a dusty *coat stand*, which is propping up a crumbling *roof*. Down it comes, and behind it glitters the whole **universe**: planets, comets, a galaxy like a teapot. He swallows it in one gulp and lays a speckled egg, and the **universe** twinkles softly through the shell."],"猛":["fierce","{Mario} skids into the {Basement} of the {Jungle} hut, where a *prowling dog* guards a sleeping *firstborn* tiger cub, snarling, **fierce** as a dragon. He eats a mushroom, grows huge and stomps the floor to scare it, but the dog does not even blink. Then the cub wakes, even more **fierce**, and roars a tiny roar that blows the red cap clean off him."],"摆":["to arrange","{Batman} kneels in the {Basement} of the {Island} hut studying a *dropped net* as evidence, and shells and starfish lie scattered everywhere. A *helping hand* passes them to him one by one, and he must **arrange** every clue in rows with his detective's eye. Gruff and silent, he **arranges** the last shell, stands back, and sees that he has made the Bat-Signal."],"梅":["plum","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Lake} house and head-butts a *tree* as if it were a block, and instead of a coin a purple **plum** drops out. A *busy mother* rushes under it with a basket, catching, pitting and bottling. \"Wahoo!\" He head-butts on, stomps every **plum** that misses into jam, and soon the stairs are sticky and she is yelling at him to wipe his boots."],"毁":["to destroy","{Homer} wakes in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} to find his doughnut stuck in the vending machine, so his dim scheme is a huge *war club*. He swings, and he **destroys** the machine, the clock and the potted fern. The doughnut rolls under the wreckage, and he goes on to **destroy** the floor to reach it. \"D'oh!\""],"伸":["to stretch","{Sherlock} deduces in {Front} of the {Funfair}, from one drip of sauce, that the last kebab sits on a *skewer* at the top of the high striker. \"Elementary,\" he tells a *standing person*, and orders him **to stretch**. The man's arms **stretch** up past the ferris wheel, and Watson writes it all down as Sherlock puffs his pipe and takes the credit."],"摩":["to rub","{Mario} the plumber wanders {Inside} the {Fort} with a wad of *hemp* in one *hand*, and starts to **rub** a rusty warp pipe until it shines. \"Wahoo!\" The pipe sneezes out a coin, so he **rubs** the cannons, the drawbridge and a very surprised turtle, collecting a coin from each with a little ting."],"盟":["alliance","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Jungle} treehouse, where the *sun and moon* sit side by side on one *dish*, glowing with friendship. He head-butts a block and hands out mushrooms to lions, monkeys and ants. They all sign an **alliance** against the mosquitoes, and he seals the **alliance** by stomping on the largest mosquito, shouting \"Wahoo!\""],"末":["end","{Mario} leaps through the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, up and up to the *treetop* of the tallest pine, and grabs the flagpole waiting at the very top. The music plays, fireworks go off and he has reached the **end** of the level. \"Wahoo!\" Then a small Toad comes out and tells him, sadly, that this is not the **end** and the princess is elsewhere."],"乃":["to be","{Naruto} slides into the {Basement} of the {Island} cave, shouting that he is **to be** the greatest ninja of all. A *ribbon* wraps round his forehead like a headband, and forty clones burst out in orange, each one yelling that he, in fact, is **to be** the greatest. Now they argue over the ribbon, and every clone refuses to give up."],"悲":["sad","{Batman} broods in {Front} of the {Lake} house, so **sad** that his *heart* droops under the armour. A bat with *spread wings* lands beside him and sobs as well. He reaches into his utility belt for a tissue dispenser and growls that he is fine, and even the Batmobile sags on its tyres, looking **sad** in the rain."],"拍":["to clap","{Pikachu} stands in {Front} of the {Island} fort, and every time his little paws *clap*, sparks jump from his cheeks. \"Pika!\" The crabs begin to **clap**, the palm trees join them, and one big Thunderbolt runs round the audience. They **clap** so hard that the whole island glows yellow, and a passing ship turns round to take a bow."],"丁":["man","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and lifts a *nail* with the Force, breathing loudly. It bends, sprouts arms and legs and turns into a skinny little **man**. \"I am your father,\" he booms, and the terrified little **man** topples off the ropes with a tiny \"Noooo!\" while the boxers look away."],"赵":["to surpass","The {Joker} pranks his way through the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, hiding *scissors* to snip the finish ribbon before a *runner* can arrive. A wind-up copy of himself whizzes past, chattering, so he can **surpass** the runner without moving. He then winds up a bigger one to **surpass** that one, and the room fills with little grinning racers."],"硬":["hard","{Yoshi} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} and, thinking it is a snack, swallows a *stone*. He groans and lays an egg so **hard** that it hits the floor with a BONG like a *gong*. Boxers punch it and hop away howling, for it is **hard** enough to bend the gloves, and Yoshi flutter-jumps on it with pride."],"麦":["wheat","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and stomps on a *seedling top* poking through the floor. \"Wahoo!\" With every stomp more **wheat** shoots up, and his *trudging feet* spread it out of the door and over the beach. He head-butts a block and gets a loaf, and by sunset the coconuts are drowning in an ocean of **wheat**."],"蒋":["Jiang","{James Bond} skids into the {Basement} of the {Stadium} and clicks his cufflink from Q, which does one absurd thing: it mows lawns. The tall *grass* falls away to reveal a stern *general*, hiding there with his plans. \"**Jiang**. General **Jiang**,\" the man says, offering his hand, and Bond, unruffled, tells him the look suits him."],"操":["to grasp","{Cookie Monster} sits in {Front} of the {Tower} as a riot of *birdsong* drifts overhead, and he decides it smells like cookies. \"Me want!\" A giant *helping hand* reaches up to **grasp** one tune right out of the air, and he snatches it and munches it. He tries to **grasp** the rest with both blue paws, and now each burp comes out tweeting."],"耶":["Jesus (in 耶稣)","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Hut} and his long tongue snatches a giant *ear* from the *hillside*, where a choir sings \"Ye-su, Ye-su!\", the Chinese name of **Jesus**, 耶稣. He swallows it, and the egg he lays hums the same hymn. \"Yoshi!\" he sings along: that \"ye\" is the first sound of **Jesus**."],"阻":["to block","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and kicks a *stepladder* across the corridor **to block** a stampede of runaway bulls. With a flash of his rapier he slits a Z in a *hillside* of sandbags, and they slump down to fill the gap. He **blocks** every last bull with a flick of his cape, and vanishes laughing."],"订":["to book","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} with a *small speech bubble* floating before him, saying \"Reserved\". With the Force he drives a *nail* through it and into the best seat in the house, and that is how he **books** it. He **books** the whole first row, the ring and the boxers, finding the lack of a queue most satisfactory."],"彩":["colour","{Cookie Monster} tumbles into the {Basement} of the {Island} cave, where a *fruit picker* is painting the walls with the *bristles* of a giant brush. \"Me want cookie!\" He mistakes the paint pots for snacks and devours them all. His blue fur flashes red and gold, **colour** sprays out in the crumbs, and he sneezes a rainbow of **colour** across the bats."],"抽":["to pull out","{Charlie Brown} runs up to kick a football planted in a *sprouting field* in {Front} of the {Boathouse}. At the very last second a giant *helping hand* comes down to **pull out** the ball, and he sails up and lands flat on his back. Good grief. He tries again, and the hand **pulls out** the ball, a carrot and his shoelaces."],"赞":["to praise","{Zorro} drops from a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} to judge *two racers* sprinting for a golden *shell*, and they tie. With his rapier he slashes a dashing Z in the shell, then bows **to praise** them both. The sweep of the cape rattles the taps; he **praises** the winners, the butler and his black horse, and vanishes laughing."],"魔":["devil","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Fort} and meets the final boss: a *ghost* in a cloak of *hemp*, horns poking out, a grinning **devil** juggling fireballs. He stomps it once, twice, three times, shouting \"Wahoo!\" with every bounce. The cloak falls empty and the castle cheers, but then the **devil** pops up behind him, laughing, with a second health bar."],"纷":["numerous","{Frodo} trudges barefoot in {Front} of the {Funfair}, weary, wanting only a slice of *cut cake* and some peace. Relatives are **numerous**, though, and they swarm him, tugging his *silk thread* cloak and asking for favours. He slips on the Ring and vanishes, but his hairy feet stay in view, and the **numerous** relatives simply follow those, with Sam apologising to each."],"沿":["along","{Yoshi} walks {Inside} the {Mansion} with his tongue out, slurping up a trail of *water drops* **along** the hallway. Every drop he swallows, he lays as a small speckled egg, so a neat line of eggs rolls **along** behind him, past the kitchen and out to the river. He looks up and the trail ends at a dripping duck, which he also swallows."],"喊":["to shout","{Homer} stumbles into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, mistakes a bag of *salt* for doughnut sugar and pours it into his huge *mouth*. \"D'oh!\" It comes out as such a mighty **shout** that the windows shatter and the butler's wig flies off. He runs in circles, and each **shout** bounces the mansion three feet in the air."],"违":["to disobey","{Walter White} storms {Inside} the {Lake} house with a *leather strap* of school rules round his wrist: no explosions, no fumes, no rockets on the *road*. Proud of his science, he decides **to disobey**. He **disobeys** every rule at once with perfect precision, and a neat fizzing rocket goes sailing out of the window while the headmaster's hat smoulders."],"妹":["younger sister","{Mario} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house and head-butts a block, and out jumps his **younger sister**, a tiny *woman* holding a *sapling*. She plants it in his cap and it grows. \"Wahoo!\" he says, until his **younger sister** eats a mushroom, grows twice his size and stomps on him for fun."],"浪":["wave","{Lara Croft} slides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} with a *good meal* on a tray and steps on a pressure plate, an ancient trap. From a stone mask come trickling *water drops*, and then a roaring **wave** bursts out, lifting the jets like toy boats. She surfs the **wave** on her tray, flips over the wing and never spills a single noodle."],"汇":["to converge","{Homer} slumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} with a lazy scheme: rather than walk to the tap, he will leave an *open crate* out and let the *water drops* **converge** on it. They do, followed by rivers of patients, magazines and floating doughnuts, which all **converge** at once. \"Mmm,\" he says, before the crate sails off with him aboard. \"D'oh!\""],"币":["coin","{Batman} shoots down a *slide* into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, cape flapping, and finds one **coin** lying on a *towel*. He bags it, dusts it and studies it through a lens from his utility belt, growling that it has two heads. The case is solved, so he flicks the **coin** high, catches it on a batarang and glides away."],"丰":["abundant","{Frodo} plods out in {Front} of the {Jungle} lodge on his bare hairy feet and plants one stalk of *wheat*, while Sam sprinkles a pinch of elvish dust. Boom: the harvest is **abundant**, with mangoes, pumpkins, and a mountain of bread for second breakfast. It is so **abundant** that he forgets the Ring for a moment and walks off happily through the loaves."],"蓝":["blue","{Lara Croft} cartwheels {Inside} the {Mansion}, spots a suspicious patch of *grass* on a carpet and pulls a hidden lever beneath it. An ancient urn tips and floods the room with **blue**, soaking the *inspector* who has been following her with a clipboard. She somersaults clear, ponytail spotless, and he stands there in **blue** from hat to boots, writing up the trap."],"殊":["special","{Sherlock} marches out in {Front} of the {Pool} and inspects a *skeleton* lounging on a deckchair, coated in shiny *red lacquer*. \"Elementary,\" he says through his magnifying glass: one bone is carved from soap, so this is a **special** guest. The skeleton takes a bow, and Watson, trailing behind, notes down that Sherlock thinks only himself more **special**."],"献":["to offer","{Shrek} rises into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with a *dog* wearing a hat that points *south*, and kneels before the bankers **to offer** them a deal. They turn their noses up at the dog and at his finest onion. Grumbling, he **offers** Donkey, who has not stopped talking since he got here, and they pay Shrek to take him away."],"桌":["table","The {Joker} saws a fallen *tree* into planks in {Front} of the {Warehouse} and nails on four legs to make a **table**, with a huge grin. He lays out a feast and sits the pigeons down in tiny chairs. When the first pigeon pecks, the **table** folds up, whoopee cushions honk and a squirting flower soaks them all, while he cackles."],"啦":["excited particle","{Lara Croft} swings onto the {Roof} of the {Spa} on a grappling rope, a relic in hand, and her *mouth* can't stop cheering: \"Found it la! Escaped la!\" A *pulling hand* hauls each tourist up to join her, and they all shout that same **excited particle**. No trap can stop the whole roof bouncing to the **excited particle**."],"瓦":["tile","{Walter White} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and knocks on each *tile*, for he is the one who knocks. One rings wrong, so he lifts it and runs a flame test, proud of his precision. It burns green, the class gasps and he finds another **tile** beneath it, then another, and he stacks each **tile** in order of composition, a mile high."],"莱":["goosefoot","{Lara Croft} cartwheels {Inside} the {Island} temple, where a puzzle of *grass* and *barley* covers the floor and only one plant is safe to touch. She spots it: scruffy **goosefoot**, its leaves like little webbed feet. She plucks it, a stone door grinds open, and then a boulder rolls, so she scrambles up the wall clutching her **goosefoot**, while geese waddle in to compare."],"援":["to help","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Mint} just as a banker tumbles into the coin vault. He cannot throw a *rescue rope*, so his tongue becomes one, and a *helping hand* steadies it as he reels the man in **to help** him. He swallows him and lays him safely on the floor in an egg, then **helps** a lost cat out the same way."],"译":["to translate","{Yoshi} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut where a crab and a seagull are arguing, each word floating up in a *small speech bubble*. He can only say his own name, so to **translate** he swallows each bubble and lays it as an egg. The egg cracks and the words come out plain, and he **translates** the whole quarrel: \"He says your feet smell.\""],"夺":["to seize","{Darth Vader} storms {Inside} the {Warehouse} to **seize** a giant teddy bear from a *big man* who has been hogging it. He raises one gloved *thumb*, and with a rasp of breath the Force rips it across the room into his hand. Then he **seizes** the man's sweets as well, floating them up in a long line, and booms his disapproval of the flavours."],"汽":["steam","{Chewbacca} is fixing a ship's boiler in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} sauna when *water drops* hit the hot pipes and hissing *steam* billows out. **Steam** fills the place and all his fur puffs up into a giant ball. He roars, whacks the valve and fixes it at last, then stomps out with **steam** blowing from every hair."],"烧":["burn","{Sherlock} crouches in {Front} of the {Tower} with his magnifying glass and deduces, from one singed crumb, that a tiny *emperor* has lit a *campfire* by the drawbridge. \"Elementary,\" he says, tilting the lens, and his own focused sunbeam makes the evidence **burn**. The emperor's paper crown starts to **burn**, the flagpole follows, and Watson trots behind with a very small bucket."],"距":["distance","{James Bond} adjusts his bow tie in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and tests Q's latest gadget: a *set square* that shouts the **distance** to anything it points at. A spring-loaded *kicking foot* pops out of his shoe and boots it through the door, past the mummies. \"Four hundred metres,\" it calls faintly, and Bond, unruffled, remarks that he prefers to keep his **distance**."],"裁":["cut out","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Island} palace, googly eyes spinning, and spears a velvet *robe* on a jousting *lance*. \"Me **cut out** cookie shape!\" he roars, chewing a perfect round hole through the cloth in a spray of crumbs. He holds it up, sees the moon through the gap, and goes on to **cut out** stars, hearts and one wobbly gingerbread man with his teeth."],"偏":["lean","{Pikachu} scampers in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *standing person* is hanging a heavy *nameboard* above the door. \"Pika!\" he squeaks, and a Thunderbolt snaps the left-hand hook, so the board starts to **lean**. The person tilts to hold it up, the lamp post sags, and soon the whole street has to **lean** over, with small yellow sparks skipping down the slope."],"符":["sign","{Frodo} plods wearily {Inside} the {Pool} on bare hairy feet, and a *cashier* behind a *bamboo* till demands a ticket. He has only the Ring, which glows and traces a fiery **sign** across the water, and the cashier stamps it nervously. Now every locker door shows the same **sign**, the swimmers back away, and Sam whispers that perhaps they should have walked round."],"勇":["brave","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} hut, where a tiny *man* faces a snoring sea monster with nothing but a silver *hairpin*. Yoshi swallows the little fellow whole, thinks it over, and lays him back out as a spotted egg. Out he hatches, **brave** as ever, and jabs the *hairpin* at the monster's nose; it flees squeaking, and Yoshi licks the **brave** little man's cheek."],"触":["touch","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} holding an *ox horn*, and a shiny green *bug* settles on its tip. He reaches out for one gentle **touch** and, naturally, it sparks, zapping him until his zigzag shirt stands on end. \"Good grief,\" says Charlie, who cannot **touch** a kite, a football or even an insect without disaster."],"课":["lesson","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, arms flailing, to stage-manage today's **lesson**, but the whole class is one *small speech bubble* and a heap of *fruit*. The bubble floats up and squeaks \"apple!\" while the pears roll away and a banana dives into the tub. \"Yaaay!\" he shrieks, strumming his banjo, because the **lesson** must go on."],"敬":["respect","{James Bond} glides through the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} without a crease in his tuxedo, and Q's wristwatch fires out a tiny arm that snaps up in a crisp *salute*. The champion salutes back, the towels stand to attention and the soap bows in **respect**. Bond, unruffled, straightens his cuffs and says that his bow tie never comes undone, which earns him even more **respect**."],"哭":["cry","{Kermit} sits in {Front} of the {Pool} and strums his banjo, singing how hard it is to be green, so sadly that a *dog* stops its cheerful *chatter* and begins to **cry**. Its howls fill the drainpipe, so he flails his arms and yells for everybody to take their places. It is no use: the lifeguards, the ducks and finally Kermit himself all **cry** into the deep end."],"懂":["understand","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} hut, breathing loudly, where a film *director* is shouting at a *standing heart* that will not act. Vader raises one glove and lifts the pair into the air with the Force until the heart gives a nervous thump and begins to **understand**. \"Now you **understand**,\" he booms, and the director, still floating, nods very fast and rewrites the ending."],"墙":["wall","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Stadium} and finds a *miser* patting together a **wall** of *soil*, one mean spoonful at a time, so nobody can watch the game for free. He lets out a long furious roar that only friends understand and rips the **wall** apart in a temper. Then, feeling bad, he welds it back together with ship parts, and the miser charges him a coin."],"袭":["raid","{Shrek} sits grumpily {Inside} the {Beach} house peeling an onion, wishing to be left alone, when a *dragon* in a silk *robe* swoops down on a **raid**. It grabs every towel, while Donkey, naturally, asks it to dinner. Shrek roars so hard that the robe blows off, then declares a **raid** of his own on its sandcastles, just so that everyone will go away."],"召":["summon","The {Joker} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} with a huge grin and squirts his flower at a *town crier*, whose bell starts to ring by itself. \"I **summon** the horses!\" cackles the Joker, flicking out trick cards that turn into tiny invitations. Three hundred horses in party hats squeeze up the stairs, and he winds the bell tighter to **summon** three hundred more."],"罚":["punish","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Spa} after a very long walk and, tempted by the Ring, slips it on to dodge paying. An invisible hobbit is no match for the *fishing net* that drops from above: the manager hauls him up, dripping, to **punish** him. Every wriggle dunks his hairy feet in the hot tub, and Sam, loyal as ever, asks to be the next one they **punish**."],"侠":["hero","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Piazza} wanting only quiet, but a *standing person* bursts through the crowd with blacksmith's *tongs*, snapping them at his nose and shouting that every **hero** must slay an ogre. Shrek just roars him, tongs and all, into the fountain. Donkey, who will not shut up, tells the whole square that the town's new **hero** is a grumpy one who smells of onions."],"厅":["hall","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} on a vine and gives his jungle yell, and the echo booms back from a vast stone **hall** carved into a *cliff*. Baffled by civilisation, he hangs his vine on the only *nail*, which pings out and rattles round the walls for ten minutes. His apes march in and declare the **hall** an excellent place to shout."],"拜":["bow","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, cape spread, and a crowd of crabs each raise one *shading hand* to peer up at him. Then they **bow**, claws to the tiles. Gruff and suspicious, he checks the floor with a gadget from his belt, finds nothing, and growls that he will not **bow** back, until his cape catches on a hook and bends him double."],"巧":["skilful","{Chewbacca} squeezes into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café}, where a broken starship engine sits on a *workbench*. Huge hairy fingers that rip doors apart turn out to be **skilful** as a watchmaker's: one *puff of breath* clears the dust, two growls set the gears spinning, and the engine purrs. The cats stare at the **skilful** giant, then bring him all their broken wind-up mice."],"侧":["side","{Cookie Monster} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, where a *standing person* reads from a huge *rulebook*: cookies stay on the left **side** of the sink. His googly eyes roll, and \"Me want cookie!\" he bellows, gobbling that whole half in a spray of crumbs. Then he eats the *rulebook*, and the other **side** of the sink as well."],"韩":["Korea","{Homer} dozes {Inside} the {Mansion} until *dawn* bursts through a window that looks out on **Korea**, all mountains and kimchi jars. \"Mmm…\" he drools at a stall selling sweet rice doughnuts, and his dim scheme is to lasso them with a *leather strap*. It snags and yanks him through the window, and \"D'oh!\" he says, landing face first in **Korea**."],"冒":["emit","{Mario} leaps up in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and head-butts a block, and out pops not a coin but a *brimmed hat*. He stomps on it with a \"Wahoo!\" and it starts to **emit** steam, then coins, then a stream of bubbles from under the brim. He stomps again, but every stomp only makes it **emit** more, until the taps are buried and he floats upward on his moustache."],"债":["debt","The {Joker} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, where a *debt collector* is chasing a *standing person* with a giant bill. Grinning, he offers to settle the **debt** with a trick playing card, and the card squirts water in the collector's face. The bill flutters over to the Joker, who cackles, signs it in custard and passes the **debt** on to a passing crab."],"曼":["graceful","{Mario} bounds into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} with a \"Wahoo!\" and stomps on a *long veil* left hanging over the bath. It flies up and floats him down, spinning, as **graceful** as a swan. Every jump tips a coin out of the folds, each landing is slower and more **graceful** than the last, and soon the plumber is pirouetting across the taps on one boot."],"融":["melt","{Robocop} marches stiffly {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut, visor glowing, and reads a *bug* its rights for stirring a *cauldron* without a permit. His targeting display flashes a warning as the steam rises, and his knees begin to **melt**. \"Directive four,\" he says, sinking, \"no citizen may **melt** an officer,\" and he arrests the *bug* very politely from a silver puddle."],"惯":["used to","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} exactly when he means to, as he does every day, pipe lit and robes dripping. A swan in a *string of coins* hisses, he taps his staff to make it jingle a tune, and his *standing heart*, hopping along beside him, does not even skip. \"You get **used to** it,\" he mutters; after centuries of wizardry you get **used to** anything."],"享":["enjoy","{Shrek} shuffles into the {Basement} of the {Stadium} to hide from the noise and finds a *feast* of onions, slugs and swamp soup laid out just for him. Alone at last, he belches a happy roar and starts to **enjoy** it, layer by layer. Then Donkey trots in, talking nonstop, and Shrek stuffs an onion in his mouth so he can **enjoy** the silence too."],"戴":["wear","{Darth Vader} sweeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, breathing loudly, and with the Force lifts a *lance* that carries a *strange mask* on its tip. He floats the mask down and, disapproving of everything else on the shelf, clamps it over his helmet to **wear** it. It fits badly, his breathing now whistles through its nose, and he booms at the towels that they too will **wear** one."],"童":["child","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut on a vine, where a *schoolkid* sits doing homework. Raised by apes, he decides this small **child** must be a lost baby gorilla, tucks the **child** under one arm and gives his jungle yell. The *schoolkid* giggles and hangs on, and they sail off over the water while a monkey finishes the maths."],"犹":["as if","{Yoshi} sits {Inside} the {Boathouse} when a *prowling dog* comes sniffing after the *wart* on his nose. His tongue whips out, swallows the dog, and he lays it as a spotted egg, then sits on it **as if** nothing has happened. The egg barks. Yoshi gazes out of the window, **as if** eggs bark every day, and the wart wobbles with the effort of not laughing."],"乘":["ride","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Jungle} with his kite, and a *rider* on an elephant shouts that he may **ride** too. He climbs up, good grief, and the elephant instantly sits down, then stands up the moment he slides off. Every time he tries to **ride**, it happens again, while Snoopy rolls past on a tortoise, looking smug."],"挂":["hang","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park} clutching a *jade tablet* and taps his staff, whereupon a magic *helping hand* shoots out of the plughole. It tries to **hang** the tablet on a wet hook, but it slides off. Muttering a cranky spell, he makes the tablet float up and **hang** in mid-air, along with his pointy hat and most of his beard."],"奖":["prize","{James Bond} saunters into the {Basement} of the {Stadium}, where a *big man* guards a golden trophy, the grand **prize**. Bond clicks a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing: it swaps whatever it points at for a rubber chicken. The *big man* now hugs the chicken, and Bond strolls off, unruffled, with the real **prize** under his arm and one eyebrow raised."],"绍":["introduce","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and, with one look at the *silk thread* on a *town crier*'s sleeve, deduces everybody's entire life. The crier ties the thread from guest to guest and begs him to **introduce** them. \"Elementary,\" he says with a smug puff of his pipe, and he begins to **introduce** each stranger by their secrets, while Watson trails behind, apologising."],"厚":["thick","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} holding a doughnut as **thick** as a mattress, his dim scheme for never being hungry again. A small *child* asks for a bite and cannot get her teeth through the icing. \"Mmm…\" says Homer, eating deeper until he is wedged in it to the ears, and the **thick** ring jams him in the door with a \"D'oh!\""],"纵":["vertical","{Zorro} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} hut and slashes his rapier straight up the wall, drawing only the long **vertical** stroke of a Z. A *silk thread* falls from the cut, and a *follower* in a small mask climbs it hand over hand. Zorro tugs the thread stiff and **vertical** as a flagpole, laughs, and vanishes upward past him."],"障":["block","The {Joker} skips into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and finds his way stopped by a *hillside* that has slid in overnight, with a guard on top flashing a shiny *badge* to **block** him. He cackles and squirts his flower, and the badge spins round to show a smiley face. The guard tries to **block** him again, but steps on a whoopee cushion and rolls down the slope."],"讯":["news","{Shrek} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} hut, wanting peace, but a *swift* dives through the window with a *small speech bubble* in its beak. It bursts above his head with terrible **news**: Donkey has found him. Shrek roars, which only brings Donkey galloping in with more **news**, and he will not shut up about any of it."],"涉":["wade","{Sherlock} examines the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, ankle-deep in *water drops*, and deduces from one damp crumb that the tap was left on by a left-handed sailor. He must **wade** across with his violin held high, testing every *step* with his magnifying glass. \"Elementary,\" he says as the floor drops away, and Watson, trailing behind, has to **wade** after him, carrying the pipe."],"彻":["thorough","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} leaving muddy *footsteps* and decides, for once, to clean up in a **thorough** way. He scrubs every tile, and at last makes one proud *cut* through the tangled kite string in the drain. That string was holding the pipes together, good grief, and the flood is so **thorough** that it washes the zigzag off his shirt."],"刊":["publish","{Kermit} stands in {Front} of the {Mansion}, flailing his arms at a chaos of wet newspapers on a *drying rack*, because the show's paper must **publish** tonight. A *standing knife* hops along trimming every page crooked. \"Yaaay!\" he yells, tossing armfuls at the crowd, and he hops on the rack to **publish** a new edition every hour, each one just a picture of him panicking."],"丈":["ten feet","The {Joker} prances into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} leaning on an old *walking staff*, then flips it over to reveal a trigger with a huge grin painted on it. He presses it and, with a rude honk, the staff shoots up **ten feet**, carrying his purple hat to the rafters. A little flag pops out reading **ten feet**, and he cackles as he jumps for it."],"爆":["explode","{Batman} grapples into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and finds a *campfire* crackling in the tub, with a *heatwave* pouring off it. In the heat his batarangs begin to **explode** with little pops of black confetti. \"Stay calm,\" he growls, as the utility belt itself starts to **explode**, shooting grappling hooks and one very small Batmobile out through the window."],"乌":["crow","{Walter White} sets up a class experiment in {Front} of the {Pool}, beakers gleaming, to turn one black *crow* perfectly white. He pours his precise mixture and, with a fizz, the **crow** turns shocking pink while the class gasps. Proud and furious, he corrects the ratio by one drop, and now the **crow** is blacker than his hat, cawing at him for marks."],"役":["labour","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a sergeant waves a *war club* at a mountain of wet sand and shouts for hard **labour**. Muddy *footsteps* march away from the job, so Yoshi does it his way: he swallows the sand in huge licks and lays it out as neat egg after egg. Hours of **labour** later, the whole beach has been rebuilt in spots."],"描":["trace","{Mario} bounces {Inside} the {Cat Café} and head-butts a block, and out drop a coin and a sheet of thin paper. A *helping hand* lays it over a tray of *young crop* seedlings and starts to **trace** every leaf. \"Wahoo!\" he shouts, stomping the table, and each stomp jolts the pencil, so it must **trace** them all again, this time with a moustache on every sprout."],"洗":["wash","{Shrek} stamps into the {Basement} of the {Beach} house and finds a muddy *front runner* from the marathon dripping on his carefully kept swamp slime. Furious, he roars so hard that *water drops* burst from the pipes, and he grabs a sponge to **wash** the man. Layer by layer, like an onion, he has to **wash** off the mud, while Donkey keeps asking if he may be next."],"玛":["agate","{Mario} drops through a warp pipe into the {Basement} of the {Spa}, where a *king* sits on a *horse* in a mud bath. He jumps up, head-butts the floating block above them, and instead of a coin out pops a striped **agate**. The *horse* snorts, the *king* claps for more, and with a \"Wahoo!\" he keeps bashing until one glossy **agate** after another pings into the mud."],"患":["suffer","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} eating a *kebab* snatched from a swan's picnic, while his *heart* thumps in protest. \"Mmm…\" he says, and then he begins to **suffer**, with a stomach ache as wide as the pond. His dim cure is a second kebab. \"D'oh!\" he moans, and the *heart* goes on making him **suffer** while the swans line up to watch."],"妙":["wonderful","{Mario} bounces into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and finds a *woman* dusting a mushroom with a *pinch* of golden powder. He gulps it, grows to the size of a wardrobe and shouts \"Wahoo!\", and everything turns **wonderful**: coins rain from the taps and cats surf his moustache. The woman adds another *pinch*, and the day gets so **wonderful** that even the soap applauds."],"镜":["mirror","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} for the grand *finale*, and Q's bow tie flicks open into a shiny **mirror**. In it he spots a thug creeping up behind him. He flips a handful of *gold coins* at the glass, they ricochet past his ear and bop the thug on the nose, and Bond, never turning round, smooths his hair in the **mirror**."],"唱":["sing","{Charlie Brown} mopes into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and opens his *mouth* to **sing** for the school concert, and of course it goes wrong: a *double sun* blazes through the window and both suns boo him. He tries one sad little note. Good grief, Snoopy dances on the sink, the suns start to **sing** louder, and Charlie gets the only part with no words."],"烦":["annoyed","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Mansion} after walking for months and sits by a *campfire* on the landing, only to have a *page* of Sam's endless poem flutter out and stick to his face. He peels it off, weary and **annoyed**, and another lands. Even the Ring feels **annoyed**, and whispers that it could make him invisible to poetry."],"签":["sign","{Chewbacca} looms in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, where an *assembly* of bankers holds out *bamboo* pens and begs him to **sign** a loan for his broken ship. He roars a long roar only friends understand, snaps every pen in his huge fist and, for want of ink, presses one hairy paw to the contract. Now all the bankers must **sign** with paw prints too."],"仙":["immortal","{Shrek} stomps in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} to complain about a *standing person* floating over the *mountain* behind it, eating clouds. \"I am **immortal**,\" says the old man, \"and I will never leave you alone.\" Shrek roars, which only ruffles the old man's robes, and he groans that an **immortal** neighbour is even worse than Donkey."],"彼":["that","{Batman} prowls into the {Basement} of the {Beach} house, following sandy *footsteps* to a heap of buckets with an old *hide* draped over them. He sweeps his detective scanner across and growls, \"Not this clue, **that** one.\" He fires his grappling hook over there, the *hide* flaps up, and nothing is under it. \"No,\" he growls, pointing further away, \"**that** one.\""],"弗":["not","{Frodo} plods {Inside} the {Pool} on sore hairy feet, and a giant *dollar sign* blocks the ladder and shakes itself: **not** today. He slips on the Ring and vanishes, tiptoeing past, but it rings like a till and sniffs him out. It booms that **not** even an invisible hobbit swims free, so weary Frodo sits down on the edge with Sam."],"症":["illness","The {Joker} prances into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} clinic, wheels a *sickbed* up to a chalk *goal line*, and declares that a monkey has a terrible **illness**: laughing fits. He pins a squirting flower on its chest and shows a trick card as the chart. The monkey giggles so hard it rolls over the line, and everybody catches the silly **illness**, cackling till the palm trees shake."],"仿":["imitate","{Frodo} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, and a *standing person* starts to **imitate** every weary step, even the hairy-footed limp. Frodo slips on the Ring and vanishes, so the copycat holds up a cardboard *square* and hides behind it. The *square* sighs when he sighs. Sam wanders in, cannot tell whom to follow, and ends up trying to **imitate** them both."],"倾":["tilt","{Chewbacca} stomps in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and finds a *standing person* with a *tilted head*, peering at the ring he has just repaired with ship parts. Insulted, he yanks out one bolt with a roar, and the whole arena begins to **tilt**. The boxers slide, the crowd slides, and the person just smiles, since at last everything shares the same **tilt** as his neck."],"牌":["sign board","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Island} hut with a *wood slice* on his back, and a Thunderbolt scorches letters into it, making a smoking **sign board** that reads PIKA. A big paper *fan* flaps it cool, and he hangs it up. Trainers come to read it and throw a Poké Ball at him, so he sparks out and points proudly at the next **sign board**: PIKA again."],"陷":["trap","{Shrek} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, hoping for a moment alone, but a *hillside* of coins gives way under his feet and drops him into a *trap pit*. He roars, and the **trap** only sinks deeper. Donkey leans over the edge and starts to chat, and Shrek realises that the real **trap** is that he cannot get away from him."],"鸟":["bird","{Naruto} bursts into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} in his orange jumpsuit, promising to save one tiny *bird* from the prowling cats. With a loud shout he makes a hundred shadow clones, every one flapping and squawking as a decoy **bird**. The cats pounce in a heap, each clone vanishes with a pop, and the real **bird** perches on his headband, unimpressed."],"轰":["bang","{Homer} naps in {Front} of the {Lagoon} hut when a runaway *cart* rolls up, full of doughnut-shaped fireworks. He grabs one with *both hands*, thinks \"Mmm…\" and takes a bite. A huge **bang** flings him across the water with a \"D'oh!\", and another **bang** sends the cart spinning skywards, with all the fish leaping up to watch."],"咱":["we","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier {Inside} the {Mansion}, masked and laughing, and slashes a giant Z into the curtains. Out of the slash pop a talking *mouth* and a sniffing *nose*, who shout that **we** all ride with him now. He sweeps his cape round them, the butler and the black horse, laughs that **we** are all masked tonight, and vanishes, taking everyone along."],"菜":["vegetable","{Cookie Monster} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, where a *fruit picker* is plucking cabbages from *grass* growing out of the tub. \"Eat your **vegetable**,\" says the picker, so Cookie Monster shouts \"Me want cookie!\" and crunches a carrot by mistake in a spray of orange crumbs. His googly eyes spin in horror, and he lets out a small wail: \"Me just eat **vegetable**.\""],"闭":["close","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a tiny *green shoot* has wedged an iron *gate* ajar. He fires his grappling hook, hauls, and the *gate* slams with a boom to **close** on his cape. Brooding in the dark, pinned at the neck, he decides to **close** his eyes and pretend that this was the plan."],"奋":["strive","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, whose back door opens on a muddy *rice field* where a *big man* is stuck up to his knees. Weary and reluctant, Frodo takes the next step anyway, because that is how hobbits **strive**: one hairy foot after another, for months. The *big man* is shamed into pulling free and starts to **strive** too, and Sam ends up carrying them both."],"庆":["celebrate","{Chewbacca} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, roaring with joy because his ship has flown at last, and lifts a *big man* clean off the floor in a hairy hug. Then he rips a *shed* apart with his bare hands for confetti, because that is how he likes to **celebrate**. The *big man* cheers, splinters rain down, and everyone must **celebrate** until his crossbow fires a streamer."],"撤":["withdraw","{Charlie Brown} runs into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} for the kick of his life, with the football waiting on the sink. At the last second a *helping hand* pulls it back, as it does every time, and he flies past it. \"Good grief,\" he groans from the floor, as the hand starts to **withdraw** the towels and the soap as well, and all his hopes **withdraw** through the door."],"泪":["tears","{Lara Croft} climbs down into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and finds an ancient stone *eye* guarding a relic behind a locked door. Its lid trickles *water drops*, and she works out that the lock opens only when the bowl beneath is full of **tears**. She tells it a very sad story, ponytail swinging, and as the door grinds open she backflips over a flood of **tears**."],"茶":["tea","{Charlie Brown} sits {Inside} the {Spa} hoping someone will share his **tea**, but with his luck the only leaves he can find are *grass* clippings from the lawn. Good grief: the kettle whistles, the *grass* swells up and bursts out of the spout, and Lucy pulls the cup away just as he reaches for it. Snoopy drinks his **tea**, of course."],"疾":["disease","{James Bond} lounges {Inside} the {Beach} house, tuxedo spotless, in spite of a blazing *fever*. Q's pocket gadget diagnoses any **disease** and does one absurd thing: it inflates the patient's bow tie. The tie swells up and floats him out over the sand, and he remarks, unruffled, that this **disease** is at least going places."],"缘":["fate","{Yoshi} pads {Inside} the {Mint} and spots a *hog* trailing a red *silk thread*, so out shoots his sticky tongue and down goes the pig. He lays it as an egg, but the thread still runs from the shell to his own toe. It must be **fate**: he flutter-jumps, he runs, and the egg bounces after him, until the *hog* hatches and moves in, bound to him by **fate**."],"播":["sow","{Batman} lands in {Front} of the {Fort} and loads a belt gadget that shoots seeds like tiny batarangs across a *footprint field*, while a mechanical *helping hand* tucks each one into a print. He growls that if you **sow** a clue in every footprint, the sunflowers will lead you to the culprit. By morning a bat-shaped hedge stands there, and he broods off to **sow** the next field."],"朗":["bright","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where an ancient puzzle says the hidden door opens only to the full *moon*. She climbs a wall, ponytail flying, and twists a bronze mirror until the *moon* pours through a crack and the room goes **bright** as noon. It gets so **bright** that a stone idol seems to squint, and the door slides open."],"杜":["stop","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, breathing loudly, where a *tree* is bursting up through the tiles in a fountain of *soil*. He raises one glove and Force-chokes the trunk until its leaves freeze in mid-air. \"You will **stop**,\" he booms, and it does. With one more twitch of his fingers he makes the taps, the echoes and even the drips **stop** as well."],"奶":["milk","{Naruto} crashes into the {Basement} of the {Island} hut demanding ramen, and a *woman* hands him a coconut tied with a *ribbon*, full of **milk** instead. Never one to give up, he spawns a hundred shadow clones, and each one shakes a coconut until the *ribbon* bursts and the **milk** flies everywhere. The *woman* sighs and ladles noodles into the puddle."],"季":["season","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and turns the dial on Q's new watch, which does one absurd thing: it changes the **season**. A *grain stalk* sprouts from the tub, turns gold and then frosty, and a *child* catches snowflakes in a bucket. He clicks again and spring returns, and Bond shrugs, noting that his tuxedo suits every **season**."],"丹":["red","{Darth Vader} stalks in {Front} of the {Mansion}, breathing loudly, and ignites his **red** lightsaber under a stone *archway*. The glow paints everything: the door, the cat, the toast. With the Force he lifts a pot *lid* and spins it overhead until it catches the beam and turns **red** as well, and he booms his disapproval of every other colour."],"狗":["dog","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} exactly when he means to, taps a *prowling dog* with his staff, and gives the **dog** a voice. It sits up and barks out one wise *quotation* after another until even a firework spell cannot silence it. \"You shall not pass,\" he snaps, but the **dog** just trots past him, quoting that back."],"尾":["tail","{Walter White} marches into the {Basement} of the {Lake} cottage with his beakers, where a *lying man* snores on a bench. One precise drop from the school experiment lands on the man's trousers and, with a fizz, *fur* sprouts and grows into a long **tail**. Walter checks his notes, proud of the science, and the **tail** wags and knocks the black hat off his head."],"仪":["ceremony","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Beach} house for the grand **ceremony**, where a *standing person* holds a velvet cushion and a *judge* in a wig raises a gold medal. Out flies the sticky tongue, and Yoshi swallows medal, cushion, wig and all. He lays them one by one as spotted eggs, to a blast of trumpets, and the *judge*, sighing, begins the **ceremony** again."],"偷":["steal","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Boathouse} and spots a *standing person* creeping away with a *dugout canoe*. Raised by apes, he is baffled by the whole idea, so the monkeys show him how to **steal**: they drop from the vines, tickle the thief and carry off the canoe. He gives a jungle yell of joy and goes off to **steal** it back from them."],"奔":["rush","{Batman} perches in {Front} of the {Funfair}, brooding, when a *big man* bursts out of the *shrubbery* and begins to **rush** toward the gates. He fires the grappling hook, misses, leaps into the Batmobile, and the two of them **rush** past the carousel, scattering candyfloss. The man stops at last: he was only late for the dodgems, and a gruff voice from the car just says, \"Noted.\""],"珠":["pearl","The {Joker} capers in {Front} of the {Pool}, where a *king* is polishing a tray of *red lacquer* with one giant **pearl** on it. Grinning, he swaps it for a trick one when nobody is looking. The king leans in to admire it, the fake **pearl** squirts him in the eye, and the Joker cackles and deals him a playing card."],"虫":["bug","{Charlie Brown} slumps {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut and finds his kite eaten, not by a tree this time, but by a *bug* the size of a hat. He shoos the **bug**, trips over Snoopy, and of course it comes back with a thousand friends. Good grief: the **bug** army lifts him off the floor and flies away wearing his zigzag shirt."],"驻":["station","The {Joker} skips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with a *horse* in a party hat and a lit *candle*, declaring the sink his secret **station**. He orders the horse to **station** itself by the taps and not budge. It stands guard all night, huffing at a trick *candle* that keeps relighting, while he cackles behind the shower curtain."],"孔":["hole","{Kermit} hops into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} hut to set the stage and falls straight through a *hole*. Arms flailing, he bounces back up, and a spotlight finds another **hole**, then dozens, with a singing fish popping out of each. \"Yaaay!\" he yells, strumming his banjo, and the show goes on around the biggest **hole** of all."],"宜":["suitable","{Yoshi} flutters {Inside} the {Beach} house into a *cozy room* that plumps its cushions and dims its lamps, and he looks for a place to lay an egg. The sofa is too bouncy and the shelf too high, so he swallows both and lays them as eggs. Only a soft rug is left: perfectly **suitable**. He curls up on it, and the crabs nod that it is **suitable**."],"艾":["mugwort","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, wanting a friend, and finds a bundle of *mugwort* drying on a line. The villagers burn **mugwort** to chase away ghosts, so they scream in terror and wave the smoking *mugwort* at him. He just sniffs it, turns invisible, and reappears in a **mugwort** crown, asking if anyone wants to play."],"桥":["bridge","{Chewbacca} thunders {Inside} the {Cat Café} and finds the cats stuck at a stream. With a roar he rips a *tree* out by the roots, lashes it to two *stilts* and fixes the **bridge** with ship bolts. The cats stare, unimpressed, so he lies down and makes himself the **bridge**, and three hundred paws walk over his hairy back."],"淡":["bland","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, where a pot of soup bubbles on a *blaze*. He raises a glove and floats up *water drops* from every tap, dropping them in until the pot holds ten gallons of nothing. One sip through the helmet grille and he booms that it is **bland**, that he finds its lack of flavour disturbing, and that **bland** is the dark side of soup."],"翼":["wing","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, legs pedalling, but cannot stay up. He licks up *feathers* and a *strange mask* with his sticky tongue, swallows the lot, and lays an egg that hatches into one huge **wing**. It straps to his back with the mask glaring from the tip, and he soars, but with only one **wing** he just circles the ice-cream van."],"恨":["hate","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, doughnut in hand, and a *standing heart* gives him a furious *glare*. It is his own heart, and it could not **hate** anything more than doughnuts. His dim scheme is to feed it one and make friends. \"Mmm…\" it goes, then \"D'oh!\", and now they **hate** each other, fighting over the last bite."],"繁":["numerous","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Mansion} and finds an *acrobat* tumbling through a *silk skein* that unravels into threads as **numerous** as the miles behind him. Weary, he starts counting them, the way he counts his long steps, while Sam sighs. The Ring glints, and the threads grow more **numerous** still, tangling round his hairy feet."],"寒":["cold","{Homer} snores {Inside} the {Mansion}, sure that his dim plan to save on heating has worked: he has sold the *roof*. It flaps away on a crane and a blizzard pours in, so **cold** that the doughnut in his hand freezes solid. \"D'oh!\" he mumbles, his bald head gleaming with frost, and the **cold** turns the word into an icicle that drops on his toe."],"伴":["companion","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and finds a *standing person* holding only *half* a friendship bracelet, looking for a **companion**. Gruff as ever, he growls that he works alone, then scans the bracelet with a belt gadget and, in one swing of his grappling hook, returns with its owner. The pair click together, and he broods on the edge of the tub, wishing he had a **companion** too."],"叹":["sigh","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} on a vine, baffled by the taps, and a statue with a huge *mouth* lets out a **sigh** so big that he swings straight back out again. A stone *right hand* pats it on the back. He gives his jungle yell to cheer it up, but it answers with a second **sigh** that blows him through the window, vine and all."],"旦":["dawn","{Darth Vader} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} at midnight, breathing loudly. He raises a glove and with the Force hauls a *sunrise* up over the windowsill three hours early, blazing orange. \"I find your lateness disturbing,\" he booms at the **dawn**, and the terrified **dawn** hurries across the tiles, apologising to every rooster."],"愈":["recover","{Yoshi} paddles a *dugout canoe* into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where a cracked *heart* lies groaning on a cushion. He swallows it with one lick, flutters round the room to digest, and lays it as a warm spotted egg, the quick way to **recover**. The shell breaks, the *heart* thumps loudly in the canoe, and even the dinosaurs next door begin to **recover** their good mood."],"潮":["tide","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Tower} to fly his kite for the *royal court*, but *water drops* start seeping up the stairs. That is the **tide**, rising just for him. Good grief: it rolls his kite out of the window and drags his shoes in and out, and just as he runs up to kick his football, the **tide** carries it away."],"粮":["grain","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Stadium}, ponytail flying, to crack an ancient puzzle: a stone tray holds a *good meal*, and the slab beside it wants its weight in **grain**. She pours in *rice* from a relic jar and the slab clicks, but as usual it is a trap. A rolling boulder chases her across the pitch, spraying **grain** in all directions as she somersaults clear."],"缩":["shrink","{Sailor Moon} skids in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, trips over a *silk thread* and, wailing, pulls out her moon wand for a very long sparkly transformation. The sparkles hit an *inn* tied up in the thread, and it starts to **shrink**, windows, guests and all. Luna sighs, Sailor Moon delivers her speech about justice, and by the last word even her pigtails **shrink**."],"罢":["stop","{Batman} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and fires a belt gadget overhead, and a *dropped net* falls over the steam room. He growls in his gruffest voice that the music, the massage and the bubbles must all **stop**, because he is detecting a clue. It turns out to be a bath bomb, and when it fizzes, even his brooding has to **stop**."],"聚":["gather","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and clicks Q's magnetic cufflink, which does one absurd thing: it makes statues **gather** round him. Knights, mummies and one stone horse shuffle in and form a *gathering*, blocking the sinks. Bond, unruffled, tells them to **gather** closer, then walks up their shoulders and out of the window."],"径":["path","{James Bond} escapes into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring}, and Q's shoes leave glowing *footsteps* for one absurd purpose: they mark the only safe **path**. Laser beams criss-cross the tiles and a pit yawns by the sink. He strolls along the **path**, unruffled, until it ends at a blank wall, so he presses his bow tie and the wall politely opens."],"恰":["exactly","{Chewbacca} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} to repair a ship's fuel tank, and his huge hands snap a *fitted lid* on **exactly**, with a tiny click. His *standing heart* thumps with loyal pride. He roars with joy, tries it on a fountain, a bell and a pigeon, and it fits each one **exactly**, which makes him roar even louder."],"挑":["choose","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, where a *helping hand* holds out a tray of eggs, each with a *cracked shell*, and tells him to **choose**. Raised by apes, he grunts to each egg in turn and asks a passing parrot for advice, and they all argue back. He gives his jungle yell and, unable to **choose**, scoops up the lot to raise as a family."],"袋":["bag","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, where his *stand-in* is practising loud breathing and knotting a black *robe* into a **bag**. Vader waves a hand, and with the Force towels and seashells float over, filling the **bag** until it sways. The *stand-in* staggers off under it, still wheezing, while Vader booms his disapproval at the knot."],"灰":["ash","{Homer} dozes in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, with a dim scheme to toast his doughnut on a smoking chimney pipe. A cough of grey *ash* blasts out over him, the doughnut and a whole queue of patients. He takes a bite anyway. \"Mmm… **ash**,\" he says, then \"D'oh!\", and he sneezes **ash** all down the line."],"捕":["catch","{Batman} crawls into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, following a wet trail to a *seedbed* where a runaway rubber duck is hiding. A mechanical *helping hand* springs from his utility belt to **catch** it, and grabs the duck, his cape and, with a squeak, three lifeguards. He growls from the tangle that he will always **catch** his duck."],"徐":["slowly","{Shrek} plods {Inside} the {Museum} so **slowly** that his *footsteps* echo for minutes, because he is carrying a tray of onion *leftovers* and would like nobody to talk to him. Donkey trots rings around him, chattering about every mummy. Shrek just breathes, growls and moves **slowly** on, hoping that if he is boring enough, the donkey will give up."],"珍":["treasure","The {Joker} capers in {Front} of the {Funfair}, where a *king* is combing his *thick hair*, his dearest **treasure**. Grinning, the Joker offers him a trick comb. One stroke and out tumble rubber rubies, squirting coins and a honking gold crown. The king gasps, the **treasure** squeaks, and the Joker cackles and takes a long, purple bow."],"幕":["curtain","{Mario} bounces into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a warp pipe hidden behind a thick **curtain** of *grass*. \"Wahoo!\" he shouts, jumping to head-butt the pole, and coins fall as the **curtain** swishes open and shut with each bump. The *grass* tickles his moustache, and from behind it a lone Toad starts to applaud."],"映":["reflect","{Yoshi} flutters into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} with a wooden *yoke* across his back, hung with eggs he has just laid from swallowed mirrors. The *sun* hits them through the window, and the eggs **reflect** it into every corner. Boxers squint and swing at the towels, and the more he waddles, the more the swaying eggs **reflect** sunbeams right into their eyes."],"裂":["crack","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a *lineup* of yetis stands flexing round a relic: one ancient *robe*. She climbs over them, tugs the *robe* from its hook, and a **crack** races across the stone floor, as ancient traps do. She backflips over a rolling boulder as the **crack** widens, and the yetis applaud with their huge paws."],"泰":["peaceful","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, mid-yell, and stops dead: a *spring planter* sits by the window with *splashing water* trickling over its flowers. Apes doze, parrots hum and even the snakes share a towel. It is so **peaceful** that he lets go of his vine and whispers his jungle yell, and the whole jungle gently whispers back, a **peaceful** ahh."],"隔":["separate","{Gandalf} strides {Inside} the {Hut}, where two goats are fighting on a *hillside* that has rolled in through the door. \"You shall not pass!\" he roars, striking his staff, and a giant *cauldron* crashes down to **separate** them. They butt it with a bong. Cranky now, he lights his pipe, then conjures another to **separate** the hens from the cabbages."],"启":["open","{Chewbacca} crouches in the {Basement} of the {Beach} house at a jammed ship's *door* with a painted *mouth* that demands a password. He growls it nicely, but only friends understand him, so the *mouth* stays shut. In a temper he roars, grabs the hatch and rips it **open**, and the *mouth*, terrified, yawns **open** too, letting in a wave of sand and crabs."],"尖":["sharp","{James Bond} stands unruffled in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *big man* blocks the door. Q's pen does one absurd thing: it sharpens itself, shaving *crumbs* of wood, until it is so **sharp** that it pokes a hole in a cloud. Rain falls on the man alone, and Bond strolls past, remarking that he likes his wit **sharp** and his suit dry."],"忠":["loyal","The {Joker} lounges in {Front} of the {Lagoon} hut, flicking trick cards at a *bullseye* painted on a giant *heart*. Each card pops out a paper flower, and the *heart* just beats happily, **loyal** as a puppy. He squirts it, tickles it and honks at it, and it follows him all the way home, **loyal** to the end of the prank."],"累":["tired","{Lara Croft} climbs down into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake}, ponytail drooping and **tired** out after nine tombs. She collapses on a relic *yarn pile*, which slowly rolls after her like a fluffy boulder, as ancient traps must. She is too **tired** to run, so she lets it flatten her gently and falls asleep under the wool.","lèi"],"炎":["inflammation","{Yoshi} pads {Inside} the {Mansion} and, with one lick, swallows a *blaze* off the banister. Bad idea: his throat swells up red, hot and puffy with a nasty **inflammation**. He lays it as a steaming egg, which rolls down the stairs and cracks on the butler's thumb, and now the butler has a glowing **inflammation** too."],"暂":["temporary","{Zorro} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} on the towel rail and slices a Z into a *chopping block*, where a tiny *sun* sits frying eggs. That Z is only **temporary**, he laughs, since the heat fades it in seconds. He cuts another, then another, then vanishes in a swirl of cape, because his visits, like the sun's, are strictly **temporary**."],"估":["estimate","{Gandalf} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Pool} as a *standing person* holds up a dusty *antique* vase and begs him to **estimate** its worth. He taps it with his staff, and fireworks of tiny numbers burst out: three hundred years, five gold pieces, give or take a dragon. Cranky and wise, he declines to **estimate** anything else until someone brings him tea."],"泛":["float","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} after a very long walk, and the sink overflows with *water drops*. Too weary to take another step, he flops on a *flat tyre* and lets it **float** him past the towels, hairy feet dangling. The Ring tugs, he goes invisible, and all anyone sees is a tyre starting to **float** out of the door, with Sam paddling after it."],"荒":["barren","{Homer} slouches in {Front} of the {Swamp}, sure that his dim scheme will grow a doughnut tree on a *wasteland*. The land is **barren**: no frogs, no mud, one dry tumbleweed. He buries a doughnut and takes a nap while it grows, and a goat eats it. \"D'oh!\" he yells at the **barren** ground, then lies down to sleep some more."],"偿":["repay","{Charlie Brown} sulks {Inside} the {Hangar}, where a *standing person* runs a *taste test* and has just handed him the bill for one bite. Good grief, he wants to **repay** it, so he counts out his pennies, which roll down a drain. He offers his kite, but a passing tree eats it. He will **repay** it, he sighs, in about a hundred years."],"横":["horizontal","{Homer} flops {Inside} the {Jungle} camp, **horizontal** on a fallen *tree*, because lying down is his favourite thing. An egg *yolk* drips from a nest onto his bald head. \"Mmm…\" he says, not moving, and licks it off. The trunk starts to roll downhill, and with a \"D'oh!\" he spins all the way to the river, proudly **horizontal** to the end."],"拒":["refuse","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, and a *helping hand* holds up a wooden *set square* like a stop sign. Bond offers his most charming one-liner, then Q's talking cufflink, then a bow tie that plays a tango, but the hand goes on to **refuse** each one with a poke. Nobody ever dares to **refuse** him, so he raises one eyebrow and escapes through the window."],"瑞":["lucky","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *king* holds a pot with a single *sprout tip*. His targeting display reads it as a four-leaf clover, one hundred percent **lucky**, and he politely places it under arrest. At once his handcuffs fall off, the *king* wins the raffle and his stiff knee starts working: a **lucky** day for everyone."],"忆":["recall","{Yoshi} pads into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a *swan* rests its head on a *standing heart*, and he swallows the pair with one lick. He lays them as an egg, and when it cracks, out float sandcastles and ice cream and one old holiday the heart had tried to **recall**. The *swan* honks, and now Yoshi can **recall** where he buried his favourite melon."],"孤":["lonely","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Pool} exactly when he means to, finding a *child* alone with one giant *melon*, the most **lonely** sight in the land. He taps the fruit with his staff, and it grows eyes, a mouth and a grumpy voice. The *child* laughs, the melon chatters, and the old wizard, left out now, smokes his pipe, feeling rather **lonely** himself."],"鼻":["nose","{Batman} crouches {Inside} the {Beach} house examining a giant *nose* on a wooden *serving stand*. The detective in him scans for clues with a belt gadget, and its beep tickles the **nose** until it rumbles. One colossal sneeze blasts him out through the window, cape flapping, and, gliding back, he growls that he never forgets a **nose**."],"闹":["noisy","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} through an iron *gate*, yelling that he will be the greatest ninja, and his hundred shadow clones set up a *market* selling ramen. They all shout at once, and it is so **noisy** that the taps rattle. A real ninja would hush, but he only yells louder, and the place gets even more **noisy**."],"羊":["sheep","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Hangar} and finds a *sheep* chewing on a jet's wing. Out flies his tongue, down goes the **sheep**, and seconds later he lays a fat woolly egg, which bleats. He flutters off for more, and the pilot comes back to a floor of bleating eggs, with one fluffy **sheep** after another hatching out on the runway."],"呆":["dull","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Island} hut, breathing loudly, facing a parrot with a *blank stare*. He lifts coconuts with the Force, ignites his lightsaber, even announces that he is its father. The *blank stare* never blinks. \"How **dull**,\" he booms, and it is so **dull** that he sits down on a coconut and sulks under his cape."],"厉":["strict","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and finds an ancient *whetstone* guarding a relic, the most **strict** guardian in any tomb. One wrong tile and it grinds out a warning, one stray drip and a boulder rolls. She flips across in perfect form, and the **strict** old stone still scrapes out a demand that she dry her boots."],"衡":["weigh","{Homer} wanders {Inside} the {Jungle} clearing to a *crossroads*: doughnuts down one track, a hammock down the other. A monkey hands him a balance scale so that he can **weigh** the two. He eats one doughnut to be fair, then another. \"Mmm…\" he says, trying to **weigh** them again, until the scale tips over on his foot with a \"D'oh!\""],"胞":["womb","{Batman} lands in {Front} of the {Tower} under the *moon* and detects, with a belt gadget, a tiny heartbeat in a brown *parcel*. Gruffly he unwraps it and finds a baby star curled up warm, as if in a **womb**. He ties it up again to keep it snug, growling that every star needs a **womb**, and the *moon* glows approval over his cape."],"零":["zero","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a *herald* reads from a stone tablet in the *rain*: the ancient dial on the corner post opens only at **zero**. She climbs the ropes, ponytail dripping, and spins it round until it clicks. A hidden door grinds open on a chest that holds exactly **zero** relics, and the herald politely blows his trumpet."],"穷":["poor","{Chewbacca} lumbers {Inside} the {Youth Club} and down a damp *cave*, where a *strong arm* pokes out of the wall holding an empty bowl: so **poor**. Huge and loyal, he rips open his bandolier and pours out every spare bolt. The arm pockets them, then waves the bowl again. He growls, because now he is **poor** as well."],"舍":["give up","{Sherlock} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Hut}, magnifying glass raised, to find the whole *hut* trying to walk away on chicken legs. From one crumb he deduces everything except why, and for the first time Watson begs him to **give up**. \"Never,\" he says smugly, and then the *hut* sits on his violin and he sadly agrees to **give up**."],"码":["number","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe into the {Basement} of the {Spa}, where a *horse* stands over a *stone* tablet. Each time he head-butts the block above it, a coin drops out with a **number** on it, and the *horse* stamps the same into the *stone*. \"Wahoo!\" he shouts, stomping in delight, until he reaches the **number** 100 and a green mushroom bounces off his cap."],"赫":["impressive","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, where a giant warrior's glowing *red cheeks* shine like two suns. His dim scheme is to copy him, so he slaps on doughnut jam and flexes in the mirror. \"Mmm… **impressive**,\" he says, and the warrior's *red cheeks* flare brighter, which is even more **impressive**, until the jam slides off with a \"D'oh!\""],"婆":["granny","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Fort}, cheeks sparking, when an old *woman* rides a giant *wave* up the steps on a surfboard. She is a **granny** with a Poké Ball, and she catches him with her first throw. \"Pika!\" he squeals, and he shocks the ball open with a Thunderbolt, only for the **granny** to clap, curlers smoking, and catch him again."],"魂":["soul","{Homer} ambles {Inside} the {Casino} with a doughnut when a wispy *ghost* drifts out of a slot machine on a small *cloud*: the **soul** of a man who never won. Dim as ever, Homer offers to swap his own **soul** for one more doughnut. The *ghost* takes one look at him, sighs, hands him the doughnut for free and rides off on the *cloud*. \"Mmm…\" says Homer."],"灾":["disaster","{Zorro} leaps in {Front} of the {Island} hut, where a monkey has lit a *campfire* right under the *roof*. Sparks fly and the thatch catches: **disaster**. He slices a great Z through the rope of a water tank and, with a laugh, douses the lot, but the tank is full of lemonade. Now the island is sticky and smoking, a second **disaster**, and he vanishes on his black horse."],"洪":["flood","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut, while a hundred *joined hands* try to hold back the *water drops* seeping under the door. His dim scheme is to plug the gap with a doughnut. \"Mmm…\" he says, eating it instead. A **flood** pours in with a \"D'oh!\", and he surfs down the stairs on a door, riding the **flood** past the fish."],"腿":["leg","{Tarzan} swings down a vine into the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} and lets out his jungle yell, because a baffling plastic chair has swallowed his **leg**. An ape tugs, the vine hauls him up towards the *moon*, and halfway there it does a *u-turn* and whirls him back. Tarzan lands, wiggles the freed **leg** in triumph, and asks the chair, politely, what it wanted."],"胆":["courage","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} over a shaking stormtrooper who is afraid of the dark. Breathing loudly, Vader lifts the *moon* away with the Force and hauls up a *sunrise* in its place. \"You lack **courage**,\" he booms, and the trooper, glowing pink, finds just enough **courage** to pat the cape."],"津":["saliva","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Inn} and uncaps Q's latest gadget, a *writing brush* that paints anything into a lemon. Every guest's mouth fills with **saliva**, and *water drops* patter from their chins onto the paving stones. \"Shaken, not dribbled,\" says Bond, stepping unruffled across a river of **saliva**."],"俗":["custom","{Sailor Moon} skids {Inside} the {Pool} and meets a *standing person* in a deep *valley* in the tiles, who explains that the local **custom** is to bow to a fish before swimming. Mid-transformation, pigtails whirling, she trips, lands on the fish and cries loudly. Everyone applauds, and now the town's **custom** is a sparkly speech about justice followed by a belly flop."],"辩":["debate","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and hurls a batarang to end a *quarrel* between two bankers, but it only pins a *small speech bubble* to the wall. He yanks two podiums from his utility belt and growls that this is now a formal **debate**. Each bubble swells with numbers until it pops, and Batman wins the **debate** with one gruff word."],"胸":["chest","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Youth Club} so the teenagers will leave him alone, and the *moon* rattles in the sky. Each roar swells his green **chest** until a layer peels back like an onion and a tiny treasure *chest* pops out. Donkey, who will not shut up, climbs in to chat, so Shrek shuts him away in his **chest**."],"晓":["dawn","{Shrek} is snoring in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café}, wanting only to be left alone, when an *emperor* marches in with the *sun* on a tray and announces **dawn**. Cats yowl and coffee boils. Shrek roars, blows the sun out like a candle and rolls over, but Donkey keeps singing about **dawn** until it lights itself again."],"劲":["strength","{James Bond} adjusts a cufflink in the {Bathroom} of the {Inn}, and Q's gadget fires a rubber *strong arm* out of his sleeve. It has the **strength** of ten gorillas, ripping off the towel rail and arm-wrestling the taps. Bond, unruffled, shakes its hand, sails through the door, and lands remarking that such **strength** should come with a manual."],"贫":["poor","{Pikachu} trots {Inside} the {Inn} with one *cut cake* and one *shell*, so **poor** that his Poké Ball has no furniture. He pushes the shell across the counter as rent with a hopeful \"Pika?\" The innkeeper laughs, the shell skids back, his cheeks spark, and the cake toasts black. Still **poor**, Pikachu curls up in his ball and nibbles the burnt crumbs."],"仁":["kind","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Funfair} and his targeting display locks on a *standing person* laying *two planks* across a puddle so a duckling can cross. \"Directive four: be **kind**,\" he reads out stiffly, and politely arrests the puddle. The duckling waddles over, and Robocop, visor steaming, stamps every form **kind** in triplicate."],"偶":["by chance","{Casper} drifts through a wall into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, looking for a friend, and **by chance** meets a *standing person* and a *monkey*. He waves, they scream, run straight through him and collide. Both are wearing the same hat, so they become best friends, all **by chance**, while Casper sighs and floats off alone."],"辑":["compile","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} house behind a *cart* from Q, which has one absurd purpose: to **compile**. Every shell he loads lets out a *whisper* of crab gossip, and the cart staples each one into a secret file. Bond gives his name to a shell and that gets filed as well, so he escapes just as it starts to **compile** the whole coast into ten volumes."],"邦":["nation","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Hangar}, pins a flag to the lawn with a batarang, and broods until the grass becomes his own *country*. His utility belt holds everything a **nation** needs: stamps, tiny passports, a gruff anthem. The pigeons queue up, the Batmobile becomes the navy, and every plane must ask the **nation** for permission to land."],"恢":["restore","{Homer} dozes in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} until his doughnut burns to *ash* on his belly, and out of the pile rises a *standing heart* that can **restore** anything it beats upon. The doughnut comes back whole, mmm. Homer's dim scheme is to **restore** his hair, so he rubs the heart on his bald head and gets exactly two hairs. D'oh!"],"赖":["rely on","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} ruin and finds a *freeloader* lounging on her relic's pedestal, eating her snacks. Whenever a trap springs he yells that he will **rely on** her, so she cartwheels him past the spikes and hauls him up a cliff by her ponytail. The boulder rolls, he naps, and she sighs: he will always **rely on** her."],"圈":["circle","{Chewbacca} storms up in {Front} of the {Mint}, rips a *fence* out of the ground in a temper, then, being handy, bends it into a perfect **circle** and welds the ends. A *scroll* of repair notes unrolls itself all the way round. Coins roll out of the door and race around the **circle**, while he gives a proud growl only his friends understand."],"摸":["touch","{Mario} leaps in {Front} of the {Fort} at *sunset* and head-butts a block, but out pops a *helping hand* instead of a coin. It gives his moustache one gentle **touch**, and he grows as tall as the towers, just as a mushroom would make him. \"Wahoo!\" He stretches up to **touch** the sun itself, and it sizzles and pays out a coin."],"仰":["look up","{Yoshi} waddles through the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and finds a *standing person* whose *upward gaze* is stuck on the ceiling, so he has to **look up** too. His sticky tongue shoots skywards, swallows a dangling plane whole, and he lays it as a huge egg that rolls upwards. Now everyone who walks in must **look up** and wave at it."],"润":["moist","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} and reads out a directive: nothing may be **moist** during a *leap month*. The *water drops* ignore him, beading on his visor and squeaking in his knee joints. He politely arrests each one, but the handcuffs turn **moist** as well, and he slides away across the tiles, stiff as a plank."],"堆":["pile","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} and, with one raised glove, the Force lifts every clump of *soil* in the garden into a tall **pile**. A *sparrow* lands on top and cheerfully kicks one clump off. Vader's breathing grows louder, he booms his disapproval and lifts it back, the sparrow kicks again, and the whole **pile** starts to wobble."],"碰":["bump","{Pikachu} scurries into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} and settles *side by side* with a big round *stone*, which rolls over and gives him a **bump** on the cheek. Sparks fly, a Thunderbolt crackles, and the stone goes pinging off through the trees. Each **bump** lights up another startled monkey, and the jungle flashes like a pinball table."],"艇":["boat","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, over a flooded *courtyard*, and meets a *boat*. Baffled by civilisation, he beats his chest and asks the **boat** what it wants, and when his gorilla friend sits on it, it sinks. Tarzan yells across the water, and six crocodiles line up nose to tail as a much better **boat**."],"稍":["slightly","{Sherlock} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Tower}, magnifying glass trained on a *portrait* that hangs **slightly** crooked, with one *grain stalk* poking from the frame. From that alone he deduces a mouse, a bad carpenter and a thief. \"Elementary,\" he tells Watson, nudging it **slightly** to the left, and the entire tower tilts."],"迟":["late","{Charlie Brown} sprints down the *road* {Inside} the {Beehive}, already **late** for the big football kick, when a giant *ruler* drops across his path and smacks his zigzag shirt. Good grief. He reaches the field hours **late**, runs up anyway with his eyes shut, and the queen bee pulls the ball away."],"辆":["counter for vehicles","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} and faces an ancient puzzle: a stone *balance scale*, a *cart* on one pan, and a sealed door. The relic wants every vehicle numbered with its proper **counter for vehicles**, one 辆, two 辆. She slips once and a boulder rolls, so she scales the wall, ponytail flying, yelling the **counter for vehicles** at each passing truck."],"废":["abolish","{Frodo} trudges barefoot into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house, and the Ring whispers that he could **abolish** anything he likes. He slips it on, the rusty *shed* fades with a groan, and the *launch pad* on top sinks hissing into the water. Tempted, he is about to **abolish** Mondays and all stairs, when Sam gasps and he pulls it off, horrified."],"净":["clean","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} in a spotless tuxedo, where two teams play *tug of war* with a rope of *icicles*. He clicks Q's cufflink, which does only one thing: it makes everything **clean**. Icicles melt, mud vanishes and boxers squeak helplessly across the tiles, and Bond remarks that he likes his escapes squeaky **clean**."],"凶":["fierce","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Youth Club}, wanting to be left alone, and rigs the door with a *booby trap* of onions and rope. Snap! Out leaps a **fierce** guinea pig with teeth like nails, roaring straight back at him. The most **fierce** ogre in the swamp bolts round the lamp post, with Donkey chattering happily behind."],"署":["office","{Sherlock} strides into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and studies one damp crumb on the floor. \"Elementary, Watson: a secret tax **office**.\" Behind a *fishing net* of paperwork he finds a *busy man*, and the net flings forms at them both. Sherlock smugly deduces the man's whole life from his stapler, and still leaves the **office** with three forms to fill in."],"壁":["wall","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a *pioneer* is raising a **wall** out of wet *soil*. Growling that every cave needs one, Batman fires his grappling hook at the top and hauls himself up. The hook holds, but the whole **wall** folds over him like a heavy sandy cape, and he broods beneath it until low tide."],"御":["defend","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} as muddy *footsteps* march towards the crown jewels. A *porter* raises a suitcase to **defend** them, but Yoshi's tongue whips out, swallows every jewel and lays them as eggs too hard to crack. He hurls one at each thief to **defend** the hall, yelling his own name."],"奉":["offer","{Frodo} limps barefoot into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} temple, where monkeys kneel to **offer** his hairy feet a golden *tribute* of bananas and a tiny crown. Then the chief ape holds out a palm for the Ring. Trembling, Frodo very nearly does **offer** it, then slips it on and vanishes, leaving only damp footprints heading for the door."],"旋":["spin","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Mint} to find Donkey balancing on a giant *spinning top*, talking nonstop. Shrek's furious roar makes it **spin** faster, and coins fly off like sparks. His onion sandwich peels itself layer by layer as it whirls past. Donkey only talks louder, so Shrek roars again, and now the whole building starts to **spin**."],"冬":["winter","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Lagoon} with a fluffy *winter coat* over his cape, and it zips itself to his helmet. Each loud breath freezes in a cloud, and the water turns white beneath it: seals begin to skate. He booms his disapproval of **winter** and Force-chokes a snowman's carrot, but **winter** only settles more snugly on his shoulders."],"矿":["mine","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp} hut and finds a rickety *shed* over a deep **mine**, where he must stage a musical by tonight. Flailing his arms, he cues the miners, but a glowing *stone* rolls out and flattens the banjo. \"Yaaay!\" he screams in panic, and the whole **mine** collapses into wild applause."],"抬":["lift","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Island} theatre and, baffled by the *stage*, decides it is a fallen tree trapping his friends, because a *helping hand* is waving from under the boards. He gives his jungle yell, and elephants charge in to **lift** it. They **lift** the stage, the actors and the orchestra high in the air, to great applause."],"蛋":["egg","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and with the Force lifts a huge **egg** swaddled in a *bolt of cloth*. A *bug* knocks from within, so he bends close, breath rasping, and booms that he is its father. Crack! The **egg** falls open and out marches the bug in a tiny helmet, breathing loudly, wearing the cloth as a cape."],"晨":["morning","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Funfair} early one **morning**, just as the *sun* comes up, to fly his kite in peace. A giant *clam* yawns open on the carousel and snaps shut on the kite, the way trees always do. Good grief. Snoopy naps on the shell, and Charlie knows that every **morning** will end like this."],"伏":["lie low","{Frodo} crawls {Inside} the {Pool} on his hairy feet and hisses at Sam to **lie low**, for a *standing person* in a black robe is striding by, blowing a whistle. A *dog* comes sniffing along the tiles. Frodo slips on the Ring to **lie low** unseen, the dog sneezes all over his invisible toes, and the game is up."],"吹":["blow","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} with his kite and no wind at all, good grief. A huge *mouth* opens above him in a *yawn* and begins to **blow**. The kite soars at last, straight into a tree, which eats it, and one final **blow** knocks Charlie flat on his back."],"鸡":["chicken","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Beach} hut in his tuxedo as Q hands him a *bird*: a clockwork **chicken** with one absurd feature. Bond winds it with his *right hand*, it clucks, lays a smoke bomb, and he vanishes. When the smoke clears he is on a speedboat, unruffled, remarking that the **chicken** crossed the road first."],"倍":["times","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house, where a *standing person* has a *spitting mouth* that copies whatever it spits. He throws a batarang and it comes back two **times** over, then ten **times**. He growls and reaches for his utility belt, but the belt has now grown bigger than the Batmobile, and he can only brood."],"糊":["paste","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Pool} building with a dim scheme: mash *rice* into a **paste** and glue spare doughnuts to his belly for later, mmm. A passing cat's *whiskers* twitch into it and stick fast, then the cat, then Homer's hand. \"D'oh!\" He tries to lick himself free, the **paste** glues his tongue to a doughnut, and he calls this a success."],"秦":["Qin","{Chewbacca} lumbers {Inside} the {Inn} as a *spring planter* pushes up one *grain stalk* after another, and out of the soil march clay soldiers stamped **Qin**. He roars and rips an arm off the first in a temper. Then, feeling bad, he gets out his tools and fixes it, and the entire **Qin** army adopts him, growling along."],"盾":["shield","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} with his red lightsaber humming, and the gamblers raise a *shield* of poker tables. His blade hisses against it, the **shield** holds, and he booms his disapproval. With one raised glove he lifts it away by the Force and whirls it round himself as his own **shield**, and every flung chip bounces into the slot machines."],"杯":["cup","{Batman} crouches in {Front} of the {Lake} house, studying a *tree* that grows a teacup on every branch beside a *no sign*. He fires his grappling hook and snatches one **cup**, and the sign wails like an alarm. The tree weeps into the gap, so Batman, brooding, holds up the **cup** to catch its tears as evidence."],"租":["rent","{Zorro} gallops up in {Front} of the {Pool} building on his black horse, where a landlord demands **rent** for a *stepladder* made of *grain stalk* bundles. Slash, slash, slash: the rapier carves a huge Z through the bill, the ladder collapses into straw, and Zorro vanishes laughing. Next morning the landlord charges **rent** for the Z."],"骑":["ride","{Chewbacca} squeezes {Inside} the {Beach} house and tries to **ride** a *horse* that is a real *oddball*, in flippers and sunglasses, walking backwards. His hairy feet still touch the floor. He growls, unpacks his tools and bolts on a starship engine, and it blasts through the wall. Afterwards the horse insists on its turn to **ride** him home."],"乏":["tired","{Frodo} drags his hairy feet {Inside} the {Spa} after walking all the way from the Shire, rolling a *flat tyre* that Sam found on the road. He is so **tired** that the Ring feels as heavy as a piano. The tyre lets out a long sigh and flops across his lap, just as **tired**, and Sam carries them both to the steam room."],"隆":["grand","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Lagoon} palace, carved out of a whole *hillside*, and lifts the relic off its pedestal. The *hillside* rumbles, trumpets blare from stone mouths and a **grand** staircase unfolds, followed by the most **grand** rolling boulder ever carved. She backflips over it, ponytail flying, and takes a bow."],"诊":["diagnose","The {Joker} cackles in the {Basement} of the {Funfair} in a doctor's coat, peering into a clown's *thick hair* with a squirting flower as his stethoscope. A *small speech bubble* pops up over his green hair, ready to **diagnose** the patient. He deals a card from his trick deck, soaks the clown, and proudly goes on to **diagnose** a severe case of giggles."],"奴":["slave","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Pool} in his orange jumpsuit and finds a weary *drudge* lugging every towel for a lazy king, who calls him his **slave**. Refusing to give up, Naruto summons shadow clones by the dozen, and each grabs a towel. Then they all carry the king away, and the drudge dives in, nobody's **slave** ever again."],"摄":["take in","{Sherlock} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and with one glance begins to **take in** everything: mud on a boot, a crumb, a sigh. Behind the door an *eavesdropper* listens at the wall, while a *helping hand* stuffs stray words in a jar. \"Elementary,\" says Sherlock, who can **take in** the man's breakfast, birthday and cousin without looking up."],"丧":["lose","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and begins her long sparkly transformation, and with every twirl she starts to **lose** something: tiara, wand, one boot. Luna yells at her from the sink. She bursts into loud tears, spins faster to look for them, and by the final pose she has managed to **lose** the plane as well."],"污":["dirty","{Walter White} stands in {Front} of the {Pool} building in glasses and black hat, teaching a class with a *leaky pot* and a beaker. As *water drops* fall into the pool, he measures precisely how **dirty** they make it. He adds one exact reagent to clean it, and it foams up green. Dripping slime, he declares that this is precisely as **dirty** as science predicted."],"渡":["cross","{Darth Vader} reaches the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and must **cross** it without wetting his cape. With the Force he lifts a giant *thermometer* and lays it down as a bridge, but the *water drops* hiss against it and the red line starts to climb. Breathing loudly, he stalks on as it boils beneath him, and does **cross** with dignity intact."],"旗":["flag","{Chewbacca} lumbers {Inside} the {Beach} house and, in a temper, rips a curtain into one giant *square*. He ties it to a crossbow bolt and fires it into the sand, where it flaps as a **flag**. The crabs salute. Nobody but his friends can understand his roar, so nobody knows what country it is, and a seagull plants its own **flag** beside it."],"甘":["sweet","{Gandalf} strikes his staff in {Front} of the {Mansion} and casts a spell on a single *candy*. Lollipop trees burst from the paving stones, the rain turns to syrup and fireworks burst in fudge, until the whole world tastes **sweet**. Ants march up from miles around, and the cranky wizard bars their way across his **sweet** lawn: \"You shall not pass!\""],"耐":["endure","{Naruto} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and, as a ninja test, must **endure** a crab tugging the fake *beard* on his chin, hair by hair. He sticks up his *thumb* and shouts that he never gives up. The crab calls its friends, so he summons shadow clones to **endure** it with him, a hundred crabs dangling from a hundred chins."],"凭":["rely on","{Pikachu} bounds {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, far too small to reach his opponent, so a *bearer* carries in a *small table* for him to stand on. \"Pika!\" He will **rely on** it for every Thunderbolt, zapping from the top with sparking cheeks. When the bearer walks off with it, he has nothing to **rely on** and tumbles back into his Poké Ball."],"扎":["prick","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Spa} holding out a rubber *helping hand* with a tiny cactus hidden in the palm, and every guest who shakes it gets a **prick** on the finger. He flees on a single *ski*, green hair flying, and crashes into the hot tub. There his own cactus gives him a **prick** on the nose, and he laughs even harder."],"抢":["grab","{Chewbacca} crashes into the {Basement} of the {Stadium} and finds a tiny *barn* holding the last hot dog in the world. A *helping hand* shoots out to **grab** it. He roars, rips the barn in two and lunges, and they wrestle over the bun, until a goat trots past and takes its chance to **grab** the sausage."],"绪":["thread","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} for some peace and finds a *busy man* winding *silk thread* round his fingers. Stories have layers, like onions, and each **thread** starts a new one: a knight, a mummy, a lost sock. Donkey tugs one loose **thread**, the whole tangle unravels over the dinosaurs, and Shrek's roar shakes the skeletons."],"粗":["thick","{Cookie Monster} climbs a *stepladder* in {Front} of the {Pool} building towards a cookie as **thick** as a mattress. \"Me want cookie!\" Googly eyes spinning, he bites, crumbs spray everywhere and the ladder buckles. A sack of *rice* bursts over him and sticks to his fur, leaving him as **thick** and round as a blue snowman."],"肩":["shoulder","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and taps his tuxedo's **shoulder**, where Q has hidden a tiny *door*. It clicks open, a small rocket shoots out and hooks the *moon*, and the bankers stare. \"Bond. James Bond,\" he says, unruffled, shrugging as the moon settles neatly on his other **shoulder**."],"梁":["beam","{Lara Croft} sprints {Inside} the {Stadium} with a relic under her arm as an ancient trap brings the ceiling grinding down. Hauling a whole *tree* onto her back, she shoves it upright, and it wedges into place as a mighty wooden **beam**. She swings round the **beam** by her fingertips, ponytail flying, and drops down laughing as the crowd cheers."],"幻":["illusion","{Homer} wakes from a nap in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} and sees a *cocoon* dangling from a *bracket*, opening to reveal a giant pink doughnut, mmm. He bites, and his teeth clack on air: it is an **illusion**. D'oh! Then the swans, the pond and the whole nap fade away, one more **illusion**."],"菲":["fragrant","{Frodo} limps along in {Front} of the {Lake} house after a very long walk, and his bare hairy feet smell dreadful. Sweet *grass* wraps round his toes while butterflies with *spread wings* fan away the stink. Soon those feet are so **fragrant** that bees follow him, and Sam, deeply moved, sniffs them and declares them the most **fragrant** in the Shire."],"皆":["all","{James Bond} straightens his bow tie in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} as the yetis charge at him *all together*. He presses the one button on Q's watch, and **all** of them begin to waltz. An avalanche slides past as he steps between the twirling giants, unruffled, remarking over his shoulder that he did say **all** were invited."],"碎":["smash","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a chess *pawn* is butting a *stone* with its tiny head. She gives a speech on justice and throws her tiara, which misses, bounces off the stone and starts to **smash** the clock and the vending machine. She wails loudly, and the pawn, inspired, helps her **smash** the fish tank."],"宙":["universe","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, under a glass *roof*, where a *sprouting field* is growing tiny planets like turnips. Cackling, he squirts them with his flower, and up shoots the entire **universe**. The glass flips open like a joke lid, every star turns out to be a trick playing card, and the whole **universe** laughs with him."],"叔":["uncle","{Sherlock} examines one sunburnt crumb in {Front} of the {Pool} building and announces that someone nearby is an **uncle**. \"Elementary, Watson.\" He points his pipe at the lamp post, and there is his own *uncle*, in striped trunks, who waves and cannonballs into the water. Only an **uncle** would soak a detective this smugly."],"岩":["rock","{Yoshi} trots {Inside} the {Mansion} as a *mountain* comes rumbling down the staircase, shedding a *stone* at every step. His tongue shoots out and he swallows the lot, gulp, gulp. He strains, wobbles and lays a single enormous egg of solid **rock**. It rolls off, flattens the piano and sits there, a very smug **rock**, while he flutters away."],"荡":["sway","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, where a bowl of *soup* hangs from ropes of *grass*. He lifts it with the Force to inspect it, and it begins to **sway**. Soup slops over his helmet and his breathing starts to bubble, so he Force-chokes the ropes, and now the entire ceiling starts to **sway**."],"综":["combine","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and his rapier slashes a Z through a rack of *silk thread*. The loose ends lash out and tie a zebra, a parrot and a crocodile together, and they **combine** into one striped, squawking beast. The *ancestral hall* rings its bell in alarm, so Zorro slashes again, to **combine** it with a teapot, and vanishes laughing."],"爬":["climb","{Pikachu} scrambles {Inside} the {Spa}, chased by a huge *python* whose eagle *talon* feet let it **climb** the steam pipes. Small and yellow, he tries to **climb** the towel rack, cheeks sparking, and lets off a Thunderbolt that lights the sauna. \"Pika!\" He slips on a bath bomb, and lands safely shut in his Poké Ball."],"荷":["lotus","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Hut} on a bed of *grass* until he smells something pink and mistakes a **lotus** for a frosted doughnut, mmm. He takes a huge bite, and the *lotus leaf* beneath it tips him into the pond and floats off with him aboard. \"D'oh!\" He drifts out to sea, still chewing his **lotus**."],"悉":["know","{Shrek} crouches in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, studying *animal tracks* in the sand: crab, duck, sheep, four-legged chatterbox. His *heart* sinks, for ogres **know** these things, layer by layer, like onions. \"I **know** who stole my onion sandwich!\" he roars, and from behind a dune, Donkey stops talking for the first time in his life."],"蒂":["stem","{Darth Vader} sweeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a *sky god* rises from the *grass*, swinging a giant cherry by its **stem**. Vader's red lightsaber flashes once, and the fruit rolls away, leaving the god holding only the **stem**. Breathing loudly, Vader booms his disapproval, and the god meekly uses it as a toothpick."],"返":["return","{Frodo} sets out from the {Basement} of the {Mansion} along a very long *road*, bare feet aching, and reaches the far end at last. There a *rebel* cheerfully tells him he has forgotten his lunch, so he must **return**. Weary and reluctant, he trudges all the way back, only to find he must **return** again for Sam."],"井":["well","{James Bond} steps across the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, the floor snaps open, and he falls down a deep stone *well*. Q's umbrella pops open, he floats gently past the bucket, and a pulley shoots him out again, tuxedo perfectly dry. \"**Well**, **well**,\" he says, straightening his cuffs."],"壮":["strong","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp} hut and challenges a *strongman* who is **strong** enough to lift an alligator in each hand. Grinning hugely, he hands over a trick barbell made of balloons. The strongman heaves, soars up through the rafters and bobs away over the bog, and the Joker cackles that nobody is too **strong** for a good prank."],"薄":["thin","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Fort} and pulls from his utility belt a gadget sheet so **thin** that he can read through it. He spreads it across the *grass* of a *floodplain* in the courtyard, growling that nothing will get past. The *floodplain* rises and seeps straight through, a cow's hoof tears it like tissue, and he broods about making one even more **thin**."],"悄":["quietly","{Chewbacca} tiptoes **quietly** in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, all seven hairy feet of him, so that the cats won't wake. His *standing heart* thumps like a ship's engine. He reaches a *portrait* of the head cat and draws on a moustache, then lets out the most **quietly** triumphant growl ever heard, and every cat opens one eye."],"扫":["sweep","{Sailor Moon} twirls through the {Basement} of the {Tower}, and her long sparkly transformation ends with her wand turning into a giant *comb*. Luna sighs. Delivering a speech on justice for dust, she starts to **sweep**, while a *helping hand* grabs at the spiders and lost socks. She trips on her pigtails, and they **sweep** the whole lot up the stairs."],"敏":["quick","{Mario} jumps through the {Basement} of the {Inn} to stomp an *acrobat*, who is so **quick** he flips out from under every boot. He gulps a mushroom and grows huge, and still misses. The acrobat head-butts Mario's block, pockets the coin and gives him a wink, then dives down a warp pipe, too **quick** for even a \"Wahoo!\""],"碍":["hinder","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} hut, for no huge *stone* blocking the door can **hinder** a ghost. A *found coin* glued to it dazzles him, but his fingers pass straight through. He calls happily to some crabs to be his friends, they flee in terror, and his kindness is now the only thing to **hinder** their picnic."],"殖":["breed","The {Joker} sneaks {Inside} the {Beehive} with a rubber *skeleton* and drops one trick playing card into the honeycomb. The skeleton swings a *plumb line* over it, and the card splits in two, then four, because the Joker's cards **breed** faster than bees. He cackles and squirts them with his flower, which makes them **breed** even more, and the hive fills with jokers."],"详":["detailed","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Stadium} for some peace, but a *sheep* bars his way with a *small speech bubble*, giving a **detailed** account of the match: each pass, each sneeze, each blade of grass. Donkey arrives with an even more **detailed** account of the sheep. Shrek roars at them both, and they start describing the roar."],"迪":["enlighten","{Darth Vader} strides {Inside} the {Beach} house down a *road* through a *sprouting field*, where every sprout pops open a lightbulb. He has come to **enlighten** a small crab about the power of the dark side. He breathes loudly, booms that he is its father, and the crab, truly **enlighten**ed, walks forwards for the first time ever."],"矛":["spear","{Mario} bounces {Inside} the {Tower} and stomps on a turtle guard, whose long *spear* pops into the air like a coin, ding. He collects the **spear** and head-butts a block, and out flies a second **spear**. \"Wahoo!\" Riding it like a warp pipe, moustache streaming, he shoots right through the ceiling."],"霍":["suddenly","{Homer} is napping in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} with a doughnut on his belly when **suddenly** a *rain* cloud bursts over him. A *sparrow* dives down with the drops and flies off with the doughnut. \"D'oh!\" He lunges, misses, and **suddenly** the storm turns round and rains upwards, carrying the doughnut away and leaving him wet and hungry."],"允":["allow","{Yoshi} waddles through the {Basement} of the {Dunes} hut when a camel slides in a *permit*, begging him to **allow** it past. His tongue shoots out, he swallows the paper and lays it as an egg, and it hatches with a stamp on it. Now he has to **allow** the whole caravan, one egg at a time, shouting his own name."],"幅":["width","{Frodo} sets off barefoot {Inside} the {Pool} hall to walk its full **width**, for no one thought it could be walked. He drags a *towel* behind him to mark the distance, while Sam follows with a *full jar* that sloshes at every step. Three weary days later they reach the far wall, and only then discover the **width** was the short way."],"撒":["scatter","{Sailor Moon} twirls in {Front} of the {Spa}, swings her moon wand and knocks loose a *helping hand*, which flings *scattered seeds* in every direction. They **scatter** into the jacuzzi, the sauna and the guests' ears, and flowers sprout from every head. She bursts into loud sobs and sparkles at once, which **scatter** glitter over everything."],"剩":["remain","{Sherlock} peers around the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} camp, where a *rider* on an elephant has hacked a giant cake to bits with a *standing knife*, and only one crumb will **remain**. Magnifying glass raised, he deduces the rider's name, weight and favourite aunt from it. Then Watson eats it, and only the smugness will **remain**."],"凯":["triumph","{Kermit} hops up onto a *small table* in the {Basement} of the {Island} palace with his arms flailing, because the show has ended and nothing has exploded: **triumph**! \"Yaaay!\" He blows the *triumph horn* so hard that the blast shoots him through the ceiling, banjo and all, and he hangs from the rafters, waving in **triumph**."],"颗":["grain","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Hut}, stage-managing a parade of rice, in which each **grain** has its own cue on a *page* of his clipboard. A *fruit* falls from a tree and squashes the lead dancers. \"Yaaay!\" he screams in panic, grabs his banjo and starts the whole show over, one tiny **grain** at a time."],"骂":["scold","{Mario} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and stomps on a *horse*, which pops back up with furious *chatter* and starts to **scold** him: late, loud, silly cap. Every stomp brings a shiny coin and a fresh complaint. \"Wahoo!\" Mario keeps bouncing, getting rich, as the horse goes on to **scold** his moustache as well."],"赏":["reward","{Sherlock} lurks in the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, having deduced the plane thief from a single crumb, when a grateful pilot hands him a shiny *shell* as a **reward**. He turns his magnifying glass on it, notes one grain of runway sand, and smiles smugly. \"Elementary.\" The **reward** itself proves that the pilot took the plane."],"液":["liquid","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} at *night*, while the dark drips down the window and *water drops* glow green on the floor. His tongue slurps them all up, and he lays an egg that is nothing but **liquid**, wobbling like jelly. It bursts, the chairs start to ripple, and the whole room flows out the door as **liquid**."],"番":["foreign","{Frodo} pads up in {Front} of the {Mansion}, a long way from the Shire, and stares at a *footprint field* full of strange tracks that look utterly **foreign**: curly boots, kangaroos, penguins. Locals wave little flags and offer him fizzing sweets. Then he sees that the biggest, hairiest prints are his own, and here he is the **foreign** one."],"箱":["box","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Stadium}, sick of crowds, climbs into a cardboard **box** and pulls the lid shut. A *lookout* up a *bamboo* tower spots it and shouts, and fans swarm over. Donkey sits on top and starts chatting, so Shrek roars and bursts the **box** open, showering the whole pitch with onions."],"贴":["stick","{Tarzan} swings down a vine in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a *fortune teller* is laying out *shell* stickers and predicting trouble. Baffled by civilisation, he licks one, and it starts to **stick** to his chin. He tries to pull it off and it moves to his hand, so he gives his jungle yell, and the yetis arrive to **stick** to him as well."],"漫":["overflow","{Mario} dives out of a warp pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, wrench in hand, because the tub is starting to **overflow**. A *long veil* is jammed in the drain, *water drops* gush from it, and every stomp only squeezes out more. \"Wahoo!\" He surfs down the stairs on a plank as the ballroom and the hall **overflow** behind him."],"酸":["sour","{Sailor Moon} sits in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} with a *handsome man* who pours lemon juice from a *wine jug*. She takes a sip, and it is so **sour** that her pigtails stand up and she bursts into loud tears. She starts a speech about justice for taste buds, but it comes out **sour** too, and the swans tie their necks in knots."],"郎":["young man","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Hangar}, where a nervous *bridegroom*, a **young man** with a bouquet of fish, has lost the wedding ring in an ancient chest. She dodges two spike traps, backflips over a boulder and pulls it out, ponytail smoking. She hands it over, the **young man** faints with relief, and the chest locks itself again."],"腰":["waist","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Tower} and his sticky tongue reaches right up and swallows the full *moon*. He lays it as a silver egg, which rolls and settles around his **waist**. It starts to orbit him, faster and faster, like a glowing hula hoop. Owls clap, and he wiggles his **waist** until the night tide comes in."],"舒":["relax","{Sherlock} sits in {Front} of the {Pool} building in a tiny *hut*, ordered by Watson to **relax**. Locals leave an *offering* of cushions and iced tea, and he immediately deduces the masseur's secret love of turnips from the cushion's dent. His violin shrieks in frustration. Everyone else begins to **relax** only when he finally goes home."],"眉":["eyebrow","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Lake} house with one *raised brow* that keeps climbing off his face like a caterpillar. He jumps, stomps the runaway **eyebrow**, and a coin pops out. \"Wahoo!\" It crawls away over the water and lands on a duck, who looks very surprised, so he leaps again after the **eyebrow**, moustache quivering."],"忧":["worry","{Yoshi} waddles in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, where a *standing heart* with a *wart* on its nose paces up and down, and all it can do is **worry** about sinking boats. Gulp! His tongue swallows the whole fret, and he lays it as an egg. The egg rocks back and forth on the jetty and starts to **worry** too."],"浮":["float","{Frodo} pads nervously {Inside} the {Pool}, being a hobbit who distrusts water, when a little *hatchling* rides past on rising *water drops* and begins to **float** into the air. He grabs its foot and starts to **float** as well, bare toes dangling. The Ring tugs him downwards, Sam grabs his ankle, and all three bob over the diving board."],"辛":["toil","{Shrek} grumbles in {Front} of the {Inn}, where he must **toil** all day to pay for one onion, hauling a red *chili* as big as a car up from the fields. Each test bite makes him roar flames, while Donkey sings work songs and offers no help. His sweat steams, and he goes on to **toil** by moonlight, longing for his swamp."],"恋":["love","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *sweating man* kneels, holding up a huge carved *heart*. He is in **love** with her. She treats it as any relic, swapping it for a bag of sand, and instantly his sighs start a rolling boulder. She runs, ponytail flying, for **love** is the worst trap of all."],"餐":["meal","{Cookie Monster} sits in {Front} of the {Mansion} at a long table while a *bone picker* carries out all the *food* in the kingdom for a **meal** meant to last three days. \"Me want cookie!\" Googly eyes whirling, he devours it in three seconds in a spray of crumbs. Then he eats the table, and the bone picker hurries to start the next **meal**."],"吓":["scare","{Shrek} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} and opens his huge *mouth* in a roar, because a good roar can **scare** anyone off. Tourists flee *downstairs* and pigeons explode out of the square, leaving him at last in blissful peace. Then Donkey pops up behind him and squeaks boo, the only creature alive who can **scare** an ogre."],"挺":["straight","{Tarzan} knuckle-walks through the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, the way the apes raised him, into a *courtyard* where a *helping hand* grabs his collarbone and pulls him up **straight**. He is baffled by the view. The moment it lets go he slumps, it hauls him **straight** again with a twang, and his ape friends hoot with laughter."],"励":["encourage","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} ruin, facing an ancient stone *strong arm* slumped over a *whetstone*. The puzzle is carved on the wall: it moves only if you **encourage** it. She cheers it on, ponytail bouncing, and the arm grinds faster till the door cracks open. Now the next statue wants her to **encourage** it as well."],"辞":["resign","{Cookie Monster} barges {Inside} the {Beehive}, the official honey taster, when a red *chili* lands on his *tongue*. Flames shoot out, and he roars, \"Me **resign**!\" spraying crumbs across the queen. He scribbles a letter of protest, and promptly eats it, so he has to write another saying that he will **resign** again tomorrow."],"艘":["counter for ships","{Sailor Moon} twirls in {Front} of the {Boathouse} as a white-bearded *elder* asks her to name each *boat* with the proper **counter for ships**, 艘. Her wand sparkles and each ship honks as she reaches it: one 艘, two 艘, three. She trips, loses count and wails, until Luna the cat whispers the **counter for ships** in her ear."],"键":["key","{James Bond} wakes in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *builder* has bricked him up with a billion *gold coins*. Unruffled, he pulls out Q's latest gadget, a **key** as big as an oar that fits anything at all. It unlocks the wall, the builder's lunchbox and the moon, and Bond strolls off twirling the **key**."],"伍":["squad","{Walter White} knocks at the {Basement} of the {Pool} building, the one who knocks, and his chemistry class files in as a **squad** of five in goggles. A *standing person* ties them to a *spool* of rope so that they march in exact step, as precise as science demands. One pupil adds one extra drop, and the **squad** foams up in a purple cloud."],"峰":["peak","{Frodo} trudges up in {Front} of the {Jungle} temple and meets a *mountain* whose snowy *peak* pokes the clouds. Weary and reluctant, he sighs, and walks. Days later, with Sam carrying him on his back, he hauls himself onto the **peak**, and there in the distance rises a higher **peak**."],"尺":["Chinese foot","{Charlie Brown} crawls into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} with a wooden *ruler*, marked off in **Chinese foot** units, to measure the kite string he needs. Good grief: his string falls short by a whisker, and a bee stings him. Gloomily he lays the ruler on the swelling, and it measures exactly one **Chinese foot**."],"昨":["yesterday","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier {Inside} the {Warehouse} and slashes a Z into a *jack-in-the-box*. It pops up with the *sun* on its head and squeaks that he did this **yesterday**. Every crate he checks carries an old Z, all from **yesterday**, so he bows, swirls his cape and vanishes, laughing."],"黎":["multitude","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Beach} ruin, lifts a relic from its pedestal, and the trap springs: not a boulder but a **multitude**. Farmers, grandmothers, babies and ice-cream sellers pour out of the stone doors in their thousands. She scales the wall by her fingertips, and from the top she sees the whole **multitude** dive into the sea, and the tide goes out."],"辈":["generation","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house on *spread wings* and lands on a wooden *cart* holding a grandmother bat, a mother bat and a baby bat. Each **generation** stares at his cape. The cart rolls off with him aboard, and he growls a brooding speech, while each **generation** flaps along and adopts him as the sulky one."],"贯":["pierce through","{Gandalf} arrives exactly when he means to in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, raises his staff and turns a *string of coins* into a flying lance. It will **pierce through** a swan's hat, an apple and the reeds. \"You shall not pass!\" he cries, cranky, but it does, going on to **pierce through** the pond and come out on the far side of the world."],"侦":["spy","The {Joker} creeps in {Front} of the {Funfair} in a fake moustache to **spy** on a *standing person* who is consulting a glowing *oracle*. The oracle announces that a grinning man in purple is watching. The Joker cackles, gives himself away and squirts them both with his flower, then bows, the worst **spy** in the history of pranks."],"滑":["slippery","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Water Park}, doughnut in hand, and treads on a *bone* covered in *water drops*, whoosh! It is so **slippery** that he shoots belly first down every slide, through the lazy river and into the wave pool, howling. He clings to his doughnut, but the glaze has turned **slippery** too, and it pops away. \"D'oh!\""],"券":["ticket","{Chewbacca} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, where *rolling hands* print sheets of paper and a *knife* chops them apart. One golden **ticket** flutters onto his bandolier: free ship repairs for life! He roars his joy at the clerk, who understands nothing and refuses, so he rips the **ticket** up in a temper, then patiently fixes it with tape."],"崇":["lofty","{Charlie Brown} climbs {Inside} the {Lagoon} temple, an *ancestral hall* on a *mountain* that grows taller with each step he takes. Good grief. It becomes so **lofty** that eagles live in the kitchen, yet his kite still finds a tree to eat it. At this **lofty** height, there sits Snoopy on his doghouse, who got there first and is not even trying."],"扰":["disturb","{Robocop} is recharging in the {Basement} of the {Tower}, visor dim, when a *helping hand* pokes the *wart* on his steel nose. His visor flares and he stiffly reads out the rule: citizens must not **disturb** an officer. The hand pokes again, so he reads every rule he has, at top volume, all night, until he starts to **disturb** the whole building."],"宪":["constitution","{Shrek} shuts himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} to be left alone, but a *front runner* sprints in under the rattling *roof*, waving the new **constitution**. Rule one says ogres may be left alone, and Shrek grunts with approval. Rule two says donkeys may speak whenever they like, so he roars and eats the **constitution**, layer by layer, like an onion."],"绕":["wind around","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} to arrest an *emperor*, politely, but he has run out of handcuffs and has only *silk thread*. Stiffly he walks in circles to **wind around** the suspect, reading out each directive at every turn. His targeting display spins, and he has soon managed to **wind around** himself, the flagpole and the entire staircase."],"趋":["hurry","{Chewbacca} roars at a *runner* in {Front} of the {Museum} who is plodding along with a bale of *hay*. Only friends understand his growl, which means **hurry**, the ship is leaving, so the runner just nods and strolls on. Chewbacca scoops him up, hay and all, tucks him under one hairy arm, and hurls himself away to **hurry** aboard."],"慈":["kind","{Cookie Monster} tiptoes {Inside} the {Beehive} with a *magnet* on a string and a soft *heart* in his furry chest. He is trying to be **kind**, so he tows the lost bees home on tiny paperclips and hands them his last cookie. \"Me **kind**,\" he whispers, googly eyes wet, and then in a spray of crumbs he eats the magnet."],"乔":["tall","{Chewbacca} clomps {Inside} the {Cat Café}, already huge, on a pair of *stilts* he has welded out of spare ship parts. He grows so **tall** that his head pokes out through the ceiling, and cats climb his hairy legs and swing from his bandolier. He growls happily, so **tall** that pigeons start to nest on his head."],"阅":["read","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} past a *gate* where a *money changer* swaps coins for books. He can't **read**, so his sticky tongue swallows a whole encyclopedia and he lays it as an egg. He cracks it open, and the words march out in a line, so he can **read** them, while the money changer charges per egg."],"汗":["sweat","{Homer} collapses in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} after walking ten whole steps to fetch a doughnut, and starts to **sweat**, and *water drops* pour off his bald head, filling buckets and soaking the shirts on the *drying rack*. \"D'oh!\" He tries a dim scheme of sitting in the sink, and the **sweat** carries him off down the hall, floating on a doughnut."],"枝":["branch","The {Joker} stands in {Front} of the {Beehive}, grinning, and screws a fake *branch* onto a real *tree*. A bee lands on the **branch**, which squirts it in the face. Cackling, he leans on it to enjoy the joke, but the whole **branch** is spring-loaded, and it boings him over the hedge, green hair first."],"拖":["drag","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Warehouse} and grabs what he takes for a vine, but it is a *snake*, who hisses a complaint he can understand. A *helping hand* seizes it by the tail and begins to **drag** it away. Loyal to all animals, Tarzan hangs on and yells, so the snake and the hand both **drag** him round the yard."],"墨":["ink","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and lands on a heap of black *soot* and wet *soil*. Stomp, stomp, stomp: he treads it into thick **ink**. \"Wahoo!\" He head-butts a block, and instead of coins it rains **ink**, drawing a second moustache over his moustache and leaving black footprints marching up the walls."],"胁":["threaten","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} under a hanging *moon* and finds a *workshop* of spiky tools, where a yeti waves a hammer to **threaten** him. Shrek doesn't blink. He peels an onion and breathes out slowly, layer by layer. The yeti's eyes stream, and Donkey arrives to **threaten** it with a song, and it hands over the hammer."],"插":["insert","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Spa}, where a *husker* has stripped one perfect corncob that he must **insert** into the popcorn machine. A *helping hand* holds the slot steady and promises not to move it this time. He runs up to **insert** the cob, and the hand whips the machine away, and he lands flat on his back. Good grief."],"箭":["arrow","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and clicks Q's tie clip, and a *bamboo* **arrow** shoots out of the *front* of his shirt. It pins a banker's tie to the wall and knocks a coin out of a piggy bank. Bond catches the coin, unruffled, and observes that an **arrow** always gets straight to the point."],"腊":["cured meat","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and discovers an ancient tomb, where strips of *sun-dried meat* hang gleaming under a carved *moon*. She lifts one prize of **cured meat** with great care, and the floor drops away. Swinging on a rope by her ponytail, she bites off a salty piece and declares that the **cured meat** was worth the boulder."],"粉":["powder","{Frodo} creeps through the {Basement} of the {Funfair} wearing the Ring, invisible, with Sam carrying a sack of *rice* and a *cut cake* for second breakfast. He trips them both into a mixer, which grinds it all to fine white **powder**, and a great puff billows out. Now a little hobbit shape stands coated in **powder**, invisible no longer."],"泥":["mud","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Beach} house, where a *nun* is pouring *water drops* onto the sand, turning it into sticky **mud**. He summons shadow clones by the dozen to help, and every one of them slips and slides into a heap. Mistaking it for ramen, Naruto tastes a bowl of **mud**, and shouts that he will never give up."],"氏":["surname","{Sherlock} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, peers at a huge *family tree* drawn across the honeycomb, and from one crumb of wax deduces every bee's **surname**: Buzz, Buzz, Buzz. \"Elementary,\" he tells Watson. Then his magnifying glass stops on the queen, who has a different **surname**, and the whole hive gasps at the scandal."],"彭":["Peng","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Jungle} and fires Thunderbolts into a hollow log, each crackle thumping out a *drumbeat* that spells a surname. Zap go his cheeks, PENG goes the *drumbeat*, and the parrots shriek it back as the whole family of **Peng** marches out of the trees. Grandma **Peng** pops him in a Poké Ball and keeps him as the family band."],"拔":["pull out","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Spa}, brooding over a *pulled weed* that has grown back through the mud bath. He fires his grappling hook, and a spring-loaded *helping hand* from his utility belt locks on to **pull out** the root. Metres of it come up, then a rubber duck, and he growls that he will **pull out** the truth from that duck."],"骗":["cheat","{Pikachu} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} behind a fake *nameboard* reading HONEST TELLER, sparking his cheeks until bottle caps glow like gold. He squeaks an innocent \"Pika!\" and uses them to **cheat** a *horse* in a green visor out of its savings. The glow fades, the *horse* kicks down the *nameboard*, and the tiny **cheat** climbs into his Poké Ball and shuts the lid."],"凤":["phoenix","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} after a very long walk, and a *small table* bursts into flames beside him. He slips on the Ring to hide, but his invisible *right hand* brushes the ashes and a blazing **phoenix** rises out of them. The **phoenix** sees him anyway, sneezes sparks and settles on his head, and he sighs that he never wanted to carry this either."],"慧":["wise","{Homer} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} with a doughnut on his chest until a *broom* starts sweeping by itself, brushing the crumbs off his *heart*. With every stroke his dim schemes blow away and he grows terrifyingly **wise**, explaining the universe to a plunger. Then the *heart* begs for the doughnut, he says \"Mmm…\", and the man who was **wise** for nine seconds is gone."],"媒":["media","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Lake} and head-butts a floating block, but instead of a coin out pops a *woman* holding a giant *plum* like a microphone. She shouts into the *plum* and the question booms across the water. Every block he hits now releases more of the **media**, cameras flashing, so with one \"Wahoo!\" he dives down a warp pipe to escape the **media**."],"佩":["admire","{Pikachu} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and hits a *standing person* with a full Thunderbolt, and the *standing person* does not even blink, though every hair now points at the ceiling. Pikachu's ears droop and his cheeks stop fizzing, for he can only **admire** such calm. \"Pika…\" he breathes, climbs into a Poké Ball by himself, and hands it over to the one he will always **admire**."],"愤":["anger","{Frodo} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} while the Ring whispers on its chain, until his *standing heart* glows red with **anger**. The meek little hobbit stamps one hairy foot, the *standing heart* kicks a *fountain*, and the *fountain* spouts boiling steam over the dodgems. Sam gently takes the Ring away, the **anger** drains out, and Frodo apologises to a wet carousel horse."],"扑":["pounce","{Pikachu} crouches in {Front} of the {Pool}, tail twitching, as a *fortune stick* clatters past reading YOU WILL BE CAUGHT. He wiggles and leaps to **pounce** on it, cheeks crackling, just as a giant *helping hand* swoops to **pounce** on him with a Poké Ball. All three hit the deep end with a fizzing bang and one soggy \"Pika!\""],"龄":["age","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a stone crocodile idol sits on a pressure plate and a *herald* trumpets its riddle: name its **age**. She climbs the jaw, ponytail swinging, and counts the *teeth*, one for every century. The *herald* bows at her answer, a rolling boulder just misses her, and the idol grumbles that nobody should ever ask a crocodile its **age**."],"驱":["drive away","{Chewbacca} storms up in {Front} of the {Museum} on a terrified *horse* and roars so loudly that burglars scatter. In a temper he rips a *district map* in two, because one roar can **drive away** only one street at a time and he wants the lot. By noon he has managed to **drive away** the whole quarter, the pigeons and finally the *horse*, which gallops off without him."],"惜":["cherish","{Shrek} glowers in {Front} of the {Beach}, cradling his last strip of *sun-dried meat* and roaring at any gull that comes near. Under all his ogre layers a *standing heart* peels itself free and hugs the strip too, for nothing else in life does he **cherish** so. Donkey asks for one bite and will not shut up, so Shrek wraps it in onion skin to **cherish** for ever."],"豪":["heroic","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Tower} with a dim scheme to skip the fire drill by sending a tiny *pig* in a cape to do it for him. The scheme backfires: the *pig* is truly **heroic**, rescuing guards, stamping out sparks and saving his doughnut from a falling beam. \"D'oh!\" he says, as the crowd carries off the **heroic** *pig* and hands him a broom."],"掩":["cover","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} just as a *sudden flash* bursts from the fuse box and blinds everybody. His sticky tongue swallows the *sudden flash* whole, and he lays it as a giant egg that will not stop blinking. A *helping hand* throws a bedsheet to **cover** it, then a curtain, then a carpet, and Yoshi sits on top to **cover** the last bright crack."],"兼":["both","{James Bond} strolls up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} carrying *two sheaves* of wheat, and a banker orders him to pick one. \"I'll take **both**,\" he says, unruffled, and clicks a cufflink from Q. The *two sheaves* sprout rotor blades and lift him over the traffic, clutching **both** his wheat and the banker's hat."],"跃":["leap","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} and launches a flutter jump, one *kicking foot* pedalling the air while he yells \"Yoshi!\". A twirling *dancer* gapes at a **leap** that simply hangs there for a full minute, and the ceiling lights sway as he passes. The *dancer* tries the same **leap**, spins three times and vanishes into a snowbank."],"尸":["corpse","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Beehive} over a *lying man* stiff with honey, and deduces from one crumb that this **corpse** expired on Tuesday, of boredom. \"Elementary, Watson,\" he says smugly, and lights his pipe. The *lying man* sneezes, sits up and asks for toast, and Sherlock coolly informs the **corpse** that it is mistaken."],"肃":["solemn","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and begins her long sparkly transformation, until a *stern face* on the wall turns to glare. The music dies, the sparkles drop to the tiles, and the room goes **solemn**. She tries her speech about justice, wobbles, and bursts into loud tears, but the *stern face* never blinks, so she finishes in a whisper, tiara drooping, perfectly **solemn**."],"帕":["handkerchief","{Pikachu} fizzes into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} wrapped in a *towel*, and his sneeze fires a Thunderbolt that sends the *towel* flying off in terror. A *white dove* flutters down with a tiny **handkerchief** in its beak. He blows his nose with a \"Pika-CHOO!\", and the **handkerchief** stands on end, fizzing, along with every feather on the dove."],"驶":["drive","{Sherlock} peers into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} and deduces, from one smear of honey on a *horse*, exactly who ought to **drive**. \"Not you, Watson. Elementary.\" He seizes the reins, the *horse* bolts through the honey tunnels, and a *historian* in the back seat takes notes, proving that no detective in all of history could **drive** this badly."],"堡":["fortress","{Batman} grapples into the {Basement} of the {Tower} and pulls a drill from his utility belt, tunnelling through the *soil* and packing it into walls for a secret **fortress**. The sensors are set, the bats are hung, and he broods in the dark. Then a *nanny* marches straight past every trap, tuts at the mud, and proves no **fortress** can stop bedtime, tucking him in, cape and all."],"届":["session","{James Bond} escapes into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and lands in the annual **session** of the Yeti Parliament, held beside a *sprouting field* that grows one new delegate each year. A *lying man* snores in the speaker's chair, having slept through everything since 1890. Bond straightens his bow tie, fires Q's gavel pen, and says this **session** is now closed."],"欣":["happy","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Inn} wanting only to be left alone, but Donkey tells one joke too many, and a huge *grin* breaks through all his layers. He roars at it to go away, so the *grin* slides off his face and bounces through the windows. Every guest it lands on turns **happy**, and Shrek, to his disgust, stays **happy** till morning."],"惠":["favour","{Homer} wedges himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} with a box of doughnuts and a dim scheme to finish them unseen. A giant *heart* knocks on the door and asks one **favour**: the last pink doughnut, for a hungry nurse. \"Mmm…\" he says, and shakily hands it over, the greatest **favour** of his life. The *heart* waddles off and his stomach howls: \"D'oh!\""],"册":["booklet","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, googly eyes spinning, and mistakes a *bamboo book* for a very long biscuit. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, and the *bamboo book* clacks like castanets as he chews through it in a spray of splinters. All that survives is a tiny **booklet** of recipes, and he reads one line before he eats that **booklet** too."],"储":["store","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Basement} of the {Pool} to **store** his winter kites where no tree can ever reach them. A *standing person* takes a careful *headcount* of them, three hundred kites, stacked to the ceiling. \"Good grief,\" he says, as the shelf snaps, and everything he tried to **store** floats away past Snoopy, who is lounging on a lilo."],"飘":["flutter","{Pikachu} waits in {Front} of the {Cat Café} clutching a *ticket* when a gust of *wind* whips it away, and it starts to **flutter** just out of reach. He fires a Thunderbolt after it, and the static makes every napkin, menu and paper bag **flutter** up and cling to his fur. The *wind* lifts him off the pavement, a small yellow kite squeaking \"Pika!\""],"桑":["mulberry","{Sailor Moon} twirls in {Front} of the {Hangar} through her sparkly transformation, and her moon wand misfires, blasting a giant *mulberry* tree up through the lawn. She throws her tiara to chop it down, and a purple rain of **mulberry** fruit splats on every aeroplane and on her uniform. She cries loudly, while Luna the cat sits nearby, calmly licking **mulberry** juice off one paw."],"闲":["idle","{Shrek} roars everybody out from {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, slams the *gate* and plants a *tree* in the doorway, so that at last he can be left alone. The bankers stand locked out, and even the coins lie **idle**. He strings a hammock in the branches of the *tree* and stays **idle** with an onion until Donkey squeezes through the bars, talking."],"惨":["miserable","{Cookie Monster} gropes into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and devours what he thinks are cookies: a jar of bitter *ginseng*. His googly eyes roll, crumbs spray from his mouth, and his *standing heart* sobs into the empty jar. \"Me **miserable**!\" he wails, reaching for the next jar, which is more *ginseng*. Soon he is a damp blue heap, the most **miserable** monster alive."],"洁":["clean","{James Bond} strides {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and twists a *lucky charm* from Q, whose one absurd function is firing *water drops* at tremendous pressure. Every hairy yeti gets scrubbed until it sparkles, and the cave turns so **clean** it squeaks. The yetis shake themselves dry, and Bond, tuxedo spotless, remarks, \"Shaken, not stirred, and perfectly **clean**.\""],"踪":["trace","{Zorro} dashes away laughing in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, but he cannot resist slashing a Z into everything he passes. The soldiers follow each **trace**: a Z on a palm, a Z on a duck, a muddy print from his *kicking foot*. It all leads to an *ancestral hall*, which creaks open on a hundred portraits, each with a fresh Z, the last **trace** of him."],"勃":["thriving","{Batman} glides {Inside} the {Fort}, a sad ruin, and snags a passing *comet* with his grappling hook. A *strong arm* springs from his utility belt and plants it in the courtyard like a seed. Shops, gardens and cheering crowds burst up around the glow, a **thriving** town in seconds, and Batman growls gloomily that a **thriving** place has no need of him."],"宾":["guest","{Batman} drops from the sky in {Front} of the {Inn} and, in his gruffest voice, interrogates the *guest of honour*, a goat in a crown. Finding no crimes, he produces a red carpet and a cake from his utility belt, because Alfred insists a **guest** must be treated well. The goat eats both, then starts on the cape, and Batman broods over the worst **guest** in Gotham."],"频":["frequently","{Pikachu} creeps {Inside} the {Inn}, and every *step* on the staircase hides a Poké Ball that snaps him up, so he pops back out with a furious \"Pika!\". A trainer turns a *page* in a notebook to mark each capture, for it happens **frequently**. He is caught so **frequently** that sparks set the *page* smoking and he never reaches the second floor."],"仇":["hatred","{Charlie Brown} runs {Inside} the {Boathouse} to kick the football, and a *standing person* flicks it away with a *crowbar* for the thousandth time. Flat on his back in his zigzag shirt, he feels pure **hatred** rise for the first time ever. He leaps up and glares, the *crowbar* clangs, a canoe falls on him, and \"Good grief\" is all that remains of his **hatred**."],"磨":["grind","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Fort} and stomps on a round *stone*, which spins like a kicked shell across a heap of *hemp*. \"Wahoo!\" Every stomp makes it **grind** the fibres finer, and a coin pops out with each dusty puff. He collects so many that he stays all day to **grind**, moustache full of fluff, while the guards sneeze in unison."],"递":["hand over","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and booms at his *little brother* to **hand over** the TV remote. The boy bolts away down a sandy *road*, so Vader raises one glove and the Force tugs at the buttons. \"I am your brother,\" he booms, deeply disappointed, and the boy sulkily begins to **hand over** the remote, one button at a time."],"邪":["evil","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} wanting peace and finds an **evil** yeti cackling over his stolen onions, one huge *fang* glinting in the dark. Shrek roars so loudly that the *hillside* shudders and the *fang* pops out and bounces away. Now the **evil** yeti can only lisp his threats, and Donkey will not stop imitating him."],"撞":["bump into","The {Joker} rigs a prank in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, a spring-loaded *helping hand* in a joke box, and cackles as he opens it himself by mistake. It shoves him straight at a *schoolkid* on a lily pad, and they **bump into** each other in a splash of trick cards. The *schoolkid* squirts his flower right back, and soon the frogs all **bump into** each other too."],"拟":["draft","{Naruto} crouches in the {Basement} of the {Beach} and summons a hundred shadow clones to **draft** a battle plan against the sandcastle over the bay. Each clone lends a *helping hand*, gripping a *tool* as a pencil and yelling over the rest. A hundred pages later, every **draft** says exactly the same thing: eat ramen first, and never give up."],"滚":["roll","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Casino} exactly when he means to and mutters a spell at the dice. His staff spits sparks, the *water drops* on the ceiling harden into marbles, and a *royal robe* on a chair bundles itself into a ball. Everything begins to **roll**, chips and croupiers alike, and he thunders \"You shall not pass!\" as the lot continue to **roll** straight past him."],"奏":["play music","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and slashes a Z across a *spring planter* of tulips. Each tulip flicks open like a trumpet and begins to **play music** aimed at the *sky*, which thunders back a drum roll. He conducts with his rapier, the ducks **play music** on the oars, and he vanishes laughing before the final chord."],"巡":["patrol","{Shrek} marches {Inside} the {Dunes} on a one-ogre **patrol** to keep trespassers off his land, roaring at every cactus, with Donkey trotting behind and never shutting up. The *road* loops back on itself, and a *wavy river* of sand carries off all his KEEP OUT signs. So he grumbles, peels an onion, and sets off on **patrol** again."],"颜":["colour","{Yoshi} scampers {Inside} the {Mansion}, flicks out his tongue and swallows a *page* of paint samples from the hand of a dapper *gentleman*. He lays egg after egg, each one a new **colour**, and they burst against the walls like fireworks. \"Yoshi!\" he chirps, and the *gentleman*, splattered from hat to spats, faints in every **colour** at once."],"剂":["dose","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} with a sniffle, and Q's newest gadget, a *standing knife*, springs from his shoe and carves a *trimmed hedge* into a pill the size of a car. \"One **dose**, shaken, not stirred,\" he says, unruffled. He rolls the whole **dose** down his throat somehow, straightens his bow tie and sneezes out a single leaf."],"绩":["achievement","{James Bond} is cornered in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} by a *debt collector* reading out the cost of every tuxedo he has ruined. Unruffled, he pulls a *silk thread* from his cuff, Q's gadget, and it whirls round the man until he is tied in a neat bow. Slipping away unpaid is a rare **achievement**, so he pins a medal on himself for that **achievement**."],"贡":["contribute","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} and slams his staff on a *workbench*, crankily announcing that everyone must **contribute** to a great statue of a whale. A spell sends one *shell* flying from every creature in the water, clattering into place. Fish grumble, crabs salute, and he himself chooses to **contribute** a burst of fireworks, which sets the statue afloat."],"疯":["crazy","{Frodo} collapses in {Front} of the {Jungle} onto a *sickbed*, and the Ring keeps whispering till he goes **crazy**. On it goes and he vanishes, off it comes and he giggles, on, off, on, as a hot *wind* spins the *sickbed* round on its wheels. Sam runs after him with soup, shouting, until the monkeys catch it and go **crazy** too."],"坡":["slope","{Pikachu} fires a Thunderbolt in {Front} of the {Fort} and the blast heaps the *soil* into a steep **slope**. He hops onto a *hide*, cheeks fizzing, and whooshes down squeaking \"Pika!\" with cannonballs bouncing after him. At the bottom a trainer waits, Poké Ball ready, but the *hide* flips and flings him straight back up the **slope**."],"瞧":["look","{Chewbacca} ducks {Inside} the {Cat Café} to fix a sizzling *barbecue*, rips off its lid, and a giant *eye* on a stalk pops out of the grill. He lets out a long growl that only friends understand, and it means **look**. No cat understands, so he roars it again, louder, **look**, until the *eye* swivels round and every whisker in the room turns to stare."],"截":["cut off","{James Bond} skis {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} with a furious yeti behind him and presses a button on Q's ski pole, which shoots out into a long *lance*. A *sparrow* perches on the tip and pecks at his aim, and the *lance* swings up, snaps an icicle, and drops it to **cut off** the yeti's path. \"Sorry to **cut off** the conversation,\" he says, skiing on."],"燃":["ignite","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Mansion} and his targeting display locks onto a tiny illegal *campfire* on the rug. He reads aloud a directive forbidding citizens to **ignite** anything, but a spark from his steel arm lands on the curtains. As *flames* leap to the piano, he politely places each one under arrest, while the chandelier behind him begins to **ignite**."],"焦":["burnt","{James Bond} aims his wristwatch in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, and Q's tiny laser, which does nothing else, turns every sausage on a *barbecue* to charcoal. The cats sniff the **burnt** heap and sneeze soot over the tablecloth. Bond, unruffled, spears one and takes a bite. \"**Burnt**,\" he says, \"not stirred.\""],"殿":["palace hall","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, which he has ordered rebuilt as a golden **palace hall**, his breathing echoing off the columns. With one glove he lifts a *throne* through the air and sits. A manager charges with a *war club*, Vader Force-chokes the club until it squeaks, and he booms that this **palace hall** does not please him."],"伪":["fake","{Walter White} knocks in the {Basement} of the {Lake} house, where a *standing person* in a grey costume and an *elephant handler* swear their beast is real. Proud of his precise science, he drips iodine from a beaker onto the trunk, and it turns blue-black. \"Starch,\" he says, adjusting his glasses: the elephant is a **fake** made of potatoes, and the handler is a **fake** too."],"柳":["willow","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel} and slots a relic into a *mortise* in the wall, solving the ancient puzzle. A *tree* erupts through the floor, its long branches drooping like hair: a weeping **willow**, sobbing over the bunk beds. She swings across on it, ponytail tangled in the leaves, as the **willow** wails so loudly that a boulder starts rolling."],"锁":["lock","{Sailor Moon} stumbles into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, trips over a pile of *gold coins*, and each coin snaps shut round her ankle like a tiny **lock**. She makes a long speech about justice, waves her wand and twirls through her whole transformation, but the *gold coins* just clink. She cries loudly until Luna the cat strolls up and picks the **lock** with one claw."],"逼":["force","{Batman} looms in {Front} of the {Beach} over a crooked crab, growling that he will **force** the truth out of it. He hurls a batarang at a *full jar* of jam, which thunders down the *road* behind the crab, herding it towards the sea. With sticky doom rolling closer, one gruff whisper is enough to **force** a confession about the missing sandcastle."],"颇":["quite","{Pikachu} sprawls on an animal *hide* in {Front} of the {Fort} and reads a *page* of poetry aloud, using only the word \"Pika\". The cannon crew nods: **quite** good. He adds sparks for the rhymes, the *hide* stands on end, the *page* begins to smoke, and the soldiers declare themselves **quite** moved, and also tingling."],"昏":["faint","{Homer} slumps in {Front} of the {Casino} as *twilight* turns the sky the exact pink of a sprinkled doughnut. \"Mmm…\" he says, reaching up, and he grows so dizzy with hunger that he begins to **faint**. The *twilight* deepens, a round moon rises like an even bigger doughnut, and he comes round, sees it, and goes down for another **faint**."],"劝":["urge","{Chewbacca} squeezes into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint} to **urge** a stalled coin press back to life with long, loving growls that only friends understand. His *right hand* pats its side and his *strong arm* gives it a hefty shove. The press purrs and starts stamping, and every broken machine in the building lines up for him to **urge** it on too."],"呈":["present","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Jungle} to **present** his *petition* against kite-eating trees to the gorilla king. On the very last step a tree leans down, snatches the *petition* and swallows it. \"Good grief,\" he says, and bows, and has to **present** an empty silver tray while Snoopy, behind him, collects a medal."],"搜":["search","{Sailor Moon} weeps in {Front} of the {Boathouse} because an *elder* has lost his false teeth, and she vows justice in a long sparkly speech. Her wand fails as a detector, so a *helping hand* joins her to **search** every net, barrel and gull. They **search** until sunset, Luna sighing, and then the *elder* grins: the teeth were in his mouth, and she wails all over again."],"勤":["hardworking","{Chewbacca} crawls {Inside} the {Inn} with tools in his bandolier and starts fixing everything, because a loyal Wookiee cannot sit still. His *strong arm* mends the boiler, the stairs and the door before dawn: **hardworking** does not begin to describe it. Even a *violet* on the windowsill sprouts tiny spanners and joins in, as **hardworking** as he is, while he growls at Han to get up."],"戒":["give up","{James Bond} slinks into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a yeti *sentry* has orders to make him **give up** gadgets for good. One by one the *sentry* confiscates his exploding pen, his laser cufflink and his singing tie. Unruffled, Bond remarks he would sooner **give up** breathing, taps his heel, and his shoe walks him out through the wall."],"驾":["drive","{James Bond} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} and leaps onto a *horse* with a big *plus sign* on its rump, assuming it is Q's latest. He presses the *plus sign* and another *horse* appears, then another, all harnessed together. Unruffled, he shoots his cuffs and takes the reins, for only he could **drive** forty horses in a tuxedo, and he will **drive** them twice round the fountain."],"漂":["pretty","{Pikachu} primps in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, clutching a *ticket* to a Pokémon beauty contest. He flicks *water drops* onto his red cheeks, every spark making them twinkle, and the mirror sighs at how **pretty** he is. \"Pika!\" he poses, tail high, and the cats swoon. A trainer simply walks up and catches him, because he is too **pretty** to run."],"饮":["drink","{Yoshi} follows his nose into the {Basement} of the {Inn} and slurps up a *side dish* of salty peanuts. His thirst stretches his *yawn* so wide that his tongue uncurls and takes one enormous **drink** from a barrel of tea. He lays the whole barrel as a giant sloshing egg, and the innkeeper taps it and serves the next **drink** from the shell."],"曹":["Cao","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Tower} and spots a wooden *trough* heaped with biscuits at the feet of General **Cao**, whose name is stitched across his armour. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, and the *trough* vanishes in a spray of crumbs and splinters. He eats the general's name badge too, then looks up, googly eyes sorry: \"Me burp, General **Cao**.\""],"朵":["flower","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, breathing loudly, and finds a single *flower* growing out of a crack in the dark. He ignites his red lightsaber, and the **flower** does not flinch. \"I find your petals disturbing,\" he booms, and lifts it with the Force, but the **flower** keeps blooming, until he tucks it under his helmet, where nobody can see."],"仔":["careful","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, where a lion *cub* sleeps in a blanket among ten thousand dozing bees. Being **careful** is not his habit, but he draws his rapier and, tongue out, cuts one tiny Z into the blanket's hem. The *cub* sneezes, the bees stir, and he vanishes with a **careful**, very quiet laugh."],"柔":["soft","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Boathouse} and politely reads a *springy twig* its rights. The twig bends, bounces and tickles his steel chest, and his targeting display flashes an error as his armour goes **soft** as jelly. He wobbles into a canoe, hugs a pillow, and announces a new directive: arrest nothing that is not **soft**."],"俩":["two","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Basement} of the {Piazza} and faces an ancient trap: a *balance scale* that opens the tomb door only for **two**. She grabs a *standing person* gawping nearby, somersaults them both on board, and the *balance scale* settles dead level at exactly **two**. The door grinds open, a pigeon lands on her ponytail, and the boulder starts rolling."],"孟":["Meng","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, head-butts a block, and instead of a coin down falls the *firstborn* baby of the **Meng** family, swaddled in leaves. \"Wahoo!\" He feeds the *firstborn* a mushroom, and the child shoots up past the treetops. Monkeys bow by the hundred to enormous young **Meng**, heir of the whole jungle."],"腐":["rotten","{Frodo} limps into the {Basement} of the {Pool} after a very long walk, and finds a tiny *mansion* built entirely of *meat*. Faint with hunger, he steps up to it, and one bare hairy toe sinks right through a green, fuzzy wall: completely **rotten**. Sam sniffs and says even the road to Mordor smelled better, and the **rotten** *mansion* sags with a sigh."],"幼":["young","{Yoshi} licks up a silk *cocoon* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, swallows it, and lays it as an egg. A tiny *strong arm* punches through the shell, and out wriggles a caterpillar in a nappy, so **young** it still wears the eggshell as a hat. It flexes, calls him mum, and rows off in a boat, and Yoshi flutter-jumps after the **young** champion in alarm."],"践":["carry out","{James Bond} surfaces in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with a perfect plan and Q's shoes. A click, and *twin blades* flick out from each toe, and his *kicking foot* slices the vault hinges without creasing his tuxedo. Others talk about plans, but he will **carry out** every step, he remarks, as bankers gape, and he strolls away to **carry out** the last one over lunch."],"籍":["register","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} to sign the town **register**, which is a stalk of *bamboo* for every citizen, sprouting from a *ploughed field* of sand. He carves \"Bond. James Bond.\" with Q's pen. Unfortunately the pen does one absurd thing: every other stalk of *bamboo* falls over, leaving him the only name in the **register**."],"牧":["herd","{Mario} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and head-butts a block, and instead of a coin out flops a *cow* on an inflatable ring. Every block brings another, until fifty are splashing about and he must **herd** them with a long *cane*. He eats a mushroom, grows huge, and with one \"Wahoo!\" sweeps the whole **herd** down a warp pipe."],"凉":["cool","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Stadium}, up the frozen walls of a buried *palace* where a heatwave rages outside, and *icicles* drop like spear traps around her. She backflips through them and lifts the relic, and the ancient vents exhale: the whole sweating crowd turns delightfully **cool**. She pulls on sunglasses, ponytail frosted, and walks away from the falling ice, looking very **cool**."],"牲":["livestock","{Sherlock} crouches in {Front} of the {Jungle} with his magnifying glass over a nibbled *seedling*. From one tooth mark he deduces a left-handed *cow*, then goats, pigs and hens: an entire herd of **livestock**. \"Elementary, Watson,\" he says smugly. Out of the trees they all trot exactly as predicted, and the **livestock** eats his deerstalker."],"佳":["fine","{James Bond} sits in {Front} of the {Piazza} as a *standing person* offers him a polished *jade tablet*, Q's gadget for rating absolutely everything. It chimes **fine** at the wine and at his tuxedo, then overheats trying to find a flaw. The *jade tablet* starts to smoke, the *standing person* flees, and Bond sips calmly as it explodes. \"**Fine**,\" he says."],"娜":["female name","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} disguised as a grandmother, with a dozen shadow clones in matching robes. A *woman* in a mud mask demands a **female name** from each, and her *pointing finger* slides down the list. \"Anna! Lana! Nana!\" they yell, all at once, and he never gives up until every **female name** is taken and she is out of towels."],"浓":["thick","{Naruto} dives {Inside} the {Lagoon} with a ramen pot while a dozen shadow clones raid a whole *farm* for noodles, and the *water drops* boil away. He stirs with a spinning Rasengan, and the broth grows so **thick** that the Rasengan stops dead. Never giving up, he stands his headband in it, then a clone, and the **thick** soup holds them both upright."],"芳":["fragrant","{Frodo} trudges barefoot in {Front} of the {Hangar} and steps onto a *square* of *grass* that smells of the Shire. It is so **fragrant** that he drops to his knees, wiggling his hairy toes, and refuses to walk another step towards anywhere. Pilots float out of their cockpits, sniffing, and Sam rolls up the whole **fragrant** *square* to carry home."],"稿":["draft","{Gandalf} mutters in the {Basement} of the {Tower}, and at one tap of his staff every *grain stalk* in the sacks rises and begins writing out his memoirs, stacking itself into a tiny *tower*. He reads the first **draft**, scowls, and fires a rocket from his pipe. The *tower* collapses, the sentences scramble, and he crankily announces that this is the second **draft**."],"竹":["bamboo","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Pool} and casts a *fish hook* on a trick line, and up comes a stalk of green **bamboo** with a squirting flower on top. He has rigged the whole pool. Under every lilo another stalk of **bamboo** springs up, lifting a startled swimmer into the air, squirting him gently in the eye, and the Joker falls over laughing."],"腹":["belly","{Frodo} reaches the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} on the *return trip* from a very long walk, and Sam announces it is time for second breakfast, then third. His **belly** swells with every stop, and the *return trip* turns into one long meal. The *moon* peers through the window, sees a **belly** rounder than itself, and sulks away behind a cloud."],"跌":["fall","{Darth Vader} marches in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} breathing loudly when a *lost arrow* whizzes past and pins his cape, and his *kicking foot* catches on a rock. The great black helmet begins to **fall**. He reaches out with the Force to save himself, but lifts only a passing yeti, who drops on him, and they **fall** together while he booms \"Nooo!\""],"逻":["patrol","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Warehouse} to **patrol** a *road* of conveyor belts lined with stolen relics that keep trying to escape in their crates. Every lap she flips over a rolling boulder and swipes a flying dart out of the air with a *gauze net*, ponytail whipping. The *road* speeds up, the relics giggle, and she must **patrol** all night."],"垂":["droop","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Waiting Room}, where a *weeping willow* grows out of the carpet and promptly eats his kite. \"Good grief,\" he sighs, and his round head begins to **droop**. His shoulders follow, then the zigzag on his shirt, then every branch of the *weeping willow* in sympathy, and even Snoopy's ears **droop**, just to be polite."],"遵":["obey","{Zorro} lands in {Front} of the {Casino} and raises a *toast* on the tip of his rapier, and the gamblers along the *road* swear to **obey** the new rules: no cheating, no bullying. A fat sergeant refuses. Flash go three strokes, a Z appears on his belt and his trousers drop, so he bows, pink-faced, and starts to **obey**, as Zorro vanishes laughing."],"脉":["pulse","{Mario} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, sees a glowing *stream* under the *moon*, and being a plumber, grabs it like a leaky pipe. He feels a **pulse**: thump, thump, the whole island is alive! A coin pops out with every beat and he jumps for each one, \"Wahoo!\", as the *moon* nods in time and the **pulse** speeds up."],"貌":["appearance","{Mario} climbs out of a pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, where a sheet shows the *silhouette* of a princess in distress. Judging by **appearance**, the rescue is done: he stomps the guards, tears down the sheet, and shouts \"Wahoo!\". Out steps a *badger* in a paper crown, whose whole **appearance** was a trick, and who says the princess is in another castle."],"柏":["cypress","{Batman} descends on his grappling hook into the {Basement} of the {Island} and finds a secret cave holding one tall, black, gloomy **cypress**, a *tree* dark enough to brood under. He scans its bark, hangs up his cape and scowls happily. Then a *white dove* builds a nest on it and coos all night, and even the **cypress** cannot keep him miserable."],"狱":["prison","{Yoshi} wanders into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and is thrown in **prison** by a *prowling dog* with a ring of keys. He flicks out his tongue, swallows the bars one by one, and lays them as a tidy egg. Then he gulps up the startled *prowling dog* too and lays it as an egg with a tiny barred window, its very own **prison**."],"猜":["guess","{Cookie Monster} squats in {Front} of the {Island} as a *prowling dog* digs at a patch of *moss* and barks at him to **guess** what lies under it. \"Me **guess** cookie!\" he roars, then again, and again, googly eyes whirling, spraying crumbs from no cookie at all. The *moss* peels back on one old sock, and he eats it anyway, moss and all."],"怜":["pity","{Lara Croft} swings {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} as a *herald* announces that a tiny relic coin has lain alone for three thousand years. Tough as she is, her *standing heart* melts with **pity**. She vaults a boulder, flips through a dart trap, snatches the tarnished little thing and, out of pure **pity**, carries it all the way back to its tomb to be with its friends."],"惑":["puzzled","{Homer} dozes at a *guard post* in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, just like at the plant, until he wakes to find a beating *heart* in a box marked GUARD THIS. Guard it from whom, and why, he wonders, utterly **puzzled**. He tries feeding it a doughnut, the *heart* thumps something in Morse, the barrier falls on him, and he stays **puzzled**: \"D'oh!\""],"陶":["pottery","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Tower} and, baffled by civilisation, asks a shelf of *pottery* in ape-speech where it lives. It does not answer, so he wears a teapot as a hat. His jungle yell shatters all the **pottery**, and the apes rush to dig clay from the *hillside*, patting out wobbly new **pottery** shaped like bananas."],"兽":["beast","{Sherlock} peers into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and, from a single wet hair under his magnifying glass, deduces an enormous **beast**. \"Elementary,\" he says smugly, and a pair of *horns* rises from the water exactly where he points. Watson shrieks as the **beast** surfaces, and Sherlock calmly hangs his deerstalker on the *horns* and asks it for a light."],"帐":["tent","The {Joker} rigs a prank in the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, hanging up one innocent fluffy *towel*. A pilot tugs it and it springs open into a giant purple **tent**, trapping him with confetti. A wig of green *long hair* shoots out of the top like a flag, the Joker cackles, and jet wind carries the whole **tent** off down the runway."],"饰":["decoration","{Sherlock} inspects a *side dish* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and, with one look through his magnifying glass, deduces that the parsley is pure **decoration**. \"Elementary, Watson,\" he says, as Watson eats it. Offended, the bees start gluing sprigs to his deerstalker, his pipe and his violin, until the great detective stands there smugly, a walking **decoration**."],"贷":["loan","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and, with one raised glove, floats a giant *shell* of pearls away from a crab, calling it a **loan**. A *stand-in* in a cheap plastic helmet signs the papers for him. When the crab returns for the **loan**, waving its claw, the *stand-in* can only quaver, \"I am your father.\""],"昌":["prosperous","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Hangar} under a *double sun*, two blazing suns side by side, and everyone around him booms. Crops sprout, planes multiply, and even Snoopy turns **prosperous** selling lemonade. Charlie buys one kite with his last nickel, and in the most **prosperous** town on Earth, the only tree for miles eats it. \"Good grief.\""],"叙":["narrate","{Shrek} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} with a plate of *leftovers*, but Donkey will not stop begging for a story. So a big green *right hand* points at each scrap and he grumbles out to **narrate**: this crust was a dragon's, this bone a lord's, and ogres, like onions, have layers. Visitors crowd in, and he must **narrate** till the plate is an exhibit."],"躺":["lie down","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and, baffled by a fallen *attic* with a mattress spilling from it, asks a passing ape what it is for. The ape shows him how to **lie down**. He stretches his *torso* across it, sinks, and lets out the softest jungle yell in history. Jets roar overhead, and the apes **lie down** in a row beside him."],"钢":["steel","{Gandalf} plants himself in {Front} of the {Hangar} on a mountain *ridge* and raises his staff over a heap of *gold coins*. A crack of spellwork melts them, and they flow out as a wall of grey **steel**. \"You shall not pass!\" he roars at a taxiing jet, which bounces off the **steel** with a boom, while the *ridge* rumbles in approval."],"沟":["ditch","{Gandalf} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, ties a firework to a long *hook*, and lights it with a flick of his staff. It tears off across the yard, the *hook* scraping a deep **ditch** behind it, and with a muttered spell he calls *water drops* from a clear sky. Boats slide off their racks and sail down the **ditch**, exactly as he meant."],"寄":["send","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where an *oddball* sits under a *roof* of envelopes, begging to be posted to the moon. Bond draws Q's stamp gun, a gadget that can only **send** things, and fires. The *roof* flaps away like a flock of pigeons, the *oddball* rockets off, and Bond murmurs, \"Do **send** a postcard.\""],"扶":["help up","{Frodo} collapses {Inside} the {Pool}, too weary to go on, right beside a slippery *husband* who has gone splat. Loyal Sam arrives with a *helping hand* to **help up** Frodo and carries him if he must. Barely standing, on bare hairy feet, Frodo still turns back, reluctant and shaking, to **help up** the *husband*, and all three slide over again."],"铺":["shop","{Pikachu} opens a **shop** in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} on a floating *seedbed*, selling berries he grows on it. Every sale, his cheeks spark and the *gold coins* leap across the water and stick to his fur by static. Customers ask the prices and hear only \"Pika!\", until a trainer throws a Poké Ball and catches him, **shop** and all."],"邓":["Deng","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} as a *right hand* waves from the top of a *hillside*. He raises one glove and floats the whole *hillside* over with the Force, delivering Mr **Deng**, mid-wave. \"I am your father,\" Vader booms. Mr **Deng** checks his family scroll, shakes his head, and informs him that no **Deng** has ever breathed that loudly."],"寿":["long life","{Sherlock} examines a *longevity peach* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, and from one bite mark deduces that its last eater is nine hundred years old. \"Elementary.\" He takes a bite to prove it and a white beard shoots down past his boots. **Long life** suits him, he tells Watson smugly, for a **long life** gives him centuries of saying he was right."],"惧":["fear","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, unruffled as ever, and opens a *toolbox* from Q, which starts buzzing and sawing by itself. For the first time, his *standing heart* leaps out of his tuxedo, trembling with **fear**, and dives into a mummy's coffin. He straightens his bow tie, but the rattling lid betrays his secret **fear**."],"询":["inquire","{Shrek} trudges {Inside} the {Dunes}, lost, and hates to ask, but Donkey will not shut up, so a grudging *small speech bubble* squeezes out of his mouth to **inquire** the way to his swamp. The camel says nothing. For *ten days* he must **inquire** of every cactus, roaring when none replies, until the sky is crowded with sulky question marks."],"汤":["soup","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Hangar} and, baffled by a bubbling cauldron of *soup*, asks it in ape-speech what kind of animal it is. He wrestles it when it spits, and it boils over. At his jungle yell, elephants thunder in to slurp the **soup** with their trunks, and they spray so much **soup** that the jets taxi away dripping noodles."],"盗":["rob","{Darth Vader} looms over a long *queue* of thieves in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, all waiting to **rob** a golden *dish*. He finds them slow. One raised glove, and every gem floats out of the *dish*, past their noses and under his cape. The *queue* gasps, and he booms, between loud breaths, that only the Empire may **rob** anyone here."],"肥":["fat","{Frodo} tiptoes {Inside} the {Lake} with Sam's second breakfast, and a *python* swallows the whole basket and swells up **fat**. He slips on the Ring to vanish, but it swallows his cloak, the pots and Sam's hat, growing so **fat** that it cannot slither. Then it opens wide at the *moon*, which rolls hopefully in, and Frodo sighs and starts walking."],"尝":["taste","{Charlie Brown} queues {Inside} the {Hangar} for a *taste test* of free sweets, hoping that just this once his luck will change. Everybody ahead gets to **taste** a chocolate cake. When he reaches the table, he opens his bag and looks in. \"I got a rock,\" he says, and with a gloomy sigh, licks it, because at least he can **taste** the rock."],"匆":["hurried","{Cookie Monster} sits in {Front} of the {Lagoon} when a *flapping flag* signals that the cookie boat sails in one minute. \"Me no time!\" In one **hurried** gulp he swallows breakfast, plate and chair in a spray of crumbs, then the *flapping flag* as well. He makes such a **hurried** dash for the jetty that he runs straight off the end, still chewing."],"辉":["shine","{Homer} stumbles in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} fresh from a nap at the nuclear plant, and a beam of *light* pours from his bald head. His scheme is to use it to find doughnuts, but he begins to **shine** so brightly that a passing *army* lifts its shields in salute. They **shine** it right back at him, and the blinded Homer yells \"D'oh!\""],"奈":["how","{Naruto} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, where a *big man* is bowing at an *altar*, and yells, \"**How** do I become Hokage?\" The *altar* says nothing. So he makes a dozen shadow clones and they all yell **how**, never giving up, until the *altar* cracks and the *big man* just picks up Naruto and carries him out, still asking."],"扣":["button","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} one minute before showtime, as the star's coat bursts and a **button** pings across the tiles. \"Yaaay!\" he panics, arms whirling, and a *helping hand* rushes in with needle and thread. A big *mouth* from the chorus bites off the thread too soon, and the **button** pops off again and lands on his banjo with a twang."],"廷":["court","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} on a vine and lands in a marble *courtyard* full of the emperor's **court**. Baffled by all the bowing, he decides it must be a greeting, so he grooms the emperor for fleas and chats with the royal peacocks. Then he lets out his jungle yell, and the whole **court** ends up in the trees, eating fruit."],"澳":["Australia","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and drifts into a *maze* where *water drops* pass right through him. Straight through the hedges he finds a kangaroo and says hello, and it screams and bolts. Only wanting a friend, he follows it across the sea, through wall after wall, until he comes out in **Australia**, where he frightens all of **Australia** by accident."],"嘛":["obviously","{Mario} stomps on the {Roof} of the {Spa}, where a warp pipe is blocked, and a guest asks how a plumber will clear it. He bites the rope of *hemp* stuck inside the pipe and hauls it out with his *mouth*, metre after metre, moustache bristling. Coins spray out behind it, the guest stares, and he shrugs: \"**Obviously**.\" Then out comes a mushroom too: **obviously**."],"董":["director","{Darth Vader} sinks into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, where the *director* of the company is banging a rubber duck for silence. Vader's breathing does the job instead, and the boardroom table rises slowly in the Force. \"I am your **director**,\" he booms, and the old *director* bows, hands him the duck, and asks in a very small voice if a new **director** needs a coffee."],"迁":["move","{Chewbacca} roars in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} as *thousand ants* march down the *road*, each struggling with one coin, trying to **move** the bank across town. Loyal to any friend in need, he straps his bandolier round the building and heaves. Growls that only they understand keep them in step, and the entire bank begins to **move**, ants underneath like wheels."],"凝":["freeze","{Naruto} charges {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, Rasengan spinning, and smashes it into a row of *icicles* hanging from the ropes. The whirling frost makes everything **freeze**: the punches, the crowd, his dozen shadow clones in mid-leap, each wearing the same *puzzled face*. Inch by inch he too starts to **freeze**, still yelling that he will never give up."],"慰":["comfort","{Walter White} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake}, where an *officer* cradles a broken *heart* that will not stop crying. Adjusting his glasses, he mixes a beaker of cocoa at exactly 37 degrees, proud of his precise science, as a **comfort**. The *officer* holds it steady, the *heart* sips, and it purrs at last, full of warm, measured **comfort**."],"厌":["fed up","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} at the foot of a tiled *cliff*, where a *dog* keeps bringing him the same stick. He swallows it and lays it as an egg; the *dog* cracks the egg and brings the stick back, a thousand times over. Finally his tongue droops, and both are totally **fed up**, the **fed up** dog flopping at the bottom."],"脏":["dirty","{Zorro} slashes a Z in {Front} of the {Hangar} and splits an oil drum, which sprays over a *farmstead* of startled pigs and over his cape. Everything turns **dirty**: pigs, planes, and the *moon* itself, frowning through a smear of grease. He bows, dashing as ever, but his black horse takes one sniff and refuses to carry so **dirty** a hero.","zāng"],"腾":["soar","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Jungle} on his longest vine, lets go with a jungle yell, and lassoes the *moon*. It tugs him up past the canopy and he begins to **soar** over the treetops, loincloth flapping, baffled but delighted. The apes grab his ankles one by one and they all **soar** away together, a long hairy tail on a very bright kite."],"幽":["secluded","{Yoshi} creeps in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, behind a *mountain*, and with his long tongue swallows everything noisy: ducks, radios, a brass band, laying each as a silent egg. A *silk pair* of curtains swishes shut behind him. The place is now completely **secluded**. He says \"Yoshi!\" and hears nothing back, for nobody remains to admire how **secluded** it is."],"怨":["resent","{Yoshi} slides into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint} and, with one flick of his tongue, steals the pillow from a *tossing sleeper* and lays it as an egg. All night the man turns and mutters, his *heart* thumping with grudges, for he will **resent** that dinosaur for ever. Yoshi offers the egg back, chirping, and he goes on to **resent** that as well."],"鞋":["shoe","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave}, roaring, because a yeti with bunions has stolen his only **shoe**. He wants peace, so he slaps a sheet of *rawhide* on a *jade tablet* and cuts the yeti one of its own. The new **shoe** fits, but he has stuffed it with onions, and the stink drives every yeti far away, which is exactly what he wanted."],"丢":["lose","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel}, balancing spare helmets on a *shoulder pole*, and one jab of his *elbow* tips the lot down the lawn. The Force fetches back a single helmet, but he has managed to **lose** the rest. Booming with disapproval, he reaches for his lightsaber and finds he contrived to **lose** that too."],"埋":["bury","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Island} and jumps on a treasure chest, stomp, stomp, stomp, because that is how he will **bury** it. The *soil* closes over with a coin-like ding. A whole *village* hears it, moves in on top and starts stomping too, wanting to **bury** their own treasures, until the island is all lumps, and Mario shouts \"Wahoo!\""],"泉":["spring","{Chewbacca} ducks {Inside} the {Mint} to fix a leaking coin press, loses his temper and rips off the panel, and a *wellspring* bursts up through the floor. A **spring** of hot sparkling water fires coins at the ceiling. He roars, wrestles it with a spanner and gives up, then shakes his soaked fur dry and climbs in, a huge happy Wookiee soaking in his new **spring**."],"涌":["gush","{Yoshi} sits in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} as *water drops* trickle out of a *tunnel* in the wall. He sticks in his tongue and gulps until he swells like a balloon, then lays the lot as one huge wobbling egg. It cracks, the water starts to **gush** across the floor, and more begins to **gush** from the *tunnel*, so he floats away, chirping \"Yoshi!\""],"辖":["govern","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Piazza} and, to his horror, is declared mayor, so now he must **govern** it. He roars decrees from a *cart*: no visitors, no singing, nobody near him. A *pest* keeps nibbling the speech, Donkey keeps adding clauses, and the *cart* rolls off down the hill. To **govern**, he finds, is mostly roaring and being talked at."],"躲":["hide","{Darth Vader} tries to **hide** in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, crouching his huge *torso* behind a tiny *flower*. Stormtroopers tiptoe past with a birthday cake, but his loud breathing echoes off the crates and the *flower* bends flat with every gust. \"You cannot **hide**, my lord,\" one whispers, and the cake's candles blow out."],"晋":["advance","{James Bond} surfaces in the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} wearing a *silver medal*, which simply does not go with his tuxedo. He clicks it, and Q's gadget, glinting like the *sun*, fires a small rocket upward so that he may **advance** one rank. Unruffled, he passes the attic, a pigeon and the *sun* itself, remarking that he always intended to **advance**."],"紫":["purple","{Zorro} lunges into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} and slashes a Z at *this spot* on a blackberry barrel. Juice spurts out, soaks a *silk skein* **purple**, and he cracks it like a whip through the swarm. Every bee, every comb and his own black cape turn **purple**, and he swings away laughing on the skein, trailing grape-scented bees."],"艰":["hard","{James Bond} dangles in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} by one *right hand*, his jetpack jammed, under the burning *glare* of a banker below. For once it is **hard**: Q's other gadget, a cufflink, can only play the flute. So he plays, unruffled, one-handed, while the *glare* climbs the wall, and he remarks that it has been a **hard** day at the office."],"魏":["Wei","{Walter White} knocks on the door of the {Bathroom} of the {Lake}, where a *ghost* clutches a *wilting stalk* and moans for the lost kingdom of **Wei**. Glasses gleaming, he measures plant food into a beaker, correct to the milligram, and pours. The *wilting stalk* shoots upward, tiny towers sprout from it, and **Wei** rises on the water, top of the class."],"吾":["I","{Walter White} strides {Inside} the {Pool} in his black hat, sets up a chemistry class in the shallow end, and taps a *speaker* with a beaker. \"**I** am the one who knocks,\" he booms. The *speaker* squeals and echoes it, **I**, **I**, **I**, until the whole class is too scared to say the word and the swimmers raise their hands to ask permission."],"慌":["panic","{Homer} sits in {Front} of the {Swamp}, opens his doughnut box, and finds a *wasteland* of crumbs. **Panic**! \"D'oh!\" he screams, and his *standing heart* sprints in circles, sets off the alarm from the plant and tumbles into the mud. Frogs join the **panic**, croaking sirens, while the *wasteland* blows gently away in the breeze."],"祝":["wish","The {Joker} skips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and sets up a *small altar* with a birthday cake whose trick candles relight forever. His *big brother* kneels to make a **wish**, blows until he turns purple, and the squirting flower on the altar soaks him. Cackling, the Joker hands him a playing card that reads \"**Wish** again\"."],"邮":["mail","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Boathouse} as the *hillside* above tips a *sprouting field* of letters through the door, a landslide of **mail**. His long tongue gulps the lot, then he flutter-jumps from boat to boat laying one speckled egg per address. Rowers crack them at breakfast and find their **mail**, slightly sticky."],"吐":["spit","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, gives his jungle yell, and a giant *mouth* in the wall yells back. Raised by apes, he knows the proper greeting: he shows it how to **spit**. Delighted, the mouth starts to **spit** *soil* in great wet gobs, and the apes line up to catch it."],"狠":["ruthless","{Homer} naps in the {Basement} of the {Funfair} with a doughnut on his chest when a *prowling dog* sidles up. Its *glare* is **ruthless**: no blinking, no mercy, and it eats the doughnut one slow bite at a time while he watches. \"D'oh!\" Homer tries a dim scheme with a decoy doughnut on a string, and the **ruthless** dog eats the string as well."],"鉴":["examine","{James Bond} slips into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, straightens his tuxedo and clicks open a cufflink from Q that does one thing: it lets him **examine** *gold*. A bar of it squeals under the tiny lens and confesses it is chocolate in foil. Unruffled, he pauses to **examine** it once more, then eats the evidence."],"曰":["say","{Yoshi} skids on a *plank* in {Front} of the {Ice Rink}, and a chattering *mouth* floats by with something to **say**. His tongue shoots out and swallows it whole, but it keeps talking from his belly. He lays an egg, the egg cracks, and the mouth pops out to **say** \"Yoshi!\", the only word it has left."],"械":["tool","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} wanting only peace, but a *sentry* blocks the door and a *tree* hung with saws and spanners rattles at him. Donkey will not shut up about which **tool** to choose. Shrek roars, every spanner falls off, and he picks the only **tool** an ogre needs: an onion to throw at the sentry."],"咬":["bite","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps down into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where a hungry *mouth* on *crossed legs* hops after him, trying to **bite** his tail. His tongue whips out, he gulps it down, and it carries on trying to **bite** him from his own stomach. Hiccup: out plops a spotted egg, gnashing, with two little legs kicking through the shell."],"邻":["neighbour","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Inn} through a window, ponytail flying, and cracks open a secret tomb door in the wall. A *herald* in the dark trumpets that she has just met her **neighbour**: a mummy in slippers, whose tomb is dug into the *hillside* next door. The *hillside* rumbles and sends a boulder rolling through, and Lara somersaults over it as her new **neighbour** asks to borrow some sugar."],"赤":["red","{Charlie Brown} chases his kite into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and walks straight into the door, with every bee watching. His *red cheeks* glow so hot that the towels, the honey and the bees all turn **red** too. \"Good grief,\" he mumbles, while Snoopy, also **red**, waves from the top of the hive."],"挤":["squeeze","{James Bond} escapes into the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut to find a *trimmed hedge* filling the whole room. A *helping hand* on a spring, Q's latest gadget, shoots from his briefcase and shoves him in, so he must **squeeze** through the twigs without creasing his tuxedo. He pops out spotless, and the hedge gives a final **squeeze**. \"Shaken,\" he says, \"not stirred.\""],"弯":["bent","{Walter White} sets up beakers in {Front} of the {Mansion}, adjusts his glasses and dips a straight stick into a class experiment. Out comes a *bent bow*, which twangs and fires test tubes across the lawn, every one landing **bent**. Proud of his precise science, he dips the lamp post too and chalks on the board that it is exactly forty degrees **bent**."],"椅":["chair","{Yoshi} pads into the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut, where an *oddball* perches on a whole creaking *tree*, insisting it is comfortable. His tongue whips out and swallows the tree in one gulp, leaving the oddball hanging in mid-air. He squats, strains and lays a huge egg, which cracks to reveal a **chair** with bark on it, and the oddball sits on the **chair**, complaining."],"陪":["accompany","{Pikachu} trots {Inside} the {Lake} house as the *hillside* rolls a *spitting mouth* down after him. \"Pika!\" he says, zapping it with a Thunderbolt, but the mouth only spits cherry stones and insists it will **accompany** him. He hides in his Poké Ball, and it rolls up alongside, spitting politely, to **accompany** the ball instead."],"割":["cut","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Hut} exactly when he means to, as a *pest* chews the thatch. He raises his staff and mutters a spell, and a *standing knife* rises from the ground and marches off to **cut** the grass by itself. It chases the pest in circles, and at his \"You shall not pass!\" it stops to **cut** one neat line between them."],"揭":["uncover","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a huge *question mark* quivers under a sheet. His bow tie, from Q, fires a *helping hand* that whips the sheet away to **uncover** a yeti in an identical tuxedo. \"Bond,\" says the yeti. Unruffled, Bond tugs at its lapel to **uncover** a smaller yeti, also armed with a one-liner."],"韦":["Wei","{Walter White} teaches {Inside} the {Lake} house in his black hat, lowering a *leather strap* into a beaker of bubbling school chemicals. The strap wriggles out and fizzes letters onto itself, spelling the name **Wei**. Walter nods at his precise science, and Grandpa **Wei** rows up at once to claim his strap and demand full marks."],"悟":["realise","{Walter White} chalks an equation across the tiles of the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, while a *speaker* booms the question at his only pupil, a *standing heart*. He drops one indicator into a beaker, it flashes pink, and the heart thumps as it starts to **realise** the answer. Walter, glasses gleaming, is so proud that he doesn't **realise** his hat is fizzing."],"聪":["clever","{Cookie Monster} lollops in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, where a giant *ear* hears every secret and a *tally* on a slate counts them up. He devours both in a spray of crumbs, and his googly eyes stop spinning: all the facts are in his tummy. \"Me **clever** now!\" he booms, solving sums for the ducks, and then eats the answers, which is less **clever**."],"雾":["fog","{Walter White} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} to do one *chore*: mop the floor, but as a precise experiment. Dry ice meets hot water in his largest beaker while *rain* drips through a crack, and a thick **fog** rolls out. Swimmers walk into each other. Walter, proud, measures it, announces that it is textbook **fog**, and cannot find his glasses."],"锋":["sharp edge","{Frodo} trudges barefoot in {Front} of the {Jungle} after a very long walk, with *gold coins* pouring down a *peak* behind him, tempting him to stop. He won't, but his bare hairy feet tread them thin until every coin has a **sharp edge**. Sam picks one up, slices a pineapple clean through, and sighs that at least the **sharp edge** keeps them fed."],"梯":["ladder","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Beach} hut and stops, baffled: his *little brother*, an ape, has pulled a **ladder** out of a *tree*, whose branches are shaking off rungs. Tarzan sniffs it, bites it, and wears it as a hat. Then he yells, and the whole troop of apes climbs the **ladder** on his head."],"猫":["cat","{Mario} leaps in {Front} of the {Tower} as a *prowling dog* snarls out of a patch of *young crop*. \"Wahoo!\" He stomps on it, it goes flat with a boing, and up it pops as a **cat**, coughing out one gold coin. He stomps the next dog, collects another coin, and soon every sprouting shoot has a smug **cat** on it."],"祥":["lucky","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Stadium} to demand some quiet, and a *small altar* rolls out with a *sheep* on it, chewing the fans' scarves. He roars at it, and his ogre breath blows the ball straight into the net. Goal! Now the crowd is chanting that the sheep is **lucky**, that ogre breath is **lucky**, and Donkey will not shut up about it."],"阔":["wide","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} to stage-manage a show, flails his arms and accidentally opens a *gate*. *Living water* pours through, spreading out into a lake so **wide** he can't see the other side. \"Yaaay!\" he panics, paddling with his banjo, arms flung as **wide** as they will go."],"誉":["praise","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and lands in a surprise *party*, where every statue holds a *speech bubble* full of **praise**. His tongue darts out and he swallows the bubbles one by one. He lays a glittering egg, it hatches, and more **praise** pours out, all of it for him, all of it in his own voice: \"Yoshi!\""],"筹":["raise funds","{Charlie Brown} sets up a stall {Inside} the {Boathouse} selling *longevity peach* tarts on *bamboo* sticks, trying to **raise funds** for a new kite. The bamboo snaps, the peaches roll into the water, and Snoopy eats the rest. \"Good grief,\" he sighs, the only boy ever to **raise funds** and end up owing three cents."],"丛":["cluster","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Lagoon} palace and a *follower* scurries after him carrying a *plank* stacked with cookies, then hundreds more. They huddle so tight they form one bristling **cluster**, planks sprouting like branches. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, munching into the **cluster** in a spray of crumbs until only one embarrassed follower remains."],"牵":["lead","{Chewbacca} pounds in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} with his bandolier looped around a *big man* like a dog **lead**. He roars directions nobody else understands, so the man trots wherever the tug goes, whimpering and fetching coins. When the man tries to **lead** the way himself, Chewbacca growls, rips a parking meter from the ground and loyally hands it to him as a treat."],"鸣":["chirp","{Mario} bounces {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and head-butts a floating block. Out flies a little *bird*, it opens its *mouth* to **chirp**, and a coin pops out. \"Wahoo!\" He butts block after block, every **chirp** paying one coin, and the boxers give up the fight to chase the money."],"沈":["Shen","{Sherlock} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, pipe in mouth, and studies *water drops* falling on a soggy *pillow*. One dent and one snore are enough: \"Elementary, Watson: old Mr **Shen**.\" Mr **Shen**, asleep under the pillow, rolls over, soaked, as Watson trails behind with a towel."],"阁":["pavilion","{Gandalf} ducks {Inside} the {Hut}, bumps his pointy hat on a dusty *loft* and, being cranky, taps it with his staff. With a crackle of fireworks the *loft* unfolds like a flower into a grand **pavilion** with curved eaves and swaying lanterns. He lights his pipe, blows a smoke ring shaped like a second **pavilion**, and declares that it arrived exactly when he meant it to."],"穆":["solemn","{Mario} rises from a warp pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, gripping a *grain stalk* whose *shimmer* hushes the room. He takes off his red cap, the taps stop dripping, and every swimmer stands **solemn**, as at a funeral for a mushroom. Even his \"Wahoo\" comes out as a **solemn** whisper, and he stomps on a rubber duck very, very slowly."],"屈":["bend","{Chewbacca} arrives in {Front} of the {Museum}, far too huge for its little door, and a *crouching man* beckons him from underneath. He roars, tries to **bend** like him, gets stuck, and rips the door frame off in a temper. Then he loyally rebuilds it even lower, so that now the crouching man has to **bend** double too."],"旨":["aim","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} and slaps a trick *edict scroll* on the queen bee's throne, where it unrolls with a honk. It declares that the hive's only **aim** is to make him laugh. Cackling, he takes **aim** with his squirting flower, soaks the bees, and the scroll squirts him right back."],"袖":["sleeve","{Shrek} barges into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} in a *shirt* with one enormous **sleeve**, just wanting to wash. A *sprouting field* grows out of the cuff: onions, layers upon layers of them, and then Donkey pops up among them, talking. Shrek roars, stuffs him back up the **sleeve**, and peels an onion in peace."],"猎":["hunt","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} on a relic **hunt**, and a *prowling dog* sniffs out a trail of *sun-dried meat* for her. Each strip sits on a pressure plate: click, darts; click, a rolling boulder. She backflips over them all, ponytail flying, and the **hunt** ends at a golden idol with a yeti sitting on it, chewing jerky."],"臂":["arm","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a *pioneer* is boasting that nothing beats his **arm**. Growling, Batman fires a grappling hook through the window at the *moon*, and the moon reels him in by the **arm**, stretching it across the sand. The pioneer hangs his washing on it, and Batman broods, one very long limb still in the sky."],"蛇":["snake","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Hut}, magnifying glass up, and finds a *bug* riding a huge *serpent* like a horse. From one scale he deduces all: \"Elementary, Watson: a **snake**, left-handed, fond of jam.\" The **snake** hisses in amazement, and the bug asks how he knew, as Watson backs slowly out of the door."],"贺":["congratulate","{Homer} wakes from a nap in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} as a *shell* snaps open and fires confetti, and a medal shaped like a *plus sign* lands on his chest. The whole town crowds in to **congratulate** him on the longest nap in history. \"Mmm… doughnut,\" he says, biting the medal, \"D'oh!\" They **congratulate** him on that as well."],"柱":["pillar","The {Joker} skips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and spots a *tree* holding up the ceiling, a *candle* burning on its tip. Grinning, he paints it to look like a marble **pillar**, then squirts the candle with his flower. It relights, as trick candles do, and everyone who leans on the **pillar** sets off a whoopee cushion while he cackles."],"抛":["throw","{Pikachu} sparks in {Front} of the {Tower} as a *helping hand* loads Poké Balls into a *catapult*. Each **throw** curves up and comes down on him, and snap, he's caught, and has to zap his way out. \"Pika!\" he yells, charging himself with a Thunderbolt, and the next **throw** hurls him, glowing, straight at the hand."],"鼠":["mouse","{Sherlock} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and peers through his magnifying glass at a *mortar* rattling by itself, dusted with cheese. One crumb is all he needs. \"Elementary, Watson: a **mouse**, left-pawed, recently in Belgium.\" The mortar tips, the **mouse** strolls out, every bit as smug as he is, and takes his pipe."],"瑟":["zither","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and lands on a **zither** with *twin jades* for pegs. Her moon wand touches it, and in a long sparkly transformation the jades begin to pluck the strings alone. A *pinned heart* on the wall throbs along, she bursts into loud tears, and Luna the cat sighs as the **zither** sobs too."],"戈":["halberd","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Hut} as crows mob the thatch, and he taps his staff on a rusty *halberd*. It leaps up by itself, spinning, and he thunders, \"You shall not pass!\" The enchanted **halberd** is as cranky as he is, so it misses every crow and prunes the apple tree instead. Gandalf lights his pipe and pretends the **halberd** meant to."],"牢":["prison","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Tower} and pulls an ancient lever, and down crashes a *roof* of stone bars, trapping her and a *cow* in a tiny **prison**. Ponytail swinging, she solves the rune puzzle in seconds, backflips out and dodges a rolling boulder. The cow moos, chews the key, and stays in **prison**, because the hay is excellent."],"逊":["modest","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes}, where his *grandson*, a tiny ogre, has just built a *road* of gold medals across the sand. Donkey will not shut up about it, but the little ogre blushes and buries them, far too **modest** to look. Shrek grunts that ogres have layers, and one layer, deep under the onion smell, is **modest** too."],"迈":["stride","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, and a *swarm* of bees chases him onto the *road*. He gobbles a mushroom, grows as tall as a lighthouse, and crosses half the island in one giant **stride**. \"Wahoo!\" Each **stride** stomps a coin out of the ground, and the bees give up, out of breath."],"欺":["bully","{Chewbacca} wakes from a nap in {Front} of the {Beach} hut to see a **bully** stuffing small kids into a *winnowing basket*. His enormous *yawn* blows off the boy's hat and rumbles into a roar that nobody needs translated. He rips the basket apart in a temper, the kids climb onto his shoulders, and nobody here will ever **bully** anyone again."],"吨":["ton","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Casino}, breathing loudly, and lifts an entire army *camp* into the air with the Force. A giant *mouth* in the sky opens to swallow it, gulping tank after tank, and the weight meter ticks up **ton** by **ton**. Vader booms his disapproval, Force-squeezes its jaw, and it spits every last **ton** back onto the lawn."],"琴":["zither","{Chewbacca} ducks {Inside} the {Inn} hugging a tiny **zither**, with *twin jades* for pegs and a ticking *clock* at one end. He plucks it with huge hairy fingers, roars along, and snaps every string in a temper when the clock strikes. Then, as with any broken ship, he mends the **zither** with bandolier straps, and it twangs louder than ever."],"衰":["decline","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Wine Cellar}, examining a once-glorious *robe* that frays as he watches, thread by thread. One loose button tells him all: \"Elementary, Watson: a noble family in **decline**.\" His smug grin wilts, his violin goes flat, he guesses Watson's lunch wrong, and Watson notes that the great detective is now in **decline** too."],"瓶":["bottle","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a glass **bottle** rattles along *linked rails* and smacks into a *tile*. \"Pika!\" His Thunderbolt runs down the rails, and the lightning ends up trapped in the glass, glowing yellow. The boxers pass it around like a lantern, until someone pops the **bottle** and everyone's hair stands on end."],"恼":["annoyed","{Naruto} slurps ramen in the {Basement} of the {Tower}, and a *standing heart* stomps up, **annoyed** at the noise. He summons a shadow clone to say sorry, then fifty more, all slurping and all shouting. By the time the last one pops, the heart is so **annoyed** that it steals his noodles."],"燕":["swallow","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} as glowing *embers* pop in the grate and a little fork-tailed **swallow** darts out. His tongue flicks, gulp, and down goes the bird. He lays one warm speckled egg, it cracks with a puff of sparks, and out flies the **swallow**, tail singed, looking deeply betrayed."],"仲":["middle","The {Joker} prances into the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} and paints a *bullseye* on the tummy of a *standing person*. He flicks a trick playing card that lands dead in the **middle**, squirts water everywhere, then pops into a bunch of flowers. Cackling, he spins the poor victim around until they end up in the **middle** of the room, dizzy, soaked and confused."],"诱":["lure","{Yoshi} sniffs his way into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, where a *small speech bubble* floats out from behind a pink *blossom*, whispering about melons, to **lure** him closer. His tongue shoots out and swallows both, bait and whisper. Then he lays them as an egg, sets it by the door, and its muffled melon talk begins to **lure** every duck on the water."],"狼":["wolf","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Hangar} with a relic from an old tomb: a cursed platter holding a *good meal*. A *prowling dog* gobbles it, the ancient trap triggers, and the dog swells, grey and shaggy, into a howling **wolf**. Lara flips onto a wing, ponytail flying, and climbs a rope while the **wolf** gnaws the landing gear."],"池":["pond","{Charlie Brown} shuffles {Inside} the {Beehive} after his kite, which has fallen in a tiny **pond** fed by falling *water drops*. A *scorpion* sails up on a leaf and pulls the kite away at the last second, exactly as he reaches for it. He topples into the **pond** with a \"Good grief\" while Snoopy rides past on the leaf."],"疼":["hurt","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Jungle} lodge, misses the vine and smacks into a *sickbed*, and everything starts to **hurt**. His ape family tuck him in and button him into a *winter coat*, which baffles him so much that he tries to eat it. He beats his chest in a jungle yell, which makes it **hurt** even more."],"卢":["Lu","{Lara Croft} abseils {Inside} the {Pool} and prises an ancient *black pot* from the deep-end tiles, a relic with a riddle on its rim. She solves it, the lid flies up, and out pops Grandma **Lu** holding a ladle. The pot rumbles and releases a rolling boulder, and Lara flips over it while Grandma **Lu** calmly scrubs her back."],"仗":["battle","The {Joker} slides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and declares **battle** on a *standing person* armed with a *walking staff*. He deals trick cards that burst into streamers, and the staff, secretly rigged, unfolds into a bouquet at every swing. Cackling, he squirts his flower, a white flag pops from the staff, and the **battle** ends in a pile of paper aeroplanes."],"冠":["champion","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} in a burst of fireworks and flicks a *cloth cover* from the smallest swan with his staff. A spell starts the *crowning*: a golden wreath drifts down, and she is **champion** of the whole pond. He puffs his pipe, growls that he always knew, and all the swans honk \"**Champion**!\""],"粒":["grain","{Lara Croft} creeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a lone *podium* stands in a shaft of light, holding the relic: a single **grain** of *rice*. She swaps it for a **grain** of sand, the podium sinks with a click, and a rolling boulder chases her out. She backflips clear, ponytail flying, and the rice leaps from her hand, laughing."],"遥":["distant","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Tower} as a giant *claw* dangles from somewhere far, far above. He flutter-jumps, legs windmilling, and it is still **distant**. His long sticky tongue shoots up, on and on for miles, but the claw just waves and drifts away until it is a **distant** dot, and the tongue has to come home alone."],"吕":["Lü","{Lara Croft} drops by rope into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a dinosaur *spine* hangs across a sealed tomb door. She pulls its bones like levers in the right order, the *spine* starts to dance, and the door grinds open to reveal old Professor **Lü**, trapped since last Tuesday. A boulder rolls after them, and she carries Professor **Lü** over it in one backflip."],"玄":["mysterious","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Mint}, grumbling, because a *dark thread* has tied itself to his toe and keeps tugging him through the gloom. It ends at a coin wrapped in layers, like an onion, each layer more **mysterious** than the last. He peels off the final one, finds nothing but Donkey's voice asking questions, and roars at the **mysterious** voice to leave him alone."],"尘":["dust","{Charlie Brown} runs {Inside} the {Funfair} to kick a football, which is pulled away at the last second. He lands flat on his back, and up fly *crumbs* and *soil* in a great cloud of **dust** that settles on him alone. \"Good grief,\" he coughs, and all day the **dust** follows him onto every ride, like his own small raincloud."],"冯":["Feng","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Jungle} on his bare hairy feet, weary of walking, when a *horse* jangling with *icicles* trots up. Its rider, Captain **Feng**, offers a lift, but Frodo, ever reluctant, slips on the Ring and vanishes instead. Captain **Feng** snaps off an icicle, sighs, and offers it to the empty air, where Sam politely takes it."],"抚":["comfort","{Frodo} trudges into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a *vanishing man* sobs because he keeps fading away. Frodo knows that feeling, so he slips on the Ring and vanishes too, just to **comfort** him. Now nobody can see either of them, but Sam's *helping hand* pats the air until it finds them, and that does more to **comfort** them than any speech."],"浅":["shallow","{Chewbacca} wades into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} to fix a leak, roaring, as *water drops* patter on his fur. He rips open the tank with *twin blades* from his bandolier, and the flood drains away until it barely wets his ankles. The bank's little submarine bumps along the **shallow** bottom, and he growls and carries it, loyally, across the **shallow** water."],"敦":["honest","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in {Front} of the {Casino}, where a grandpa taps his *cane* and demands the **honest** truth at his family *feast*. Vader lifts every hidden card from every sleeve with the Force. Then he points at a boy with a drumstick and booms, \"I am your father,\" and the whole feast gasps, because it is, unfortunately, **honest**."],"纠":["correct","{James Bond} adjusts his bow tie in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} and sees a *silk thread* snagged in a *twisted vine*. His watch from Q does one absurd thing: it beeps and pulls anything crooked straight, so he aims it to **correct** them both. Then it goes on to **correct** lamp posts, antennas and a backpacker's spelling. \"Straight,\" he says, \"not stirred.\""],"钻":["drill","{Zorro} swings down in {Front} of the {Swan Pond}, where a *fortune teller* swears treasure lies under the lawn. He spins his rapier like a **drill**, whirling on one heel, cape flying, and bores a perfect Z into the earth. Up spray *gold coins*, the swans duck, and he rides off laughing, his **drill** of a sword still humming."],"晶":["crystal","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and clicks open a pocket gadget from Q that does just one thing. It sucks a *sun* out of the sky, then another *sun*, then a third *sun*, and squeezes all three into one blazing **crystal**. The boxers squint at the glitter, and Bond checks his hair in the **crystal**. \"Bright,\" he says."],"岂":["how could","{Chewbacca} hunches over a board game in the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut as a crab wins and blows a *triumph horn*. **How could** a crab beat him? He roars it, in words only friends understand, and rips the board apart in a temper. Then he mends it, the horn blares again, and the roar comes again: **how could** it happen twice?"],"峡":["gorge","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Piazza}, where a *mountain* has landed right in his way and the crowds will not leave him alone. Roaring, he prises it apart with giant *tongs*, and a deep **gorge** opens down the middle, perfect for an ogre who wants peace. He settles at the bottom with an onion, and then Donkey's voice comes echoing down the **gorge**, on and on."],"苍":["dark green","{Cookie Monster} charges in {Front} of the {Hangar}, mistaking a *barn* for a giant cookie and the *grass* on it for icing. He devours the lot in a spray of crumbs. Burp: his blue fur slowly turns **dark green**, googly eyes and all. \"Me want cookie,\" he moans, and everything he breathes on goes **dark green** too."],"喷":["spray","{Pikachu} laps from a *fountain* in {Front} of the {Funfair}, and his cheeks crackle as his *mouth* fills with fizzy pop. \"Pika!\" The sparks set it off, and he lets out a glowing yellow **spray** over the carousel. The fountain answers with a **spray** of its own, every drop crackling, and the electric horses gallop off."],"耗":["consume","{Homer} hauls a *plough* into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, in a dim scheme to grow doughnuts in a carpet of *fur*. Too lazy to wait, he starts to **consume** the seed doughnuts, then the fur (sprinkles, he thinks), with a long \"Mmm…\" By noon the plough is scraping bare floor, nothing is left to **consume**, and he says, \"D'oh!\""],"凌":["soar","{Lara Croft} races {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and tackles a *hill climb* of *icicles*, ice axes biting, while a rolling boulder grinds up behind her. At the peak she leaps, ponytail streaming, to **soar** over the crowd with a gleaming relic in her arms. The boulder, inspired, tries to **soar** too, and doesn't."],"敲":["knock","{Chewbacca} stoops in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, beside a tiny *tower*, and raps with a *tall cane* to **knock** politely. The door falls off. He growls sorry, which only friends understand, fixes it with his bandolier and tries one gentle **knock**, and this time the whole tower falls over while the cats stream out, unimpressed."],"菌":["bacteria","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Dunes} to a mouldy *granary* with *grass* bursting through its walls. His monocle from Q does one thing, show germs, and through it he sees **bacteria** in tiny tuxedos, plotting to take over the world. \"Shaken,\" he tells them, rattling the grain sack, and the **bacteria** tumble out in a heap, not stirred."],"赔":["compensate","{Pikachu} sneezes a Thunderbolt {Inside} the {Lake} house and fries the fuse box. A *spitting mouth* rises from the sink, spraying cherry stones, and yells that he must **compensate**. \"Pika!\" He offers a *shell*, it spits that back too, so he sits in the hall with his cheeks glowing to **compensate**, the household's new yellow lamp."],"涂":["smear","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Pool} and lands beside a plate of *leftovers*, baffled: he decides that cutlery is for scratching and food is war paint. He starts to **smear** spaghetti on his chest and gives his jungle yell, while *water drops* make it run down his loincloth. The apes arrive and **smear** custard on every diving board."],"粹":["pure","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a chess *pawn* is sorting *rice* grain by grain. \"Me help!\" He gobbles each dusty grain in a spray of crumbs, until a heap of **pure** white glows on the floor. Then he looks at it, googly eyes spinning, decides that **pure** rice is not cookie, and eats that as well."],"扁":["flat","{Batman} roars the Batmobile into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and rolls straight over a *nameboard*, which squeals and goes **flat**. Growling, he reverses, and now the chairs, the coins and a banker's hat are **flat** as well. From his utility belt he pulls a bicycle pump, pumps up the hat, and glides off, brooding."],"亏":["lose money","{Kermit} stage-manages a show in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, dropping the ticket money into a *leaky pot*. Coins dribble out the bottom and hop away, so the show begins to **lose money** every second. \"Yaaay!\" he panics, arms flailing, strumming his banjo for tips that fall straight through, and it's not easy being green and to **lose money** this fast."],"寂":["silent","{James Bond} slips into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where an *uncle* snores under a *roof* of flapping palm leaves. He clicks Q's latest bow tie, which does one absurd thing, and the whole beach goes **silent**: waves, gulls, the uncle's snoring. Unruffled, Bond delivers his finest one-liner, and nobody hears it, not even him, in the **silent** air."],"煤":["coal","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Lake} house and head-butts a block, and out rolls a fat *plum* instead of a coin. He stomps on it, boing, and it squashes into a lump of black **coal**. \"Wahoo!\" He stomps plum after plum to feed a hungry *campfire*, which burps smoke rings and demands more **coal** as his moustache turns grey."],"熊":["bear","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Youth Club} wanting a quiet nap by some glowing *embers*, but a *bear* has taken the spot. He roars, and the **bear** roars louder, and the contest rattles every window in the building. Then Donkey wanders in, already talking, and Shrek and the **bear** hide under the same table."],"恭":["respectful","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Lagoon} temple and nobody greets him, which makes him cranky. One tap of his staff and a spell spreads: frogs, fish and ducks form *joined hands* and turn **respectful**, bowing to a *heart cushion* on a throne. The cushion blushes and bows back, and Gandalf, pipe lit, mutters that he too can be **respectful**, on Thursdays."],"湿":["wet","{Sherlock} bends over a glass *showcase* in {Front} of the {Beehive} as *water drops* patter on his deerstalker. He studies one through his magnifying glass, sniffs it, and plays a sad bar on his violin. \"Elementary, Watson: it is **wet**.\" Watson, **wet** to the socks, holds up an umbrella and says nothing."],"循":["follow","{Shrek} plods {Inside} the {Dunes} watchtower with a *shield* over his head, determined to **follow** a trail of *footsteps* and roar at whoever is on his land. They lead in a circle, back to his own big green feet. Behind him Donkey, who has been chattering all day, won't stop, and Shrek roars that nobody asked him to **follow**."],"暖":["warm","{Naruto} shivers in the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} lodge, his ramen frozen solid, and he refuses to give up. He summons a hundred shadow clones, who stack up, lasso the *sun* with a *rescue rope* and haul it down the stairs, yelling. Soon his toes are **warm**, the ramen is **warm**, and the clones pop, one by one, in blissful puffs."],"糖":["sugar","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Hangar} and lands among sacks, baffled by civilisation. He bites open one of *rice* (dull) and one of *sugar*, which pours out like white snow. His jungle yell brings every elephant for miles, and soon they are licking **sugar** off the wings while he surfs a **sugar** dune on a pilot's tray."],"赋":["endow","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where a *warrior* stands guard on a giant *shell*, and reluctantly holds out the Ring, just for a moment, to **endow** her with its power. She vanishes, the shell walks off in a huff, and he snatches the Ring back, shaking. Sam, loyal as ever, decides to **endow** her with something safer: a potato."],"抑":["restrain","{Yoshi} pads into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, his *upward gaze* fixed on a melon on a high shelf, tongue quivering. He must **restrain** himself, so a *helping hand* clamps his snout shut to **restrain** the tongue. He wobbles, he turns purple, and then it bursts out, swallows melon and hand together, and he lays a very guilty egg."],"秩":["order","The {Joker} creeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, where bees stand in perfect **order** along a *grain stalk*, and fires a rubber *lost arrow* with a flag reading BANG. He shuffles them like trick playing cards, cackling at the buzzing chaos. The queen blows a tiny whistle, and they snap back into **order**, every bee now wearing a little green wig."],"帽":["hat","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, a *towel* on his head because his red cap has gone missing. He head-butts a block, and out jumps a *brimmed hat* with a coin on top. \"Wahoo!\" He flings the **hat** like a boomerang, the **hat** lands on a sleeping guard, and the guard grows a moustache and starts jumping."],"哀":["grief","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse wrapped in a tattered *robe*, because once again everyone has run away screaming. His *mouth* opens in a wail of **grief**, which only makes more people run. He turns invisible so as not to scare them, and now the whole beach is soaked in **grief** from nowhere, until a crab offers the empty air a biscuit."],"宿":["stay overnight","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and begins her long sparkly transformation just as a floating *inn* made of lilos is closing. The ribbons and twirls go on until midnight, so she has no choice but to **stay overnight**. She cries loudly, gives the *inn* a speech about justice, and Luna the cat, sighing, books them both to **stay overnight** again tomorrow."],"踏":["tread","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and, baffled, lands on a tall *stack of papers*: forms, whatever those are. His *kicking foot* starts to **tread** them flat like a nest, the way the apes do. He yells, three elephants barge in to **tread** with him, and the forms become a soft, mushy bed."],"烂":["rotten","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, where a cursed *orchid* sits on a pedestal above a *campfire*. She grabs the relic, the ancient trap clicks, and the petals turn **rotten** in her hand, oozing a stink like old socks. Ponytail flying, she dives out of the window with a boulder behind her, and even the boulder smells **rotten** now."],"袁":["Yuan","{Yoshi} trots {Inside} the {Mint} and his tongue catches the trailing end of a *long robe*, reeling it in like spaghetti. At the far end comes old Mr **Yuan**, who is swallowed in one gulp, still counting coins. Yoshi lays a huge egg, and it hatches to reveal Mr **Yuan**, unharmed, robe neatly folded and demanding a receipt."],"侯":["marquis","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Boathouse} until a pompous *marquis* in a powdered wig prods him awake, demanding to be rowed across the lake. Dim and hungry, Homer mistakes the wig for a giant sugared doughnut. \"Mmm…\" He takes a bite, the **marquis** shrieks, and the boat tips the **marquis** into the water. \"D'oh!\""],"抖":["shake","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, breathing loudly, and Force-chokes a *dipper* full of fish until it starts to **shake**. A *helping hand* reaches up to steady it, and that starts to **shake** as well. Soon boats, oars and the whole boathouse are rattling under his disapproving stare, and only his cape stays still."],"夹":["clip","{James Bond} sits coolly in {Front} of the {Piazza} cafe and unfolds Q's latest gadget: spring-loaded *tongs* that do one thing, which is to **clip**. They shoot across the square and **clip** a waiter's tie, a pigeon's tail and the mayor's nose. The mayor sneezes, the tongs snap onto Bond's tuxedo, and he straightens them. \"Very well clipped,\" he says."],"昆":["elder brother","{Kermit} sits in {Front} of the {Casino} with his banjo and, being a frog, shoots out his tongue at a tiny *insect* in a tuxedo. \"Wait,\" squeaks the bug, \"I am your **elder brother**!\" Arms flailing, Kermit spits him out with a panicked \"Yaaay!\" and spends the evening stage-managing his **elder brother**'s card act, which is not easy."],"肝":["liver","{Gandalf} sweeps in {Front} of the {Mansion} at midnight, and a giant wobbling **liver**, escaped from the butcher, flops toward the door. \"You shall not pass!\" he roars, and one zap of his staff hangs it on a *drying rack*. The *moon* leans down to sniff it, and he puffs his pipe, warning that a **liver** is best with onions."],"擦":["wipe","{Cookie Monster} munches in {Front} of the {Spa}, spraying crumbs, as a *detective* follows the trail on his hands and knees. A *helping hand* darts behind him to **wipe** the evidence away, but every bite makes more. \"Me no do it!\" says Cookie Monster, and the hand gives up, reaches over and starts to **wipe** his furry blue mouth."],"猪":["pig","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Pool} house as he straps a rubber snout and a curly tail to a *prowling dog* and paints it pink. He presents this **pig** to a *busy man* hurrying to a meeting, who tucks it under his arm without looking up. It barks all through the meeting, and outside a real **pig** belly-flops into the pool, laughing."],"炼":["refine","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with a lumpy ancient relic and lights a *campfire* on the tiles, as the tomb's riddle instructs. Each flare burns off a layer of dirt as she works to **refine** it, somersaulting over the sparks. The *campfire* roars twice more to **refine** it further, until only a tiny shining key remains."],"恒":["constant","{Homer} sprawls {Inside} the {Jungle} lookout, on duty, snoring at the *horizon*, while a *standing heart* beside him thumps in time. Storms blow, monkeys throw bananas, years pass, and his nap stays **constant**. Now and then he mumbles \"Mmm… doughnuts,\" as **constant** as the sunrise, and the heart thumps on."],"慎":["careful","{Sherlock} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} behind a *standing heart* on a tightrope, which inspects each step through a *magnifying glass*. \"Be **careful**, Watson,\" he says, deducing a hidden pit from one crumb and a smell of soap. He is so smug and so **careful** that he walks round it, and Watson, trailing behind, drops through it."],"搬":["move","{Batman} swoops in {Front} of the {Mansion}, clips his grappling hook to the chimney, and growls that the whole house must **move**. The Batmobile pulls, a gadget from his belt unfolds into a giant *helping hand* that pushes, and a *boatman* poles it along like a raft. They **move** it to the seaside overnight, with Alfred still pouring the tea."],"纽":["button","{Naruto} skids into the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel}, where a *clown* honks and stitches a huge **button** to his orange jumpsuit with *silk thread*. Naruto rips it off, never giving up, and spins it in his palm on the thread, whirring like a Rasengan. A dozen shadow clones each spin a **button**, and the clown's trousers fall down."],"纹":["pattern","{Walter White} sets up {Inside} the {Funfair}, dips *silk thread* in a beaker, and crystals creep along it in a precise spiral **pattern**. Proud, he touches it to a volunteer's *tattoo*, and the ink wakes up and swirls over the carousel and the dodgems. Walter adjusts his glasses, takes notes, and finds his goatee now has the same **pattern**."],"玻":["glass","{Batman} glides in {Front} of the {Fort} and, as he always must, smashes through the biggest window he can find. **Glass** rains down on a *king* cowering under a crocodile *hide*. A perfectly good door stands open beside him, but Batman growls that doors are for criminals, pulls a tiny broom from his utility belt, and sweeps up the **glass**, brooding."],"渔":["fishing","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum} and dangles his long sticky tongue into a tank of *water drops*, **fishing** like a living rod. A giant *fish* bites and drags him up the stairs, until, gulp, it is swallowed whole. He lays it as an egg, it hatches and flops back in the tank, and he goes on **fishing**."],"磁":["magnetic","{Cookie Monster} blunders {Inside} the {Beehive} and gobbles what looks like a chocolate cookie, but it is a *stone* with a *magnet* stuck in it. Gulp: his blue tummy turns **magnetic**. Spoons, hairpins and the bees' tiny armour all fly at him and stick. \"Me **magnetic**!\" he cries, in a spray of crumbs, as a biscuit tin zooms across the room."],"铜":["copper","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Lagoon} hotel, baffled by civilisation, and finds *gold coins* stacked in a *matching cup*. He bites one, and the gold flakes off, showing plain orange **copper**. He yells, a troop of apes arrives, and they beat the **copper** like a gong until the fish rise to listen."],"齿":["tooth","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Basement} of the {Beehive} flying his kite, and a set of giant *teeth* snaps it out of the air, just like that tree. He tugs, and one loose **tooth** falls out and lands on his foot. \"Good grief.\" Snoopy sells the **tooth** back to him for five cents."],"跨":["stride across","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Water Park}, where a *show-off* lifts his *kicking foot* to **stride across** the wave pool in one step. Kermit, stage manager of this chaos, tries to **stride across** it too, but frogs only hop. \"Yaaay!\" he cries, arms flailing, and lands on the show-off's head with his banjo."],"押":["pawn","{Yoshi} swallows a suit of *armour* in {Front} of the {Spa} and lays it as a heavy steel egg, which he carries to the pawnshop window. A *helping hand* reaches out, weighs it and lets him **pawn** it for one melon. Next day the egg cracks and the armour clanks off home, so he swallows the melon and lays that to **pawn** instead."],"怖":["terror","{Batman} drops silently into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, cape spread, and growls at a *standing heart* hiding under a sheet of *linen*. **Terror** is his whole method, and it works: the heart shrieks, the linen flees like a ghost, and swimmers scream down the hall. Brooding, Batman only wanted to borrow the soap, and now he stands alone in the **terror** he made."],"漠":["desert","{Mario} pops out of a pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and, being a plumber, turns the main tap off with a wrench. The last *water drops* shrivel in the red *sunset*, and the whole fort becomes a vast **desert**. \"Wahoo!\" He head-butts a block, gets sand instead of a coin, and stomps off across the **desert** looking for a pipe."],"疲":["weary","{Pikachu} crawls {Inside} the {Beach} hut after one Thunderbolt too many, dragging a *hide* for a blanket, and collapses onto a *sickbed*. He is so **weary** that his cheeks give only one tiny spark. \"Pika,\" he whispers, and his Poké Ball rolls up to collect him, but it is too **weary** to open."],"叛":["rebel","{Pikachu} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and flatly refuses to get in his Poké Ball, a born **rebel**. \"Pika!\" He zaps it, and one *half* rolls away, sparking. Out of the other climbs another *rebel*, waving a tiny flag, and soon every toy in the tub has joined the **rebel** cause."],"遣":["dispatch","{Chewbacca} fixes a motorbike in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, ripping out the engine and bolting in part of a starship, while a *dispatch rider* waits nervously. He roars, which only friends understand, and slaps the seat to **dispatch** him with a sack of coins. The rider vanishes in a streak of stars, and Chewbacca grabs another bike to **dispatch** the next."],"兹":["this","{Zorro} leaps from his black horse in {Front} of the {Beehive}, and a *magnet* yanks his rapier straight at a single bee. \"**This** one!\" he cries, and slashes a tiny Z on her helmet. The *magnet* swings again, and he slashes, laughing, \"and **this** one,\" until every bee is monogrammed and he vanishes up a chandelier."],"祭":["offer sacrifice","{James Bond} wakes up tied to a raft in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, in his tuxedo, as villagers chant to **offer sacrifice** to the sea. He is the *sacrifice*, along with a giant cake. A bow tie from Q turns into a tiny outboard motor and he escapes unruffled, eating cake, so they **offer sacrifice** again, with a pineapple."],"醉":["drunk","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a chess *pawn* sways over a *wine jug*, totally **drunk**. He slashes a crisp Z on the door, and the pawn grabs a toothbrush to duel him, slashing only a wobbly squiggle. Zorro bows, cape swirling, and vanishes laughing, while the **drunk** little pawn challenges the mirror."],"拳":["fist","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Mint}, his *rolling hands* winding up like a windmill, because a coin press has jammed. In a temper he closes one huge *hand* into a **fist** and thumps it, and the machine, just like a starship, coughs into life. Coins spout like confetti, and every worker raises a shaky **fist** in thanks."],"弥":["fill","{Mario} bounces {Inside} the {Beach} villa, stomps on a giant *bow*, and its string twangs and rings a huge *wind chime*. Each ding drops a coin, and the coins begin to **fill** the room, then the stairs. \"Wahoo!\" He swims through them, head-butting blocks that make things worse, until the ringing and the gold **fill** the whole villa to the ceiling."],"斜":["slanting","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave}, roaring for peace so hard that the whole floor tips, **slanting** like a slide. A yeti's *leftovers* skid past him and a *dipper* tumbles after them, spilling stew. Donkey slides by, still talking, and Shrek clings to a **slanting** wall, wishing he had stayed in his swamp."],"档":["files","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, breathing loudly, where a *tree* has grown through a *roadblock* of filing cabinets. With one gloved hand he lifts out the **files** with the Force, and they hover, page by page, as he booms disapproval at each. The last of the **files** is about his son, and he goes very quiet, except for the breathing."],"稀":["rare","{Shrek} grumbles in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, holding a *grain stalk* wrapped in *lace*, the only one in the world. Collectors stampede across the sand, bidding millions for something so **rare**, and Donkey starts an auction. Shrek roars until they scatter, tosses the stalk in the sea, and sits down to enjoy something truly **rare**: five minutes of quiet."],"捷":["quick","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} as a *sprinter* in shorts dashes off with his secret plans. Q's shoes do one absurd thing: they make him so **quick** that he arrives before he sets out. A *helping hand* shoots from his cuff and plucks the plans away, and he straightens his tuxedo. \"**Quick** enough,\" he says."],"肤":["skin","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Pool} house and finds a *husband* sunbathing under the *moon*, his **skin** glowing silver. Frodo, who knows that shine from his mail shirt, pokes it and winces. Reluctantly he slips on the Ring to escape the glare and vanishes, but his own **skin** has caught the moon too, leaving two bare hairy feet glowing in the air."],"疫":["epidemic","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where every sandcastle lies on a *sickbed*, sneezing sand: an **epidemic**. A crab doctor swings a *war club* at the germs and misses. Yoshi's tongue snatches each sneeze and swallows it, and he lays egg after egg, but the eggs start sneezing too, and the **epidemic** rolls off down the corridor."],"肿":["swell","The {Joker} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} villa and slips a trick air pump under the painted *bullseye* on a snoozing guard's rubber knee pad. Cackling, he squeezes the bulb, and the knee begins to **swell** up round as a *moon*. Bigger and bigger it goes, until his own grin starts to **swell** with laughter and the whole thing pops into confetti."],"豆":["bean","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, breathing loudly, and raises a tiny *bean* on the Force. It quivers, shoots up into a stalk, and he squeezes it back down with one gloved hand. He slices the **bean** in half with his red lightsaber, finds a smaller **bean** within, and booms his deepest disapproval at it."],"削":["peel","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Cat Café} with a *standing knife* and a *portrait* of himself, hung there by Donkey. Ogres have layers, so the knife starts to **peel** the painting like an onion, curls of paint landing on the cats. He weeps, as one does, and keeps going to **peel** until he reaches the last layer: Donkey's face, still talking.","xiāo"],"岗":["post","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and, with a flick of his staff, raises a small *mountain* with a *ridge* along its top. He takes up his **post** there, thundering \"You shall not pass!\" at every mechanic with a spanner. Nobody wants to pass, but he stays at his **post** all night, cranky, while the ridge puffs smoke from his pipe."],"晃":["sway","{Homer} dozes in a hammock in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, where the *sun* dangles on a string and casts flickering *light* on a doughnut. \"Mmm…\" He starts to **sway** after it, and his hammock, the frogs and the reeds **sway** too. He lunges with a dim plan, misses, and lands in the mud. \"D'oh!\"","huàng"],"吞":["swallow","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Casino} as a giant *mouth* opens in the *sky* and starts to **swallow** dice, chips and roulette wheels, all of which baffle him anyway. He yells, and every hippo in the jungle comes stampeding up with its jaws wide open. They **swallow** whatever falls out, while Tarzan, on a vine, tickles the sky's tonsils until it hiccups."],"宏":["grand","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Lagoon} palace with a dim scheme: a **grand** doughnut hall, hole and all. A vast *roof* goes up, propped by one massive *upper arm* he has hired because pillars cost money. There are chandeliers like moons and a **grand** staircase of sprinkles, and then the arm gets an itch and scratches. \"D'oh!\""],"癌":["cancer","{Casper} floats through the wall and {Inside} the {Island} hospital to a *sickbed* weighed down with heavy *boulders*. The doctor explains it's **cancer**, like rocks pressing on the patient, and nobody screams at him for once. Invisible, he helps the nurses roll the boulders away, night after night, until the **cancer** is gone and the patient sits up and calls him a friend."],"肚":["belly","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where a swimmer with a big round **belly** floats like a *moon* as kids pile *soil* on it. He raises the swimmer with the Force, soil and all, and booms his disapproval at the sandcastle on top. The **belly** starts to laugh, and the whole lot slides down onto his helmet."],"隶":["servant","{Lara Croft} vaults through a window into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and prises a cursed relic off the sink. A stone *servant* clanks awake, kneels and carries her ponytail, her ropes and her boulder-dodging boots. The curse is simple: whoever touches the relic gets a **servant**, so he touches it too and acquires a tiny **servant** of his own."],"履":["fulfil","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a puzzle tomb opens only if an ancient oath is kept. A carved *lying man* swore to guard this floor, so he rolls *back and forth*, crushing every trap she triggers while she somersaults over him. The door grinds open, his oath **fulfilled**, and Lara salutes a statue who can **fulfil** a promise without getting up."],"涨":["to rise","The {Joker} cackles in the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, squirting *water drops* from his flower until the puddle **rises** past his purple knees. He draws a *stretched bow* and fires a trick playing card at the ceiling, where it pops open a banner reading BANG. The flood keeps **rising**, lifting him up, still grinning, with planes bobbing round him like rubber ducks."],"耀":["brilliant","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps through the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and his tongue snaps up a *pheasant* stuffed with *light*. He gulps, shudders, beams leaking from his nostrils, and lays one egg so **brilliant** that it blazes through its shell. Ships steer by it, moths form a queue, and the *pheasant* pokes out its head, **brilliant** and blinking, demanding sunglasses."],"扭":["to twist","{Naruto} charges into the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel} and finds a *clown* blocking the stairs. A dozen shadow clones pile in, each one a *helping hand*, and together they **twist** the clown like a balloon animal, nose honking. Then the clones get carried away and **twist** Naruto too, so he bounces off in an orange knot, yelling that he never gives up."],"坛":["altar","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Mansion}, baffled by carpets, and rips up the parquet to find some honest *soil*. It heaps itself into a mound, a rough **altar**, and a fluffy *cloud* drifts down to sit on top and rumble. He gives the jungle yell, the apes troop in, and everyone kneels at the **altar** of the weather."],"拨":["dial","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Fort} and pulls a rotary phone from his utility belt, growling for backup. A gauntlet gadget springs out as a *helping hand* and spins the **dial** so hard that a hidden *launch pad* ignites beneath him. Every number he **dials** fires another Batmobile into the sky, and he broods as they rain down."],"沃":["fertile","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and measures *water drops* of plant food from a beaker onto the muddy floor. A barefoot *dancer* twirls through the mixture, and wherever her toes splash the ground turns **fertile**: tomatoes erupt, pumpkins swell, a sunflower knocks off his black hat. He proudly records the most **fertile** soil ever made in a school experiment."],"绘":["to draw","{Homer} snoozes in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} until a *meeting* of bored patients wakes him, demanding doughnuts. His dim scheme is to pull a strand of *silk thread* from his robe, dip it in jam and **draw** doughnuts on the wall, hoping they turn real. He licks the finest **drawing**, gets a mouthful of plaster and howls, D'oh!"],"伐":["to cut down","{Frodo} plods barefoot {Inside} the {Spa} after a very long walk, wanting only a nap under a potted palm. A *lumberjack* in a bathrobe bellows TIMBER and sets out to **cut down** the palm, the bamboo screens and the coat stand. Frodo slips on the Ring and hides, weary and invisible, while every towel rail around him is **cut down** too."],"堪":["to endure","{Kermit} flails his arms in {Front} of the {Mansion}, stage-managing a garden show, when a stagehand passes him an *overflowing bowl* of hot soup. It slops over his banjo while *soil* from the collapsing scenery piles up to his webbed knees. Yaaay, he shrieks, because a frog must **endure** it: it's not easy being green, and he will **endure** anything until the curtain drops."],"仆":["servant","{Pikachu} bursts out of his Poké Ball {Inside} the {Pool} and finds a *standing person* in a bow tie holding a *fortune stick* like a tray. The stick wiggles and declares this man his **servant**. Pika, says Pikachu, testing him with one small spark, and the **servant** bows, hair frizzing, and carries him round the pool on the stick."],"郭":["Guo","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Warehouse} exactly when he means to and raps his staff on the ground. A *city wall* erupts from the cobbles, with fireworks spelling the name **Guo** along every battlement. A passing pigeon objects, so he thunders 'You shall not pass!' until it signs in as Mr **Guo**, and the wall swings politely open."],"牺":["sacrifice","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, wanting only to be left alone, but a storm god demands a **sacrifice** or there will be no more peace and quiet. Grumbling, he pushes forward his beloved *cow*, and a *bird nest* flies down to crown her. Donkey will not stop talking about what a noble **sacrifice** it is, so the god flees."],"歼":["to annihilate","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} as a *skeleton* leads a *thousand ants* off with the coins. He clicks Q's cufflink, which does one thing: it releases an enormous anteater that will **annihilate** the whole column in a single slurp, and the skeleton collapses in shock. Total **annihilation**, he remarks, unruffled, and not one coin stirred."],"墓":["tomb","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} under a red *sunset* painted on the tiles, and stomps a heap of *soil*. Up rises a stone **tomb** with a question block floating over it. He head-butts the block, grabs the coin with a Wahoo, then reads his own name on the **tomb** and stomps it flat in protest."],"雇":["to hire","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} needing a guard for his quest, and taps a *door* with his staff until it yawns open. A *sparrow* hops out with a tiny CV, and he reads it by staff-light, cranky and wise, then **hires** it with a puff of fireworks. By noon the door has coughed up forty more, and he must **hire** them all."],"廉":["honest","{Lara Croft} cartwheels {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} past swinging blades and finds an ancient *shed* guarding the relic: *two sheaves* of golden wheat on a pressure plate. Steal them and the boulders roll, because this puzzle wants someone **honest**. She drops one coin, the fair price, the sheaves bow and the shed creaks open, trap beaten by being **honest**, and she is rather disappointed."],"契":["contract","{Chewbacca} ducks into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where a *big man* stands with a pocketknife over a *carving* in a surfboard: a **contract** promising him one spaceship. Chewbacca roars at the small print and rips the board in two in a temper. Then, being loyal, he welds the **contract** back together with ship parts and signs it with a growl."],"拼":["to piece together","{Pikachu} sits in {Front} of the {Inn} beside his Poké Ball, smashed into a hundred bits. A trainer's *helping hand* lays down *linked rails*, and his Thunderbolt powers a toy train that hauls each scrap along. Spark by spark he welds and **pieces together** the ball, and the moment it is **pieced together** it snaps open and catches him."],"惩":["to punish","{Charlie Brown} sighs {Inside} the {Jungle} after a tree eats his kite, so he reports it and the ants vow to **punish** someone. A drumming *march* of soldier ants parades up behind a cracked paper *heart* that thumps out the beat. With his luck they **punish** him instead of the tree, and he must stamp along all day, muttering good grief."],"捉":["to grab","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Warehouse} and aims a rubber *helping hand* on a spring at a passing guard. It shoots out, **grabs** his own *foot* and whips him upside down, green hair swinging. Laughing even harder, he squirts his flower and flicks a trick card that sprouts a second hand, which tries to **grab** the first."],"覆":["to cover","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and feels a great Eye searching the water for the Ring. Bare feet slapping, he hauls a huge *cabinet* *back and forth* until its doors swing wide and **cover** the surface like a lid. Sam adds every towel, the Eye sees only planks, and the two hobbits sit on the **covered** pool eating lunch."],"刷":["to brush","{Sherlock} crouches in {Front} of the {Water Park}, where a *standing knife* quivers upright in a slide, the only clue. He **brushes** it with a *dustcloth*, stroke by stroke, until a fingerprint appears, and smugly declares the culprit had a wet moustache. Elementary, he says, and he **brushes** Watson's moustache to prove it, which matches."],"劫":["to rob","{James Bond} stands unruffled {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} as a burglar with one *strong arm* tries to **rob** the sleeping yeti of its fur and bolts for the *exit*. Q's bow tie does one thing: it spins the exit sign round to point at the yeti. The **robber** runs straight into a huge furry hug, and Bond murmurs that some exits are final."],"嫌":["to dislike","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} and tries to pay a *woman* at the counter with *two sheaves* of swamp hay and an onion. She holds her nose: she **dislikes** hay, onions, ogres and talking donkeys. Shrek roars with delight, because he **dislikes** everybody too, and the pair sit in contented silence, flicking straw at Donkey."],"瓜":["melon","{Gandalf} plants his staff in {Front} of the {Water Park} and mutters over one seed, and a giant *melon* bursts up and rolls at the crowd. You shall not pass, he bellows, and the **melon**, being polite, stops dead and explodes in fireworks. Now everyone floats on slices of **melon**, and he lights his pipe as though he planned it."],"歇":["to rest","{Shrek} flops in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} wanting only to **rest**, while Donkey's chatter hangs in the air as one huge *question mark* that bends over him like a deckchair. His *yawn* roars off the ice and blows Donkey clean down the mountain. Silence at last, so he curls into the curve and **rests**, snoring louder than any avalanche."],"雕":["to carve","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, breathing loudly, and ignites his red lightsaber to **carve** a block of cheese. A *sparrow* pecks the *circuit* on his chest panel, and every peck jolts the blade. He **carves** a perfect cat by accident, lifts it with the Force, and booms that he is its father while it meows for milk."],"闷":["bored","{Mario} warps into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and finds a locked *gate* with no blocks, no coins and nothing to stomp. He is **bored**. His *heart* ticks slowly, he jumps once and lands, and his Wahoo comes out flat and **bored**, while even his moustache droops."],"乳":["milk","{Robocop} clanks through the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a fluffy *hatchling* zooms about on a tiny *ski*, crying with hunger. His visor flashes a directive, feed all minors, and a hatch in his steel chest pours out a jet of warm **milk**. He politely arrests the chick for speeding, then releases it to ski away through puddles of **milk**."],"串":["string together","{Charlie Brown} tries to fly his kite in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, and of course it goes wrong. The line whips round and **strings together** a lily pad, a rubber boot, a frog in a hat and one furious swan into a long *kebab* that drags him across the water. Good grief, he says, as Snoopy **strings together** two sausages on the end."],"娃":["baby","{Walter White} sets out his beakers {Inside} the {Spa} to test what a *jade tablet* does in warm mud. A *woman* in a face mask drops it in by mistake, and the reaction fizzes, foams and becomes a gurgling **baby** in a fluffy towel. He checks his notes, proud and appalled, as the **baby** seizes his goatee and refuses to let go."],"缴":["to hand in","{James Bond} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café}, tuxedo spotless, to **hand in** his gadgets to a fat tabby clerk. He reels them out of his cuff on *silk thread*, but Q's last pen does one thing: it sprays *sparkle*. The tabby sneezes glitter across his lapels, and Bond, **handing in** the pen, says only that he preferred it shaken."],"唤":["to call","{Homer} wakes starving in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} and opens his enormous *mouth* to **call** for doughnuts. Swans glide in instead for a free *makeover*, part of his dim scheme to get them to fetch food: wigs, lipstick, feather boas. Each time he **calls**, another swan arrives, glamorous and empty-handed, and he groans, D'oh!"],"赢":["to win","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and his sticky tongue whips past the champion's gloves to gulp down the *winner's purse*. Nobody can **win** now, so the crowd howls. He squats, strains and lays it back as an egg with a golden *shell*, which bounces off the champion's nose and flattens him, and Yoshi **wins** without throwing a punch."],"莲":["lotus","{Lara Croft} climbs a pillar {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, hunting a lost relic, while a *convoy* of tiny trucks rumbles over an ancient pressure plate. It tips pond *grass* into a stone basin, and a pink **lotus** pops open in the middle. She snatches the **lotus**, a boulder starts to roll, and she sprints off, ponytail flying, past startled customers."],"霸":["tyrant","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, where a bad-tempered **tyrant** commands indoor *rain* to soak anyone who dares relax. Gruff and unamused, he fires his grappling hook and lands in a *saddle* strapped to the **tyrant**'s back. He pops an umbrella from his utility belt and rides the brute round the tiles until the clouds give up."],"桃":["peach","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Tower} on a vine tied to a *tree* growing up through the stairs and lets out his jungle yell. The noise shakes down a *cracked shell*, which splits on his head and out rolls a juicy **peach**. Baffled by the butler's fork, he hands it to an ape to demonstrate, then swings off with a **peach** in each foot."],"妥":["suitable","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} and, baffled by shelves, tries to sleep in a cardboard box, which is not **suitable** at all. A *soothing hand*, huge and hairy, pats his head as his ape mother drags the crates into a proper nest. He flops down, sighing, because at last civilisation has made something **suitable**."],"瘦":["thin","{Sherlock} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and studies a creaking *sickbed* through his magnifying glass. From one crumb he deduces that the *elder* is so **thin** he has slipped through the slats, and indeed the old man floats out from under it like a kite. Elementary, he tells Watson, tying the **thin** fellow to his violin bow."],"搭":["to put up","{Darth Vader} breathes heavily in {Front} of the {Spa}, disapproving of the sun. He raises one black glove, a *helping hand* of pure Force, and lifts bundles of *thatch* into the air to **put up** a hut without touching a thing. A crooked bundle gets Force-choked until it behaves, the hut is **put up** in seconds, and he booms that it will do."],"赴":["to go to","{Frodo} sinks into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} to rest his hairy feet when a *runner* skids in, waving a *fortune stick* that points east. You must **go to** the far end at once, the man gasps, as the stick pokes him in the ribs. Frodo groans, Sam packs sandwiches, and they **go to** the deep end on foot, a weary journey of three weeks."],"岳":["high mountain","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, and his tongue slurps up a *hillock* and then a whole *mountain*, belly wobbling. He lays one gigantic egg that cracks open and stacks them, the hillock at the base and the peak on top, into one **high mountain** poking the clouds. He flutter-jumps up the **high mountain** and falls just short of the summit."],"嘉":["excellent","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Piazza} in his tuxedo while a stern *scholar* with a red pen marks his entrance. Q's fountain pen does one thing: whatever it writes on becomes **excellent**. Bond hands it over with a small bow, and the scholar writes on a pigeon, a fountain and his own forehead until the whole square is declared **excellent**."],"舱":["cabin","{Cookie Monster} bounds up in {Front} of the {Hangar} and finds a *boat* on a trailer, with a little *barn* creaking open on its deck as a snug **cabin** stacked with biscuits. Me want cookie, he howls, googly eyes spinning. He devours the biscuits, the bunks and the door in a spray of crumbs until the whole **cabin** has gone."],"俊":["handsome","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes}, adjusts his bow tie and squirts Q's aftershave, which does one absurd thing. Every *standing person* in the sand turns into a *handsome man* with his exact haircut, all admiring themselves in the mirrors. Bond surveys them, unruffled, and remarks that they are nearly as **handsome** as he is, sand in their teeth, **handsome** anyway."],"址":["site","The {Joker} tiptoes into the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, grinning, and piles *soil* round a red *stop sign*, declaring this the official **site** of his joke shop. The bees obey the sign and halt in mid-air. So he flips it to read GO, and they chase him, cackling, round and round his own building **site**."],"庞":["huge","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Hangar} and finds a *dragon* crammed into a garden *shed*, so **huge** that its tail pokes out of the window and the walls bulge. Pika, he says, and fires a Thunderbolt, which merely tickles. The beast sneezes, and the tiny yellow mouse sails across the hangar, amazed at how **huge** one sneeze can be."],"耕":["to plough","{Gandalf} taps his staff in {Front} of the {Jungle} and an enchanted *plough* leaps up and drags itself round an old stone *well*, which spits sparks to keep it moving. It **ploughs** a perfect circle while parrots drop seeds behind it. You shall not pass, he shouts at one stubborn root, and the blade **ploughs** on while he puffs his pipe."],"锐":["sharp","{Robocop} clanks into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *money changer* is filing *gold coins* on a whetstone until each one is razor **sharp**. His targeting display flashes a directive against dangerous objects as a coin whistles past and slices off his antenna. He stiffly reads every coin its rights and arrests them one by one, handcuffs shredded because they are too **sharp**."],"缝":["seam","{Frodo} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} on his very long walk, and a *chance meeting* stops him cold: a gorilla with split trousers, begging for help. The Ring tempts him to vanish and escape. Instead he pulls out *silk thread* and stitches the **seam** with tiny hobbit stitches, and the gorilla checks the **seam**, nods and carries him onward."],"悔":["to regret","{Homer} wakes in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} and remembers he promised a *busy mother* to mind her five toddlers, then napped and ate their doughnuts. She glares, a child under each arm, and his *standing heart* wilts and slaps him across the chops. D'oh, he sobs, he **regrets** the nap, and he **regrets** nothing about the doughnuts."],"邀":["to invite","{Yoshi} swallows a sack of cards in {Front} of the {Tower} and lays them as eggs all along a winding *road*, which carries them off down the hill. Each egg cracks in a burst of *sparkle* that spells out, you are **invited**. His tongue plucks pigeons and passing balloons to **invite** them personally, and he flutter-jumps at the moon, which arrives late."],"玲":["ting-a-ling","{Lara Croft} flips over the ropes {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, drawn by an ancient bell trap. A tiny stone *king* swings his bell, **ting-a-ling**, and a *herald* in tights shouts for the next boulder to drop. She cartwheels clear every time until she scales the corner post and gags the bell with her ponytail, one last muffled **ting-a-ling** and silence."],"惟":["only","{Walter White} titrates a beaker {Inside} the {Lake} house while a *standing heart* thumps upright in a glass jar on his bench. A *sparrow* lands on the rim and sings, and his needle leaps: of thousands of birds tested, this is the **only** one that makes the heart race. He underlines it twice, proud of his science, and calls it the **only** result he trusts."],"斥":["to blame","{Charlie Brown} slumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} clutching a *chipped axe*, asking who broke it. The bees **blame** him, the queen agrees, and even Snoopy points a paw. Then the blade flies off and lands on his shoe, and he sighs good grief, because everyone always **blames** him, and this time they may be right."],"宅":["residence","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Island} lighthouse, knocking on a tiny *dwelling* tucked under each step, where crabs, turtles and a grumpy seagull live. He hammers up signs reading Private **Residence**, then swaps all their door keys as a prank. A trick card springs from every letterbox announcing each tiny **residence** as his own, and a jet from his flower answers the seagull's complaint."],"添":["to add","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and meets a teapot, an object that baffles him completely. A *blushing* clerk begs for tea, so he calls an elephant, which sprays *water drops* in, and waves for it to **add** more. It keeps **adding** until the pot bursts, coins float away and the blushing clerk bobs past, redder than ever."],"挖":["to dig","{Walter White} raps on the paving in {Front} of the {Spa}, the one who knocks, and hears a hollow sound. He pours a precise fizzing solution from a beaker, a gloved *helping hand* rises from his lab kit gripping a *shovel*, and it starts to **dig**. It **digs** through the sauna and the hot tub until steam shoots up and the great discovery proves to be a rubber duck."],"呵":["to breathe out","{Homer} dozes in {Front} of the {Hut}, freezing, a doughnut stuck to his lip with frost, and his dim plan is to **breathe out** on it. He opens his *mouth*, and each time he **breathes out**, a warm cloud of icing fog rolls over the snow while his *nodding head* bobs along. The doughnut thaws, drops into a drift, and he moans, D'oh!"],"讼":["lawsuit","{Sailor Moon} whirls through her long sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, and the splash drenches a *town square* full of fish in wigs, who file a **lawsuit**. A *small speech bubble* floats from her lips carrying a speech about justice, and Luna sighs. The crab judge bangs her claw, she cries so loudly that the tide comes in, and the **lawsuit** washes away."],"氧":["oxygen","{Yoshi} holds his breath too long in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and turns from green to blue. His tongue snatches a *sheep* puffing *steam* from its nose, gulp, and he lays an egg that hisses at every crack with pure **oxygen**. He gulps it down, flutter-jumps up on the **oxygen** like a balloon, and the sheep staggers out of the shell, baaing."],"浩":["vast","{Homer} leaves the tap running in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and naps, and the *water drops* spread and spread until they form a **vast** ocean. An *announcer* on a passing buoy roars through a megaphone that this is the most **vast** sea ever. Homer wakes floating on a giant doughnut, looks for the shore, takes a bite and starts to sink."],"羽":["feather","{Yoshi} flicks out his tongue in the {Basement} of the {Museum} and swallows a stuffed goose from its display, and *feathers* blast from his nostrils like snow. He strains and lays an egg, and when it cracks there sits one lonely **feather**. He balances the **feather** on his snout, sneezes, and flutter-jumps after it through the dinosaur bones."],"斤":["catty","{James Bond} arrives in {Front} of the {Inn}, where a market woman demands to know whether her sack of rice is a full **catty**. Q's wristwatch unfolds into a tiny *axe* that does one thing: it chops anything into exactly half a kilo. Each bundle drops onto the scales as one perfect **catty**, and he straightens his cuffs and orders his rice shaken."],"酷":["cool","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, stage-managing a talent show in sunglasses and trying to look **cool**. An *announcer* bawls his name and a *wine jug* full of ice cubes shoots under his feet, so he skids off with arms flailing, banjo flying and a panicked Yaaay. He crashes in a heap, and the crowd roars that this is really **cool**."],"掠":["to plunder","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} and finds a buried *palace* of ice, perfect for a proper tomb raid. She vaults a spike trap, but a greedy *helping hand* beats her to it, sliding from the wall to **plunder** crowns, candlesticks and golden skates. Appalled that anyone would **plunder** her tomb first, she chases it up a frozen column."],"妖":["witch","{Yoshi} waddles in {Front} of the {Tower} as a *woman* on a broomstick reveals herself as a **witch** and zaps a *dancer* into a spinning bat. Out shoots his tongue, and in one gulp the bat is gone, and he lays a speckled egg. The dancer hops out, restored, and the furious **witch** flies off after a dinosaur who has eaten her best spell."],"祸":["disaster","{Homer} shuffles into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and spots doughnuts on a *small altar* beside a sizzling *wok*. His dim plan is to fry them, so he tips the pan, the oil spreads, and boxes of fireworks start going off, a total **disaster**. He hides under the wok with one doughnut, murmuring mmm, and wonders how a snack became such a **disaster**."],"侍":["to serve","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} at a tiny wax *temple* and a *standing person* balancing a tray of honey cakes. From one crumb he deduces that the man must **serve** the queen bee, left-handed, since Tuesday. Elementary, he says smugly, and he makes Watson **serve** too, pouring nectar while he plays the violin."],"乙":["second in order","{Yoshi} sets up a race in the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut, swallowing a crab and a *swan* and laying them back as two eggs. The crab's egg rolls out first and the swan's comes **second in order**. The bird hatches furious, curls itself into the shape of a 2 and sulks, and he pins on a silver medal, **second in order** for ever."],"妨":["to hinder","{Frodo} plods {Inside} the {Hangar} on his long walk, and a *woman* slides a giant concrete *square* across his path. Whenever he steps left the slab goes left too, to **hinder** him, so he wearily puts on the Ring and turns invisible. She simply follows the hairy footprints in the dust, and he is **hindered** all over again."],"贪":["greedy","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Mansion}, baffled by a *clock* that drops a golden *shell* at every tick. His apes have told him gold is useless, but he grabs them all, **greedy** as a monkey at a banana stall, stuffing his loincloth until it sags. The vine snaps under the weight, and the apes hoot at the most **greedy** man in the jungle."],"挣":["earn","The {Joker} dances into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} and challenges a gorilla to a *tug of war*, betting bananas. A rubber *helping hand* hidden behind him hauls the rope, and the gorilla lands in a heap, cackled at from all sides. He **earns** a whole bunch, squirts his flower in celebration, and every prank after that **earns** him more fruit.","zhèng"],"汪":["expanse of water","{Walter White} lights a burner in {Front} of the {Hangar} to show how hydrogen and oxygen make *water drops*, and the lesson gets out of hand. They pour out until the tarmac is one glittering **expanse of water**. A tiny *king* in a rubber ring floats by demanding an end to the lecture, but Walter, proud of the exact ratio, rows on across the **expanse of water**."],"尿":["urine","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and spots a *lying man* asleep on a cushion, with a tomcat lifting its leg above him. Down trickles *water*, or rather **urine**, and Naruto summons a dozen shadow clones to dive in the way. Each clone gets hit and vanishes in a puff of smoke, but he never gives up, so he goes on making clones to stop the **urine**."],"莉":["jasmine","{Lara Croft} dives through a hidden hatch into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and lands in a chamber of tall *grass* around a golden *sickle*, the relic she came for. She lifts it, the trap wakes, and every swing she makes bursts white **jasmine** from the stalks. The perfume sends the stone guardians to sleep, and she somersaults out wearing a crown of **jasmine**."],"悬":["to hang","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Mint}, desperate for peace, and climbs a *stepladder* to **hang** Donkey by his collar on a line among the drying coins. Donkey only talks louder from up there. Then the ladder folds up with a snap, and now Shrek **hangs** right beside him by his braces, swinging, listening, with nowhere to go."],"唇":["lip","{Charlie Brown} sits gloomily {Inside} the {Casino}, amazed to have won a free *clam* at last. He lifts it to his *mouth* and of course it snaps shut on his **lip**. Good grief, he mumbles, **lip** stretched like a rubber band, as gamblers bet on when it will let go and Snoopy dances past holding the other end."],"翰":["writing brush","{Homer} snores in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} until *dawn* pokes him in the eye with a pink finger, and he seizes a giant **writing brush** to scrawl an excuse for the plant. Half asleep, he takes it for a long doughnut and bites down, D'oh, and ink pours down his chin. The butler admires the moustache and orders a **writing brush** for himself."],"仓":["barn","{Cookie Monster} sniffs the air in {Front} of the {Hangar}, rips open a wooden *barn* door, and grain pours over him like a waterfall. Not cookie, he wails, googly eyes spinning, but he eats it anyway, then the **barn** walls in a spray of splinters and crumbs. He pats his blue belly, burps, and announces that me want second **barn**."],"轨":["track","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} exactly on time and casts a spell, and a *crowbar* starts dancing, bending steel rods into a **track**. A wobbly *cart* rolls along it spitting fireworks, with patients aboard. He stands in the middle, bellows that it shall not pass, then steps aside, cranky, as it rattles round the **track** again."],"枚":["piece","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Lake} cottage and head-butts a *tree* whose trunk pays out coins, one **piece** per bonk. Between hits he stomps on a walking *cane*, which pogoes him back up for another go. Two, three, four, he goes, shouting Wahoo as he collects his money one **piece** at a time in his red cap."],"盐":["salt","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Mansion} and licks up a whole sparkling *salt flat* someone has rolled out as a carpet. Thirsty and wobbling, he lays a white egg in the soup *dish*, where it cracks and pours out pure **salt**. The butler tastes the soup, his lips shrivel, and the dish sneezes a blizzard of **salt** up the stairs."],"览":["to view","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} expecting untouched treasure and finds a *sightseer* with a gigantic camera already there, wanting to **view** everything. His flash sets off a trap, so she swings him over the pit by his camera strap, dodging darts. He goes on to **view** every painting upside down, flash, flash, flash, thrilled with the tour."],"傅":["instructor","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} for swimming lessons, since hobbits sink, and a *standing person* waves a *proclamation* declaring himself his **instructor**. It also forbids invisibility, which is a pity, because the Ring is tempting him badly. Frodo sinks twice, his hairy toes the last to go, and his strict **instructor** awards him a gold star for trying."],"帅":["handsome","{Sherlock} poses in the {Bathroom} of the {Wine Cellar} with a *towel* draped like a cape, and examines his reflection in a bottle through his magnifying glass. From one cheekbone he deduces it all: elementary, Watson, I am **handsome**. Watson sighs, the towel slips to the floor, and Sherlock says even that proves how **handsome** he is."],"庙":["temple","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} into a *shed* ringed by a *sprouting field* that pushes up mushrooms round his boots. He eats one, grows huge, and the shed swells around him into a grand **temple** with golden ceilings. He head-butts a block, Wahoo, the coin rings out, and cats queue to pray as the **temple** bells meow."],"芬":["fragrance","{Frodo} plods up in {Front} of the {Funfair}, hungry after a long walk, and finds a *cut cake* on the *grass*, whose blades all lean towards it. The **fragrance** is so sweet that his hairy toes curl and the rollercoaster stops mid-air. The Ring tempts him to vanish and take the lot, but Sam follows the **fragrance** and gets there first."],"屏":["screen","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a *lying man* glides by on *linked rails* past a giant, dead **screen**. Pika, he squeaks, cheeks crackling, and a Thunderbolt hits the cable. The **screen** blazes to life showing a tiny yellow face, the rails rattle faster, and the man sits up and applauds as he rolls away."],"寺":["Buddhist temple","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and lands in a tiny golden *temple*, a **Buddhist temple** where bees in saffron robes are quietly chanting. Her sparkly transformation goes off by accident, ribbons everywhere, and her tiara flies off and strikes the gong. Luna scolds her, she wails, and the monks just hum until peace returns to the **Buddhist temple**."],"胖":["fat","{Pikachu} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and stuffs a *moon* pie into his cheeks, and he gets visibly **fat**. Determined to stop, he cuts the next pie in *half*, then eats both pieces. Now he is so **fat** that his Poké Ball will not close around him, and every Pika comes out as a muffled, sparking wheeze."],"璃":["glass","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Beach} hut, past three traps, to a relic behind a pane of **glass**, as a tiny *king* chases a *goblin* round the pedestal. The goblin crashes through and the pane bursts, setting a boulder rolling. She somersaults over it, ponytail flying, while the king orders the goblin to glue back every last piece of **glass**."],"愚":["foolish","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum} and sees a *monkey* trying to stuff a giant *heart* into a teapot, which is **foolish**. Out goes his tongue, in go monkey, heart and teapot, and he lays one large egg. It cracks, and there sits the monkey trying to force the heart into the eggshell, even more **foolish** than before."],"滴":["to drip","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, his loud breathing interrupted by a *dripping tap*, and *water drops* **drip** on his helmet, plink, plink. He raises a black glove and Force-chokes the tap with booming disapproval, and it only **drips** faster. Finally he lights his red lightsaber and stands there, hissing with steam, defeated by plumbing."],"疏":["to clear away","{Sherlock} bends in {Front} of the {Pool} over an *unclogged drain*, which gurgles smugly at him. From one damp duck feather he deduces that a plug of hair and rubber ducks has been **cleared away**, and the culprit is the drain itself. Elementary, he tells Watson, and the drain burps a whirlpool that will **clear away** Watson's hat as well."],"萧":["Xiao","{Shrek} settles down in {Front} of the {Cat Café} on a nice patch of *grass*, and a *stern face* pops up from behind a sign reading **Xiao** family lawn. He roars his loudest ogre roar, the one that sends villagers running. The face does not blink, and for once Shrek backs away, out-grumped by Mr **Xiao**, with Donkey asking why."],"姿":["posture","{Zorro} slashes a Z in the air in {Front} of the {Beehive}, where a *woman* waits in a *queue* of bees to have her portrait taken. Her **posture** is dreadful, so he leaps off his black horse and corrects it with a flick of the rapier, one leg up, arms like wings. The bees copy her **posture** and wobble after him as he vanishes, laughing."],"颤":["to tremble","{Charlie Brown} slips into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and hides in a grain *silo*, because his report card has arrived. A single *page* flutters down the chute with a large red F, and he starts to **tremble**, zigzag shirt rippling. The silo **trembles** with him, grain pours over his head, and he says good grief from underneath."],"丑":["ugly","{Charlie Brown} hires a *clown* to cheer himself up in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, which goes wrong at once. The man takes off his make-up and is so **ugly** that the fish jump out of the water, yet he looks Charlie up and down, points at the zigzag shirt and pronounces it **ugly**. Good grief, says Charlie, and Snoopy nods."],"劣":["inferior","{Lara Croft} climbs down into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a yeti's *strong arm* flexes over a relic stamped solid gold. She dodges the arm, takes a *pinch* of the treasure between finger and thumb, and it crumbles to yellow chalk: a clearly **inferior** fake. Every relic in the place is **inferior**, and she tosses them aside, deeply offended."],"柯":["branch","{Kermit} hops up a *tree* in {Front} of the {Hut} with his banjo to hang the stage lights, and lands on one thin **branch**. Below him a stagehand's *nodding head* keeps bobbing to say it will hold. It does not: the **branch** snaps with a crack, and he drops through the scenery, arms flailing, shrieking Yaaay."],"寸":["inch","{Cookie Monster} barges into the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} and wins a cookie at roulette, and the croupier's *thumb* measures it at exactly one **inch**. Only one **inch**, he howls, googly eyes spinning, me want cookie! He swallows it, then the ruler, the chips and the wheel in a spray of crumbs, and burps."],"扔":["to throw","{Robocop} stomps stiffly in {Front} of the {Jungle}, and his visor reads a new directive: all litter goes in the bin. A long *ribbon* trails from his steel *helping hand* as he **throws** coconuts, bananas and a startled hat at a target on the far side. He **throws** so hard that his forearm flies off too, whirling on the ribbon, and he politely arrests it."],"盯":["to stare at","{Darth Vader} lifts a *nail* with the Force in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, drives it into a beam, and hangs a giant *eye* on it. Then he turns his black helmet and **stares at** each boxer, breathing loudly, while the eye swivels and **stares at** them too. They freeze in mid-punch, and nobody dares even to blink."],"辱":["disgrace","{Robocop} marches into the {Basement} of the {Pool} to arrest a *clam*, reading out its rights in a flat voice. It snaps shut on his steel *thumb* and hauls him round the floor while a crowd laughs, a complete **disgrace**. His visor flickers and his circuits blush red as he files a report on his own **disgrace**, one finger at a time."],"匹":["matching","{Pikachu} sniffs around in the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut and finds a *matching pair* of tiny striped socks, a miracle. He pulls them on, shuffles across the rug, and the static builds in his cheeks. Pika, he yelps, and a Thunderbolt sends every sock in the hut flying through the air to land in neat, **matching** couples, all perfectly **matching**."],"俱":["all","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} carrying a *toolbox* from Q, who built it to do one absurd thing: open **all** its compartments at once. A *standing person*, the curator, flips the catch, and hammer, saw, spanner and drill **all** launch at the statues. Bond sidesteps every one without spilling his drink and remarks that the tools are all present."],"辨":["to distinguish","{Batman} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and lands in a loud *quarrel* between twins over which coin is fake. Nobody can **distinguish** them by eye, so he pulls a scanner from his utility belt, brooding. In seconds he can **distinguish** real from false, growls that one is chocolate, and eats the evidence."],"饿":["hungry","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, **hungry** and hoping for a friend. A *spearman* on guard screams at the sight of him and flings up a *side dish* of dumplings. Casper catches them gratefully and gulps them down, but they drop straight through him and splat on the tiles, and he stays **hungry**, smiling sadly."],"蜂":["bee","{Frodo} trudges in {Front} of the {Jungle}, climbing a *peak* on his long walk, when a *bug* lands on his hairy toe, and it is a **bee**. Then there are ten, then a thousand, all pouring off the summit. He slips on the Ring and vanishes, but every **bee** can still smell those feet, and they hum along behind him to Sam's dismay."],"哦":["oh","{Casper} drifts through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, only wanting a friend, and pops out beside a *spearman*. The man's *mouth* drops into a perfect round **oh**, and his spear clatters to the tiles. Casper turns invisible to be polite, reappears to apologise, and gets another **oh**, until the whole fort is a choir of round mouths.","ò"],"腔":["cavity","{Chewbacca} hauls a broken hollow *moon* in {Front} of the {Stadium} and, in a temper, rips its side open to repair it. Out yawns an *empty room*, one great **cavity**, and his furious roar comes echoing back ten times louder. Fans climb into the **cavity** to cheer along, and only his friends understand that he wants them out."],"郁":["gloomy","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} onto a grey *hillside* where a sad man stands *holding meat* in the drizzle. Everything is **gloomy**, so Yoshi swallows the rain cloud in one slurp to cheer him up. He lays it as an egg, it hatches, and out comes a bigger and even more **gloomy** cloud, which rains on both of them."],"溃":["to burst","{Kermit} flails in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, stage-managing chaos, as *water drops* pile up against a dam of chairs with a *price tag* fluttering on top. He waves a banjo at the leak, but the dam groans and **bursts** with a roar. Yaaay, he screams, surfing past the patients on a magazine, and shouting that it **burst**."],"谨":["careful","{James Bond} steps through a laser grid in the {Basement} of the {Inn}, carrying a potted *violet* from Q that does one thing: it sneezes loudly if jolted. A *small speech bubble* floats up from its petals saying be **careful**. He inches forward so **careful** that he does not breathe, sets it down without a tremor, and straightens his bow tie."],"糟":["messy","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier in {Front} of the {Tower}, dashing as ever, and slashes a huge Z into a *trough* brimming with *rice*. It bursts, and grains spray over his mask, his cape, his black horse and a passing flock of birds. Everything is **messy**, and he vanishes laughing, leaving one neat Z in the middle of the **messy** lawn."],"葛":["kudzu vine","{Gandalf} mutters a growth spell {Inside} the {Hut} over one tuft of *grass*, and it backfires: a **kudzu vine** curls up like a *question mark*. It climbs his staff, his hat and his pipe, cranking out a new loop every second. You shall not pass, he roars, and it passes anyway, until the place is one green knot of **kudzu vine**."],"苗":["sprout","{Mario} head-butts a block {Inside} the {Cat Café}, expecting a coin, and out pops a *young crop* in a pot. A green **sprout** wiggles up from it like a worm, and he stomps on it, which only makes it split in two. Wahoo, he says doubtfully, jumping again and again, while each new **sprout** tickles a cat's nose."],"肠":["intestines","{Charlie Brown} tries to fly a kite {Inside} the {Hangar}, tied to the long paper **intestines** from his science project, and of course it goes wrong. The kite soars off and hooks the *moon*, hauling the whole tube into the sky, where hot *sun rays* shrivel it. Good grief, he says, as pilots slalom through the **intestines**."],"忌":["avoid","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut, where Q has warned him to **avoid** one *coiled rope*, a gadget that does nothing but hug. His *heart* ticks calmly under his tuxedo as he walks a huge, unruffled circle round it. All day he **avoids** every hose and string on the sand, and he says only that he never hugs on duty."],"溜":["to slip away","{Lara Croft} clips a stolen *keepsake* to her belt in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} as an ancient trap springs and *water drops* slick the lawn. She drops flat and slides on them, so that nobody sees her **slip away**, ponytail streaming. The owner runs after her with a torch, but she has **slipped away** over the wall with a backflip."],"鸿":["wild goose","{Homer} naps with a doughnut on his chest {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut when a **wild goose** splashes down, showering him with *water drops*, and takes the doughnut. D'oh, he cries, and his dim scheme is to dress as a goose and steal it back. It works too well: the **wild goose** falls in love and follows him home."],"爵":["noble rank","{James Bond} glides {Inside} the {Ice Rink} in a tuxedo and Q's skates, and a queen taps his shoulder with a golden *wine goblet*, granting him **noble rank**. The cup rattles, shaken but not stirred, and his blades do their one absurd trick and spin him like a top. Bond, Lord James Bond, he says, whirling unruffled on his **noble rank**."],"鹏":["roc","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Jungle}, hears his *buddies* yelling, and looks up to see them waving from a huge *bird*. It is a **roc**, wings as wide as the sky. Pika, he squeaks, firing a friendly Thunderbolt, and the **roc** hiccups, swoops down and scoops him up, caught yet again, as they all soar off."],"鹰":["eagle","{Yoshi} waits in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} when a *falconer* releases a giant *bird*, an **eagle**, straight at him. Out shoots his tongue, gulp, and he lays an egg with a very cross speckle. It hatches, the **eagle** climbs onto his head, shrieks, and the falconer faints as the boxers duck as if punched."],"笼":["cage","{Lara Croft} leaps {Inside} the {Lagoon} hut, and finds a sulking *dragon* squashed into a *bamboo* **cage** no bigger than a birdhouse, a relic-guarding trap. Its fire only makes the bars smell of toast, so she solves the ancient puzzle lock upside down, hanging by one boot. The bars spring open, and the dragon thanks her by shutting her in the **cage** as a joke."],"丘":["mound","{Chewbacca} rips open every pillow in a temper in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel}, roaring about the ship, until the stuffing heaps into a soft *hillock*. It swells into a **mound** as he stomps it down and the backpackers climb up, along with a goat. Only his friends understand that he wants to sit alone on top of his **mound**."],"桂":["laurel","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} with a potted *tree* and raps his staff on the *jade tablet* dangling from its branches. It glows, rings like a bell, and the bare twigs burst into fragrant **laurel**. With a muttered spell and a shower of fireworks he weaves a **laurel** crown for every patient, and crankily calls them all champions."],"滋":["to nourish","{Zorro} flicks his rapier in {Front} of the {Beehive}, slashing a Z round a dangling *magnet*, and *water drops* leap up to cling to it. The bees drink, swell and glow, and with each dashing stroke he **nourishes** the entire colony. They ooze honey that **nourishes** his black horse, and he gallops away laughing."],"聊":["to chat","{Lara Croft} scales the wall {Inside} the {Cat Café} and presses an *ear* to a *mortise* in the ancient panelling, listening for the clicks of a trap. All she hears is cats who **chat** about tuna, naps and gossip, and the joint hums with their purring. She solves the puzzle by joining in, and they **chat** for hours through the hole while the door swings open."],"挡":["to block","{Darth Vader} stands breathing in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} as a runaway plane rolls toward him. He raises a *helping hand* and the Force drags a *roadblock* into its path to **block** it, and the plane bounces off. He **blocks** a second with his red lightsaber and booms his disapproval at a third, which reverses by itself."],"纲":["guiding principle","{Gandalf} strides in {Front} of the {Hangar} and with a flick of his staff stretches a glowing *silk thread* from the top of a *ridge*, which hums, down to every plane. This, he says crankily, is his **guiding principle**: follow the thread. One strays, he roars that it shall not pass, and the rest taxi in single file, obeying the **guiding principle**."],"肌":["muscle","{James Bond} steps out in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, tuxedo spotless, and presses Q's cufflink, which does one absurd thing: it inflates his arm **muscle**. The arm hoists a *small table* with a giant glowing *moon* balanced on it, while the bulge pops and starts to sing. He flexes the **muscle** once more, unruffled, and sips his coconut with the other hand."],"茨":["caltrop","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Beehive} and spots spiky seed pods hidden in the *grass*, which look to him like cookies. He chomps a **caltrop**, and his googly eyes cross. A polite *queue* of bees offers him another and another, and he eats each **caltrop** in a spray of crumbs, wailing that me not want this cookie."],"壳":["shell","{Kermit} hops {Inside} the {Hut} to stage-manage a lecture and trips over a *scholar* buried in *clutter*: books, bottles, odd socks. In a panic he grabs an empty snail **shell** and blows it like a trumpet to start the show. Whoosh, the mess and the scholar are sucked in, and he flails his arms and yells Yaaay at the talking **shell**."],"痕":["scar","{Homer} shuffles {Inside} the {Funfair} with a doughnut and meets a man on a *sickbed*, whose *glare* could melt icing, and who shows off a long **scar** from the bumper cars. Homer's dim scheme to look tough is to paint himself a **scar** in jam. He admires it in a mirror, murmurs mmm, licks it off and looks exactly the same."],"碗":["bowl","{Walter White} drips a precise solution onto a *stone* in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, and it fizzes, hollowing itself into a *rice bowl*. Proud of his science, he fills the **bowl** with soup, but the reaction has not stopped. The **bowl** keeps widening until he has to paddle round in it with a long spoon, adjusting his glasses and taking notes."],"穴":["cave","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Ice Rink}, dreaming of solitude, and roars so hard that a dark *cave* cracks open at his feet. Perfect: a **cave** with no one in it, and not a skater for miles. He climbs down, lights an onion candle, sighs happily, and then hears Donkey's voice come echoing out of the depths of the **cave**."],"膀":["upper arm","{Batman} glides into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} as a runaway *moon* rolls off the *roadside* toward the planes. He fires his grappling hook, braces his **upper arm**, and flexes until his cape strains and a sleeve bursts. Gruffly he hauls it to a stop, parks it, and broods beside the moon, massaging his sore **upper arm**."],"卓":["outstanding","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Warehouse}, lighting a blazing *beacon* on a pole above a tower of crates. He stands on top, glowing gold in his purple suit, and fires trick cards into the crowd, each printed **outstanding**. The workers cheer, then his squirting flower puts out the flame, and he takes a bow as the most **outstanding** prankster in the place."],"贤":["virtuous","{Shrek} grumbles {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, finds a golden *shell* worth a fortune, and roars for its owner, an old lady, to take it back so everyone will leave him alone. The money changers weep and bow at such a **virtuous** ogre. The shell glows with **virtuous** light, and Donkey will not stop talking about it, which is Shrek's punishment."],"卧":["to lie down","{Walter White} knocks at a stall in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort}, the one who knocks, with a warm beaker of chamomile for a class experiment. A *minister* sips it, yawning, and the *fortune stick* beside him twitches and spells out **lie down**. He obeys and **lies down** at once on the stone floor, and Walter proudly times the snores."],"膜":["membrane","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Fort} and finds a thin, wobbly **membrane** stretched between the *moon* and the *sunset*, like cling film over the sky. He stomps on it, the moon wobbles, the sunset stretches, and he is flung upward with a Wahoo. Coins rain down from nowhere, and the **membrane** pings him back for another bounce."],"毅":["resolute","{Yoshi} plants his feet in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut as an *angry boar* charges at him swinging a *war club*. He swallows the beast, lays it as an egg, and it bursts out charging again. **Resolute**, Yoshi swallows it forty more times without taking one step back, until the boar slumps down, defeated by something so **resolute**."],"锦":["brocade","{James Bond} stands in the {Basement} of the {Inn}, presses a button on Q's cuff, and it does one absurd thing: it fires *gold coins* through flapping rolls of *silk cloth*. Each coin stitches itself in, and the fabric becomes shimmering **brocade** covered in golden dragons. He wraps it round him as a new jacket and, unruffled, orders one more **brocade** for the road."],"欠":["to owe","{Chewbacca} ducks into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and lets out a gigantic *yawn* that shakes hundreds of IOUs from his bandolier. He **owes** everyone for ship parts: the banker, the mechanic, a cat. He roars and rips up the bills in a temper, then, being loyal and honest, tapes them together again, and now he **owes** for the tape."],"哩":["lively ending","{Lara Croft} climbs up on the {Roof} of the {Beach} hut, where an ancient password lock will open only for a happy little 'li!' She opens her *mouth* and shouts a riddle with that **lively ending**, and a secret door flips open. The whole *village* below shouts it back, and a hundred hidden doors clatter open at every **lively ending**."],"函":["envelope","{Homer} sleepwalks {Inside} the {Mansion} dreaming of doughnuts and tumbles into a deep *pit*, which swallows him with a gulp, and he yells D'oh. At the bottom waits a fat **envelope** he hopes holds doughnut coupons. The letter says, please stop falling into pits, so he climbs out grumbling and posts the **envelope** straight back down the hole."],"茫":["boundless","{Mario} warps up a green pipe {Inside} the {Hangar} and finds no walls at all, only *grass* rolling down into an *open sea*. He stomps on the horizon to make it stop, but it hops further off, **boundless**. 'Wahoo?' he squeaks, running right for hours, and the level never ends, **boundless** green and blue with no flagpole anywhere."],"昂":["to raise","{Casper} floats {Inside} the {Hangar} with an *upward gaze*, hoping the *sun* will be his friend. He drifts through a parked plane's belly, and the pilots flee in fright, so he gently **raises** the whole empty plane on his shoulders like a gift. The *sun* beams through the skylight, and he **raises** it higher, waving shyly."],"薛":["Xue","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Ice Rink} and roars at everyone to leave his swamp, which he has just planted here in bitter *wormwood*. Donkey reads the mailbox aloud and will not shut up: it says property of the **Xue** family. Old Grandma **Xue** glides up, sniffs the *wormwood* that makes the skaters flee, and hands Shrek an eviction notice with a grin."],"皱":["to wrinkle","The {Joker} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and squirts his trick flower at a cow *hide* drying on a bale of *hay*. The prank water makes the *hide* **wrinkle** up like a giant raisin. Cackling, he squirts again, and the hay prickles his chin until even his huge grin starts to **wrinkle**."],"夸":["to boast","{Kermit} flails his arms in {Front} of the {Water Park} as a *show-off* in a cape seizes his stage microphone and starts to **boast** about being the greatest swimmer alive. 'Yaaay?' Kermit croaks, hopping up with his banjo to announce the next act, but the *show-off* belly-flops with a SMACK and floats up still **boasting**, while the whole chaotic show falls apart."],"豫":["carefree","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where an *elephant* sits guarding an *offering* of bananas. His long tongue slurps up the bananas, and then the worries of every guard, and he lays them all as one speckled egg. The *elephant* hums, totally **carefree**, and rolls the egg away while Yoshi naps, just as **carefree**, in the sink."],"胃":["stomach","{Walter White} knocks on the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house, adjusts his glasses and lifts a beaker of antacid toward a giant gurgling *stomach* in the sink. He announces precise chemistry and pours exactly one hundred millilitres. The **stomach** fizzes, foams purple and burps him across the water, black hat spinning, proud that every bubble matches his equation for a **stomach**."],"舌":["tongue","{Sherlock} bends {Inside} the {Hut} with his magnifying glass as a huge pink *tongue* rolls out like a carpet and licks his deerstalker. From one crumb on its tip, he deduces it had toast at nine. 'Elementary,' he says smugly, while the **tongue** wraps Watson up and tastes him too, and Sherlock records that this **tongue** prefers marmalade."],"剥":["to peel","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Fort}, opens his *logbook* and growls the day's mission: **peel** it all. From his utility belt he pulls a *standing knife* on a gadget spring, and it hops along the battlements, curling off the paint. He fires his grappling hook, and the whole wall starts to **peel** away in one long brooding strip."],"傲":["proud","{Casper} drifts through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, where a *standing person* and a *wanderer* sit arguing over who is grander. He turns visible and shyly says hello, but they are far too **proud** to scream. Both lift their noses higher and look straight through him, so Casper, who only wanted a friend, floats away past the most **proud** pair in town."],"拾":["to pick up","{Sherlock} squeezes {Inside} the {Beehive}, raises his magnifying glass and deduces from one sticky crumb where every lost honey jar has rolled. 'Elementary,' he says, and a *helping hand* trailing behind him **picks up** each jar, pressing on a *fitted lid* with a click. Poor Watson, stung and sighing, must **pick up** the violin Sherlock has dropped."],"窝":["nest","{Walter White} marches out in {Front} of the {Fort} to a dark *cave*, where a bird has laid its eggs in a rusty *wok*. He puts on his glasses, pours precise chemistry into the *wok*, and the foam sets hard and warm into a perfect insulating **nest**. Proud of his science, he writes the formula on the cave wall, and the eggs hatch in the **nest** with a small fizz."],"睁":["to open eyes","The {Joker} tiptoes out in {Front} of the {Jungle} and ties a trick playing card to a sleeping tiger's eyelid, starting a *tug of war* with a troop of giggling monkeys. Pop! One *eye* flies wide as the tiger **opens its eyes**. Cackling, he squirts his flower, and each time it dozes off he makes it **open its eyes** again."],"携":["to carry","{Shrek} grumbles {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} with a sack of onions, wanting only to be left alone, but Donkey will not stop talking. So he makes a *helping hand* from swamp mud to **carry** the sack, perches a *carried bird* on each shoulder and then, with a roar, throws Donkey over his back. He **carries** the whole noisy lot up the ice, still grumbling."],"陵":["tomb","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where the canvas tilts up into a steep *hillside* full of ancient traps. After a hard *hill climb* with a boulder rolling at her ponytail, she cracks a puzzle and the corner post slides open onto an emperor's **tomb**. She backflips in for the relic while the referee counts to ten over the **tomb**."],"哼":["to snort","{Homer} naps in {Front} of the {Jungle} in a *shrine hall* he thinks is a doughnut shop, his *mouth* wide open. He wakes, sees there are no doughnuts, and goes 'D'oh!' so hard he starts to **snort** sprinkles. A wild boar **snorts** back, certain he is family, and the temple bells ring with every blast."],"棉":["cotton","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, head-butts a block and a potted *tree* shoots up, dropping not coins but fluffy balls of **cotton**. 'Wahoo!' He stomps on them, and each squashed ball springs out as a square of *silk cloth* that the bankers refuse to accept. They sneeze as his moustache vanishes under the rising **cotton**."],"晴":["clear","{Chewbacca} roars {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a week of rain has grown *moss* all over the ropes. In a temper he rips the ceiling panels apart, then fixes the hole with ship parts into a giant lens, and the *sun* blazes through. The sky is suddenly **clear**, the moss crisps up, and he howls a long happy growl at the **clear** blue above."],"铃":["bell","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where a *herald* guards a relic: a sack of ancient *gold coins* sitting on a pressure plate. She solves the puzzle by swinging the coins into a mould hung from the ropes, and they fuse into a golden **bell**. The herald shouts, a boulder rumbles in, and the **bell** goes DING just as she somersaults away."],"填":["to fill","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, baffled by a *magnifying glass* on the counter, and through it he spots a hole in the floor. He gives his jungle yell, and a herd of elephants storms in with trunkfuls of *soil* to **fill** it. Bankers scream and the money gets buried, but Tarzan beats his chest: he has **filled** the hole."],"饲":["to rear","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, where the queen bee, her *boss* today, orders her to **rear** a thousand larvae. Cue a long sparkly transformation, then she raises her moon wand and conjures a *side dish* of pollen pancakes for each one. Crying loudly with love, she **rears** them in the name of justice while Luna the cat rolls her eyes."],"渴":["thirsty","{Kermit} hops into the {Basement} of the {Hut}, dry-skinned and flailing, because it's not easy being green and this **thirsty**. A few *water drops* fall from a pipe, and each bends into a *question mark* asking for more. 'Yaaay!' he screams, opening wide, strumming his banjo for another drip, and he is still so **thirsty** that he licks the pipe."],"吻":["kiss","{Walter White} marches into the {Basement} of the {Funfair} with a beaker, testing a red *pennant* for pure science. One drop of his reagent and a painted *mouth* blooms on the cloth, which swoops down and plants a big wet **kiss** on his bald head. Glasses fogged, he logs the reaction with pride: every pennant in the fair now blows a **kiss** at exactly twenty degrees."],"扮":["to dress up","{Batman} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} for a costume party he has brooded over for weeks. He checks his utility belt for a disguise, finds only a *helping hand* gadget, and it grabs a *cut cake* and smears it all over his cowl. Now he is **dressed up** as a giant cream bun, growling about vengeance, and Alfred **dresses up** the cape with a cherry."],"逆":["contrary","{Naruto} charges into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and finds a *road* where an *upside-down man* walks on his hands, going right when everyone goes left. Never giving up, Naruto summons a dozen shadow clones to turn him over, but every clone comes out **contrary**, walking backwards and yelling the opposite of each order. It is the most **contrary** ninja squad ever."],"脆":["brittle","{Cookie Monster} bounds into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *teetering man* balances a *moon* of sugar glass on one finger. 'Me want cookie!' he roars, and takes one bite: it is so **brittle** that it explodes in a spray of crumbs. The man wobbles, and Cookie Monster, googly eyes whirling, eats the chairs next, all just as **brittle**."],"喘":["to pant","{Charlie Brown} runs into the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond} chasing his kite, *mouth* hanging open, and starts to **pant** like Snoopy in August. A *sprout tip* pokes up through the floor and trips him, of course. 'Good grief,' he wheezes, lying flat and **panting**, as a swan eats the kite and walks off."],"罩":["cover","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, cackling, and flings a *fishing net* stitched with playing cards over the blinking *beacon*. The light is **covered**, so the whole tower goes dark, and a sign pops up: SURPRISE. He grins at his fine **cover**, then finds the net has caught his own green hair."],"卜":["to divine","{Batman} dives into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, brooding over tonight's crime, and shakes a *fortune stick* he keeps in his utility belt. He uses it to **divine** the future with grim detective precision, and it says a splash is coming. A whale bursts up and soaks him. He growls, shakes again, and **divines** a bigger splash, his cape dripping more each time."],"炉":["stove","{Lara Croft} climbs down {Inside} the {Pool}, hauls on an ancient lever, and a stone *door* grinds open onto a sacred *campfire* that has burned for a thousand years. She solves the puzzle, shuts the door on it and the whole relic becomes a roaring **stove**. Swimmers yelp as the water bubbles, and she backflips over a boulder to fry sausages on her **stove**."],"柴":["firewood","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Island} lighthouse and marks *this spot* for a kite launch, but *this spot* has a *tree*, which eats his kite at once. 'Good grief.' In a rare temper he chops that tree into **firewood**, and the kite is in there somewhere. The pile of **firewood** burns all night, while Snoopy roasts marshmallows on it."],"愉":["pleased","{Yoshi} paddles a *dugout canoe* {Inside} the {Museum}, shoots out his sticky tongue and swallows a sour portrait whole. He lays it as an egg, it hatches, and the portrait comes out **pleased**, grinning at everyone. A *standing heart* bounces on the bow, thumping, as he eats painting after painting, until the whole gallery is **pleased**."],"绳":["rope","{Sherlock} creeps {Inside} the {Jungle} lookout, deducing from one sticky strand that a *frog* has been braiding *silk thread* with its tongue. 'Elementary,' he says, and the frog's finished **rope** loops round Watson's ankles. Sherlock plays one note on his violin, the frog hops in time, and the **rope** hoists Watson up among the trees."],"胎":["fetus","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Island} hut and sees the *moon* shine on a little *stage*, where a mother ape shows him a shadow picture of her unborn baby: a tiny **fetus**, curled up sucking its thumb. Baffled, he puts his ear to her tummy and speaks ape. The **fetus** kicks back, and Tarzan's jungle yell shakes the island."],"蓄":["to store up","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and claims it as his new swamp, hauling sacks of *grass* for winter. He **stores up** layers like an onion: grass, then onions, then more grass, while Donkey chatters and his *livestock* chew the mummies' wrappings. He roars at visitors and **stores up** so much that the walls bulge, which means nobody can come in."],"眠":["to sleep","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} and head-butts a block, which spits out a sleepy mushroom rather than a coin. A weary *commoner* eats it, her *eye* droops, and she falls to **sleep** standing up. He stomps along the queue, and each stomped banker flattens into a pillow and goes to **sleep**, coins snoring in their piles."],"竭":["to exhaust","{James Bond} strides {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and climbs a *podium* in his tuxedo, pressing every button on a Q gadget that fires snowballs. He keeps firing until the battery and the poor yeti are both **exhausted**. A glowing *question mark* floats up from the gadget, asking if any are left. 'Nothing,' he says, unruffled, and walks out having **exhausted** all of Q's gadgets."],"喂":["to feed","{Walter White} sets up beakers in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house, and a hungry *spook* opens its *mouth* wide. Soup passes straight through it, so he calculates a precise ghost-safe vapour, glowing green, and **feeds** it with a pipette. Proud of his science, he adjusts his glasses and **feeds** it another measured millilitre until the spook burps a tidy smoke ring."],"傻":["silly","{Sherlock} steps into the {Basement} of the {Spa}, where a *standing person* wears cucumber slices as glasses and a towel as a cape. He deduces from one crumb of soap that the man is a superhero, quite wrong for once. Watson giggles: how **silly**! Smugly, Sherlock puts on a towel to prove his point, slips on the cucumber and looks even more **silly**."],"慕":["to admire","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and lands on a *heart cushion* floating under a painted *sunset*. A koopa diver does a perfect flip; he sighs, moustache trembling, and starts to **admire** it. He forgets to stomp anything, hugging his cushion to **admire** every splash and head-butting a block to toss the diver its coin."],"浑":["muddy","{Homer} dozes {Inside} the {Casino} fountain, and his dim scheme of sneaking a doughnut past an *army* of toy soldiers backfires: they stomp through in boots, and the *water drops* turn brown as gravy. 'D'oh!' The water is so **muddy** that the doughnut sinks, and he dives after it. He surfaces **muddy** from head to toe, going 'Mmm' and licking his fingers."],"奸":["crafty","{James Bond} strolls out in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} in his tuxedo and watches a *woman* hide coins in socks on a *drying rack*, which is very **crafty**. He fires a Q gadget that only sniffs laundry and steals the biggest sock, but she, even more **crafty**, has stuffed it with buttons that burst into confetti. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, unruffled, picking it from his hair."],"扇":["fan","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and from one stray crumb deduces a draught. He traces it with his magnifying glass: a swinging *door* covered in *feathers*, working like a giant **fan**. 'Elementary,' he says, as it blows his deerstalker off and his pipe out. Watson chases the hat, while Sherlock sits smugly before the **fan**, playing his violin in the breeze."],"柜":["cupboard","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} exactly when he means to, and taps a *tree* with his staff. A magic *set square* flies out and measures it as the trunk folds itself into straight lines, making a **cupboard** with a crackle of fireworks. He opens the **cupboard**, and a dozen patients tumble out holding their tickets. 'You shall not pass,' he tells them crankily."],"悦":["delighted","{Yoshi} slides into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} and his tongue shoots out and swallows a sour *money changer*, coins and all. He squats and lays a huge spotted egg that cracks open: the man is **delighted**, raining coins. Yoshi's *standing heart* skips, he flutter-jumps in loops, and every skater hit by a coin is **delighted** too."],"拦":["to stop","{Lara Croft} sprints {Inside} the {Mansion} with a rolling boulder behind her, down a hall of ancient traps. She backflips onto a plinth and sets an *orchid* in the palm of a stone *helping hand*, which rises from the floor to **stop** the boulder dead. Every blade in the hall **stops** too, quivering an inch from her ponytail."],"诞":["birth","{Darth Vader} marches into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, breathing loudly, along a *stretching road* of balloons he lifts aside with the Force. A *small speech bubble* pops over a cradle: it is a **birth**! 'I am your father,' he booms at the baby, and the whole party gasps. His red lightsaber lights the candles for the **birth**, and he disapproves of the cake."],"饱":["full","{Batman} glides into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where Alfred's *parcel* holds every *side dish* in Gotham. He brings down each dumpling with a batarang and eats it, brooding, until he is **full**. Now the cape won't close and the utility belt snaps with a ping, so he growls that he is **full** and has to be winched up the stairs by his own grappling hook."],"乾":["dry","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Mansion} at *dawn*, exactly when he means to, and a *beggar* holds up an empty bucket pleading for rain. He raises his staff and casts a great spell, but it backfires: fireworks flare, every cloud evaporates and the lawn goes **dry** as toast. Crankily he lights his pipe, and the beggar stares at the **dry** bucket, now full of dust."],"泡":["bubble","{Pikachu} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} with a soapy *parcel* in his paws, and *water drops* splash on it. 'Pika!' His cheek sparks zap the soap, and out swells a giant **bubble**, which snaps shut round him as a Poké Ball would. He floats past every window, shocking the glass, until the **bubble** pops with a Thunderbolt."],"贼":["thief","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier {Inside} the {Lake} house and spots a **thief** stuffing a golden *shell* in his sack. A toy *soldier* marches out and blows a trumpet, so Zorro's rapier flashes and slashes a Z in the sack and another on the seat of his trousers. Laughing, he vanishes on his black horse, leaving the **thief** marked and dripping in the lake."],"亭":["pavilion","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} on a vine and crashes into a little *pavilion* with a curly top standing mid-canvas. Baffled by civilisation, he sniffs it, taps it, gives his jungle yell and fetches apes to decorate the **pavilion** with bananas. The boxers stop to sip tea, and the referee raises the arm of the **pavilion**."],"夕":["evening","{Shrek} settles in {Front} of the {Beach} hut at last, alone, with an onion, as a pale *dusk moon* rises and it is finally **evening**. Then Donkey starts singing, and the moon leans down to listen. Shrek roars so loud the sun sinks faster, and the purple **evening** falls silent for just one second before Donkey starts again."],"爹":["dad","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, breathing heavily, and booms 'I am your father' at a startled young yeti. The real hairy *father*, who has waited *many moons*, stomps out, roaring that he is the **dad** here. Vader lifts them both with the Force in booming disapproval, but the little yeti leaps into the hairy arms and shouts for his **dad**."],"酬":["to repay","{Charlie Brown} sits {Inside} the {Boathouse} owing the fishermen of many little *islands* for all the kites they pulled out of the water. To **repay** them he rolls a huge *wine jug* down the dock, full of grape juice, but it bounces away, of course. 'Good grief.' It floats from boat to boat, and he **repays** every one by accident, still getting no thanks."],"儒":["Confucian scholar","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Pool} with his visor locked on a *standing person* *waiting in rain* under a tiny umbrella, reading a scroll. He reads out a directive against reading on wet tiles and politely arrests him. The prisoner bows, a **Confucian scholar**, and quotes rules on courtesy until the targeting display flashes **Confucian scholar** and Robocop bows stiffly, squeaking."],"姻":["marriage","{Yoshi} waddles in {Front} of the {Inn} where a *woman* rolls out a *sleeping mat* for two and her groom arrives late. Yoshi's tongue shoots out, swallows both rings and lays them as one big wedding egg. It hatches with a pop, and out comes a **marriage** certificate, already signed. The whole inn throws rice, and Yoshi flutter-jumps over the happy **marriage**."],"卵":["egg","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Swan Pond}, where one *bamboo joint* and another *bamboo joint* guard a carved pedestal like ancient relics. She solves the puzzle by rolling both over a trap, and each one cracks open: it was an **egg** all along! A fluffy cygnet tumbles out, and she somersaults away from a furious swan with the last **egg** tucked into her ponytail."],"氛":["atmosphere","{Frodo} trudges on bare hairy feet in {Front} of the {Funfair}, weary from his long walk, and finds a giant *cut cake* puffing *steam* like a dragon. Sam sniffs: the whole **atmosphere** turns sweet and cosy. Tempted, Frodo slips on the Ring, vanishes from the crowd's hugs, and still feels the **atmosphere** of the place getting warmer, tugging him towards a second slice."],"泄":["to leak out","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and peels an inflatable *globe* like an onion, layer by layer, looking for somewhere quiet. It springs a hole, and *water drops* **leak out** of Africa, then Asia, then the oceans. He roars and plugs it with his thumb, but Donkey's chatter and all his secrets **leak out** too."],"杆":["pole","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Mansion}, points his staff at a tall *tree*, and with a blast of fireworks strips it into one long **pole**. A *drying rack* flies up and hooks on, heavy with socks. He bangs the **pole** on the ground and shouts 'You shall not pass!' and every sock rains down on the guests."],"挨":["next to","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse, only wanting a friend, but the sailors flee in fright. A *helping hand* drags a deckchair **next to** him, and a round *full stop* rolls up and sits down without a scream. He turns invisible from shyness, then appears again, and they stay **next to** each other all night, silent but cosy."],"僧":["monk","{Sailor Moon} twirls in {Front} of the {Jungle} temple through her long sparkly transformation, while a *standing person* in orange robes waits with a *steamer* of buns on his head. She makes her speech about justice, trips over her own pigtails and cries loudly. The **monk** simply hums and lowers a bun to her, so she throws her tiara in thanks, and it lands neatly on the **monk**."],"蜜":["honey","{Mario} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} hut and head-butts a block, and the *roof* starts to drip gold: not coins but **honey**. 'Wahoo!' He stomps on the next block for more and his boots stick fast. Bees pour out, and his moustache is glued up with **honey** when he warps down the drain."],"吟":["to chant","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Inn}, swallows a ticking *clock* whole and lays it as an egg that keeps on ticking. His *mouth* falls open and he starts to **chant** his own name in time, and guests shuffle out of their rooms to **chant** along until the whole inn hums like a very large, very sleepy clock."],"猩":["ape","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} wanting quiet, when a *prowling dog* chases a falling *star* right past his onion. A huge hairy **ape** catches the star and beats his chest in Shrek's face. Shrek roars, the **ape** roars louder, and Donkey, delighted, will not stop commentating."],"遂":["to succeed","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, onto a *road* where a *trotting pig* races for the doctor's door. She lifts her moon wand, makes a tearful speech about justice and hurls her tiara, which knocks every obstacle away. The pig **succeeds**! She **succeeds** too, at last, then cries loudly with joy while Luna looks at the ceiling."],"狭":["narrow","{Shrek} squeezes {Inside} the {Piazza} arcade, a passage so **narrow** that his big green belly wedges like an onion in a bottle. A *prowling dog* gets stuck behind him, so he pulls it through with *tongs*, roaring. Donkey keeps talking from behind as it gets more **narrow**, and they all pop out the far end like toothpaste."],"肖":["to resemble","{Shrek} barges into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and finds a *portrait* on the wall that looks just like him. He roars at it, and a cat hops into the frame, turns green and starts to **resemble** him, ears and all. Soon every cat **resembles** Shrek, growling about onions and telling Donkey to leave."],"甜":["sweet","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} on a vine, baffled, and spies a gigantic stick of *candy* the bankers use as a pen. He licks it with his *tongue*: it is so **sweet** that his jungle yell comes out as a squeak. He tells the monkeys, and they swarm in to lick every coin, each one **sweet** enough to make them faint."],"霞":["rosy clouds","{Shrek} stands {Inside} the {Piazza} bell tower, where gloomy *rain* spoils his grumpy nap. He snatches a *borrowed tool* from a painter, a long brush, and slaps swamp mud and onion juice across the sky; Donkey squeals, because it turns into **rosy clouds**. Tourists gasp, and Shrek roars at them to leave him and his **rosy clouds** alone."],"驳":["refute","{Batman} crouches {Inside} the {Fort}, glaring at a talking *horse* behind a wooden *lattice*, who claims it never took the hay. He pulls a forensic gadget from his belt, shows a hoofprint and growls that every claim is one he can **refute**, one gruff fact at a time. The horse opens its mouth again, and a batarang pins the lie to the lattice, **refuting** that too."],"裕":["abundant","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and finds a lush *valley* where a single *shirt* grows on a branch. He swallows it and lays it as an egg, which hatches a dozen shirts. He swallows those and lays more, until the supply is truly **abundant**, and mummies, statues and guards are all buried under **abundant** stripes."],"顽":["stubborn","{Walter White} strides {Inside} the {Mansion}, black hat on, and finds a *yuan coin* stuck to a *page* of his chemistry textbook. He tries acid, base and heat, each measured to the milligram, and the coin will not move. It is **stubborn**. Walter, just as proud, is now **stubborn** too, and the two of them glare through his glasses all night."],"於":["in, at","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum}, swallows a *kite* whole and lays it as an egg in a *square* glass case. Asked where it is, the guard points: **in** the case, **at** the museum. The *kite* hatches and tugs, and Yoshi flutter-jumps up after it, **in** the air and **at** the very top of the stairs."],"摘":["to pick","The {Joker} prances in {Front} of the {Island} hut and rigs a coconut palm with a *dripping tap* as a prank. He pulls a lever, and a rubber *helping hand* springs out to **pick** a coconut, then another, cackling in a squeaky voice. Each one he **picks** turns out to be a squirting flower that soaks the tourists, and his grin grows wider."],"矮":["short","{Casper} drifts through the floor into the {Basement} of the {Island} hut, hoping to make friends with an *arrow* and a *wilting stalk*. Everything here is **short**, even the candles, so the stalk droops lower in fright when he says hello. The arrow flies only an inch, he shrinks to be polite, and soon Casper is so **short** that he fades under a chair."],"秒":["second","{Mario} warps into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} with a level timer ticking fast. He holds a *grain stalk* and plucks a *pinch* of husk every **second**, stomping in rhythm while cats swish like clock hands. 'Wahoo!' If he is late by one **second**, the music speeds up, and twelve cats pounce on his red cap."],"卿":["high official","{Chewbacca} fixes a busted door in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and peers through a *mortise* at a **high official** in silk robes, who orders silence. He roars an answer only friends understand and, in a temper, rips the whole door apart. The **high official** blinks, scroll shaking, then meekly asks him to fix the *mortise*, which he does in seconds with a growl."],"畜":["livestock","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and, of course, lands on a pig on a lilo. The *livestock* have taken over: cows paddle, goats eat his kite, and a chicken pulls away his football at the last moment. 'Good grief,' he sighs, while Snoopy sells the **livestock** sun cream, and every **livestock** splash hits Charlie alone."],"咽":["to swallow","{Yoshi} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} onto a *sleeping mat* and opens his *mouth* wide. Out whips the long sticky tongue, and he **swallows** a dumpling, the chandelier, the butler and the mat. 'Yoshi!' He lays them one by one as spotted eggs, looks at the eggs thoughtfully, and **swallows** them again."],"披":["to drape","{Pikachu} shivers in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, cheeks barely sparking. A *helping hand* picks up a bear *hide* and **drapes** it over him, but a spark goes off and the fur stands straight up. 'Pika!' The hand keeps **draping** more, until he is a furry mountain crackling with Thunderbolts, two yellow ears sticking out."],"辅":["to assist","{Frodo} limps into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, weary, on bare hairy feet, to plant Sam's tomatoes. Loyal Sam pushes a *cart* with a *seedbed* and **assists** at every step, digging, watering and carrying Frodo when he can go no further. Tempted by the Ring, Frodo nearly vanishes, but Sam **assists** him there too, just by saying 'Mr Frodo'."],"勾":["to attract","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Boathouse} and casts a glowing spell on a golden *hook*, which he dangles from his staff. It **attracts** bees, then a duck, then a dreamy sailor, all floating towards it as his fireworks sparkle. He smokes his pipe crankily as everything in sight is **attracted**, and the lawn fills with admirers who shall not pass."],"盆":["basin","{Pikachu} scampers {Inside} the {Funfair} and finds a *dish* holding a *cut cake*. 'Pika!' One Thunderbolt and the dish grows, crackling, into a giant **basin**. Water fills it, kids splash in, and he floats in the **basin** on a slice of cake with cheeks sparking, until a Poké Ball rolls in and catches the lot."],"疆":["border","{James Bond} arrives in {Front} of the {Stadium} in his tuxedo and presses a Q gadget that does only one thing: it sprays a chalk line. Now the car park is a *borderland* with guards, passports and a very small **border** post. Unruffled, he steps to and fro over the **border**, shaken, not stirred, as both sets of fans chase him."],"赌":["to gamble","{Darth Vader} looms into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, breathing loudly, where a *busy man* in dark glasses shuffles cards on a lilo. He bets a golden *shell*, and Vader agrees to **gamble**, nudging the dice with the Force. The dice disobey, and with booming disapproval he **gambles** his cape, his lightsaber and finally his helmet, then swims home breathing twice as loud."],"塑":["plastic","{Sailor Moon} falls into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} onto a pile of *soil* glowing under a *new moon*. She waves her moon wand through a long sparkly transformation, and the soil transforms too, into shiny **plastic**: boats, ducks, a whale. She cries loudly when her tiara turns to **plastic** as well, and Luna squeaks across it."],"畏":["to dread","{Walter White} knocks on the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house and comes face to face with a *spook*. His hands shake over his beaker: no formula explains it, and he **dreads** what he cannot measure. He squeaks that he is the one who knocks, but the *spook* says Boo, and he **dreads** it so much that his goatee turns white."],"吵":["noisy","{Charlie Brown} sits in the {Basement} of the {Tower} and opens his *mouth* to say 'Good grief', when a *pinch* of pepper flies in. ACHOO! The sneeze sets Snoopy howling and the pots clanging; it's so **noisy** that the tower bells ring. Everybody blames Charlie, naturally, and the boos make it even more **noisy**."],"囊":["sack","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Hangar} dragging a gigantic **sack** and yelling about ramen. He makes a hand sign and a hundred shadow clones pop out, each hauling a smaller sack, bump, bump, bump. He never gives up opening them, and the last tiny **sack** holds one peanut, which he eats with his headband on crooked."],"嗯":["mm-hmm","{Casper} floats on the {Roof} of the {Funfair}, hoping to give each visitor a *warm hug*, but they all run screaming. Only one stays, and Casper's round *mouth* hums, '**Mm-hmm**.' The visitor nods back and hums '**Mm-hmm**' too. Soon the carousel, the clowns and the candyfloss stall nod along, no longer frightened, all humming with the ghost."],"泊":["lake","{Pikachu} scampers in {Front} of the {Fort}, sparking at a rain cloud until *water drops* pour down into a glassy **lake** on the lawn. A *white dove* lands on it and floats like a swan. 'Pika!' He dips one paw, a Thunderbolt races across the **lake**, and the dove's feathers all stand on end."],"肺":["lung","{Frodo} staggers into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} house, worn out after a very long walk, and collapses by a *moon* wearing an *apron*. It fans him as he takes one deep breath, and his **lung** blows up like a balloon, lifting his hairy feet off the ground. Sam pats his back, and with the air from one mighty **lung** he blows every candle out."],"骤":["sudden","The {Joker} leaps into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} on a *horse* and crashes a quiet *gathering* of ducks with a **sudden** bang. A trick playing card explodes into feathers, his flower squirts, and a **sudden** storm of custard pies drops from nowhere. He cackles with his huge grin as the horse rows off in a canoe."],"缠":["to wind around","{Charlie Brown} tries to fly his kite {Inside} the {Mansion}, which goes as well as you would expect. Its *silk thread* starts to **wind around** his legs, the banisters and the chandelier, and he trips into a *tangle*. 'Good grief,' he says, hanging upside down, while the thread **winds around** Snoopy, who takes a nap in it."],"冈":["ridge","{Gandalf} strikes his staff on the tarmac in {Front} of the {Hangar}, and with a rumble a long *ridge* erupts like a dragon's back. 'You shall not pass!' he shouts at the taxiing planes, which scrape their tails on the **ridge**. Pleased, he lights his pipe and conjures a second **ridge**, just to annoy the pilots."],"羞":["shy","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel} at a *clown* trying to kiss a *sheep*. The sheep blushes and hides in his swamp-green shadow: it is so **shy**! The clown, suddenly just as **shy**, ducks behind his red nose, and Shrek, who only wants to be left alone, goes pink himself when Donkey says he has a soft heart."],"瞪":["to glare","{Darth Vader} looms into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, beside a *climber* stuck halfway up a tree. He **glares** at her through his helmet, one huge lens like an angry *eye*, breathing loudly, and lifts her down with the Force. She **glares** back, and they stare until the monkeys get bored and the tree looks away."],"吊":["to hang up","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and with one raised finger lifts a *hanging lamp* shaped like a fish to the ceiling. He **hangs up** more with the Force, booming his disapproval at the darkness, and cats swing across on them. Then he **hangs up** his own cape, and a kitten climbs it, purring in time with his breath."],"贾":["surname Jia","{James Bond} slides into the {Basement} of the {Piazza} and unlocks a dusty *cabinet* with a Q gadget that opens only cabinets. Golden *shell* coins spill out, each stamped with the **surname Jia**. Unruffled, he introduces himself, 'Bond. James Bond,' and an old shopkeeper bursts in, waving a ledger: his is the **surname Jia**, and Bond escapes through a shell-shaped trap door."],"漏":["to leak","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, in search of a relic, and *water drops* hit her from a *leaky roof*. It's an ancient trap: each drip opens a sluice, and the boats begin to **leak**. She swings from rafter to rafter, ponytail flying, as the walls, the buckets and even the relic **leak** in a gurgling chorus."],"斑":["spot","{Batman} crouches in {Front} of the {Mansion} with *twin jades* in his belt as clues, when a *tattoo* gadget misfires on his chest. Instead of a bat, it stamps a **spot**, then another. He scans them, brooding: they form a map, and he glides off covered in **spots** like a leopard, growling at the jades as they turn spotty."],"涛":["big wave","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Tower} and drops a *longevity peach* in a bucket of *water drops*, just to see what civilisation does. The bucket boils and launches a **big wave** across the city. With a jungle yell he grabs a vine, calls his elephants and rides the **big wave** on a startled hippo."],"悠":["drawn out","{Yoshi} sets off on a *leisurely stroll* in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, his *heart* thumping slow as a drum. He sticks his tongue out at a fly, and it takes an hour, long and **drawn out**. His call of 'Yo-o-o-o-shi' is even more **drawn out**, and by the time he swallows the fly and lays the egg, it's next week."],"鹿":["deer","{Lara Croft} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} on a rope and lands between the antlers of a stone *deer*, a relic doing backstroke. She pulls one antler, the **deer** comes alive, and they gallop across the water with boulders rolling behind. A whole herd of **deer** leaps the traps, and she hangs on by her ponytail."],"俘":["to take prisoner","{Frodo} tiptoes {Inside} the {Pool} on bare hairy feet, where a *standing person* in armour guards a tiny *hatchling* in a cage. He slips on the Ring, vanishes, and ties the guard up with elven rope to **take him prisoner**. Sam cheers, the freed chick hops onto the helmet, pecks it, and **takes it prisoner** too."],"锡":["tin","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, hoping for peace, and melts Donkey's *gold coins* in an onion pan, but they come out dull grey: **tin**. A *lizard* taps it with its tail and it clinks like a cheap can. Shrek roars, then hammers the **tin** into a muzzle for Donkey, who talks straight through it."],"卑":["low","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Lake} house, and a king on a barge hands him a huge *fan*, ordering him to bow. Batman, gruff and brooding, won't, so he hides it by ducking **low** to inspect a clue, his nose on the paving. 'Lower!' shouts the king, and he crawls even **lower** until his cape slides into the ditch, the fan waving above him."],"葬":["to bury","{Zorro} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} on a rope, black cape flying, with a goldfish in a matchbox. He slashes a Z in a mat of *grass* on the floor to **bury** it gently, then his rapier cuts a tiny Z for a headstone. Pilots line up, caps off, as he **buries** the fish and vanishes, laughing softly through his tears."],"铭":["to engrave","{Mario} bounds {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, head-butts a block and collects a stream of *gold coins* that fuse into a *name tag*. He stomps his boots on it, tap, tap, tap, and each stomp begins to **engrave** a letter. 'Wahoo!' He **engraves** his own name, since he has stomped every champion flat."],"滩":["beach","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Mansion}, baffled by lawns, and gives a yell that brings elephants spraying *water drops* until the grass turns to a sandy **beach**. A *caught bird* wriggles in a butler's net, and Tarzan talks it free. It flops on the **beach** in sunglasses, and he hangs a vine hammock next to it."],"嫁":["to marry","{James Bond} escapes into the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} and lands in a wedding, where a *woman* waits by a little *home* made of flowers. She is about to **marry** a scowling villain, so Q's ring gadget fires one absurd net of confetti, and the groom flees. She vows to **marry** the man who can stay, but Bond, unruffled, has already gone."],"催":["to urge","{Cookie Monster} bounces in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *standing person* climbs a *lofty peak* of paperwork to reach the last biscuit. 'Hurry! Me want cookie!' he roars, to **urge** him on. He **urges** so hard, spraying crumbs, that the papers blow away, and the man lands at the top by accident."],"璇":["jade","{Shrek} lumbers {Inside} the {Mint}, where a tiny *king* spins a *spinning top* carved from green **jade**. Shrek, green too, wants quiet, so he roars, and the top only hums louder. He tries to peel it like an onion, but the **jade** has no layers and it bounces off his head, leaving a perfect green bruise nobody can see."],"翅":["wing","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and climbs a *branch* to rescue his kite. It snaps, of course, but *feathers* sprout from his zigzag shirt, then a **wing**, then another. For once he soars, and Snoopy salutes below. Then one **wing** sticks in the honey and he drops again, sighing 'Good grief'."],"盒":["box","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Hut} with a *dish* of doughnuts, scheming to keep them safe from himself. He snaps a *fitted lid* on top and it makes a perfect **box**, then puts that into another **box**, and another. He wakes, can't open any of them, and says 'D'oh!', eating the cardboard with a happy 'Mmm'."],"蛮":["barbarian","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Mansion} and meets a *sweating man* in furs, a **barbarian** roaring and swinging a club at a *bug*. Vases smash, and the piano is next. 'Wahoo!' Mario stomps once on the club, twice on the fur hat and collects the coin, and the **barbarian**, flattened like a Goomba, pops up asking for a rematch."],"矣":["already","{Yoshi} skids into the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut and finds a *full stop* sitting where the snacks were. He swallows it and lays it as an egg, but it has **already** hatched. It rolls off, saying everyone has **already** eaten and gone home, and Yoshi flutter-jumps after it, tongue flapping, too late for everything."],"潘":["Pan","{Pikachu} scampers in {Front} of the {Mansion} and zaps a *slop bucket* with a Thunderbolt. The slop leaps up, sizzling, and spells **Pan** across the white walls. Lady **Pan** storms out in her dressing gown, shouting that it is her family name, and throws a Poké Ball. 'Pika!' he squeaks, caught, and she carries him away."],"歧":["diverge","{Chewbacca} stoops {Inside} the {Beach} hut, where the hallway splits like a *branch* round a *stop sign*. He roars which way to go, but only friends understand him, so the crew's paths **diverge**, half left, half right. In a temper he rips up the sign to block one, and it only makes the two routes **diverge** further."],"赐":["to bestow","{Cookie Monster} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, where the queen bee **bestows** a golden *shell* on him with great ceremony. 'Me want cookie!' he roars and eats it in a spray of crumbs. Shocked, she **bestows** a *lizard* in a honey crown instead, and it sprints up his fur while he looks for milk."],"鲍":["abalone","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} clutching a wriggling *parcel*, evidence for the case. He unwraps it: a slippery *fish*, and a shiny **abalone** clamped to the paper. His grappling hook cannot prise it off, so he tries three gadgets, growling, and the **abalone** suckers onto his cowl, right over the nose."],"锅":["wok","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Warehouse} and taps a giant *wok* with his staff, and it ignites with magical fire. He tosses in *gold coins* and casts a spell, and the **wok** bangs out fireworks, spraying pigeons with coins. 'You shall not pass!' he barks at the pigeons, and the **wok** spits one at his pointy hat."],"廊":["corridor","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Hangar} through a *shed* whose walls stretch out like chewing gum into a long **corridor** of ancient traps. A nervous *bridegroom* sprints behind her, late for his wedding. She flips over darts and pulls him past a boulder, but the **corridor** keeps growing, and they reach the bride on her anniversary."],"拆":["to tear down","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Island} hut, whose walls have eaten his kite, and he wants it back. A *helping hand* passes him a *chipped axe* and starts to **tear down** the walls, the lamp post, the door. Seagulls cheer. He **tears down** everything, and, good grief, the kite was behind him all along and blows out to sea."],"灌":["to pour","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, raises his staff and enchants a *heron*, who lifts a watering can in its beak. It begins to **pour** *water drops* on the swans, the lilies and his grey robes. He crankily casts a stopping spell, but the can only **pours** harder, and he floats away with his pipe still lit."],"勉":["to make an effort","{Mario} jumps into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and faces a block too heavy to head-butt, while a *dodger* slips away from work. He eats a mushroom and grows, his *strong arm* bulging, and he **makes an effort**, straining till his cap steams. The block gives up one coin, and the dodger, ashamed, finally **makes an effort** too."],"盲":["blind","{Mario} warps {Inside} the {Hangar} with his red cap pulled down over each *eye*, so he is completely **blind**. He hops along, stomps a *tombstone* he takes for a block and head-butts a plane's wheel looking for coins. 'Wahoo?' he squeaks, **blind** as a mole, walking straight off the edge of the level."],"宰":["to slaughter","{Zorro} swings into the {Basement} of the {Island} hut from a beam under the *roof*, where a cook plans to **slaughter** vegetables for soup. A red *chili* shakes with fear. His rapier flashes, and he appears to **slaughter** a tomato, slashing a Z through it, but it is only soup now, so he bows, laughing, and the chili sets fire to the pot."],"佐":["assistant","{Zorro} leaps into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} and hires an **assistant**: a *standing person* who can use only his *left* hand. He slashes a Z on every crate with the rapier, and the man trails behind, proudly adding a wobbly backward Z. Zorro vanishes, laughing, and his **assistant** salutes nobody with his left hand."],"啥":["what","{Sherlock} peers {Inside} the {Spa} through his magnifying glass at a little *hut*, where a giant *mouth* sits in a hot tub. '**What**?' he demands, for once unable to deduce anything. '**What**?' it shouts back, louder. Watson sighs in the steam, as the smuggest man alive ends up playing the question on his violin."],"胀":["to swell","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and swaps the *moon* for a prank balloon, cackling. A girl with *long hair* blows in the valve, and it starts to **swell**. It **swells** until planes press against the walls, his grin stretches to match, and bang: a shower of playing cards."],"扯":["to pull","{Charlie Brown} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Hut}, where a *stop sign* has trapped his kite string. A *helping hand* starts to **pull** it, and he **pulls** too, harder and harder, until with a POP the sign comes free and flings him through the wall. 'Good grief,' he says, as the string comes back without its kite."],"禧":["joy","{Shrek} retreats to the {Basement} of the {Beach} hut, grumbling, and builds a *small altar* to being left alone, piled with onions. Its candles flare, bells jingle and Donkey bursts in singing, and the ogre's scowl cracks: it is **joy**. He roars a big swampy laugh, and crabs clap along, all overflowing with **joy**."],"辽":["distant","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Cat Café} and spots a *swaddled baby* far off along a *road* painted on a wall, a puzzle from some ancient tomb. She climbs, swings and dodges boulders, yet it stays **distant**, its tiny fist waving. Cats watch her ponytail fly by, and when she arrives the baby is more **distant** than ever."],"抹":["to smear","{Mario} jumps into the {Basement} of the {Fort} and stomps a paint pot flat, splattering his overalls. A *helping hand* grabs a *treetop* like a brush and starts to **smear** green across the walls, so he head-butts a block and collects more paint. 'Wahoo!' Together they **smear** the floor and the ceiling until the fort looks like level one."],"筒":["tube","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} and bites a long *bamboo* stalk into a hollow **tube**, then drops in a *matching cup*. He takes a breath and lets out his jungle yell. FWOOMP! The cup shoots out, skims over the water and knocks a fish flat; the apes all line up for a **tube**."],"棋":["chess","{Chewbacca} ducks {Inside} the {Beach} hut to play **chess** with a talking *tree*, the pieces kept in a *winnowing basket*. The tree takes his knight, and he howls, because he hates to lose. In a temper, he rips off a branch, then loyally fixes it with ship tape, and the **chess** goes on, with nobody daring to win."],"裤":["trousers","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} in only a *shirt*, minutes before curtain, and flails his arms: the whole cast has lost their **trousers**. 'Yaaay!' he screams, hopping over to a *warehouse* on the far side and pulling out a mountain of them. He pulls on fifty pairs to show how it's done, and sinks like a stone in all his **trousers**."],"唉":["sigh","{Casper} hovers in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse, and the sailors have fled again, so he opens his *mouth* and lets out a long, sad **sigh**. A *full stop* falls out at the end and plops into the waves. He turns invisible, and one more **sigh** rolls out of thin air, frightening the ships, which is the opposite of what he wanted."],"朴":["plain","{Pikachu} scurries into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, cheeks sparking, and finds only a *tree* and a *fortune stick* reading 'nothing here'. He fires a Thunderbolt, hoping for something dazzling, but the walls are **plain**, the rice is **plain**, and the socks in the chest are **plain** too. 'Pika,' he mutters, and curls up in a **plain** ball."],"咐":["to instruct","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where a *cashier* with a huge *mouth* starts to **instruct** him: walk to the far end, carry this, do not put it on. He sighs, very weary, and sets off on his bare hairy feet with Sam. The cashier **instructs** him to walk back, and the Ring whispers, so he vanishes."],"孕":["pregnant","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} and finds a camel with a pink *ribbon* round a huge tummy: she is **pregnant**. Yoshi lays eggs all day and thinks he knows everything, so he offers her one. He pats the tummy, a tiny *child* camel kicks his nose from within, and he tries to lay an egg in sympathy, looking very **pregnant** himself."],"誓":["vow","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and deduces from a *snapped stick* that someone has stolen the honey. 'Elementary,' he says, and swears a solemn **vow**, which floats out in a huge *speech bubble*: never to rest till it's solved. Ten thousand bees take the **vow** too, while Watson, stuck to the wall, can only nod."],"喉":["throat","{Homer} snoozes {Inside} the {Boathouse} when a *marquis* in a powdered wig wakes him, gargling. A doughnut rolls past, and Homer opens his *mouth* so wide that the marquis drops it straight down his **throat**. 'Mmm,' he says, but it sticks, and his 'D'oh' comes out as a gurgle. The marquis peers down with a lantern, and Homer's **throat** gurgles like a drain."],"妄":["absurd","{Walter White} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} with his beakers, and a *woman* dances on a *tombstone* with a plane on her head. He measures her, balances the equation, checks it twice through his glasses, and the result is **absurd**. She claims to be queen of the moon, and each new **absurd** claim makes the plane spin faster, while he furiously rewrites his proud textbook."],"拘":["to restrain","{James Bond} saunters in {Front} of the {Museum}, reaching for a statue, and reads a *quotation* on the wall: hands off the art. A *helping hand* shoots out of the plaque to **restrain** him, pinning his tuxedo sleeves. Unruffled, he presses a Q gadget that does nothing but play trumpet, and it **restrains** him tighter as he delivers a one-liner."],"链":["chain","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *convoy* of tiny stone carts trundles past, each linked by a **chain** of *gold coins*. It's an ancient trap. She grabs hold and swings across the pit, ponytail flying, and the **chain** clinks so loudly that boulders start rolling."],"驰":["to speed","{Charlie Brown} climbs {Inside} the {Beehive}, looking for his kite, and a *scorpion* waves its tail at his *horse*, which bolts with him hanging on. They **speed** past the stairs, past the bees, past Snoopy, who waves. Good grief, he never wins: they **speed** on through the forest, and the kite, stuck in a tree, watches him go."],"栏":["railing","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Mansion} and trips an ancient trap, sending a boulder thundering down the grand stairs. She backflips onto a *tree* growing through the hall, where an *orchid* whips out its stem and lashes the branches into a **railing**. The boulder bounces off the **railing**, and Lara strikes a pose on top, ponytail swinging."],"逝":["to pass by","{Sherlock} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} with his magnifying glass, watching a *snapped stick* tick like a clock hand across a tiny *road* of wax. From one crumb of pollen he deduces that a bee will **pass by** at noon, then a decade, then his whole youth. He murmurs \"Elementary\" through a long white beard while Watson and the years **pass by** without stopping."],"窃":["to steal","{Chewbacca} tiptoes through the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, huge and hairy and trying to be silent, because his ship needs one last part. Deep in the *cave* a crossbow bolt makes a neat *cut* in the sleeping yeti's toolbag, and he **steals** the spanner. His joyful roar wakes everyone, and the yeti bellows that a walking carpet came to **steal** his tools."],"艳":["glamorous","{Yoshi} flicks his tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, swallowing a stalk of *wheat* and then the *rainbow* shining in the shower steam. The *rainbow* glows through his belly as he squeaks, strains and lays one dazzling egg, sequinned and far too **glamorous** for a bathtub. The butler faints, and the egg poses on a towel, the most **glamorous** thing Yoshi has ever laid."],"臭":["smelly","{Charlie Brown} opens the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} to fly his kite indoors, the one place no tree can eat it. A green cloud of *stink* seizes the string and drags him through a week-old fish stew. He comes out so **smelly** that Snoopy packs a bag, and even the kite-eating tree spits out his **smelly** kite."],"纤":["fine","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, roaring at a *thousand ants* who are stealing his onion lunch. They haul each layer along a *silk thread* so **fine** that Donkey walks straight through it without pausing his chatter. Grumbling, Shrek peels his last layer until it is just as **fine**, and the ants wave it over their heads like a flag."],"玑":["irregular pearl","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Beach} and plays cards with a *king* across a *small table*. The *king* stakes an **irregular pearl**, lumpy as a potato, which is really a gadget from Q that does one absurd thing: it sprouts a propeller. The **irregular pearl** wobbles crookedly out to sea, the *small table* scuttling after it, and Bond calls that a fair bluff."],"棵":["counter for trees","{Kermit} flails his arms in {Front} of the {Hut}, stage-managing a musical where every *tree* must hop on cue. His banjo is the **counter for trees**: one twang, one *tree*, and a panicked \"Yaaay!\" for each. When he loses count, the cast hurls *fruit* at him, so he ducks, hops back and starts the **counter for trees** again."],"趁":["to take advantage of","{Charlie Brown} hides in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} until Lucy looks away, then decides to **take advantage of** his one lucky moment. A *runner* with *thick hair* bolts past, and Charlie grabs the hair like a kite string and flies behind him over the rides. Then a tree eats them both, and Snoopy, on the ground, is quick to **take advantage of** it by finishing Charlie's candy floss."],"匠":["craftsman","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium}, where Q's oldest **craftsman** lifts a gadget from an *open crate*. It is an *axe* that does one absurd thing: it carves tiny perfect chairs. Bond gives it one bored swing, and a whole wooden grandstand of them tumbles out, while the old **craftsman** weeps with pride and Bond brushes sawdust off his tuxedo."],"盈":["filled","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and swallows a *brimming cup* in one long slurp. He lays it as an egg on a *dish*, and the egg starts pouring tea from a crack and will not stop. The *dish* is **filled**, then the ring is **filled** to the ropes, and the boxers paddle around Yoshi, who bobs along squeaking his own name."],"翁":["old man","{Walter White} sets out his beakers in {Front} of the {Jungle} and pours a school experiment on ageing, proud of every decimal place. One drop lands on a passing *grandpa*, whose beard races to his knees until he is the oldest **old man** on Earth. Walter adjusts his glasses and takes notes, while the **old man** raps on the beaker, wheezing that he is the one who knocks."],"愁":["to worry","{Charlie Brown} sits gloomily {Inside} the {Boathouse}, because *autumn* has arrived, and *autumn* means Lucy and the football. Every falling leaf makes his *heart* thump under his zigzag shirt. He begins to **worry** about the kick, the sky, the boats and the leaves, and he goes on to **worry** so hard that the boats start to sink out of sympathy."],"瞬":["blink","{Sherlock} leans in the {Bathroom} of the {Casino}, one huge *eye* behind his magnifying glass, watching a card cheat's sleeve. In one *eyeblink* the ace has moved, yet he can solve it all from a single crumb if only he does not **blink**. Watson sneezes, Sherlock has to **blink**, and the cheat, the cards and his pipe are gone."],"婴":["infant","{Yoshi} waddles out in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and lays an enormous spotted egg. It cracks, and out crawls a *baby* in red gloves, an **infant** who decides Yoshi is its mother. Each time the **infant** crawls under the ropes, Yoshi's long sticky tongue gently reels it back, and each time it punches the tongue and giggles."],"孝":["filial piety","{Shrek} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, wanting only to be left alone, but a *dutiful son* marches in with his old father on his back and starts washing the old man's feet in the sink. Shrek peels his onion, layer after layer, and finds **filial piety** at its heart. Grumbling, he goes off to phone his ogre dad, while Donkey will not shut up about **filial piety**."],"颈":["neck","{James Bond} stands unruffled in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} when Q hands him a book with one loose *page*. It leaps out and folds round his **neck** as a paper bow tie, a gadget that does one absurd thing: it stretches. His **neck** rises like a giraffe's until his head pokes through the ring, and from up there he introduces himself to the referee."],"倘":["if","{Tarzan} swings on a vine through the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, baffled by an *attic* dangling from the ceiling, where a *standing person* dithers at the hatch. The apes taught him only one word of human talk, and he bellows it with his jungle yell. **If** you jump, Tarzan catch; **if** you stay, the *attic* shakes until you do."],"浙":["Zhejiang","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and offers a squirting flower that sprays so many *water drops* he floats out to sea. Grinning, he paddles with a *snapped stick* until green tea hills rise up: **Zhejiang**. The tea pickers lean in to sniff his flower, get soaked, and squirt him back with their teapots, shouting that **Zhejiang** always returns a prank."],"谅":["to excuse","{Lara Croft} climbs up through the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} into a buried *palace*, snatches a relic and sets a boulder rolling through the stone queen's cake. A *small speech bubble* floats from the statue's lips, saying the queen will **excuse** her. Lara backflips, flattens a second cake, and the bubble sighs that it will **excuse** her once more before the spikes come out."],"蔽":["to shield","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} just as a sandstorm screams in. A gadget from his utility belt weaves *grass* and *rags* into an emergency cape, which he throws up to **shield** Alfred's sandwiches while sand pings off it like hail. The *rags* flap and the *grass* holds, and Batman growls that he will **shield** the smallest crab in the city too."],"畅":["smooth","{Charlie Brown} lines up the football in the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, propped on a *skewer* because Lucy cannot be trusted. *Sun rays* pour through a window and melt a block of butter across the tiles, leaving the floor perfectly **smooth**. His run-up is **smooth** for once in his life, so he glides straight past the ball and out among the planes, sighing \"Good grief.\""],"赠":["to present","{Zorro} swings on a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle}, rapier flashing, and slashes a Z into a glittering *shell*. He lifts it from a bamboo *steamer* with a dashing bow to **present** it to a startled gorilla. The *steamer* puffs a cloud, Zorro vanishes laughing, and the gorilla wakes next morning to find him waiting to **present** a second one."],"妮":["girl","{Naruto} skids to a halt in {Front} of the {Beach}, where a *woman* and a *nun* are arguing over who minds a little **girl**. He yells that he will never give up on babysitting and makes shadow clones by the dozen, all in orange, all holding ramen. The **girl** defeats every clone with a sand bucket while the *woman* and the *nun* cheer."],"莎":["katydid","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Spa} with his magnifying glass as the *grass* trembles and the warm *sand* shifts. From one tiny footprint he deduces the culprit: green, long-legged and musical. He tries a tune on his violin, and a **katydid** springs out and plays it back better. Smugly he declares the case closed, while the **katydid** kicks sand on Watson."],"尉":["officer","{Walter White} knocks at the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} in his black hat, and a brass-buttoned *officer* comes to inspect his school experiment. Proudly, Walter drops one precise pellet into a beaker, and foam full of brass buttons pours into the water. Each fish that touches it snaps to attention, until every fish is an **officer** saluting, and the first **officer** salutes them back."],"冻":["to freeze","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} and raises one glove, using the Force to drag in a wind from the *east*. It howls, *icicles* shoot from his helmet, and the waves **freeze** in mid-curl. He Force-chokes a dripping tap until it starts to **freeze** as well, then booms his disapproval at the flamingos."],"跪":["to kneel","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} exactly when he means to, slams his staff down and thunders \"You shall not pass!\" at a *teetering man* in the queue. A spell conjures a *kicking foot* that taps the man behind the knees, and he has to **kneel**. Patients, nurses and the receptionist all **kneel** in a row as the wizard lights his pipe."],"闯":["to charge","{Charlie Brown} climbs on a *horse* in the {Basement} by the {Swamp}, determined that just once he will win. They **charge** at the locked *gate*, frogs scattering, but at the last second Lucy whisks the *gate* away like a football. The *horse* stops dead, Charlie alone keeps trying to **charge**, flying through empty air into the mud, and he sighs \"Good grief.\""],"葡":["grape, Portugal","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Pool}, where *grass* grows on every step and a slow *crawler* drags a giant **grape** flying the flag of **Portugal**. Sparks fizz in his cheeks and a Thunderbolt hits, so the **grape** bursts purple across the water. The *crawler* squeaks with fury and turns round for the long crawl home to **Portugal**, while Pikachu licks his paw."],"後":["behind","{Homer} sneaks a doughnut in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and hears *footsteps* **behind** him. He spins around with a \"D'oh!\" but sees nobody, so he hides the doughnut **behind** his back. The *footsteps* pad closer, there is a soft munch, and when he brings his hand back round the doughnut has one neat bite missing."],"厨":["kitchen","{Charlie Brown} tries to cook Snoopy's supper {Inside} the {Pool}, in a **kitchen** carved into a *cliff*. The *cliff* gives a shrug and drops a boulder on his stove, sending every pot into the deep end. Swimmers wave for lunch and Snoopy looks on from his doghouse, as Charlie mutters \"Good grief\" and the whole **kitchen** slides slowly into the water."],"鸭":["duck","{Yoshi} flicks his tongue in {Front} of the {Spa} and swallows a *bird* clanking in *armour*. He strains and lays a steel-plated egg, which rattles, quacks and bursts open. Out waddles a **duck** knight, visor up, honking a battle cry and charging straight at the hot tub, and Yoshi flutter-jumps after the brave **duck** just in time to see the belly flop."],"颠":["top","{Darth Vader} raises one glove in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and lifts himself with the Force to the very **top** of the flagpole. There he settles into a *headstand*, cape flopping over his helmet, breathing slowly and loudly as coins rain from his pockets. From the **top** he booms his disapproval at the whole city, upside down."],"遮":["to cover up","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Hut} after his exploding-pie prank blasts a whole *kitchen* out onto the *road*. An inspector is coming, so he deals out giant trick playing cards to **cover up** the mess, wallpapering the *road* and hiding every pot. The inspector lifts one card and gets squirted, and the Joker grins and moves to **cover up** the inspector too."],"谊":["friendship","{Yoshi} pops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and finds a *cozy room* full of lonely crabs. A *small speech bubble* floats over each crab, asking for a friend. His tongue slurps up every bubble, and he lays one huge warm egg of **friendship** for them all to sit on. The sea rolls in, but the **friendship** floats with everyone aboard."],"圳":["ditch","The {Joker} tiptoes into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} with a shovel and a grin, digs a **ditch** through the *soil* and hides it under trick playing cards. A little *river* gushes in. Visitors step on the cards and whoosh away, shrieking with joy, and he cackles so hard he topples into the **ditch** himself, his squirting flower still going."],"吁":["to implore","{Yoshi} gets a hungry look in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, beside a *coat stand* with a wailing *mouth*. The *mouth* begins to **implore** him not to swallow it as his long tongue unrolls across the tiles. He gulps it down anyway and lays it as a spotted egg, and from within the shell it goes on trying to **implore** him, muffled."],"仑":["to arrange","{Lara Croft} somersaults {Inside} the {Casino} and finds an ancient puzzle door behind the roulette wheel. To stop the boulder overhead she must **arrange** the chips in the right order, so she flips across the tables building one *neat stack*. The *neat stack* clicks into its slot, the door grinds open, and out of sheer habit she goes on to **arrange** the dealer's eyebrows."],"辟":["to open up","{Pikachu} bursts from his Poké Ball in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} beside a sweating *pioneer* whose machete cannot dent the wall of jungle. Cheeks crackling, he squeals \"Pika!\" and a Thunderbolt blasts the vines aside to **open up** a trail. The *pioneer* marches on through the smoke, and Pikachu zaps on ahead until he has managed to **open up** the whole island."],"瘤":["tumor","{Lara Croft} rappels {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} to raid an ancient *sickbed* said to hide a relic. Under the pillow she finds a pharaoh's stone **tumor**, kept as a *keepsake* in a jar with a plaque. The moment she lifts the **tumor**, a boulder rolls, the *sickbed* shoots off on hidden wheels, and Lara rides it past the startled backpackers."],"嫂":["sister-in-law","{Sailor Moon} begins her long sparkly transformation in the {Basement} of the {Tower} when a *woman* bursts in to shout that the table is not set: her **sister-in-law**. An *elder* joins the nagging. Sailor Moon cries loudly, gives a speech about justice and dumplings, and throws her tiara, which the **sister-in-law** catches and wears to serve the soup while Luna sighs."],"陀":["slope","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Warehouse} and lands, baffled, on a floor that has tilted into a grassy *hillside*. He hisses a greeting to a passing *serpent*, who offers him a ride, so he grabs its tail and they rocket down the **slope** like a sled. The *serpent* calls the turns, and at the foot of the **slope** they plough into a forklift, a thing Tarzan greets as a rude elephant."],"框":["frame","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, where a huge *picture frame* hangs nailed to a *tree* for tonight's show. He flails at the curtain, shrieks \"Yaaay!\" and leaps, landing stuck in the **frame** with his legs dangling. The *tree* sways, the crowd applauds this lifelike portrait of panic, and from his **frame** Kermit sighs that it is not easy being green."],"谭":["surname Tan","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Mansion} on a chandelier, baffled by all the guests' name tags. A *small speech bubble* pops up over each guest, announcing \"Tan!\", so he decides it must be how people say hello. He beats his chest and yells it back, and everyone of the **surname Tan** rushes to hug him, until the apes outside apply for the **surname Tan** too."],"亨":["prosperous","{Homer} naps in {Front} of the {Jungle} against a golden *shrine hall*, with a dim scheme: leave one doughnut as an offering and collect two. The *shrine hall* rumbles and coughs out doughnuts by the cartload, and he is suddenly **prosperous**. \"Mmm, **prosperous**,\" he drools, stretching out on the pile, until monkeys open a bank and foreclose on him. \"D'oh!\""],"钦":["to respect","{Chewbacca} roars in a temper in {Front} of the {Inn} because a guest's huge *yawn* has blown away his *gold coins*. The guest looks up at him and simply yawns again, a thing nobody dares do to a furious Wookiee. Chewbacca falls silent, lays his bandolier at the guest's feet and growls deeply, in words only friends understand, that he must **respect** this. The whole inn learns to **respect** him too."],"庸":["ordinary","{Yoshi} swallows a plain wooden *shed* in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, hoping to lay some treasure. He flutter-jumps, squeaks and strains, and the egg that drops out is completely **ordinary**. It cracks open, and the *shed* unfolds itself again with one chair, one broom and one sock. Tourists applaud politely and take photos of the most **ordinary** miracle they have ever seen."],"歉":["to apologize","{Chewbacca} loses his temper in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and rips the sink off the wall, flattening *two sheaves* of wheat drying there. His next furious roar shrinks into a sheepish *yawn*, so he fixes the sink and growls long and low to **apologize**. The banker hears only terrifying noises and hastily begins to **apologize** as well."],"芝":["zoysia grass","The {Joker} grins in {Front} of the {Beehive} and hides beside a *winding path*, lying flat in the *grass*. It is **zoysia grass**, so soft that passers-by lie down for a nap, and his green hair makes perfect camouflage. When the sleepers begin to snore, he pops up cackling from the **zoysia grass** and soaks each one with his squirting flower."],"吼":["to roar","{Homer} drops his doughnut down a dark *hole* in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, cries \"D'oh!\" and presses his *mouth* to the opening. He lets out a mighty **roar** demanding it back, and from far below something answers with an even bigger **roar**. Boats rattle, oars leap off the walls, and the doughnut flies up again, neatly half eaten."],"甫":["just","{Frodo} trudges on bare hairy feet into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, weary from a very long walk, and sinks down on a *seedbed*. **Just** as he sits, sprouts shove up between his toes. He sighs to Sam that he has **just** got here, but the *seedbed* heaves up a beanstalk that carries him off on another journey."],"衫":["garment","{Sherlock} studies a washing line in {Front} of the {Mansion} through his magnifying glass, where one *shirt* has sprouted *bristles* like a hedgehog. From a single thread he deduces that this **garment** went for a walk on Tuesday with a hedgehog. The *bristles* twitch in agreement, and he smugly says \"Elementary\" as Watson tries on the **garment** and yelps."],"摊":["to spread out","{Tarzan} drops in {Front} of the {Mansion}, opens a *helping hand* and speaks softly in bird to a *caught bird*. Freed and grateful, it starts to **spread out** its wings, wider and wider, until they cover the lawn like a picnic cloth. Baffled by the butler's napkins, Tarzan gives his jungle yell, and all his animal friends arrive to **spread out** on the feathers for lunch."],"宴":["banquet","{Yoshi} wanders into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} to find a **banquet** laid out beneath a glass *roof*, with a *sunbathing woman* stretched between the turkeys. His tongue shoots out and swallows every dish, and he lays a hundred eggs where the food stood. The *sunbathing woman* lifts her sunglasses, sniffs and asks who ordered an all-egg **banquet**."],"嘱":["instruct","The {Joker} grins in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and nails up a giant wind-up *mouth* as a prank. It starts to **instruct** his *kinfolk* to do silly things: Grandma must wear the flower, Uncle must hop, the cousins must quack. They all obey, and he cackles until it turns round to **instruct** him to sit on a whoopee cushion."],"衷":["inner feelings","The {Joker} flings open a purple *robe* in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, revealing a painted *bullseye* over his heart. He deals trick cards at it, and each card that sticks sings out one of his **inner feelings**: nobody laughs, nobody calls, he only wanted a friend. His huge grin wobbles, so he squirts his flower and cackles to drown out those **inner feelings**."],"娇":["pampered","{James Bond} sits in {Front} of the {Cat Café} as a *woman* refuses to touch the ground, tottering only on golden *stilts*. Q's latest cufflink does one absurd thing, peeling grapes at thirty yards, so he fires it and feeds her from across the street. She is the most **pampered** guest alive, the *stilts* stalk off in a huff when one grape is warm, and Bond remarks that even his drink is less **pampered**."],"陕":["Shaanxi","{Sherlock} lifts one crumb of yellow earth with *tongs* in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and peers at it through his magnifying glass. From that crumb he deduces **Shaanxi**, and says \"Elementary.\" The *tongs* give a tug, and a whole *hillside* of yellow loess slides through the wall, with clay soldiers marching out of it to stamp **Shaanxi** on Watson's forehead."],"矩":["rule","{James Bond} stands in the {Basement} of the {Museum} and fires Q's newest wristwatch, which launches an *arrow* carrying a tiny *set square*. It does one absurd thing, enforcing a single **rule**: everything must stand at right angles. Statues snap upright, frames straighten and the *set square* corrects a crooked mummy, and Bond adjusts his bow tie and says a **rule** is a **rule**."],"浦":["river bank","{Pikachu} tumbles out of his Poké Ball in the {Basement} of the {Pool} onto a muddy **river bank** where the tiles should be. A *cattail* tickles his nose, his cheeks spark, and with a sneeze of \"Pika!\" a Thunderbolt lights every *cattail* like a candle. Otters scold him, and a passing trainer catches him all over again on the **river bank**."],"讶":["astonished","{Yoshi} flicks his tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and swallows the *fang* of a sleeping vampire, whose *small speech bubble* asks who took his tooth. Yoshi lays it as an egg, and out hatches a tiny vampire with Yoshi's green nose. Yoshi is **astonished**, and the vampire is more **astonished** still, and the two of them gape at the baby through the steam."],"耸":["to raise up","{Sailor Moon} twirls her moon wand in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, and a sparkly beam seizes a *follower* by the *ear*. She needs to **raise up** this poor fellow so that he can hear her speech on justice, and his *ear* stretches like rubber toward the ceiling. Then she trips over Luna, cries loudly, and the wand goes on to **raise up** the entire lagoon floor."],"裸":["naked","{Lara Croft} prises open an ancient crate in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} and sets off a trap: tiny darts whisk the *shirt* off every piece of *fruit*. Peeled bananas and oranges scatter across the floor, totally **naked** and shrieking. A boulder comes rolling after them, and Lara flips over the **naked** crowd, offering towels as she goes."],"碧":["bluish green","{Batman} swoops into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and scans a lump of glowing *amber* with a gadget from his belt. It drips onto a mossy *stone*, which hums, and every wave in the bay turns **bluish green**. His batarang comes back the same **bluish green**, and he broods over the clue, growling at his stained cape."],"摧":["to destroy","{Cookie Monster} spots a *lofty peak* in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, and his googly eyes decide it is a giant cookie. Roaring \"Me want cookie!\", he reaches out a *helping hand* and begins to **destroy** it in an avalanche of crumbs. He eats the chairs, the clock and the magazines next, announcing happily that he will **destroy** waiting forever."],"薪":["salary","{Shrek} grumbles in {Front} of the {Inn} as the innkeeper pays his **salary** in bundles of *firewood* tied with *grass*. He wanted onions, and his roar rattles the windows, so the innkeeper nervously adds more until the pile is taller than the lamp post. Donkey chews through the *grass* while lecturing on money, and Shrek's whole **salary** comes crashing down on his head."],"淋":["to sprinkle","{Lara Croft} somersaults {Inside} the {Inn} into a tiny indoor *grove* of lemon trees guarding a relic. A carved puzzle tells her to **sprinkle** each trunk in order, so she hangs by one hand and tips an old urn, and *water drops* patter down until a secret door clicks open. The innkeeper puts up an umbrella, so she stops to **sprinkle** his slippers, just for luck."],"耻":["shame","{Charlie Brown} misses the football yet again in the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, with the entire hive watching. One bee holds up a tiny *stop sign*, and another buzzes the score into his *ear*. He glows red with **shame** down to his zigzag shirt, and even Snoopy pretends not to know him, leaving Charlie sighing \"Good grief\" in his deep **shame**."],"胶":["glue","{James Bond} sits with *crossed legs* in {Front} of the {Cat Café}, testing Q's newest pen under the *moon*. It does one absurd thing, squirting **glue**, and now his *crossed legs* are stuck together for good. When the *moon* dips down for a closer look it sticks to the lamp post, and Bond hops off unruffled, remarking how **glue** to see him it was."],"屠":["butcher","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Pool}, baffled by a *busy man* in an apron, a **butcher**, who is sharpening knives over a *lying man* asleep on the steps. Raised by apes, Tarzan takes this for a hunt and lets out his jungle yell. The *lying man* wakes and bolts on the back of an elephant, and the sulky **butcher** slices a pool noodle instead."],"鹅":["goose","{Casper} floats through the wall {Inside} the {Hut}, hoping to befriend a *spearman* who stands guarding a white *bird*. He only says hello, but the *spearman* screams and runs off. The *bird* is a **goose**, afraid of nothing, and she honks and chases Casper through every wall. He turns invisible, and the **goose** bites the empty air exactly where he is."],"饥":["starving","{James Bond} sits in {Front} of the {Beach} in his tuxedo at a *small table*, absolutely **starving**, and a waiter sets down one *side dish*: a single pea. Q's fork does one absurd thing, launching whatever it touches, so the pea soars off and a seagull takes it. Still **starving**, he raises his empty glass and orders it shaken, not stirred."],"盼":["to long for","{Pikachu} peeks out of his Poké Ball in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, one *eye* fixed on a *cut cake* on the windowsill. He begins to **long for** it so hard that his cheeks spark, and the sparks leap across the room and toast the *cut cake* black. Pulled back into the ball, he goes on to **long for** it through the crack, whispering \"Pika.\""],"脖":["neck","{Batman} crouches {Inside} the {Fort} as a *comet* streaks past the *moon*, and the detective in him must see where it lands. He clicks a gadget on his belt, a telescoping collar, and his **neck** shoots up the staircase like a grappling line. Thirty feet up, the *moon* ducks in fright, and Batman growls his name from the far end of his **neck**."],"虹":["rainbow","{Homer} wakes {Inside} the {Lagoon} from a nap to see a *bug* at a tiny *workbench*, hammering stripes together to build a **rainbow**. He drools \"Mmm, sprinkles\" and decides it must be icing for some enormous doughnut. One long lick later the whole **rainbow** collapses on his head, his tongue is striped, the *workbench* is flat, and he wails \"D'oh!\""],"翠":["emerald green","{Cookie Monster} barges into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and spots a chess *pawn* wearing a hat of *feathers* on a plate. Yelling \"Me want cookie!\", he chomps it down in a spray of crumbs, and his blue fur flashes **emerald green**. The *feathers* tickle his throat, he burps, and every patient and magazine turns **emerald green** as well."],"崩":["to collapse","{Batman} glides in {Front} of the {Jungle} as an *avalanche* thunders down the mountainside. He hurls batarangs and fires his grappling hook to pin the slope in place, but each line snaps and everything begins to **collapse**. Trees and monkeys tumble past, and the whole cliff goes on to **collapse** in a neat ring around him, leaving Batman standing in the dust, brooding."],"账":["account","The {Joker} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and prises open a giant *shell*, where a bank clerk sits with *long hair* scribbling sums on the walls by itself. The clerk says his **account** is overdrawn, so he pays with a trick playing card that squirts ink all over the numbers. Cackling, he declares his **account** settled as the *shell* snaps shut on his green hair."],"萍":["duckweed","{Pikachu} leaps {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, now flooded, where *grass* grabs his ankles and *pond weed* wraps his tail. Little round specks of **duckweed** stick to his yellow fur until he is covered in green polka dots. Furious, he yells \"Pika!\" and fires a Thunderbolt into the water, and every speck of **duckweed** jumps off, then gently floats back."],"逢":["to meet by chance","{Frodo} plods barefoot {Inside} the {Jungle}, weary from another very long walk, and slips on the Ring to hide from the monkeys. Invisible, he walks smack into Sam: a *chance meeting*, thousands of miles from home. They **meet by chance** beside a banana tree, share a potato and part, and a mile further on they **meet by chance** all over again."],"赚":["to earn","The {Joker} grins in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} and sells a swan *two sheaves* of wheat for one gleaming *shell*. The sheaves explode into confetti, and the swans laugh so hard that they pay to see it again. Soon he begins to **earn** a whole sack of shells from his trick, cackling that nobody has ever had so much fun helping him **earn**."],"撑":["to prop up","{Charlie Brown} watches a kite-eating *palm* in {Front} of the {Jungle} sag under the weight of all his kites. Being kind, he lends a *helping hand*, using his shoulder to **prop up** the trunk. It rewards him by dropping a coconut on his head. \"Good grief,\" he sighs, and he goes on trying to **prop up** the tree while Snoopy naps on top."],"翔":["to soar","{Shrek} roars {Inside} the {Stadium} because he wants the crowd gone, and the blast bursts every pillow in the stands. *Feathers* settle on a *sheep*, which flaps once, baas and starts to **soar** over the scoreboard. Donkey, who will not shut up, demands wings as well. When both of them **soar** off into the clouds, Shrek finally gets his moment of silence."],"倡":["to initiate","{Charlie Brown} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, tired of losing and ready to **initiate** a baseball league of his own. A *standing person* raises a flag for him under a blazing *double sun*, but nobody else turns up. Dazzled by the glare, he tries to **initiate** the first pitch, and the ball comes back and knocks his cap across the runway. \"Good grief.\""],"绵":["continuous","{Mario} head-butts a block {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, and instead of a coin out comes a *silk thread*. Shouting \"Wahoo!\", he hits it again and a sheet of *silk cloth* follows, then a **continuous** ribbon that never stops. It wraps the bankers and the vault and pours down a warp pipe, and however hard he stomps on it, the flow stays **continuous**."],"猴":["monkey","{Homer} snores {Inside} the {Boathouse} with a doughnut on his belly until a *prowling dog* sniffs up to a velvet-robed *marquis*. His dim scheme is to bow low and beg for more doughnuts, but the *marquis* pulls off his wig and is a **monkey**. The **monkey** snatches the doughnut and rides away on the dog, leaving Homer wailing \"D'oh!\""],"枯":["withered","{Kermit} flails his arms in {Front} of the {Pool} because the star of tonight's show, an *antique* *tree*, has gone **withered** one minute before curtain. Shrieking \"Yaaay!\", he plays his banjo at it to cheer it up, but each twang drops one more crackly leaf. He tells the **withered** branches it is not easy being green, and they creak and take a bow."],"巫":["wizard","{Walter White} sets up beakers on a *workbench* in {Front} of the {Pool} to prove there is no magic, only chemistry. His *follower* spills one flask, and in a puff of purple smoke he sprouts a pointy hat: he is a **wizard**! Walter adjusts his glasses, recalculates in a rage and insists there is no such thing as a **wizard**, while a wand turns his goatee blue."],"昭":["bright","The {Joker} wheels a giant *spotlight* in {Front} of the {Tower} and swings it across the night, cackling. The beam is so **bright** that owls put on sunglasses and the moon files a complaint. Then he aims it at his own huge grin, and his teeth bounce it back twice as **bright**, so that the whole town gets a tan at midnight."],"怔":["startled","The {Joker} crouches in {Front} of the {Jungle} with a jack-in-the-box, waiting for a *standing heart* jogging on tiny legs toward the *goal line*. He springs out cackling, and the heart stops dead, utterly **startled**. Then it pulls out a squirting flower of its own and soaks him, and for the first time ever the Joker is **startled**, his grin stuck in place."],"渊":["deep pool","{Yoshi} slurps up *water drops* one by one in {Front} of the {Mint} and lays a wobbling egg over the *abyss* beneath the building. It falls without a sound, then cracks far below, and all the water floods out into a **deep pool** that swallows coins, chairs and a printing press. Yoshi flutter-jumps over it, but his long tongue cannot reach the bottom of the **deep pool**."],"凑":["to gather together","{Cookie Monster} opens the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and sees *icicles* hanging from every beam like frosted biscuits. Bellowing \"Me want cookie!\", he crunches them all in a spray of ice crumbs, and the air turns so cold that the boatmen and ducks **gather together** round his blue fur. Shivering with brain freeze, he says that if they **gather together**, they must bring cookies."],"溪":["creek","{Shrek} lies in the mud in {Front} of the {Beach}, wanting peace, when a *page boy* arrives to read a proclamation. One roar makes him drop his silver tray of *water drops*, which trickle away to form a tiny babbling **creek** through the onion patch. Shrek almost smiles, until Donkey wades in, talking nonstop about how he discovered the **creek**."],"蠢":["stupid","{Charlie Brown} bets his kite in the {Basement} of the {Casino} on two *worms* racing through a flowerpot in *springtime*. The *worms* curl up for a nap, and Lucy tells him this is **stupid**, so he bets his shoes as well. Blossoms of *springtime* rain on his head as he loses it all, and he sighs that it was **stupid**, while Snoopy collects the winnings."],"禅":["Zen","{Charlie Brown} sits {Inside} the {Mansion} before a *small altar*, holding a tennis *racket* perfectly still, because he cannot lose if he never plays. A football rolls up and is pulled away, and he does not stir. This is **Zen**: no kick, no tumble, no \"Good grief.\" Then the *racket* strings snap, the altar tips onto his foot, and so ends his **Zen**."],"阐":["to explain","{Charlie Brown} stands at a locked *gate* in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, wielding a tennis *racket* as a pointer to **explain** to Snoopy why he never wins. He covers kites, footballs and the little red-haired girl while Snoopy falls asleep. He starts to **explain** louder, the *racket* catches the latch, and the *gate* swings back and flattens him. \"Good grief.\""],"旺":["flourishing","{Walter White} measures out a plant food with perfect precision in the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, under a little *sun* he has built from test tubes. A *king* pours it on his potted fern, and shoots burst through the concrete until the whole place is **flourishing**. Planes sprout leaves, and Walter lectures proudly on photosynthesis as even his goatee starts **flourishing** with ferns."],"寓":["to reside","{Yoshi} unrolls his tongue in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and swallows a *monkey* swinging beneath the glass *roof*. He lays it as a spotted egg, and the *monkey* decides to **reside** in the shell, hanging out a tiny washing line and a doormat. Now Yoshi carries the egg everywhere, while the tenant continues to **reside** there and complains about the draught."],"藤":["rattan","{Tarzan} yells and swings {Inside} the {Jungle} on a *rattan* stem, but tall *grass* tangles his feet and tips him into a furniture shop. Baffled by civilisation, he finds his favourite vines woven into a **rattan** chair. He sniffs it, asks a passing monkey what it is, then grabs the armrest and swings off through the trees with a whole **rattan** sofa."],"匪":["bandit","{Frodo} slips on the Ring in the {Basement} of the {Lake} as an *open crate* bursts and a **bandit** swoops out on *spread wings* of stolen bedsheets, grabbing for his pockets. Now invisible, he tiptoes away on bare hairy feet, while the Ring whispers to him to stay hidden forever. The **bandit** swipes at empty air and flaps helplessly into the water, and Sam fishes him out."],"伞":["umbrella","{Sailor Moon} twirls her moon wand in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, and a long sparkly transformation leaves her holding a black **umbrella**. She opens it, and a tiny *person* drops out, then twenty more, each making a little speech about justice. She bursts into loud tears at this indoor drizzle, and when she snaps the **umbrella** shut they all land on her head, to Luna's disgust."],"碑":["monument","{Batman} broods in {Front} of the {Lake}, hurling batarangs at a huge *stone* until it becomes a **monument** of himself. He pulls a tiny *fan* from his utility belt, and it blasts away the dust until the stone cape flutters. He growls that the city needs a **monument**, then stands glowering beside it while fishermen row past, unable to tell which one is real."],"挪":["to shift","{Naruto} bursts {Inside} the {Warehouse}, makes shadow clones by the dozen and sets about trying to **shift** one crate. A *pointing finger* on the wall yells that it must go that way, so every clone lends a *helping hand*. They never give up: they **shift** the crate, then a forklift, then the entire warehouse an inch to the left, and the finger says it meant the other way."],"琼":["fine jade","{Chewbacca} is fixing the lights {Inside} the {Youth Club} when a *king* begs him to repair a tiny *palace* carved from **fine jade**. Temper flaring, he rips off one of its towers, and it rings like a bell, without a chip. He whacks it with his spanner and roars at it, but **fine jade** never shatters, so he hugs the *king* and gives up."],"脂":["fat","The {Joker} unrolls a fake *edict scroll* in {Front} of the {Beehive}, cackling by the light of the *moon*. It orders all bees to hand in their **fat** by dawn, so they queue up in panic carrying little lumps of **fat** made of wax. The *moon* covers its mouth to hide a laugh, and he stamps each bee's belly with a squirting flower."],"谎":["lie","{Homer} swears in the {Basement} by the {Swamp} that he never touched the doughnut, crumbs all over his chin, and a *small speech bubble* floats out with the **lie**. It drifts off to a grey *wasteland*, where every **lie** he has ever told hangs bobbing. \"D'oh!\" he yells, as the *wasteland* burps the whole lot back at him."],"慨":["impassioned","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Basement} of the {Island} as tonight's star, a *standing heart*, leaps onto a *finished meal* and delivers an **impassioned** speech about pudding. Shrieking \"Yaaay!\", Kermit grabs his banjo and strums along, tears streaming, then hops up on the table. His own encore is even more **impassioned**, and the plates of the *finished meal* rattle with applause."],"菩":["bodhisattva","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Pool} through tall *grass* and meets a serene **bodhisattva** sitting on the diving board, untroubled by a *spitting mouth* that hurls peanuts. Cheeks crackling, Pikachu fires a Thunderbolt to help, and the **bodhisattva** just catches the lightning and turns it into a lotus. Fizzled out, Pikachu climbs quietly back into his Poké Ball, deeply humbled."],"萄":["grape","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Tower} on a vine climbing out of a *pottery* jar, where *grass* sprouts round the rim. He yells, the vine shakes, and down falls one fat purple **grape**. Baffled, he sniffs it, then asks it politely in ape whether it is an animal. Offended, the **grape** rolls away down all the stairs, with Tarzan swinging after it."],"狮":["lion","{Sherlock} examines a paw print in {Front} of the {Beehive} and smugly deduces a *prowling dog*, calling it elementary. A strict *teacher* marches up, tells him to look again and shakes a great mane onto the animal, and it opens its jaws and roars: it is a **lion**. Watson faints, Sherlock insists the clues said dog, and the **lion** eats his deerstalker."],"掘":["to excavate","{James Bond} glides {Inside} the {Ice Rink} in his tuxedo and clicks a cufflink from Q, and a mechanical *helping hand* shoots out to **excavate** the ice. A *crouching man* scoops the shavings aside as a frozen mammoth appears, wearing skates. They **excavate** further and uncover a penguin, who complains of being woken early, and Bond offers him a drink, shaken."],"抄":["to copy","{Charlie Brown} sits a spelling test in {Front} of the {Tower} and sends a sneaky *helping hand* to **copy** from the next desk. It nips off a *pinch* of his neighbour's answer sheet and carries it home. For once he feels clever, until he sees he has chosen to **copy** Snoopy, who has written nothing but woof. \"Good grief.\""],"岭":["mountain range","{Lara Croft} climbs in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, ponytail flying, up a *mountain* that has burst through the floor. At the peak a stone *herald* blares a trumpet, which trips a trap, and more peaks spring up in a row: a whole **mountain range**. Boulders roll as she leaps from summit to summit and snatches the relic at the far end of the **mountain range**."],"晕":["dizzy","{Yoshi} swallows an entire *army* in {Front} of the {Dunes}, and the soldiers go on marching round and round in his belly under the hot *sun*. His eyes start to spin and he feels **dizzy**, so he lays them all as one huge wobbling egg. It cracks and the soldiers stagger out, equally **dizzy**, and collapse on top of him."],"逮":["catch","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Basement} of the {Island} as a *servant* in slippers flees down a winding *road* with his favourite cape. One raised glove uses the Force to **catch** him in mid-stride, legs still pedalling in the air. Vader booms with disapproval that this was too easy to **catch**, lowers him, and the *servant* immediately runs off again.","dǎi"],"砍":["to chop","{Kermit} panics in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} because a prop *stone* will not stop its huge *yawn* and is ruining the show. Flailing, he grabs a stage axe to **chop** it in half, yelling \"Yaaay!\", but now both halves yawn. He hops about trying to **chop** faster, until a whole chorus of pebbles is yawning in harmony and the audience demands an encore."],"掏":["to fish out","{Tarzan} lands in {Front} of the {Tower}, baffled by a tall *pottery* jar. Taking it for a termite mound, as the apes taught him, he thrusts in a *helping hand* to **fish out** his lunch and pulls up a sock, a rubber chicken and a tuba. He sniffs each one, hands the tuba to an elephant, and goes on to **fish out** a whole marching band."],"狄":["low official","{Darth Vader} breathes heavily {Inside} the {Beach}, where a *prowling dog* in a paper hat warms its paws by a *campfire* and demands a sandcastle permit. This is the **low official** in charge. Vader lifts the *campfire* into the air with the Force and booms his disapproval, but the **low official** merely barks and stamps a form on his cape."],"晰":["distinct","{Shrek} gives a roar in {Front} of the {Beach} that blows away all the fog, and the *sun* blazes down on a *woodcutter* splitting an enormous onion. With each chop, every layer falls away sharp and **distinct**, like the pages of a book. Shrek grunts with approval, and even Donkey's endless chatter becomes horribly clear, each word **distinct** in the bright light."],"罕":["rare","{Homer} naps in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} under a *torn net* hung on a *drying rack*, until something flops onto his belly: a glowing purple fish, extremely **rare**. Scientists burst in with cameras, but he has already had a dim idea, dips it in sprinkles and takes a bite. \"Mmm,\" he says, then \"D'oh!\", because now it is even more **rare**."],"挽":["pull back","{Walter White} teaches elasticity in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, stretching a polymer into a rubbery *helping hand*. When a *dodger* tries to skip class, Walter fires it across the room to seize him by the collar, and announces exactly how hard it will **pull back**. It snaps, the *dodger* flies back to his desk, and Walter proudly marks how well the hand can **pull back**."],"脾":["spleen","{Pikachu} clutches his side {Inside} the {Beach} under the *moon*, because his Thunderbolt has backed up into his **spleen**. A nurse waves a paper *fan* over him, and each breeze makes sparks fly out. The *moon* lights up the X-ray, where the **spleen** is glowing like a melon, and with a tiny hiccup of \"Pika!\" it goes dark."],"舟":["boat","The {Joker} unveils a *boat* in {Front} of the {Boathouse} with a huge grin and invites all the ducks aboard. Its sail is a trick playing card and its mast is a squirting flower. Halfway across the lake the whole **boat** folds up like a deck of cards, the ducks splash down, and he cackles from the one real **boat** he kept for himself."],"痴":["infatuated","{Charlie Brown} sighs in {Front} of the {Beehive} over the little red-haired girl, so **infatuated** that he collapses on a *sickbed*. A wise *sage* takes his pulse, shakes his head and calls it hopeless. She walks by, Charlie freezes, and the bees eat his valentine. \"Good grief,\" he mumbles, and then the *sage* spots the queen bee and falls just as **infatuated**."],"蔡":["surname Cai","{Cookie Monster} bursts up in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, where a family with the **surname Cai** are laying out a *sacrifice* of *grass* bundles at their shrine. Shouting \"Me want cookie!\", he devours the lot in a spray of green crumbs. The family gasp, then laugh, and stitch a **surname Cai** name tag to his fur, which he also eats."],"剪":["scissors","{James Bond} stands in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and unwraps Q's latest gadget, a *knife* that does one absurd thing: its *front* splits into two blades that snap together as **scissors**. He cuts banknotes into paper dolls that dance across the floor. Guards charge in, but he snips off all their ties, pockets the **scissors** and strolls out, unruffled."],"脊":["spine","{James Bond} steps into the {Basement} by the {Beach} wearing Q's newest tuxedo, whose one gadget is a brace for lifting any heavy thing. He hoists the full *moon* onto his back, and his **spine** creaks and rings like a xylophone, one note per bone. Unruffled, he remarks that it has been a heavy night, while crabs conga to the tune of his **spine**."],"弓":["bow","{Gandalf} raises his staff in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and mutters a spell, and it curves into a giant *bow*. He looses fireworks for arrows, and dragons of sparks burst over the water while the fish sit up to applaud. Cranky, he lights his pipe on the last spark and says that a wizard's **bow**, like a wizard, fires exactly when it means to, then hangs the **bow** on his hat."],"懒":["lazy","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and trips a rolling boulder, which grinds to a halt at a sofa where a *freeloader* lies, too **lazy** to look up. A *standing heart* trots about fetching his crisps. Lara backflips over them both and blows the dust off a relic, and the man is so **lazy** that even the boulder gives up and rolls away."],"叉":["fork","{Charlie Brown} finally gets his kite aloft in {Front} of the {Spa}, and a kite-eating tree reaches out with a giant *fork*. It winds the string around the **fork** like spaghetti and slurps the whole kite down. \"Good grief,\" he says, and Snoopy trots up with a napkin and a little **fork** of his own, in case the tree leaves any."],"拐":["to turn","{Gandalf} taps a barrel with his staff in the {Basement} of the {Wine Cellar}, and a spell conjures a *helping hand* that jams in a *spare part* for a steering wheel. The barrel shoots off and he must **turn** left, **turn** right and roar \"You shall not pass!\" at the wine racks. Fireworks trail behind him, and he arrives exactly when he means to."],"喃":["to mumble","{Naruto} creeps {Inside} the {Mansion}, loud even for a ninja, past a portrait with a moving *mouth*. A wind from the *south* sets it off, and it starts to **mumble** shopping lists, grudges and his exact hiding place. He makes a dozen shadow clones to clamp it shut, but now every clone begins to **mumble** about ramen."],"僚":["colleague","{Lara Croft} drops on a rope {Inside} the {Cat Café} and meets a *standing person* holding up a *torch*: her new **colleague** on this tomb raid. The *torch* reveals a shrine of the ancient cat kings, with puzzles carved beneath the sofas. She leaps over the boulder, he trips on a kitten, and the cats elect her **colleague** employee of the month."],"捐":["to donate","{James Bond} holds out a *helping hand* in {Front} of the {Mint}, and on his palm sits Q's latest gadget: a *silkworm* that spins gold coins. It does one absurd thing, which is making him **donate** them, and every coin leaps out of his tuxedo into the nearest charity box. Unruffled, he introduces himself to a pigeon and proceeds to **donate** his cufflinks too."],"姊":["older sister","{Zorro} leaps off a chandelier in the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, slashes a Z into the honeycomb and is caught by the cape: a tall *woman* in a beekeeper hat, his **older sister**. She licks her thumb, wipes his mask and makes him apologize to the bees. He vanishes laughing, but only an **older sister** could find a Z slashed into his socks."],"骚":["to disturb","{Sailor Moon} begins her speech on justice in {Front} of the {Tower} when a *flea* on a tiny *horse* gallops up her pigtails to **disturb** her. She starts over, the *horse* neighs, and she hurls her tiara and misses. Crying loudly, she appeals to Luna, while the *flea* rides off through town to **disturb** everyone else."],"拓":["to expand","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and is baffled by such a tiny jungle. He gives his yell, calls the elephants and, lending a *helping hand*, shoves a *stone* wall until the walls begin to **expand**. Soon there is room for a good long vine swing, then for all the apes, and it goes on to **expand** into the next town."],"歪":["askew","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in {Front} of the {Island}, annoyed by a *no sign* on the *goal line* of the beach pitch. He drips one precise drop of school solution on its post, and it sags **askew**. Proudly he explains the reaction as it creeps along the *goal line*, tilting the palm trees and the hut, until his black hat sits **askew** too."],"粘":["to stick","The {Joker} sits down with a *fortune teller* in {Front} of the {Mansion} and swaps her crystal ball for one that squirts hot sticky *rice*. Grains **stick** to her shawl, his purple suit and his green hair, and he cackles until she points at him calmly. She says that he and that ball will **stick** together forever, and it will not leave his hand."],"柄":["handle","{Batman} sets up a *tripod* in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} to scan a fallen *tree*, then carves it with batarangs into a gigantic **handle** for his grappling hook. When the bell rings overhead, he grips the **handle** and fires. The hook bites, the line goes taut, and he bursts up through the canvas with a gruff growl, and his cape settles over the champion."],"坑":["pit","{Kermit} hops in {Front} of the {Jungle}, directing a stagehand in a *high collar* who is digging a stage hole in the *soil*. He digs too far, and now it is a **pit** that swallows the set. Shrieking \"Yaaay!\", arms flailing, Kermit tumbles in after the scenery, his banjo plunking on every ledge, as the **pit** echoes with the sound of a show going wrong."],"陌":["unfamiliar","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} onto a strange *hillside*. He head-butts a block, and instead of a coin he gets a *banknote* covered in faces he has never seen. Everything here is **unfamiliar**: square mushrooms, polite turtles, flags he cannot read. He stomps on the *banknote* out of habit, and a purple goat, equally **unfamiliar**, eats it."],"窄":["narrow","The {Joker} crawls through the {Basement} of the {Island}, down a *cave* so **narrow** that his huge grin has to turn sideways. The *jack-in-the-box* he set as a prank for someone else springs up and jams the passage. Cackling, he breathes in, flattens his purple suit and squeezes through the **narrow** gap with a pop like a cork."],"湘":["Hunan","{Shrek} climbs a *lookout* in {Front} of the {Stadium}, searching for somewhere to be left alone. Far below, *water drops* fall into a long river, and he follows it south to fields of chili: **Hunan**. He bites a chili thinking it is an onion, and a roar of flame shoots from his mouth. All of **Hunan** cheers and Donkey asks for seconds."],"兆":["omen","The {Joker} finds a *cracked shell* in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and scrawls a fake **omen** on it as a prank: tomorrow it will rain custard pies. He cackles all night. Next morning the *cracked shell* glows and pies really do pour down, splatting his green hair, and his grin wobbles as he wonders who wrote that **omen** for real."],"崖":["precipice","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Spa}, up a *mountain* of steam, until he teeters on the *cliff edge* above a sheer **precipice**. He swallows a hot towel to steady himself and lays it as an egg, but the egg rolls off the *cliff edge*. His long tongue snags it in mid-air, and he hangs squeaking over the **precipice**, legs paddling, as a goat applauds."],"骄":["arrogant","{James Bond} sips a drink in {Front} of the {Cat Café} as a *horse* struts by on golden *stilts*, nose in the air, the only creature more **arrogant** than he is. It refuses to look at him. Q's cufflink does one absurd thing, launching a kitten, so the *stilts* trip, the horse falls flat, and still **arrogant**, it pretends it meant to. Bond nods with respect."],"刹":["brake","{Sherlock} chases an *assassin* on a runaway bathtub in {Front} of the {Spa}, and from one soap bubble he deduces that the tub has no **brake**. Calling it elementary, he jams a *standing knife* into the lawn and hangs on as sparks fly and Watson screams. The tub stops dead, but the *assassin*, with no **brake** of his own, sails on into the pool.","shā"],"鞭":["whip","{Batman} pulls a long **whip** of braided *rawhide* from his utility belt in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and cracks it with a gruff growl. It takes a *shortcut* through the air, zigzagging between lamp posts, and snatches stolen coins from the robbers' fingers. The **whip** then ties them in a neat bow, and Batman glides off, brooding, without saying thanks."],"芒":["awn","{Mario} warps up a green pipe {Inside} the {Hangar} and stomps a clump of *prickly grass*, expecting a coin. Instead a bristly **awn** spears straight through his boot. He head-butts the next block, and out pops another spiky **awn**, then a hundred more, until his moustache bristles like a wheat field and he hops away yelling \"Wahoo!\" in pain."],"筋":["tendon","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Inn} as Q hands him a *bamboo* cane with a giant *rib* on the end. One click and a stretchy **tendon** shoots out, catapulting him over the villain's wall. He lands unruffled, plucks the **tendon** like a cello, and remarks that Q is a little highly strung."],"聘":["to employ","{Pikachu} sparks into the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} and squeals \"Pika!\" into a *knight*'s *ear*, which apparently means you're hired. A tiny Thunderbolt jolts the armour to attention, so Pikachu can **employ** him to scrub the tub. He goes on to **employ** a goose and a mop, paying everyone in static."],"钩":["hook","{Gandalf} raps his staff in {Front} of the {Boathouse} and mutters a spell over a heap of *gold coins*, which melt and curl into a shining *hook*. The enchanted **hook** flies off on its own, snags a whale, a rowboat and the moon's reflection, and drags them all ashore. Cranky but pleased, he hangs the **hook** on his pointy hat."],"棍":["stick","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Bathroom} of the {Casino} exactly when he means to, and finds his staff has been pawned. Cranky, he zaps a potted *tree* with a spell and it shrivels into one plain **stick**. An *insect* clinging to the twig is knighted Keeper of the **stick** and sails it off to the roulette table like a broom."],"嚷":["to shout","{Robocop} clanks down to the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where a giant *mouth* wearing an *embroidered robe* is breaking Directive Nine: no singing. His visor locks on and he reads the rule out at full volume, so the mouth starts to **shout** back. Now they both **shout**, steel man and robed lips, until every rivet shakes loose and is politely arrested."],"腺":["gland","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} wanting to be left alone, but a *wellspring* is gurgling across the tiles, glittering under the *moon*. It comes from a swollen **gland** in his own neck, squirting swamp water with every grumpy roar. Donkey will not shut up about it, so Shrek roars louder, and the **gland** soaks every banker in the queue."],"弦":["string","{Shrek} sits {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} peeling an onion when Donkey starts to sing. To drown him out, Shrek bends a *bow* from a teller's rail and pulls a *dark thread* out of his sock for its **string**. One grumpy pluck booms through the vault, coins hop, bankers dance, and Donkey, thrilled, demands the **string** for his solo."],"焰":["flame","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps over a *trap pit* in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and spots a *campfire* blazing at the bottom. Out shoots the long tongue, and down goes one hot **flame**. His eyes water, his tail smokes, and he lays a glowing egg with a **flame** dancing through its shell, which the butler uses to light his candles."],"耍":["to play with","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in the {Basement} of the {Water Park} and deduces from one wet hair that a *woman* with a long *beard* is nearby, and bored. \"Elementary,\" he says, \"she wants someone to **play with** it.\" Watson braids it, Sherlock swings on it, and soon she lets the lifeguards **play with** it as a water slide."],"俯":["to look down","{Frodo} plods into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and meets a *standing person* so tall his head has poked up into a *mansion* overhead. Wearily, Frodo begins another very long walk, up the trouser leg and over the collar, to the mansion's carpet. There he makes the mistake of trying to **look down**: Sam is a dot, and the Ring swings over the hole, begging him to **look down** again."],"厘":["one hundredth","{Lara Croft} squeezes {Inside} the {Beach} through a sand tunnel and finds a *cliff* sheltering an ancient *village*, exactly **one hundredth** of normal size. She plucks the thimble-sized relic from its temple, and a boulder the size of a pea rolls after her ankle. Even the trap is **one hundredth** of a trap, so she backflips over it, yawning."],"愣":["to stare blankly","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} temple, ponytail flying, and a stone door grinds open on a *standing heart* doing the cha-cha. No puzzle, trap or relic in her notes covers this, so all she can do is **stare blankly**. A boulder rolls up behind her, stops, and seems to **stare blankly** at the dancing heart too."],"厦":["tall building","{Sherlock} examines one crumb of concrete in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and announces that a **tall building** has appeared overnight. \"Elementary, Watson: mortar in the soap.\" He throws open the window and, sure enough, the *summer* sun has baked the *cliff* opposite into a **tall building**, which adds a floor every time he says he told them so."],"恳":["earnest","{Kermit} flails down to the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, where the show is falling apart and the stagehands fix him with a *glare*. He clutches his banjo, his green *heart* hammering, and sings the most **earnest** song a frog ever sang, begging them to carry on. He ends on a tiny \"Yaaay?\", arms waving, so **earnest** that even the candy floss cries."],"饶":["spare","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Tower}, visor glowing, and politely arrests an *emperor* for stealing a *side dish* of cold broccoli. The emperor drops to his knees and begs him to **spare** him. A directive scrolls across the targeting display: first offence, vegetables returned. Stiffly he reads it aloud, agrees to **spare** the emperor, and handcuffs the broccoli instead."],"钉":["nail","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and lifts a sack of *gold coins* with the Force, then a giant *nail*. One gesture of his glove and the coins hammer the **nail** into the canvas, clang, clang, clang, while the boxers duck. When it bends, he Force-chokes the **nail** until it straightens, whimpering."],"寡":["few","{Gandalf} strikes his staff in the {Basement} of the {Water Park} and conjures rain over the empty slides, but the spell misfires and a little thatched *roof* pops up to catch nearly all of it. Only a **few** drops get past: drip, drip. Cranky, he sets off his finest fireworks, and the crowd that comes is very **few**: one duck and a lonely inflatable flamingo."],"憾":["pity","{Homer} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} for a nap and finds one last doughnut on the sink. He lunges, it rolls down the drain, and with a \"D'oh!\" his *standing heart* sinks to his knees. Big *tears* fill the basin, and he paddles a finger in them. \"What a **pity**,\" he sobs, and falls asleep, still mumbling \"Mmm, **pity**.\""],"摔":["to throw down","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Wine Cellar} and deduces, from one cork, that the thief is caught in the *dragnet* Watson has just hauled up. Smugly lending a *helping hand*, he **throws down** the whole net, and barrels bounce away down the hill. Out climbs a startled goat, and Sherlock **throws down** his pipe in disgust."],"叠":["to pile up","{Darth Vader} stalks {Inside} the {Yeti Cave}, where *leaf pickers* are dropping leaves all over the floor. Disapproving, he raises one glove and the Force lifts each leaf onto a *folded blanket*, then another blanket, and they **pile up** until they touch the ceiling. \"Impressive,\" he breathes, and makes them **pile up** on the sleeping yeti as well."],"惹":["to provoke","{Robocop} clanks into the {Basement} of the {Hut} and meets his *lookalike*, an identical armoured man, tapping a dent right over Robocop's steel *heart*. Directive Four says citizens must not **provoke** an officer. The lookalike recites the same directive in a sing-song voice, tap, tap, just to **provoke** him, so Robocop stiffly arrests him, and is stiffly arrested back."],"喻":["analogy","{Yoshi} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} and finds a *dugout canoe* with a big *mouth* carved on its prow, droning that life is a canoe. That **analogy** bores him, so out flicks his tongue and down it all goes, gulp. He lays a speckled egg, and a tiny voice from the shell offers a better **analogy**: life is an egg."],"谱":["chart","{Pikachu} skitters into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a music **chart** hangs in a shaft of *broad daylight*. A *small speech bubble* floats off every note, and all of them say \"Pika!\", the only lyric he can read. His cheeks crackle, a Thunderbolt lights up the whole **chart**, and the pipes start to sing along."],"愧":["ashamed","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} having shoved past the whole queue, and a *ghost* rises from the sink and taps his *standing heart*. His arms drop and his banjo droops. It's not easy being green, he mumbles, turning a deep, **ashamed** shade of olive, and he hops back to the end of the line, too **ashamed** to say \"Yaaay\"."],"煌":["radiant","{Homer} flops {Inside} the {Swamp} for a nap and uses a *golden crown* to toast a doughnut over a *campfire*. Then comes the dim scheme: he puts the hot crown on his bald head to keep it warm. His scalp turns so **radiant** that frogs squint and the mud shines, and with a \"D'oh!\" he finds he is now too **radiant** to sleep."],"徽":["badge","{Homer} waddles in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} after a trail of muddy *footsteps*, because they smell of doughnuts. They stop at a shiny **badge** on a lamp post, and his dim scheme is to pin it on and skip the queue for ever. Then the *footsteps* start up again, straight up his leg, and a tiny furious dog takes back its **badge**. \"D'oh!\""],"溶":["to dissolve","{Robocop} wades {Inside} the {Lagoon}, finds a sugar cube loitering, and locks it in a glass *container*. Politely he reads it its rights, but *water drops* fall in and the suspect begins to **dissolve**. He repeats the charge, stiffly adds his handcuffs to secure it, and watches the evidence and the cuffs **dissolve** together in a fizz of bubbles."],"坠":["to fall","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and pulls a trick toilet chain, and a whole football *team* starts to **fall** through the floor. They land unhurt in soft *soil* and sprout like turnips, still in their kits. He deals a playing card to the receptionist, reading SURPRISE, and she and the potted fern **fall** after them, while he howls with laughter."],"煞":["to cut short","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Spa}, sniffing some glowing *embers*, and begins a long, smug deduction about who lit them. A bucket of water hisses over the coals, and his speech is **cut short**. Relighting his pipe, he tries his violin instead, but the *embers* spit, a string snaps, and that too is **cut short**."],"巾":["towel","{James Bond} steps out in {Front} of the {Inn} in a crisp tuxedo, and Q hands him a *towel* that does one absurd thing: it drinks anything it touches. He flicks the **towel** at a puddle, then the rainstorm, then a henchman's coffee. Unruffled, he tucks the whale-sized, dripping **towel** under one arm and remarks that he is quite dry now."],"滥":["overflowing","{Lara Croft} solves a stone puzzle in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and the ancient trap springs: *water drops* turn to torrents from every tap. The tub is **overflowing**, the sinks are **overflowing**, and an *inspector* in a raincoat floats past on his clipboard, writing it all down. She climbs the towel rail, ponytail dripping, and swings out through the window with the relic."],"洒":["to spray","{Sailor Moon} spins through a long sparkly transformation in the {Basement} of the {Spa}, trips over a pipe, and cries so loudly that *water drops* **spray** from her eyes. They hit a *bird nest* on the valve and soak the birds, who **spray** her back with flapping wings. Luna the cat sighs and hides behind the boiler."],"堵":["to block up","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a *busy man* is shovelling *soil* at a drain, one tiny spadeful at a time. Finding this lack of progress disturbing, Vader raises a glove, and the Force hurls the whole heap at once to **block up** every pipe with a thud. The man, delighted, asks him to **block up** the taps as well."],"瓷":["porcelain","{Cookie Monster} barges {Inside} the {Beehive} past a *queue* of bees, each carrying one shiny white *tile*. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, and crunches one anyway: fine **porcelain**, crumbs everywhere, googly eyes spinning. It needs milk, he decides, so he devours the bees' whole **porcelain** tea set, and the queue starts again from the beginning."],"咒":["spell","The {Joker} sets up a *small table* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and deals his trick cards, and each one starts to *chatter* a **spell** in a squeaky voice. The oars turn to rubber chickens and the boats to geese. Cackling, he squirts his flower to end the **spell**, but it only turns his green hair into seaweed."],"姨":["aunt","{Yoshi} wriggles {Inside} the {Beach} and meets a *woman* in a feathered hat: his **aunt**, a champion *bowman* who shoots sandwich after sandwich at him. His sticky tongue snatches each one out of the air, and he lays it as an egg. She pinches his cheek, pockets the eggs and fires again; nobody ever finishes lunch with this **aunt**."],"棒":["club","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, where pilots present him with a whole *tree* as a *tribute*. Brooding, he reaches into his utility belt, pulls out a tiny Bat-Lathe and carves a huge **club** in seconds. He growls that he is the night, swings the **club** once, and bats a helicopter clean out of the door."],"郡":["county","{James Bond} sandboards into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} in his tuxedo, where a *lord* on a sandy *hillside* gloats that he owns the whole **county**. Bond clicks Q's latest cufflink, which does one absurd thing: it moves borders. The line slides past the lord's slippers, and Bond adjusts his tie. \"You seem to have mislaid your **county**.\""],"浴":["bath","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where warm *water drops* fill a tiny *valley* between two display cases. His tongue shoots out and swallows the whole **bath**, bubbles, rubber duck and all. A moment later he lays a huge blue egg, cracks it open, and there is the **bath** again, with a mummy already soaking in it."],"媚":["charming","{Mario} warps out of a pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and leaps to stomp a *woman* who has one *raised brow*. She is so **charming** that his stomp turns into a curtsy in midair, and he head-butts a block just to offer her the coin. The brow lifts higher, and even the block blushes and pays out ten more: that is how **charming** she is."],"稣":["to revive","{Sailor Moon} trips in {Front} of the {Pool} over a dried-up *fish* lying beside a limp *grain stalk*, and bursts into loud tears. Then she raises her moon wand, gives a long speech about justice for seafood, and sparkles rain down to **revive** it. The fish gasps and flips; the stalk stands tall and waves, and she goes on to **revive** a fainting lifeguard."],"淮":["Huai River","{Homer} trudges {Inside} the {Wine Cellar} hunting a snack, following *water drops* and a *sparrow* carrying his stolen doughnut. His dim scheme is to pull the plug in the floor, and in gushes the wide **Huai River**, barges and all, the old line between north and south China. With a \"D'oh!\" he floats off on a barrel, and the sparrow steers him down the **Huai River**."],"哎":["hey","{Casper} floats shyly in {Front} of the {Island} and waves at a bush of *mugwort*, only wanting a friend. A *mouth* in the leaves yells **Hey**, and he turns invisible in fright. He drifts back through a palm tree and tries a small **hey** of his own, and every islander runs away screaming, leaving poor Casper sighing on the sand."],"屁":["fart","{Pikachu} scampers into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a *lying man* snores between a pair of *twins*. A thunderous **fart** shakes the sand, and the twins point at each other. \"Pika?\" His cheeks crackle, a stray Thunderbolt zaps the air, and the next **fart** goes off like a firework and lifts the man an inch off his towel."],"漆":["lacquer","{Chewbacca} roars in {Front} of the {Beach} because his ship needs sealing, and rips a branch off a *lacquer tree*. Sticky *water drops* of red sap run down his bandolier, and he slathers **lacquer** over the hull, the seagulls and his own fur. Then he sticks fast to the ship and growls something only Han understands: too much **lacquer**."],"淫":["excessive","{Yoshi} sits {Inside} the {Inn} as a *greedy claw* pokes through the ceiling and hoards all the *water drops* leaking from the tub upstairs. That is **excessive**, so out shoots his tongue, and he swallows the claw, the buckets, the soup and the fish tank. He lays egg after egg until the staircase is blocked: an **excessive** clutch, and the innkeeper paddles out in a pot."],"巢":["nest","{Charlie Brown} flies his kite {Inside} the {Tower} stairwell and, naturally, it gets eaten: a giant *nest* of sticks swallows it whole. He sighs \"Good grief\" and climbs up to fetch it, and the **nest** collapses gently around him. The mother bird comes home, sits on him all night, and Charlie becomes the only boy ever to wait for hatching in a **nest**."],"吩":["to order","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Funfair} after a very long walk, and a huge painted *mouth* over the gate demands the Ring. Tempted, he slips it on instead and, invisible, begins to **order** everyone about in a booming voice: ride the coaster, share that *cut cake*, bow to the Ferris wheel. Sam prises it off his finger, but the clowns still beg for more **orders**."],"撰":["to compose","The {Joker} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, where a *kneeling pair* of swans holds out a quill. A rubber *helping hand* on a spring grabs it and starts to **compose** an ode full of whoopee jokes about honking. He signs it with his squirting flower, ink hits him in the eye, and the swans cheerfully **compose** a very rude review."],"啸":["to whistle","{Shrek} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} wanting peace, but a *stern face* on the wall puckers its *mouth* and begins to **whistle**. Cats fly off the shelves and teacups crack. Shrek has had enough of this: he roars, stuffs two green fingers between his lips and starts to **whistle** louder, blowing Donkey, still talking, out through the window."],"滞":["stagnant","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and cinches a trick *belt* round the tub, and the *water drops* stop dead in midair. The whole pool turns **stagnant**, green and silent, which is his idea of a great joke. He cackles and squirts his flower, but even the squirt hangs there, **stagnant**, until a bee tows it away."],"玫":["rose","{Mario} warps {Inside} the {Lake} castle and jumps on a block that a *king* is poking with his *cane*. Instead of a coin, out pops a red **rose**. \"Wahoo!\" He head-butts the block again and again, until the king is buried in petals and sneezing, and his cane sprouts one last thorny **rose** as a thank-you."],"硕":["master's degree","{Sherlock} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, inspects a *stone* tablet through his magnifying glass, and deduces from one chipped corner that it is a diploma. A single *page* glued to it confirms the fact: a **master's degree** in Being Right. He plays himself a victory tune on the violin while Watson staggers behind him, carrying the enormous **master's degree**."],"钓":["to fish","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and, needing no rod, raises one glove to **fish** with the Force. A soup *ladle* baited with *gold coins* floats out over the giant milk bowl, and he hauls in a tabby, a cupcake and the barista, breathing loudly throughout. The cats, insulted, set off to **fish** for his cape."],"蝶":["butterfly","{Darth Vader} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and flicks a pile of *leaves* aside with the Force, uncovering one shy *bug*. \"I am your father,\" he booms, and the appalled bug unfolds into a **butterfly** as wide as a carpet. He cannot choke it, for it is no object. It settles on his helmet, and the **butterfly** slows his breathing to a sigh."],"膝":["knee","{Shrek} tramps in {Front} of the {Beach} looking for a quiet spot, trips on a *lacquer tree*, and bangs his **knee**. He roars, the tree drips sticky sap, and Donkey is glued to his leg. The *moon* gleams on the shiny green swelling all night while Donkey, who will not shut up, tells stories from his **knee**."],"姚":["Yao","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Tower}, where a *woman* hands him a *cracked shell* scratched with the surname **Yao**. He gulps it down and flutter-jumps up the stairs, laying an egg on each landing. Every egg hatches a small relative of hers, and they all shout their name. \"Yoshi!\" he protests, and \"**Yao**!\" they yell back."],"茂":["luxuriant","{Mario} warps into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, drops his super mushroom, and a tuft of *grass* in the sink gobbles it and goes **luxuriant**. He stomps it, and it springs back. He swings a *pole axe*, and with each \"Wahoo!\" every stalk returns twice as **luxuriant**, lifting his red cap to the ceiling."],"躯":["body","{Chewbacca} storms in {Front} of the {Museum} in a temper, roars at an ancient marble *torso*, and rips off the *district map* wrapped round it. Sorry at once, he sticks the map all over his own hairy **body**, ankles to ears. Lost tourists now comb through his fur for directions, and every street in town runs along his **body**."],"吏":["minor official","{Lara Croft} rappels into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} after a relic and finds a tiny *clerk* guarding it at a desk. This **minor official** demands a permit for every trap, and even the rolling boulder must wait for its stamp. She backflips over his paperwork, snatches the relic, and the **minor official** stamps the boulder as it rumbles by."],"猿":["ape","{Yoshi} prowls {Inside} the {Mint} and spots a *prowling dog* in a *long robe* creeping past the coin presses. His tongue whips the robe away, and the dog is really an **ape**, howling in surprise as it goes down in one gulp. He lays an egg that promptly sprouts long arms, and the **ape** swings off with a sack of coins."],"寨":["stockade","The {Joker} skips into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and plants a *bare tree*, sharpened like a pencil, then shuffles his trick cards. Each card he flicks turns into another trunk, until a wooden **stockade** rings the pirates' lunch. They snarl and climb the **stockade**, and every trunk squirts them in the face while he howls with laughter."],"恕":["to forgive","{Sherlock} deduces in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, from a single thread, that Watson stole his deerstalker, and prepares a smug speech. An *echo* from the drain repeats every word, and hearing it, his *heart* softens. \"Elementary, my dear friend, I **forgive** you.\" The echo booms **forgive** so loudly that Watson bursts into tears and hands back the hat."],"渠":["canal","{Chewbacca} is fixing a leaky ship {Inside} the {Museum} when he loses his temper and rips a long trench through the floor to drain it: a **canal**, past mummies and dinosaurs. Still growling, he tears a *tree* out of the atrium and rows it along the *canal* like a gondola. The **canal** soon pours into the café, flooding the cappuccinos."],"戚":["relatives","{Chewbacca} bellows in {Front} of the {Beach}, and from over the waves his hairy **relatives** bellow back, landing by the shipload. Grandfather hacks the cake with a *pole axe*, cousins hurl *soybean* snacks, and everyone roars in a language only family understands. The hugs snap his bandolier, and still the **relatives** keep coming until the sand sinks."],"辰":["fifth Earthly Branch","{Charlie Brown} finally wins a prize {Inside} the {Funfair}, and it is a giant *clam* with a dragon curled up in it, booming \"I am the **fifth Earthly Branch**.\" He sets up his football for a celebratory kick. Good grief: the dragon pulls it away at the last second, and the **fifth Earthly Branch** laughs at him as he lands flat on his back."],"舶":["ship","{Batman} broods {Inside} the {Fort} as a *white dove* tows in a tiny *boat*, which grows and grows on the ribbon into an ocean-going **ship**. Suspicious, he fires his grappling hook into the mast and ties the other end to the Batmobile. The dove drops onto his cowl, exhausted, and he growls that the **ship** is impounded."],"颁":["to issue","{Batman} stands in {Front} of the {Mansion} with a launcher from his utility belt, about to **issue** the annual awards. He slips a *page* into every slice of *cut cake* and fires them out like batarangs: best moustache, loudest sneeze, most polite pigeon. Alfred, who is **issued** only a crumb and a blank sheet, sulks behind the lamp post."],"惶":["anxiety","{Homer} naps {Inside} the {Swamp} and wakes to see the *golden crown* he borrowed for a dim scheme sinking into the mud. \"D'oh!\" His *standing heart* leaps out of his chest and paces up and down in pure **anxiety**. Homer knows only one cure, so he eats twelve doughnuts while the frogs around him croak with **anxiety**."],"狐":["fox","{Homer} dozes on an inflatable ring {Inside} the {Pool} when a *prowling dog* rolls up with a *melon* and swaps it for his doughnut. He bites the melon: \"D'oh!\" That was no dog but a **fox** in disguise, so he sets a dim trap with a second doughnut. The **fox** eats the bait, winks, and swims off with his towel."],"讽":["to satirize","{Frodo} limps into the {Basement} of the {Jungle} temple after a very long walk, and the *wind* blows in a *small speech bubble* mocking his hairy toes. Parrots **satirize** his weary sigh, his bare feet, his staring at the Ring. He slips it on and tiptoes off invisible, and the parrots **satirize** that too, by covering their eyes and bumping into walls."],"笨":["dumb","{Batman} grapples into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and, as a disguise from his utility belt, straps on a clump of *bamboo* planted upside down, *roots* waving like hair. Children point and laugh at how **dumb** he looks. The world's greatest detective growls that this is not a **dumb** plan, turns with a brooding swirl of his cape, and walks straight into the door."],"袍":["gown","{Pikachu} sparks open a mysterious *parcel* {Inside} the {Tower} and finds one folded *shirt*. A single jolt of static and it unrolls into a long silk **gown**, trailing down twelve flights of stairs. \"Pika!\" He sweeps up the steps with his tail in the air, and the crackling **gown** stands out all round him like a yellow balloon."],"嘲":["to ridicule","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Tower} to show his kite to the *royal court*, and a giant *mouth* over the throne starts to **ridicule** his zigzag shirt. \"Good grief,\" he mumbles, and the kite falls apart in his hands. The whole court joins in to **ridicule** him, and even Snoopy, up on a pillar, snickers."],"啡":["coffee","{Frodo} drags his bare hairy feet in {Front} of the {Lake} after three weeks of walking and collapses, until Sam hands him a steaming *coffee*. One sip and his feet blur: he circles the lake forty times, hair on end. The fish swim at double speed, and even the Ring seems to whisper for more **coffee**. Nobody sleeps that week: too much **coffee**."],"泼":["to splash","{Pikachu} hops onto a *launch pad* in {Front} of the {Fort} and charges it with a Thunderbolt. It fires a barrel of *water drops* into the sky, which bursts overhead and starts to **splash** him, shorting out his cheeks. \"Pika!\" Soggy but stubborn, he fires again and manages to **splash** the guards, the flag and himself once more."],"衔":["hold in mouth","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} to a busy *crossroads* of traders with Donkey yapping behind him. Genius strikes: he stacks *gold coins* between Donkey's teeth, since a donkey forced to **hold in mouth** a fortune cannot talk. Blessed silence, for one moment. Then Donkey mumbles on through the coins, and soon every banker has to **hold in mouth** his money to hear him."],"倦":["weary","{James Bond} slips into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, where a *standing person* has been reading an endless *scroll* of coin numbers for nine years, utterly **weary**. Unruffled, Bond offers to take over and gives Q's pocket pillow to the man, who collapses snoring. Two lines later, Bond is **weary** too. \"The name's Bond. James...\" he says, and sleeps."],"涵":["to contain","{Homer} lounges {Inside} the {Mansion} as the pipes burst, and his dim scheme is to **contain** all the *water drops* in one doughnut box. In go the fountain, the goldfish and a rubber duck, and he sits on the lid and says \"Mmm.\" The box can **contain** it for four seconds, and then it fires him through the chandelier. \"D'oh!\""],"雀":["small bird","{Chewbacca} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink}, and his huge roar blows a *sparrow* out of a towel. Sorry at once, he lifts it in one gentle *pinch*: a **small bird** no bigger than a thimble. He tucks it into his bandolier and carries it everywhere, and soon the **small bird** is roaring back at everybody."],"旬":["ten-day period","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Dunes} and tells Donkey he wants just *ten days* of silence. Donkey lasts four minutes, so Shrek scratches a line in the sand and starts the **ten-day period** over. He peels one onion layer each time he begins, and by the time he has only a tiny core left, not one **ten-day period** has been completed."],"僵":["rigid","{James Bond} strides in {Front} of the {Stadium} and meets a *standing person* just back from a frozen *borderland*, perfectly **rigid**, with frost in his eyebrows. Henchmen close in, so Bond tips the man over and walks across him to the stands, tuxedo spotless. \"Do keep your chin up,\" he tells the **rigid** man, escaping into the crowd."],"撕":["to tear","{Sailor Moon} begins her long justice speech in {Front} of the {Beehive}, trips on her own boots, and a flailing *helping hand* goes straight through the honeycomb, *tearing* it open. The bees **tear** her bow to ribbons while she wails loudly enough to make the comb **tear** further. Luna the cat watches from a safe distance, shaking her head."],"肢":["limb","The {Joker} grins in {Front} of the {Beehive} and straps a rubber *branch* to his purple sleeve as a fake arm. He offers it to a passing guard under the *moon*, and the joke **limb** comes off with a cackle. Then it grows an elbow, wriggles free, and the runaway **limb** chases him round the hive, tickling him."],"垄":["crop row","{Lara Croft} climbs down to the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, lifts a relic off its stone, and the trap wakes: a *dragon* bursts up through the *soil*, ploughing a long **crop row** as it charges. She backflips from furrow to furrow, ponytail flying, and every lunge adds another **crop row**. By the time she escapes, carrots are coming up behind her."],"夷":["eastern tribes","{Yoshi} tunnels {Inside} the {Beach} and meets a *bowman* of the **eastern tribes**, whose arrows trail ribbons of sea mist. The long tongue catches each one in midair and down it goes, and he lays it as an egg painted with a rising sun. Delighted, the **eastern tribes** paddle ashore and march off beating his eggs like drums."],"逸":["to escape","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} after a *rabbit* digging under the mat, and gulps it down with one flick of his tongue. He lays it as an egg, but the egg wobbles off along the coastal *road*, hatches, and manages to **escape**. Three more times he swallows it, and three more times it will **escape**, waving."],"茅":["reeds","{Mario} warps {Inside} the {Tower} and stomps a patch of *grass* in a window box, and each stomp shoots up tall **reeds** that rustle and whistle. One green *spear* jabs through his cap. \"Wahoo!\" He head-butts the last block for his coin, it drops into the thicket, and he wades off into the **reeds** to find it."],"侨":["emigrant","{Chewbacca} ducks {Inside} the {Cat Café} and meets a *standing person* tottering on cracked *stilts*, a suitcase in each hand: an **emigrant** who has walked across the ocean to find a new home. Chewbacca fixes the stilts with ship parts and roars a welcome. Only an **emigrant** so far from home understands every growl, and they weep together over tea."],"舆":["the public","{Yoshi} stands {Inside} the {Museum} when **the public** floods in: tourists, schoolkids, grannies, a mime, all shouting opinions at once. Fed up, he uncoils his tongue and swallows them one by one. Then he lays a long row of eggs, and the shells rattle with argument, because even as eggs **the public** will not stop complaining."],"窑":["kiln","{Yoshi} clambers {Inside} the {Tower} to a hot *cave* at the top, where a glowing **kiln** roars. He gulps down a *clay jar*, then a mouthful of fire for good measure, and his belly becomes a second **kiln**, smoke puffing from his nostrils. With a loud \"Yoshi!\" he lays the jar back out as an egg, shiny, blue and baked solid."],"涅":["black dye","{Naruto} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} yelling that he never gives up, and slips into a pit of *black mud*. He spins a Rasengan to get out, and it whips the mud and *water drops* into **black dye**, ruining his orange jumpsuit. A dozen shadow clones pop up, all soaked in **black dye**, and the yeti cannot tell which one to scold."],"蒲":["cattail","{Pikachu} pads {Inside} the {Pool} through tall *grass* and spots a fuzzy brown *cattail* on the diving board. \"Pika?\" A Thunderbolt leaps from his cheeks, hits the **cattail**, and it glows like a torch. A lifeguard tries to catch him with a Poké Ball, but the **cattail** works as a lightning rod and fries the ball's hinges."],"谦":["modest","{Chewbacca} repairs the broken vault in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, patching it with *two sheaves* of wheat, and saves the whole economy. The bankers hold out a medal; he growls, and a *small speech bubble* translates that it was nothing. Too **modest** to accept it, the enormous Wookiee tries to hide behind a pigeon, the most **modest** hero ever to go without a medal."],"杭":["Hangzhou","{Homer} snoozes {Inside} the {Hangar} under a willow *tree* wearing a scholar's *high collar*, and it points a branch at the nearest cargo plane. His dim scheme is to nap in there all shift, but he wakes up in **Hangzhou**. \"D'oh!\" He paddles across West Lake on a giant doughnut float, sighing \"Mmm, **Hangzhou**\" among the pagodas."],"噢":["oh, I see","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Fort}, lost in a hedge *maze* and wailing softly, until a giant *mouth* in the leaves tells him to turn left at the gargoyle. \"**Oh, I see**,\" he says, grateful, and drifts straight through the hedge anyway. The soldiers scream and run away, and Casper murmurs a sad little \"**oh, I see**\"."],"弊":["drawback","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} in a new stealth cape stitched from *rags* and *grass*. It hides him perfectly; the **drawback** is that it does not glide, so he lands in the sink. Another **drawback**: every crab on the beach moves into it, and the Dark Knight broods while being pinched."],"勋":["merit","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Dunes}, wanting only to be left alone, and his roar startles a falling camel into the arms of an *employee* with a *strong arm*. The manager pins a gold star for **merit** on Shrek's vest. He hurls it away, and gets another star for throwing, until Donkey, wild with envy, demands some **merit** too."],"刮":["to scrape","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Water Park}, mutters a spell, and a *standing knife* hops up and begins to **scrape** the moss off the slides. The moss sticks out a long green *tongue* at him. Cranky, he thumps his staff and declares that it shall not pass, and the knife **scrapes** harder, throwing up sparks like fireworks."],"郊":["suburbs","{James Bond} sits with *crossed legs* in {Front} of the {Cat Café} and presses Q's newest button, which does one absurd thing: it ejects his chair over a green *hillside* into the **suburbs**. He lands on a lawn, unruffled, cat in his lap. The villain's lair turns out to be a garden shed, and everyone in the **suburbs** mows in unison."],"凄":["mournful","{Chewbacca} sits in {Front} of the {Beach} as *icicles* grow on a fisherman's *wife*, who has been waiting for his boat through the snow. Loyal to anyone who waits, he joins her song with a long, **mournful** Wookiee moan. The seagulls weep, the waves stop to listen, and the whole shore turns **mournful**, all minor keys."],"捧":["to cup","{Pikachu} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Jungle} temple, where a stone *helping hand* holds out a *tribute* of rubies. His cheek sparks heat them till they blaze, so he has to **cup** them in two tiny paws, blowing and squeaking \"Pika, pika!\" He hops in circles, tries to **cup** them against his belly, and gives them back fast."],"浸":["to soak","{James Bond} escapes into the {Bathroom} of the {Inn} still in his tuxedo and lowers himself into a tub of warm *water drops* to **soak**. Hours pass. His fingers wrinkle into raisins and Q's waterproof bow tie inflates like a duck. The villain hammers on the door, and Bond, unruffled, calls that he will be another hour: he must **soak** the other side."],"砖":["brick","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} and hands a swan a rigged *spindle*, which spins a lump of *stone* into a rubber **brick** for pranking passers-by. Then the swans get the idea and spin a thousand real ones, honking with glee. Before he can draw a card, the last **brick** clicks into place and he is walled in, grinning."],"鼎":["cauldron","{Darth Vader} strides into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, raises a glove and Force-lifts a great bronze **cauldron** by its three *cauldron legs*. A painted *eye* on its belly blinks at him defiantly. He finds its soup disturbing and tightens his grip, and the choked **cauldron** burps, kicks free, and stomps off to challenge the champion."],"篮":["basket","{Lara Croft} swings {Inside} the {Mansion} on a chandelier with a *bamboo* **basket** of stolen relics on her back, and lands in the path of a fussy *inspector*. He rummages through it: a jade cat, a golden trumpet, a lost crown. He faints from surprise, so she folds him up neatly, pops him into the **basket** too, and backflips away."],"蒸":["to steam","The {Joker} stands in {Front} of the {Jungle} lodge and stuffs *grass* into a joke basket over a bonfire, and *rising steam* billows from his squirting flower. His prank is to **steam** a monkey's banana, but the cloud swallows him instead. When it clears, his green hair is limp and his purple suit has shrunk, and the monkeys queue to **steam** him again."],"饼":["flat cake","{Batman} roars into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} in the Batmobile, which skids along a pair of *linked rails* and runs over a mound of dough, pressing it into a huge **flat cake**. Alfred arrives with a *side dish* of jam. Brooding, Batman flings the **flat cake** like a batarang, and it circles the ring and comes back to him."],"亩":["mu","{Mario} warps into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and head-butts a block, and out flies a *lid* with a tiny *rice field* folded under it. A super mushroom falls in, and the field unrolls across the floor until it covers exactly one **mu**. \"Wahoo!\" He stomps along its edge to measure it: one **mu**, not a coin more."],"肾":["kidney","{Sherlock} studies a squashy, bean-shaped balloon in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} and, by the light of the *moon* through the window, makes his deduction. \"Elementary: a giant **kidney**, won at the ring toss.\" Watson, being a doctor, nods. It breaks loose and bounces off the dodgems, and Sherlock chases his **kidney** with a magnifying glass."],"陡":["steep","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, where a *hillside* rises so **steep** it is nearly a wall. A *runner* in spiked shoes sprints up it and slides back down, again and again. Breathing loudly, Vader disapproves, raises a glove, and tilts the whole hill with the Force until it is even more **steep**."],"爪":["claw","The {Joker} is sneaking through the {Basement} of the {Tower} when a giant *talon* punches through the brick wall. He grins, puts on a joy buzzer and shakes the huge **claw** politely: bzzzt! It shudders, withdraws, and comes back wearing a joy buzzer of its own. The **claw** shakes his hand, and his green hair stands straight up."],"兔":["rabbit","{Tarzan} swings on a shower hose into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, jungle yell echoing off the tiles, and a *rabbit* in goggles leaps from the tub. He talks to it in squeaks, baffled by the goggles, and the **rabbit** patiently explains civilisation. Soon Tarzan wears the goggles on his knees, and the **rabbit** swings on the hose."],"殷":["plentiful","{Yoshi} stands in {Front} of the {Inn} holding up a polished *mirror body* as a *war club* swings at him. His tongue snatches the club, and he lays it as an egg, which the mirror doubles into two, then four, then a hundred. Each one cracks open on a plate of food, and soon the dumplings are **plentiful**, the ducks more **plentiful** still."],"贞":["chaste","The {Joker} skips in {Front} of the {Funfair} to prank an *oracle* in a striped tent, but she squints at him and rules that he must live **chaste** and pure. His squirting flower turns into a white lily and his huge grin into a prim line. A clown blows him a kiss and he faints, the most **chaste** prankster who ever lived."],"荐":["to recommend","{James Bond} lands in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} on a pile of *grass*, holding Q's latest gadget: a *piggy bank* that does one absurd thing, which is **recommend** investments. It squeaks gold, and he is rich. It squeaks tulips, and he is richer. Unruffled, he asks what else the pig would **recommend**, and the bankers queue up behind him."],"哑":["mute","{Yoshi} is awarded a *silver medal* in the {Basement} of the {Spa}, and he opens his *mouth* to cry his own name. His tongue snaps up the medal by mistake, gulp, and his voice goes down with it: he is completely **mute**. He lays an egg, and when it hatches it shrieks \"Yoshi!\" while he stands there, **mute**, waving his arms."],"炭":["charcoal","{Tarzan} swings on a towel rail into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, jungle yell blasting, and lands in a heap of *charcoal*. Baffled by civilisation, he takes it for fruit and bites a lump: black teeth, black chin. Rubbing **charcoal** all over his loincloth, he strides out; guests faint, and the cat he stops to chat with now has **charcoal** whiskers."],"坟":["grave","{Frodo} shuffles {Inside} the {Funfair}'s haunted house on aching feet and comes to a **grave** of fresh *soil*, its headstone marked with a skull *tattoo*. The tattoo crawls off the stone and starts writing his name. Sighing that he has walked too far for this, he slips on the Ring and vanishes, leaving the **grave** rumbling with disappointment."],"眨":["to blink","The {Joker} glues a googly *eye* to a *flat tyre* in the {Basement} of the {Spa} as a prank, and the eye begins to **blink**. Every **blink** puffs out a gust of steam, and the tyre swells, wheeze by wheeze. He cackles and tickles it with his squirting flower; it winks, the tyre bursts, and confetti covers his purple suit."],"搏":["to fight","{Batman} swoops {Inside} the {Fort}, where a *proclamation* on the door dares all comers to **fight** its armoured knight. A spring-loaded *helping hand* pops out of his utility belt and slaps the knight's visor shut. They **fight** all the way down the stairs, batarangs clanging and capes tangling, until the knight surrenders to his gruff voice alone."],"咳":["to cough","{Kermit} flails {Inside} the {Hut} to open the show, stretches his *mouth* wide to shout his \"Yaaay!\", and a hairy *wild boar* charges out. He begins to **cough**, and with every **cough** another snorting boar tumbles past the banjo. Arms waving, he screams for the stagehands to bring down the curtain, but the pigs have eaten it."],"拢":["to draw together","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} and finds a mosaic puzzle: the scales of a *dragon* scattered across the floor. A stone *helping hand* rises, and she flips from tile to tile to **draw together** every scale. The last one clicks and the trap springs: the walls begin to **draw together** too, and she climbs out by her fingertips."],"舅":["maternal uncle","{James Bond} escapes up a drain into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel}, where a burly *man* is pounding chilies in a huge stone *mortar*. It is his **maternal uncle**, his mother's brother, who has been making this curry since before Q was born. Unruffled, Bond requests his chilies shaken, not pounded, and his **maternal uncle** throws the pestle at him."],"昧":["dark","{Mario} warps into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} just as the *sun* sinks behind a skinny *sapling*, and everything turns **dark**. He head-butts a block, and the coin comes out black. He eats a mushroom to grow, bumps his head on something unseen, and stomps on his own foot. \"Wahoo?\" It is so **dark** he cannot find his own moustache."],"擅":["be good at","{Sherlock} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, spots one grain on Watson's sleeve, and deduces what fills the tall *silo* beyond the window. Smugly he tosses hay at it with one *helping hand*, and every bale sails in. He is insufferably **good at** this, as he is at violin and at chemistry. Watson asks if he is **good at** apologizing. Sherlock is not."],"爽":["bright and clear","{Sherlock} wades into the {Basement} of the {Swamp} and meets a *big man* wrapped in *crisscross* bandages, groaning. From one loose thread he deduces the whole affair and tugs, and with every loop the fog lifts until the swamp is **bright and clear**. \"Elementary,\" he says, puffing his pipe, and the case, like the air, is **bright and clear**."],"咖":["café","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Spa}, stage-managing the grand opening of a **café** with a door like a giant *mouth* and a neon *plus sign* that doubles every order. One coffee becomes two, then eight, then a landslide of saucers. \"Yaaay!\" he screams, arms whirling, as guests in robes applaud the worst-run **café** in town."],"搁":["to put","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Hut}, waves his staff, and a floating *helping hand* starts to **put** things up in the *loft*: flowerpots, the cat, a startled postman. Wise and cranky, he tells it where to **put** each one and lights his pipe. The loft creaks, groans and bursts into fireworks, and everything rains down on the vegetable patch."],"禄":["official salary","{Lara Croft} climbs into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, dodges a rolling bath sponge, and finds a *small altar* holding a dusty *logbook* that records her **official salary** as a tomb raider: one sardine a day. She turns the altar's stone dials like a puzzle until it rumbles and the page rewrites itself. Now her **official salary** is two sardines."],"雌":["female","{Cookie Monster} blunders {Inside} the {Beehive}, roaring for cookies, and a fierce *sparrow* blocks him on *this spot*, guarding three speckled eggs. She is a **female** who fears nothing. \"Me not eat egg,\" he says, googly eyes wobbling. The queen bee, also **female**, marches over, and the two ladies make him sweep up his own crumbs."],"哨":["whistle","{Sherlock} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and inspects an old *portrait* with a puckered painted *mouth*, deducing that the sitter was a referee. It blows a shrill **whistle**: wheeeet! Each time he says \"Elementary\" it does it again, so he drowns it out on his violin, and Watson wearily hides the **whistle** behind a towel."],"巩":["to secure","{Gandalf} strides into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, where a crack is running up the wall, and taps a wooden *brace* with his staff to **secure** it by spell. \"You shall not pass,\" he tells the water. Then, feeling cranky, he goes on to **secure** the wobbly table, the leaky boat and a dog who keeps trying to walk off."],"绢":["thin silk","{James Bond} leaps from the {Bathroom} of the {Mint} and pulls Q's newest cufflink, which holds a fat *silkworm*. It spins a glimmering *silk thread* so fast that a parachute of **thin silk** billows over his head. He drifts down unruffled, straightening his tie, while banknotes printed on **thin silk** flutter after him like kites."],"螺":["snail","{Lara Croft} grapples {Inside} the {Warehouse} and lifts a relic from a *yarn pile*, disturbing a *bug*, and the trap goes off: a huge spiral boulder starts to roll at her. It is actually a **snail**, moving one inch a day. She backflips away out of habit, then checks her watch; three days later the **snail** reaches her boot and asks for a lift."],"裹":["to wrap","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Warehouse} carrying a birthday *fruit*, a melon the size of a sofa. A spell makes his grey *robe* fly off and **wrap** it, sleeves tying a bow. But the magic will not stop, and it goes on to **wrap** a pineapple, a bicycle and finally the wizard himself, until only his cranky nose pokes out."],"昔":["the past","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Beach} hanging up strips of *sun-dried meat*, and one bite peels back his memory like an onion. Layer by layer he falls into **the past**: little Shrek, a smaller swamp, mud between his toes. He sighs, almost happy, until Donkey sits down and insists on telling him all about **the past** as well."],"轩":["high pavilion","{Shrek} hauls a creaking *cart* in {Front} of the {Mint}, loaded with a *drying rack*, to build a **high pavilion** on stilts where nobody can ever bother him. He climbs up, pegs his onions on the rack, and sighs at the silence. Then the ladder creaks, and Donkey pops up in the **high pavilion**, singing."],"谬":["erroneous","{Mario} pops out of a pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} and stomps a *small speech bubble* flapping past on *soaring wings*, squawking that the moon is cheese. Totally **erroneous**. A coin falls out, and it says fish can knit, so he stomps another. Soon the whole hostel is flapping with **erroneous** bubbles, and he is bouncing after them yelling \"Wahoo!\""],"谍":["spy","{Darth Vader} creeps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} under a costume of *leaves*, the galaxy's worst **spy**, because a *small speech bubble* above his head reads only hhhhk-pshhh with each loud breath. The yeti looks up, then lifts its own leaves. It is a **spy** too, spying on him, and it can hear him perfectly well."],"龟":["turtle","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, scratching a rune on a **turtle** with a *bent knife*, then lifts his staff and calls down a *lightning bolt*. It strikes the shell, and the creature streaks across the paving leaving scorch marks. A wizard's **turtle** is never late, he grumbles; it arrives precisely when it means to."],"媳":["daughter-in-law","{Shrek} hides {Inside} the {Beach}, wanting only quiet, when a *woman* gasping for *breath* drags eleven suitcases down the tunnel: his new **daughter-in-law**. He gives his best go-away roar. She fills her lungs and roars right back, blowing every onion off the shelf, and Donkey, thrilled, announces that he adores the **daughter-in-law**."],"姜":["ginger","{James Bond} strides in {Front} of the {Stadium} as a *woman* slips him Q's latest gadget, a knobby root of **ginger** that does one absurd thing. He grates it into the mouth of a passing *sheep*. The sheep turns red, sneezes fire and rockets over the stands with Bond on its back, while the crowd chants for more **ginger**."],"瞎":["blindly","{Shrek} stomps in {Front} of the {Piazza} when a buzzing *pest* flies into his *eye*, and he roars and staggers **blindly** about. He flattens a fruit stall, a café awning and most of a band, swinging **blindly** at Donkey, who will not stop giving directions. He lands in the fountain, and the tourists, thinking it is a show, throw coins."],"冤":["injustice","{Yoshi} waddles in {Front} of the {Mint}, where a *rabbit* is trapped under a *cloth cover*, accused of stealing carrots, while the real thief, a goat, chews nearby. Such **injustice**! His tongue whips away the cloth and gulps down the goat, and he lays it as an egg for the judge as evidence. The rabbit marches round the lawn chanting against **injustice**."],"鸦":["crow","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Spa} after a big black *bird* with a gleaming vampire *fang*, a **crow** with attitude that has just stolen his towel. His legs whirl in the air, his tongue snaps shut on nothing, and \"Yoshi!\" echoes over the lawn. The **crow** perches on a lamp post wearing the towel as a cape and caws with delight."],"蓬":["disheveled","{Pikachu} bounds {Inside} the {Jungle} temple and has a *chance meeting* with a lion in the tall *grass*. Both scream, and a panicked Thunderbolt goes off: every hair stands up, and the mane is left **disheveled** and smoking. \"Pika...\" Pikachu looks down at his own fur, just as **disheveled**, and they borrow a comb from a passing monkey."],"巷":["lane","{Shrek} squeezes through the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} and finds himself in a narrow *alley*, a **lane** so tight his green belly scrapes both walls. Behind him, Donkey is explaining how to breathe in. Stuck like toothpaste, Shrek gives one enormous roar and pops out of the far end of the **lane**, Donkey still talking, as the crowd cheers."],"琳":["gem","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Inn} and vaults into a tiny indoor *grove*, where a *king* sits polishing a **gem** the size of an egg. In one acrobatic flip she swaps it for a bag of sand. The king glances down and howls, a boulder rumbles through the trees, and she swings away, the **gem** flashing in her ponytail."],"栽":["to plant","{Zorro} gallops along in {Front} of the {Island} lighthouse and slashes a giant Z into the sand with his rapier. He drives a *lance* into the middle of the Z and drops a baby *tree* in the hole: that is how he **plants**. Laughing, he rides the whole coast, signing and **planting**, until a forest of Z-shaped orchards hides him and he vanishes."],"沾":["to moisten","The {Joker} bows in {Front} of the {Mansion} and offers a *fortune teller* his lovely squirting flower to sniff. *Water drops* spray out, **moistening** her crystal ball, her tarot cards and her eyebrows. She saw this coming, sighs, and licks a finger to **moisten** the next page of her book, while he cackles and refills the flower."],"诈":["to cheat","The {Joker} deals cards in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, grinning, and every card he turns over is an ace. A *small speech bubble* over his head promises a fair game, but a *jack-in-the-box* springs from his sleeve with five more aces. The guests in towels howl that he **cheats**, and he cackles that **cheating** is the only game in town."],"斋":["to fast","The {Joker} tiptoes in {Front} of a hut on the {Island}, where a monk with a long *beard* and a *tattoo* of an empty bowl has sworn to **fast**. He dangles a rubber doughnut, then a trick coconut that squirts custard. The *beard* quivers and the bowl on the skin rumbles, but the monk keeps his **fast**, and the Joker's huge grin slowly droops."],"瞒":["to conceal","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe {Inside} the {Mansion}, and a giant painted *eye* on the wall swivels to watch him. He head-butts a block, grabs the coin and shoves it under his red cap to **conceal** it. The *eye* narrows, so he stomps a rug flat over the pipe and combs his moustache across his grin to **conceal** that too. Wahoo!"],"彪":["tiger stripes","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Cat Café} and finds a *crouching tiger* crying because it is plain orange. From his utility belt he pulls a Bat-brush with black *bristles*, and in silent, brooding swipes they paint bold **tiger stripes** across its fur. The tiger roars with joy, and Batman growls that every cat in this city deserves **tiger stripes**."],"厄":["distress","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and finds a *trapped man* wedged under a fallen shelf, waving a tiny white flag of **distress**. Casper only wants a friend, so he says hello. The man sees a ghost and shrieks, his **distress** doubling, while Casper's kind little hands keep passing straight through the shelf."],"咨":["to consult","{Zorro} reins in his black horse in {Front} of the {Beehive}, where a *queue* of bees waits to **consult** the masked expert about everything. A huge *mouth* carved in the hive repeats each bee's problem aloud. He swirls his cape, slashes a Z on the answer sheet, and vanishes laughing, then swings back on a branch because the next bee wants to **consult** him too."],"纺":["to spin","{Frodo} trudges wearily into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and slips on the Ring, vanishing at once. One invisible hairy foot works the pedal of a wheel set in a chalk *square*, and it starts to **spin** by itself. Out runs *silk thread*, mile after mile, while loyal Sam stares at the wheel **spinning** for nobody and packs it for the long walk."],"罐":["jar","{Gandalf} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} and finds a *heron* stuck head-first in a *clay jar*. He taps it with his staff, mutters a spell, and the bird pops free in a burst of fireworks, while the **jar** hovers, glowing and cross. Another tap, and every swan wears a small **jar** as a helmet, exactly as he meant."],"桶":["bucket","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Basement} of a shack by the {Lagoon}, baffled by a leaking *tunnel* that is pouring in seawater. He gives his jungle yell, and the apes bend a hollow *tree* into a **bucket**. Tarzan has never seen one and wears it as a hat, until a patient gorilla shows him how a **bucket** scoops water."],"壤":["soil","{Robocop} clanks stiffly into the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, where an *embroidered robe* lies dumped across a heap of *soil*. His targeting display scans one shovelful and reads out: **soil**, dark, earth-based, no permit. He recites a directive, politely arrests the robe for littering, and escorts each clump of **soil** to the exit in handcuffs."],"糕":["cake","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Tower} exactly when he means to, with a sack of *rice* and a hungry *lamb* at his heels. He raises his staff, and the grains whirl up and bake themselves in midair into a giant **cake**, with fireworks for candles. \"You shall not pass!\" he tells the *lamb*, which passes anyway, face-first, into the **cake**."],"颂":["ode","{Sailor Moon} whirls through a long sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, trips over a pigtail and tumbles out into a *town square*. She unrolls a *page* as long as her hair and, in place of her speech about justice, bellows an **ode** to her wand. Luna the cat groans, the *town square* weeps, and the **ode** has ninety more verses."],"膨":["swollen","{Pikachu} sparks {Inside} the {Jungle} under a full *moon*, and with every *drumbeat* from the trees his cheeks charge a little more. \"Pika!\" They grow **swollen** like yellow balloons, then his belly follows, then his ears. One last boom, and the **swollen** little fellow floats up over the canopy, crackling and looking very surprised."],"谐":["harmonious","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} wanting silence, but Donkey will not shut up, and a *small speech bubble* pops from every icicle. Shrek roars at them to sing it *all together* or get out. They do: donkey, yeti and ogre in one huge chord, so **harmonious** that he is furious, then horrified to find he likes being **harmonious**."],"垒":["rampart","{Lara Croft} slides down a rope into the {Basement} of a ruin on the {Lake} and trips an ancient trap: a wave roars along the passage. Ponytail flying, she backflips to a *brick pile*, kicks it across the doorway and packs *soil* behind it until she has a **rampart**. The wave smashes and stops, and she climbs her muddy **rampart** to grab the relic."],"咕":["gurgle","{Gandalf} stops in {Front} of the {Pool} beside an *antique* fountain shaped like a giant *mouth*, dry for a thousand years. He taps it with his staff, speaks a spell, and deep down it begins to **gurgle**. Bubbles wobble up as the *mouth* tries to say something wise, but it can only **gurgle**, so the cranky wizard puffs his pipe and answers in kind."],"隙":["crack","{Shrek} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, and the roar shakes the *hillside* behind it until the wall splits with a loud **crack**. Hoping to be left alone at last, he squeezes his green belly halfway through and sticks fast. Then, through the narrow **crack**, Donkey's nose appears, and Donkey will not shut up."],"辣":["spicy","{Lara Croft} solves a wall puzzle in the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, and an ancient idol spits out a *bundle* of vines holding one cursed *chili*. She takes a careful bite. It is so **spicy** that her ponytail whirls like a propeller and lifts her clear over a rolling boulder, which touches the crumbs and glows red, as **spicy** as the relic."],"绑":["to tie","{Batman} fires his grappling hook across the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and snags a flapping map of the whole *country*. Gruffly he pulls a spool of *silk thread* from his utility belt and **ties** the map to a propeller. Then, still brooding, he **ties** up the mechanics, the toolbox and, by accident, his own cape."],"宠":["to pamper","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Basement} of a hut by the {Lagoon} to **pamper** the baby *dragon* he adopted: silk pillows, foot rubs, a hot-water bottle. It thanks him by burping a flame through the *roof* and eating his kite. \"Good grief,\" he says, and **pampers** it some more, while Snoopy looks on from his kennel in disgust."],"嘿":["hey","{Homer} naps in {Front} of a cabin by the {Lake} while his doughnut-toasting scheme explodes, coating him in *soot*. Only his *mouth* shows through the black. \"**Hey**! D'oh!\" it yells at a passing boat, begging for a snack, but the fishermen see a shouting lump of coal. \"**Hey**!\" they shout back, rowing away fast, and Homer goes back to sleep."],"兑":["to exchange","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, where a *money changer* has set up a cash drawer. With the Force he lifts every coin into the air and booms that he will **exchange** them for Imperial credits. The trembling *money changer* nods, and Vader floats over the waiting room's chairs to **exchange** those as well."],"霉":["mold","{Mario} pops out of a warp pipe {Inside} the {Lake} after a week of *rain* and finds his power-up mushroom furred with green **mold**. He eats it anyway and grows huge and fuzzy, and a *busy mother* chases him with a mop. He stomps, he head-butts a block, and out drops no coin: only more **mold**. Wahoo?"],"挫":["setback","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} yelling \"Me want cookie!\" and finds the jar empty: a terrible **setback**. A *sitting pair* of guards holds up their last cookie, a *helping hand* passes it over, and it slips down the drain. \"Me have **setback** again!\" he wails, and eats their chairs in a spray of crumbs."],"稽":["to check","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of a {Beach} hut in a spotless tuxedo, holding a *grain stalk* that Q swears is a gadget. He clicks it, and it beeps to **check** everything nearby: his cufflinks, a seagull, a passing crab. Every result says harmless. \"Always **check** twice,\" he says, unruffled, as the stalk fires a tiny parachute and carries off his sunglasses."],"辐":["spoke","{Frodo} limps {Inside} the {Pool} on a very long walk, pushing a *cart* whose wheel has just collapsed. Sam passes him a *full jar* of chopsticks, and Frodo wearily slots in each one as a **spoke**. He slips on the Ring to rest, so the cart seems to roll off by itself, and every wobbly **spoke** squeaks all the way up the steps."],"乞":["to beg","{Chewbacca} roars into the {Basement} of a {Beach} café, where a tiny *beggar* holds out a seashell and **begs** for one chip. Moved to a long sad growl nobody understands, Chewbacca sits down, huge and hairy, shell held high, loyal to the cause. Soon the two of them **beg** together, and the terrified seagulls drop a mountain of chips."],"纱":["yarn","{Sherlock} crouches in {Front} of the {Spa} with his magnifying glass over a *pinch* of fluff. \"Elementary, Watson,\" he says, deducing a sheep, a left-handed spinner and a burglar. He tugs, and it twists into *silk thread*, then thick **yarn**. Smugly he follows the **yarn** round the block, Watson trailing, straight back to a hole in his own jumper."],"裙":["skirt","{Chewbacca} trudges {Inside} the {Dunes} and meets a snooty *lord* in a far-too-long *shirt*. The man sneers at his bandolier, so Chewbacca roars and rips the cloth in two with one furious tug. The bottom half drops and knots itself round the lord's waist as a **skirt**. He twirls, delighted, and hands the growling Chewbacca a **skirt** of his own."],"嘻":["giggle","{Shrek} sits grumpily in {Front} of a {Beach} hut, wanting peace, when Donkey starts thumping a *joy drum*. Each beat tickles his green belly. He clamps a hand over his *mouth* and growls, but a tiny **giggle** escapes, and then come ogre-sized **giggles** that shake the onions out of his pockets and blow Donkey across the sand."],"哇":["wow","{Walter White} sets up beakers in {Front} of the {Spa} for a school experiment and, adjusting his glasses, lowers a *jade tablet* into a bubbling flask. With precise science it turns violet, then gold, then shoots up coloured flames. Every student's *mouth* falls open. \"**Wow**!\" they shout, and Walter, proud under his black hat, says the correct word for **wow** is chemistry.","wā"],"绣":["to embroider","{Shrek} locks himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel}, because ogres have layers, and his secret layer is to **embroider**. He stitches a pink *blossom* onto a swamp-green sock with *silk thread*, tongue poking out. Donkey hammers on the door and will not shut up, so Shrek **embroiders** a sign saying GO AWAY and slides it through the gap."],"杖":["staff","The {Joker} limps theatrically into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, leaning on a *walking staff*, and offers it kindly to an old pilot. It is a prank: press the handle and the **staff** bursts into a *tree*, shooting out squirting flowers and playing cards. He cackles as the pilot, lifted off the floor, clings to the **staff** with both hands."],"塘":["pond","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Hangar}, baffled by civilisation, and knocks a sack of *sugar* onto a patch of *soil* where the floor has cracked. Rain leaks in, and a sweet **pond** appears. He gives his jungle yell, and every frog and elephant for miles arrives to sip from the sticky **pond**, then gets stuck there, complaining to him in animal."],"衍":["to spread out","{Yoshi} waddles into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, where four tunnels meet at a *crossroads*, and his long sticky tongue slurps up a puddle of *water drops*. He lays it all as a huge egg, which cracks and lets the water **spread out** down every tunnel. \"Yoshi!\" he cries, flutter-jumping, as a dozen more eggs **spread out** after it in all directions."],"轴":["axle","The {Joker} rolls a *cart* {Inside} the {Boathouse}, grinning, and flicks a trick playing card at it. With a cackle from him, the **axle** pops out like a party snake and shoots through the window, wheels and all, landing in a *sprouting field*. Next morning a crop of purple **axle** plants springs up, and each one squirts the farmer."],"攀":["to climb","{Pikachu} dodges a flying Poké Ball in {Front} of the {Mansion} and bolts up a giant *climbing frame* on the wall. Tiny legs, big panic: he **climbs** and climbs, cheeks sparking at every bar. At the top, \"Pika!\", his Thunderbolt welds the frame to the gutter, and the ball, bouncing after him, starts to **climb** too."],"膊":["upper arm","{Batman} perches {Inside} the {Fort} under the *moon*, brooding, when a herald reads out a *proclamation*: whoever has the strongest **upper arm** commands the fort. Saying nothing, he fires his grappling hook, dangles all night by one **upper arm** without blinking, and at dawn growls that he works alone. Every soldier salutes the cape."],"譬":["example","{Pikachu} scampers into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and meets a *pioneer* who asks what electricity is. He can only say \"Pika!\", so he Thunderbolts the man's kettle as an **example**. A *speech bubble* over the bewildered traveller asks for a clearer one, and Pikachu, cheeks crackling, frizzes the man's beard straight out: **example** number two."],"斌":["refined","{Batman} drops from the sky in {Front} of the {Inn} to stop a huge *warrior*, but the man sips tea with his little finger out and recites the poem on his *tattoo*, which glows at every rhyme. So **refined**! Batman searches his utility belt for a gadget to match, finds a Bat-teacup, and growls in his gruffest voice that he too is **refined**."],"祈":["to pray","{Chewbacca} wades {Inside} the {Beach} with a broken ship part and a heavy *axe*, and kneels at a *small altar* of shells to **pray** for a spare engine. His growls go unanswered, so he **prays** louder, until the blade hums and the shells rattle. A rusty spanner falls from the sky, and he roars his thanks at the clouds, sobbing with loyalty."],"踢":["to kick","{Tarzan} snores on a branch in {Front} of a {Beach} hut until a *lizard* he calls brother runs up his loincloth. His *kicking foot* goes wild: one **kick** flings the lizard over the sea. It lands on a turtle, rides back and, in animal talk, dares him to **kick** it again, so Tarzan gives his jungle yell and swings down for more."],"肆":["unrestrained","{Sailor Moon} transforms in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} for twenty sparkling minutes, her *flowing locks* whipping honey over everything, utterly **unrestrained**. She mistakes a *writing brush* for her moon wand, slops her speech about justice across every wall and cries loudly when it drips. Luna begs for calm, but the bees dance, as **unrestrained** as she is."],"坎":["pit","{Kermit} hops into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} to stage-manage tonight's show, and the *soil* floor gives a huge *yawn*, opening a **pit** under the set. Arms flailing, he screams \"Yaaay!\" and tumbles down with his banjo and half the chorus. From the bottom he announces that it's not easy being green, and it is harder in a **pit**."],"轿":["sedan chair","{James Bond} presses a button in the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, and Q's latest gadget unfolds: a *cart* with no wheels on four *stilts*, which turns out to be a **sedan chair**. It does only one thing: carry him very, very slowly. Unruffled, he straightens his tuxedo as the **sedan chair** totters away, and an angry kitten overtakes him on foot."],"棚":["shed","{Pikachu} and his *buddies* scamper {Inside} the {Jungle} in a storm, and one Thunderbolt fells a *tree* that drops neatly into a lopsided **shed**. Everyone crowds under it, all cheeks and tails, dripping and squeaking. \"Pika!\" he says proudly, and his sparks light up the leaky **shed** like a small yellow lantern."],"泣":["to sob","{Chewbacca} stands on a *podium* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} as medals go to everyone but him. The huge hairy hero growls, quivers and starts to **sob**. *Water drops* the size of grapefruit rain off his fur until the whole platform floats away, and a crab climbs onto his bandolier and **sobs** along with him."],"屡":["repeatedly","{Lara Croft} raids a tomb in the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a stone *lying man* keeps sliding off his slab, **repeatedly** setting off the same rolling boulder. A curator with a *tall bun* heaves him back each time, her hair taking the bumps. Lara backflips over it **repeatedly**, ponytail flying, and the bun gets a fresh dent every round."],"躁":["impatient","{Zorro} waits in the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} for the *birdsong* at the window to stop so he can make a dashing exit, but the birds sing on. His *kicking foot* taps, stamps, then kicks the door. Too **impatient** to wait, he slashes a Z in the door and the perch, swings off the lamp, vanishes laughing, and returns, still **impatient**."],"邱":["surname Qiu","{Chewbacca} fills in a form in {Front} of the {Youth Hostel}, on a small *hillock* below a huge *hillside*. The warden cannot understand his roar, so Chewbacca rips boulders apart and hurls the pieces into letters: Q, I, U, **surname Qiu**. The *hillside* booms it back, and the *hillock* sprouts a sign: home of the **surname Qiu**."],"凰":["phoenix","{Homer} wanders {Inside} the {Swamp} looking for doughnuts and spots a *golden crown* on a *small table*, which wobbles under the weight. \"Mmm… doughnut,\" he says, and bites it. It bursts into flame, and out rises a **phoenix**, shaking ash off its wings. \"D'oh!\" he says with a scorched tongue, as the **phoenix** flies off wearing the crown."],"溢":["to overflow","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and unrolls his sticky tongue to swallow a *spilling dish*, which goes on filling up in his tummy. He lays it as an egg, and *water drops* leak from every spot. The egg begins to **overflow**, then the sink does, then the whole shoreline starts to **overflow**, with surfers riding the wave."],"椎":["vertebra","The {Joker} unveils a prank in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}: a rubber *tree* with a trunk of knobbly bones. A *sparrow* pecks the bottom **vertebra**, and the whole trunk leaps up like a spring, showering the patients with playing cards. He cackles, squirting his flower at every **vertebra** as it rattles back down into place."],"砸":["to smash","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier {Inside} the {Spa}, a borrowed *headband* slipping down over his mask, and slashes a Z at a huge *stone* dangling on a rope. He misses the stone and cuts the rope, and it drops to **smash** a marble tub. Laughing, he gallops through on his black horse, every hoof going on to **smash** a fancy mirror."],"趟":["trip","{Tarzan} swings down a vine into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} from the *attic*, one baffling shirt in his teeth, yelling. A panting *runner* hands him the next one, and up he goes. Each **trip** takes ten seconds, and by dinner the apes have joined in, while the *runner*, collapsing, begs for one final **trip**."],"帘":["curtain","{Lara Croft} rolls under a falling gate {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} and climbs into a secret *cave* of ancient coins. Darts fly from the wall, so she flicks her *towel* over a spear, where it hangs as a **curtain**. The darts stick harmlessly in the **curtain**, and she slips behind it with the relic, ponytail swinging."],"帆":["sail","{Frodo} trudges in {Front} of the {Mansion}, which has floated out to sea, his feet sore from the long walk. The torn *sail* on the flagpole flaps uselessly, so Sam ties on a bath *towel* for a new **sail**. The wind fills it, the house races off across the waves, and Frodo, hairy toes dangling, at last travels by **sail**."],"栖":["to perch","{Chewbacca} climbs a skinny *tree* in {Front} of a {Beach} hut, wanting to **perch** like the parrots around the *bird nest* at the top. Branches creak, his bandolier snags, and the nest wobbles as the parrots complain. He roars, the tree bends double, but loyal to the flock he goes on **perching**, huge and hairy, with a chick on his head."],"窜":["to flee","{Cookie Monster} peers into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, a smoky *cave* where a mouse is roasting a *kebab*. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, googly eyes whirling, and devours the kebab, stick and all, in a spray of crumbs. The mouse **flees**, the swans **flee**, honking, and he lumbers after them, munching the edge of the pond."],"丸":["ball","{Walter White} teaches a lesson {Inside} the {Mansion}, adjusting his glasses over a beaker. He drops in one fizzy *pill* of baking soda, measured exactly, and the foam swells into a huge wobbling **ball**. It rolls out of the beaker and thunders down the hall. \"Precisely as calculated,\" he says, as the **ball** flattens his black hat."],"斩":["to chop","The {Joker} slaps a carrot on a *chopping block* in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and flicks a trick playing card, which **chops** it in two. Cackling, he flicks the whole deck, and it **chops** a broom, a wardrobe and a cake into neat slices. Then the block, being rubber, squirts custard in his huge grin."],"堤":["dike","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in {Front} of a {Beach} café as the tide rises. With one black glove he Force-lifts tons of *soil* into a long **dike**, then burns a *tick mark* into it with his red lightsaber to show the height. The sea crashes in, he booms his disapproval, and the waves, ashamed, back away from the **dike**."],"塌":["to collapse","{Tarzan} gives his jungle yell in {Front} of the {Spa}, built entirely of dried *soil*, and a tired pigeon with *drooping wings* lands on a wall to listen. The wall groans and starts to **collapse**. Tarzan swings in on a vine to help, grabs a beam, and the whole building **collapses** round him, leaving the guests bathing in warm mud."],"贩":["to deal in","{Frodo} slips on the Ring in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and, invisible, spies a *rebel* selling a singing *shell* from a suitcase. \"I **deal in** shells,\" the man whispers to nobody, and the shell hums along. Then he sniffs the air. \"I **deal in** rings too.\" Tempted and weary, Frodo tiptoes away on bare hairy feet, for a very long walk."],"厢":["side room","{Shrek} climbs a *cliff* in {Front} of the {Stadium} to get away from everyone and finds a *lookout* with a little door that creaks open by itself. Behind it: a cosy **side room**, smelling of swamp and onions. He bolts the door, sighs with pleasure and roars at the crowd to stay out, but Donkey is already on the sofa in the **side room**, talking."],"掀":["to lift","{Shrek} stomps up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} looking for a swamp to hide in, and a *helping hand* pokes from a manhole to **lift** the lid. Donkey's wide *grin* appears beneath it, still talking. Shrek roars and **lifts** the whole pavement like a rug, and rows of bankers blink up at him from their desks."],"喀":["coughing sound","{Kermit} flails his arms in {Front} of the {Spa}, stage-managing a steam-bath musical, when a *guest* swallows a lungful of steam. Out of the man's *mouth* comes a dry **coughing sound**, right in the love song. Kermit panics, \"Yaaay!\", and strums his banjo to cover it, but the whole chorus joins in with a **coughing sound** on every beat."],"乖":["well-behaved","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Wine Cellar} and glares over his pipe at a *thousand ants* swarming a picnic. \"You shall not pass!\" he booms, and a glowing arrow marked *north* leaps from his staff. Every ant lines up and marches after it in neat rows, so **well-behaved**. He hands out tiny gold stars, and the snails try to look **well-behaved** too."],"谜":["riddle","{Mario} head-butts a block {Inside} the {Beach}, and out pops no coin, only a *small speech bubble* holding a **riddle**: what has sand but never tells the time? A *lost traveller* scratches his head and begs for directions. Mario stomps, jumps and head-butts again, \"Wahoo!\", but each block hands over another **riddle**, and the poor man stays lost."],"捏":["to pinch","{Naruto} yells a jutsu in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, and forty shadow clones pop up around a lump of *black mud*. Each clone lends a *helping hand* to **pinch** it into a ramen bowl, then they start to **pinch** each other's cheeks by mistake. Poof! Poof! They vanish one by one, and the real Naruto, never giving up, goes on alone."],"阎":["Yan","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Mansion}, past an iron *gate* carved with the name **Yan**, and his tongue shoots down a *trap pit* to fish out a stuck visitor. Gulp! He lays the man as a big spotted egg and politely stamps it. Now every egg in the hall is labelled **Yan**, and the *gate* clangs shut, very pleased."],"滨":["shore","{Batman} roars up in the Batmobile in {Front} of the {Inn}, which stands at the very edge of the **shore**. *Water drops* splash his cape as a soaked *guest of honour* waves from a sinking rowboat, sash trailing. Batman fires his grappling hook, hauls the man up onto the **shore** like a fish, and broods gruffly at the sea."],"虏":["to capture","{Lara Croft} drops on a rope into the {Basement} of the {Pool} and finds a stone *tiger*, guardian of a tomb, doing slow backstroke. A trap springs, her *strong arm* flings a rubber ring, and she **captures** it in one throw. The tiger sulks, wearing the ring like a necklace, while she flips past to **capture** the relic beneath its paw."],"匙":["key","{Sherlock} sits on the {Roof} of the {Beehive}, locked out, and studies a honey *spoon* through his magnifying glass. One crumb, a bent handle, a faint *tick mark* that glints in the sun: \"Elementary, Watson,\" he says. \"This is no spoon but a **key**.\" He slots it in, it clicks, and he smugly hands Watson the sticky **key**."],"芦":["reed","{Lara Croft} dives {Inside} the {Pool} and finds it choked with tall *grass* hiding a stone *door* carved with a puzzle. She snaps a hollow **reed** and blows three notes through it, and the door rumbles open. She swims on through, breathing from the **reed**, her ponytail floating behind her like a question mark."],"苹":["apple","{Pikachu} bounces {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where the canvas has sprouted *grass*, and faces a giant red **apple** in boxing gloves. One punch, and he is *flat* on his back. \"Pika!\" A Thunderbolt later the **apple** is baked, sizzling and smelling of cinnamon, and the crowd climbs through the ropes for a slice."],"卸":["to unload","{Shrek} roars in the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, because a puffing *porter* has delivered Donkey, twelve fairy-tale creatures and their sofas to his private hideout. Grumbling, he starts to **unload**, hurling each sofa out of the door. He **unloads** the creatures next and the *porter* after them, and last of all Donkey, who goes on talking in midair."],"沼":["pond","The {Joker} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Tower} and squirts his flower until *water drops* cover the floor in a muddy **pond**. He paints it green as a lawn, then invites a *town crier* to stroll across. Splash! The man rings his bell, knee-deep, announcing the **pond**, while the Joker cackles and the frogs applaud."],"钥":["key","{Yoshi} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} and finds the door frozen shut. He swallows a pile of *gold coins*, then the *moon* peeping through the skylight, gulp, gulp, and lays one shining egg. It hatches a thin silver **key**. \"Yoshi!\" he cries, his sticky tongue whips the **key** into the lock, and a line of penguins skates out."],"株":["tree trunk","The {Joker} tiptoes in {Front} of the {Pool}, where a *tree* shades the diving board, and coats the **tree trunk** in wet *red lacquer* with a sign saying HUG ME. A swimmer hugs it and comes away bright red. The Joker cackles, squirts his flower and pins a playing card to the **tree trunk** for the next fool."],"祷":["prayer","{Darth Vader} kneels with a long mechanical breath in the {Basement} of the {Tower} before a *small altar*. He Force-floats a *longevity peach* onto it and booms a **prayer**, then, finding the silence disappointing, slowly bends the candlesticks from across the room. Nobody refuses a **prayer** like that: the peach blushes, glows and promises him a very long life."],"剖":["to cut open","{Pikachu} sits in {Front} of the {Boathouse} glaring at a huge clam with a *spitting mouth* that squirts him in the eye. \"Pika!\" A Thunderbolt jolts a *standing knife* on the jetty, and it leaps up and **cuts open** the clam in a shower of sparks. There sits a Poké Ball. Horrified, he zaps again, and the knife **cuts open** another: two balls."],"熙":["bright","{Shrek} roasts an onion over a fire in {Front} of a {Beach} hut, wanting a quiet, dark evening. He burps, and swamp gas hits the *embers*. Their *glow* spreads until the night turns **bright** as noon. Everyone for miles comes to look, Donkey first, and Shrek roars up at the sky, which stays stubbornly **bright**."],"哗":["clang","{Homer} hatches a dim scheme in {Front} of the {Water Park}: cook doughnuts with *fireworks*. He lights the fuse and they rocket into the metal slides: **clang**! **Clang**! \"D'oh!\" Every swimmer's *mouth* drops open, and his saucepan, flung skyward, lands on his bald head with one last, ringing **clang**."],"劈":["to hack","{Pikachu} watches in {Front} of a {Beach} hut as a bearded *pioneer* **hacks** at a coconut with a blunt *knife* and misses. \"Pika!\" A Thunderbolt magnetises the blade, and it flies round on its own, **hacking** the coconut, the door and the palm tree into firewood, with the startled man dangling from the handle."],"怯":["timid","{Chewbacca} peeks into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, all seven feet of him, with his *standing heart* thumping like a drum. For once he is **timid**: his roar comes out as a tiny squeak, and his bandolier rattles. The yeti waves hello, Chewbacca dives for the *exit*, and the yeti, just as **timid**, hides behind an icicle."],"棠":["crab apple","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Hangar}, baffled by a *lampshade* he wears as a hat, when a monkey lobs him a small red **crab apple**. He bites it, and it is so sour that his face freezes in a *blank stare*. The apes hoot and roll on the floor, and all afternoon they pelt him with **crab apple** after sour fruit."],"胳":["arm","{Gandalf} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Hut} under the *moon* when a *visitor* stumbles on a wobbly ladder. With a flick of his staff, his **arm** stretches like toffee to catch her, then on past her into the sky. The *moon* shakes hands with his **arm**, and the wizard says crossly that he meant to do exactly that."],"桩":["stake","The {Joker} pops up in {Front} of a sinking *farmstead* in the {Swamp} and kindly offers to prop it up. He whittles a *tree* into a **stake**, hammers it down, and it honks like a clown's nose and springs back up, showering playing cards. The farmer tries another **stake**, and this one squirts him. A cackle floats across the bog."],"瑰":["precious stone","{Gandalf} stops in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} as a *ghost* and a *king* squabble over a glowing **precious stone**. He raps his staff and booms \"You shall not pass!\" at them both. In a burst of fireworks, the **precious stone** floats up into his pointy hat, and he crankily puffs his pipe as they stare after it."],"娱":["to amuse","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum}, where a *woman* who is a real *loudmouth* is shouting jokes at the statues. To **amuse** her back, he swallows her megaphone and lays it as an egg, which hatches honking. She howls with laughter, and even the dinosaur skeleton is **amused**, rattling its bones at every honk."],"娶":["to marry","{Chewbacca} growls in the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a knight in armour wants to **marry** a *woman* in a painting. Loyal as a best man, Chewbacca rips the frame apart in his excitement, and a *grabbing hand* pulls her out. He roars the whole ceremony, not one word understood, and they **marry** anyway, showered in fur."],"沫":["foam","{Mario} grabs his wrench in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and stomps on a blocked pipe. *Water drops* shoot up as high as a *treetop*, which sneezes them back as white **foam**. He stomps again, \"Wahoo!\", and **foam** pours from every window, while the soldiers slide down the walls with their helmets full of bubbles."],"嗓":["throat","{Sailor Moon} cries so loudly in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} that her **throat** goes raw halfway through a speech about justice. Luna the cat pops a *mulberry* into her *mouth*, and it slides down cool and sweet. Her **throat** healed, she shouts \"In the name of the moon!\", and the high note shatters a plane's windscreen."],"蹲":["to squat","{Darth Vader} floats a slice of *toast* through the air in {Front} of the {Casino} and, finding no chair worthy of him, tucks in his *kicking foot* and **squats** behind his cape. His breathing echoes down the street. A row of pigeons **squats** beside him, and he booms his disapproval, because the helmet will not open for breakfast."],"焚":["to burn","{Frodo} trudges {Inside} the {Funfair} after his longest walk yet and holds the Ring over a small *campfire* to **burn** it. He cannot let go. Sam sighs. A spark jumps to a *grove* of candyfloss trees, and they **burn** with a pink glow that smells of caramel, while the Ring stays perfectly cold in his hand."],"淘":["to wash","{Tarzan} swings through a window {Inside} the {Tower}, baffled by a shelf of muddy *pottery*. He calls an elephant, which sprays *water drops* to **wash** each bowl, and gold dust starts to sparkle at the bottom. Delighted, he yells, and they **wash** the stairs, the monkeys and the bewildered mayor as well."],"嫩":["tender","{Naruto} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, where a *woman* runs a ramen stall for a shouting *drill sergeant*. Naruto slurps first, and the pork is so **tender** that it melts. He sends a shadow clone to pop a bite into the sergeant's mouth. The man stops mid-yell, goes **tender** too, and hugs everyone, clones included."],"韵":["rhyme","{Yoshi} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} and swallows all the *music* in the air, then lays a speckled egg that sings. It hands out words to the camels in *even shares*: sun, fun, run, every line a **rhyme**. One camel tries \"banana\", so Yoshi's sticky tongue whips it away and drops back a proper **rhyme**: bun."],"衬":["lining","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} to mend his zigzag *shirt*, and his *thumb* pokes through the pink **lining**. He tugs, and it all unravels. Good grief. He tries flying it as a kite, a tree eats it, and Snoopy trots off wearing what is left of the **lining** as a scarf."],"匈":["Hungary","{Shrek} bellows at the teenagers in {Front} of the {Youth Club} to get off his land, and his green *chest* swells with every roar until it is the exact shape of **Hungary**, river and all. Donkey will not shut up about it, tracing the map with his nose. The teenagers salute and ask Shrek for goulash from **Hungary**."],"钧":["great","{James Bond} adjusts his cufflinks in {Front} of a palace in the {Dunes} as a sultan counts *gold coins* into *even shares*. Q's briefcase does only one thing: it weighs them. Each coin weighs as much as a camel, a truly **great** load. He lifts his share and sinks in the sand to his bow tie. \"A **great** weight,\" he says, unruffled."],"竖":["vertical","{Sherlock} climbs a *podium* in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and examines one crumb. \"Elementary, Watson: the culprit stood perfectly **vertical**.\" To prove it he stands stiff as a flagpole and smugly orders Watson to do the same, along with the mops, the towels and the rubber ducks, until the whole room is **vertical**."],"峻":["steep","{James Bond} steps from the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} and faces a *mountain* so **steep** that it leans backwards. A *handsome man* in climbing boots slides past on his bottom, grinning. Bond clicks his cufflink, and Q's gadget fires a rope that only holds up his trousers. \"Bit **steep**,\" he says, unruffled, and takes the cable car he has just noticed."],"豹":["leopard","{Batman} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and corners a *badger* that longs to be fierce. He pulls a *ladle* from his utility belt, because of course he has one, dips it in dark paint and dabs spots all over its fur. Now it is a **leopard**! Batman growls that fear is a tool, and the **leopard** practises its roar."],"捞":["to fish up","{Lara Croft} dangles by her ankles in {Front} of the {Tower}, over a moat where a *labourer* has dropped an ancient relic. His *helping hand* grips her boots as she dips a hook to **fish up** the treasure. She **fishes up** a boot, a bicycle and an angry eel, then the relic, which sets off a boulder at once."],"菊":["chrysanthemum","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Museum} with a *handful of rice* that Q swore was harmless. He tosses it on a patch of *grass*, which ripples, and each grain explodes into a golden **chrysanthemum**. The alarms stop and the guards sneeze. Unruffled, he plucks one **chrysanthemum** for his buttonhole and walks out past them all."],"鄙":["despise","{Batman} hangs upside down in the {Basement} of a {Beach} villa, watching a snooty lord sneer at a *village plan*. He **despises** the farmers on the *hillside*, who wave up at him, and their muddy boots. Batman growls from the dark and fires a batarang that pins the man's wig to the wall, and now he **despises** bats too."],"魄":["soul","{Pikachu} falls into the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and lands on a sleeping *ghost*. A reflex Thunderbolt, a startled \"Pika!\", and his **soul** pops from his chest as a *white dove*, flapping round the room and trailing sparks. The ghost catches it in a Poké Ball, looks it over and politely hands him back his **soul**."],"兜":["pocket","{Darth Vader} sits in {Front} of the {Boathouse}, stretches out his long black *legs* and breathes. With the Force he reaches into his **pocket** and floats out a toothbrush, a canoe and a whole lighthouse. A tiny fisherman drifts out last, terrified. \"I am your father,\" Vader booms, and floats him gently back into the **pocket**."],"哄":["coax","{Homer} kneels in the {Basement} of a hut by the {Lagoon}, where a baby crocodile sulks under the bed with his last doughnut. With *joined hands* he pleads, then opens his *mouth* and sings to **coax** it out. His next dim scheme is to dangle another doughnut on a string to **coax** it, but \"Mmm…\", he eats that one himself. \"D'oh!\"","hǒng"],"颖":["clever","{Yoshi} scrambles down into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, swallows a *page* of impossible puzzles and thinks hard with his tummy. Out comes an egg with every answer written on its shell: so **clever**! He rolls it across to the referee, who reads it and declares it the most **clever** egg ever laid."],"镑":["pound","{Batman} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar}, tracking *gold coins* spilled from a *roadside* stall. Each one is stamped with a crown. He tests one with a Bat-scanner from his utility belt, and it reads: one **pound**. He growls at the evidence, and the scanner pings again: another **pound**, and coins pour out of the taps."],"屑":["bits","{Shrek} roars so hard in the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} that a framed *portrait* of a smiling ogre shatters into **bits**. A *lying man* on the bench grumbles and sweeps them together with one toe. Then Donkey sneezes, blowing the **bits** into Shrek's onion soup, and Shrek eats them, picture and all."],"蚁":["ant","{Yoshi} naps in the {Basement} of a {Beach} hut when a *bug* marches in dressed as a *judge*, banging a crumb. Slurp! His tongue swallows it, wig and all. He lays an egg, it cracks, and a tiny **ant** climbs out, still passing sentence, while a thousand **ant** jurors carry his sandwich away."],"壶":["pot","{Homer} floats asleep {Inside} the {Pool} when an old *scholar* wades past, pouring tea from a round teapot. Homer wakes, mumbles \"Mmm…\", and plugs the spout of the **pot** with a doughnut to save it for later. The scheme backfires: the **pot** swells, blows its lid and soaks the old man. \"D'oh!\""],"怡":["pleased","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Beach} and up onto a wooden *stage*, where a band plays just for him. His *standing heart* dances, so he slurps up the whole tune with his tongue, very **pleased**, and lays an egg that hums. \"Yoshi!\" The crabs clap their claws, just as **pleased**, and the egg takes a bow."],"渗":["to seep","{Sherlock} kneels in the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} with a magnifying glass, studying *water drops* on the floor. One sniff and he deduces a sack of *ginseng* brewing under the boards. \"Elementary.\" The tea starts to **seep** up round his shoes as he smugly explains, and it goes on to **seep** into the ghost train, where every skeleton feels young."],"秃":["bald","{Tarzan} swings down in {Front} of the {Pool} and stares, baffled, at a man's *bald head*, which flashes like a mirror in the sun. He calls the apes, who groom it, find nothing and hoot in dismay. He plonks on a wig of moss, but a seagull steals it, and the man is **bald** again, gloriously **bald**."],"迦":["Buddhist sound","{James Bond} walks calmly in {Front} of a temple in the {Piazza}, down a long *road* of chanting monks. Q's tuning fork does only one thing: each tap lights a glowing *plus sign* in the sky and adds one more deep **Buddhist sound**. He tries it once more, unruffled, and even the pigeons coo the same **Buddhist sound**."],"旱":["drought","{Homer} wakes from his nap in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} to find the tub bone-dry and the *sun* blazing through a year-long **drought**. Towels on the *drying rack* crackle, and his doughnut crumbles to dust. \"D'oh!\" His dim scheme is to pour out his lemonade to make rain, but the **drought** just drinks it."],"哟":["oh","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Fort}, and his long tongue tangles in a *promise knot*. His *mouth* pops open: \"**Oh**!\" He swallows the rope and lays an egg tied up in a bow, and the egg trips him over. \"**Oh**, oh, oh!\" The soldiers on the wall think it is a song and join in."],"咸":["salty","{Shrek} stomps {Inside} the {Yen Exchange} to complain about the noise and roars so hard that a sack of *salt* bursts across the counters. A banker licks a coin and winces: **salty**. Shrek shrugs, rubs an onion in the mess and crunches it. Donkey, still talking, licks the cash machine, and it spits out **salty** notes."],"焉":["how","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Mansion}, where a *goal line* peels off the lawn and curls up as a perch for a strange bird. It asks **how** to reach the sky. Yoshi swallows it and lays it as an egg, which feels like a fine answer. The egg cracks, and the bird blinks: \"Yes, but **how**?\""],"谴":["to reprimand","{Chewbacca} is fixing a vault in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} when a *dispatch rider* gallops in to **reprimand** him for ripping the door off. A *small speech bubble* spells out the boss's rage. Chewbacca roars and tears the bubble in two, and the trembling rider **reprimands** his horse instead."],"宛":["as if","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and pours one precise chemical into a *rice bowl* for his class. The grains float up, swirling **as if** they were snow. \"Correct,\" he says, proud under his black hat. He adds a single drop, and they drift back down **as if** nothing had happened."],"稻":["paddy rice","{Darth Vader} wades through the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, flooded with **paddy rice**. With the Force he raises every *grain stalk* from the mud and straightens them in ranks like troops. A *rice scoop* floats along the lines, harvesting. He breathes loudly, disapproves of one crooked row of **paddy rice**, and the ducks salute."],"铸":["to cast","The {Joker} melts *gold coins* in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and pours them into a mould to **cast** a shiny *longevity peach*, cackling. It looks delicious. A hungry swimmer bites it and it squirts custard up his nose. Delighted with his huge grin in the gold, the Joker **casts** a dozen more."],"锻":["to forge","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond}, where a sweaty *blacksmith* hammers *gold coins* on an anvil. Unimpressed, he lifts the anvil with the Force and heats the metal with his red lightsaber to **forge** a tiny black helmet. A swan puts it on, breathing loudly, and he **forges** one for every bird on the water."],"伽":["ga (in names)","{James Bond} strolls out in {Front} of the {Piazza}, where a *standing person* peers through a telescope that Q has rigged to yell \"**Ga**!\" Unruffled, Bond clips a glowing *plus sign* onto the man's head, which adds the sound to his foreign name: **Ga**-li-leo, 伽利略. \"Galileo. Stargazing Galileo,\" Bond says, straightening his tuxedo."],"詹":["verbose","The {Joker} sticks his head out from under the *eaves* in {Front} of the {Mansion} and hands a butler a trick playing card that will not stop talking. It is **verbose**: six hours on its family tree, every king, queen and knave. The eaves drip with boredom, he cackles, and the card, ever more **verbose**, starts on the jokers."],"毙":["to die","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, hunting clues, and finds *twins* lying in a sand *grave*, pretending to **die** with dramatic groans. He checks for a pulse, brooding, and they wink. He pulls a Bat-tickler from his utility belt, they shriek with laughter, and he growls that nobody can **die** while being tickled."],"恍":["hazy","{Homer} wakes from a nap in the {Basement} of a hut in the {Swamp}, where a strange *light* drifts through the fog. His *standing heart* flutters, and everything is **hazy**: the frogs look like doughnuts. \"Mmm…\" he says, and licks one. It croaks. \"D'oh!\" He rubs his eyes, but the room stays **hazy**."],"贬":["to demote","{Batman} broods in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} as the bank boss takes back his golden *shell* badge and hands him a Batmobile with a *flat tyre*. He is **demoted** from night guard to crumb sweeper. Batman opens his utility belt, deduces that the boss forged the books, and **demotes** the boss instead."],"烛":["candle","The {Joker} creeps {Inside} the {Pool} at night and lights a trick **candle** topped with a tiny *campfire*. Blow it out, and back it comes, cackling. A *bug* flutters round it, dizzy. He squirts his flower, the **candle** relights yet again, and the bug, giving up, puts on a little party hat."],"骇":["to startle","{Homer} snores in the {Bathroom} of the {Island}, a doughnut on his belly, when a *wild boar* trots in to steal it. His sudden \"D'oh!\" **startles** the boar, and the boar **startles** a passing *horse*, which rears and kicks him into a palm tree. \"Mmm… coconut,\" he says, and it lands on his bald head."],"芯":["core","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Inn} peeling an onion the size of a sheep, because everything has layers. Layer after layer of *grass* falls away, until at the very **core** a small *heart* is beating. He growls that ogres are like that too, Donkey starts to sing about it, and Shrek quickly wraps the **core** back up."],"汁":["juice","The {Joker} squeezes an orange on a *cross* of sticks in {Front} of the {Beehive}, cackling, and loads the **juice** into his squirting flower. Sticky *water drops* spray across the hive, and the bees dunk their heads and buzz in dizzy zigzags. Then they squirt the **juice** straight back at his huge grin."],"桓":["soapberry","{Homer} wades {Inside} the {Swan Pond} and sees a *tree* so wide that it fills the *horizon*, hung with round fruit. \"Mmm… doughnut,\" he says, and bites a **soapberry**. Bubbles foam from his mouth and out of his ears. \"D'oh!\" The swans peck at another **soapberry** and float off in a cloud of suds."],"坊":["lane","{Frodo} plods in {Front} of the {Hangar}, on the last mile of a very long walk, down a narrow **lane** of bare *soil*. Rows of *square* houses lean in to watch his hairy feet go by. He slips on the Ring to escape their stares, but the **lane** goes on just the same, and Sam, loyal as ever, offers to carry him."],"驴":["donkey","{Lara Croft} leads a small grey *horse* {Inside} the {Museum} to carry relics, but at a stone *door* it plants its hooves. It is a stubborn **donkey**. She solves the door's puzzle, backflips over the darts and hauls on the rope, but it will not budge. Then a boulder rolls up behind, and the **donkey** overtakes her at a gallop."],"朽":["rotten","{Shrek} hides from Donkey in the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel}, leaning on the old *tree* that holds up the ceiling. He sighs, and one onion-scented *puff of breath* makes it crumble like biscuit, completely **rotten**. Beds and backpackers drop down beside him, for the floorboards are **rotten** too, and there goes his peace."],"靖":["peaceful","{James Bond} steps from the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} in his tuxedo, ready for a fight, but *moss* has crept over the ropes, the old *podium* is sinking under it, and the boxers snooze. He presses Q's watch, which only plays a lullaby. Everything is so **peaceful** that he lies down, unruffled, as **peaceful** as a kitten."],"佣":["to hire","{Yoshi} sits in {Front} of a hut by the {Lagoon}, leaking everywhere, because he has swallowed a wave. He decides to **hire** help, and a *standing person* climbs up with a *bucket*. Each time she bails him out, he pays her with an egg, and every egg hatches a cousin, so soon he has to **hire** her whole family."],"汝":["thou","{Robocop} clanks stiffly into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a *woman* sits beside a fountain of *water drops* that spray his visor. His display switches to old-fashioned mode, and he reads out his directive: \"**Thou** art under polite arrest for dripping.\" She giggles and replies, \"And **thou** art rusty.\" He blushes and squirts oil."],"碌":["busy","{Lara Croft} sprints through the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, so **busy** she cannot stop: dodging a rolling *stone*, scribbling traps in her *logbook*, scaling a shower pipe, ponytail whirling. A second boulder appears, and she notes it down mid-flip. Even hanging from the ceiling she stays **busy**, solving the towel rack."],"迄":["until","{Chewbacca} bursts from the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} onto a long dusty *road* and finds a tired *beggar* shuffling along. Loyal to the end, he hoists the man onto his shoulders and roars that he will carry him **until** they reach the sea. He keeps going **until** the waves reach his furry nose, and the beggar, up top, waves."],"冀":["Hebei","{James Bond} steps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} wearing a *strange mask* from Q that does one thing: it points *north*. He follows it, unruffled, in his tuxedo, past Beijing and on to **Hebei**. \"Bond. James Bond,\" he says, and everyone in **Hebei** lifts an identical mask and says exactly the same."],"荆":["chaste tree","{James Bond} strolls in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} in his tuxedo and presses a gadget from Q, a wristwatch that grows one **chaste tree** on command. Purple blossom bursts through the *grass* and hoists the town *stocks* into the air, with a furious referee locked in them. Bond straightens his bow tie, snips a sprig of **chaste tree** for his lapel and murmurs, 'Branching out.'"],"崔":["Cui","{Cookie Monster} sits in {Front} of the {Waiting Room} and devours a giant cookie iced with one word, the family name **Cui**. The *lofty peak* beneath him is furious, shaking him by the bottom and booming its owners' name through a spray of crumbs. 'Me want more **Cui**!' he roars, and he starts on the snowy summit, which tastes of vanilla."],"雁":["wild goose","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps up a *cliff* to the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and his sticky tongue snatches a *wild goose* out of the sky mid-honk. Gulp, and he lays it as a speckled egg, which cracks open on a furious **wild goose**. The *cliff* shakes as the whole V of geese dive-bombs him, and every **wild goose** honks his name back at him."],"绅":["gentry","{Sherlock} raises his magnifying glass in {Front} of the {Funfair} and studies one crumb of caviar on a candyfloss stick. 'Elementary, Watson: **gentry**,' he says, smugly. A *silk thread* trails from the crumb to a duke's sash, pinned by a golden *skewer* that yanks him off the dodgems, and all the **gentry** tumble after him in their top hats."],"珊":["coral","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Mansion}, sunk on the sea floor, his pipe blowing bubbles as he squints at a pink twig. A weeping *king* swims up, and his *bamboo book* has turned to **coral**, page by page. One glance at the barnacled bookmark and Sherlock deduces it all: the *king* reads in the bath, and now even Watson's moustache is sprouting **coral**."],"榜":["list of names","{Batman} fires his grappling hook in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and hauls a whole *tree* in from the *roadside*, then pins a **list of names** to its trunk with a batarang. The *roadside* comes along too, honking with traffic and flapping its signs. He growls every villain's name in his gruff voice, and at the bottom of the **list of names** he finds his own, in Alfred's handwriting."],"诵":["to recite","{Sailor Moon} twirls through her long sparkly transformation in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon}, then begins to **recite** her speech about justice, word for word. Each line pops out as a *small speech bubble* and drifts into a *tunnel*, which echoes it back wrong. She forgets line nine and howls with tears until Luna the cat whispers it, and the fish **recite** the rest in chorus."],"傍":["near","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} holding a gadget from his utility belt that beeps when he is **near** a suspect. It shrieks beside a *standing person* selling buns, and a strip of *roadside* rolls in under the door to give the stall somewhere to park. Batman edges closer, cape brushing noses, and growls that this is how **near** justice gets."],"彦":["accomplished","{Yoshi} licks up a *gentleman* in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} with one swipe of his sticky tongue, swallows him and lays him as an egg. The egg is even more **accomplished** than he was: it plays the violin, fences with a toothbrush and recites sonnets through its shell. The *gentleman* hatches and bows, and Yoshi, the least **accomplished** dinosaur present, says his own name."],"醇":["alcohol","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Casino} hugging a *wine jug* for the *feast*, and naturally a croupier whips it away like a football at the last second. Charlie flies through the air, lands flat, and a splash of strong **alcohol** soaks his zigzag shirt. The *feast* slides off its table in the fumes, the roulette wheel spins dizzily, and all that **alcohol** only makes him sigh, 'Good grief.'"],"笛":["flute","{Darth Vader} raises one black glove {Inside} the {Beach}, and the Force hollows a stalk of *bamboo* into a **flute**. It floats up to his helmet, and his loud breathing plays through it, one long gloomy note after another. A *sprouting field* bursts through the sand and sways in time, while he booms his disapproval at every wrong note from the **flute**."],"禽":["fowl","{Chewbacca} growls {Inside} the {Inn} while fixing a ship's engine on the landing, and only the *fowl* understand him. Hens pass the spanners, ducks hold the torch and a goose dangles from his bandolier. When a bolt snaps he roars and rips a sack of corn in half, and each loyal **fowl** roars right back, until the last **fowl** tightens the bolt with its beak."],"勿":["do not","{Walter White} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} in goggles, teaching his chemistry class, and a red *pennant* snaps up over each beaker, reading **do not** mix. A student reaches for the blue flask, and the *pennant* whacks his wrist. Walter taps the glass, announces that he is the one who knocks, and chalks a precise new rule on the wall: **do not** knock."],"娟":["graceful","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Mint} and steps into Q's latest shoes, which make the wearer **graceful** for exactly ten seconds. He pirouettes past a *woman* dancing on a line spun by a tiny *silkworm*, and the *silkworm* applauds with all its legs. At second eleven he lands in a coin bucket, unruffled, and remarks that being **graceful** is overrated."],"瞄":["to take aim","{Mario} crouches {Inside} the {Cat Café}, shuts one *eye* and tries to **take aim** for the perfect stomp on a mushroom thief hiding in a pot of *young crop*. The sprouts of *young crop* shuffle sideways to hide him. 'Wahoo!' Mario leaps, and in mid-air all twenty cats **take aim** at his red cap, so he lands on none of them and bags one coin."],"幢":["building counter","The {Joker} cackles in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, clicking a giant **building counter** as he deals a trick playing card onto each stilt house. A *towel* whips down from a ceiling and snatches the cards away, and a *schoolkid* paddles past, swapping all the houses round. The Joker squirts his flower at the **building counter**, it resets to zero, and he howls with delight.","zhuàng"],"寇":["to plunder","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, clipboard out, as bandits drop through the *roof* to **plunder** his show. He stage-manages it anyway, yelling cues, and they **plunder** the props in perfect time: golden oars, crowns, one rubber duck. The *roof* flaps shut behind them like a curtain, and Kermit strums his banjo and sighs that it's not easy being robbed."],"睹":["to observe","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and uses the Force to float one huge glass *eye* behind a *busy man*, so he can **observe** him in secret. The man polishes each tile with a tiny cloth, then polishes a duck. Vader goes on to **observe** every stroke, booms his disapproval of the grouting, and the *busy man* polishes the eye."],"贿":["bribery","{Homer} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} until a sly clerk appears *holding meat* and offers him a pearly *shell* to move up the queue. 'Mmm, **bribery**,' says Homer, and he hatches a dim scheme of his own, stuffing a half-eaten doughnut in the *shell* for the receptionist. She reports the **bribery**, the doughnut is confiscated, and Homer wails, 'D'oh!'"],"踩":["to step on","{Cookie Monster} thunders into the {Basement} of the {Island} after a trail of crumbs, just as a *fruit picker* spills a basket of cookies across the floor. His *kicking foot* comes down to **step on** one: crunch. 'Me **step on** cookie!' he wails, googly eyes spinning, and he devours the foot-shaped crumbs, the basket and the mango the picker was holding."],"霆":["clap of thunder","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and lets out his jungle yell, which arrives as a **clap of thunder**. The *rain* falls down in shock, pouring into the *courtyard* next door until it spills over the ropes. Baffled by the bell, Tarzan asks the elephants what it wants, yells again, and a second **clap of thunder** knocks out the champion."],"呜":["whimper","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in {Front} of the {Pool} and sets a soggy *crow* on the lab bench, a thermometer in its *mouth*. It lets out a tiny **whimper**, and he captures it in a beaker, proud of the precise pitch. He heats it gently, explains the science to his class, and the **whimper** boils into a long sad steam that the bird sniffles back up."],"拱":["to cup hands","{Gandalf} mutters a spell in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon} when a pipe starts to drip, and a floating *helping hand* appears from the tip of his staff. It joins his own *joined hands* to **cup hands** under the leak. Crankily he sets off a tiny firework in the water they hold, and a goldfish rises up to **cup hands** with its fins."],"妃":["imperial consort","{Frodo} trudges on bare hairy feet in {Front} of the {Lake}, and a *woman* in phoenix robes, the **imperial consort**, demands his Ring for her crown. He slips it on and turns invisible, but she flicks a *coiled rope* that lassoes his ankle anyway. Sam wades in with a frying pan, and the **imperial consort** wins nothing but a very long walk home."],"蔑":["to belittle","{Mario} head-butts a block in the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave}, out pops a coin, and the yeti yawns. It loves to **belittle** everything, even the mushroom that makes him grow ten feet tall. A blade of *grass* between its teeth chimes in, sneering at his moustache, so Mario stomps them both with a 'Wahoo!' and the flattened yeti carries on to **belittle** the stomp."],"谕":["decree","{Yoshi} paddles a *dugout canoe* into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} when a *small speech bubble* drifts from the emperor's statue, carrying a royal **decree**. His tongue shoots out, gulps it down, and he lays it as an egg stamped with a red seal. The egg cracks and bellows the **decree** that everyone must paddle, and the *dugout canoe* starts rowing itself round the marble hall, towing the curators."],"缚":["to bind","{Frodo} limps into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, and a giant spider, the very sort he dreads, pounces to **bind** him in *silk thread* from hairy toes to curly head. A *proclamation* flutters down declaring that all hobbits shall be wrapped. Loyal Sam arrives, shouts his name and unwinds him, then uses the same thread to **bind** the spider to a lilo."],"诡":["sly","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room} exactly when he means to, and catches a *teetering man* slipping a *small speech bubble* to the clerk. It whispers that the man has waited a hundred years, which is **sly**, since he came at noon. 'You shall not pass!' cries Gandalf, tapping his staff, and the bubble becomes a toad, even more **sly**, who slips him a ticket."],"篷":["sail","{Pikachu} sparks {Inside} the {Jungle} and weaves *bamboo* into a tiny **sail**, lashing it to his Poké Ball to make a boat. A *chance meeting* with a startled parrot ends in a 'Pika!' and a Thunderbolt that crackles through the air. The **sail** fills with electric wind, and off he bowls through the trees, cheeks fizzing, with the parrot perched on top."],"淹":["to flood","{Yoshi} gulps down the whole fountain in {Front} of the {Mansion} just as a *sudden flash* of lightning startles him into laying it as an egg. The egg splits, *water drops* burst out by the billion, and they **flood** the lawn, the gardens and the ground floor. He flutter-jumps above the waves crying his own name while the rising water goes on to **flood** the valley."],"腕":["wrist","{Walter White} stands in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} in his goggles, stirring a glowing solution in a *rice bowl* with a flick of his **wrist**, exactly forty turns. The *moon* in the window pulls the liquid up like a tide. He taps the glass and proudly notes that only a scientist's **wrist** could manage it, and then the rice sets into a solid white cuff."],"煮":["to boil","The {Joker} cackles in the {Basement} of the {Pool}, blowing on *embers* under a giant pot and tricking a *busy man* into tossing in all his noodles. A label on the pot says never **boil**, which is the joke, since he squirts his flower on the coals and it starts to **boil** at once. Rubber ducks pop out wearing green wigs, and the man keeps stirring."],"倩":["pretty","{Chewbacca} squeezes into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and gapes at a *standing person* in a gown of fresh *moss*, so **pretty** the clerks forget to count. He growls a compliment only friends could understand, then rips the mirror off the wall in a temper at his own reflection. The *moss* creeps across his fur, he looks almost **pretty**, and a frog proposes."],"卒":["soldier","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier {Inside} the {Pool} and, with three flicks of his rapier, slashes a Z across a wooden *pawn* from a giant chessboard. It snaps to attention, a real **soldier** in a tiny helmet. The *pawn* marches into the deep end, gurgling salutes, and twenty more follow, each a Z-marked **soldier**, as Zorro vanishes laughing over the diving board."],"勘":["to survey","{Kermit} hops about in {Front} of the {Mansion} with a telescope to **survey** the grounds for tonight's show, flailing his one *strong arm*. That arm is gripping an *overflowing bowl* of soup, and each flail soaks another member of the cast. He hops up on the sundial to **survey** the wreckage, screams 'Yaaay!' and strums a panicked banjo chord as the chorus line slides away."],"馨":["fragrant","{Shrek} roars in {Front} of the {Inn} because someone has lit *incense* and rung a *chime stone*, and the air has turned horribly **fragrant**. All he wanted was to be left alone with his swamp stink. He bites a raw onion to fight back, but Donkey will not shut up, the *chime stone* keeps ringing, and even his layers now smell **fragrant**."],"逗":["to tease","{Darth Vader} raises one glove in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and lifts a *bean* with the Force to **tease** a hungry duck. Each time its beak gets near, the bean floats a little further down the *road*, which curls along like a lazy river. Breathing loudly, he booms his disapproval of the duck's effort and goes on to **tease** it all the way to the bakery."],"甸":["outskirts","{Darth Vader} lifts the whole {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} with the Force and sets it down far out in the **outskirts**, among mile after mile of *rice field*. A farmer's *blanket* flaps off in the blast of his breathing and wraps round his helmet. Out here in the **outskirts** nobody is impressed, so he tells the *rice field* he is its father, and it only rustles."],"贱":["cheap","{James Bond} falls down a chute into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} and lands in a *bargain bin*, where Q has stocked this mission's gadgets. Everything is **cheap**: the exploding pen only squeaks, the jet pack is a fan, the tuxedo is a paper bag. The *bargain bin* slaps a one-coin sticker on his forehead and he sighs, 'Bond. **Cheap** Bond.'"],"炒":["to stir-fry","{Charlie Brown} lights a *campfire* in the {Basement} of the {Tower} and tosses noodles in a wok to **stir-fry** them for Snoopy. He adds a *pinch* of chilli, and at the last second the noodles leap away from his spoon like that football, so he falls flat on his back. They **stir-fry** themselves in a whirlwind round the room, and he sighs, 'Good grief.'"],"灿":["glorious","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and lights a *campfire* under a *mountain* of cookies, to toast them all at once. The blaze turns the night gold, **glorious**, and the *mountain* glows like a sunrise made of chocolate chips. 'Me think this **glorious**!' he bellows, spraying crumbs, and he eats the mountain, the firelight and most of the door."],"敞":["spacious","{Charlie Brown} goes down to the {Basement} of the {Hangar} with a *cane* and knocks out each wall, because here, at last, it is so **spacious** that no tree can catch his kite. The *attic* crashes down in a heap of dust, and planes taxi in for a look. The kite rises beautifully in all that **spacious** air, and a tree sprouts through the floor and eats it."],"蜡":["wax","{Lara Croft} somersaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and finds an ancient relic sealed in yellow **wax**, guarded by a *bug* the size of a boot. It gnaws a slab of *sun-dried meat* on a pressure plate, and she snatches the meat away, which springs the trap. Hot **wax** gushes from the walls, and she climbs out, ponytail shining, over the coated guests."],"囚":["prisoner","{Chewbacca} storms {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} and finds a *person* locked behind a *fence* in the hallway, a **prisoner** of the laundry rules. Roaring with loyalty, he rips the *fence* apart with his bare paws and hugs him. The freed man weeps, because now he must do laundry, so Chewbacca fixes the fence around himself and sits down, a very hairy **prisoner**."],"栗":["chestnut","{Lara Croft} opens a *cabinet* in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, lifts out a golden relic and hears a click. A giant spiky **chestnut** drops from a *tree* and rolls down a stone chute after her like the boulder in every tomb she has ever raided. She flips, cartwheels and vaults clear, ponytail flying, and the **chestnut** bursts on the sand and roasts in the sun."],"辜":["crime","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Pool}, smells smoke, and taps an *antique* vase with his staff, because a spell can reveal any **crime**. Out spray fireworks and a *chili* that glows with guilt. 'You shall not pass!' he thunders at it, and the chili sneezes sparks. Crankily lighting his pipe on it, he declares the **crime** solved and arrests the vase as well."],"垫":["cushion","{Darth Vader} lowers himself in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, lifting a heap of *soil* with the Force and shaping it into a giant **cushion**. A guard snaps *handcuffs* on him, and he Force-chokes the *handcuffs* until they squeal and drop off. Then he sinks into the **cushion**, cape spread, his loud breathing slowing to a snore that rattles the vault."],"妒":["to envy","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, breathing loudly, and sees a *woman* behind a glass *door*, twirling a sparkly pool noodle that outshines his red lightsaber. He starts to **envy** it so hard that the *door* rattles in the Force. He booms his disapproval and lifts the noodle away, and now the ducks all **envy** him."],"魁":["chief","{Kermit} flails {Inside} the {Waiting Room} with his clipboard, auditioning a crowd of spirits to be **chief** of tonight's show. The biggest *ghost* grabs the *dipper* and ladles soup over the others without waiting for a cue, which settles it: that one is **chief**. Kermit screams 'Yaaay!', plays a banjo fanfare, and the rest of the chorus bows, dripping."],"谣":["rumor","{Yoshi} sits {Inside} the {Tower} and says the only thing he can say, his own name, and a *small speech bubble* carries it up the stairs as a **rumor**. By the second floor it says the tower is cheese. By the top, the **rumor** says the tower is a giant egg he laid, so he licks the wall with his long tongue, just to check."],"寞":["lonesome","{Mario} stomps the last enemy in the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} and looks up through the leaky *roof* at the *sunset*, which sinks without a word. A note says the princess is in another castle, and he feels terribly **lonesome**. He head-butts a block for company, but even the coin hops away, leaving him the most **lonesome** plumber alive, whispering a tiny 'Wahoo.'"],"蜀":["Sichuan","{Sherlock} wades into the {Basement} of the {Pool} with a *fishing net* and scoops up a *curled worm*, which he studies through his magnifying glass. One tingling peppercorn on its tail is enough: 'Elementary, Watson, it has come from **Sichuan**.' The worm uncurls, burps chilli fire across his deerstalker, and the whole pool begins to taste of **Sichuan** hot pot."],"甩":["to fling","{Sherlock} tests a theory in the {Basement} of the {Wine Cellar} by swinging a *bucket* round his head, because the only way to read a stain is to **fling** something. It flies off, lands on a *ski* and zooms across the barrels, and he deduces the rest from its path. Thrilled, he starts to **fling** bottles, corks and his pipe, while Watson dives for cover."],"涯":["horizon","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Spa} off a *cliff edge*, where *water drops* spray up from a painted sea, and he shoots his sticky tongue out at the **horizon**. It sticks. He reels the whole **horizon** in like a green noodle, swallows it and lays it as one long flat egg, and the *cliff edge* teeters, having nothing left to look at."],"枕":["pillow","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Funfair} and carves a *tree* stump into a *pillow*, then hides a squeaker in it as a prank. Each ghost-train skeleton who lies on the **pillow** lets out a rude honk and sits up mortified. He cackles so hard that his green hair stands on end, and he deals out a trick card for every **pillow** he has rigged."],"丐":["beggar","{Gandalf} rows up to the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and a **beggar** holds out a *begging bowl*, asking for a pinch of pipe-weed. Cranky but wise, Gandalf taps the *begging bowl* with his staff and mutters a spell. Fireworks fizz up, gold pours out and a coconut tree sprouts, and the **beggar** is now the richest man around, still begging for pipe-weed."],"泳":["to swim","{Yoshi} tumbles into the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, where a *stream* sweeps across the floor, and he suddenly remembers he cannot **swim**. He flutter-jumps in panic, kicking *water drops* everywhere, and gulps down fish after fish, laying each as an egg that floats. Perched on his raft of eggs, he watches the little fish hatch and **swim** circles round him."],"奎":["crotch","{Kermit} hops {Inside} the {Waiting Room} with his banjo, late for his own show, and a *big man* with his legs planted wide blocks the way. He flails, holds a *jade tablet* over his head like a shield and leaps straight at the **crotch** of those enormous trousers. Rrrip goes the **crotch**, the big man giggles, and Kermit shrieks 'Yaaay!' from the far side."],"泌":["to secrete","{Mario} kneels in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} with his plumber's wrench, because a giant *pinned heart* has sprung a leak. It starts to **secrete** *water drops* like sweat, and each one he stops pops up somewhere else. He stomps the valve, a coin flies out, and now the heart begins to **secrete** perfume, so the crabs line up and Mario sighs, 'Wahoo.'"],"逾":["to exceed","{Yoshi} paddles a *dugout canoe* {Inside} the {Museum} along a *road* painted across the floor, where a sign sets the limit at slow. He flutter-jumps clean over the rope, canoe and all, and goes on to **exceed** it by a mile. The *road* curls up after him, the guards give chase, and each egg he throws makes them **exceed** it too."],"叮":["to sting","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} when a mosquito whose *mouth* is tipped with a rusty *nail* tries to **sting** his helmet. Clank, clank. Vader Force-chokes the *nail* until it squeaks and booms his disapproval, so the mosquito drifts off to **sting** the champion on the nose, and the champion punches the referee."],"黛":["eyebrow paint","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and with the Force he stirs *soot* and oil into **eyebrow paint**, floating a brush through the air. It draws two thick black arches on his helmet, so he looks permanently surprised. His *stand-in* walks on stage wearing them too, the crowd gasps, and every parrot squawks for **eyebrow paint**."],"燥":["dry","{Zorro} flings open the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} with a swish of his cape, and a hot wind from a *campfire* blasts out, the air so **dry** that his rapier throws sparks. He slashes a Z on the wall and it crumbles to dust. The morning *birdsong* cracks into croaks, the parrots crackle, and his moustache goes **dry** as toast, yet he vanishes, laughing hoarsely."],"掷":["to throw","The {Joker} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and starts to **throw** trick playing cards at the bees, cackling. A *helping hand* springs from his sleeve on a spring and grabs a *pitcher* of honey, and he goes on to **throw** that too. It bursts on his own purple suit, so the bees forgive him and he grins, sticky and thrilled."],"藉":["to tread on","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} in Q's newest spring-loaded shoes, which can only **tread on** things. The sand gives way to a *ploughed field*, whose furrows ripple to trip him, while *grass* whips at his ankles in protest. He has to **tread on** a tomato, a melon and a sleeping crab before stepping off, unruffled, to say, 'Mind the step.'"],"枢":["hinge","{Sherlock} stops in {Front} of the {Pool} at a giant gate held up by a *tree*, pulls out his magnifying glass and hears one squeak. A glance at the *district map* and a sniff of oil, and he deduces it: 'Elementary, Watson, the **hinge**.' He gives the **hinge** a smug tap with his pipe, and the gate spins so fast that Watson flies off."],"憎":["to detest","{Zorro} leaps from his black horse in {Front} of the {Jungle}, his *standing heart* burning, and slashes a Z through a bamboo *steamer*, for he must **detest** dumplings with all his dashing soul. The monkeys only steam more of them. He goes on to **detest** the monkeys too, until one hands him a dumpling, and he vanishes laughing with his mouth full."],"鲸":["whale","{James Bond} adjusts his cufflinks in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} when a **whale** bursts through the canvas and swallows him, tuxedo and all. This *fish* carries a tiny *palace* on its back, whose chandeliers rattle at every gulp. Bond inflates Q's pocket submarine, sails out of the **whale** through its blowhole, lands on the palace balcony and says it was a whale of a time."],"弘":["great","{Homer} wanders {Inside} the {Lagoon} with a *bow* taller than a house and a dim scheme: fire a doughnut far enough to feed him for life. He draws it back past his *elbow*, and the shot is a **great** one, circling the whole planet. 'Mmm, **great**,' he says, mouth open, and it comes round again and bonks him on the head. 'D'oh!'"],"倚":["to lean on","{Yoshi} curls up in the {Basement} of the {Beach} and starts to **lean on** a *standing person*, who never moves, ever. The *oddball* opens one eye and leans back, so they prop each other up like two playing cards. Yoshi yawns, stretches his long tongue and lays a startled egg, and now all three **lean on** one another."],"侮":["to insult","{Walter White} measures chlorine in the {Basement} of the {Pool} when a *standing person* comes down to **insult** his goatee, calling it seaweed. Walter pushes up his glasses and takes it as a chemistry problem, weighing every word on his precise scale. The *busy mother* who runs the pool marches over to **insult** the insulter, and Walter records the reaction, proud of the data."],"藩":["hedge","{Frodo} plods in {Front} of the {Mansion} on bare hairy feet, weary from a very long walk, and finds his way barred by a **hedge** of *grass* and twigs. A goat kicks over a *slop bucket*, and the **hedge** gobbles the slops and swells taller than the chimneys. Frodo slips on the Ring to sneak through, while loyal Sam sighs and picks up the shears."],"拂":["to brush off","{Frodo} tiptoes {Inside} the {Pool} on bare feet when a *dollar sign* floats up and sticks in the hair on his toes, tempting him like the Ring. A *helping hand* darts out to **brush off** the money, but more arrive, whispering sweetly. Weary but stubborn, he goes on to **brush off** each one, and the swimmers dive after them, leaving him alone with Sam."],"鹤":["crane","{Homer} pokes his head into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and spots a tall white *crane* napping on one leg, which gives him a dim idea. A smaller *bird* tries to copy it and falls over, and Homer tries too, doughnut in hand. 'D'oh!' he yells as he topples, and the **crane** gulps the doughnut, while another **crane** lifts off and leaves him."],"蚀":["to eat into","{Sherlock} sits {Inside} the {Beehive} with a *side dish* of honey cakes, and his magnifying glass finds one neat tiny hole. 'Elementary,' he says smugly, for a greedy *bug* has begun to **eat into** the cake, crumb by crumb. He follows the trail with his pipe as it goes on to **eat into** the staircase, the hive and finally Watson's boots."],"浆":["thick liquid","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Stadium} and orders his *water* shaken, not stirred, with a spoon of flour in Q's cocktail shaker. The shaker whirrs until the *water* thickens to a gloopy **thick liquid** that glugs out over the pitch. Footballers slide past on their bellies, the goalposts sink, and Bond, spotless, sips some **thick liquid** and calls it a sticky situation."],"芙":["lotus","{Frodo} wades {Inside} the {Pool} on his hairy feet, longing for one flat place to rest, and clambers onto a pink **lotus** ringed with *grass*. A *husband* in swim trunks is already sitting on it and refuses to budge, so Frodo slips on the Ring and sits on him invisibly. The man yelps, and the **lotus** bobs off like a boat."],"垃":["garbage","{Lara Croft} rappels down in {Front} of the {Spa} and finds a towering mound of **garbage** that she treats like a lost tomb, banana skins and *soil* from potted plants forming its walls. She climbs it hand over hand, ponytail swinging, to a *podium* at the peak. Lifting the relic, an old slipper, sets off the trap, and **garbage** rolls after her like a boulder."],"烤":["to roast","{Kermit} lights a *campfire* in the {Basement} of the {Tower} to **roast** flies on a stick while cramming for his stage-management *exam*. The *exam* paper catches a spark and flaps round the room, and he hops after it with his arms flailing. 'Yaaay!' he screams as the flies **roast** black, and he strums a banjo chord, eating them anyway."],"晒":["to bask","{Sherlock} climbs out of the {Bathroom} of the {Island} to **bask** in the hot *sun*, smug as ever, pipe in mouth, deducing nothing at all. He lies so still that a bird builds a *bird nest* in his deerstalker, and Watson takes notes. One sunburn line on his nose tells him all he needs, and the chicks **bask** beside him in a row."],"霜":["frost","{Sherlock} strides out in {Front} of the {Swamp} after a night of freezing *rain*, and his magnifying glass settles on one white crystal of **frost**. From his *lookout* he deduces the culprit: 'Elementary, Watson, the alligators have been skating.' Sure enough, they glide past with **frost** on their eyelashes, and he plays his violin at them until his bow freezes."],"剿":["to wipe out","{James Bond} slips into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} with Q's latest gadget, a pen that can **wipe out** anything it circles. He circles a *nest* of wind-up mice, and it vanishes with a polite pop. A *standing knife* leaps off the table to defend the crumbs, so he circles that too, clicks the pen shut and says, 'Nothing left to **wipe out**.'"],"蕴":["to store up","{Yoshi} trots through the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes} with a line of eggs bouncing behind him, the way he always does, to **store up** for winter. He swallows dry *grass*, gulps bales of *cotton padding* and lays each as an egg that joins the queue. Soon he can **store up** no more: the *cotton padding* eggs swell soft and the *grass* ones sprout."],"圾":["rubbish","{James Bond} parachutes down in {Front} of the {Beach} and opens Q's briefcase, which does nothing but suck up **rubbish**. Bags, bottles and a wet boot whoosh past, pursued by a *chaser* who sprints across the *soil* shouting for his bin. The case bursts, **rubbish** rains on the tuxedo, and Bond flicks away one banana skin and says, 'Waste not.'"],"绸":["silk","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Boathouse} with a new kite of shining **silk**, certain that this time it will fly. A spider runs a *silk thread* round and round in a *circuit*, and at once the kite is wrapped to a post. 'Good grief,' he sighs, tugging, and he ends up wound in **silk** himself, while Snoopy glides past on a boat."],"屿":["islet","{Yoshi} unwraps a *gift* in the {Basement} of the {Museum}, finds a tiny *mountain* and gulps it down with one flick of his tongue. He lays it as a huge spotted egg, the egg sinks into the flooded floor, and its top pokes out: an **islet**. A palm tree sprouts, a crab moves in, and the *mountain* grumbles from under the **islet** about the damp."],"氢":["hydrogen","{Chewbacca} tries to fix a ship's fuel tank in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, and in a temper he rips it open, and a cloud of *steam* and pure **hydrogen** whooshes out. He breathes it in, and his mighty roar comes out as a tiny squeak. Only friends understand him now, as all that **hydrogen** lifts him and his bandolier gently over the crowd."],"驼":["camel","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Warehouse} and lands on a *horse* that suddenly has a hump. He asks it what is wrong in its own language, and a *serpent* hisses from under its blanket. Baffled by the crate labels, he reads the stamp and yells: this is a **camel** now. The **camel** spits at the serpent, which slithers off."],"妆":["makeup","The {Joker} perches in {Front} of the {Swamp} with a huge grin, offering free **makeup** to a *woman* sitting on a *split log*. He paints her face white, gives her green eyebrows and a smile to match his own, then squirts his flower to rinse the brush. The *split log* snaps shut with laughter, and the frogs queue for **makeup** with pink cheeks."],"捆":["bundle","{Kermit} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Casino}, where a *helping hand* passes him a **bundle** of banknotes from a *trapped tree* tied up in rope. Arms flailing, he snaps a banjo string and tries to tie the notes down, but the branches burst loose and bloom with cash. He screams 'Yaaay!', and every leaf falls as another **bundle**."],"铅":["lead","{Chewbacca} storms up in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} waving *gold coins* that weigh far too much, and in a temper he rips one apart with his teeth. It is grey **lead**, painted yellow. He growls his outrage, which only his friends understand, and hurls the coins down, and all that heavy **lead** cracks the pavement and drops him into the vault."],"逛":["to stroll","{Gandalf} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp} and starts to **stroll** along a muddy *road*, puffing his pipe and arriving exactly nowhere on purpose. A *mad dog* races up, barking. 'You shall not pass!' he says, and he taps his staff, and the dog is compelled to **stroll** beside him, wearing a small grey hat."],"淑":["gentle","{Sherlock} sits in {Front} of the {Pool} beside his *uncle* and, glancing at one damp teacup, deduces the whole man: so **gentle** that he catches *water drops* so they will not hit the swimmers. 'Elementary,' he sniffs, unimpressed, as his *uncle* pats a wasp on the head. Watson weeps at the sight of anyone so **gentle** while Sherlock plays a smug tune on his violin."],"榴":["pomegranate","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} to a *tree* growing on a stone altar, with one **pomegranate** hanging like a holy relic. She swaps it for a bag of sand, keeping it as a *keepsake*, and the floor starts to shake. The **pomegranate** bursts, red seeds rain down the stairs, and she flips away over the bunks, ponytail flying."],"丙":["third","{Batman} broods in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, setting a camera on a *tripod* to check the Batmobile's time in the race. It comes **third**: not first, not second, but **third**, beaten by a milk cart. The *tripod* wobbles away in shame while Batman growls into his cape, and he checks his utility belt for a gadget that fixes this."],"痒":["to itch","{Yoshi} lies on a *sickbed* in the {Basement} of the {Hangar} when a *sheep* rubs its wool on his feet and they begin to **itch**. His sticky tongue shoots out to scratch, licks up the sheep by mistake, and he lays it as a woolly egg. Now the egg makes him **itch**, the *sickbed* wriggles with laughter, and the planes scratch their wings."],"钞":["paper money","{Charlie Brown} stands in {Front} of the {Tower} with a pot of *gold coins*, melts them, adds a *pinch* of salt and rolls them flat into **paper money**. At last, he thinks, his luck has turned. He pegs the **paper money** out to dry, and a gust carries it all up into a kite-eating tree. 'Good grief,' he says, and Snoopy buys the tree."],"蹄":["hoof","{Tarzan} swings on a vine {Inside} the {Beach} and lands beside a horse sent by the *sky god*, and asks it in its own language why it looks so glum. Its *kicking foot* lashes out, showing a golden **hoof** with no shoe. He has never seen a shoe, baffled by the whole idea, so he ties a coconut to the **hoof**, and the horse neighs thunder."],"犬":["dog","{Chewbacca} squeezes into the {Basement} of the {Mint}, where a *dog* guards a mountain of coins, and he lets out a mighty roar. The **dog** understands him at once, being a loyal friend, and howls back. Bankers come running, the *dog* wags so hard that coins fly everywhere, and Chewbacca hugs the **dog** and straps it to his bandolier."],"躬":["to bow","{Gandalf} stands in {Front} of the {Lagoon} and cranky as ever taps his staff, casting a spell that forces all to **bow** to the sunrise. His own *torso* bends like a *bow*, and his pointy hat tips off into the water. He bends lower with a grumble until his nose meets his toes, and the fish **bow** back politely."],"昼":["daytime","The {Joker} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} at *sunrise* and lays a giant *ruler* across the river, sneering at how slowly the light climbs. He flips a trick playing card, and suddenly the sun is a joke sun, jumping to full **daytime** in a blink. The *ruler* snaps with laughter, and all **daytime** long he cackles at the sleepy owls."],"藻":["aquatic grass","{Zorro} crashes through a window into the {Basement} of the {Tower} and lands in a *bath*, where green *grass* sprouts from the plughole: **aquatic grass**, waving like hair. He draws his rapier and slashes a Z through it, but the Z grows back as more. His black horse wades in, wearing **aquatic grass** as a wig, and Zorro vanishes laughing."],"蛛":["spider","The {Joker} tiptoes in {Front} of the {Pool} and dangles a huge fake **spider**, painted in shiny *red lacquer*, right over the swimmers, cackling. A little *bug* stuck to it waves for help. The swimmers shriek, then a real **spider** drops down, tuts at the workmanship and knits him a purple scarf, which tickles so much that his grin grows wider."],"褐":["brown","{Homer} drops a chocolate doughnut in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and, lunging for it, smears his white *shirt* a deep gooey **brown**. A *question mark* pops up over his bald head as he tries to work out where the white went. 'D'oh!' He licks the shirt, 'Mmm', and shakes himself like a dog, and the cat and the walls turn **brown** too."],"颊":["cheek","{James Bond} lounges {Inside} the {Piazza} and flicks open Q's newest *tongs*, built to do only one thing: pinch a **cheek**. They clamp onto his own, and the *page* of instructions flutters off, pursued by pigeons. His **cheek** swells round and pink, yet he escapes by pinching the tongs back, and he says, unruffled, 'Cheeky.'"],"奠":["to settle","{Darth Vader} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, where a *chieftain* and a *big man* are arguing over a heap of gold. He raises one glove and lifts them both with the Force, and they dangle, still shouting. Breathing loudly, he booms that he will **settle** this, and the gold floats into two piles and they **settle** down, very quiet."],"募":["to raise funds","{Mario} head-butts blocks by the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} at *sunset* to **raise funds** for a new diving board, and each block spits out a coin. His *strong arm* waves a bucket, the coins ring in, and he shouts 'Wahoo!' But each coin turns into a fish, so he has to stomp more blocks and **raise funds** all over again to buy a net."],"耽":["to delay","{Darth Vader} reclines in {Front} of the {Mansion} with his helmet's *ear* sunk in a fluffy *pillow*, and he reaches out with the Force to hold back the hands of each clock. He will **delay** lunch, the Empire and the afternoon. The *pillow* wheezes in time with his loud breathing, and even the sunset has to **delay** until he wakes."],"蹈":["to tread","{Darth Vader} stamps through the {Basement} of the {Tower} to his own marching music, and his *kicking foot* starts to **tread** on piles of rice with a boom at each step. A *rice scoop*, lifted by the Force, flies round him, tossing more under his boots. He breathes in time, cape swirling, and goes on to **tread** the whole harvest into flour."],"陋":["humble","{Lara Croft} leaps across a spike pit into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} and solves a door puzzle, only to find a shack on a bare *hillside*. Her treasure is **humble**: one stool, one candle, one sock. The *hillside* rumbles a warning as she lifts the sock, the old man who lives there beams, and she leaves him his **humble** relic and climbs out."],"侣":["companion","{Lara Croft} cartwheels through the {Basement} of the {Museum} and finds a *standing person* made of nothing but a *spine*, a skeleton chained to an old stone puzzle. She cracks the puzzle, ponytail flicking, and it steps free, her new **companion** on every climb. The *spine* clicks with joy, and the dinosaur skeleton rattles its cage, begging for a **companion** too."],"魅":["charm","{Mario} leaps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and meets a *ghost* hiding shyly behind a *sapling*, covering its eyes the moment he looks. It has such **charm** that the ducks swoon and the frogs propose. He tries to stomp it, but it fades, so he head-butts a block and gets one coin, and the *sapling* blushes, overcome by **charm**."],"岚":["mountain mist","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Mansion} up a sheer indoor *mountain*, hand over hand, her ponytail streaming in the *wind*. Thick grey **mountain mist** swirls round her ankles and hides the traps, a rolling boulder rumbling somewhere within it. She backflips over the boulder, lands on a relic, and the **mountain mist** curls into the shape of a tiny ancient guardian, who applauds."],"侄":["nephew","The {Joker} tiptoes {Inside} the {Beehive} with a squirting flower, cackling, and a *standing person* waits at the *arrow landing* holding a bow: his **nephew**, a tiny boy with green hair and an even bigger grin. The **nephew** fires a candy arrow, the flower squirts back, and the bees chase them both round the combs, howling with delight."],"虐":["brutal","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Ice Rink} in his orange jumpsuit, because a *tiger* on skates is being **brutal** to the penguins and stealing their ramen. Fifty shadow clones skid in, shouting that they never give up, and a spinning Rasengan twirls the bully like a top. It slides into a snowbank, a **brutal** defeat, and the penguins get their noodles back."],"堕":["to fall","{Darth Vader} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and the floor gives way in a *landslide* of boxes and *soil*. He starts to **fall**, cape flapping, breathing loudly, past shelves, pipes and a surprised mole. He reaches out with the Force, but only the boxes float, leaving him to **fall** on, and on the way he tells the mole he is its father."],"陛":["throne steps","{Batman} fires his grappling hook in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and swings across to *throne steps* carved into a sandy *hillside*. The *hillside* slides under his boots, and he broods all the way up the **throne steps**, utility belt rattling. At the top sits the sand king, a crab, who has hidden a clue under the last of the **throne steps**, and Batman growls with approval."],"莹":["lustrous","{Yoshi} sticks out his tongue {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and licks dew off the *grass* growing in the corners, then lays one perfect egg. It is so **lustrous** that the boxers see their faces in it and stop fighting to comb their hair. The *grass* leans in to admire itself, and the champion begs for gloves as **lustrous** as that shell."],"荫":["shade","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps in {Front} of the {Inn} and swallows a whole leafy tree, *grass* and all, then lays it as an enormous egg that casts a cool **shade**. The jealous sun tries to sneak under it, but the *shade* stretches out and gulps it like his own tongue. He curls up in the **shade**, crying his name happily."],"狡":["cunning","{James Bond} sits with *crossed legs* in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café}, playing cards against a *prowling dog* in a tiny tuxedo. The dog is **cunning**: it has swapped Q's card-shooting shoe, hidden under his *crossed legs*, for a squeaky toy. Bond raises one eyebrow, wins anyway with a shirt-cuff ace and remarks that he was once as **cunning** himself."],"阀":["clique","{Frodo} plods {Inside} the {Spa} to a *gate* guarded by a *lumberjack*, behind which a **clique** of rich guests sips tea and lets nobody in. He slips on the Ring and tiptoes past invisibly on his hairy feet, stealing one scone for Sam. The *lumberjack* sniffs and chops the gate down, and the whole **clique** shrieks to find no one there."],"绞":["to twist","{James Bond} is tied to a chair in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café}, and a villainous kitten turns a winch to **twist** his *crossed legs* into a pretzel. Bond fires Q's cufflink, and out shoots a *silk thread* that loops round the winch. With one neat **twist** he is free, the kitten wears a bow, and he adjusts his tie and murmurs, 'Plot twist.'"],"膏":["ointment","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Tower} with a sunburnt nose, unscrews a jar of thick white **ointment** and mutters a spell over it, because a wizard never settles for plain cream. It bubbles up in fireworks and leaps out of the jar. Soon the pigeons, the lamp post and his pointy hat are shining with **ointment**, and he crankily lights his pipe."],"垮":["to collapse","{Kermit} flails into the {Basement} of the {Water Park}, clipboard high, where a *show-off* is stacking *soil* into a stage for tonight's show. One shrill 'Yaaay!' sets it wobbling, and it starts to **collapse**. Then the curtain, the banjo stand and the *show-off* all **collapse** too, and Kermit calls out, hopping on the heap, that it was supposed to happen."],"茎":["stem","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} and presses the **stem** of the rose in his lapel, Q's latest gadget. The **stem** shoots out like a green grappling line, hooks the ring post and drags him, tuxedo spotless, through the tall *grass*, which bows as he passes. He lands on the ropes, brushes off a petal and says, 'Blooming marvellous.'"],"缅":["remote","{Mario} dives down a warp pipe in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} to reach a friend on an island so **remote** that letters take a year. A *silk thread* trails behind him, tied to a portrait of a smiling *face* so he can find his way home. He pops out, 'Wahoo!', and the *face* winks at him from those far, **remote** waters."],"喇":["la (in 喇叭, trumpet)","{Lara Croft} vaults into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and pries an ancient *trumpet* from a booby-trapped relic chest. She presses it to her *mouth* and blasts \"**La**-ba! **La**-ba!\" A boulder starts rolling, the hot tubs boil over, and she flips clear holding the prize: 喇 is the **la** in 喇叭, the trumpet."],"绒":["velvet","{Robocop} clanks stiffly {Inside} the {Lagoon} when his targeting display flags a *soldier* for illegal softness, in a uniform of **velvet** woven from *silk thread*. He reads out a directive on correct uniforms and politely arrests the jacket. The *silk thread* winds round his steel arm, and his visor flickers as he strokes the **velvet** and purrs, off duty at last."],"搅":["to disturb","{James Bond} reclines in the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} in a silk bed, tuxedo on, under a sign that says do not **disturb**. A *helping hand* pokes through the wall and shakes an *alarm clock* at his ear. He presses Q's button and the bed ejects him, the clock and twenty cats, but nothing can **disturb** his bow tie."],"凳":["stool","{Darth Vader} sweeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} and with one glove summons a tiny **stool** through the air. It lands on *spread feet*, then bolts away on them, squeaking. A monkey rides it past, then a tiger, so he Force-chokes the **stool** until its legs buckle, and he sits on a squashed pancake, breathing loudly."],"梭":["shuttle","{Sailor Moon} sparkles through her transformation in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, then throws her tiara, which flies back and forth like a wooden **shuttle** through a loom carved from a *tree*. A *handsome man* is weaving sails and swoons so hard that he lets go. The **shuttle** whizzes off and hits a ship, and she bursts into loud tears while Luna the cat sighs."],"丫":["fork","{Yoshi} swallows a *pole* topped with two *horns* in {Front} of the {Spa} and lays it as an egg. The egg cracks, and out sticks a perfect **fork**, so he grabs it with his tongue. The *pole* wobbles, the *horns* spear a passing cloud, and he slurps it down, then lays a little cloud egg on the **fork**, crying his own name."],"姬":["lady","{James Bond} arrives by speedboat in {Front} of the {Beach}, where a noble **lady** waits with her *chin* raised so high that gulls perch on it. She is the one *woman* who sees through him, plucking Q's exploding teapot out of his sleeve. 'Bond. James Bond,' he says, and the **lady** simply hands it back and tells him to pour."],"诏":["imperial edict","The {Joker} bursts out of the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} with a forged **imperial edict**, and he hands it to a *town crier* with a huge grin. The crier bellows it, a *small speech bubble* floats over the crowd, and all must ride backwards on Tuesdays. Horses neigh, a flower squirts, and the **imperial edict** turns into a trick playing card, which he cackles at."],"钮":["button","{Naruto} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Youth Hostel} and meets a *clown* whose coat has lost every **button**, so he shouts 'Shadow Clone!' and fifty of him appear. They sew *gold coins* on, one each, arguing loudly over the thread and slurping ramen. The last **button** pops off and rolls away, and all fifty dive after it, refusing to give up."],"棺":["coffin","{Gandalf} strides up in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} and an *official* in black is measuring him for a **coffin** made from a *tree*, because the rumour says he has fallen. Crankily, Gandalf taps his staff, declares he arrives exactly when he means to, and turns the **coffin** into a boat with one spell. The swans climb aboard, setting off his fireworks."],"耿":["honest","{Gandalf} sits in the {Basement} of the {Jungle} with his *ear* glowing red beside a *campfire*, because his spell makes everyone in earshot **honest**. A monkey asks who ate the bananas, and the wizard hears himself confess it at once. Crankily he puffs his pipe, the *campfire* sends up honest fireworks, and the monkeys clap for the most **honest** wizard alive."],"缔":["to form a union","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and offers his glove to two quarrelling crabs, booming that together they will **form a union**. With the Force he flies a *silk thread* round their claws. The *sky god* rumbles a blessing over his loud breathing, and all the starfish line up to **form a union** and rule the sand."],"懈":["lax","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} demanding to be left alone, and finds the guard yeti has gone **lax**, its *standing heart* snoring, its belt hanging in an *untied knot*. Donkey will not shut up about it. Even Shrek's roar comes out as a yawn, his swamp seems far away, and soon the pair of them are **lax** as old onions."],"嫉":["jealous","{James Bond} sunbathes {Inside} the {Beach} wearing Q's gold-plated tuxedo, and a *woman* on the next towel turns green, **jealous** of its shine. Her *fever* rises until the thermometer pops and the sand steams. She presses a button on a bigger gadget of her own and out rolls a diamond tuxedo, and now Bond is the **jealous** one, though he hides it with a one-liner."],"灶":["stove","{Zorro} flings open the {Bathroom} of the {Tower} and finds a **stove** of baked *soil* with a *campfire* blazing in its belly. He slashes a Z into its side with his rapier, and the flames roar out through it, cooking soup in a flash. The lions rush up to steal the **stove**, so he swings from a chandelier, cape flying, and vanishes laughing."],"匀":["even","{Yoshi} swallows a heap of sand {Inside} the {Dunes} and lays it back as a row of eggs for the camels, in *even shares*. One camel grumbles, so he licks up each egg, swallows them again and lays them perfectly **even**, with the same number of spots. The *even shares* stand in a row, so **even** that the camels cannot tell whose is whose."],"嗣":["to inherit","{Sailor Moon} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, where the old queen bee, the *boss*, is retiring, and her son is to **inherit** the hive. She waves her moon wand through a long sparkly ceremony and delivers a speech about justice. The prince trips, she cries loudly, and Luna the cat points out that he will **inherit** nothing but honey on his crown."],"鸽":["pigeon","{Gandalf} sits in {Front} of the {Hut} puffing his pipe when he waves his staff and pulls a **pigeon** from his pointy hat, instead of a moth. It lands on a jar with a *fitted lid* and pecks until the lid flies off with a firework. The *bird* calls a hundred friends, and each **pigeon** settles on his robes, delivering a cranky message."],"澡":["bath","{Zorro} rides his black horse down to the {Basement} of the {Tower} and fills a giant *bath*, slashing a Z through the tap with one flick of his rapier. The horse leaps in and water floods the stairs: the best **bath** ever. Zorro swings in on a chandelier, cape and all, then his mask runs, and now everyone needs another **bath**."],"凿":["chisel","{Zorro} leaps onto a *scaffold* {Inside} the {Tower} and, with no time for tools, uses his rapier as a **chisel**, slashing Zs into the stone. Chips fly, and out comes a statue of his own horse, which sneezes and walks off. The *scaffold* rocks as he bows, tosses the **chisel** away with a flourish and vanishes laughing."],"纬":["latitude","{Walter White} stands at a bench in the {Basement} of the {Lake} in glasses and goggles, winding *silk thread* round a glass globe and fixing it with a *leather strap*. Each thread marks a line of **latitude**, proud and exact to the decimal. He tells his class science is precise, then tugs one, and the globe spins, sliding along its **latitude** lines into the beaker."],"沸":["to boil","{Frodo} staggers into the {Bathroom} of the {Lake} and the Ring round his neck burns hot, as if he has reached the fires of the mountain at last. *water drops* spit from a kettle and begin to **boil**, and a *dollar sign* of steam tempts him. Weary and reluctant, he dips one hairy toe, and Sam's soup, the kettle and the lake all **boil**."],"畴":["arable field","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Boathouse}, which somehow holds an **arable field**, with one *rice field* beside it for Snoopy. He plants kite seeds, because this year must be his year. Up comes a *longevity peach* tree, which eats the kite, and the *rice field* floods his shoes. 'Good grief,' he sighs, the only farmer whose **arable field** grows bad luck."],"刃":["blade edge","{Robocop} clanks stiffly into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair}, and a steel spike with a gleaming *blade edge* slides from his fist. His targeting display locks onto a candyfloss cone and reads out a directive that all snacks be square. The **blade edge** slices it in four neat cuts, and he politely arrests the crumbs, holding up that **blade edge** for inspection."],"遏":["to restrain","{Casper} floats through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, and the *road* outside beckons him off to find a friend. Walls cannot stop a ghost, but a glowing *question mark* hooks his sheet like a crook, the one thing solid enough **to restrain** him. 'Why won't you be my friend?' he wails, turning invisible, and it **restrains** him anyway."],"烁":["luminous","{Sherlock} raises his magnifying glass in the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} and deduces from one hot crumb that someone has lit a *campfire* in the sink. 'Elementary,' he says, as *joy bells* ring out with every spark, and each spark hangs in the air, **luminous**. Watson squints: the whole room twinkles, and the glass throws a **luminous** beam across Sherlock's smug face."],"嗅":["to sniff","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Youth Hostel} after a glorious swamp *stink*, because ogres adore it. He begins **to sniff** every sock like fine perfume, while Donkey's *mouth* never stops: 'Why do you sniff? Can I sniff?' Shrek roars, takes one more deep **sniff**, and smiles for the first time all year."],"叭":["bang","{Batman} grapples down in {Front} of the {Spa}, where red *curtains* whip apart on an enormous *mouth*. It shouts so loudly that a comic-book word bursts in the air, and Batman hurls a batarang straight into it: **bang**! Every bather leaps from the hot tub, and he growls that this town deserves a quieter **bang**."],"熬":["to simmer","{Casper} floats {Inside} the {Tower} and scares a weary *wanderer* by accident, so badly that he drops his soup pot on the *embers*. Casper only wants a friend, so he hovers over the pot, his ghostly chill holding back the boil, and the soup begins **to simmer**. A hundred years later they are still friends, and it still **simmers**."],"瞥":["glance","{Pikachu} hides in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave} under a heap of *rags*, because a trainer is hunting him with a Poké Ball. One *eye* pops out for a quick **glance**, his cheeks sparking with nerves. The ball whistles past, the rags flop down, and the next **glance** lasts barely a blink."],"骸":["skeleton","{Homer} sits {Inside} the {Island} with a box of doughnuts and a dim scheme. To scare off a greedy *wild boar*, he wires every *bone* he can find into a giant **skeleton** and hides behind it, whispering 'Boo.' The boar snorts, charges and scatters the lot, and Homer groans 'D'oh!' wearing the **skeleton**'s ribs as a hat while his doughnuts vanish."],"奢":["extravagant","{Sherlock} studies one gold crumb in {Front} of the {Hut} and deduces everything: a *big man* eats diamonds on toast here, and a *busy man* gilds his lawn all day. Both walk up, and the busy man gilds Watson too. 'Elementary: **extravagant**,' says Sherlock, and the big man hands him a solid gold violin, more **extravagant** still."],"拙":["clumsy","The {Joker} cackles in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, building a *double mountain* of trick playing cards. His spring-loaded *helping hand* boings out to add the top card, so **clumsy** that it swats both peaks flat, squirts his flower in his own eye and stuffs cards down his purple suit. He howls with laughter, because being this **clumsy** is the best prank of all."],"栋":["building","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in the {Bathroom} of the {Lagoon} and raises one black glove. A *tree* tears out of the water with the Force, then another, stacking floor upon floor while the *east* glows and lights the new windows: a ten-storey **building**. He booms his disapproval at the crooked door and Force-chokes the knob until the whole **building** stands up straight."],"毯":["rug","{Tarzan} swings on a vine into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} and freezes at a great flat *fur* on the floor. A *blaze* crackles in the furnace and shows him no head, no legs, no breathing, so he talks to it in ape, then wrestles it. Jane explains it is only a **rug**. Tarzan loses to the **rug** anyway and lies down, baffled."],"桐":["paulownia","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Lagoon} on a vine from a huge purple-flowered *tree*, and the monkeys chatter that it is a **paulownia**. Jane hands him a *matching cup*; baffled, he wears it as a hat, and it catches a falling flower and fills with purple tea. He gives his jungle yell and shakes the **paulownia** until every monkey has a drink."],"砂":["sand","{Sherlock} kneels in {Front} of the {Spa} with his magnifying glass over a single *stone* and announces that he can deduce its whole future: it will be **sand**. Insulted, the stone starts to crumble, and a *pinch* of it leaps into Watson's shoe. 'Elementary,' says Sherlock, smugly, as the rest slumps into a heap of **sand** over his violin."],"莽":["reckless","{Mario} warps out of a pipe into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} and, without looking, stomps on everything: crates, a propeller, the tall *grass* grabbing at his boots. 'Wahoo!' he yells, swallowing a mushroom and growing through a wing. Toad squeaks that this is **reckless**, so Mario jumps off the wreckage, lands on Toad's hat, and does it all again, even more **reckless**."],"泻":["to pour out","{Shrek} storms into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} to write a KEEP OUT sign at a *writing desk*, wanting only to be left alone. *Water drops* seep from a drawer, and Donkey, who will not shut up, yanks it open, so a whole swamp begins **to pour out**. Donkey's chatter **pours out** with it, and Shrek roars for silence, knee-deep."],"坪":["plain","{Pikachu} sparks {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, where the canvas is buried under heaps of *soil*. One mighty Thunderbolt makes the ropes ping and the heaps shake themselves perfectly *flat*, into a wide grassy **plain** with cows on it. The boxers now jog for an hour across the **plain** to reach each other, and Pikachu curls up in his Poké Ball."],"梳":["comb","{Sherlock} studies one strand of hair in {Front} of the {Pool} and deduces that a *tumbling baby* with terrible curls rolled past at noon. Right on time the baby rolls back, and a *tree* drops a twig with teeth on it, which Sherlock whittles into a wooden **comb**. Watson gives chase, and every tumble earns one smug stroke of the **comb**."],"杉":["fir","{Sherlock} points his magnifying glass at a tall *tree* in {Front} of the {Mansion}, and its stiff green *bristles* prick his nose. From that prickle, the resin on Watson's sleeve and a whiff of pine, he deduces the answer with enormous pride: 'A **fir**.' Watson sighs and points to the label nailed to the trunk, which also says **fir**."],"晤":["to meet","{Walter White} knocks at the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} with his beakers and announces a class experiment: two reactants are going **to meet**. He sets a tiny *sun* in one flask and a booming *speaker* in the other, then slides them together with precise pride. The speaker says hello, the sun blushes orange, and Walter notes that when they **meet**, the room warms exactly four degrees."],"稚":["young","The {Joker} creeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} and offers a *grain stalk* that is really a trick: it pops open into a bunch of flags. A *sparrow* so **young** that it still wears fluff is not frightened at all. It claps its wings, pecks the squirting flower and soaks him, too **young** to know that he is the one meant to laugh."],"蔬":["vegetables","{Sherlock} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Pool} and deduces from one pea on Watson's shoe exactly what blocked the plumbing. On cue the *unclogged drain* gives a burp, *grass* whips up, and out shoot carrots, cabbages and leeks, a geyser of **vegetables**. 'Elementary,' he says as a sprout bounces off his deerstalker: every child here has been flushing their **vegetables**."],"蝇":["fly","{Yoshi} flutters {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, tongue ready, because a buzzing *bug* keeps circling the referee: a **fly**. A green *frog* hops up, both tongues shoot out together, and they tie themselves in a knot. Yoshi finally gulps the **fly** down and lays it as a spotted egg, and out it buzzes again, laughing at them both."],"捣":["to pound","{Darth Vader} looms in the {Basement} of the {Tower} and, with the Force, lifts a tiny *island* out of a puddle onto a stone slab. A terrified *helping hand* grabs a pestle and starts **to pound** it to the rhythm of his breathing: thump, hiss, thump, hiss. 'Harder,' he booms, and it **pounds** palm trees and sand into paste."],"顷":["unit of area","{Chewbacca} is mending a leak in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} when a huge *tilted head* rolls up and declares that the floor must measure exactly one **unit of area**. He growls, rips up a field's worth of boards in a temper and bolts them down again. The head tilts further, squints, and says that is still not one **unit of area**, so he roars."],"麽":["tiny","{Mario} bites the wrong mushroom {Inside} the {Fort} and shrinks until he is **tiny**. A coil of *hemp* now towers over him like a hairy mountain, so he jumps and stomps on it, and out springs a *tiny thread* that lassoes his moustache. He squeaks 'Wahoo!' so faintly, and is so **tiny**, that Toad needs a magnifying glass to find him."],"尴":["awkward","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Mansion} exactly when he means to, leaning on a *crutch* because his staff is at the mender's. 'You shall not pass!' he thunders at an *inspector* who only wants to read the meter. The crutch fizzes out one sad firework and nobody speaks; it is deeply **awkward**, and his pipe going out makes it more **awkward** still."],"镖":["dart","{Batman} glowers at the *ticket* flapping on the Batmobile in {Front} of the {Cat Café}. From his utility belt he pulls a fistful of *gold coins* that click together into a spike, a Bat-**dart**. He throws without looking and pins the ticket to the wall, the cats pounce, and he growls 'Justice,' loading another **dart** while Alfred quietly pays the fine."],"诧":["astonished","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, and a *small speech bubble* floats out of a tiny *dwelling* on the sink with the words: you win, Charlie. He is **astonished**, because he never wins, not at anything. 'Good grief,' he whispers, still **astonished**, and then the bubble pops and turns out to have been meant for Snoopy."],"尬":["embarrassing","{Gandalf} sweeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} on a *crutch*, muttering a spell to clear the steam. It misfires and turns his grey robes bright pink, which is **embarrassing**. A *go-between* rushes over, mistakes him for a blind date and introduces him to a lady in a mud mask, and when the crutch sprouts roses it is even more **embarrassing**."],"硫":["sulfur","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Youth Hostel}, ponytail flying, clutching a relic: a yellow *stone* that reeks of rotten eggs. It is **sulfur**, and it sets off an old tomb curse that sends backpackers running. A *tumbling baby* rolls down the corridor with a giggle, so Lara backflips, scoops it up and climbs a bunk bed away from the **sulfur** fumes."],"嚼":["to chew","{James Bond} raises a *wine goblet* from Q {Inside} the {Cat Café}, and it does one absurd thing: it is made of toffee. His *mouth* begins **to chew** and cannot stop, working through rim, stem and olive while the cats stare. 'Bond. James Bond,' he mumbles, quite unruffled, and goes on **to chew** the bill."],"羡":["to envy","{Shrek} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, wanting only his swamp to himself. A *queue* of sleek *sheep* files past, each with a bag of yen and the deed to a private bog, and he begins **to envy** them. 'You've gone green with it!' shouts Donkey. 'I am always green,' Shrek roars, but he does **envy** that deed."],"沦":["to sink","{Lara Croft} solves the last puzzle {Inside} the {Casino}, pressing a carved tile that springs an ancient trap. *Water drops* trickle, then pour, and each *neat stack* of chips begins **to sink** into the rising flood. She leaps acrobatically from stack to stack, and every one **sinks** under her boots with a glug as she snatches the relic and swings to safety."],"沪":["Shanghai","{Homer} naps in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} until *water drops* wake him, and he spots a *door* he is sure leads to the doughnut shop. He pushes it, a dim shortcut scheme, and steps into **Shanghai**: skyscrapers, river boats and soup dumplings. 'Mmm,' he says, eating twenty, then 'D'oh!' when he burns his tongue, and he tells Marge that **Shanghai** is a doughnut full of soup."],"旷":["to skip class","{Kermit} flails his arms in the {Bathroom} of the {Swamp}, having decided **to skip class** and hide in a muddy *shed* with his banjo. The *sun* pokes through a crack like a stage spotlight, and he panics, because now it is a show. Gonzo and Fozzie arrive with a chicken, the whole cast decides **to skip class**, and he screams 'Yaaay!' at the chaos."],"彬":["well-bred","{Batman} glides down in {Front} of the {Inn}, where Alfred has been training a *grove* of potted trees. They bow as one, their *bristles* combed and neatly parted, and one offers him tea. Batman growls, then uses his grappling hook to lift the cup with one claw raised, and Alfred nods: **well-bred** trees, and at last a **well-bred** Batman."],"芽":["sprout","{Yoshi} licks up a *fang* poking through the *grass* {Inside} the {Spa}, swallows it and, with a grunt, lays a spotted egg. The egg cracks and out uncurls a tiny green **sprout** with two leaves and one sharp tooth. Delighted, he swallows the **sprout** and lays it again, until the bathers are wading through a snapping salad."],"狸":["wild cat","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Beach} after a *prowling dog* that has stolen an ancient idol. It runs straight up a cliff, which no dog does, so she climbs after it, ponytail swinging, and finds stripes, tufted ears and claws: a **wild cat**. The fishing *village* below rolls a boulder across its lair, and the **wild cat** hops on and surfs it away."],"冥":["dark","{Mario} bounces {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} and head-butts a block, but out drops a *cloth cover* instead of a coin. It settles over the *dim sun* that lights the ring, and everything goes **dark**. He says 'Wahoo?' and stomps about in the **dark**, landing on a boxer, then a Goomba, then the sun itself, which hiccups."],"碳":["carbon","{Tarzan} swings through a window into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and lands on a heap of *charcoal*. He thinks it is food, so his ape friend cracks a lump with a *stone* and Tarzan bites it, and his teeth turn black. 'Pure **carbon**,' says Jane. Baffled, he points at the lump, the ape and his own grin and proudly yells, '**Carbon**!'"],"咧":["to grin","{Lara Croft} drops into the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave} and faces a *lineup* of stone idols, an old puzzle. She climbs each one and hauls every *mouth* wider, until all of them begin **to grin** from ear to ear. The wall rolls open, a boulder rolls out, and as she somersaults clear with the relic, even she has to **grin**."],"惕":["wary","{Tarzan} drops off a vine into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} and greets a *lizard* in perfect lizard. It stares back with one eye and says nothing, deeply **wary**. Tarzan crouches and sniffs the air, just as **wary**, while his *standing heart* thumps and hops behind him to hide. Neither of them moves all afternoon."],"暑":["heat","{Sherlock} mops his brow in the {Basement} of the {Pool} and deduces from one melted violin string that someone has stolen the sky. 'Elementary,' he gasps, and there is a *busy man* shovelling the *sun* into the boiler. The **heat** wilts his deerstalker, Watson flops onto a towel, and the busy man only shovels faster, raising the **heat** until the pipes sing."],"咯":["cackle","{Gandalf} puffs his pipe in {Front} of the {Hut} when a cheeky *visitor* mocks his pointy hat. One cranky flick of the staff turns the visitor's *mouth* into a hen's beak, and out comes a **cackle** that sets every chicken in the valley off. Gandalf tries to undo the spell, but each new **cackle** only explodes in fireworks."],"萝":["radish","{Lara Croft} creeps {Inside} the {Warehouse}, tugs a tuft of *grass* growing from the floor, and hears the rumble of an ancient trap. A boulder comes rolling at her, huge and white and leafy: a giant **radish**. She somersaults clear, but a *gauze net* springs down from above and catches her, until the next rolling **radish** rips it open."],"汹":["torrential","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of the {Youth Club} hoping to be left alone, so he rigs a *booby trap* to keep the noisy teenagers away. Donkey trots straight onto it, still talking. *Water drops* spit out, then comes a **torrential** swamp flood, and Shrek roars as the **torrential** wave carries him, the ping-pong tables and Donkey all the way home."],"腥":["fishy","{Shrek} sits in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} eating onions under the *moon*, when a *star* falls at his feet, flapping. It is a starfish, gloriously **fishy**, and the moon wrinkles its nose. Donkey gags and backs away, so Shrek, delighted, nails the **fishy** thing to his door to make sure nobody ever visits."],"窥":["to peep","{Kermit} hops in {Front} of the {Waiting Room}, arms flailing, because curtain up is in one minute and his cast has vanished. His *compass* spins wildly and points to a tiny *cave* in the wall, so he presses one green eye to it **to peep**. Gonzo and Fozzie are in there rehearsing with a pig, and he shrieks 'Yaaay!' and goes on **peeping**."],"俺":["I","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, and a *standing person* with a camera screams. A *sudden flash* goes off, and the picture shows nothing at all, because he has turned invisible by accident. 'Who's there?' the person wails. 'It is **I**!' says Casper hopefully. '**I** only want a friend!'"],"潭":["deep pool","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Mansion} on the chandelier, baffled by a tap, and pulls it clean out of the wall. *Water drops* chase him along the hall, then fill it, and the stairwell becomes a **deep pool**. He dives with a bubbling jungle yell to ask the goldfish what happened, while the butler tests the **deep pool** with one toe."],"崎":["mountainous","{Chewbacca} crashes {Inside} the {Beach} hunting for a lost ship part, and in a temper he hauls up the sand into a *mountain*. An *oddball* in a snorkel pops up on top and cheerfully says that the part is under the next one. He roars and digs again, and again, until the whole coast is **mountainous**, and so is his mood, **mountainous** and growling."],"麟":["qilin","{Lara Croft} cracks an old puzzle {Inside} the {Inn} by turning a carved *deer* on the wall three times. A *will-o'-the-wisp* flares up, and the deer steps out in dragon scales with a single horn: a **qilin**, the relic she has crossed the world for. She vaults onto its back, the guests faint into their porridge, and the **qilin** leaps over the corridor traps."],"捡":["to pick up","{James Bond} strolls into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} and presses a cufflink from Q. Out of his tuxedo sleeve shoots a *helping hand* whose one absurd talent is **to pick up** whatever is on the floor. An *assembly* of bankers gasps, and it begins **to pick up** their dropped coins and then their wigs. 'Loose change,' says Bond, unruffled."],"拯":["to rescue","The {Joker} cackles in the {Basement} of the {Jungle}, where his *assistant* is stuck to the waist in a prank tub of custard. 'I shall **rescue** you!' he cries, and a spring-loaded *helping hand* boings from his purple sleeve **to rescue** him. It honks the assistant's nose, hands him a squirting flower, then lifts him out with a loud raspberry."],"厥":["to faint","{James Bond} skates {Inside} the {Ice Rink} along a sheer ice *cliff* when a *hiccup* hits him. He swallows Q's cure, which does one absurd thing: it makes you **faint**. He starts **to faint** in perfect style, tuxedo uncreased, topples over the edge, and a parachute pops from his bow tie. 'Shaken,' he murmurs, and lands asleep."],"澄":["clear","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Jungle} after his kite. A *climber* up a tree wrings muddy *water drops* onto his head, and they gather in a pool and settle **clear** as glass. There, at last, is his kite on the bottom. 'Good grief,' he sighs, as Snoopy cannonballs in, and the water is no longer **clear**."],"萎":["to wither","{Walter White} sets up a school experiment in the {Basement} of the {Lake}, pouring salt water with total precision over a patch of *grass*. Water leaves the cells, each blade shrinks into a *wilting stalk*, and the lawn begins **to wither**. 'Osmosis,' he says proudly, adjusting his glasses. The class gasps as he makes the last daisy **wither**, exactly on schedule."],"哉":["exclamation","{Zorro} leaps in {Front} of the {Island} and crosses swords with a long *lance*, on whose tip a *mouth* shouts 'Alas!' and 'Ah!' and 'Oh!' Every gasp is an **exclamation**. He slashes a Z in the air, and the mouth only yells louder, so he slashes a huge **exclamation** into the sand and vanishes, laughing, on his black horse."],"涡":["whirlpool","{Walter White} sets a giant *wok* on a burner in {Front} of the {Fort} for a physics lesson. *Water drops* rain in, and with enormous pride he lowers a school magnetic stirrer until the water spins into a roaring **whirlpool**. 'Vortex, class,' he says, as cannonballs and a goat go round and round, and he notes how fast the **whirlpool** spits them back out."],"滔":["torrent","{Tarzan} stands baffled in {Front} of the {Tower}, trying to catch *water drops* with a *rice scoop* for a thirsty monkey. The scoop keeps tipping them away, so he gives his jungle yell for help, and a herd of elephants answers, blasting from their trunks until a roaring **torrent** fills the street. Tarzan grabs a vine and swings over the **torrent**."],"暇":["leisure","{Shrek} flops {Inside} the {Piazza} in the *sun* on his one day of **leisure**, wanting only to be left alone. Donkey will not stop asking when he plans to return the *borrowed tool*, which is busy scratching Shrek's back. He roars, peels an onion, and explains that this, Donkey, is called **leisure**, and it does not include you."],"溯":["to go upstream","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, where *water drops* are rushing down a pipe and carrying off Luna, her talking cat. She cries loudly, then waves her wand through a long sparkly transformation, and a silver *new moon* floats up as a canoe. Speech about justice done, she paddles **to go upstream**, and she **goes upstream** all the way to the filter."],"鳞":["scales","{Lara Croft} hauls a stone *fish* relic {Inside} the {Inn}, and a *will-o'-the-wisp* hovers near, lighting up its **scales**. She spots the puzzle: each one is a tiny lever. She presses three, an ancient trap clicks, and **scales** shoot across the room, sticking to every guest's face, while she flips over the table and climbs out through the chimney."],"酿":["to brew","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} with a *wine jug* and summons shadow clones by the dozen. They tip in a whole *good meal*, rice, plums and a spare bowl of ramen, determined **to brew** something legendary. It burps, it explodes, and he will not give up, so at half time he hands round the **brew**, shouting about his ninja way."],"茵":["mattress","{Yoshi} licks up a *sleeping mat* and a lawn of *grass* in {Front} of the {Inn}, swallows the lot and strains. Plop: out comes an enormous egg that cracks open flat into the softest **mattress** in the world. Guests climb out of their windows to try it, and he flutter-jumps up and down on the **mattress**, yelling his own name."],"愕":["startled","{Casper} slips through the wall of the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, only wanting to say hello, and his accidental *jump scare* sends a knitting *standing heart* three feet in the air, **startled**. 'Sorry!' he cries, going invisible, which makes it worse. The heart spins round and yells 'Boo!' at thin air, and now Casper is so **startled** that he drops through the floor."],"瞅":["to look at","{Charlie Brown} sits gloomily in the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} as *autumn* blows in, which means football. Lucy holds the ball, he runs, she pulls it away, and he lands flat in the leaves. A giant *eye* opens in the pile **to look at** him, and he says 'Good grief.' Even Snoopy wanders over **to look at** the mess."],"暮":["evening","{Mario} warps up a pipe into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and head-butts a block, but instead of a coin out pops the **evening**. The sky goes orange, then purple, and the tall *grass* folds itself up to sleep. 'Wahoo?' he says, and he head-butts it again, the swimmers yawn, and the **evening** deepens with every bump of his red cap."],"衙":["government office","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Spa} to a *crossroads* of corridors, where a big *speaker* barks 'Fill in form 27B!' This is the **government office**, and bathers in towels queue for permits. His tongue shoots out, swallows the form and the queue's pens, and he lays them all as one spotted egg. The **government office** demands a permit for the egg."],"诫":["commandment","{James Bond} strolls into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and meets a *sentry*, whose *small speech bubble* reads: no tuxedos beyond this point. It is a **commandment**, carved into the wall for good measure. Bond clicks a pen from Q, which does one absurd thing, adding the words 'except Bond' to any rule. 'Every **commandment** has a loophole,' he says, walking past."],"斧":["hatchet","{Frodo} trudges on bare hairy feet into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, weary from yet another very long walk. A kindly *father* in swimming trunks offers him an *axe*, but it is far too big for a hobbit and topples over onto his toes. Loyal Sam files it down into a neat little **hatchet**, and Frodo carries the **hatchet** on, sighing."],"兮":["poetic ah","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of the {Beach} because Donkey has hung velvet *curtains* and forced him into a poetry evening. They swish open, Shrek groans, and a *puff of breath* rolls out, reeking of onions, as one long 'ah'. The waves stop to listen. Donkey weeps at such a **poetic ah**, and begs for another **poetic ah** until Shrek roars."],"焕":["shining","{Homer} flops into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} with a dim scheme: a *campfire* to dry his shirt. Marge has booked him a *makeover*, so soap and polish get to work until his bald head is **shining**. The firelight bounces off it and blinds the swans, and he sees a doughnut reflected in his **shining** scalp and tries to bite it. 'D'oh!'"],"棕":["brown","{Zorro} swings in {Front} of the {Lagoon} from a *tree* that grows out of an *ancestral hall*. His rapier slashes a Z in the trunk, and thick **brown** sap gushes out over his black cape and his black horse. The old portraits in the hall gasp and turn **brown** as well, and he vanishes, laughing, the colour of tea."],"佑":["to bless","{Yoshi} flutters up in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, where a *standing person* trembles before a stormy voyage. A *feeding hand* holds out a melon, and Yoshi swallows it and lays a glowing spotted egg, which he sets on the sailor's hat **to bless** the trip. Lightning bends politely around the mast, and from then on every egg he lays will **bless** one boat."],"嘶":["neigh","{Sailor Moon} trips in {Front} of the {Beehive} halfway through her speech about justice and lands on a passing horse. Its *mouth* gapes in a wild **neigh** with a *tearing* edge, a sound like ripping cloth, and the hive splits in two. She cries loudly, the horse answers with a second **neigh**, and Luna the cat runs from the bees."],"妓":["prostitute","{James Bond} steps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} with Q's latest gadget, a monocle that does one absurd thing: it reads old scrolls aloud. A painted *woman* on the scroll waves a blossom *branch* at him, and it announces 'a **prostitute** in an old tale, who sings at banquets.' Unruffled, Bond taps the page, and the story's **prostitute** is promoted to spy."],"喧":["clamor","{Shrek} storms out in {Front} of the {Mint}, wanting only peace and quiet, but coins are clanking off the presses and the workers are yelling. Donkey has found a *megaphone*, and his *mouth* will not stop, which doubles the **clamor**. Shrek roars for silence, the megaphone picks that up too, and the **clamor** shakes every coin off the lawn."],"蓉":["paste","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Lagoon}, and his targeting display flags a *container* of lotus seeds with *grass* trying to sneak out of it. He politely reads them directive four and squeezes with one steel fist until they are a sweet **paste**. 'You have the right to remain **paste**,' he says, and his heavy boots glue to the floor."],"删":["to delete","{Sherlock} opens a *bamboo book* in {Front} of the {Mansion} and announces, smugly, that a great mind keeps only useful facts. A *standing knife* slices along each line, starting with the planets, **to delete** them from his memory. Watson protests, so the knife goes on **to delete** Watson's name too, and Sherlock looks up and politely asks who this man is."],"樱":["cherry","{Yoshi} stretches his long sticky tongue up a *tree* in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, plucking one **cherry** after another, while a *baby* on a branch claps and shakes down more. He swallows the lot, flutter-jumps and lays a round red egg. It cracks to show a single giant **cherry**, and the baby slides down and starts to eat."],"伺":["to wait on","{Cookie Monster} sits in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} roaring 'Me want cookie!', and a *standing person* rushes **to wait on** him with plate after plate. He devours cookies, plates and tray in a spray of crumbs. The *boss* bee buzzes in with a complaint, he eats the complaint too, and now she has **to wait on** him as well."],"嗡":["buzz","{Walter White} stands at a blackboard in {Front} of the {Jungle}, proudly teaching vibration. A sleepy *grandpa* volunteers, and Walter clips a tuning fork to his false teeth with great precision. His *mouth* gives a perfect **buzz**, exactly 240 hertz, and the jungle bees swarm over to crown him queen. 'Precisely,' says Walter, writing the **buzz** down in his notebook."],"娥":["beautiful","{Casper} floats through the wall {Inside} the {Hut} and sees a *woman* so **beautiful** that he forgets to stay invisible. A *spearman* guarding her screams and lunges, but the spear passes clean through the ghost and pins his own hat to the door. 'Will you be my friend?' Casper asks. She smiles, and for a moment he glows pink, **beautiful** too."],"梢":["branch tip","{Sherlock} peers through his magnifying glass in {Front} of the {Tower} at one twig fallen from a *tree*, and deduces that a *portrait* is hidden at the highest **branch tip**. Poor Watson is sent up to fetch it. The **branch tip** bends like a fishing rod, and the portrait swings past, showing Sherlock himself, looking smug and saying 'Elementary.'"],"坝":["dam","{Batman} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} as bath water floods the corridor. His utility belt has a shovel for this, and his grappling hook drags in sacks of *soil*, then wedges a giant *shell* in the gap to plug it: a **dam**. The water stops, the bathers bob behind it like ducks, and he growls that this is the **dam** Gotham deserves."],"蚕":["silkworm","{Cookie Monster} bursts {Inside} the {Mansion} and sees a fat white *bug* munching leaves that fall from the open *sky*. 'Me want cookie!' he yells, thinking each leaf is a green biscuit, and he devours the lot in a spray of crumbs. The hungry **silkworm** is furious and spins him into a cocoon, and the **silkworm** then eats its leaves in peace."],"敷":["to spread","{Frodo} limps in {Front} of the {Pool} on sore, hairy feet after another very long walk. Loyal Sam dips a *cane* in a pot of *ointment* and begins **to spread** it over his toes. Too weary to be fussed over, Frodo slips on the Ring and vanishes, so Sam **spreads** it on empty air, a deckchair and one startled seagull."],"澜":["big waves","{Lara Croft} pulls a lever {Inside} the {Mansion}, and it is a trap. *Water drops* patter from the ceiling, and then **big waves** crash down the grand staircase, one after another. She vaults the *railing*, which snaps off in her hands, and she surfs on it, ponytail streaming, while the **big waves** roll an ancient boulder along behind her."],"杏":["apricot","{Shrek} shoves into the {Bathroom} of the {Boxing Ring} to be alone, and finds a *tree* growing out of the sink. A *mouth* in its trunk spits an **apricot** at his head. He roars, it spits another, so he catches it, bites, and grumbles that it has no layers, only a stone. Still, it is the best **apricot** ever, so he locks Donkey out."],"绥":["to pacify","{Sailor Moon} rises {Inside} the {Waiting Room} to face an angry crowd **to pacify** them, and starts her transformation, which is long, sparkly and has its own music. A *soothing hand* glides from her wand, patting heads, while *silk thread* tucks a shawl around each patient. By the final pose they are all **pacified** and snoring, and she bursts into tears because nobody watched."],"冶":["to smelt","{Yoshi} licks up a lump of iron ore in the {Basement} of the {Hut}, swallows it, and his belly starts **to smelt** it, glowing red through his green skin. He flutter-jumps onto a *stage* and lays one red-hot egg. The *icicles* above drip and hiss on it, the shell cracks, and out rolls the bright metal he managed **to smelt**."],"庇":["to protect","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} as hail starts, and spreads his cape over two small *twins*. 'I am here **to protect** you,' he growls. He presses his utility belt, and a folding bat-*shed* clangs up around them, with ears on top. The twins giggle in the dry, and he broods out in the hail, standing guard **to protect** them."],"挠":["to scratch","{Naruto} sneaks {Inside} the {Tower} and finds the *emperor* with an itch that no servant can reach. He summons shadow clones by the dozen, each with a *helping hand*, and they begin **to scratch** his back, nose and crown. He giggles helplessly and begs for mercy, but Naruto never gives up, so they **scratch** on until he pays them in ramen."],"搂":["to hug","{Lara Croft} swings down into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse} and springs a trap: a stone idol with a *tall bun*, whose *helping hand* grabs her **to hug** her tighter and tighter. Struggling only makes it worse, but she spots the puzzle. She flings her arms around it and **hugs** back, something clicks in the bun, and the wall rolls open."],"倏":["sudden","{Sherlock} lights his pipe in {Front} of the {Pool} and has barely said 'Elementary' when a **sudden** swimmer shoots out of the water and lands in his teacup. Watson blinks, and the swimmer is gone. Sherlock, not at all surprised, shows him the crumb that predicted it, and then a **sudden** gust whips away both the crumb and his deerstalker."],"聂":["Nie","{Naruto} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and fills it with shadow clones to catch an *eavesdropper* with three huge ears pressed to the wall. Its name tag reads **Nie**. All the clones shout at once about becoming the greatest ninja ever. 'My name is **Nie**, and I hear everything,' it moans, clutching all three ears in pain."],"婉":["tactful","{Walter White} knocks on a door in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, and a *woman* in his chemistry class hands in a *rice bowl* holding her experiment, a smoking black sludge. His pride in precise science screams, but he stays **tactful**: 'How bold. Remarkable carbon content.' She beams. Being this **tactful** hurts him so much that his goatee twitches for an hour."],"噪":["noise","{Zorro} swings from a chandelier into the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, where a giant *mouth* blasts out the *birdsong* of a thousand birds in one shrieking **noise**. His rapier flicks a Z across its lip, and for one dashing second there is silence. Then the **noise** comes back twice as loud, cracking the windows, and he vanishes, laughing, with his fingers in his ears."],"稼":["crops","{James Bond} steps out of the {Bathroom} of the {Piazza} holding a *grain stalk* from Q, whose gadgets each do one absurd thing: this one plants **crops**. He presses the stem, and wheat bursts through the cobbles while a little farm *home* pops up around the café. 'Bond. James Bond,' he tells a startled waiter, harvesting the **crops** with a butter knife."],"鳍":["fin","{Chewbacca} lumbers {Inside} the {Beach} with his toolbox and finds an old *fish*, a *great-grandpa* with a long white beard, swimming in circles in a rock pool because one **fin** has snapped. He growls gently, the way he talks to his ship, and welds it back on. The mended **fin** spins like a hyperdrive, and the old fish shoots out to sea."],"菱":["water caltrop","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Boxing Ring}, which has flooded into an ancient obstacle course of floating *grass*. Ahead rises a steep *hill climb* of spiky black nuts, each with two horns: a **water caltrop**, nature's own trap. She leaps barefoot from spike to spike, ponytail whirling, says 'Ouch' just once, and claims the relic on top, a golden **water caltrop**."],"盏":["small cup","The {Joker} cackles down into the {Basement} of the {Mansion} with a prank. His rubber *twin blades* snip a huge *dish* smaller and smaller until only one dainty **small cup** is left, and he offers it to the butler, bowing with a huge grin. The butler sips, the **small cup** squirts him in the eye, and the Joker falls over laughing."],"匿":["to hide","{Naruto} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, loud as ever, and dives into an *open crate* **to hide** from his teacher. A shadow clone, his perfect *lookalike*, jumps in after him, then dozens more, until the crate bulges with orange and every clone is shouting 'Shh!' Kakashi lifts one eyebrow: the worst attempt **to hide** in ninja history."],"吱":["creak","The {Joker} creeps in {Front} of the {Beehive} along a thin *branch*, to which he has glued a wind-up *mouth*, so that every step goes **creak**. The bees freeze, and he bounces with glee and cackles. Another huge **creak**, and the bees start laughing too, and then the real branch gives way and drops him grinning into the honey."],"寝":["bedroom","{Chewbacca} ducks into the {Basement} of the {Inn} with a pillow, huge and tired, and rips some panels off the wall in a temper. He bolts them into a low *roof* over a mattress, just like a bunk on his ship, and calls it a **bedroom**. It rattles with every snore, and the whole **bedroom** is soon shaking the inn awake."],"揽":["to seize","{Lara Croft} leaps into the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, where a *sightseer* is photographing a golden idol and standing right on the pressure plate. A stone *helping hand* shoots out of the wall **to seize** the idol, and it snaps shut on the camera. Lara somersaults over it, ponytail flying, and is first **to seize** the idol, the sightseer and the exit."],"髓":["marrow","{Sailor Moon} sits crying in the {Basement} of the {Waiting Room}, too hungry to give her speech, when a scruffy *tagalong* drags in a giant *bone*. She throws her tiara, and it cracks the bone open, spilling soft **marrow** that sparkles in the moonlight of her wand. They sit side by side slurping **marrow**, and Luna the cat looks away."],"秉":["to grasp","{Batman} crouches in the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring} over his only clue: a *grain stalk*. A *long comb* from his belt teases it straight, looking for prints, and he pulls on his bat-gloves **to grasp** it. The grip is a gadget, and it will not let go: boxers tug at it for ten rounds, and he goes on brooding with it **grasped** tight."],"哺":["to feed","{Batman} grapples down into the {Basement} of the {Pool}, where a *seedbed* is sprouting baby birds, each one a wide-open *mouth*. He broods over them, then reaches for his utility belt and fires tiny grappling hooks loaded with worms **to feed** every chick at once. 'Nobody goes hungry in Gotham,' he growls, and he stays all night **to feed** them."],"矢":["arrow","{Sherlock} finds one feather on a wasp in the {Basement} of the {Beehive}, and deduces that an *arrow* will arrive at exactly noon. He holds up his watch and the **arrow** whistles in, pinning his deerstalker to the wall. 'Elementary,' he says, not blinking. Watson asks what happens at one o'clock, and a second **arrow** answers him."],"啪":["pop","{Pikachu} bounces in {Front} of the {Spa}, cheeks sparking, and opens his small *mouth* to shout his own name. A tiny spark jumps to the hot tub, and every bubble goes **pop**. The bathers give a startled *clap*, the static leaps from hand to hand, and their shower caps **pop** off one after another, until he dives back into his ball."],"帜":["flag","The {Joker} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive}, ties a *towel* to his squirting flower and cackles at his new **flag**. A *lone bird* lands on top to look important and pecks it, and the flower soaks every bee in the hive. The bees salute anyway, and the **flag** unrolls a sign saying BANG, which makes him laugh until he falls over."],"邵":["surname Shao","{Sherlock} kicks open the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, finds a grassy *hillside* where the tub should be, and a *town crier* bellowing 'Oyez!' From the mud on one boot he deduces the man's name: **surname Shao**. 'Elementary,' he says smugly. The crier rings his bell, and by teatime everyone on the hill, Watson included, has the **surname Shao**."],"嗽":["to cough","{Sailor Moon} sips lemonade through a *sipping straw* in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, halfway through a speech about justice. It goes down the wrong way, her *mouth* flies open, and she starts **to cough** and to cry at the same time. Every **cough** fires her tiara off her head, and Luna the cat ducks as it whizzes past."],"挟":["to clasp","{Shrek} slips {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} to get away from Donkey, wanting only silence. A huge *helping hand* with iron *tongs* lunges from the dark **to clasp** him by the belt, and it grabs Donkey too. Shrek roars and thrashes, but they stay **clasped** together nose to nose, and Donkey is delighted, because now he has all night to talk."],"缸":["vat","{Gandalf} taps a *clay jar* on a *workbench* in {Front} of the {Hangar} and mutters a spell to make it hold more pipe-weed. It swells, and swells, until the bench groans and buckles under a **vat** taller than an aeroplane. Cranky, he climbs in to reverse the magic, and his 'You shall not pass!' booms around the **vat** like a gong."],"揉":["to knead","{Robocop} clanks {Inside} the {Boathouse}, his visor locking on a lump of dough: directive nine says he is **to knead** it. A *helping hand* folds out of his steel chest, gripping the dough, and a *springy twig* boings out to keep the beat. Push, fold, push, fold. 'Thank you for your cooperation,' he says, and **kneads** the captain's hat as well."],"腻":["greasy","{Naruto} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, his hands **greasy** from a huge bowl of ramen. He tries to climb the *moon* for ninja training and slides straight off, then pays for more ramen, but the coin slips away and a *second coin* shoots after it. Even his spinning Rasengan comes out **greasy**, spraying oil over the sand."],"驯":["to tame","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Dunes}, where a wild *horse* is kicking everything in sight. He gives his loudest ogre roar, and it leaps into a *river* and kicks harder. Nothing can **tame** it until Donkey wades in and starts talking, on and on, for six hours. Shrek nods: there is no better way **to tame** a beast."],"缆":["cable","{Lara Croft} dangles over a pit in the {Basement} of the {Mansion}, needing to cross. She braids *silk thread* round and round, her fingers flying, into a thick **cable**, and flings it across with a perfect knot. A *sightseer* clips on first and slides over, taking pictures. Then a boulder comes rolling, and Lara runs across the **cable**, ponytail flying."],"晌":["midday","{Sherlock} taps out his pipe in the {Basement} of the {Hangar}, and from one sandwich crumb on a pilot's sleeve he deduces the exact hour. 'Elementary, Watson: it is **midday**.' To prove it, a rusty *weathervane* spins round and points straight up, a hatch opens, and the *sun* beams down on his smug face, exactly at **midday**."],"瘫":["paralyzed","{Tarzan} swings in {Front} of the {Mansion} and lands on a *sickbed* left out on the lawn, the softest thing a jungle man has ever met. He cannot move a finger: he is **paralyzed** by comfort. A *caught bird* flutters to his chest and explains, in bird, that it is only feathers. He gives one weak yell, still **paralyzed**, and sleeps."],"贮":["to store","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds a *storeroom*, the perfect place **to store** his pranks. He packs a squirting flower into each *shell* and stacks them to the ceiling, cackling. He tries **to store** one more, the door bulges, and the whole lot bursts out and soaks every swimmer, and his huge grin only gets bigger."],"觅":["to seek","{Mario} warps up in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, where a giant *claw* scoops sand and a *watcher* with binoculars scans the horizon. 'Wahoo!' he shouts, and he stomps sandcastle after sandcastle, all **to seek** the princess. Each time Toad pops out to say she is in another castle, so Mario just goes on, **to seek** the next one."],"朦":["dim","{Mario} creeps {Inside} the {Jungle} at night, but the *moon* is wearing a *blindfold*, so all is **dim**, a blur of grey shapes. He stomps on something he hopes is a Goomba, and it turns out to be his own foot. He head-butts a block for a coin to light his way, but the coin is **dim** too."],"僻":["remote","{Pikachu} sparks in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, a spot so **remote** that surely no trainer can find him. But a *standing person* appears on the dune, a *pioneer* in a fur hat, planting a flag and holding up a Poké Ball. He throws it, and it is all so **remote** that the ball has to come by post, three weeks late."],"隋":["Sui dynasty","{Sailor Moon} begins her long sparkly transformation {Inside} the {Waiting Room}, and it goes on so long that her wand opens a grassy *hillside* back in the **Sui dynasty**. The hillside rumbles and splits into a canal, and an emperor digs it with a tiny spoon. She makes a speech about justice, cries loudly, and the **Sui dynasty** asks her to dig."],"蔓":["creeper","{Mario} pops from a warp pipe in the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, and a *long veil* of *grass* slithers over his boots. He stomps it, head-butts a block, and out climbs a beanstalk of a **creeper** that winds up the piano and the butler's legs. 'Wahoo!' he yells, and he climbs the **creeper** right through the ceiling, collecting coins."],"咋":["how","{Zorro} swings down into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and vanishes in a swirl of cape, laughing. A *jack-in-the-box* springs up with a huge *mouth*, yelling '**How**? **How** did you do that?' He reappears, slashes a Z in its lid and shuts it. It bounces straight back out with a Z on its forehead, wanting to know how.","zǎ"],"嵌":["to inlay","{Chewbacca} fixes his bandolier in the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange} when a *mountain* of coins slides over him, and he roars. A child with a *sweet tooth* shows him how **to inlay** gumdrops into gold, and his great hairy fingers, used to mending ships, turn out to be perfect. He sets to work to **inlay** every coin, growling happily."],"虔":["reverent","{Chewbacca} roars his way {Inside} the {Yen Exchange}, furious about the rates, and starts ripping a till apart. A *tiger* kneels at the cash machine, very **reverent**, and the *tattoo* of a temple on its back begins softly to chime. He stops in mid-roar, takes off his bandolier and bows with his hairy forehead on the floor, shockingly **reverent**."],"畔":["side","{Pikachu} tumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, and a muddy *rice field* sucks at his small feet, so he scuttles along the **side**, tail sparking. Ash, on the far **side**, throws a Poké Ball to rescue him. It plops into the mud only *half* way across, and they stare at each other through the ducks."],"琐":["trifling","{Sailor Moon} bursts into the {Basement} of the {Warehouse}, completes her whole long sparkly transformation and throws her tiara, only to find a *king* on a bucket weeping over **trifling** matters: a bent paper clip, a crumb, a sock with a hole. She gives her speech about justice anyway, then cries loudly. Luna sighs: all that sparkle for something so **trifling**."],"碟":["plate","{Darth Vader} looms {Inside} the {Yeti Cave} and raises one black glove. A flat *stone* floats up with the Force, *leaves* whirl off it, and his red lightsaber trims it round into a perfect **plate**. The Yeti holds it out for dinner, but Vader spots a tiny chip and booms his disapproval, Force-choking the **plate** until it cracks."],"涩":["astringent","{Sailor Moon} strikes a pose in the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} to make a speech, and *water drops* from a green persimmon plop into her open mouth. It is so **astringent** that her lips pucker shut, and justice comes out as a squeak. She tries to cry loudly, and even that is dry. Luna licks a drop, **astringent** again, and her whiskers curl."],"胧":["hazy","{Lara Croft} climbs a sea wall {Inside} the {Lagoon} at night to read an old puzzle, but a *dragon* drifts across the *moon*, puffing smoke, and everything turns **hazy**. The carved symbols blur. She swings by her ponytail? No: by one hand, squinting through the **hazy** glow, until the dragon sneezes, the air clears, and she cracks the code."],"嘟":["toot","{Darth Vader} breathes loudly in {Front} of the {Pool}, where a giant *mouth* is blowing a trumpet over the *capital city*. **Toot**! Every bus in the city honks back. He raises one black glove and Force-chokes the trumpet, booming his disapproval, and it wheezes out one small, squashed **toot**, right in time with his breathing."],"蹦":["to hop","{Batman} crouches in the {Bathroom} of the {Jungle} as an *avalanche* of coconuts roars down at him. His *kicking foot* stamps on the utility belt's emergency button, and out springs a Bat-pogo stick, so he begins **to hop**. Cape flapping and voice gruff between boings, he has to **hop** over every coconut, growling that nobody must ever hear of this."],"冢":["burial mound","The {Joker} cackles in the {Basement} of the {Lagoon}, arranging a fake **burial mound** under a *cloth cover* as a prank. He whips the cover off with a huge grin, and out trots a *shackled pig* in a party hat, rattling its chain and squirting a flower. The guests shriek, then laugh, and the **burial mound** waddles away after the pig."],"浏":["browse","{Lara Croft} rests {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} with old tomb maps on her phone, *water drops* falling from her ponytail onto the screen. She uses a relic, a *tattooed blade*, to flick the pages past. 'Just a quick **browse**,' she says, and climbs to the top bunk. Six hours later she is still there to **browse**, while a boulder rolls by unnoticed."],"裔":["descendants","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach} wearing a long *robe*, and lays egg after egg. They crack and out hop his **descendants**, children and grandchildren in tiny matching robes. A *skylight* bangs open in the sand, more flutter-jump through it, and all of them shout his name, as his **descendants** start laying eggs of their own."],"襟":["lapel","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Inn} and touches the gadget from Q on his **lapel**, which does one absurd thing: it sprouts a *forbidden grove* of tiny trees. His *shirt* buttons pop off in alarm, and a squirrel creeps up his sleeve to steal an acorn. 'Hands off my **lapel**,' he says, unruffled, and orders a drink."],"叨":["garrulous","{Darth Vader} glares in {Front} of the {Tower} at a *mouth* that will not stop: the weather, its cousins, the trouble with stormtroopers. He Force-chokes it, and it is still **garrulous**. He lifts a *knife* with the Force to cut off one word, and the mouth asks if it is sharp. 'I am your father,' he booms, and the **garrulous** thing wants to hear all about the family."],"诀":["knack","{James Bond} glides {Inside} the {Ice Rink} wearing an *archer's ring* from Q, which does one absurd thing: it whispers. A *small speech bubble* floats out and tells him the **knack** of skating backwards in a tuxedo without spilling his drink. He does it first time, shaken but never stirred, and every skater begs to learn the **knack**."],"旭":["rising sun","{Shrek} stumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Museum} at dawn, grumpy, wanting it dark for ever. Donkey, wide awake, has wedged a *crowbar* under the *sun*, which is stuck behind a dinosaur skeleton, and he heaves until up it comes: the **rising sun**. It blasts Shrek in the eyes, he roars, and Donkey sings a song about the **rising sun**."],"虾":["shrimp","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of the {Piazza} enjoying a quiet supper when a pink *bug* with a curled tail marches *downstairs* towards the fountain, then a thousand more. **Shrimp**! He scoops them up in one huge green hand and fries them over swamp gas. 'They've got layers,' he grunts, peeling one, while Donkey asks for every **shrimp** he can get."],"簿":["register","{Batman} studies the evidence in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}: *bamboo* slips, stitched into a soggy **register** of swimmers. A *floodplain* of bath water spreads around his boots and floats each slip towards him. The detective reads out the **register** in his gruffest voice, every swimmer squeaks 'Here!' in terror, and he broods over who is missing."],"啤":["beer","{Pikachu} sits {Inside} the {Beach} and sees a crab go by with a tray of **beer**. His cheeks spark, a tiny jolt hits the glass, and foam erupts. A sleeping sailor's huge *mouth* catches some and burps, and a palm-leaf *fan* flaps the rest out over the waves in bubbles. Soon every gull is chasing **beer** foam, and Pikachu cheers."],"擒":["to capture","{Chewbacca} roars {Inside} the {Inn} after a runaway *fowl* that has stolen a part of his ship. A vast *helping hand* swoops in **to capture** it, feathers explode, and the hand grabs the innkeeper by mistake. In a temper Chewbacca rips off the door, flings his bandolier like a lasso, and that is how he manages **to capture** the bird."],"枣":["Chinese date","{Zorro} drops from a chandelier into the {Basement} of the {Tower}, where a black bush bristles with one huge *thorn* after another. His rapier slashes a Z across the biggest *thorn*, and *two sparks* fly off the steel and light up a fat red **Chinese date** hanging in the dark. He spears the **Chinese date**, takes a sweet bite and vanishes laughing, cape swirling."],"嘎":["squawk","{Gandalf} arrives in {Front} of the {Spa} exactly when he means to, and a crow lands on his staff. He casts a silencing spell, but it misfires: the crow's *mouth* swells to the size of a bathtub and lets out a **squawk** that knocks a drainpipe down with a *clank*. \"You shall not pass!\" he roars, and the next **squawk** blows his pointy hat clean off."],"苑":["garden","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, and his sticky tongue slurps up a lawn of *grass* along with a *tossing sleeper* rolling about on it. Gulp, wobble, plop: he lays one enormous egg, and it cracks open into a **garden** of tulips and hedges. The *tossing sleeper* flattens the flowerbeds, snoring, while coins sprout along every path of the **garden**."],"牟":["to moo","{Mario} jumps {Inside} the {Boathouse} and head-butts a floating block, but instead of a coin out drops a *cow*. He stomps on her back and she begins **to moo**, so he jabs her with his *elbow* for a bonus and she holds the note longer. \"Wahoo!\" he shouts, stomping in rhythm as she goes on **to moo** an entire opera, each note paying out one coin."],"呕":["to vomit","{Casper} floats through the wall into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, hoping to make a friend of a seasick sailor. The sailor looks up from his spinning *district map*, sees a ghost, and his *mouth* drops open as he starts **to vomit** green soup straight through Casper's see-through tummy. \"Sorry,\" says Casper, waving kindly, which only makes the sailor **vomit** again, all over the harbour."],"骆":["camel","{Lara Croft} somersaults into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, dodges a rolling boulder and lands astride a *horse* with two humps. A lost *visitor* clinging to the back hump hands her a relic tablet, and she solves its puzzle in seconds: this is no horse, it is a **camel**. The **camel** spits, and Lara climbs its neck, ponytail flying, to ride it out past the crates."],"凸":["protruding","{Tarzan} swings down on a vine in {Front} of the {Pool} and lands on a knob of paving that shoves up under his foot. He gives the jungle yell, and every slab answers by bulging upward, **protruding** like the belly of a well-fed ape. Baffled by civilisation, he asks the apes for advice, and they all stick out their stomachs, **protruding** even further."],"熄":["to put out","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Beach} hut, furious that Donkey has lit a *campfire* on his quiet sand and will not stop singing around it. He sucks in one huge onion *breath* and roars **to put out** the flames. It works too well: he manages **to put out** the fire, the lighthouse and the moon, and for one blissful second nobody talks."],"兀":["towering","{Walter White} adjusts his glasses in the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and adds exactly three drops of growth solution to the legs of a *tall stool*. It fizzes and shoots upward, past the diving board and past the clouds, **towering** over the whole town. \"That is precise science,\" he calls down proudly, black hat among the pigeons, as the **towering** stool goes on climbing."],"喔":["oh","{Casper} hovers on the {Roof} of the {Fort} beside a tiny *cottage*, hoping someone will be his friend. He turns visible to say hello, and a huge *mouth* pops out of its chimney and gasps, \"**Oh**!\" He turns invisible and it gasps again, \"**Oh**!\" Flicker, gasp, flicker, gasp: he never means to frighten anyone, and the whole fort joins in with startled little gasps."],"裳":["clothes","{Sherlock} crouches on the {Roof} of the {Hangar} and studies a single silk *robe* through his magnifying glass. From one loose thread he deduces everything the owner has ever worn, and as he names each item, the *robe* shakes it out of a sleeve: shirts, socks, ball gowns. \"Elementary,\" he says, buried to the deerstalker in **clothes**, while Watson trails behind folding the **clothes**."],"凹":["concave","{Casper} floats in {Front} of the {Tower} and says a friendly hello to the lawn. The frightened lawn flinches away, sinking in the middle until it curves into a bowl, **concave** as a satellite dish. He drifts lower to apologise, and it shrinks from him further, more **concave** with every kind word, until rain pools there and birds arrive to bathe."],"赎":["to ransom","{Sherlock} strides {Inside} the {Pool}, inspects one wet footprint and deduces that the pirate at the *market stall* has kidnapped Watson. \"Elementary,\" he says, slapping down a giant *shell* stuffed with coins **to ransom** his friend. The stall snaps shut on the money like a trap, the pirate grins, and Sherlock must also **ransom** his own violin."],"屯":["to station","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Casino} on a vine, baffled by the flashing machines, and gives the jungle yell to summon his apes. They come by the hundred, and he orders them **to station** themselves at every table. A *camp* springs up on the carpet, tents and flags and all, and apes are soon **stationed** on the roulette wheel, eating bananas and guarding the chips."],"膛":["hollow space","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Hangar} and his vine lets go over an empty *main hall*, so wide he cannot see the far wall. He gives the jungle yell, and it rolls round the **hollow space** for ten minutes, while the *moon* drifts in and floats about with nothing to bump into. Apes arrive, baffled, and shout at the **hollow space** to hear it answer them."],"浇":["to pour","{James Bond} straightens his tuxedo in {Front} of the {Cat Café} and presses a cufflink from Q that does one absurd thing: it summons rain on whoever is nearest. *Water drops* gather over a shouting *emperor*, then buckets, then a whole lake begins **to pour** down on his crown. \"Reign stops play,\" says Bond, unruffled, and he keeps it **pouring** until the emperor sprouts petunias."],"灼":["to scorch","The {Joker} cackles his way {Inside} the {Warehouse}, scooping glowing coals from a *campfire* with a long *ladle*. His prank is **to scorch** a giant grin onto every crate, and the smell of burnt toast fills the air. He deals trick playing cards that **scorch** smiley faces where they land, then squirts his flower at the *campfire* and shrieks with laughter when it spits sparks back."],"裘":["fur coat","{Chewbacca} squeezes {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} in a borrowed silk *robe*, growls at the cold and rips the *robe* apart in a temper. A sleepy backpacker sees all that hair, shouts that someone left out a giant *fur coat*, and hangs him in the wardrobe. He roars in protest, but only friends understand him, so the whole dormitory queues to try on the **fur coat**, the warmest **fur coat** they have ever hugged."],"砰":["thump","{Pikachu} crackles in {Front} of the {Jungle}, cheeks sparking, and fires a Thunderbolt at a *stone* the size of a sofa. It hops into the air and lands *flat* on the mud with a huge **thump**, and monkeys tumble out of the trees. \"Pika!\" he squeaks, zapping it again, and every **thump** throws him a little higher, until he lands back in his Poké Ball."],"棘":["thorns","{James Bond} strolls {Inside} the {Beach} in his tuxedo and finds the sand has grown **thorns**. One *thorn* punctures his left Q-issue shoe, which inflates as a lifeboat, and another *thorn* pops it with a bang. Unruffled, he adjusts his cuffs, tells the hedge \"Bond. James Bond,\" and strides on through the **thorns**, trousers in ribbons, without spilling a drop of his drink."],"橡":["oak","{Shrek} stomps into the {Bathroom} of the {Stadium} wanting only to be left alone, but a huge *tree* has burst up through the floor, and an *elephant* is shaking it with its trunk. Acorns rain on his head like hail. \"It's an **oak**!\" yells Donkey, who will not shut up, so Shrek roars, moves his swamp into the shade of the **oak** and slams a door on them both."],"碱":["alkali","{James Bond} descends to the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} with a Q pen that does one absurd thing: it sprays **alkali**. He squirts a *stone* and it fizzes, then squirts a jar of *salt* and it hisses and bubbles over. The banker's notes turn slippery and squeak out of his fingers. \"Basically, you're finished,\" says Bond, rinsing his hands in **alkali**, perfectly unruffled."],"聋":["deaf","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Lagoon}, lifts a relic off its pedestal and springs an ancient trap: a stone *dragon* wakes and roars into a giant *ear* carved in the wall. The *ear* rings like a bell and goes **deaf**, and so does she. She backflips away, ponytail flying, and solves the rest of the puzzle by sign language, completely **deaf**."],"姥":["grandma","{Lara Croft} climbs down into the {Basement} of the {Tower} expecting ancient traps, and the floor tilts as dumplings the size of boulders roll at her. She leaps them, ponytail flying, and finds the little *woman* who built it all: her **grandma**, knitting beside an *old man* who pulls the levers. \"Eat!\" cries **grandma**, and another dumpling rumbles down the corridor."],"瑜":["excellence","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps {Inside} the {Museum}, legs whirring, and hovers above a *king* paddling a *dugout canoe* up the stairs in perfect balance. He swallows the *dugout canoe* in one slurp and lays it as a flawless golden egg, not a scratch on it. The *king* gasps and stamps it with a plaque reading **Excellence**, and the whole museum applauds such pure **excellence**."],"毋":["don't","{Walter White} strides {Inside} the {Pool} holding a beaker of school sodium, ready to show the class a spectacular splash. A huge *left hand* rises from the water, palm out: **Don't**! He cites his precise calculations and raises the beaker again, and the hand wags a finger: **don't**. \"I am the one who knocks,\" he mutters, and the hand knocks the beaker gently back into its rack."],"娅":["-ya (in names)","{Yoshi} flutter-jumps into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and his sticky tongue whips out at every *woman* in the pool, adding a **ya** to each name: \"Sonya! Tanya! Natalya!\" He gulps, strains, and lays an egg that cracks open on a *silver medal* for each of them, because 娅 is the **ya** that ends women's foreign names in Chinese."],"沮":["dejected","{James Bond} sits in the {Basement} of the {Museum} on a broken *stepladder*, after the first failed escape of his career, as *water drops* plip onto his tuxedo. Q's exploding pen only squeaks, the one-liner dies in his throat, and for once he is **dejected**. He sighs, \"Bond. James Bond,\" to nobody, and even the stuffed mammoth droops beside him, equally **dejected**."],"萌":["to sprout","{Mario} leaps {Inside} the {Jungle} and head-butts a block hidden in the *grass*, but instead of a coin, a vine begins **to sprout** from it. The *sun and moon* both beam down at once, and everything he stomps starts **to sprout** too: beans, mushrooms, a baby palm from his red cap. \"Wahoo!\" he shouts, climbing the vine with leaves coming out of his moustache."],"俏":["charming","{Chewbacca} ducks out of the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, combs his huge hairy chest and poses with his bandolier beside a *standing person* painting his *portrait*. He gives one soft, flirty growl, and the *portrait* winks, waves and growls it back. It's so **charming** that cats fall off their cushions and the painter faints. Han would never admit it, but Chewbacca is **charming**."],"黯":["dim","{Casper} floats down the chimney and through the wall into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion}, trailing a cloud of *soot*. He only wants to join the party, so he waves, and the *soot* spreads over every lamp until the room turns **dim**. A sad *music* starts up on its own, the guests flee, and the friendly ghost sits alone in the **dim** grey light, humming along."],"撇":["to cast away","{Pikachu} sparks in {Front} of the {Yeti Cave}, dressed in smelly *rags*, when a giant *helping hand* hurls a Poké Ball to catch him. \"Pika!\" he snaps, and a Thunderbolt knocks it flying: he wants **to cast away** the ball, the trainer and the whole idea. The hand rips off the *rags* and flings them after it, all **cast away** across the snow, where the Yeti tries them on."],"粟":["millet","{Sailor Moon} trips into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} mid-transformation, pigtails spinning, ribbons everywhere, and her thrown tiara smashes a *cabinet* open. Out pour tiny yellow grains that shove aside a sack of *rice*, and she bursts into loud tears as the **millet** rises round her knees. Luna sighs and names the stuff, and Sailor Moon makes a speech about justice for **millet** as chickens arrive."],"粪":["manure","{Frodo} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Funfair} after a very long walk, and his bare hairy feet sink into a steaming heap of **manure**. Two *joined hands* pop up and shower him with *rice* as if it were his wedding. He slips on the Ring to vanish, but his footprints give him away, so loyal Sam plods after him through the **manure** with a bucket."],"尹":["Yin","{Yoshi} flutters down into the {Basement} of the {Inn} and lands beside a stern *magistrate* who stamps every paper with his name: **Yin**, **Yin**, **Yin**. Yoshi's tongue snatches the stamp, gulp, and he lays it as an egg that prints the name on whatever it hits. He throws it with a cheerful chirp, and the *magistrate* wakes up with **Yin** across his forehead."],"苟":["careless","{Gandalf} stomps into the {Basement} of the {Boathouse}, wise and cranky, and enchants a *scruffy dog* to tidy up while he smokes his pipe. The spell is **careless**, cast without looking, and the dog sinks a canoe, chews the oars and sets off his fireworks. Gandalf sighs, reaches for his staff and trips on the paint pot, just as **careless** as the dog."],"癫":["crazy","{Darth Vader} stands in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange}, breathing loudly, and lifts a *sickbed* into the air with the Force. The patient on it flips into a *headstand* and shouts that coins taste like music: he has gone **crazy**. Vader booms his disapproval, but the floating coins start to spin, and soon the great black helmet is nodding along, also **crazy**."],"蚂":["ant","{Mario} drops through a warp pipe into the {Basement} of the {Spa} and goes to stomp a tiny *bug* saddled like a *horse*. It's an **ant**, trotting off with a crumb of soap, and it dodges his boot every time. He tosses it a mushroom, and with a rising jingle the **ant** grows to the size of a pony, so he hops on with a \"Wahoo!\" and rides it round the steam room."],"禹":["Yu the Great","{Yoshi} paddles down into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, which is flooding fast, and a bearded *flood hero* in straw sandals climbs on his back, booming that he is **Yu the Great**. Yoshi's tongue slurps up the flood, gulp after gulp, and he lays it as giant eggs. Each egg rolls off and digs a channel, the water drains away, and the exhibits bow to **Yu the Great**."],"廖":["surname Liao","{Lara Croft} flips into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and squeezes past a rotten *shed* hiding an ancient tomb door. She solves its puzzle and lifts the relic, a bronze nameplate, and a pair of *soaring wings* bursts up and carries it off through the ceiling. She climbs after it, ponytail flying, and reads the inscription: **surname Liao**. The cats, all wearing **surname Liao** tags, purr."],"俭":["frugal","{James Bond} descends to the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} to collect his gadget from Q, but budgets have been cut. A *standing person* in patched socks calls an *assembly* of coins, counts them twice and hands him a single paperclip, so **frugal** that it has been used before. \"How thrilling,\" says Bond, unruffled, and he escapes using the paperclip, suitably **frugal**."],"帖":["notice","{Tarzan} swings into the {Basement} of the {Yeti Cave}, where a *fortune teller* pins a *towel* to the wall with a **notice** painted on it. Baffled by civilisation, he sniffs it, licks it and asks a passing ape what it says. The ape shrugs, so Tarzan gives the jungle yell, tears down the **notice** and wears it as a spare loincloth while the snow falls exactly as foretold.","tiě"],"煎":["to pan-fry","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Yen Exchange} and presses a Q button on the *front* of his tuxedo, which flips open into a frying pan. He crouches over glowing *embers* and starts **to pan-fry** an egg, a dumpling and the banker's lunch. \"Sunny side up,\" he says, unruffled, and goes on **to pan-fry** a gold coin for dessert."],"缕":["strand","{Lara Croft} creeps into the {Basement} of the {Museum}, where a statue with a *tall bun* guards a maze of ancient corridors. She tugs a loose *silk thread* and follows one gleaming **strand** through the dark, ducking spikes, as the *tall bun* unravels above her. At the end she ties the **strand** to her ponytail and climbs it hand over hand, out past the relics."],"窦":["cavity","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, breathing loudly, and finds a dark *cave* hiding a *market stall* that sells teeth. He lifts a giant fish with the Force and peers into its mouth at a huge **cavity**. His red lightsaber hums as he bores it clean, booming disapproval at its brushing, and the stall hands him another fish with an even bigger **cavity**."],"簇":["cluster","{Cookie Monster} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool}, googly eyes spinning, where a whole *clan* of tiny cookies huddles on *bamboo* rafts. Seeing him, they crowd closer and closer into one tight **cluster**, like a bunch of grapes. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, and he swallows the entire **cluster** at one go in a spray of crumbs, rafts and all."],"棱":["edge","{Lara Croft} runs {Inside} the {Jungle} as the path turns into a brutal *hill climb*, boulders bouncing behind her. At the top stands a *tree* cut perfectly square, and she grabs its sharp **edge**, swings up and lands on it. A rolling boulder clips the trunk, and she runs along the **edge** on her toes, ponytail flying, arms wide, while a relic glints at the far end."],"叩":["to kowtow","{Kermit} flails into the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse} with his clipboard, late for the river god's big number, and hops straight down **to kowtow**, forehead banging the tiles. A brass *door knocker* on the door bangs back in time. \"Yaaay!\" he panics, arms flapping, hopping and bowing faster, and by the finale the entire cast has come out **to kowtow** in a line."],"呐":["battle cry","{Naruto} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} in his orange jumpsuit and makes fifty shadow clones, all stuffed in a steamy *inner room*. Each clone opens its *mouth* in a **battle cry**, and the noise blows cucumbers off every bather's face. He never gives up, so the clones fill their lungs and deliver a second, bigger **battle cry** that rattles the ramen bowls."],"瑶":["jade","{Yoshi} flutters {Inside} the {Tower} to a *king* on a throne of green stones, and his long tongue slurps up the glowing seat. Gulp, wobble, plop: he lays one smooth egg of pure **jade**, cool and shining. The *king* lands on the floor with a bump, then claps, and Yoshi lays a dozen more until the stairs are paved in **jade**."],"墅":["villa","{Sherlock} strides into the {Bathroom} of the {Pool} and finds it opens on an empty *wilderness* of weeds. He rubs a pinch of *soil* under his magnifying glass and deduces, from one crumb of plaster, that a **villa** stands here. \"Elementary,\" he says, and the *soil* heaves and spits up the white shutters, the hammock, the whole **villa**, with Watson already unpacking on the terrace."],"莺":["oriole","{Yoshi} crouches in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring}, in long *grass*, and his tongue zips out at a flash of yellow: gulp. Wobble, plop, and he lays an egg that cracks open, and out flies an **oriole** singing like a flute. The song knocks a boxer flat and the referee starts counting, as the *grass* sways in time and Yoshi lays three more, each hatching another **oriole**."],"烫":["to scald","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} on a vine, following the smell of *soup* bubbling over a roaring *campfire*. Baffled by spoons, he plunges his whole face in, and it is hot enough **to scald** his tongue. His jungle yell shakes the planes, apes come running, and he hops about blowing on his toes, for he has managed **to scald** those too."],"蛙":["frog","{Walter White} adjusts his goggles in {Front} of the {Spa} and drips one green reagent onto a *jade tablet* beneath a *bug*. There's a precise fizz, and the *bug* swells, grows legs and becomes a big **frog**. \"That, class, is chemistry,\" he says proudly, black hat tilted. The **frog** leaps up, swallows his beaker with a slurp, and sits in the hot tub looking pleased."],"歹":["bad","{Darth Vader} stalks into the {Basement} of the {Island}, breathing loudly, and feels something **bad** in the Force. A *skeleton* with a moustache has stolen his spare cape and is twirling it, teeth clacking. He lifts it into the air and booms his disapproval: **bad** skeleton, very bad. It only cackles, drops onto his boot and scuttles off with the pirates' treasure map."],"伶":["actor","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Boxing Ring} carrying a relic from a lost tomb, a cracked tragic mask. A *standing person* puts it on and begins to weep grandly, and a *herald* blows a trumpet to present the great **actor**. Boxers drop their gloves and sob. Lara snatches the mask back before the curse spreads, and the **actor** keeps bowing and bowing anyway."],"葱":["scallion","{Cookie Monster} stampedes in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, googly eyes spinning, as long green *grass* shoots up through the paving. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, and a stopwatch labelled *hurry* buzzes at him, so he devours the lot in a spray of crumbs. It's no cookie: it's **scallion**! His eyes water, every crumb turns oniony, and he burps a long curl of **scallion** across the water."],"哮":["roar","{Shrek} throws open the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café}, wanting only peace, and finds a *dutiful son* politely begging him to keep it down. That does it: his huge green *mouth* opens and out comes an ogre **roar** that blows off the boy's glasses and flattens the cats. They answer with tiny furious copies, and Donkey, not shutting up, adds a **roar** that sounds like a kettle."],"眩":["dizzy","{Shrek} stumbles into the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, where Donkey is gabbling in circles round him and coins spin on every shelf. A *dark thread* loops round his *eye* and whirls him like a top, layers flapping, till he's completely **dizzy**. He roars at the room to stand still, grabs a coin press for balance, and even the onion in his pocket feels **dizzy**."],"坤":["earth","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Casino} with his clipboard as the big finale falls apart, so he spears a lump of *soil* on a *skewer* and holds it up like a prop planet. \"Yaaay! I bet the whole **earth**!\" he yelps, arms windmilling. The roulette ball lands on his number, the owner hands him the deed, and he strums his banjo and bows with the **earth** on a stick."],"廓":["outline","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, clipboard flapping, with a show to stage and no set, just one dusty *shed*. In a panic he chalks a *city wall* on the floor, only the **outline** of a city, and the actors pretend to walk through its gates. \"Yaaay!\" he squeals, and by curtain time he has chalked the **outline** of an entire country round the crates."],"讳":["taboo","{Homer} waddles out of the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room} and a *small speech bubble* floats up, full of doughnuts. A *leather strap* lassos it and pulls tight, because here that word is **taboo**. He tries a dim scheme, spelling it out with his fingers, and the strap snaps round that too. \"D'oh!\" he wails, and the patients gasp: even that is **taboo**."],"啼":["to cry","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Beach} on a vine and hears a huge *mouth* up in the clouds begin **to cry**. He talks to animals, so he asks the gulls, and they say the *sky god* has lost his kite. Tarzan's jungle yell comes out as a sob, the gulls sob, the apes sob too, and soon the whole shoreline has started **to cry** in the rain."],"乍":["suddenly","The {Joker} creeps over to the {Bathroom} of the {Spa} and, cackling, sets a trap in every towel. **Suddenly** a *jack-in-the-box* springs out of the sink with a boing, a squirting flower in its fist, and bathers leap into the air. **Suddenly** another bursts from a cucumber, a playing card flies out of the soap, and nobody, not even the Joker, knows when the next will pop."],"瓣":["segment","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and lands between two cooks locked in a *quarrel*, tugging a *melon* back and forth. He growls, unclips a melon gadget from his utility belt and twists once: the fruit falls open in neat **segments**. The *quarrel* stops dead. Brooding, he deduces who deserves which **segment** and delivers each one by grappling hook."],"矫":["to correct","{James Bond} wobbles into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} on *stilts*, wearing Q's latest cufflink, which does one thing: it straightens. He fires an *arrow*, it bends like a banana, and he clicks the cufflink **to correct** it in mid-air. Unruffled, he goes on **to correct** the crooked stilts, the tilted paintings and the lopsided whiskers of every cat. \"Straight up,\" he says."],"跋":["to trek","{Batman} sets off {Inside} the {Spa} on foot, because his grappling hook has jammed and his cape won't glide. His *kicking foot* catches a *pulled weed* on every tile, and he has **to trek** for days, brooding, with a map from his utility belt. He camps by the towels, growls at the steam, and finally has **trekked** all the way to the sauna."],"枉":["crooked","{Walter White} climbs down to the {Basement} of the {Hangar} with a ruler and a spirit level, where a *king* is trying to stand a *tree* up straight. It leans **crooked**, and Walter, proud of his precise science, is appalled. He titrates a straightening solution and pours it on, but the *tree* bends worse and the *king* leans **crooked** in sympathy, as do Walter's glasses."],"梗":["stalk","{Gandalf} arrives in the {Basement} of the {Jungle} temple exactly when he means to and finds a tiny *tree* growing from a *gong*. He taps the *gong* with his staff and mutters a spell, and one leafy **stalk** shoots up and wiggles. \"You shall not pass!\" he snaps at it, but the **stalk** passes him anyway, dancing the cha-cha round his pointy hat."],"厕":["toilet","{Cookie Monster} stampedes into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut} and skids to the lip of a *cliff*, where a lone **toilet** sits with a *rulebook* chained to it. \"Me want cookie!\" he bellows, devouring the *rulebook*, which goes on shouting its rules through his crumbs. The chain goes next, then the seat, and the **toilet** flushes in disgust and splashes his blue fur."],"琢":["carve","The {Joker} sneaks {Inside} the {Warehouse}, where a *king* wants **to carve** a noble statue from jade. Cackling, he swaps the chisel for a trick playing card and hands it to a *shackled pig*, which grips it in its teeth. Chips fly, and together they **carve** the king's proud face with a huge grin, green hair and all, as the Joker squirts his flower in delight.","zhuó"],"讥":["to ridicule","{James Bond} stands unruffled in {Front} of the {Beach} hut in his tuxedo when a cocky gull lands on a *small table*. A *small speech bubble* pops from its beak, and it starts **to ridicule** his bow tie. Bond answers with a dry one-liner, the gull fires another, and soon the whole colony has come **to ridicule** him, until his Q-issue bow tie spins and blows them all out to sea."],"釉":["glaze","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Boathouse}, swallows a wet clay pot and lays it as a dull grey egg in a *sprouting field*, which lifts it up on green shoots. Wild *animal tracks* stamp all over it, a fox, a hen, a deer, and each print gleams with shining **glaze**. He rolls it till it shines, then licks the animals' paws to **glaze** them too."],"窟":["grotto","{Kermit} hops in {Front} of the {Pool}, clipboard flailing, and finds a *cave* where the next act should be. A *crouching man* beckons him through, and it opens into a huge glittering **grotto** full of stalactites and glowing fish. \"Yaaay!\" Kermit squeals, and his voice rings round and round, so he strums the banjo and announces tonight's show live from the **grotto**."],"敛":["to gather","{Lara Croft} swings down into the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange}, where an ancient treasure lies scattered across the floor. She solves the puzzle on the wall, calls an *assembly* and taps an old *cane* three times, and every coin rolls towards her. With a backflip she starts **to gather** them, ponytail swinging, and she **gathers** the notes, the bankers and their lunches in a single rolling pile."],"轼":["carriage handrail","{Sherlock} crash-lands in the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} on a runaway *cart*, gripping the **carriage handrail** with one hand and his magnifying glass with the other. A *stencil* of flowers slides across it, and he deduces, from a single grain of pollen, exactly who tampered with it. \"Elementary,\" he shouts, smug, as the cart hurtles on and bees cling beside him to the **carriage handrail**."],"庐":["hut","{Lara Croft} vaults {Inside} the {Pool} and spots a tiny *shed* with a round *door*, clearly an ancient trap. She picks the lock with a hairpin, dodges two darts and rolls through before the boulder lands, only to find the coziest **hut** in the world, with thatch and a teapot. She kicks off her boots, the *door* swings shut, and swimmers queue to visit the **hut**."],"胚":["embryo","{Pikachu} sparks in {Front} of the {Lake} house and finds the *moon* resting on a stone *plinth* like an egg. It cracks a little, and there floats a tiny curled-up **embryo** with yellow ears. \"Pika!\" he squeaks, warming it with small sparks from his cheeks, night after night, and each gentle zap makes the **embryo** twitch and the *moon* hum along."],"呻":["groan","{Sherlock} lies on the grass in {Front} of the {Funfair}, bored out of his mind, with a *skewer* of candy floss stuck to his coat. Watson asks who did it, and from one crumb he deduces everything: his *mouth* opens in a long **groan** at how easy it is. \"Elementary,\" he moans, and the roller coaster lets out a sympathetic **groan**, creaking, while his violin wails along."],"绰":["ample","{Charlie Brown} trudges into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse} with his kite, where a *beacon* glows over a mountain of *silk thread*. For once he has **ample** string, miles and miles, and he lets it out with hope. The kite flies straight into a tree that has grown through the sink. \"Good grief,\" he sighs, tangled in the branches, with still **ample** thread left to wrap Snoopy's doghouse."],"扼":["to grip","{Casper} drifts into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, meaning to rescue a *trapped man* dangling from the fingers of a huge *helping hand*. The hand reaches out **to grip** him too, and for the first time a ghost can't slip through: its fingers **grip** him tight. He tries going invisible, but it squeezes harder, so the pair of them hang there and, at last, Casper has a friend."],"懿":["virtuous","{Yoshi} pops up in the {Bathroom} of the {Beach}, tongue out, about to swallow *one jug* of water. A *runaway heart* gallops past, panting, and for the first time ever he spits something back, handing over the jug. How **virtuous**! He lays his only melon egg beside it, and the seagulls nominate him for a halo, the most **virtuous** dinosaur alive."],"炯":["bright","{James Bond} crouches in the {Basement} of the {Youth Club} by a single *window* and flicks his Q lighter, which does one absurd thing: it never stops getting stronger. A *campfire* leaps up, the flames bounce off the glass, and the room glows **bright**, then brighter, until teenagers reach for sunglasses. Unruffled, Bond puts on his own, and his grin is **bright** too."],"竿":["pole","{Gandalf} strides in {Front} of the {Mansion}, finds a *drying rack* sagging under socks and raises his staff, cranky. With one spell a stalk of *bamboo* shoots up into a long **pole**, laundry fluttering from it like banners. \"You shall not pass!\" he tells a burglar, slamming the **pole** across the gate, and pears rain from the tree next door."],"慷":["generous","{Kermit} hops in {Front} of the {Hangar} clutching a sack of gold and *rice husk*, overcome by the show's success, and his *standing heart* beams green. \"Yaaay!\" he squeals, arms flailing, flinging handfuls at every pilot. So **generous**! He hands out his banjo, his clipboard and his collar, and it's not easy being this **generous** when all you have left is the green."],"虞":["to expect","{Yoshi} waddles {Inside} the {Museum}, belly wobbling, because he knows exactly what **to expect**: an egg. A *tiger* reads tea leaves on a plinth while a *loudmouth* bellows that rain is coming, then lunch. He tongue-snatches the *loudmouth*, gulp, and lays him as an egg that keeps on shouting. Yoshi pats it, **expecting** the next loud prediction, and the *tiger* yawns."],"锤":["hammer","{Charlie Brown} trudges {Inside} the {Waiting Room}, where a *weeping willow* has grown through the floor and eaten his kite. He shakes the tree, and *gold coins* fall instead, and Snoopy melts them into a **hammer**. Hoping at last to free the kite, he swings, the kite stays put, and the **hammer** lands on his thumb. \"Good grief,\" he says, as the doctor asks to borrow it."],"栓":["stopper","{Sherlock} stands in {Front} of the {Swan Pond} and examines a leaking *treasure chest* with his magnifying glass. A small *tree* sprouts from its keyhole, and he deduces from one wet leaf that it's a **stopper**. \"Elementary,\" he says, yanking it out, and the whole pond gushes through the chest as swans spin. Watson rams it back, and the **stopper** holds with a fat pop."],"桨":["oar","{James Bond} wades into the flooded {Basement} of the {Stadium} without wetting his tuxedo. He clicks a Q gadget that does one thing, turning anything into an **oar**, and aims it at a *tree*: zap, the trunk snaps and shaves itself smooth. He rows a bathtub round the goalposts, one-handed, and as the football team chases him, he tosses them a second **oar**, unruffled."],"蚊":["mosquito","{Walter White} marches {Inside} the {Funfair} and a *bug* with a *tattoo* whines in his ear: a **mosquito**. It bites him, and he pauses, glasses glinting. In a beaker he mixes a perfectly measured repellent, but the formula is too good, and the **mosquito** grows big enough for tourists to ride. \"I am the one who knocks,\" he tells it, tapping the glass."],"磅":["scale","{Batman} glides into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} and lands on a giant *stone* dragged in from the *roadside*, which turns out to be a weighing **scale** with a wild dial. Detecting, he unclips evidence from his utility belt and weighs a loaf, a plane, the pilot. The needle snaps, he growls, and he deduces that the loaf has been cheating the **scale** all along."],"孽":["disaster","{Naruto} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Yeti Cave} and lands in a heap of *wormwood*, while a naughty *child* waves a match at it. Whoosh! He makes fifty shadow clones to help, but they all sneeze, knock down the walls and spin Rasengans at the smoke: a total **disaster**. \"I never give up!\" he yells, as each new clone multiplies the **disaster** and the Yeti runs for it."],"惭":["ashamed","{Cookie Monster} creeps {Inside} the {Mansion}, blue fur full of crumbs, because last night he ate every guest's cake. His *standing heart* sits blushing on a *chopping block*, and his googly eyes look away. \"Me sorry,\" he mumbles, deeply **ashamed**, and brings a fresh one. It smells so good that he devours it in a spray of crumbs, more **ashamed** than ever."],"戳":["to poke","{Charlie Brown} trudges in {Front} of the {Warehouse}, where a *pheasant* is pecking at his new kite. He picks up a *halberd* and tries **to poke** it gently, but of course he trips, and it jabs his own zigzag shirt. The bird hops up and starts **to poke** him right back, all across the lawn. \"Good grief,\" he sighs, as Snoopy sells tickets."],"禀":["to report","{Batman} drops silently into the {Basement} of the {Boxing Ring}, cape spread, and lifts a *lid* off a barrel with a gadget from his belt. A tiny officer salutes from within and says he must **report**: the bread is stale. Gruff and brooding, Batman taps the barrel, and another pops up **to report** another disaster, until the Bat-Signal is full of breadcrumbs."],"鄂":["Hubei","{Casper} floats out of the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, onto a green *hillside* in central China, and waves a shy hello to a hiker. It lands as a *jump scare*: the hiker leaps into a lake, then the next one leaps into another, for **Hubei** has a thousand lakes. Casper only wanted a friend, and he drifts sadly across **Hubei** leaving splashes behind him."],"馈":["to present","{Kermit} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Waiting Room}, arms flailing, ready to host. \"And now, it's time **to present**!\" he squeals, carrying a *side dish* with a big *price tag* on it. He tears off the tag in a panic, bows and hops along the row of patients **to present** each one with noodles, as the *price tag* sticks to his foot."],"垣":["wall","{Yoshi} flutters {Inside} the {Mint}, tongue out, and slurps up a great mouthful of *soil*. Gulp, plop, plop, plop: he lays egg after egg of packed earth in a line that runs to the *horizon*, then stacks them into one long **wall**. Robbers come to climb it, and he fires an egg at each, until the **wall** grows taller with every throw."],"溅":["to splash","{James Bond} dives into the {Bathroom} of the {Yen Exchange}, tuxedo spotless, and lands in a *bargain bin* brimming with *water drops*. He clicks a Q-issue shoe, which does one absurd thing: it starts **to splash**. Coins, receipts and bankers fly. \"Making a splash,\" he says, unruffled, strolling off as everyone grabs a bucket to **splash** him back, missing every time."],"咚":["boom","{Darth Vader} looms in {Front} of the {Lagoon}, breathing loudly, where a huge *mouth* in a *winter coat* beats a drum. He lifts the drum with the Force and drops it: **boom**! Fish leap and his cape flaps. He voices his disapproval, so deep that it makes a bigger **boom**, and the buttons of the *winter coat* pop off across the water."],"钙":["calcium","{Gandalf} climbs out of the {Bathroom} of the {Island} with a *begging bowl* and a cranky frown, for his old bones ache. He taps his last *gold coins* with his staff, and they melt in the bowl into a glowing potion of chalk and milk. One sip and his bones ring like steel: pure **calcium**! He kicks a palm tree down, and the goats queue for **calcium** too."],"礁":["reef","{James Bond} stands in {Front} of the {Cat Café} in his tuxedo, grilling on a *barbecue* made of *stone*, when Q's remote goes off. The grill sinks into the sea with a fizz and grows into a jagged coral **reef**, with sausages on the ledges. He surfaces wearing a snorkel, unruffled, and says \"Well done,\" as cats paddle round the **reef** chasing fish."],"彰":["conspicuous","The {Joker} struts in {Front} of the {Hangar} in his purple suit, wearing a *badge* the size of a dinner plate. From it, *bristles* stick out in every direction like fireworks, and pilots can see the glitter from the clouds. He is so **conspicuous** that birds swerve round him. Cackling, he adds flashing lights and a squirting flower, more **conspicuous** still."],"豁":["open","{Homer} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Warehouse}, following the smell of doughnuts down a narrow *valley* between towering crates. His dim scheme is to train a *pest* to gnaw through them, but it gnaws the lot, and the valley breaks wide **open**. \"D'oh!\" he yells, as sunlight floods in, but every box of doughnuts now lies **open**, and \"Mmm\" is all he says."],"眯":["to squint","{Mario} leaps in {Front} of the {Beach} hut and head-butts a block, but instead of a coin out flies a grain of *rice*, straight into his *eye*. He starts **to squint**, scrunching up his moustache, and now he cannot tell a shell from a sandwich. He stomps on a seagull's lunch with a \"Wahoo!\", and the gull begins **to squint** back at him, equally baffled."],"磷":["phosphorus","{Lara Croft} climbs {Inside} the {Inn} at night, searching for a lost tomb's entrance, and trips on a *stone* that glows green. A *will-o'-the-wisp* floats out and leads her past spikes. She wipes her glove on it, and the puzzle is solved: **phosphorus**! Her ponytail starts glowing, and guests find their rooms by trails of **phosphorus** on the stairs."],"雯":["colorful clouds","{Walter White} marches {Inside} the {Funfair} under grey *rain* with a rack of beakers and gives his class a lesson in flame tests. Copper, strontium, potassium: each salt blazes up into the sky, painting **colorful clouds** in green, red and lilac. A cloud drifts down with a rainbow *tattoo* on its side, and he rides the Ferris wheel up through the **colorful clouds**, proud of every shade."],"墟":["ruins","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of the {Museum}, shovelling swamp *soil* over his shoulder because he wants to be left alone. An ancient city heaves up out of the ground, layer after layer like an onion, then crumbles into *ruins*. He roars at the tourists to clear off, but they buy tickets to the **ruins**, and Donkey leads the tour of the **ruins**, talking nonstop."],"迂":["pedantic","{Yoshi} sits in {Front} of the {Museum} beside a *road*, where a *coat stand* in spectacles lectures every driver about comma rules, so **pedantic** it corrects the clouds. His tongue zips out, gulp, and he lays the coat stand as an egg. The egg goes on correcting grammar from its shell, and as the *road* fills with stalled cars, Yoshi sits on the **pedantic** egg to muffle it."],"瞻":["to gaze","The {Joker} sprawls in {Front} of the {Mansion} under the *eaves*, huge grin fixed, playing a staring contest. A giant *eye* peers down from the gutter, and they both begin **to gaze** at the stars for hours, not blinking. Then he squirts his flower at the *eye*, it blinks, and he cackles and goes back **to gaze** at the moon, which gets shy and hides."],"颅":["skull","{Lara Croft} flips {Inside} the {Pool} with an ancient *black pot* hauled from a tomb. She lifts the lid and a grinning **skull** rises, reading from a crumbling *page*, and its jaw clacks the curse aloud. A boulder starts rolling, so she snatches the page, ponytail flying, and solves the riddle. The **skull** sulks and asks for its bookmark back."],"琉":["precious stone","{Lara Croft} slides down the banisters {Inside} the {Youth Hostel} as a *king* rolls past with a *tumbling baby* on his back. The baby drops a sparkling **precious stone**, and it bounces off the stairs, setting off an ancient trap: darts, a boulder, the lot. Lara cartwheels through it all, ponytail flying, and catches the **precious stone** in a teacup, just as the tea turns blue."],"悼":["to mourn","{Darth Vader} stalks out of the {Bathroom} of the {Tower}, breathing loudly and holding up a lit *beacon*, because his favourite droid has rusted. He lays it in a tiny coffin with the Force, and a *standing heart* on his chest panel beats slow and heavy as he comes **to mourn**. His cape droops, and every stormtrooper must **mourn** too, by booming order."],"蝴":["butterfly","{Homer} waddles {Inside} the {Pool}, half asleep, and sees a *bug* with long *whiskers* and frosted pink wings. \"Mmm, doughnut,\" he drools, and lunges, but it is a **butterfly**, and he belly-flops with a huge splash. His next dim scheme is a net baited with sprinkles, but the **butterfly** lands on his bald head, and \"D'oh!\" is all he can say."],"拣":["to pick","{James Bond} sits in the {Basement} of the {Yen Exchange} before a mountain of coins, as a Q gadget unfolds from his watch: a giant *helping hand* that does one thing. It starts **to pick** only the shiny ones, plink, plink, ignoring the bent ones. Unruffled, he orders it **to pick** the olive from his drink, and it flicks that out too, shaken, not stirred."],"渺":["vast","{Mario} warps into the {Basement} of the {Cat Café} through a green pipe and splashes down in a sea of *water drops* stretching away forever. A tiny cat with *one eye* stares out across the **vast** flood. He swims, stomps on every floating crate for coins and shouts \"Wahoo!\", but no wall ever comes, for the place is so **vast** that whales pass by."],"眷":["family","{James Bond} opens the {Bathroom} of the {Mint}, says \"Bond. James Bond,\" and out climb a hundred more Bonds in tuxedos: his **family**. Grandma Bond, Uncle Bond, baby Bond in a bow tie. *Rolling hands* pass round gadgets, every *eye* narrows with unruffled cool, and the guards demand passports. \"Shaken, not stirred,\" they chorus, and the **family** sets up a picnic among the coins."],"悯":["to pity","{Mario} slides down a pipe into the {Basement} of the {Inn} and finds a *mourner* weeping into her hanky. His *standing heart* melts, and he begins **to pity** her, so he head-butts a block and offers her a coin. She cries harder, so he offers a mushroom, and she grows huge and cries bigger tears. \"Mamma mia,\" he sighs, and he can only **pity** the drenched guests too."],"汰":["to eliminate","{Tarzan} swings into the {Bathroom} of the {Island} and lands with a splash among *water drops*, where a *giant* is panning for gold and flicking aside all that isn't shiny. Old boots, fish and apes go flying, and Tarzan's jungle yell is no help. The giant's rule is **to eliminate** everything dull, so Tarzan, baffled, in a loincloth, is **eliminated** across the sea on his own vine."],"慑":["to frighten","{Sherlock} drops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hut}, where an *eavesdropper* has his ear glued to the wall. With one glance, Sherlock lists his shoe size, his secrets and his sandwich, a deduction meant **to frighten** him stiff. The man's *standing heart* leaps out of his shirt. \"Elementary,\" says Sherlock, and goes on **to frighten** the cat and the kettle with what he deduces about them."],"婶":["aunt","{Sherlock} sneaks into the {Basement} of the {Funfair}, magnifying glass out, where a *woman* holds court in a tiny *courtroom* made of candy floss. One sniff of toffee and he deduces she's his **aunt**, the only person he can't outsmart. She bangs her gavel and, spotting him behind a teddy bear, sentences him to seven goes on the teacups. \"Yes, **Aunt**,\" he mumbles, and Watson giggles."],"斐":["brilliant","{Frodo} trudges barefoot into the {Basement} under the {Lake} and slips on the Ring. He vanishes, but the *tattoo* on his arm stays behind, blazing so **brilliant** that the fish put on sunglasses. Its inked *spread wings* peel off and flap round the cellar in **brilliant** red and gold, and poor Frodo, invisible at last, has never been easier to find."],"嘘":["to hiss","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Museum}, trying to nap among crumbling *ruins*, when Donkey starts talking. A huge *mouth* in a fallen column begins **to hiss** at him, and Shrek joins in, an ogre's roar shrunk to a furious whisper. Tourists freeze, Donkey doesn't, and the museum goes on **to hiss** like a punctured swamp."],"镶":["to embed","{Shrek} marches out in {Front} of the {Stadium} with an *embroidered robe* Fiona wants fixed and a sack of *gold coins*. Grumbling, he uses one giant green thumb **to embed** every coin in the cloth, layer upon layer, like an onion. It becomes a glittering suit of armour, Donkey won't stop admiring it, and Shrek goes on **to embed** coins in the scoreboard just to shut him up."],"炕":["kang bed","{Kermit} hops into the {Bathroom} of the {Hangar} in a *high collar*, hunting for a place the cast can sleep, and lands on a brick **kang bed** with a *campfire* crackling beneath it. \"Yaaay!\" he yelps, flailing as his green bottom warms up. He strums the banjo, and the whole troupe piles on, pigs and bears and pilots, snoring on the **kang bed**."],"宦":["official","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Swan Pond} looking for a nap, and lands under a golden *roof* that creaks open to drop a *minister* in silk, who stamps his forehead with a seal. He is now an **official**! Swans in hats salute him. He sleeps at his desk, eats doughnuts off the seal and says \"D'oh!\" only when a paper wakes him, the laziest **official** in the land."],"趴":["lie face down","{Pikachu} scampers in {Front} of the {Spa} under a pair of *curtains*, and a *kicking foot* sends him tumbling. He flops flat, cheeks fizzing, and has to **lie face down** on the paving as the *curtains* fall over him. \"Pika,\" he mumbles, sparks tickling the masseur who thinks he's a client, and soon every bather wants a shock and will **lie face down** on the lawn."],"绷":["to stretch taut","{Batman} crouches in {Front} of the {Jungle} lodge with his *buddies*, fires his grappling hook across the canopy and ties a *silk thread* to it. They all pull, growling, **to stretch taut** a line from tree to tree until it twangs like a guitar. Batman steps out, cape spread. With the line **stretched taut**, a monkey plucks it, and he twangs up into the clouds, still brooding."],"窘":["embarrassed","{James Bond} strolls into the {Basement} of the {Youth Club}, into a dark *cave* where a *lord* is reciting poetry. He says \"Bond. James Bond,\" clicks his cufflink, and Q's gadget fires: his trousers fall off. Silence. For once Bond is **embarrassed**, tomato red to the bow tie, and as the *lord* politely hands him a napkin he gets more **embarrassed** still."],"襄":["to assist","{Shrek} stomps out in {Front} of the {Stadium}, desperate to be left alone, but a player in an *embroidered robe* is stuck on the scoreboard. Donkey won't shut up until he agrees **to assist**, so he grumbles, lifts the whole scoreboard down and peels the player off like an onion layer. The fans cheer, and now everyone wants him **to assist**: the referee, the mascot, a pigeon."],"珀":["amber","{Pikachu} scuttles into the {Bathroom} of the {Fort} clutching a golden lump of *amber*, a tiny mosquito waving a flag trapped within. He zaps the **amber** with his cheeks and it glows like honey, so the soldiers swap their cannonballs for a look. \"Pika!\" he squeaks, until a red and white ball flies at him and catches the **amber** instead, and he sulks."],"嚣":["noisy","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of the {Cat Café} wanting peace, while a *chorus* of cats screeches songs off a single *page* of music, all different, each at full volume. It's so **noisy** the windows rattle. Donkey joins in. Shrek finally roars for silence, and that's the loudest of all, so now the whole street is **noisy**, and his onion rolls off the table in despair."],"拚":["to strive","{Pikachu} skids into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and a *helping hand* plonks an *officer's cap* on his head. Suddenly he's determined to be the very best, so he sets out **to strive**: Thunderbolts at the grandfather clock, a duel with the butler, a \"Pika!\" after every fall. He will **strive** till his cheeks are smoking, and the cap gives him a medal."],"酌":["to pour wine","The {Joker} slinks {Inside} the {Warehouse} in his purple suit, carrying a *wine jug* and a *ladle*. With a huge grin he stops **to pour wine** for each worker, one polite ladleful at a time, but every cup squirts back at him like his flower. Cackling, he drops a trick card into each, and soon he's **pouring wine** into his own hat."],"浊":["murky","The {Joker} cackles {Inside} the {Warehouse}, tipping a tank so that *water drops* trickle into a basin, and releases his prank: a wind-up *bug* that stirs up mud. The basin turns **murky**, brown as old soup, and nobody can see their boots. He drops in a trick playing card, and its little grin peers up through the **murky** water while he squirts his flower at it."],"毓":["to nurture","{Yoshi} pops out of the {Bathroom} of the {Museum}, where a *busy mother* is juggling seedlings and a *tumbling baby*. His tongue gently swoops up the baby, gulp, and he lays it as a big spotted egg, then sits on it **to nurture** it. It hatches giggling and bigger each day, the seedlings shoot up, and the *busy mother* lets him **nurture** the dinosaur skeleton too."],"撼":["to shake","{Homer} waddles into the {Bathroom} of the {Mansion} and spots a doughnut stuck on a high shelf. His dim scheme: a giant *helping hand*, borrowed from the plant, grabs the house and starts **to shake** it like a snow globe. The butler's *tears* fly sideways, the chandelier swings, and Homer goes on **to shake** the building until the doughnut lands on his head. \"Mmm,\" he says."],"嗜":["to crave","{Sherlock} sweeps into the {Bathroom} of the {Beehive} with his pipe and meets *great-grandpa*, whose sticky *mouth* and jar of honey tell him everything. From one crumb of comb he deduces it: the old fellow will **crave** sweets until the last bee flees. \"Elementary,\" says Sherlock, smugly, but then he licks his finger to check and begins **to crave** it too, and Watson locks them out."],"扛":["to shoulder","{Kermit} staggers {Inside} the {Hangar}, flailing, the stage manager of a show with no crew, and a heavy *workbench* for the set lands on his head. A giant *helping hand* swings it up for him **to shoulder** like a sack of potatoes. \"Yaaay!\" he yelps, hopping under it, and he has to **shoulder** a propeller and a tiny plane too, because it's not easy being green."],"峭":["precipitous","{Chewbacca} crashes into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} and finds the wall has become a *mountain* so **precipitous** it's vertical. A *portrait* hangs off the cliff, and he grabs it, roaring. Cats cling to his fur as his crossbow swings. He rips handholds from the rock in sheer temper, growling all the way up the **precipitous** face to the cake shelf."],"磕":["to knock","{Kermit} flails in {Front} of the {Hut} with a *lidded dish* of dumplings for the cast's dinner, but the lid is stuck. He grabs a *stone* and starts **to knock** on it: knock, knock, KNOCK! He **knocks** harder, hopping up and down, arms flapping, hens flying, and the whole hut shakes. \"Yaaay!\" he squeals, as the lid pops open and a dumpling says, \"Who's there?\""],"翘":["to stick up","{Chewbacca} bursts into the {Bathroom} of the {Cat Café} beside an *emperor* with *feathers* in his hair. He lets out a huge roar, and every feather springs **to stick up**, straight at the ceiling, like a firework. The emperor tries to comb them flat, but they boing back. Chewbacca's own fur starts **to stick up**, and not even a spanner from his bandolier can flatten it."],"槽":["trough","{Cookie Monster} thunders {Inside} the {Tower}, dragging a hollowed-out *tree* as long as a canoe, and declares it a *trough* for cookies. \"Me want cookie!\" he roars, tipping in a whole bakery's worth, and kneels down, googly eyes spinning, to devour them. Crumbs spray up the stairs, the **trough** is empty in a second, and then he eats the **trough** too."],"淌":["to trickle","{Tarzan} crawls into the {Basement} of the {Hangar} as *water drops* leak from the *attic* far above. They begin **to trickle** down the walls in thin silver lines, then along the floor. Baffled by plumbing, he swings about on a vine, calls the apes for advice and tries to catch them in a coconut, but they **trickle** round it and straight into his loincloth."],"栅":["fence","The {Joker} sneaks into the {Bathroom} of the {Spa}, saws a *tree* into stakes and follows a prank plan from a *bamboo book*. Bang, bang! He hammers them in a ring round the hot tub, and the bathers find themselves behind a **fence**, steaming like dumplings. Cackling, he paints a grin on each stake, and every plank of the **fence** squirts water when they touch it."],"颓":["to crumble","{Tarzan} swings {Inside} the {Waiting Room} and lands on a marble statue with a *bald head*, which is reading a *page* of instructions. He gives the jungle yell, and the walls start **to crumble** like stale biscuits. The statue's nose goes, then its ears. Apes hurry in, baffled, and Tarzan's vine is tied to nothing as the whole room goes on **to crumble**."],"熏":["fragrance","{Shrek} stands in {Front} of a hut in the {Dunes}, roasting onions and swamp weed on smoking *embers*, and a **fragrance** curls out across the desert. Camels lift their noses and drift towards it in a dreamy line, which is not what he wanted at all. He roars at them to go away, and his breath only spreads the **fragrance**, until the very sand smells of swamp."],"瑛":["jade-like stone","{Yoshi} perches in {Front} of the {Boxing Ring} as a *king* climbs up and hands a *hero* a shining green **jade-like stone**. The *hero* thinks it's a sweet, bites it and cracks a tooth, so Yoshi's tongue zips over, gulp, to try it himself. Wobble, plop: he lays a perfect egg, and the *king* polishes the **jade-like stone** that hatches out, not a mark on it."],"颐":["chin","{Yoshi} sits {Inside} the {Beach} with his tongue out, and slurps up a *page* of philosophy with a gulp. Instead of an egg, his *chin* swells, longer and longer, rolling across the sand like a red carpet. Crabs stroll along it and kids slide down into the sea. He wails, wagging his **chin**, which now reaches the lighthouse, and when he lays at last, out plops a small egg-shaped **chin**."],"忖":["to ponder","{Cookie Monster} slumps in the {Basement} of the {Casino} with one cookie left, his *thumb* on his lip and his *standing heart* thumping. Eat it now, or bet it for more? \"Me must **ponder**,\" he rumbles, googly eyes crossing, and he goes on **to ponder** for an hour, then a day. Dust gathers on his blue fur and the roulette wheel rusts before he eats it."]};
